# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Abbrevs-Suggestions.html
msgid ""
"You can get abbrev suggestions when you manually type text for which there "
"is currently an active defined abbrev.  For example, if there is an abbrev "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; with the expansion &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">find outer otter</samp>&rsquo;, and you manually type "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">find outer otter</samp>&rsquo;, Emacs can notice "
"this and show a hint in the echo area when you have stopped typing."
msgstr ""
"現在有効な略語が定義されているテキストを手動で入力すると、略語の候補が表示さ"
"れます。例えば、展開文字列が &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">find outer otter</"
"samp>&rsquo; である略語 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; があ"
"り、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">find outer otter</samp>&rsquo; と手動で入力す"
"ると、Emacs がそれを検知し、入力を止めた際にエコーエリアにヒントを表示しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Abbrevs-Suggestions.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-abbrev_002dsuggest\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-abbrev_002dsuggest\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Abbrevs-Suggestions.html
msgid ""
"To enable the abbrev suggestion feature, customize the option <code "
"class=\"code\">abbrev-suggest</code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> value."
msgstr ""
"略語提案機能を有効にするには、オプション <code class=\"code\">abbrev-"
"suggest</code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に設定してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Abbrevs-Suggestions.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"abbrev_002dsuggest_002dhint_002dthreshold\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"abbrev_002dsuggest_002dhint_002dthreshold\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Abbrevs-Suggestions.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">abbrev-suggest-hint-threshold</code> "
"controls when to suggest an abbrev to the user.  This variable defines the "
"minimum savings (in terms of the number of characters the user will not have "
"to type) required for Emacs to suggest using an abbrev.  For example, if the "
"user types &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo bar</samp>&rsquo; (seven "
"characters) and there is an abbrev &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">fubar</"
"samp>&rsquo; defined (five characters), the user will not get any suggestion "
"unless the threshold is set to the number 2 or lower.  With the default "
"value 3, the user would not get any suggestion in this example, because the "
"savings in using the abbrev are below the threshold.  If you always want to "
"get abbrev suggestions, set this variable&rsquo;s value to zero."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">abbrev-suggest-hint-threshold</code> は、ユーザーに"
"略語を提案するタイミングを制御します。この変数は、Emacs が略語の使用を提案す"
"るために必要な最小の削減量（ユーザーが入力しなくて済む文字数）を定義します。"
"例えば、ユーザーが &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo bar</samp>&rsquo; （7文"
"字）と入力し、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">fubar</samp>&rsquo; （5文字）という"
"略語が定義されている場合、閾値が 2 以下に設定されていない限り、ユーザーに提案"
"は表示されません。デフォルト値の 3 では、この例では略語を使用することによる削"
"減量が閾値を下回るため、ユーザーに提案は表示されません。常に略語の提案を受け"
"取りたい場合は、この変数の値を 0 に設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Abbrevs-Suggestions.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"abbrev_002dsuggest_002dshow_002dreport\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"abbrev_002dsuggest_002dshow_002dreport\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Abbrevs-Suggestions.html
msgid ""
"The command <code class=\"code\">abbrev-suggest-show-report</code> displays "
"a buffer with all the abbrev suggestions shown during the current editing "
"session.  This can be useful if you get several abbrev suggestions and "
"don&rsquo;t remember them all."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <code class=\"code\">abbrev-suggest-show-report</code> は、現在の編"
"集セッション中に表示されたすべての略語候補をバッファに表示します。複数の略語"
"候補が表示され、それらをすべて覚えていられない場合に便利です。"

