# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"A defined <em class=\"dfn\">abbrev</em> is a word which <em "
"class=\"dfn\">expands</em>, if you insert it, into some different text.  "
"Abbrevs are defined by the user to expand in specific ways.  For example, "
"you might define &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; as an abbrev "
"expanding to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">find outer otter</samp>&rsquo;.  "
"Then you could insert &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">find outer otter </"
"samp>&rsquo; into the buffer by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">f o o <kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"定義された<em class=\"dfn\">略語</em>とは、挿入した際に別のテキストへと<em "
"class=\"dfn\">展開</em>される単語のことです。略語は、特定の方法で展開されるよ"
"うユーザーによって定義されます。例えば、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</"
"samp>&rsquo;を&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">find outer otter</samp>&rsquo;に展"
"開する略語として定義できます。すると、<kbd class=\"kbd\">f o o <kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>と入力することで、バッファに&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">find outer otter </samp>&rsquo;を挿入できるようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"A second kind of abbreviation facility is called <em class=\"dfn\">dynamic "
"abbrev expansion</em>.  You use dynamic abbrev expansion with an explicit "
"command to expand the letters in the buffer before point by looking for "
"other words in the buffer that start with those letters.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Dynamic-Abbrevs.html\">Dynamic Abbrev Expansion</a>."
msgstr ""
"2種類目の略記機能は、<em class=\"dfn\">動的略記展開</em>と呼ばれます。動的略"
"記展開では、明示的なコマンドを用いて、バッファ内でその文字で始まる他の単語を"
"検索し、ポイント前のバッファ内の文字を展開します。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Dynamic-Abbrevs.html\">動的略記展開</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"A third kind, <em class=\"dfn\">hippie expansion</em>, generalizes "
"abbreviation expansion.  See <a data-manual=\"autotype\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/autotype/Hippie-"
"Expand.html#Hippie-Expand\">Hippie Expansion</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">Features for Automatic Typing</cite>."
msgstr ""
"3つ目の種類である<em class=\"dfn\">ヒッピー展開</em>は、略語展開を一般化した"
"ものです。<cite class=\"cite\">自動入力の機能</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"autotype\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/autotype/Hippie-Expand.html#Hippie-Expand\">ヒッピー展開</a>を参照"
"してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
