# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Many people have contributed code included in the Free Software "
"Foundation&rsquo;s distribution of GNU Emacs.  To show our appreciation for "
"their public spirit, we list here in alphabetical order those who have "
"written substantial portions.  Others too numerous to mention have reported "
"and fixed bugs, and added features to many parts of Emacs.  We thank them "
"for their generosity as well."
msgstr ""
"フリーソフトウェア財団によるGNU Emacsの配布版には、多くの方々がコードを提供し"
"てくださいました。その公共心に感謝の意を表し、ここでは相当量のコードを執筆さ"
"れた方々をアルファベット順に掲載します。また、書ききれないほど多くの方々が、"
"バグの報告と修正を行い、Emacsの多くの箇所に機能を追加してくださいました。こう"
"した方々の寛大さにも、深く感謝いたします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"This list is intended to mention every contributor of a major package or "
"feature; if you know of someone we have omitted, please make a bug report.  "
"More comprehensive information is available in the <samp "
"class=\"file\">ChangeLog</samp> files, summarized in the file <samp "
"class=\"file\">etc/AUTHORS</samp> in the distribution."
msgstr ""
"このリストは、主要なパッケージや機能の貢献者をすべて網羅することを目的として"
"います。記載漏れの方をご存知の場合は、バグレポートを提出してください。より詳"
"細な情報は <samp class=\"file\">ChangeLog</samp> ファイルに記載されており、配"
"布版の <samp class=\"file\">etc/AUTHORS</samp> ファイルにまとめられています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Per Abrahamsen wrote the customization facilities, as well as <samp "
"class=\"file\">double.el</samp>, for typing accented characters not normally "
"available from the keyboard; <samp class=\"file\">xt-mouse.el</samp>, which "
"allows mouse commands through Xterm; <samp class=\"file\">gnus-cus.el</"
"samp>, which implements customization commands for Gnus; <samp "
"class=\"file\">gnus-cite.el</samp>, a citation-parsing facility for news "
"articles; <samp class=\"file\">gnus-score.el</samp>, scoring for Gnus; <samp "
"class=\"file\">cpp.el</samp>, which hides or highlights parts of C programs "
"according to preprocessor conditionals; and the widget library files <samp "
"class=\"file\">wid-browse.el</samp>, <samp class=\"file\">wid-edit.el</"
"samp>, <samp class=\"file\">widget.el</samp>.  He also co-wrote <samp "
"class=\"file\">gnus-soup.el</samp>."
msgstr ""
"ペール・アブラハムセンは、通常はキーボードから入力できないアクセント付き文字"
"を入力するためのカスタマイズ機能および<samp class=\"file\">double.el</samp>、"
"Xterm経由でマウスコマンドを可能にする<samp class=\"file\">xt-mouse.el</"
"samp>、Gnus用のカスタマイズコマンドを実装する<samp class=\"file\">gnus-"
"cus.el</samp>、ニュース記事用の引用解析機能である<samp class=\"file\">gnus-"
"cite.el</samp>、Gnus用のスコアリング機能である<samp class=\"file\">gnus-"
"score.el</samp>、プリプロセッサの条件式に応じてCプログラムの一部を非表示また"
"は強調表示する<samp class=\"file\">cpp.el</samp>、そしてウィジェットライブラ"
"リファイルである<samp class=\"file\">wid-browse.el</samp>、<samp "
"class=\"file\">wid-edit.el</samp>、<samp class=\"file\">widget.el</samp>を開"
"発した。また、<samp class=\"file\">gnus-soup.el</samp>の共同執筆も手掛けた。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Tomas Abrahamsson wrote <samp class=\"file\">artist.el</samp>, a package for "
"producing <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> art with a mouse or with "
"keyboard keys."
msgstr ""
"トーマス・アブラハムソンは、マウスやキーボードのキーで<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>アートを作成するためのパッケージ<samp "
"class=\"file\">artist.el</samp>を開発しました。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Jay K. Adams wrote <samp class=\"file\">jka-compr.el</samp> and <samp "
"class=\"file\">jka-cmpr-hook.el</samp>, providing automatic decompression "
"and recompression for compressed files."
msgstr ""
"Jay K. Adamsは、圧縮ファイルの自動解凍・再圧縮を実現する<samp "
"class=\"file\">jka-compr.el</samp>と<samp class=\"file\">jka-cmpr-hook.el</"
"samp>を記述した。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Michael Albinus wrote <samp class=\"file\">dbus.el</samp>, a package that "
"implements the D-Bus message bus protocol; <samp class=\"file\">zeroconf.el</"
"samp>, a mode for browsing Avahi services; <samp class=\"file\">secrets.el</"
"samp>, an interface to keyring daemons for storing confidential data; and "
"<samp class=\"file\">filenotify.el</samp> and the associated low-level "
"interface routines, for watching file status changes.  He and Kai "
"Gro&szlig;johann wrote the Tramp package, which provides transparent remote "
"file editing using ssh, ftp, and other network protocols.  He and Daniel "
"Pittman wrote <samp class=\"file\">tramp-cache.el</samp>."
msgstr ""
"Michael Albinusは、D-Busメッセージバスプロトコルを実装するパッケージ<samp "
"class=\"file\">dbus.el</samp>、Avahiサービスを閲覧するためのモード<samp "
"class=\"file\">zeroconf.el</samp>、機密データを保存するためのキーリングデーモ"
"ン用インターフェース<samp class=\"file\">secrets.el</samp>、そしてファイルス"
"テータスの変更を監視するための<samp class=\"file\">filenotify.el</samp>および"
"関連する低レベルインターフェースルーチンを執筆した。彼とKai Gro&szlig;johann"
"は、sshやftp、その他のネットワークプロトコルを用いて透過的なリモートファイル"
"編集を実現するTrampパッケージを執筆した。彼とDaniel Pittmanは<samp "
"class=\"file\">tramp-cache.el</samp>を執筆した。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Ralf Angeli wrote <samp class=\"file\">scroll-lock.el</samp>, a minor mode "
"which keeps the point vertically fixed by scrolling the window when moving "
"up and down in the buffer."
msgstr ""
"Ralf Angeli氏は、バッファ内を上下に移動する際にウィンドウをスクロールしてポイ"
"ントを垂直方向に固定するマイナーモード <samp class=\"file\">scroll-lock.el</"
"samp> を開発しました。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Aur&eacute;lien Aptel added dynamic module support to Emacs.  Philipp "
"Stephani and others also worked on the dynamic module code."
msgstr ""
"Aur&eacute;lien AptelはEmacsに動的モジュールのサポートを追加した。Philipp "
"Stephaniらも動的モジュールのコード開発に携わった。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Joe Arceneaux wrote the original text property implementation, and "
"implemented support for X11."
msgstr ""
"Joe Arceneauxはオリジナルのテキストプロパティ実装を作成し、X11への対応を実装"
"した。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Emil &Aring;str&rsquo;&#769;om, Milan Zamaza, and Stefan Bruda wrote <samp "
"class=\"file\">prolog.el</samp>, a mode for editing Prolog (and Mercury) "
"code."
msgstr ""
"Emil &Aring;str&rsquo;&#769;om、Milan Zamaza、Stefan Brudaの3氏は、Prolog（お"
"よびMercury）のコードを編集するためのモード<samp class=\"file\">prolog.el</"
"samp>を執筆した。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Miles Bader wrote <samp class=\"file\">image-file.el</samp>, support code "
"for visiting image files; <samp class=\"file\">minibuf-eldef.el</samp>, a "
"minor mode that hides the minibuffer default value when appropriate; <samp "
"class=\"file\">rfn-eshadow.el</samp>, shadowing of <code class=\"code\">read-"
"file-name</code> input; <samp class=\"file\">mb-depth.el</samp>, display of "
"minibuffer depth; <samp class=\"file\">button.el</samp>, the library that "
"implements clickable buttons; <samp class=\"file\">face-remap.el</samp>, a "
"package for changing the default face in individual buffers; and <samp "
"class=\"file\">macroexp.el</samp> for macro-expansion.  He also worked on an "
"early version of the lexical binding code."
msgstr ""
"Miles Baderは、画像ファイルへのアクセス用サポートコードである<samp "
"class=\"file\">image-file.el</samp>、適宜ミニバッファのデフォルト値を非表示に"
"するマイナーモードである<samp class=\"file\">minibuf-eldef.el</samp>、<code "
"class=\"code\">read-file-name</code>入力のシャドウイングを行う<samp "
"class=\"file\">rfn-eshadow.el</samp>、ミニバッファの深さを表示する<samp "
"class=\"file\">mb-depth.el</samp>、クリック可能なボタンを実装するライブラリで"
"ある<samp class=\"file\">button.el</samp>、個々のバッファのデフォルトフェイス"
"を変更するためのパッケージである<samp class=\"file\">face-remap.el</samp>、お"
"よびマクロ展開用の<samp class=\"file\">macroexp.el</samp>を作成した。また、レ"
"キシカルバインディングコードの初期バージョンの開発にも携わった。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"David Bakhash wrote <samp class=\"file\">strokes.el</samp>, a mode for "
"controlling Emacs by moving the mouse in particular patterns."
msgstr ""
"David Bakhashは、特定のパターンでマウスを動かしてEmacsを操作するためのモード"
"<samp class=\"file\">strokes.el</samp>を開発した。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Juanma Barranquero wrote <samp class=\"file\">emacs-lock.el</samp> (based on "
"the original version by Tom Wurgler), which makes it harder to exit with "
"valuable buffers unsaved; and <samp class=\"file\">frameset.el</samp>, for "
"saving and restoring the frame/window setup.  He also made many other "
"contributions to other areas, including MS Windows support."
msgstr ""
"Juanma Barranqueroは、貴重なバッファを保存せずに終了することを困難にする"
"<samp class=\"file\">emacs-lock.el</samp>（Tom Wurglerによるオリジナル版に基"
"づく）と、フレーム/ウィンドウ設定の保存・復元を行う<samp "
"class=\"file\">frameset.el</samp>を開発しました。また、MS Windowsのサポートを"
"はじめ、その他の分野においても多くの貢献を果たしました。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Eli Barzilay wrote <samp class=\"file\">calculator.el</samp>, a desktop "
"calculator for Emacs."
msgstr ""
"Eli Barzilayは、Emacs用のデスクトップ電卓<samp class=\"file\">calculator.el</"
"samp>を開発した。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Steven L. Baur wrote <samp class=\"file\">footnote.el</samp> which lets you "
"include footnotes in email messages; and <samp class=\"file\">gnus-audio.el</"
"samp> and <samp class=\"file\">earcon.el</samp>, which provide sound effects "
"for Gnus.  He also wrote <samp class=\"file\">gnus-setup.el</samp>."
msgstr ""
"Steven L. Baurは、メールメッセージに脚注を挿入できる<samp "
"class=\"file\">footnote.el</samp>や、Gnus用の効果音を提供する<samp "
"class=\"file\">gnus-audio.el</samp>および<samp class=\"file\">earcon.el</"
"samp>を執筆しました。また、<samp class=\"file\">gnus-setup.el</samp>も執筆し"
"ています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Alexander L. Belikoff, Sergey Berezin, Sacha Chua, David Edmondson, Noah "
"Friedman, Andreas Fuchs, Mario Lang, Ben Mesander, Lawrence Mitchell, "
"Gergely Nagy, Michael Olson, Per Persson, Jorgen Sch&auml;fer, Alex "
"Schroeder, and Tom Tromey wrote ERC, an advanced Internet Relay Chat client "
"(for more information, see the file <samp class=\"file\">CREDITS</samp> in "
"the ERC distribution)."
msgstr ""
"Alexander L. Belikoff、Sergey Berezin、Sacha Chua、David Edmondson、Noah "
"Friedman、Andreas Fuchs、Mario Lang、Ben Mesander、Lawrence Mitchell、"
"Gergely Nagy、Michael Olson、Per Persson、Jorgen Schöfer、Alex Schroeder、お"
"よびTom Tromeyは、高度なInternet Relay ChatクライアントであるERCを開発しまし"
"た（詳細については、ERCディストリビューション内のファイル<samp "
"class=\"file\">CREDITS</samp>を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Scott Bender, Michael Brouwer, Christophe de Dinechin, Carl Edman, Christian "
"Limpach and Adrian Robert developed and maintained the NeXTstep port of "
"Emacs."
msgstr ""
"スコット・ベンダー、マイケル・ブラウワー、クリストフ・ド・ディネチン、カー"
"ル・エドマン、クリスチャン・リンパッヒ、エイドリアン・ロバートの各氏は、Emacs"
"のNeXTstep移植版の開発および保守を行った。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Stephen Berman wrote <samp class=\"file\">todo-mode.el</samp> (based on the "
"original version by Oliver Seidel), a package for maintaining <samp "
"class=\"file\">TODO</samp> list files.  He also wrote <samp "
"class=\"file\">visual-wrap.el</samp> together with Stefan Monnier."
msgstr ""
"Stephen Bermanは、<samp class=\"file\">TODO</samp>リストファイルを管理するた"
"めのパッケージ<samp class=\"file\">todo-mode.el</samp>（Oliver Seidelによるオ"
"リジナル版に基づく）を作成しました。また、Stefan Monnierと共同で<samp "
"class=\"file\">visual-wrap.el</samp>も作成しました。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Anna M. Bigatti wrote <samp class=\"file\">cal-html.el</samp>, which "
"produces HTML calendars."
msgstr ""
"Anna M. Bigattiは、HTMLカレンダーを生成する<samp class=\"file\">cal-html.el</"
"samp>を記述しました。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Ray Blaak and Simon South wrote <samp class=\"file\">opascal.el</samp>, a "
"mode for editing Object Pascal source code."
msgstr ""
"Ray Blaak氏とSimon South氏は、Object Pascalのソースコードを編集するためのモー"
"ドである<samp class=\"file\">opascal.el</samp>を開発しました。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Martin Blais, Stefan Merten, and David Goodger wrote <samp "
"class=\"file\">rst.el</samp>, a mode for editing reStructuredText documents."
msgstr ""
"Martin Blais、Stefan Merten、David Goodgerは、reStructuredTextドキュメントを"
"編集するためのモード<samp class=\"file\">rst.el</samp>を開発しました。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Jim Blandy wrote Emacs 19&rsquo;s input system, brought its configuration "
"and build process up to the GNU coding standards, and contributed to the "
"frame support and multi-face support.  Jim also wrote <samp "
"class=\"file\">tvi970.el</samp>, terminal support for the TeleVideo 970 "
"terminals; and co-wrote <samp class=\"file\">wyse50.el</samp> (q.v.)."
msgstr ""
"ジム・ブランディはEmacs 19の入力システムを開発し、その設定およびビルドプロセ"
"スをGNUコーディング標準に準拠させたほか、フレームサポートとマルチフェイスサ"
"ポートにも貢献した。また、ジムはTeleVideo 970端末向けのターミナルサポートであ"
"る<samp class=\"file\">tvi970.el</samp>を執筆し、<samp "
"class=\"file\">wyse50.el</samp>（参照）を共同執筆した。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Per Bothner wrote <samp class=\"file\">term.el</samp>, a terminal emulator "
