"of URLs; and implemented libxml2 support.  He also wrote <samp "
"class=\"file\">eww.el</samp>, an Emacs Lisp web browser; and implemented "
"native zlib decompression.  Components of Gnus have also been written by: "
"Nagy Andras, David Blacka, Scott Byer, Ludovic Court&egrave;s, Julien "
