# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Acknowledgments.html
msgid ""
"Andrew Norman wrote <samp class=\"file\">ange-ftp.el</samp>, providing "
