#: build/html/emacs/Amusements.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x blackbox</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x mpuz</kbd> and "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x 5x5</kbd> are puzzles.  <code "
"class=\"code\">blackbox</code> challenges you to determine the location of "
"objects inside a box by tomography.  <code class=\"code\">mpuz</code> "
"displays a multiplication puzzle with letters standing for digits in a code "
"that you must guess&mdash;to guess a value, type a letter and then the digit "
"you think it stands for.  The aim of <code class=\"code\">5x5</code> is to "
"fill in all the squares."
msgstr ""
