# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Android-Windowing.html
msgid ""
"Android 4.4 and earlier provide considerably inferior interfaces inadequate "
"for a complete implementation of window management.  On such systems, Emacs "
"substitutes a fairly primitive mechanism where all but the initial frame are "
"deleted when their activities are paused, only a single activity (not "
"counting the activity created at startup) is visible at a time, and "
"unattached frames are displayed in the first unoccupied activity available."
msgstr ""
"Android 4.4以前のバージョンでは、ウィンドウ管理を完全に実装するには不十分な、"
"著しく劣ったインターフェースが提供されています。こうしたシステムにおいて、"
"Emacsはかなり原始的な仕組みを採用しており、初期フレーム以外のすべてのフレーム"
"はアクティビティが一時停止した際に削除され、一度に表示できるのは単一のアク"
"ティビティ（起動時に作成されたアクティビティを除く）のみとなり、未アタッチの"
"フレームは利用可能な最初の空きアクティビティに表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Android-Windowing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-windowing-limitations_002c-"
"android\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-frame-parameters_002c-"
"android\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-windowing-limitations_002c-"
"android\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-frame-parameters_002c-"
"android\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Android-Windowing.html
msgid ""
"Emacs only supports a limited subset of GUI features on Android; the "
"limitations are as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Emacs は Android 上で限定的な GUI 機能しかサポートしておらず、その制限内容は"
"以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Android-Windowing.html
msgid ""
"Scroll bars are not supported, as they are close to useless on Android "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"Android端末ではスクロールバーはほぼ役に立たないため、サポートされていません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Android-Windowing.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">alpha</code>, <code class=\"code\">alpha-"
"background</code>, <code class=\"code\">z-group</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">override-redirect</code>, <code class=\"code\">mouse-color</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">title</code>, <code class=\"code\">wait-for-wm</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">sticky</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">undecorated</code> frame parameters (see <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Frame-Parameters.html#Frame-Parameters\">Frame Parameters</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">the Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>) are unsupported."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">alpha</code>、<code class=\"code\">alpha-background</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">z-group</code>、<code class=\"code\">override-"
"redirect</code>、<code class=\"code\">mouse-color</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">title</code>、<code class=\"code\">wait-for-wm</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">sticky</code>、および<code class=\"code\">undecorated</code>の"
"フレームパラメータ（<cite class=\"cite\">the Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</"
"cite>の<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/elisp/Frame-Parameters.html#Frame-Parameters\">Frame "
"Parameters</a>を参照）はサポートされていません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Android-Windowing.html
msgid ""
"On Android 4.0 and earlier, the <code class=\"code\">fullscreen</code> frame "
"parameter is always <code class=\"code\">maximized</code> for top-level "
"frames; on later versions of Android, it can also be <code "
"class=\"code\">fullscreen</code>."
msgstr ""
"Android 4.0 以前では、トップレベルフレームの <code "
"class=\"code\">fullscreen</code> フレームパラメータは常に <code "
"class=\"code\">maximized</code> となりますが、それ以降のバージョンの Android "
"では <code class=\"code\">fullscreen</code> となる場合もあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Android-Windowing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-selections_002c-android\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-android-clipboard\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-selections_002c-android\"></a> <a "
