msgstr ""
"<span>33.10.6 任命<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Appointments-1\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appointment-notification\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002ddisplay_002dformat\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002daudible\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002ddisplay_002dmode_002dline\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appointment-notification\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002ddisplay_002dformat\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002daudible\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002ddisplay_002dmode_002dline\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid ""
"If you have a diary entry for an appointment, and that diary entry begins "
"with a recognizable time of day, Emacs can warn you in advance that an "
"appointment is pending.  Emacs alerts you to the appointment by displaying a "
"message in your chosen format, as specified by the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">appt-display-format</code>.  If the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">appt-audible</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"the warning includes an audible reminder.  In addition, if <code "
"class=\"code\">appt-display-mode-line</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs displays the number of minutes to the "
"appointment on the mode line."
msgstr ""
"予定に関する日記エントリがあり、そのエントリが判別可能な時間帯から始まってい"
"る場合、Emacsは予定が控えていることを事前に通知できます。Emacsは、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">appt-display-format</code> で指定された任意の形式でメッセージ"
"を表示し、予定を知らせます。<code class=\"code\">appt-audible</code> の値が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、警告には音声によるリマインダーが"
"含まれます。さらに、<code class=\"code\">appt-display-mode-line</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacsはモードラインに予定までの残"
"り分数を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002ddisplay_002dduration\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"appt_002ddisp_002dwindow_002dfunction\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-appt_002ddelete_002dwindow_002dfunction\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002ddisplay_002dduration\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"appt_002ddisp_002dwindow_002dfunction\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-appt_002ddelete_002dwindow_002dfunction\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">appt-display-format</code> has the value <code "
"class=\"code\">window</code>, then the variable <code class=\"code\">appt-"
"display-duration</code> controls how long the reminder window is visible "
"for; and the variables <code class=\"code\">appt-disp-window-function</code> "
"and <code class=\"code\">appt-delete-window-function</code> give the names "
"of functions used to create and destroy the window, respectively."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">appt-display-format</code> の値が <code "
"class=\"code\">window</code> である場合、変数 <code class=\"code\">appt-"
"display-duration</code> がリマインダーウィンドウの表示時間を制御し、変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">appt-disp-window-function</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">appt-delete-window-function</code> はそれぞれウィンドウの作成"
"と破棄に使用される関数名を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002dactivate\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002dactivate\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid ""
"To enable appointment notification, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x appt-"
"activate</kbd>.  With a positive argument, it enables notification; with a "
"negative argument, it disables notification; with no argument, it toggles.  "
"Enabling notification also sets up an appointment list for today from the "
"diary file, giving all diary entries found with recognizable times of day, "
"and reminds you just before each of them."
msgstr ""
"予約通知を有効にするには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x appt-activate</kbd> と入力し"
"てください。正の引数を指定すると通知が有効になり、負の引数を指定すると無効に"
"なり、引数がない場合は切り替わります。通知を有効にすると、ダイアリーファイル"
"から本日の予約リストが作成され、時刻が判別可能なすべてのダイアリーエントリが"
"抽出され、それぞれの直前にリマインダーが表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid "For example, suppose the diary file contains these lines:"
msgstr "例えば、日記ファイルに次のような行が含まれているとします。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Monday\n"
"  9:30am Coffee break\n"
" 12:00pm Lunch\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"appt_002dmessage_002dwarning_002dtime\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-appt_002dwarning_002dtime_002dregexp\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"appt_002dmessage_002dwarning_002dtime\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-appt_002dwarning_002dtime_002dregexp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid ""
"Then on Mondays, you will be reminded at around 9:20am about your coffee "
"break and at around 11:50am about lunch.  The variable <code "
"class=\"code\">appt-message-warning-time</code> specifies how many minutes "
"(default 12)  in advance to warn you.  This is a default warning time.  Each "
"appointment can specify a different warning time by adding a piece matching "
"<code class=\"code\">appt-warning-time-regexp</code> (see that "
"variable&rsquo;s documentation for details)."
msgstr ""
"また、月曜日は午前9時20分頃にコーヒーブレイクのリマインダーが、午前11時50分頃"
"に昼食のリマインダーが届きます。変数 <code class=\"code\">appt-message-"
"warning-time</code> は、何分前（デフォルトは12分）に通知するかを指定します。"
"これはデフォルトの通知時間です。各予定では、<code class=\"code\">appt-"
"warning-time-regexp</code> に一致する記述を追加することで、それぞれ異なる通知"
"時間を指定できます（詳細は当該変数のドキュメントを参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid ""
"You can write times in am/pm style (with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">12:00am</samp>&rsquo; standing for midnight and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">12:00pm</samp>&rsquo; standing for noon), or 24-hour European/"
"military style.  You need not be consistent; your diary file can have a "
"mixture of the two styles.  Times must be at the beginning of diary entries "
"if they are to be recognized."
msgstr ""
"時刻は、am/pm形式（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">12:00am</samp>&rsquo;は午前0"
"時、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">12:00pm</samp>&rsquo;は正午を表します）、また"
"は欧州式・軍用式の24時間形式で記述できます。形式を統一する必要はなく、日記"
"ファイル内でこれら2つの形式を混在させても構いません。時刻を認識させるには、日"
"記エントリの冒頭に記述する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002ddisplay_002ddiary\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002ddisplay_002ddiary\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid ""
"Emacs updates the appointments list from the diary file automatically just "
"after midnight.  You can force an update at any time by re-enabling "
"appointment notification.  Both these actions also display the day&rsquo;s "
"diary buffer, unless you set <code class=\"code\">appt-display-diary</code> "
"to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The appointments list is also updated "
"whenever the diary file (or a file it includes; see <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Fancy-Diary-Display.html\">Fancy Diary Display</a>)  is saved.  If "
"you use the Org Mode and keep appointments in your Org agenda files, you can "
"add those appointments to the list using the <code class=\"code\">org-agenda-"
"to-appt</code> command.  See <a data-manual=\"org\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/org/Weekly_002fdaily-"
"agenda.html#Weekly_002fdaily-agenda\">Appointment reminders</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Org Manual</cite>, for more about that command."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、午前0時を過ぎた直後にダイアリーファイルから予定リストを自動的に更新"
"します。予定通知を再度有効にすることで、いつでも強制的に更新を行うことができ"
"ます。また、<code class=\"code\">appt-display-diary</code>を<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>に設定していない限り、これら両方の操作によってその日"
"のダイアリーバッファも表示されます。予定リストは、ダイアリーファイル（または"
"それがインクルードしているファイル。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Fancy-Diary-"
"Display.html\">Fancy Diary Display</a>を参照）が保存されるたびにも更新されま"
"す。Orgモードを使用し、Orgアジェンダファイルに予定を管理している場合は、"
"<code class=\"code\">org-agenda-to-appt</code>コマンドを使用してそれらの予定"
"をリストに追加できます。このコマンドの詳細については、<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Org Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"org\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/org/Weekly_002fdaily-"
"agenda.html#Weekly_002fdaily-agenda\">Appointment reminders</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002dadd\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002ddelete\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-alarm-clock\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002dadd\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-appt_002ddelete\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-alarm-clock\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Appointments.html
msgid ""
"You can also use the appointment notification facility like an alarm clock.  "
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x appt-add</kbd> adds entries to the "
"appointment list without affecting your diary file.  You delete entries from "
"the appointment list with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x appt-delete</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"また、予定通知機能を目覚まし時計のように利用することもできます。コマンド "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x appt-add</kbd> を使用すると、ダイアリーファイルに影響"
"を与えることなく、予定リストに項目を追加できます。予定リストから項目を削除す"
"るには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x appt-delete</kbd> を使用します。"

