# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Apropos.html
msgid ""
"If the variable <code class=\"code\">apropos-do-all</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, most apropos commands behave as if they had been "
"given a prefix argument.  There is one exception: <code "
"class=\"code\">apropos-variable</code> without a prefix argument will always "
"search for all variables, no matter what the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">apropos-do-all</code> is."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">apropos-do-all</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> でない場合、ほとんどの apropos コマンドは、接頭辞引数が指定されたかのよ"
"うに動作します。ただし、1つだけ例外があります。接頭辞引数のない <code "
"class=\"code\">apropos-variable</code> は、<code class=\"code\">apropos-do-"
"all</code> の値にかかわらず、常にすべての変数を検索します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Apropos.html
