#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Authentication.html
msgid ""
"<span>51.5 Keeping Persistent Authentication Information<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Keeping-Persistent-Authentication-Information\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>51.5 永続的な認証情報の保持<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Keeping-"
"Persistent-Authentication-Information\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Authentication.html
msgid ""
"Some Emacs packages, which connect to other services, require authentication "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Passwords.html\">Entering passwords</a>), "
"e.g., see <a data-manual=\"gnus\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/gnus/index.html#Top\">Gnus</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The "
"Gnus Manual</cite>, or <a data-manual=\"tramp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/tramp/index.html#Top\">Tramp</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Tramp Manual</cite>.  Because it might be annoying to "
"provide the same user name and password again and again, Emacs offers to "
"keep this information persistent via the <samp class=\"file\">auth-source</"
"samp> library."
msgstr ""
"他のサービスに接続する一部のEmacsパッケージでは、認証が必要です（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Passwords.html\">パスワードの入力</a>を参照）。例え"
"ば、<cite class=\"cite\">The Gnus Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"gnus\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/gnus/"
"index.html#Top\">Gnus</a>や、<cite class=\"cite\">The Tramp Manual</cite>の"
"<a data-manual=\"tramp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/tramp/index.html#Top\">Tramp</a>などが挙げられます。同じユーザー名"
"とパスワードを繰り返し入力するのは手間がかかるため、Emacsでは<samp "
"class=\"file\">auth-source</samp>ライブラリを通じてこれらの情報を永続的に保持"
"する機能を提供しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Authentication.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_007e_002f_002eauthinfo-file\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_007e_002f_002eauthinfo_002egpg-"
"file\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_007e_002f_002enetrc-"
"file\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_007e_002f_002eauthinfo-file\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_007e_002f_002eauthinfo_002egpg-"
"file\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_007e_002f_002enetrc-"
"file\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Authentication.html
msgid ""
"By default, the authentication information is taken from the file <samp "
"class=\"file\">~/.authinfo</samp> or <samp class=\"file\">~/.authinfo.gpg</"
"samp> or <samp class=\"file\">~/.netrc</samp>.  These files have a syntax "
"similar to netrc files as known from the <code class=\"command\">ftp</code> "
"program, like this:"
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、認証情報はファイル <samp class=\"file\">~/.authinfo</samp>、"
"<samp class=\"file\">~/.authinfo.gpg</samp>、または <samp "
"class=\"file\">~/.netrc</samp> から取得されます。これらのファイルは、<code "
"class=\"command\">ftp</code> プログラムで知られる netrc ファイルと同様の構文"
"を持っており、次のような形式になっています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Authentication.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "machine <var class=\"var\">mymachine</var> login <var class=\"var\">myloginname</var> password <var class=\"var\">mypassword</var> port <var class=\"var\">myport</var>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Authentication.html
msgid ""
"Similarly, the <samp class=\"file\">auth-source</samp> library supports "
"multiple storage backend, currently either the classic netrc backend, JSON "
"files, the Secret Service API, and pass, the standard unix password manager."
msgstr ""
"同様に、<samp class=\"file\">auth-source</samp>ライブラリは複数のストレージ"
"バックエンドをサポートしており、現在は従来のnetrcバックエンド、JSONファイル、"
"Secret Service API、および標準的なUnixパスワードマネージャーであるpassのいず"
"れかが利用可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Authentication.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-auth_002dsources\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-auth_002dsources\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Authentication.html
msgid ""
"All these alternatives can be customized via the user option <code "
"class=\"code\">auth-sources</code>, see <a data-manual=\"auth\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/auth/Help-for-"
"users.html#Help-for-users\">Emacs auth-source</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">Emacs auth-source</cite>."
msgstr ""
"これらの代替手段はすべて、ユーザーオプション <code class=\"code\">auth-"
"sources</code> でカスタマイズ可能です。<cite class=\"cite\">Emacs auth-"
"source</cite> の <a data-manual=\"auth\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/auth/Help-for-users.html#Help-for-users\">Emacs auth-"
"source</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Authentication.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"auth_002dsource_002dsave_002dbehavior\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"auth_002dsource_002dsave_002dbehavior\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Authentication.html
msgid ""
"When a password is entered interactively, which is not found via the "
"configured backend, some of the backends offer to save it persistently.  "
"This can be changed by customizing the user option <code class=\"code\">auth-"
"source-save-behavior</code>."
msgstr ""
"パスワードを対話的に入力した際、設定済みのバックエンドで見つからない場合、一"
"部のバックエンドではそれを永続的に保存する機能を提供しています。これは、ユー"
"ザーオプション <code class=\"code\">auth-source-save-behavior</code> をカスタ"
"マイズすることで変更可能です。"

