# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Fill.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Auto Fill</em> mode is a buffer-local minor mode (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minor-Modes.html\">Minor Modes</a>) in which lines "
"are broken automatically when the line becomes too wide and you type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Auto Fill</em>モードは、行幅が広すぎた際に<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>または<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>と入力すると自動的に行が折り"
"返される、バッファローカルなマイナーモード（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minor-"
"Modes.html\">マイナーモード</a>を参照）です。"

