#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<span>16.3 Automatic Scrolling<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Automatic-"
"Scrolling\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>16.3 自動スクロール<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Automatic-"
"Scrolling\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Scrolling.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-automatic-scrolling\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-automatic-scrolling\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"Emacs performs <em class=\"dfn\">automatic scrolling</em> when point moves "
"out of the visible portion of the text.  Normally, automatic scrolling "
"centers point vertically in the window, but there are several ways to alter "
"this behavior."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、ポイントがテキストの表示範囲外に移動すると、<em class=\"dfn\">自動"
"スクロール</em>が行われます。通常、自動スクロールによってポイントはウィンドウ"
"内で垂直方向に中央揃えされますが、この動作を変更する方法がいくつかあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scroll_002dconservatively\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"scroll_002dminibuffer_002dconservatively\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scroll_002dconservatively\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"scroll_002dminibuffer_002dconservatively\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"If you set <code class=\"code\">scroll-conservatively</code> to a small "
"number <var class=\"var\">n</var>, then moving point just a little off the "
"screen (no more than <var class=\"var\">n</var> lines) causes Emacs to "
"scroll just enough to bring point back on screen; if doing so fails to make "
"point visible, Emacs scrolls just far enough to center point in the window.  "
"If you set <code class=\"code\">scroll-conservatively</code> to a large "
"number (larger than 100), automatic scrolling never centers point, no matter "
"how far point moves; Emacs always scrolls text just enough to bring point "
"into view, either at the top or bottom of the window depending on the scroll "
"direction.  By default, <code class=\"code\">scroll-conservatively</code> "
"is&nbsp;0, which means to always center point in the window.  This said, in "
"minibuffer windows, scrolling is always conservative by default because "
"<code class=\"code\">scroll-minibuffer-conservatively</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, which takes precedence over <code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-conservatively</code>."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Scrolling.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scroll_002dstep\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scroll_002dstep\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"Another way to control automatic scrolling is to customize the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">scroll-step</code>.  Its value determines the number of "
"lines by which to automatically scroll, when point moves off the screen.  If "
"scrolling by that number of lines fails to bring point back into view, point "
"is centered instead.  The default value is zero, which (by default) causes "
"point to always be centered after scrolling."
msgstr ""
"自動スクロールを制御するもう一つの方法は、変数 <code class=\"code\">scroll-"
"step</code> をカスタマイズすることです。この値によって、ポイントが画面外に移"
"動した際に自動的にスクロールさせる行数が決まります。この行数分だけスクロール"
"してもポイントが画面内に復帰しない場合は、代わりにポイントが中央に配置されま"
"す。デフォルト値は 0 で、（デフォルトでは）スクロール後にポイントが常に中央に"
"配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-aggressive-scrolling\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scroll_002dup_002daggressively\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scroll_002ddown_002daggressively\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-aggressive-scrolling\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scroll_002dup_002daggressively\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scroll_002ddown_002daggressively\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"A third way to control automatic scrolling is to customize the variables "
"<code class=\"code\">scroll-up-aggressively</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-down-aggressively</code>, which directly specify the "
"vertical position of point after scrolling.  The value of <code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-up-aggressively</code> should be either <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> (the default), or a floating point number <var "
"class=\"var\">f</var> between 0 and 1.  The latter means that when point "
"goes below the bottom window edge (i.e., scrolling forward), Emacs scrolls "
"the window so that point is <var class=\"var\">f</var> parts of the window "
"height from the bottom window edge.  Thus, larger <var class=\"var\">f</var> "
"means more aggressive scrolling: more new text is brought into view.  The "
"default value, <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, is equivalent to 0.5."
msgstr ""
"自動スクロールを制御する3つ目の方法は、変数 <code class=\"code\">scroll-up-"
"aggressively</code> と <code class=\"code\">scroll-down-aggressively</code> "
"をカスタマイズすることです。これらの変数は、スクロール後のポイントの垂直位置"
"を直接指定します。<code class=\"code\">scroll-up-aggressively</code> の値は、"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>（デフォルト）か、0から1の間の浮動小数点数 "
"<var class=\"var\">f</var> のいずれかにする必要があります。後者の場合、ポイン"
"トがウィンドウの下端より下に移動したとき（つまり前方にスクロールしたとき）、"
"Emacs はウィンドウをスクロールし、ポイントがウィンドウ下端からウィンドウ高さ"
"の <var class=\"var\">f</var> 倍の位置にくるようにします。したがって、<var "
"class=\"var\">f</var> の値が大きいほどスクロールが積極的になり、より多くの新"
"しいテキストが表示領域に入ります。デフォルト値の <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> は 0.5 に相当します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"Likewise, <code class=\"code\">scroll-down-aggressively</code> is used when "
"point goes above the top window edge (i.e., scrolling backward).  The value "
"specifies how far point should be from the top margin of the window after "
"scrolling.  Thus, as with <code class=\"code\">scroll-up-aggressively</"
"code>, a larger value is more aggressive."
msgstr ""
"同様に、ポイントがウィンドウの上端を超える場合（つまり、後方にスクロールする"
"場合）には <code class=\"code\">scroll-down-aggressively</code> が使用されま"
"す。この値は、スクロール後にポイントがウィンドウの上端マージンからどれだけ離"
"れているべきかを指定します。したがって、<code class=\"code\">scroll-up-"
"aggressively</code> と同様に、値が大きいほどより大幅にスクロールします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"Note that the variables <code class=\"code\">scroll-conservatively</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">scroll-step</code>, and <code class=\"code\">scroll-up-"
"aggressively</code> / <code class=\"code\">scroll-down-aggressively</code> "
"control automatic scrolling in contradictory ways.  Therefore, you should "
"pick no more than one of these methods to customize automatic scrolling.  In "
"case you customize multiple variables, the order of priority is: <code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-conservatively</code>, then <code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-step</code>, and finally <code class=\"code\">scroll-"
"up-aggressively</code> / <code class=\"code\">scroll-down-aggressively</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"なお、変数 <code class=\"code\">scroll-conservatively</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-step</code>、および <code class=\"code\">scroll-up-"
"aggressively</code> / <code class=\"code\">scroll-down-aggressively</code> "
"は、それぞれ相反する形で自動スクロールを制御します。そのため、自動スクロール"
"をカスタマイズする際は、これらの方法のうち最大1つのみを選択してください。複数"
"の変数をカスタマイズする場合、優先順位は <code class=\"code\">scroll-"
"conservatively</code>、次に <code class=\"code\">scroll-step</code>、そして最"
"後に <code class=\"code\">scroll-up-aggressively</code> / <code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-down-aggressively</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scroll_002dmargin\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-maximum_002dscroll_002dmargin\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-scroll_002dmargin\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-maximum_002dscroll_002dmargin\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Auto-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">scroll-margin</code> restricts how close "
"point can come to the top or bottom of a window (even if aggressive "
"scrolling specifies a fraction <var class=\"var\">f</var> that is larger "
"than the window portion between the top and the bottom margins).  Its value "
"is a number of screen lines; if point comes within that many lines of the "
"top or bottom of the window, Emacs performs automatic scrolling.  By "
"default, <code class=\"code\">scroll-margin</code> is 0.  The effective "
"margin size is limited to a quarter of the window height by default, but "
"this limit can be increased up to half (or decreased down to zero) by "
"customizing <code class=\"code\">maximum-scroll-margin</code>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">scroll-margin</code> は、ポイントがウィンドウの上端"
"または下端にどれだけ近づけるかを制限します（アグレッシブスクロールで、上端と"
"下端のマージン間のウィンドウ領域よりも大きな分数 <var class=\"var\">f</var> "
"が指定されている場合でも同様です）。その値は画面行数であり、ポイントがウィン"
"ドウの上端または下端からその行数分以内に近づいた場合、Emacs は自動的にスク"
"ロールを行います。デフォルトでは <code class=\"code\">scroll-margin</code> "
"は 0 です。実効マージンサイズはデフォルトでウィンドウ高さの 4 分の 1 に制限さ"
"れていますが、<code class=\"code\">maximum-scroll-margin</code> をカスタマイ"
"ズすることで、この制限を最大で半分まで拡大（または 0 まで縮小）できます。"

