# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Help.html
msgid ""
"If you forget what a key does, you can find out by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h k</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-key</code>), "
"followed by the key of interest; for example, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h k C-n</"
"kbd> tells you what <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> does."
msgstr ""
"キーの機能を忘れてしまった場合は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h k</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">describe-key</code>) と入力した後に目的のキーを続けることで確"
"認できます。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h k C-n</kbd> と入力すれば <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> の機能が分かります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Help.html
msgid ""
"The prefix key <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd> stands for &ldquo;help&rdquo;.  "
"The key <kbd class=\"key\">F1</kbd> serves as an alias for <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd>.  Apart from <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h k</kbd>, there "
"are many other help commands providing different kinds of help."
msgstr ""
"プレフィックスキー <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd> は「help」を表します。キー "
"<kbd class=\"key\">F1</kbd> は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd> のエイリアスとし"
"て機能します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h k</kbd> 以外にも、さまざまな種類のヘルプ"
"を提供するヘルプコマンドが数多く存在します。"

