# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-forward</code>) "
"starts a forward incremental search.  It reads characters from the keyboard, "
"and moves point just past the end of the next occurrence of those characters "
"in the buffer."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-forward</code>) は"
"前方インクリメンタル検索を開始します。キーボードから文字を読み込み、バッファ"
"内でそれらの文字が次に出現する位置の直後までポイントを移動させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"For instance, if you type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> and then <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">F</kbd>, that puts the cursor after the first &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">F</samp>&rsquo; that occurs in the buffer after the starting "
"point.  If you then type <kbd class=\"kbd\">O</kbd>, the cursor moves to "
"just after the first &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FO</samp>&rsquo;; the "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">F</samp>&rsquo; in that &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FO</samp>&rsquo; might not be the first &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">F</samp>&rsquo; previously found.  After another <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">O</kbd>, the cursor moves to just after the first &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> と入力し、次に <kbd class=\"kbd\">F</"
"kbd> と入力すると、カーソルは開始位置以降のバッファ内で最初に現れる &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">F</samp>&rsquo; の後に置かれます。さらに <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">O</kbd> と入力すると、カーソルは最初の &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FO</samp>&rsquo; の直後へ移動します。その &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FO</samp>&rsquo; に含まれる &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">F</"
"samp>&rsquo; は、それまでに見つかった最初の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">F</"
"samp>&rsquo; ではない可能性があります。さらに <kbd class=\"kbd\">O</kbd> と入"
"力すると、カーソルは最初の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>&rsquo; の直"
"後へ移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-faces-for-highlighting-search-"
"matches\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-isearch-face\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-faces-for-highlighting-search-"
"matches\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-isearch-face\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"At each step, Emacs highlights the <em class=\"dfn\">current match</"
"em>&mdash;the buffer text that matches the search string&mdash;using the "
"<code class=\"code\">isearch</code> face (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Faces.html\">Text Faces</a>).  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Search-"
"Customizations.html\">Tailoring Search to Your Needs</a>, for various "
"options that customize this highlighting.  The current search string is also "
"displayed in the echo area."
msgstr ""
"各ステップで、Emacsは<em class=\"dfn\">現在のマッチ箇所</em>&mdash;検索文字列"
"に一致するバッファ内のテキスト&mdash;を<code class=\"code\">isearch</code>"
"フェイス（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Faces.html\">テキストフェイス</a>を参照）"
"を用いてハイライトします。このハイライトをカスタマイズするための各種オプショ"
"ンについては、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Search-Customizations.html\">検索の"
"ニーズに合わせた調整</a>を参照してください。また、現在の検索文字列はエコーエ"
"リアにも表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-isearch-input-item\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-input-item_002c-isearch\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-isearch_002ddelete_002dchar\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-DEL-_0028Incremental-search_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-isearch-input-item\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-input-item_002c-isearch\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-isearch_002ddelete_002dchar\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-DEL-_0028Incremental-search_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"If you make a mistake typing the search string, type <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-delete-char</code>).  Each <kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> cancels the last input item entered during the "
"search.  Emacs records a new <em class=\"dfn\">input item</em> whenever you "
"type a command that changes the search string, the position of point, the "
"success or failure of the search, the direction of the search, the position "
"of the other end of the current search result, or the "
"&ldquo;wrappedness&rdquo; of the search.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Error-"
"in-Isearch.html\">Errors in Incremental Search</a>, for more about dealing "
"with unsuccessful search."
msgstr ""
"検索文字列の入力時に誤りがあった場合は、<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-delete-char</code>) と入力してください。<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> を入力するたびに、検索中に最後に入力された項目がキャ"
"ンセルされます。Emacs は、検索文字列、ポイントの位置、検索の成否、検索方向、"
"現在の検索結果のもう一方の端の位置、または検索の「折り返し」状態を変更するコ"
"マンドを入力するたびに、新しい <em class=\"dfn\">入力項目</em> を記録します。"
"検索に失敗した場合の対処法の詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Error-"
"in-Isearch.html\">インクリメンタル検索におけるエラー</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-exit-incremental-search\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-incremental-search_002c-exiting\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-isearch_002dexit\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-RET-_0028Incremental-search_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-exit-incremental-search\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-incremental-search_002c-exiting\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-isearch_002dexit\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-RET-_0028Incremental-search_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"When you are satisfied with the place you have reached, type <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-exit</code>).  This "
"stops searching, leaving the cursor where the search brought it.  Also, any "
"command not specially meaningful in searches stops the searching and is then "
"executed.  Thus, typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> exits the search and "
"then moves to the beginning of the line; typing one of the arrow keys exits "
"the search and performs the respective movement command; etc.  <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> is necessary only if the next command you want to "
"type is a printing character, <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd>, or another character that is special within "
"searches (<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-q</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-w</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"y</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-y</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-r</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-c</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-e</kbd>, and some others "
"described below).  You can fine-tune the commands that exit the search; see "
"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Not-Exiting-Isearch.html\">Not Exiting Incremental "
"Search</a>."
msgstr ""
"現在の位置に満足したら、<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-exit</code>) と入力してください。これにより検索が停止"
"し、カーソルは検索で到達した位置に留まります。また、検索において特別な意味を"
"持たないコマンドは、検索を停止させた上で実行されます。したがって、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> と入力すると検索が終了して行頭に移動し、矢印キーのい"
"ずれかを入力すると検索が終了して対応する移動コマンドが実行される、といった具"
"合です。<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> が必要なのは、次に入力したいコマンドが印"
"字文字、<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>、<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>、あるいは"
"検索において特別な意味を持つその他の文字（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-q</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-w</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"s</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-y</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-r</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-c</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"e</kbd>、および以下で説明するその他の文字）である場合に限られます。検索を終了"
"させるコマンドは微調整可能です。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Not-Exiting-"
"Isearch.html\">インクリメンタル検索を終了させない方法</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"As a special exception, entering <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> when the "
"search string is empty launches nonincremental search (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Nonincremental-Search.html\">Nonincremental Search</"
"a>).  (This can be customized; see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Search-"
"Customizations.html\">Tailoring Search to Your Needs</a>.)"
msgstr ""
