# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"In addition to the <kbd class=\"key\">F3</kbd> and <kbd class=\"key\">F4</"
"kbd> commands described above, Emacs also supports an older set of key "
"bindings for defining and executing keyboard macros.  To begin a macro "
"definition, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x (</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-"
"start-macro</code>); as with <kbd class=\"key\">F3</kbd>, a prefix argument "
"appends this definition to the last keyboard macro.  To end a macro "
"definition, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x )</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-"
"end-macro</code>).  To execute the most recent macro, type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-end-and-call-macro</"
"code>).  If you enter <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x e</kbd> while defining a macro, "
"the macro is terminated and executed immediately.  Immediately after typing "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x e</kbd>, you can type <kbd class=\"kbd\">e</kbd> "
"repeatedly to immediately repeat the macro one or more times.  You can also "
"give <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x e</kbd> a repeat argument, just like <kbd "
"class=\"key\">F4</kbd> (when it is used to execute a macro)."
msgstr ""
"前述の <kbd class=\"key\">F3</kbd> および <kbd class=\"key\">F4</kbd> コマン"
"ドに加え、Emacs ではキーボードマクロを定義・実行するための、より古いキーバイ"
"ンド群もサポートしています。マクロの定義を開始するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x (</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-start-macro</code>) と入力します。"
"<kbd class=\"key\">F3</kbd> と同様に、接頭辞引数を指定すると、この定義が最後"
"のキーボードマクロに追加されます。マクロの定義を終了するには、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x )</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-end-macro</code>) と入"
"力します。直近のマクロを実行するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x e</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">kmacro-end-and-call-macro</code>) と入力します。マクロの定義中"
"に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x e</kbd> を入力すると、そのマクロは終了し、直ちに実"
"行されます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x e</kbd> と入力した直後、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">e</kbd> を繰り返し入力することで、そのマクロを即座に1回以上繰り"
"返すことができます。また、<kbd class=\"key\">F4</kbd>（マクロの実行に使用され"
"る場合）と同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x e</kbd> に繰り返し引数を指定すること"
"も可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x )</kbd> can be given a repeat count as an argument.  "
"This means to repeat the macro right after defining it.  The macro "
"definition itself counts as the first repetition, since it is executed as "
"you define it, so <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u 4 C-x )</kbd> executes the macro "
"immediately 3 additional times."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x )</kbd> には引数として繰り返し回数を指定できます。これ"
"により、マクロを定義した直後にそのマクロを繰り返すことができます。マクロの定"
"義自体は、定義と同時に実行されるため1回目の繰り返しとしてカウントされます。し"
"たがって、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u 4 C-x )</kbd> はマクロを直ちにさらに3回実行"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kmacro_002dredisplay\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-d\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kmacro_002dredisplay\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-d\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Basic-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"While executing a long-running keyboard macro, it can sometimes be useful to "
"trigger a redisplay (to show how far we&rsquo;ve gotten).  The <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k d</kbd> command can be used for this.  As a not very "
"useful example, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x ( M-f C-x C-k d C-x )</kbd> will "
"create a macro that will redisplay once per iteration when saying <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u 42 C-x e</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"長時間実行されるキーボードマクロの実行中、再表示（どこまで進んだかを確認する"
"ため）をトリガーすると便利な場合があります。これには <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"C-k d</kbd> コマンドが利用できます。あまり実用的ではない例を挙げると、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x ( M-f C-x C-k d C-x )</kbd> を指定すると、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u 42 C-x e</kbd> と言った際に1回の反復ごとに再表示を行うマク"
"ロが作成されます。"

