# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"Emacs supports editing text written in scripts, such as Arabic, Farsi, and "
"Hebrew, whose natural ordering of horizontal text for display is from right "
"to left.  However, digits and Latin text embedded in these scripts are still "
"displayed left to right.  It is also not uncommon to have small portions of "
"text in Arabic or Hebrew embedded in an otherwise Latin document; e.g., as "
"comments and strings in a program source file.  For these reasons, text that "
"uses these scripts is actually <em class=\"dfn\">bidirectional</em>: a "
"mixture of runs of left-to-right and right-to-left characters."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、アラビア語、ペルシア語、ヘブライ語など、表示時の水平方向の自然な順序"
"が右から左となる文字体系で書かれたテキストの編集をサポートしています。しか"
"し、これらの文字体系に埋め込まれた数字やラテン文字は、依然として左から右に表"
"示されます。また、それ以外の部分がラテン文字である文書の中に、アラビア語やヘ"
"ブライ語のテキストが一部埋め込まれていることも珍しくありません。例えば、プロ"
"グラムのソースファイル内のコメントや文字列などが挙げられます。こうした理由か"
"ら、これらの文字体系を用いたテキストは実際には<em class=\"dfn\">双方向</em>で"
"あり、左から右へ書かれる文字と右から左へ書かれる文字が混在しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"This section describes the facilities and options provided by Emacs for "
"editing bidirectional text."
msgstr ""
"この節では、双方向テキストを編集するために Emacs が提供する機能やオプションに"
"ついて説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-logical-order\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-visual-order\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-logical-order\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-visual-order\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"Emacs stores right-to-left and bidirectional text in the so-called <em "
"class=\"dfn\">logical</em> (or <em class=\"dfn\">reading</em>) order: the "
"buffer or string position of the first character you read precedes that of "
"the next character.  Reordering of bidirectional text into the <em "
"class=\"dfn\">visual</em> order happens at display time.  As a result, "
"character positions no longer increase monotonically with their positions on "
"display.  Emacs implements the Unicode Bidirectional Algorithm (UBA) "
"described in the <a class=\"uref\" href=\"https://unicode.org/reports/"
"tr9/\">Unicode Standard Annex #9</a>, for reordering of bidirectional text "
"for display.  It deviates from the UBA only in how continuation lines are "
"displayed when text direction is opposite to the base paragraph direction, "
"e.g., when a long line of English text appears in a right-to-left paragraph."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、右から左へ書かれるテキストや双方向テキストを、いわゆる<em "
"class=\"dfn\">論理</em>（または<em class=\"dfn\">読み順</em>）で格納します。"
"つまり、最初に読み取った文字のバッファまたは文字列上の位置が、次の文字の位置"
"よりも先になります。双方向テキストを<em class=\"dfn\">表示順</em>に並べ替える"
"処理は、表示時に行われます。その結果、文字の位置は、画面上の位置に応じて単調"
"に増加しなくなります。Emacsは、表示用の双方向テキストの並べ替えに、<a "
"class=\"uref\" href=\"https://unicode.org/reports/tr9/\">Unicode Standard "
"Annex #9</a>で記述されているUnicode Bidirectional Algorithm (UBA)を実装してい"
"ます。UBAと異なる点は、テキストの方向がベースとなる段落の方向と逆である場合"
"（例えば、右から左へ書かれる段落に長い英文の行が現れる場合など）の、継続行の"
"表示方法のみです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bidi_002ddisplay_002dreordering\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bidi_002ddisplay_002dreordering\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"The buffer-local variable <code class=\"code\">bidi-display-reordering</"
"code> controls whether text in the buffer is reordered for display.  If its "
"value is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs reorders characters that "
"have right-to-left directionality when they are displayed.  The default "
"value is <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"バッファローカル変数 <code class=\"code\">bidi-display-reordering</code> は、"
"バッファ内のテキストを表示時に並べ替えるかどうかを制御します。その値が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacs は右から左への書字方向を持つ文字"
"を表示時に並べ替えます。デフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">t</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-base-direction-of-paragraphs\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-paragraph_002c-base-direction\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"bidi_002dparagraph_002dstart_002dre\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-bidi_002dparagraph_002dseparate_002dre\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-base-direction-of-paragraphs\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-paragraph_002c-base-direction\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"bidi_002dparagraph_002dstart_002dre\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-bidi_002dparagraph_002dseparate_002dre\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"Each paragraph of bidirectional text can have its own <em class=\"dfn\">base "
"direction</em>, either right-to-left or left-to-right.  Text in left-to-"
"right paragraphs begins on the screen at the left margin of the window and "
"is truncated or continued when it reaches the right margin.  By contrast, "
"text in right-to-left paragraphs is displayed starting at the right margin "
"and is continued or truncated at the left margin.  By default, paragraph "
"boundaries are empty lines, i.e., lines consisting entirely of whitespace "
"characters.  To change that, you can customize the two variables <code "
"class=\"code\">bidi-paragraph-start-re</code> and <code class=\"code\">bidi-"
"paragraph-separate-re</code>, whose values should be regular expressions "
"(strings); e.g., to have a single newline start a new paragraph, set both of "
"these variables to <code class=\"code\">&quot;^&quot;</code>.  These two "
"variables are buffer-local (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Locals.html\">Local Variables</a>)."
msgstr ""
"双方向テキストの各段落は、右から左、または左から右のいずれかの<em "
"class=\"dfn\">基本方向</em>を持つことができます。左から右へ記述される段落のテ"
"キストは、画面上のウィンドウ左端から始まり、右端に達すると切り詰められるか、"
"あるいは続きが表示されます。対照的に、右から左へ記述される段落のテキストは、"
"右端から始まり、左端で続きが表示されるか、あるいは切り詰められます。デフォル"
"トでは、段落の境界は空行、つまり空白文字のみで構成される行となります。これを"
"変更するには、2つの変数 <code class=\"code\">bidi-paragraph-start-re</code> "
"と <code class=\"code\">bidi-paragraph-separate-re</code> をカスタマイズでき"
"ます。これらの変数の値は正規表現（文字列）である必要があります。例えば、単一"
"の改行で新しい段落を開始させるには、これら両方の変数を <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;^&quot;</code> に設定します。これら2つの変数はバッファ"
"ローカルです（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Locals.html\">ローカル変数</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bidi_002dparagraph_002ddirection\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bidi_002dparagraph_002ddirection\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"Emacs determines the base direction of each paragraph dynamically, based on "
"the text at the beginning of the paragraph.  However, sometimes a buffer may "
"need to force a certain base direction for its paragraphs.  The variable "
"<code class=\"code\">bidi-paragraph-direction</code>, if non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, disables the dynamic determination of the base "
"direction, and instead forces all paragraphs in the buffer to have the "
"direction specified by its buffer-local value.  The value can be either "
"<code class=\"code\">right-to-left</code> or <code class=\"code\">left-to-"
"right</code>.  Any other value is interpreted as <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、各段落の冒頭のテキストに基づいて、段落の基本方向を動的に決定します。"
"ただし、バッファによっては、段落に特定の基本方向を強制的に適用する必要がある"
"場合があります。変数 <code class=\"code\">bidi-paragraph-direction</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、基本方向の動的決定が無効になり、"
"代わりにバッファ内のすべての段落に、バッファローカル値で指定された方向が強制"
"的に適用されます。この値は <code class=\"code\">right-to-left</code> または "
"<code class=\"code\">left-to-right</code> のいずれかになります。それ以外の値"
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> として解釈されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-LRM\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-RLM\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-LRM\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-RLM\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can control the base direction of a paragraph by "
"inserting special formatting characters in front of the paragraph.  The "
"special character <code class=\"code\">RIGHT-TO-LEFT MARK</code>, or <small "
"class=\"sc\">RLM</small>, forces the right-to-left direction on the "
"following paragraph, while <code class=\"code\">LEFT-TO-RIGHT MARK</code>, "
"or <small class=\"sc\">LRM</small> forces the left-to-right direction.  (You "
"can use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 8 <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> to "
"insert these characters.)  In a GUI session, the <small class=\"sc\">LRM</"
"small> and <small class=\"sc\">RLM</small> characters display as very thin "
"blank characters; on text terminals they display as blanks."
msgstr ""
"あるいは、段落の前に特殊な書式文字を挿入することで、その段落の基本方向を制御"
"することもできます。特殊文字 <code class=\"code\">RIGHT-TO-LEFT MARK</code> "
"または <small class=\"sc\">RLM</small> は、後続の段落に右から左への方向を強制"
"し、<code class=\"code\">LEFT-TO-RIGHT MARK</code> または <small "
"class=\"sc\">LRM</small> は左から右への方向を強制します。（これらの文字を挿入"
"するには <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 8 <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> を使用で"
"きます。）GUIセッションでは、<small class=\"sc\">LRM</small> および <small "
"class=\"sc\">RLM</small> 文字は非常に細い空白文字として表示され、テキスト端末"
"では空白として表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"Because characters are reordered for display, Emacs commands that operate in "
"the logical order or on stretches of buffer positions may produce unusual "
"effects.  For example, the commands <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd> move point in the logical order, so the cursor will "
"sometimes jump when point traverses reordered bidirectional text.  "
"Similarly, a highlighted region covering a contiguous range of character "
"positions may look discontinuous if the region spans reordered text.  This "
"is normal and similar to the behavior of other programs that support "
"bidirectional text."
msgstr ""
"文字は表示用に再配置されるため、論理的な順序やバッファ位置の連続範囲に対して"
"動作するEmacsコマンドは、予期しない挙動を示すことがあります。例えば、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd> コマンドは論理的な順"
"序でポイントを移動させるため、ポイントが再配置された双方向テキストを横切る際"
"に、カーソルがジャンプすることがあります。同様に、連続した文字位置の範囲をカ"
"バーするハイライト領域が、その領域が再配置されたテキストにまたがっている場"
"合、不連続に見えることがあります。これは正常な動作であり、双方向テキストをサ"
"ポートする他のプログラムの挙動と同様です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-RIGHT_002c-and-bidirectional-text\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-LEFT_002c-and-bidirectional-"
"text\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-right_002dchar_002c-and-"
"bidirectional-text\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"left_002dchar_002c-and-bidirectional-text\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-RIGHT_002c-and-bidirectional-text\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-LEFT_002c-and-bidirectional-"
"text\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-right_002dchar_002c-and-"
"bidirectional-text\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"left_002dchar_002c-and-bidirectional-text\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"Cursor motion commands bound to arrow keys, such as <kbd class=\"key\">LEFT</"
"kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd>, are "
"sensitive to the base direction of the current paragraph.  In a left-to-"
"right paragraph, commands bound to <kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd> with or "
"without modifiers move <em class=\"emph\">forward</em> through buffer text, "
"but in a right-to-left paragraph they move <em class=\"emph\">backward</em> "
"instead.  This reflects the fact that in a right-to-left paragraph buffer "
"positions predominantly increase when moving to the left on display."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd> など、矢印キーに割り当てられたカーソル移動コ"
"マンドは、現在の段落の基本方向の影響を受けます。左から右へ記述される段落で"
"は、修飾子の有無にかかわらず <kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd> に割り当てられた"
"コマンドはバッファテキスト内を<em class=\"emph\">前方</em>に移動しますが、右"
"から左へ記述される段落では代わりに<em class=\"emph\">後方</em>に移動します。"
"これは、右から左へ記述される段落において、画面上を左に移動するとバッファ位置"
"が主に増加するという事実を反映しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"When you move out of a paragraph, the meaning of the arrow keys might change "
"if the base direction of the preceding or the following paragraph is "
"different from the paragraph out of which you moved.  When that happens, you "
"need to adjust the arrow key you press to the new base direction."
msgstr ""
"段落から移動すると、前後の段落の基本方向が移動元の段落と異なる場合、矢印キー"
"の意味が変わることがあります。その場合は、押す矢印キーを新しい基本方向に合わ"
"せて調整する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bidirectional-Editing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"visual_002dorder_002dcursor_002dmovement\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-cursor_002c-visual_002dorder-motion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"visual_002dorder_002dcursor_002dmovement\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
