# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Blank-Lines.html
msgid ""
"Here are special commands and techniques for inserting and deleting blank "
"lines."
msgstr "空行の挿入・削除に関する特殊コマンドとテクニックをご紹介します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
