#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Blank-Lines.html
msgid ""
"Delete all but one of many consecutive blank lines (<code "
"class=\"code\">delete-blank-lines</code>)."
msgstr ""
"連続する多数の空行 (<code class=\"code\">delete-blank-lines</code>) のうち、1"
"行以外をすべて削除する。"

