# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bookmarks.html
msgid ""
"To record the current position in the visited file, use the command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x r m</kbd>, which sets a bookmark using the visited file "
"name as the default for the bookmark name.  If you name each bookmark after "
"the file it points to, then you can conveniently revisit any of those files "
"with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r b</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">bookmark-jump</"
"code>), and move to the position of the bookmark at the same time."
msgstr ""
"訪問済みファイルに現在の位置を記録するには、訪問済みファイル名をブックマーク"
"名のデフォルトとして設定するコマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r m</kbd> を使用"
"します。各ブックマークにそれが指すファイル名を付けておけば、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x r b</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">bookmark-jump</code>) でそ"
"れらのファイルのいずれかに便利に再訪問でき、同時にブックマークの位置まで移動"
"できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bookmarks.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bookmark_002dfringe_002dmark\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bookmark_002dfringe_002dmark\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bookmarks.html
msgid ""
"In addition to recording the current position, on graphical displays <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x r m</kbd> places a special image on the left fringe (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Fringes.html\">Window Fringes</a>) of the screen "
"line corresponding to the recorded position, to indicate that there&rsquo;s "
"a bookmark there.  This can be controlled by the user option <code "
"class=\"code\">bookmark-fringe-mark</code>: customize it to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> to disable the fringe mark.  The default value is "
"<code class=\"code\">bookmark-mark</code>, which is the bitmap used for this "
"purpose.  When you later use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r b</kbd> to jump back "
"to the bookmark, the fringe mark will be again shown on the fringe."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
