# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Browse_002dURL.html
msgid "Load a URL into a Web browser."
msgstr "WebブラウザにURLを読み込む。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Browse_002dURL.html
msgid ""
"The Browse-URL package allows you to easily follow URLs from within Emacs.  "
"Most URLs are followed by invoking a web browser; &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">mailto:</samp>&rsquo; URLs are followed by invoking the <code "
"class=\"code\">compose-mail</code> Emacs command to send mail to the "
"specified address (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Sending-Mail.html\">Sending "
"Mail</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Browse-URLパッケージを使用すると、Emacs内から簡単にURLにアクセスできます。ほ"
"とんどのURLではウェブブラウザが起動し、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">mailto:</"
"samp>&rsquo; URLでは<code class=\"code\">compose-mail</code> Emacsコマンドが"
"起動して、指定したアドレスにメールが送信されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Sending-Mail.html\">メールの送信</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Browse_002dURL.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x browse-url</kbd> prompts for a URL, and "
"follows it.  If point is located near a plausible URL, that URL is offered "
"as the default.  The Browse-URL package also provides other commands which "
"you might like to bind to keys, such as <code class=\"code\">browse-url-at-"
"point</code> and <code class=\"code\">browse-url-at-mouse</code>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x browse-url</kbd> は URL の入力を促し、それに"
"続けます。ポイントが妥当な URL の近くにある場合、その URL がデフォルトとして"
"提示されます。Browse-URL パッケージでは、<code class=\"code\">browse-url-at-"
"point</code> や <code class=\"code\">browse-url-at-mouse</code> など、キーに"
"割り当てると便利なその他のコマンドも提供されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Browse_002dURL.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"browse_002durl_002dmailto_002dfunction\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-browse_002durl_002dbrowser_002dfunction\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"browse_002durl_002dmailto_002dfunction\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-browse_002durl_002dbrowser_002dfunction\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Browse_002dURL.html
msgid ""
"You can customize Browse-URL&rsquo;s behavior via various options in the "
"<code class=\"code\">browse-url</code> Customize group.  In particular, the "
"option <code class=\"code\">browse-url-mailto-function</code> lets you "
"define how to follow &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">mailto:</samp>&rsquo; URLs, "
"while <code class=\"code\">browse-url-browser-function</code> specifies your "
"default browser."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">browse-url</code> Customize グループの各種オプションで、"
"Browse-URL の動作をカスタマイズできます。特に、<code class=\"code\">browse-"
"url-mailto-function</code> オプションでは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">mailto:"
"</samp>&rsquo; URL の参照方法を定義でき、<code class=\"code\">browse-url-"
"browser-function</code> ではデフォルトのブラウザを指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Browse_002dURL.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-browse_002durl_002dhandlers\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-browse_002durl_002dhandlers\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Browse_002dURL.html
msgid ""
"You can define that certain URLs are browsed with other functions by "
"customizing <code class=\"code\">browse-url-handlers</code>, an alist of "
"regular expressions or predicates paired with functions to browse matching "
"URLs."
msgstr ""
"正規表現や述語と、一致するURLを閲覧するための関数をペアにしたalistである"
"<code class=\"code\">browse-url-handlers</code>をカスタマイズすることで、特定"
"のURLを他の関数で閲覧するように定義できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Browse_002dURL.html
msgid ""
"For more information, view the package commentary by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h P browse-url <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"詳細については、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h P browse-url <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd></kbd> と入力してパッケージの解説を表示してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Browse_002dURL.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-url_002dhandler_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-url_002dhandler_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Browse_002dURL.html
msgid ""
"Emacs also has a minor mode that has some support for handling <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">URL</abbr>s as if they were files.  <code "
"class=\"code\">url-handler-mode</code> is a global minor mode that affects "
"most of the Emacs commands and primitives that deal with file names.  After "
"switching on this mode, you can say, for instance, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-"
"f https://www.gnu.org/ RET</kbd> to see the <abbr class=\"acronym\">HTML</"
"abbr> for that web page, and you can then edit it and save it to a local "
"file, for instance."
msgstr ""
"Emacsには、<abbr class=\"acronym\">URL</abbr>をファイルのように扱うためのサ"
"ポートを備えたマイナーモードもあります。<code class=\"code\">url-handler-"
"mode</code>はグローバルマイナーモードで、ファイル名を扱うほとんどのEmacsコマ"
"ンドやプリミティブに影響します。このモードを有効にすると、例えば<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f https://www.gnu.org/ RET</kbd>と入力してそのウェブペー"
"ジの<abbr class=\"acronym\">HTML</abbr>を表示し、それを編集してローカルファイ"
"ルに保存するといった操作が可能になります。"

