#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"<span>30.7 Bug Reference<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Bug-"
"Reference-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>30.7 バグリファレンス<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Bug-"
"Reference-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bug-reference\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bug-reference\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"Most projects with a certain amount of users track bug reports in some issue "
"tracking software which assigns each report a unique and short number or "
"identifier.  Those are used to reference a given bug, e.g., in a source code "
"comment above the code fixing some bug, in documentation files, or in "
"discussions on some mailing list or IRC channel."
msgstr ""
"一定規模のユーザーを抱えるほとんどのプロジェクトでは、各バグレポートに一意で"
"短い番号や識別子を割り当てる何らかの課題管理ソフトウェアを用いてバグレポート"
"を追跡しています。これらは、例えばバグを修正するコードの上にあるソースコード"
"のコメントや、ドキュメントファイル、あるいはメーリングリストやIRCチャンネルで"
"の議論などで、特定のバグを参照する際に使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bug_002dreference_002dmode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bug_002dreference_002dprog_002dmode\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bug_002dreference_002dmode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bug_002dreference_002dprog_002dmode\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"The minor modes <code class=\"code\">bug-reference-mode</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">bug-reference-prog-mode</code> highlight such bug references "
"and make it possible to follow them to the corresponding bug report on the "
"project&rsquo;s issue tracker.  <code class=\"code\">bug-reference-prog-"
"mode</code> is a variant of <code class=\"code\">bug-reference-mode</code> "
"which highlights bug references only inside source code comments and strings."
msgstr ""
"マイナーモード <code class=\"code\">bug-reference-mode</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">bug-reference-prog-mode</code> は、こうしたバグ参照をハイライ"
"トし、プロジェクトのイシュートラッカーにある対応するバグレポートまで辿れるよ"
"うにします。<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-prog-mode</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">bug-reference-mode</code> の派生版で、ソースコードのコメントや"
"文字列内のバグ参照のみをハイライトします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"bug_002dreference_002dbug_002dregexp\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-bug_002dreference_002durl_002dformat\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"bug_002dreference_002dbug_002dregexp\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-bug_002dreference_002durl_002dformat\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"For its working, bug reference mode needs to know the syntax of bug "
"references (<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-bug-regexp</code>), and the "
"URL of the tracker where bug reports can be looked up (<code "
"class=\"code\">bug-reference-url-format</code>).  Since those are typically "
"different from project to project, it makes sense to specify them in see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Directory-Variables.html\">Per-Directory Local "
"Variables</a> or see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"File-Variables.html\">Local "
"Variables in Files</a>."
msgstr ""
"動作にあたり、バグ参照モードではバグ参照の構文（<code class=\"code\">bug-"
"reference-bug-regexp</code>）と、バグレポートを検索できるトラッカーのURL"
"（<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-url-format</code>）を把握しておく必要が"
"あります。これらは通常プロジェクトごとに異なるため、<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Directory-Variables.html\">ディレクトリごとのローカル変数</a>または<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"File-Variables.html\">ファイル内のローカル変数</a>を参"
"照して指定するのが適切です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"For example, let&rsquo;s assume in our project, we usually write references "
"to bug reports as bug#1234, or Bug-1234 and that this bug&rsquo;s page on "
"the issue tracker is <a class=\"url\" href=\"https://project.org/issues/"
"1234\">https://project.org/issues/1234</a>, then these local variables "
"section would do."
msgstr ""
"例えば、本プロジェクトでは通常、バグレポートへの参照を bug#1234 や Bug-1234 "
"のように記述し、イシュートラッカー上のこのバグのページが <a class=\"url\" "
"href=\"https://project.org/issues/1234\">https://project.org/issues/1234</a> "
"であるとすると、このローカル変数セクションで対応できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; Local Variables:\n"
";; bug-reference-bug-regexp: &quot;\\\\([Bb]ug[#-]\\\\([0-9]+\\\\)\\\\)&quot;\n"
";; bug-reference-url-format: &quot;https://project.org/issues/%s&quot;\n"
";; End:\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"The string captured by the first regexp group defines the bounds of the "
"overlay bug-reference creates, i.e., the part which is highlighted and made "
"clickable."
msgstr ""
"最初の正規表現グループで捕捉された文字列は、overlay bug-reference が生成する"
"範囲、すなわちハイライトされてクリック可能になる部分を定義します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"The string captured by the second regexp group in <code class=\"code\">bug-"
"reference-bug-regexp</code> is used to replace the <code class=\"code\">%s</"
"code> template in the <code class=\"code\">bug-reference-url-format</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-bug-regexp</code> の 2 番目の正規表現グ"
"ループでキャプチャされた文字列は、<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-url-"
"format</code> 内の <code class=\"code\">%s</code> テンプレートを置換するため"
"に使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"Note that <code class=\"code\">bug-reference-url-format</code> may also be a "
"function in order to cater for more complex scenarios, e.g., when different "
"parts of the bug reference have to be used to distinguish between issues and "
"merge requests resulting in different URLs."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-url-format</code> は、より複雑なシナ"
"リオに対応するための関数である場合もあります。例えば、バグ参照の異なる箇所を"
"用いてイシューとマージリクエストを区別する必要があり、その結果、異なる URL が"
"生成される場合などが挙げられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"<span>Automatic Setup<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Automatic-Setup\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>自動セットアップ<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Automatic-Setup\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"bug_002dreference_002dauto_002dsetup_002dfunctions\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"bug_002dreference_002dauto_002dsetup_002dfunctions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">bug-reference-mode</code> is activated, <code "
"class=\"code\">bug-reference-mode-hook</code> has been run, and either <code "
"class=\"code\">bug-reference-bug-regexp</code> or <code class=\"code\">bug-"
"reference-url-format</code> is still <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"mode will try to automatically find a suitable value for these two variables "
"by calling the functions in <code class=\"code\">bug-reference-auto-setup-"
"functions</code> one by one until one succeeds."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-mode</code> が有効化され、<code "
"class=\"code\">bug-reference-mode-hook</code> が実行済みで、かつ <code "
"class=\"code\">bug-reference-bug-regexp</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">bug-reference-url-format</code> のいずれかが依然として <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、モードは <code class=\"code\">bug-"
"reference-auto-setup-functions</code> 内の関数を一つずつ呼び出し、いずれかが"
"成功するまで繰り返すことで、これら2つの変数に適した値を自動的に見つけ出そうと"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"bug_002dreference_002dsetup_002dfrom_002dvc_002dalist\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"bug_002dreference_002dforge_002dalist\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
