# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"Adding support for bug-reference auto-setup is usually quite "
"straightforward: write a setup function of zero arguments which gathers the "
"required information (e.g., List-Id/To/From/Cc mail header values in the "
"case of a MUA), and then calls one of the following helper functions:"
msgstr ""
"バグ参照の自動セットアップ機能の追加は、通常非常に簡単です。必要な情報を収集"
"する引数なしのセットアップ関数（例：MUAの場合はList-Id/To/From/Ccといったメー"
"ルヘッダーの値）を記述し、その後、以下のヘルパー関数のいずれかを呼び出すだけ"
"です："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-maybe-setup-from-vc</code>, which does "
"the setup according to <code class=\"code\">bug-reference-setup-from-vc-"
"alist</code>;"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-maybe-setup-from-vc</code>（<code "
"class=\"code\">bug-reference-setup-from-vc-alist</code>に従ってセットアップを"
"行う）；"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-maybe-setup-from-mail</code>, which does "
"the setup according to <code class=\"code\">bug-reference-setup-from-mail-"
"alist</code>; and"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-maybe-setup-from-mail</code>（<code "
"class=\"code\">bug-reference-setup-from-mail-alist</code>に従ってセットアップ"
"を行う）、および"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-maybe-setup-from-irc</code>, which does "
"the setup according to <code class=\"code\">bug-reference-setup-from-irc-"
"alist</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-maybe-setup-from-irc</code>で、<code "
"class=\"code\">bug-reference-setup-from-irc-alist</code>に従ってセットアップ"
"を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"A setup function should return non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if it "
"could set up bug-reference mode, which is the case if the last thing the "
"function does is call one of the helper functions above."
msgstr ""
"セットアップ関数は、バグ参照モードを設定できた場合には <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を返すべきです。これは、関数の最後の処理が"
"上記のヘルパー関数のいずれかを呼び出す場合に当てはまります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bug-Reference.html
msgid ""
"Finally, the setup function has to be added to <code class=\"code\">bug-"
"reference-auto-setup-functions</code>."
msgstr ""
"最後に、セットアップ関数を<code class=\"code\">bug-reference-auto-setup-"
"functions</code>に追加する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
