# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h2>
#: build/html/emacs/Bugs.html
msgid ""
"<span>54 Reporting Bugs<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Reporting-Bugs\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>54 バグの報告<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Reporting-Bugs\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Bugs.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bugs\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bugs\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bugs.html
msgid ""
"If you think you have found a bug in Emacs, please report it.  We cannot "
"promise to fix it, or always to agree that it is a bug, but we certainly "
"want to hear about it.  The same applies for new features you would like to "
"see added.  This section will help you to determine whether you found a bug, "
"and if so, construct an effective bug report."
msgstr ""
"Emacsにバグを見つけたと思われる場合は、ぜひ報告してください。修正をお約束でき"
"るとは限りませんし、必ずしもバグであると同意できるとは限りませんが、ぜひご意"
"見をお聞かせください。追加してほしい新機能についても同様です。本セクションで"
"は、バグを発見したかどうかの判断方法と、発見された場合に効果的なバグレポート"
"を作成する方法について解説します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Bugs.html
msgid ""
"The general procedure when you find something that could be a bug is as "
"follows:"
msgstr "バグの可能性があるものを見つけた際の一般的な手順は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Bugs.html
msgid ""
"See if what you found is a known problem or a bug that was already reported "
"and/or fixed.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Known-Problems.html\">Reading "
"Existing Bug Reports and Known Problems</a>, where you will find how to look "
"for known problems and bugs."
msgstr ""
"見つかった内容が、既知の問題であるか、あるいは既に報告・修正済みのバグである"
"かを確認してください。既知の問題やバグの探し方については、<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Known-Problems.html\">既存のバグレポートと既知の問題の読み方</a>を参照"
"してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Bugs.html
msgid ""
"If you are unsure whether the behavior you see is a bug, see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Bug-Criteria.html\">When Is There a Bug</a>, which "
"tells what we consider as clear bugs in Emacs."
msgstr ""
"表示されている挙動がバグかどうか判断に迷う場合は、Emacsにおいてどのようなもの"
"を明確なバグとみなすかを解説した<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Bug-Criteria.html\">"
"バグとはどのような状態か</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Bugs.html
msgid ""
"Once you decide you found a bug, see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Understanding-"
"Bug-Reporting.html\">Understanding Bug Reporting</a>, which helps you in "
"describing what you see in the most efficient manner, making our job of "
"reproducing the issue and investigating it easier."
msgstr ""
"バグを発見したと判断したら、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Understanding-Bug-"
"Reporting.html\">「バグ報告の理解」</a>を参照してください。そこでは、確認した"
"内容を最も効率的な方法で記述するコツが解説されており、問題の再現や調査といっ"
"た私たちの作業がスムーズになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Bugs.html
msgid ""
"Next, see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Checklist.html\">Checklist for Bug "
"Reports</a>, where we describe in detail how to submit a bug report and what "
"information to include in it.  In a nutshell, you submit a bug report via "
"electronic mail using the Emacs command <code class=\"code\">report-emacs-"
"bug</code>, which assists you in doing so.  Submitting a bug report starts "
"the process of investigating and fixing the bug, where you will receive "
"copies of email messages discussing the bug, in which we might ask you to "
"provide more information, test possible fixes, etc."
msgstr ""
"次に、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Checklist.html\">バグレポートのチェックリスト</"
"a>をご覧ください。そこでは、バグレポートの提出方法や記載すべき情報について詳"
"しく説明しています。簡単に言うと、Emacsコマンド <code class=\"code\">report-"
"emacs-bug</code> を使用して電子メールでバグレポートを提出します。このコマンド"
"が提出をサポートします。バグレポートを提出することでバグの調査と修正のプロセ"
"スが開始され、バグについて議論する電子メールのコピーが届くようになります。そ"
"の中で、さらなる情報の提供や修正案のテストなどをお願いする場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Bugs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-security_002c-reporting-issues\"></a> "
"If you think you may have found a security issue that needs to be "
"communicated privately, please contact the GNU Emacs maintainers directly.  "
"See the file <samp class=\"file\">admin/MAINTAINERS</samp> in the Emacs "
"distribution for their contact details."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-security_002c-reporting-issues\"></a> "
"非公開で報告すべきセキュリティ上の問題を発見したと思われる場合は、GNU Emacsの"
