# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Calendar-Customizing.html
msgid ""
"The calendar display unfortunately cannot be changed from three months, but "
"you can customize the whitespace used by setting the variables: <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-left-margin</code>, <code class=\"code\">calendar-"
"day-header-width</code>, <code class=\"code\">calendar-day-digit-width</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">calendar-column-width</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-intermonth-spacing</code>.  To display text <em "
"class=\"emph\">between</em> the months, for example week numbers, customize "
"the variables <code class=\"code\">calendar-intermonth-header</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">calendar-intermonth-text</code> as described in their "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"残念ながらカレンダーの表示は3ヶ月分から変更できませんが、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-left-margin</code>、<code class=\"code\">calendar-"
"day-header-width</code>、<code class=\"code\">calendar-day-digit-width</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">calendar-column-width</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-intermonth-spacing</code> を設定することで、余白をカ"
"スタマイズできます。月<em class=\"emph\">の間</em>にテキスト（例えば週番号な"
"ど）を表示するには、各変数のドキュメントに記載されている通り、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-intermonth-header</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-intermonth-text</code> をカスタマイズしてください。"

