"calendar_002dday_002dheader_002darray\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Calendar-Customizing.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">calendar-month-header</code> controls the "
"text that appears above each month in the calendar.  By default, it shows "
"the month and year.  The variable <code class=\"code\">calendar-day-header-"
"array</code> controls the text that appears above each day&rsquo;s column in "
"every month.  By default, it shows the first two letters of each day&rsquo;s "
"name."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">calendar-month-header</code> は、カレンダーの各月の"
"上に表示されるテキストを制御します。デフォルトでは、月と年が表示されます。変"
"数 <code class=\"code\">calendar-day-header-array</code> は、各月の各日の列の"
"上に表示されるテキストを制御します。デフォルトでは、各日の名称の最初の2文字が"
"表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Calendar-Customizing.html
