# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Calendar-Unit-Motion.html
msgid ""
"The day and week commands are natural analogues of the usual Emacs commands "
"for moving by characters and by lines.  Just as <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> "
"usually moves to the same column in the following line, in Calendar mode it "
"is bound to <code class=\"code\">calendar-forward-week</code>, which moves "
"to the same day in the following week.  And <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">calendar-backward-week</code>) moves to the same day "
"in the previous week.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-forward-day</code>) and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">calendar-backward-day</code>) move forward and back by "
"days."
msgstr ""
"日および週のコマンドは、文字単位や行単位で移動するための通常のEmacsコマンドの"
"自然な対応物です。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> が通常、次の行の同じ列に移動す"
"るのと同様に、カレンダーモードでは <code class=\"code\">calendar-forward-"
"week</code> に割り当てられており、次の週の同じ日に移動します。また、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">calendar-backward-week</code>) "
"は前の週の同じ日に移動します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-forward-day</code>) と <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">calendar-backward-day</code>) は、日単位で前後に移動し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Calendar-Unit-Motion.html
msgid ""
"The arrow keys are equivalent to <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd>, just as they normally are in other modes."
msgstr ""
"矢印キーは、他のモードと同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"p</kbd>に対応しています。"

