# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Calendar-Unit-Motion.html
msgid ""
"The commands for motion by months and years work like those for weeks, but "
"move a larger distance.  The month commands <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-}</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">calendar-forward-month</code>) and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-{</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">calendar-backward-month</"
"code>) move forward or backward by an entire month.  The year commands <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;]</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">calendar-forward-year</"
"code>) and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;[</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-backward-year</code>) move forward or backward a "
"whole year."
msgstr ""
"月単位および年単位の移動コマンドは、週単位のコマンドと同様に動作しますが、移"
"動距離がより長くなります。月単位のコマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-}</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">calendar-forward-month</code>) および <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-{</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">calendar-backward-month</"
"code>) は、丸1ヶ月分、前方または後方に移動します。年単位のコマンド <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;]</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">calendar-forward-year</"
"code>) および <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;[</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-backward-year</code>) は、丸1年分、前方または後方に移"
"動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Calendar-Unit-Motion.html
msgid ""
"The easiest way to remember these commands is to consider months and years "
"analogous to paragraphs and pages of text, respectively.  But the calendar "
"movement commands themselves do not quite parallel those for movement "
"through text: the ordinary Emacs paragraph commands move to the beginning or "
"end of a paragraph, whereas these month and year commands move by an entire "
"month or an entire year, keeping the same date within the month or year."
msgstr ""
"これらのコマンドを覚える最も簡単な方法は、月と年を、それぞれテキストの段落や"
"ページになぞらえて考えることです。ただし、カレンダー移動コマンド自体は、テキ"
"スト内の移動コマンドとは完全には対応していません。通常のEmacsの段落コマンドは"
"段落の先頭や末尾に移動しますが、これらの月・年コマンドは、月内または年内の同"
"じ日付を維持したまま、丸1か月または丸1年単位で移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Calendar-Unit-Motion.html
msgid ""
"You can also use the simpler to type keystrokes <kbd class=\"kbd\">}</kbd> "
"and <kbd class=\"kbd\">{</kbd> to navigate by month, and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">]</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">[</kbd> to navigate by year."
msgstr ""
"また、入力が簡単なキー操作 <kbd class=\"kbd\">}</kbd> と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">{</kbd> で月別に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">]</kbd> と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">[</kbd> で年別に移動することもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Calendar-Unit-Motion.html
msgid ""
"All these commands accept a numeric argument as a repeat count.  For "
"convenience, the digit keys and the minus sign specify numeric arguments in "
"Calendar mode even without the Meta modifier.  For example, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">100 C-f</kbd> moves point 100 days forward from its present "
"location."
msgstr ""
"これらのコマンドはすべて、繰り返し回数として数値引数を受け付けます。利便性の"
"ため、カレンダーモードではMeta修飾子がなくても、数字キーやマイナス記号で数値"
"引数を指定できます。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">100 C-f</kbd> はポイントを現在"
"の位置から100日分先に移動させます。"

