#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Cell-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dforward_002dcell\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dbackward_002dcell\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dforward_002dcell\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dbackward_002dcell\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Cell-Commands.html
msgid ""
"The commands <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-forward-cell</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x table-backward-cell</kbd> move point from the current cell "
"to an adjacent cell.  The order is cyclic: when point is in the last cell of "
"a table, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-forward-cell</kbd> moves to the first "
"cell.  Likewise, when point is on the first cell, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"table-backward-cell</kbd> moves to the last cell."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-forward-cell</kbd> と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x table-backward-cell</kbd> は、ポイントを現在のセルから隣接"
"するセルへ移動させます。その順序は循環しており、ポイントがテーブルの最後のセ"
"ルにあるとき、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-forward-cell</kbd> は最初のセルへ"
"移動します。同様に、ポイントが最初のセルにあるとき、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"table-backward-cell</kbd> は最後のセルへ移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Cell-Commands.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dspan_002dcell\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dspan_002dcell\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Cell-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-span-cell</kbd> prompts for a "
"direction&mdash;right, left, above, or below&mdash;and merges the current "
"cell with the adjacent cell in that direction.  This command signals an "
"error if the merge would result in an illegitimate cell layout."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-span-cell</kbd> は方向（右、左、上、または下）を"
"指定し、その方向にある隣接セルと現在のセルを統合します。統合によって不正なセ"
"ル配置が生じる場合、このコマンドはエラーを通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Cell-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dsplit_002dcell\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"table_002dsplit_002dcell_002dvertically\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-table_002dsplit_002dcell_002dhorizontally\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-text_002dbased-tables_002c-splitting-cells\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-splitting-table-cells\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dsplit_002dcell\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"table_002dsplit_002dcell_002dvertically\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-table_002dsplit_002dcell_002dhorizontally\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-text_002dbased-tables_002c-splitting-cells\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-splitting-table-cells\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Cell-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-split-cell</kbd> splits the current cell "
"vertically or horizontally, prompting for the direction with the "
"minibuffer.  To split in a specific direction, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"table-split-cell-vertically</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-split-"
"cell-horizontally</kbd>.  When splitting vertically, the old cell contents "
"are automatically split between the two new cells.  When splitting "
"horizontally, you are prompted for how to divide the cell contents, if the "
"cell is non-empty; the options are &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">split</"
"samp>&rsquo; (divide the contents at point), &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">left</samp>&rsquo; (put all the contents in the left cell), "
"and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">right</samp>&rsquo; (put all the contents in "
"the right cell)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-split-cell</kbd> は現在のセルを垂直または水平に"
"分割し、ミニバッファで方向の入力を求めます。特定の方向に分割するには、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x table-split-cell-vertically</kbd> および <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x table-split-cell-horizontally</kbd> を使用します。垂直に分"
"割する場合、元のセルの内容は自動的に2つの新しいセルに分割されます。水平に分割"
"する場合、セルが空でなければ、内容をどのように分割するかの入力が求められま"
"す。選択肢は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">split</samp>&rsquo;（地点で内容を分"
"割）、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">left</samp>&rsquo;（すべての内容を左のセル"
"に入れる）、および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">right</samp>&rsquo;（すべての"
"内容を右のセルに入れる）です。"

