# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Cell-Justification.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-justification-in-text_002dbased-"
"tables\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-justification-in-text_002dbased-"
"tables\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Cell-Justification.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-justify</kbd> imposes <em "
"class=\"dfn\">justification</em> on one or more cells in a text-based "
"table.  Justification determines how the text in the cell is aligned, "
"relative to the edges of the cell.  Each cell in a table can be separately "
"justified."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-justify</kbd> コマンドは、テキストベースの表にお"
"ける1つ以上のセルに<em class=\"dfn\">両端揃え</em>を適用します。両端揃えは、"
"セルの端を基準として、セル内のテキストをどのように配置するかを決定します。表"
"内の各セルは、個別に両端揃えを行うことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Cell-Justification.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002djustify\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002djustify\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Cell-Justification.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-justify</kbd> first prompts for what to "
"justify; the options are &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cell</samp>&rsquo; "
"(just the current cell), &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">column</samp>&rsquo; "
"(all cells in the current table column) and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">row</"
"samp>&rsquo; (all cells in the current table row).  The command then prompts "
"for the justification style; the options are <code class=\"code\">left</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">center</code>, <code class=\"code\">right</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">top</code>, <code class=\"code\">middle</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">bottom</code>, or <code class=\"code\">none</code> "
"(meaning no vertical justification)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-justify</kbd> では、まず何を正当化するかを尋ねま"
"す。選択肢は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cell</samp>&rsquo;（現在のセルの"
"み）、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">column</samp>&rsquo;（現在のテーブル列内の"
"すべてのセル）、および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">row</samp>&rsquo;（現在の"
"テーブル行内のすべてのセル）です。次に、コマンドは正当化スタイルを尋ねます。"
"選択肢は <code class=\"code\">left</code>、<code class=\"code\">center</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">right</code>、<code class=\"code\">top</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">middle</code>、<code class=\"code\">bottom</code>、また"
"は <code class=\"code\">none</code>（垂直方向の正当化を行わないという意味）で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Cell-Justification.html
msgid ""
"Horizontal and vertical justification styles are specified independently, "
"and both types can be in effect simultaneously; for instance, you can call "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-justify</kbd> twice, once to specify <code "
"class=\"code\">right</code> justification and once to specify <code "
"class=\"code\">bottom</code> justification, to align the contents of a cell "
"to the bottom right."
msgstr ""
"水平方向と垂直方向の揃えスタイルは個別に指定され、両方のタイプを同時に適用す"
"ることも可能です。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-justify</kbd> を 2 回"
"呼び出し、1 回で <code class=\"code\">right</code> の揃えを、もう 1 回で "
"<code class=\"code\">bottom</code> の揃えを指定することで、セルの内容を右下に"
"揃えることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Cell-Justification.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"table_002ddetect_002dcell_002dalignment\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"table_002ddetect_002dcell_002dalignment\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Cell-Justification.html
msgid ""
"The justification style is stored in the buffer as a text property, and is "
"lost when you kill the buffer or exit Emacs.  However, the table recognition "
"commands, such as <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-recognize</kbd> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Table-Recognition.html\">Table Recognition</a>), "
"attempt to determine and re-apply each cell&rsquo;s justification style, by "
"examining its contents.  To disable this feature, change the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">table-detect-cell-alignment</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"右揃えスタイルはテキストプロパティとしてバッファに保存されており、バッファを"
"終了したりEmacsを終了したりすると失われます。ただし、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"table-recognize</kbd>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Table-Recognition.html\">表"
"認識</a>を参照）などの表認識コマンドは、各セルの内容を調べることで、その右揃"
"えスタイルを判定し、再適用しようとします。この機能を無効にするには、変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">table-detect-cell-alignment</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に変更してください。"

