# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Change-Window.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x ^</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">enlarge-"
"window</code>) makes the selected window one line taller, taking space from "
"a vertically adjacent window without changing the height of the frame.  With "
"a positive numeric argument, this command increases the window height by "
"that many lines; with a negative argument, it reduces the height by that "
"many lines.  If there are no vertically adjacent windows (i.e., the window "
"is at the full frame height), that signals an error.  The command also "
"signals an error if you attempt to reduce the height of any window below a "
"certain minimum number of lines, specified by the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">window-min-height</code> (the default is 4)."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x ^</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">enlarge-"
"window</code>) は、選択したウィンドウの高さを1行分高くし、フレームの高さを変"
"えずに、垂直方向に隣接するウィンドウの領域を削ります。正の数値引数を指定する"
"と、ウィンドウの高さがその行数分増加し、負の引数を指定すると、その行数分減少"
"します。垂直方向に隣接するウィンドウが存在しない場合（すなわち、ウィンドウが"
"フレームの最大高さにある場合）は、エラーとなります。また、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">window-min-height</code>（デフォルトは4）で指定された一定の最"
"小行数を下回るまでウィンドウの高さを下げようとした場合も、エラーとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Change-Window.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"enlarge_002dwindow_002dhorizontally\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-shrink_002dwindow_002dhorizontally\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-window_002dmin_002dwidth\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"enlarge_002dwindow_002dhorizontally\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-shrink_002dwindow_002dhorizontally\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-window_002dmin_002dwidth\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Change-Window.html
msgid ""
"Similarly, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x }</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">enlarge-"
"window-horizontally</code>) makes the selected window wider, and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x {</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">shrink-window-horizontally</"
"code>) makes it narrower.  These commands signal an error if you attempt to "
"reduce the width of any window below a certain minimum number of columns, "
"specified by the variable <code class=\"code\">window-min-width</code> (the "
"default is 10)."
msgstr ""
"同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x }</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">enlarge-window-"
"horizontally</code>) は選択したウィンドウの幅を広げ、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"{</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">shrink-window-horizontally</code>) は幅を狭めま"
"す。これらのコマンドは、変数 <code class=\"code\">window-min-width</code>（デ"
"フォルトは10）で指定された一定の最小列数を下回るまでいずれかのウィンドウの幅"
"を狭めようとした場合に、エラーを通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Change-Window.html
msgid ""
"Mouse clicks on the mode line (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mode-Line-"
"Mouse.html\">Mode Line Mouse Commands</a>) or on window dividers (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Dividers.html\">Window Dividers</a>) provide "
"another way to change window heights and to split or delete windows."
msgstr ""
"モードライン（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mode-Line-Mouse.html\">モードラインの"
"マウスコマンド</a>を参照）やウィンドウ区切り線（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Window-Dividers.html\">ウィンドウ区切り線</a>を参照）をマウスでクリッ"
"クすることで、ウィンドウの高さを変更したり、ウィンドウを分割・削除したりする"
"別の方法が利用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Change-Window.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-_002d\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"shrink_002dwindow_002dif_002dlarger_002dthan_002dbuffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-_002d\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"shrink_002dwindow_002dif_002dlarger_002dthan_002dbuffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Change-Window.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x -</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">shrink-window-if-larger-"
"than-buffer</code>) reduces the height of the selected window, if it is "
"taller than necessary to show the whole text of the buffer it is "
"displaying.  It gives the extra lines to other windows in the frame."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x -</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">shrink-window-if-larger-"
"than-buffer</code>) は、選択中のウィンドウの高さが、表示しているバッファのテ"
"キスト全体を表示するために必要な高さよりも高い場合に、その高さを縮小します。"
"これにより、余った行がフレーム内の他のウィンドウに割り当てられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Change-Window.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-_002b\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-balance_002dwindows\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-_002b\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-balance_002dwindows\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Change-Window.html
msgid ""
"You can also use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x +</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">balance-windows</code>) to balance the sizes of all the "
"windows of the selected frame (with the exception of the minibuffer window, "
"see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer.html\">The Minibuffer</a>).  This "
"command makes each horizontal pair of adjacent windows the same height, and "
"each vertical pair of adjacent windows the same width."
msgstr ""
"また、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x +</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">balance-windows</"
"code>) を使用して、選択したフレーム内のすべてのウィンドウ（ミニバッファウィン"
"ドウを除く。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer.html\">ミニバッファ</a>を参"
"照）のサイズを均等にすることもできます。このコマンドにより、隣接するウィンド"
"ウの水平方向の各ペアが同じ高さに、垂直方向の各ペアが同じ幅になります。"

