# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"<span>51.1.3 Changing a Variable<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Changing-"
"a-Variable-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>51.1.3 変数の変更<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Changing-a-"
"Variable-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of what a variable, or user option, looks like in the "
"customization buffer:"
msgstr ""
"カスタマイズバッファにおける変数（またはユーザーオプション）の表示例を以下に"
"示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Hide] Kill Ring Max: Integer (positive or zero): 120\n"
"   [State]: STANDARD.\n"
"   Maximum length of kill ring before oldest elements are thrown away.\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"Custom_002dgoto_002dfirst_002dchoice\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-C_002dc-TAB-_0028customization-buffer_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"Custom_002dgoto_002dfirst_002dchoice\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-C_002dc-TAB-_0028customization-buffer_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"The first line shows that the variable is named <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"ring-max</code>, formatted as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Kill Ring Max</"
"samp>&rsquo; for easier viewing, and also shows its expected type: a "
"positive integer or zero.  The default value is &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">120</samp>&rsquo;.  You can move directly to the value with "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> (Custom-goto-first-"
"choice).  The button labeled &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Hide]</"
"samp>&rsquo;, if activated, hides the variable&rsquo;s value and state; this "
"is useful to avoid cluttering up the customization buffer with very long "
"values (for this reason, variables that have very long values may start out "
"hidden).  If you use the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Hide]</samp>&rsquo; "
"button, it changes to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Show Value]</"
"samp>&rsquo;, which you can activate to reveal the value and state.  On a "
"graphical display, the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Hide]</samp>&rsquo; and "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Show Value]</samp>&rsquo; buttons are replaced "
"with graphical triangles pointing downwards and rightwards respectively."
msgstr ""
"1行目には、変数名が <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-max</code> であり、視認性"
"を高めるために &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Kill Ring Max</samp>&rsquo; と表記"
"されていること、およびその想定型（正の整数または0）が示されています。デフォル"
"ト値は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">120</samp>&rsquo; です。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> (Custom-goto-first-"
"choice) を使用すると、値へ直接移動できます。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[Hide]</samp>&rsquo; と表記されたボタンを有効にすると、変数の"
"値と状態が非表示になります。これは、非常に長い値によってカスタマイズバッファ"
"が煩雑になるのを防ぐのに便利です（このため、非常に長い値を持つ変数は、最初か"
"ら非表示になっている場合があります）。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Hide]</"
"samp>&rsquo; ボタンを使用すると、ボタンが &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Show "
"Value]</samp>&rsquo; に変わり、これを有効にすることで値と状態を表示できます。"
"グラフィカルディスプレイでは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Hide]</"
"samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Show Value]</samp>&rsquo; ボ"
"タンは、それぞれ下方向と右方向を指したグラフィカルな三角形に置き換えられま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"The line after the variable name indicates the <em "
"class=\"dfn\">customization state</em> of the variable: in this example, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">STANDARD</samp>&rsquo; means you have not "
"changed the variable, so its value is the default one.  The &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>&rsquo; button gives a menu of operations for "
"customizing the variable."
msgstr ""
"変数名の後に続く行は、その変数の<em class=\"dfn\">カスタマイズ状態</em>を示し"
"ています。この例では、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">STANDARD</samp>&rsquo;は変"
"数を変更していないことを意味し、その値はデフォルトとなります。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>&rsquo;ボタンからは、変数をカスタマイズするため"
"の操作メニューが表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"Below the customization state is the documentation for the variable.  This "
"is the same documentation that would be shown by the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h "
"v</kbd> command (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Examining.html\">Examining "
"and Setting Variables</a>).  If the documentation is more than one line "
"long, only one line may be shown.  If so, that line ends with a &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[More]</samp>&rsquo; button; activate this to see the full "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"カスタマイズ状態の下には、変数のドキュメントが表示されます。これは <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h v</kbd> コマンドで表示されるものと同じドキュメントです（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Examining.html\">変数の確認と設定</a> を参照）。ドキュ"
"メントが複数行にわたる場合、1行のみが表示されることがあります。その場合は、そ"
"の行の末尾に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[More]</samp>&rsquo; ボタンが表示さ"
"れます。このボタンをクリックするとドキュメントの全文が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-user-options_002c-changing\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customizing-variables\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-variables_002c-changing\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-user-options_002c-changing\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customizing-variables\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-variables_002c-changing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"To enter a new value for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Kill Ring Max</"
"samp>&rsquo;, just move point to the value and edit it.  For example, type "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-d</kbd> to delete the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">60</"
"samp>&rsquo; and type in another number.  As you begin to alter the text, "
"the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>&rsquo; line will change:"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Kill Ring Max</samp>&rsquo;に新しい値を入力するに"
"は、ポイントをその値に移動して編集してください。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"d</kbd>と入力して&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">60</samp>&rsquo;を削除し、別の数"
"値を入力します。テキストの変更を始めると、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>&rsquo;の行が次のように変わります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[State]: EDITED, shown value does not take effect until you\n"
"         set or save it.\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"Editing the value does not make it take effect right away.  To do that, you "
"must <em class=\"dfn\">set</em> the variable by activating the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>&rsquo; button and choosing &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Set for Current Session</samp>&rsquo;.  Then the "
"variable&rsquo;s state becomes:"
msgstr ""
"値を編集しても、すぐに反映されるわけではありません。反映させるには、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>&rsquo;ボタンを有効化し、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Set for Current Session</samp>&rsquo;を選択することで、変数を"
"<em class=\"dfn\">設定</em>する必要があります。すると、変数の状態は次のように"
"なります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "[State]: SET for current session only.\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"You don&rsquo;t have to worry about specifying a value that is not valid; "
"the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Set for Current Session</samp>&rsquo; "
"operation checks for validity and will not install an unacceptable value."
msgstr ""
"無効な値を指定することを心配する必要はありません。「<samp class=\"samp\">Set "
"for Current Session</samp>」演算が妥当性をチェックし、許容できない値はインス"
"トールしません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dTAB-_0028customization-"
"buffer_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dM_002di-"
"_0028customization-buffer_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"widget_002dcomplete\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dTAB-_0028customization-"
"buffer_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dM_002di-"
"_0028customization-buffer_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"widget_002dcomplete\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"While editing certain kinds of values, such as file names, directory names, "
"and Emacs command names, you can perform completion with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-i</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">widget-complete</code>), or "
"the equivalent keys <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> "
"or <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</"
"kbd></kbd>.  This behaves much like minibuffer completion (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion.html\">Completion</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ファイル名、ディレクトリ名、Emacsコマンド名といった特定の種類の値を編集する"
"際、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-i</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">widget-complete</"
"code>) または対応するキー <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></"
"kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> で補完を行うことができます。これはミニバッファ"
"による補完（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion.html\">Completion</a> を参"
"照）とほぼ同様に動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> on an editable "
"value field moves point forward to the next field or button, like <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd>.  You can thus type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> when you are finished "
"editing a field, to move on to the next button or field.  To insert a "
"newline within an editable field, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-o</kbd> or <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-q C-j</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"編集可能な値フィールドで <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd> と入力すると、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> と同"
"様にカーソルが次のフィールドやボタンへ移動します。したがって、フィールドの編"
"集が完了した際に <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> と入力"
"することで、次のボタンやフィールドへ移動できます。編集可能なフィールド内に改"
"行を挿入するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-o</kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-q "
"C-j</kbd> を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"For some variables, there is only a fixed set of legitimate values, and you "
"are not allowed to edit the value directly.  Instead, a &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[Value Menu]</samp>&rsquo; button appears before the value; "
"activating this button presents a choice of values.  For a boolean &ldquo;on "
"or off&rdquo; value, the button says &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Toggle]</"
"samp>&rsquo;, and flips the value.  After using the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[Value Menu]</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[Toggle]</samp>&rsquo; button, you must again set the "
"variable to make the chosen value take effect."
msgstr ""
"一部の変数には、有効な値が固定で定められており、値を直接編集することはできま"
"せん。代わりに、値の前に「<samp class=\"samp\">[Value Menu]</samp>」ボタンが"
"表示され、このボタンを押すと値の選択肢が現れます。ブール型の「オンまたはオ"
"フ」の値の場合、ボタンには「<samp class=\"samp\">[Toggle]</samp>」と表示さ"
"れ、値を反転させます。「<samp class=\"samp\">[Value Menu]</samp>」または"
"「<samp class=\"samp\">[Toggle]</samp>」ボタンを使用した後は、選択した値を反"
"映させるために、再度変数を設定する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"Some variables have values with complex structure.  For example, the value "
"of <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-frame-alist</code> is an association "
"list.  Here is how it appears in the customization buffer:"
msgstr ""
"一部の変数は、複雑な構造を持つ値を持ちます。例えば、<code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-frame-alist</code> の値は連想リストです。カスタマイ"
"ズバッファでは次のように表示されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Hide] Minibuffer Frame Alist:\n"
"[INS] [DEL] Parameter: width\n"
"            Value: 80\n"
"[INS] [DEL] Parameter: height\n"
"            Value: 2\n"
"[INS]\n"
"   [ State ]: STANDARD.\n"
"   Alist of parameters for the initial minibuffer frame. [Hide]\n"
"   <span class=\"r\">[...more lines of documentation...]</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"In this case, each association in the list consists of two items, one "
"labeled &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Parameter</samp>&rsquo; and one labeled "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Value</samp>&rsquo;; both are editable fields.  "
"You can delete an association from the list with the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[DEL]</samp>&rsquo; button next to it.  To add an "
"association, use the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[INS]</samp>&rsquo; button "
"at the position where you want to insert it; the very last &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[INS]</samp>&rsquo; button inserts at the end of the list."
msgstr ""
"この場合、リスト内の各関連付けは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Parameter</"
"samp>&rsquo;と&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Value</samp>&rsquo;というラベルが付"
"いた2つの項目で構成されており、いずれも編集可能なフィールドです。リストから関"
"連付けを削除するには、その横にある&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[DEL]</"
"samp>&rsquo;ボタンを使用します。関連付けを追加するには、挿入したい位置にある"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[INS]</samp>&rsquo;ボタンを使用してください。一番"
"最後の&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[INS]</samp>&rsquo;ボタンを使用すると、リス"
"トの末尾に挿入されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-saving-a-setting\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-settings_002c-how-to-save\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-saving-a-setting\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-settings_002c-how-to-save\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"When you set a variable, the new value takes effect only in the current "
"Emacs session.  To <em class=\"dfn\">save</em> the value for future "
"sessions, use the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>&rsquo; button "
"and select the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Save for Future Sessions</"
"samp>&rsquo; operation.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Saving-"
"Customizations.html\">Saving Customizations</a>."
msgstr ""
"変数を設定すると、新しい値は現在のEmacsセッションでのみ有効になります。今後の"
"セッションでもその値を<em class=\"dfn\">保存</em>するには、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>&rsquo;ボタンを使用し、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Save for Future Sessions</samp>&rsquo;操作を選択してください。"
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Saving-Customizations.html\">カスタマイズの保存</a>"
"を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"You can also restore the variable to its standard value by using the &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>&rsquo; button and selecting the &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Erase Customization</samp>&rsquo; operation.  There are "
"actually four reset operations:"
msgstr ""
"また、「<samp class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>」ボタンを使用し、「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Erase Customization</samp>」操作を選択することで、変数を標準値"
"に戻すこともできます。実際には、リセット操作は4種類あります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Undo Edits</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Undo Edits</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"If you have modified but not yet set the variable, this restores the text in "
"the customization buffer to match the actual value."
msgstr ""
"変数を変更したがまだ設定していない場合、カスタマイズバッファ内のテキストを実"
"際の値に合わせて復元します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Revert This Session's Customizations</"
"samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Revert This Session's Customizations</"
"samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"This restores the value of the variable to the last saved value, if there "
"was one.  Otherwise it restores the standard value.  It updates the text "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"これにより、変数の値が最後に保存された値（もしあれば）に復元されます。そうで"
"ない場合は、標準値に復元されます。それに応じてテキストが更新されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Erase Customization</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Erase Customization</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"This sets the variable to its standard value.  Any saved value that you have "
"is also eliminated."
msgstr ""
"これにより、変数が標準値に設定されます。保存されていた値もすべて消去されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Set to Backup Value</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Set to Backup Value</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"This sets the variable to a previous value that was set in the customization "
"buffer in this session.  If you customize a variable and then reset it, "
"which discards the customized value, you can get the discarded value back "
"again with this operation."
msgstr ""
"これにより、変数は本セッションのカスタマイズバッファに設定されていた以前の値"
"に設定されます。変数をカスタマイズした後にリセットしてカスタマイズ後の値を破"
"棄した場合、この操作によって破棄された値を再度復元できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-comments-on-customized-settings\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-comments-on-customized-settings\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes it is useful to record a comment about a specific customization.  "
"Use the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Add Comment</samp>&rsquo; item from the "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>&rsquo; menu to create a field for "
"entering the comment."
msgstr ""
"特定のカスタマイズに関するコメントを記録しておくと便利な場合があります。"
"「<samp class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>」メニューの「<samp class=\"samp\">Add "
"Comment</samp>」項目を使用して、コメント入力用のフィールドを作成してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid "Near the top of the customization buffer are two lines of buttons:"
msgstr "カスタマイズバッファの上部付近には、2行のボタンが並んでいます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" Operate on all settings in this buffer:\n"
" [Revert...] [Apply] [Apply and Save]\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Changing-a-Variable.html
msgid ""
"The &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Revert...]</samp>&rsquo; button drops a "
"menu with the first 3 reset operations described above.  The &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[Apply]</samp>&rsquo; button applies the settings for the "
"current session.  The &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Apply and Save]</"
"samp>&rsquo; button applies the settings and saves them for future sessions; "
"this button does not appear if Emacs was started with the <samp "
"class=\"option\">-q</samp> or <samp class=\"option\">-Q</samp> option (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Initial-Options.html\">Initial Options</a>)."
msgstr ""
"「<samp class=\"samp\">[Revert...]</samp>」ボタンをクリックすると前述の最初の"
"3つのリセット操作を含むメニューが表示されます。「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[Apply]</samp>」ボタンは現在のセッションに設定を適用します。"
"「<samp class=\"samp\">[Apply and Save]</samp>」ボタンは設定を適用し、次回以"
"降のセッション用に保存します。このボタンは、Emacsを<samp class=\"option\">-"
"q</samp>または<samp class=\"option\">-Q</samp>オプションで起動した場合には表"
"示されません（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Initial-Options.html\">初期オプション"
"</a>を参照）。"

