# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Checklist.html
msgid ""
"Be warned: it is often difficult, and sometimes impossible, to fix a "
"terminal-dependent bug without access to a terminal of the type that "
"stimulates the bug."
msgstr ""
"ご注意ください。バグを誘発する種類の端末を利用できなければ、端末依存のバグを"
"修正するのは困難なことが多く、時には不可能な場合もあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Checklist.html
msgid ""
"The version number of Emacs.  Without this, we won&rsquo;t know whether "
"there is any point in looking for the bug in the current version of GNU "
"Emacs.  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-emacs_002dversion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"Emacsのバージョン番号。これがないと、現行バージョンのGNU Emacsでバグを探す意"
"味があるのか判断できません。  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"emacs_002dversion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Checklist.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x report-emacs-bug</kbd> includes this information "
"automatically, but if you are not using that command for your report you can "
"get the version number by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x emacs-version <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>.  If that command does not work, you probably "
"have something other than GNU Emacs, so you will have to report the bug "
"somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x report-emacs-bug</kbd> はこの情報を自動的に含めます"
"が、レポートでそのコマンドを使用していない場合は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"emacs-version <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> と入力することでバージョン番"
"号を取得できます。もしそのコマンドが動作しない場合は、おそらく GNU Emacs 以外"
"のものを使用しているため、別の場所でバグを報告する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Checklist.html
msgid ""
"The type of machine you are using, and the operating system name and version "
