"のバッファに挿入してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Checklist.html
msgid ""
"The command-line arguments given to the <code class=\"code\">configure</"
"code> command when Emacs was built (automatically included by <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x report-emacs-bug</kbd>)."
msgstr ""
"Emacsのビルド時に<code class=\"code\">configure</code>コマンドに渡されたコマ"
"ンドライン引数（<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x report-emacs-bug</kbd>によって自動的に"
"含まれる）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Checklist.html
msgid ""
"A complete list of any modifications you have made to the Emacs source.  (We "
"may not have time to investigate the bug unless it happens in an unmodified "
"Emacs.  But if you&rsquo;ve made modifications and you don&rsquo;t tell us, "
"you are sending us on a wild goose chase.)"
msgstr ""
"Emacsのソースコードに加えた修正内容の完全なリスト。（未修正のEmacsでバグが発"
"生しない限り、調査する時間がないかもしれません。しかし、修正を加えていながら"
"報告しない場合、我々に無駄な労力を強いることになります。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Checklist.html
msgid ""
"Be precise about these changes.  A description in English is not "
"enough&mdash;send a unified context diff for them."
msgstr ""
"これらの変更については具体的に記述してください。英語での説明だけでは不十分で"
"す&mdash;統一されたコンテキスト差分を送ってください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Checklist.html
msgid ""
"Adding files of your own, or porting to another machine, is a modification "
"of the source."
msgstr ""
"自前のファイルを追加したり、別のマシンに移植したりすることは、ソースコードの"
"改変にあたります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Checklist.html
msgid ""
"Details of any other deviations from the standard procedure for installing "
"GNU Emacs."
msgstr "GNU Emacsのインストールにおける標準手順からのその他の逸脱事項の詳細。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Checklist.html
msgid ""
"If non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> text or internationalization is "
"relevant, the locale that was current when you started Emacs.  This is "
"automatically included by <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x report-emacs-bug</kbd>; "
