# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Checklist.html
msgid ""
"You can also use the <code class=\"command\">locale</code> command, if your "
"system has it, to display your locale settings."
