"discards the suffix that matched <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> and "
"searches the list again for another match.  This &ldquo;recursive extension "
"stripping&rdquo; is used for files which have multiple extensions, and the "
"&ldquo;outer&rdquo; extension hides the &ldquo;inner&rdquo; one that "
"actually specifies the right mode.  For example, backup files and GPG-"
"encrypted files with <samp class=\"file\">.gpg</samp> extension use this "
"feature."
msgstr ""
