# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Citing-Mail.html
msgid ""
"Yank the selected message from the mail reader, as a citation (<code "
"class=\"code\">message-yank-original</code>)."
msgstr ""
"メールリーダーから選択したメッセージを、引用（<code class=\"code\">message-"
"yank-original</code>）として抜き出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
