# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Code-Alignment.html
msgid ""
"In most cases, you should try <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x align</kbd> without a "
"prefix argument first, and if that doesn&rsquo;t produce the right result "
"you can undo with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-/</kbd> and try again with <kbd "
