"領域がこれらの線をすべて含む場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x align</kbd> と入力す"
"ると次のようになります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Code-Alignment.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"one       = 1;\n"
"foobarbaz = 2;\n"
"\n"
"spam  = 3;\n"
"emacs = 4;\n"
