# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors-X.html
msgid ""
"You can use the following command-line options to specify the colors to use "
"for various parts of the Emacs display.  Colors may be specified using "
"either color names or RGB triplets (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Colors.html\">Colors for Faces</a>)."
