# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors.html
msgid ""
"<span>16.9 Colors for Faces<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Colors-for-"
"Faces\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>16.9 顔の色<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Colors-for-Faces\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors.html
msgid ""
"Faces can have various foreground and background colors.  When you specify a "
"color for a face&mdash;for instance, when customizing the face (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Face-Customization.html\">Customizing Faces</"
"a>)&mdash;you can use either a <em class=\"dfn\">color name</em> or an <em "
"class=\"dfn\">RGB triplet</em>."
msgstr ""
"フェイスには、さまざまな前景色や背景色を設定できます。フェイスに色を指定する"
"場合（例えば、フェイスをカスタマイズする場合（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Face-"
"Customization.html\">フェイスのカスタマイズ</a>を参照））、<em class=\"dfn\">"
"色名</em>または<em class=\"dfn\">RGBトリプレット</em>のいずれかを使用できま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors.html
msgid "<a href=\"#Color-Names\" accesskey=\"1\">Color Names</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"#Color-Names\" accesskey=\"1\">色名</a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors.html
msgid "<a href=\"#RGB-Triplets\" accesskey=\"2\">RGB Triplets</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\"#RGB-Triplets\" accesskey=\"2\">RGBトリプレット</a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors.html
msgid ""
"<span>16.9.1 Color Names<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Color-Names\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>16.9.1 色名<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Color-Names\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-color-name\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-list_002dcolors_002ddisplay\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-list_002dcolors_002dsort\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-color-name\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-list_002dcolors_002ddisplay\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-list_002dcolors_002dsort\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors.html
msgid ""
"A color name is a pre-defined name, such as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">dark "
"orange</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">medium sea green</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  To view a list of color names, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"list-colors-display</kbd>.  To control the order in which colors are shown, "
"customize <code class=\"code\">list-colors-sort</code>.  If you run this "
"command on a graphical display, it shows the full range of color names known "
"to Emacs (these are the standard X11 color names, defined in X&rsquo;s <samp "
"class=\"file\">rgb.txt</samp> file).  If you run the command on a text "
"terminal, it shows only a small subset of colors that can be safely "
"displayed on such terminals.  However, Emacs understands X11 color names "
"even on text terminals; if a face is given a color specified by an X11 color "
"name, it is displayed using the closest-matching terminal color."
msgstr ""
"カラー名とは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">dark orange</samp>&rsquo; や "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">medium sea green</samp>&rsquo; のようなあらかじめ"
"定義された名称のことです。カラー名の一覧を表示するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x list-colors-display</kbd> と入力してください。色が表示される順序を制御する"
"には、<code class=\"code\">list-colors-sort</code> をカスタマイズしてくださ"
"い。このコマンドをグラフィカルディスプレイで実行すると、Emacs が認識している"
"すべてのカラー名（X の <samp class=\"file\">rgb.txt</samp> ファイルで定義され"
"ている標準的な X11 カラー名）が表示されます。テキストターミナルでこのコマンド"
"を実行すると、そのようなターミナルで安全に表示できる少数のカラーのみが表示さ"
"れます。ただし、Emacs はテキストターミナル上でも X11 カラー名を認識します。"
"フェイスに X11 カラー名で指定された色が割り当てられている場合、最も近いターミ"
"ナルカラーを用いて表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors.html
msgid ""
"<span>16.9.2 RGB Triplets<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#RGB-Triplets\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>16.9.2 RGBトリプレット<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#RGB-"
"Triplets\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-RGB-triplet\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-RGB-triplet\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors.html
msgid ""
"An RGB triplet is a string of the form &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#RRGGBB</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  Each of the primary color components is represented by a "
"hexadecimal number between &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">00</samp>&rsquo; "
"(intensity 0) and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FF</samp>&rsquo; (the maximum "
"intensity).  It is also possible to use one, three, or four hex digits for "
"each component, so &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">red</samp>&rsquo; can be "
"represented as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#F00</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#fff000000</samp>&rsquo;, or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#ffff00000000</samp>&rsquo;.  The components must have the "
"same number of digits.  For hexadecimal values A to F, either upper or lower "
"case are acceptable."
msgstr ""
"RGBトリプレットは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#RRGGBB</samp>&rsquo;という形"
"式の文字列です。各原色成分は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">00</samp>&rsquo;"
"（強度0）から&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FF</samp>&rsquo;（最大強度）までの16"
"進数で表されます。また、各成分に1桁、3桁、または4桁の16進数を使用することもで"
"きるため、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">red</samp>&rsquo;は&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#F00</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#fff000000</"
"samp>&rsquo;、または&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#ffff00000000</samp>&rsquo;と"
"して表現できます。各成分の桁数は同じである必要があります。16進数の値AからFに"
"ついては、大文字・小文字のどちらを使用しても構いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors.html
msgid ""
"The <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x list-colors-display</kbd> command also shows the "
"equivalent RGB triplet for each named color.  For instance, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">medium sea green</samp>&rsquo; is equivalent to &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#3CB371</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x list-colors-display</kbd>コマンドは、各名前付きカラー"
"に対応するRGBトリプレットも表示します。例えば、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">medium sea green</samp>&rsquo;は&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#3CB371</samp>&rsquo;と同等です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-face-colors_002c-setting\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-set_002dface_002dforeground\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-set_002dface_002dbackground\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-face-colors_002c-setting\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-set_002dface_002dforeground\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-set_002dface_002dbackground\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Colors.html
msgid ""
"You can change the foreground and background colors of a face with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x set-face-foreground</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x set-"
"face-background</kbd>.  These commands prompt in the minibuffer for a face "
"name and a color, with completion, and then set that face to use the "
"specified color.  They affect the face colors on all frames, but their "
"effects do not persist for future Emacs sessions, unlike using the "
"customization buffer or X resources.  You can also use frame parameters to "
"set foreground and background colors for a specific frame; See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Frame-Parameters.html\">Frame Parameters</a>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x set-face-foreground</kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"set-face-background</kbd> を使用して、フェイスの前景色と背景色を変更できま"
"す。これらのコマンドは、ミニバッファにフェイス名と色の入力を促し（補完機能付"
"き）、指定された色をそのフェイスに適用します。これらの設定はすべてのフレーム"
"のフェイス色に影響しますが、カスタマイズバッファや X リソースを使用する場合と"
"は異なり、次回以降の Emacs セッションに引き継がれることはありません。また、フ"
"レームパラメータを使用して特定のフレームの前景色と背景色を設定することもでき"
"ます。詳細は <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Frame-Parameters.html\">フレームパラ"
"メータ</a> を参照してください。"

