#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Combining-in-Emerge.html
msgid ""
"<span>30.6.6 Combining the Two Versions<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Combining-the-Two-Versions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>30.6.6 2つのバージョンの組み合わせ<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Combining-the-Two-Versions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Combining-in-Emerge.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes you want to keep <em class=\"emph\">both</em> alternatives for a "
"particular difference.  To do this, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">x c</kbd>, which "
"edits the merge buffer like this:"
msgstr ""
"特定の差分に対して、<em class=\"emph\">両方</em>の選択肢を保持したい場合があ"
"ります。その場合は <kbd class=\"kbd\">x c</kbd> を使用してください。これによ"
"り、マージバッファが次のように編集されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Combining-in-Emerge.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#ifdef NEW\n"
"<var class=\"var\">version from B buffer</var>\n"
"#else /* not NEW */\n"
"<var class=\"var\">version from A buffer</var>\n"
"#endif /* not NEW */\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Combining-in-Emerge.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"emerge_002dcombine_002dversions_002dtemplate\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"emerge_002dcombine_002dversions_002dtemplate\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Combining-in-Emerge.html
msgid ""
"While this example shows C preprocessor conditionals delimiting the two "
"alternative versions, you can specify the strings to use by setting the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">emerge-combine-versions-template</code> to a "
"string of your choice.  In the string, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%a</"
"samp>&rsquo; says where to put version A, and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%b</samp>&rsquo; says where to put version B.  The default "
"setting, which produces the results shown above, looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"この例では、Cプリプロセッサの条件分岐を用いて2つの代替バージョンを区切ってい"
"ますが、変数 <code class=\"code\">emerge-combine-versions-template</code> に"
"任意の文字列を設定することで、使用する文字列を指定できます。その文字列の中"
"で、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%a</samp>&rsquo; はバージョンAの配置場所を、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%b</samp>&rsquo; はバージョンBの配置場所を指定し"
"ます。上記の結果となるデフォルト設定は、次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Combining-in-Emerge.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "&quot;#ifdef NEW\\n%b#else /* not NEW */\\n%a#endif /* not NEW */\\n&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

