# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Commands-of-GUD.html
msgid ""
"GUD provides commands for setting and clearing breakpoints, selecting stack "
"frames, and stepping through the program."
msgstr ""
"GUDでは、ブレークポイントの設定・解除、スタックフレームの選択、プログラムのス"
"テップ実行を行うためのコマンドが用意されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Commands-of-GUD.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002da-C_002db\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-a "
"C-b</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-C_002da-C_002db\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002da-C_002db\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-a "
"C-b</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-C_002da-C_002db\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Commands-of-GUD.html
msgid "Set a breakpoint on the source line that point is on."
msgstr "そのポイントがあるソース行にブレークポイントを設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Commands-of-GUD.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-a C-b</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">gud-break</"
"code>), when called in a source buffer, sets a debugger breakpoint on the "
"current source line.  This command is available only after starting GUD.  If "
"you call it in a buffer that is not associated with any debugger subprocess, "
"it signals an error."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-a C-b</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">gud-break</code>) "
"をソースバッファ内で呼び出すと、現在のソース行にデバッガのブレークポイントが"
"設定されます。このコマンドは GUD を起動した後にのみ利用可能です。デバッガのサ"
"ブプロセスに関連付けられていないバッファ内で呼び出した場合は、エラーとなりま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Commands-of-GUD.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002da-_0028GUD_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002da-_0028GUD_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Commands-of-GUD.html
msgid ""
"The following commands are available both in the GUD interaction buffer and "
"globally, but with different key bindings.  The keys starting with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> are available only in the GUD interaction buffer, "
"while those starting with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-a</kbd> are available "
"globally.  Some of these commands are also available via the tool bar; some "
"are not supported by certain debuggers."
msgstr ""
"以下のコマンドは、GUDインタラクションバッファとグローバルの両方で利用可能です"
"が、キーバインドが異なります。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd>で始まるキーはGUDイ"
"ンタラクションバッファでのみ利用可能であり、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-a</kbd>"
"で始まるキーはグローバルで利用可能です。これらのコマンドの一部はツールバーか"
"らも利用できますが、一部のデバッガではサポートされていません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Commands-of-GUD.html
