# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Commands-of-GUD.html
msgid ""
"Execute the next single line of code (<code class=\"code\">gud-step</"
"code>).  If the line contains a function call, execution stops after "
"entering the called function."
