"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-TAB-_0028completion_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-minibuffer_002dcomplete\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete</"
"code>) is the most fundamental completion command.  It searches for all "
"possible completions that match the existing minibuffer text, and attempts "
"to complete as much as it can.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Completion-"
"Styles.html\">How Completion Alternatives Are Chosen</a>, for how completion "
"alternatives are chosen."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete</"
"code>) は最も基本的な補完コマンドです。既存のミニバッファテキストに一致する可"
"能性のあるすべての補完候補を検索し、可能な限り多くを補完しようとします。補完"
"候補がどのように選択されるかについては、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Completion-"
"Styles.html\">補完候補の選択方法</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SPC-_0028completion_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-minibuffer_002dcomplete_002dword\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SPC-_0028completion_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-minibuffer_002dcomplete_002dword\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete-word</"
"code>) completes like <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd>, but only up to the next "
"hyphen or space.  If you have &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">auto-f</"
"samp>&rsquo; in the minibuffer and type <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>, it "
"finds that the completion is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">auto-fill-mode</"
"samp>&rsquo;, but it only inserts &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ill-</"
"samp>&rsquo;, giving &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">auto-fill-</samp>&rsquo;.  "
"Another <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> at this point completes all the way to "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">auto-fill-mode</samp>&rsquo;.  This command is "
"not available for arguments that often include spaces, such as file names."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete-word</"
"code>) は <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> と同様に補完されますが、次のハイフンま"
"たはスペースまでとなります。ミニバッファに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">auto-"
"f</samp>&rsquo; がある状態で <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> と入力すると、補完"
"候補が &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">auto-fill-mode</samp>&rsquo; であると判定"
"されますが、実際には &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ill-</samp>&rsquo; のみが挿"
"入され、結果として &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">auto-fill-</samp>&rsquo; とな"
"ります。この時点で別の <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> を入力すると、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">auto-fill-mode</samp>&rsquo; まで完全に補完されます。こ"
"のコマンドは、ファイル名のようにスペースが含まれることが多い引数には利用でき"
"ません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_003f-_0028completion_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion-list\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_003f-_0028completion_0029\"></a> <a "
