"completion</code>) navigate through the completions displayed in the "
"completions buffer.  These commands are sensitive to the completion list "
"format: they move point column-wise when the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">completions-format</code> is <code class=\"code\">horizontal</"
"code> and line-wise when its value is <code class=\"code\">vertical</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion-Options.html\">Completion Options</"
"a>).  If you set <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-completion-auto-choose</"
"code> to non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, using these commands also "
"inserts the current completion candidate into the minibuffer.  You can use "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-choose-completion</code>) or <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete-and-exit</code>) to choose the selected "
"completion candidate.  By default, these commands exit the minibuffer, but "
"with a prefix argument (that is, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>)  they insert the currently selected candidate "
"into the minibuffer without exiting it."
msgstr ""
"ミニバッファまたは補完リストバッファにいる間、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-next-"
"completion</code>) および <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-previous-completion</code>) を使用する"
"と、補完バッファに表示されている補完候補を移動できます。これらのコマンドは補"
"完リストの形式に依存しており、<code class=\"code\">completions-format</code> "
"の値が <code class=\"code\">horizontal</code> のときはポイントを列方向に、"
"<code class=\"code\">vertical</code> のときは行方向に移動します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion-Options.html\">補完オプション</a>を参照）。"
"<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-completion-auto-choose</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外を設定した場合、これらのコマンドを使用すると、"
"現在の補完候補がミニバッファにも挿入されます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-choose-"
"completion</code>) または <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete-and-exit</code>) を使用して、"
"選択された補完候補を選ぶことができます。デフォルトでは、これらのコマンドはミ"
"ニバッファを終了しますが、接頭辞引数（すなわち <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>）を指定すると、ミニバッファを終了せずに現在選択"
"されている候補をミニバッファに挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-switch_002dto_002dcompletions\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-switch_002dto_002dcompletions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-v</kbd>, while in the minibuffer, selects the "
"window showing the completion list (<code class=\"code\">switch-to-"
"completions</code>).  This paves the way for using the commands below.  <kbd "
"class=\"key\">PageUp</kbd>, <kbd class=\"key\">prior</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-g M-c</kbd> do the same.  You can also select the window in "
"other ways (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Windows.html\">Multiple Windows</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"ミニバッファで <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-v</kbd> と入力すると、補完リストが表示さ"
"れているウィンドウ (<code class=\"code\">switch-to-completions</code>) が選択"
"されます。これにより、以下のコマンドが使用可能になります。<kbd "
"class=\"key\">PageUp</kbd>、<kbd class=\"key\">prior</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-g M-c</kbd> も同様です。また、他の方法でウィンドウを選択する"
"こともできます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Windows.html\">複数のウィンドウ</"
"a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-choose_002dcompletion\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-choose_002dcompletion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"While in the completion list buffer, <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> chooses the completion candidate at point "
"(<code class=\"code\">choose-completion</code>) and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> choose the "
"completion at mouse click.  With a prefix argument, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u "
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> inserts the completion at point into the "
"minibuffer, but doesn&rsquo;t exit the minibuffer&mdash;thus, you can change "
"your mind and choose another candidate."
msgstr ""
"補完リストバッファ内では、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd> がポイント (<code class=\"code\">choose-completion</code>) にある補完候"
"補を選択し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</"
"kbd> はマウスクリック時に補完を選択します。プレフィックス引数を指定すると、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> はポイントにある補"
"完をミニバッファに挿入しますが、ミニバッファからは退出しません。これにより、"
"考えを変えて別の候補を選択することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-next_002dcompletion\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-previous_002dcompletion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-next_002dcompletion\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-previous_002dcompletion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"While in the completion list buffer, you can use <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> to move point to "
"the following completion candidate (<code class=\"code\">next-completion</"
"code>) and <kbd class=\"kbd\">S-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> or <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">p</kbd> to move point to the previous completion alternative "
"(<code class=\"code\">previous-completion</code>).  Like <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"<kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd>, these commands are also sensitive to the "
"completion list format."
msgstr ""
"補完リストバッファ内では、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></"
"kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> でポイントを次の補完候補 (<code "
"class=\"code\">next-completion</code>) へ移動でき、<kbd class=\"kbd\">S-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">p</kbd> でポイントを"
"前の補完候補 (<code class=\"code\">previous-completion</code>) へ移動できま"
"す。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> や <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd> と同様に、これらのコマンド"
"も補完リストの形式の影響を受けます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-next_002dcolumn_002dcompletion\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-next_002dline_002dcompletion\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"previous_002dcolumn_002dcompletion\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-previous_002dline_002dcompletion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-next_002dcolumn_002dcompletion\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-next_002dline_002dcompletion\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"previous_002dcolumn_002dcompletion\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-previous_002dline_002dcompletion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"In contrast, <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">next-column-completion</code>) and <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">previous-column-"
"completion</code>) always move point column-wise, regardless of the "
"completion list format.  Likewise, <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">next-line-completion</"
"code>) and <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">previous-line-completion</code>) always move point line-wise."
msgstr ""
"これに対し、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">next-column-completion</code>) と <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">previous-column-"
"completion</code>) は、補完リストの形式に関わらず、常にポイントを列方向に移動"
"させます。同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">next-line-completion</code>) と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">previous-line-completion</code>) は、常にポイントを行方向に移"
"動させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"All of these movement commands (and also <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd>) accept a numeric prefix argument <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>, which makes point move to the <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var>th following or preceding completion candidate."
msgstr ""
"これらの移動コマンド（および <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</"
"kbd></kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd>）はすべ"
"て、数値のプレフィックス引数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> を受け付けます。これ"
"により、ポイントは後続または先行する <var class=\"var\">n</var> 番目の完了候"
"補に移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"minibuffer_002dcomplete_002dhistory\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-minibuffer_002dcomplete_002ddefaults\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-UP-_0028completion_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-DOWN-_0028completion_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"minibuffer_002dcomplete_002dhistory\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-minibuffer_002dcomplete_002ddefaults\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-UP-_0028completion_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-DOWN-_0028completion_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"You can also complete using the history of minibuffer inputs for the command "
"which prompted you.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete-history</code>) works like "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd>, but completes using "
"minibuffer history instead of the usual completion candidates.  A similar "
"command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete-defaults</code>) completes using the "
"default input items provided by the prompting command."
msgstr ""
"また、入力を促したコマンドのミニバッファ入力履歴を使用して補完することも可能"
"です。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete-history</code>) は <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> と同様に動作しますが、通常の"
"補完候補ではなくミニバッファの履歴を使用して補完を行います。同様のコマンドで"
"ある <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete-defaults</code>) は、入力を促したコマンド"
"によって提供されるデフォルトの入力項目を使用して補完を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quit_002dwindow\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dcurrent_002dbuffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quit_002dwindow\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dcurrent_002dbuffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Finally, <kbd class=\"kbd\">q</kbd> quits the window showing it and selects "
"the window showing the minibuffer (<code class=\"code\">quit-window</code>), "
"and <kbd class=\"kbd\">z</kbd> kills the completion buffer and delete the "
"window showing it (<code class=\"code\">kill-current-buffer</code>)."
msgstr ""
"最後に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">q</kbd> はそれを表示しているウィンドウを終了してミ"
"ニバッファを表示しているウィンドウ (<code class=\"code\">quit-window</code>) "
"を選択し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">z</kbd> は補完バッファを終了してそれを表示してい"
"るウィンドウ (<code class=\"code\">kill-current-buffer</code>) を削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"minibuffer_002dvisible_002dcompletions\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"minibuffer_002dvisible_002dcompletions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If the variable <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-visible-completions</code> "
"is customized to the value <code class=\"code\">t</code>, it changes the "
"commands bound to the arrow keys: instead of moving in the minibuffer, they "
"move between completion candidates, like meta-arrow keys do by default (but "
"note that, just as when the window showing the completion list is selected, "
"here too, <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd></kbd> only move point column-"
"wise and <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd> only move point line-wise, "
"regardless of the completion list format).  Similarly, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> selects the current "
"candidate, like <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> does "
"normally.  <code class=\"code\">C-g</code> hides the completion window, but "
"leaves the minibuffer active, so you can continue typing at the prompt.  If "
"the value of this variable is <code class=\"code\">up-down</code>, only the "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> arrow keys move point "
"between completion candidates, while <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd></kbd> move point in the minibuffer window."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">minibuffer-visible-completions</code> が値 <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> に設定されている場合、矢印キーに割り当てられたコマン"
"ドが変更されます。ミニバッファ内で移動するのではなく、デフォルトのメタ矢印"
"キーと同様に、補完候補間を移動するようになります（ただし、補完リストを表示す"
"るウィンドウが選択されている時と同様に、ここでも <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd></kbd> はポイントを列方向に、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">UP</"
"kbd></kbd> は行方向にのみ移動することに注意してください。これは補完リストの形"
"式に関わらず適用されます）。同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> は通常 <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> が行うように、現在の候補を選択します。<code "
"class=\"code\">C-g</code> は補完ウィンドウを非表示にしますが、ミニバッファは"
"アクティブなまま維持されるため、プロンプトで入力を続けることができます。この"
"変数の値が <code class=\"code\">up-down</code> の場合、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> の矢印キーのみが補完候補間でポイントを移動さ"
"せ、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd> と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd></kbd> はミニバッファウィンドウ内"
"でポイントを移動させます。"

