# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Example.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-TAB-_0028completion-example_0029\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-TAB-_0028completion-example_0029\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Example.html
msgid ""
"A simple example may help here.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> uses the "
"minibuffer to read the name of a command, so completion works by matching "
"the minibuffer text against the names of existing Emacs commands.  Suppose "
"you wish to run the command <code class=\"code\">auto-fill-mode</code>.  You "
"can do that by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x auto-fill-mode <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>, but it is easier to use completion."
msgstr ""
"簡単な例を挙げると分かりやすいでしょう。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> はミニ"
"バッファを使用してコマンド名を読み取るため、ミニバッファ内のテキストを既存の "
"Emacs コマンド名と照合することで補完が機能します。例えば、<code "
"class=\"code\">auto-fill-mode</code> というコマンドを実行したいとします。"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x auto-fill-mode <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> と入"
"力することでも実行できますが、補完を利用する方が簡単です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Example.html
msgid ""
"If you type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x a u <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd>, "
"the <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> looks for completion alternatives (in this "
"case, command names) that start with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">au</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  There are several, including <code class=\"code\">auto-fill-"
"mode</code> and <code class=\"code\">autoconf-mode</code>, but they all "
"begin with <code class=\"code\">auto</code>, so the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">au</samp>&rsquo; in the minibuffer completes to &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">auto</samp>&rsquo;.  (More commands may be defined in your "
"Emacs session.  For example, if a command called <code "
"class=\"code\">authorize-me</code> was defined, Emacs could only complete as "
"far as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">aut</samp>&rsquo;.)"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x a u <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> と入力すると、"
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">au</samp>&rsquo; "
"で始まる補完候補（この場合はコマンド名）を探します。<code "
"class=\"code\">auto-fill-mode</code> や <code class=\"code\">autoconf-mode</"
"code> などいくつか候補がありますが、いずれも <code class=\"code\">auto</"
"code> で始まるため、ミニバッファ内の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">au</"
"samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">auto</samp>&rsquo; に補完されま"
"す。（お使いの Emacs セッションでは、さらに多くのコマンドが定義されている場合"
"があります。例えば、<code class=\"code\">authorize-me</code> というコマンドが"
"定義されていた場合、Emacs は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">aut</samp>&rsquo; ま"
"でしか補完できません。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Example.html
msgid ""
"If you type <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> again "
"immediately, it cannot determine the next character; it could be &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</"
"samp>&rsquo;, or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c</samp>&rsquo;.  So it does "
"not add any characters; instead, <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> displays a "
"list of all possible completions in another window."
msgstr ""
"続けてすぐに <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> と入力する"
"と、次の文字を判定できません。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo;、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo;、あるいは &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">c</samp>&rsquo; のいずれかになる可能性があるためです。そのた"
"め、文字は追加されず、代わりに <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> が別のウィンドウ"
"に考えられるすべての補完候補の一覧を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Example.html
msgid ""
"Next, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">-f</kbd>.  The minibuffer now contains &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">auto-f</samp>&rsquo;, and the only command name that "
"starts with this is <code class=\"code\">auto-fill-mode</code>.  If you now "
"type <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd>, completion fills "
"in the rest of the argument &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">auto-fill-mode</"
"samp>&rsquo; into the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"次に <kbd class=\"kbd\">-f</kbd> と入力します。ミニバッファには &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">auto-f</samp>&rsquo; が表示され、これで始まるコマンド名は "
"<code class=\"code\">auto-fill-mode</code> だけです。ここで <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> と入力すると、補完機能が引数"
"の残りの部分 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">auto-fill-mode</samp>&rsquo; をミニ"
"バッファに入力します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Example.html
msgid ""
"Hence, typing just <kbd class=\"kbd\">a u <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> - f "
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> allows you to enter &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">auto-fill-mode</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"したがって、<kbd class=\"kbd\">a u <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> - f <kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> と入力するだけで &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">auto-fill-mode</samp>&rsquo; と入力できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Example.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> also works while point is not at the end of the "
"minibuffer.  In that case, it will fill in text both at point and at the end "
"of the minibuffer.  If you type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x autocm</kbd>, then "
"press <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd> to move point before the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">m</samp>&rsquo;, you can type <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> to insert the text &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">onf-</samp>&rsquo; at point and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ode</samp>&rsquo; at the end of the minibuffer, so that the "
"minibuffer contains &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">autoconf-mode</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> も、ポイントがミニバッファの末尾にない限り有効で"
"す。その場合、ポイントとミニバッファの末尾の両方にテキストが挿入されます。"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x autocm</kbd> と入力し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd> を"
"押してポイントを &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">m</samp>&rsquo; の前に移動させた"
"後、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> と入力すれば、ポイ"
"ントに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">onf-</samp>&rsquo;、ミニバッファの末尾に "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ode</samp>&rsquo; というテキストが挿入され、ミニ"
"バッファには &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">autoconf-mode</samp>&rsquo; が含まれ"
"るようになります。"

