"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Exit.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-RET-_0028completion-in-"
"minibuffer_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"minibuffer_002dcomplete_002dand_002dexit-1\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-RET-_0028completion-in-"
"minibuffer_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"minibuffer_002dcomplete_002dand_002dexit-1\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Exit.html
msgid ""
"When a command reads an argument using the minibuffer with completion, it "
"also controls what happens when you type <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete-and-exit</code>) to submit the argument.  "
"There are four types of behavior:"
msgstr ""
"コマンドが補完機能を用いてミニバッファから引数を読み取る際、引数を送信するた"
"めに <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">minibuffer-complete-"
"and-exit</code>) と入力したときに何が起こるかも制御します。動作には4つのパ"
"ターンがあります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Exit.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Strict completion</em> accepts only exact completion "
"matches.  Typing <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> exits the minibuffer only if "
"the minibuffer text is an exact match, or completes to one.  Otherwise, "
"Emacs refuses to exit the minibuffer; instead it tries to complete, and if "
"no completion can be done it momentarily displays &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[No match]</samp>&rsquo; after the minibuffer text.  (You can "
"still leave the minibuffer by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> to cancel "
"the command.)"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">厳密補完</em>は、完全一致する補完候補のみを受け付けます。"
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力すると、ミニバッファのテキストが完全一致す"
"るか、あるいは完全一致する候補に補完された場合にのみ、ミニバッファを終了しま"
"す。それ以外の場合、Emacs はミニバッファを終了せず、代わりに補完を試みます。"
"補完が行えない場合は、ミニバッファのテキストの後に一時的に &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[No match]</samp>&rsquo; が表示されます。（<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> と入力してコマンドをキャンセルすれば、引き続きミニ"
"バッファを終了できます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Exit.html
msgid ""
"An example of a command that uses this behavior is <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</"
"kbd>, since it is meaningless for it to accept a non-existent command name."
msgstr ""
"この挙動を利用したコマンドの例として <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> が挙げられ"
"ます。存在しないコマンド名を受け付けても意味がないためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Exit.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Cautious completion</em> is like strict completion, except "
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> exits only if the text is already an exact "
"match.  If the text completes to an exact match, <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd> performs that completion but does not exit yet; you must type a second "
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> to exit."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">慎重な補完</em>は厳格な補完と同様ですが、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> はテキストがすでに完全一致している場合にのみ終了しま"
"す。テキストが完全一致に補完された場合、<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> はその補"
"完を実行しますが、まだ終了しません。終了するには、2つ目の <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> を入力する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Exit.html
msgid ""
"Cautious completion is used for reading file names for files that must "
"already exist, for example."
msgstr ""
"慎重な完了処理は、例えば、既に存在していなければならないファイルのファイル名"
"を読み取る際に使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Exit.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Permissive completion</em> allows any input; the "
"completion candidates are just suggestions.  Typing <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd> does not complete, it just submits the argument as you have entered it."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">許容型補完</em>ではあらゆる入力が可能であり、補完候補はあく"
"まで提案に過ぎません。<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力しても補完は行われ"
"ず、入力した通りの引数がそのまま送信されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Exit.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-minibuffer-confirmation\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-confirming-in-the-minibuffer\"></a> <em "
"class=\"dfn\">Permissive completion with confirmation</em> is like "
"permissive completion, with an exception: if you typed <kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> and this completed the text up to some intermediate "
"state (i.e., one that is not yet an exact completion match), typing <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> right afterward does not submit the argument.  "
"Instead, Emacs asks for confirmation by momentarily displaying &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[Confirm]</samp>&rsquo; after the text; type <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> again to confirm and submit the text.  This catches "
"a common mistake, in which one types <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> before "
"realizing that <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> did not complete as far as "
"desired.  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"confirm_002dnonexistent_002dfile_002dor_002dbuffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-minibuffer-confirmation\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-confirming-in-the-minibuffer\"></a> <em "
"class=\"dfn\">確認付き許容補完</em>は、許容補完と同様ですが、一点だけ例外があ"
"ります。<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> と入力し、テキストがある中間状態（つま"
"り、まだ完全な補完結果となっていない状態）まで補完された場合、その直後に "
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力しても引数は送信されません。代わりに、"
"Emacs はテキストの後に一時的に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Confirm]</"
"samp>&rsquo; を表示して確認を求めます。再度 <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入"
"力して確認し、テキストを送信してください。これにより、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> が期待通りに補完されなかったことに気づく前に <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力してしまうという、よくあるミスを防ぐことができ"
"ます。<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"confirm_002dnonexistent_002dfile_002dor_002dbuffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Exit.html
msgid ""
"You can tweak the confirmation behavior by customizing the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">confirm-nonexistent-file-or-buffer</code>.  The default "
"value, <code class=\"code\">after-completion</code>, gives the behavior we "
"have just described.  If you change it to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"Emacs does not ask for confirmation, falling back on permissive completion.  "
"If you change it to any other non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, "
"Emacs asks for confirmation whether or not the preceding command was <kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">confirm-nonexistent-file-or-buffer</code> をカスタ"
"マイズすることで、確認動作を調整できます。デフォルト値の <code "
"class=\"code\">after-completion</code> では、先ほど説明した動作になります。こ"
"れを <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に変更すると、Emacs は確認を求めず、許容"
"的な補完にフォールバックします。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に変"
"更すると、直前のコマンドが <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> であったかどうかにか"
"かわらず、Emacs は確認を求めます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Exit.html
msgid ""
"This behavior is used by most commands that read file names, like <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd>, and commands that read buffer names, like <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x b</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"この動作は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd> のようなファイル名を読み込むほと"
"んどのコマンドや、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x b</kbd> のようなバッファ名を読み込む"
"コマンドで使用されています。"

