#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"<span>10.4.5 Completion Options<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Completion-"
"Options-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>10.4.5 完了オプション<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Completion-"
"Options-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case_002dsensitivity-and-"
"completion\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case-in-"
"completion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case_002dsensitivity-and-"
"completion\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case-in-"
"completion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"Case is significant when completing case-sensitive arguments, such as "
"command names.  For example, when completing command names, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">AU</samp>&rsquo; does not complete to &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">auto-fill-mode</samp>&rsquo;.  Case differences are ignored "
"when completing arguments in which case does not matter."
msgstr ""
"コマンド名など、大文字小文字を区別する引数を補完する場合、大文字小文字は重要"
"になります。例えば、コマンド名を補完する際、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">AU</"
"samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">auto-fill-mode</samp>&rsquo; に補"
"完されません。大文字小文字を区別しない引数を補完する場合は、大文字小文字の違"
"いは無視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"read_002dfile_002dname_002dcompletion_002dignore_002dcase\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"read_002dbuffer_002dcompletion_002dignore_002dcase\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"read_002dfile_002dname_002dcompletion_002dignore_002dcase\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"read_002dbuffer_002dcompletion_002dignore_002dcase\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"When completing file names, case differences are ignored if the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">read-file-name-completion-ignore-case</code> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The default value is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> on systems that have case-sensitive file-names, "
"such as GNU/Linux; it is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> on systems that "
"have case-insensitive file-names, such as Microsoft Windows.  When "
"completing buffer names, case differences are ignored if the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">read-buffer-completion-ignore-case</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>; the default is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"ファイル名を補完する際、変数 <code class=\"code\">read-file-name-completion-"
"ignore-case</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であれば、大文字小"
"文字の区別は無視されます。GNU/Linux のようにファイル名の大文字小文字を区別す"
"るシステムではデフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となり、"
"Microsoft Windows のように区別しないシステムでは <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外となります。バッファ名を補完する際、変数 <code class=\"code\">read-"
"buffer-completion-ignore-case</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外"
"であれば、大文字小文字の区別は無視されます。デフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"completion_002dignored_002dextensions\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-ignored-file-names_002c-in-completion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"completion_002dignored_002dextensions\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-ignored-file-names_002c-in-completion\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"When completing file names, Emacs usually omits certain alternatives that "
"are considered unlikely to be chosen, as determined by the list variable "
"<code class=\"code\">completion-ignored-extensions</code>.  Each element in "
"the list should be a string; any file name ending in such a string is "
"ignored as a completion alternative.  Any element ending in a slash (<samp "
"class=\"file\">/</samp>) represents a subdirectory name.  The standard value "
"of <code class=\"code\">completion-ignored-extensions</code> has several "
"elements including <code class=\"code\">&quot;.o&quot;</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;.elc&quot;</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;~&quot;</code>.  For example, if a directory contains "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo.c</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">foo.elc</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</"
"samp>&rsquo; completes to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo.c</samp>&rsquo;.  "
"However, if <em class=\"emph\">all</em> possible completions end in "
"otherwise-ignored strings, they are not ignored: in the previous example, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo.e</samp>&rsquo; completes to &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">foo.elc</samp>&rsquo;.  Emacs disregards <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-ignored-extensions</code> when showing completion "
"alternatives in the completion list."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"Shell completion is an extended version of filename completion, see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Shell-Options.html\">Shell Mode Options</a>."
msgstr ""
"シェル補完はファイル名補完の拡張版です。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Shell-"
"Options.html\">シェルモードオプション</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion_002dauto_002dhelp\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion_002dauto_002dhelp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">completion-auto-help</code> is set to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the completion commands never display the "
"completion list buffer; you must type <kbd class=\"kbd\">?</kbd> to display "
"the list.  If the value is <code class=\"code\">lazy</code>, Emacs only "
"shows the completion list buffer on the second attempt to complete.  In "
"other words, if there is nothing to complete, the first <kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> echoes &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Next char not "
"unique</samp>&rsquo;; the second <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> shows the "
"completion list buffer.  If the value is <code class=\"code\">always</code>, "
"the completion list buffer is always shown when completion is attempted."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">completion-auto-help</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> が設定されている場合、補完コマンドが補完リストバッ"
"ファを表示することはありません。リストを表示するには <kbd class=\"kbd\">?</"
"kbd> と入力する必要があります。値が <code class=\"code\">lazy</code> の場合、"
"Emacs は2回目の補完試行時にのみ補完リストバッファを表示します。言い換えれば、"
"補完すべきものがない場合、1回目の <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> は &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Next char not unique</samp>&rsquo; をエコーし、2回目の "
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> で補完リストバッファが表示されます。値が <code "
"class=\"code\">always</code> の場合、補完を試みる際は常に補完リストバッファが"
"表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"The display of the completion list buffer after it is shown for the first "
"time is also controlled by <code class=\"code\">completion-auto-help</"
"code>.  If the value is <code class=\"code\">t</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">lazy</code>, the window showing the completions pops down "
"when Emacs is able to complete (and may pop up again if Emacs is again "
"unable to complete after you type some more text); if the value is <code "
"class=\"code\">always</code>, the window pops down only when you exit the "
"completion.  The value <code class=\"code\">visible</code> is a hybrid: it "
"behaves like <code class=\"code\">t</code> when it decides whether to pop up "
"the window showing the completion list buffer, and like <code "
"class=\"code\">always</code> when it decides whether to pop it down."
msgstr ""
"補完リストバッファが最初に表示された後の挙動も、<code "
"class=\"code\">completion-auto-help</code> によって制御されます。値が <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> または <code class=\"code\">lazy</code> の場合、"
"Emacs が補完可能になると補完内容を表示するウィンドウがポップアップします（さ"
"らにテキストを入力して再び補完不能になった場合、再度ポップアップすることがあ"
"ります）。値が <code class=\"code\">always</code> の場合、補完を終了したとき"
"にのみウィンドウがポップアップします。値 <code class=\"code\">visible</code> "
"はハイブリッド型であり、補完リストバッファを表示するウィンドウをポップアップ"
"させるかどうかの判定時には <code class=\"code\">t</code> のように、表示させる"
"かどうかの判定時には <code class=\"code\">always</code> のように動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion_002dauto_002dselect\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion_002dauto_002dselect\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"Emacs can optionally select the window showing the completions when it shows "
"that window.  To enable this behavior, customize the user option <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-auto-select</code> to <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>, which changes the behavior of <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> when Emacs "
"pops up the completions: pressing <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</"
"kbd></kbd> will switch to the completion list buffer, and you can then move "
"to a candidate by cursor motion commands and select it with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>.  If the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-auto-select</code> is <code class=\"code\">second-"
"tab</code>, then the first <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></"
"kbd> will pop up the completions list buffer, and the second one will switch "
"to it."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、補完リストを表示する際、オプションでそのウィンドウを選択できます。こ"
"の動作を有効にするには、ユーザーオプション <code class=\"code\">completion-"
"auto-select</code> を <code class=\"code\">t</code> にカスタマイズしてくださ"
"い。これにより、Emacsが補完リストをポップアップ表示する際の <kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> の動作が変更されます。<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> を押すと補完リストバッファに切り替わり、その後"
"カーソル移動コマンドで候補へ移動し、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> で選択できるようになります。<code "
"class=\"code\">completion-auto-select</code> の値が <code "
"class=\"code\">second-tab</code> の場合、1回目の <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> で補完リストバッファがポップアップ表示され、2回"
"目でそこへ切り替わります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"completion_002dcycle_002dthreshold\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"completion_002dcycle_002dthreshold\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">completion-cycle-threshold</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, completion commands can cycle through completion "
"alternatives.  Normally, if there is more than one completion alternative "
"for the text in the minibuffer, a completion command completes up to the "
"longest common substring.  If you change <code class=\"code\">completion-"
"cycle-threshold</code> to <code class=\"code\">t</code>, the completion "
"command instead completes to the first of those completion alternatives; "
"each subsequent invocation of the completion command replaces that with the "
"next completion alternative, in a cyclic manner.  If you give <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-cycle-threshold</code> a numeric value <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>, completion commands switch to this cycling behavior "
"only when there are <var class=\"var\">n</var> or fewer alternatives."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">completion-cycle-threshold</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、補完コマンドは補完候補を順に切り替えて"
"補完できます。通常、ミニバッファ内のテキストに対して複数の補完候補がある場"
"合、補完コマンドは最長の共通部分文字列まで補完します。<code "
"class=\"code\">completion-cycle-threshold</code> を <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> に変更すると、補完コマンドは代わりにそれらの補完候補の最初のものに補完"
"します。その後、補完コマンドが呼び出されるたびに、循環的に次の補完候補へと切"
"り替わります。<code class=\"code\">completion-cycle-threshold</code> に数値 "
"<var class=\"var\">n</var> を指定すると、補完候補が <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var> 個以下である場合にのみ、補完コマンドはこの循環動作に切り替わります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completions_002dsort\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completions_002dsort\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"The user option <code class=\"code\">completions-sort</code> controls the "
"order in which the completions are sorted in the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">*Completions*</samp>&rsquo; buffer.  With the default value "
"<code class=\"code\">alphabetical</code>, the completions are displayed in "
"alphabetical order.  The value <code class=\"code\">nil</code> disables "
"sorting; the value <code class=\"code\">historical</code> sorts "
"alphabetically first, and then rearranges according to the order of the "
"candidates in the minibuffer history.  The value can also be a function, "
"which will be called with the list of completions, and should return the "
"list in the desired order."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーオプション <code class=\"code\">completions-sort</code> は、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">*Completions*</samp>&rsquo; バッファ内で補完候補がソート"
"される順序を制御します。デフォルト値の <code class=\"code\">alphabetical</"
"code> では、補完候補はアルファベット順に表示されます。値 <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> ではソートが無効になり、値 <code "
"class=\"code\">historical</code> では、まずアルファベット順にソートした後、ミ"
"ニバッファ履歴における候補の順序に従って並べ替えが行われます。また、この値は"
"関数を指定することもでき、その場合は補完候補のリストを引数として呼び出され、"
"所望の順序でリストを返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completions_002dformat\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completions_002dformat\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"By default, the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*Completions*</samp>&rsquo; "
"buffer lists the sorted completions horizontally (that is, from left to "
"right across the columns and continuing to the next line below), using as "
"many columns as will fit in the window-width.  You can change this by "
"customizing the user option <code class=\"code\">completions-format</code>.  "
"If its value is <code class=\"code\">vertical</code>, the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">*Completions*</samp>&rsquo; buffer lists the sorted "
"completions vertically (that is, within each column and continuing with the "
"next column to the left), and with the value <code class=\"code\">one-"
"column</code>, all completions appear in a single column.<a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF5\" href=\"#FOOT5\"><sup>5</sup></a>"
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*Completions*</samp>&rsquo;バッ"
"ファはソート済みの補完候補を水平方向（つまり、列を横切って左から右へ進み、下"
"の行へと続く）に、ウィンドウ幅に収まる限りの列数を用いて表示します。これは、"
"ユーザーオプション <code class=\"code\">completions-format</code> をカスタマ"
"イズすることで変更可能です。値が <code class=\"code\">vertical</code> の場"
"合、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*Completions*</samp>&rsquo;バッファはソート済"
"みの補完候補を垂直方向（つまり、各列内で左から右へ進み、次の列へと続く）に表"
"示し、値が <code class=\"code\">one-column</code> の場合は、すべての補完候補"
"が単一の列に表示されます。<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF5\" "
"href=\"#FOOT5\"><sup>5</sup></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion_002dauto_002dwrap\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion_002dauto_002dwrap\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"When point is on the last completion candidate, typing a key that moves "
"point to the next candidate (according to the sorting order of current "
"format) &ldquo;wraps around&rdquo; by default, that is, moves point to the "
"first candidate in the completions buffer.  Likewise, when point is on the "
"first candidate, typing a key to move to the previous candidate puts point "
"on the last candidate in the buffer.  You can suppress this wrapping around "
"by customizing the user option <code class=\"code\">completion-auto-wrap</"
"code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>; then typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">n</"
"kbd> on the last candidate, or typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">S-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">p</kbd> on the first "
"candidate, does not move point."
msgstr ""
"ポイントが最後の補完候補にあるとき、次の候補（現在のフォーマットのソート順に"
"基づく）へ移動するキーを入力すると、デフォルトでは「ラップアラウンド」が行わ"
"れます。つまり、ポイントが補完バッファの最初の候補に移動します。同様に、ポイ"
"ントが最初の候補にあるとき、前の候補へ移動するキーを入力すると、ポイントは"
"バッファの最後の候補に移動します。このラップアラウンドは、ユーザーオプション "
"<code class=\"code\">completion-auto-wrap</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> にカスタマイズすることで抑制できます。これにより、"
"最後の候補で <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> や <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> を入力しても、あるいは最初の候補で <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">S-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">p</"
"kbd> を入力しても、ポイントは移動しなくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"With the arrow keys, the wrapping behavior depends on the completions format "
"in use.  In the horizontal format, you can use <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd></kbd>, and in the vertical format <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd>, exactly like the format-"
"sensitive keys for moving between completion candidates in the sorting "
"order, and with the same wrapping behavior.  In contrast, in the horizontal "
"format <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd> move&mdash;and wrap, if "
"wrapping is enabled&mdash;only within the current column of completions, and "
"in the vertical format <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></"
"kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd></kbd> move (and "
"wrap, if enabled) only within the current line of completions.<a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF6\" href=\"#FOOT6\"><sup>6</sup></a>"
msgstr ""
"矢印キーによる折り返し動作は、使用している補完フォーマットによって異なりま"
"す。水平フォーマットでは <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></"
"kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd></kbd> を、垂直フォー"
"マットでは <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd> を、ソート順で補完候補間を移"
"動するためのフォーマット依存キーと全く同様に使用でき、折り返し動作も同じで"
"す。これに対し、水平フォーマットの <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">UP</"
"kbd></kbd> は、現在の補完列内のみで移動し（折り返しが有効な場合は折り返しも行"
"います）、垂直フォーマットの <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</"
"kbd></kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd></kbd> は、現在"
"の補完行内のみで移動（および有効な場合は折り返し）します。<a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF6\" href=\"#FOOT6\"><sup>6</sup></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completions_002dmax_002dheight\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completions_002dmax_002dheight\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">completions-max-height</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it limits the size of the completions window.  It "
"is specified in lines and include mode, header line and a bottom divider, if "
"any.  For a more complex control of the Completion window display "
"properties, you can use <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> "
"(see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Alists.html#Buffer-Display-"
"Action-Alists\">Action Alists for Buffer Display</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">completions-max-height</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、補完ウィンドウのサイズが制限されます。"
"これは、行数とインクルードモード、ヘッダー行、および（あれば）下部の区切り線"
"で指定されます。補完ウィンドウの表示プロパティをより詳細に制御するには、"
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> を使用できます（<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Alists.html#Buffer-Display-Action-"
"Alists\">Action Alists for Buffer Display</a> を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completions_002dheader_002dformat\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completions_002dheader_002dformat\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">completions-header-format</code> is a "
"format spec string to control the informative line shown before the "
"completions list of candidates.  If it contains a &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; construct, that get replaced by the number "
"of completions shown in the completion list buffer.  To suppress the display "
"of the heading line, customize this variable to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>.  The string that is the value of this variable can have text "
"properties to change the visual appearance of the heading line; some useful "
"properties <code class=\"code\">face</code> or <code class=\"code\">cursor-"
"intangible</code> (see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Special-Properties.html#Special-"
"Properties\">Properties with Special Meanings</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">completions-header-format</code> は、候補の補完リス"
"トの前に表示される情報行を制御するためのフォーマット指定文字列です。ここに "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; という構文が含まれている場合、そ"
"れは補完リストバッファに表示される補完数に置き換えられます。見出し行の表示を"
"抑制するには、この変数を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定してください。"
"この変数の値となる文字列には、見出し行の視覚的な外観を変更するためのテキスト"
"プロパティを指定できます。有用なプロパティには <code class=\"code\">face</"
"code> や <code class=\"code\">cursor-intangible</code> があります（<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Special-Properties.html#Special-Properties\">Properties with Special "
"Meanings</a> を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"completions_002dhighlight_002dface\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"completions_002dhighlight_002dface\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">completions-highlight-face</code> names a face, "
"the current completion candidate, the one that will be selected by typing "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> or clicking the mouse, "
"will be highlighted using that face.  The default value of this variable is "
"<code class=\"code\">completions-highlight</code>; the value is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> disables this highlighting.  This feature uses the "
"special text property <code class=\"code\">cursor-face</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">completions-highlight-face</code> でフェイスを指定する"
"と、現在の補完候補（<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> と"
"入力するかマウスをクリックすることで選択される候補）が、そのフェイスを用いて"
"ハイライト表示されます。この変数のデフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">completions-highlight</code> であり、値を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> にするとこのハイライト表示が無効になります。この機"
"能では、特殊なテキストプロパティ <code class=\"code\">cursor-face</code> が使"
"用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h5>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid "<a id=\"FOOT5\" href=\"#DOCF5\">(5)</a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"FOOT5\" href=\"#DOCF5\">(5)</a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"If a completion candidate is too long for more than one column to fit in the "
"window, or it there are three or less candidates, all completions appear in "
"a single column even if the value of <code class=\"code\">completions-"
"format</code> is <code class=\"code\">horizontal</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">vertical</code>."
msgstr ""
"補完候補が長すぎてウィンドウに複数列で収まらない場合、または候補が3つ以下の場"
"合は、<code class=\"code\">completions-format</code> の値が <code "
"class=\"code\">horizontal</code> や <code class=\"code\">vertical</code> で"
"あっても、すべての補完候補が単一の列に表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h5>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid "<a id=\"FOOT6\" href=\"#DOCF6\">(6)</a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"FOOT6\" href=\"#DOCF6\">(6)</a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Options.html
msgid ""
"If the completions buffer contains only single column even in the horizontal "
"or vertical format, then both the format-sensitive keys and the arrow keys "
"move point to the next (respectively, previous) candidate, wrapping only at "
"the last (respectively, first) candidate, if the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-auto-wrap</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"完了バッファに、水平方向または垂直方向のいずれの形式であっても単一の列しか含"
"まれていない場合、<code class=\"code\">completion-auto-wrap</code> の値が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であれば、書式依存キーと矢印キーの両方が"
"ポイントを次の（それぞれ、前の）候補に移動させ、最後の（それぞれ、最初の）候"
"補でのみラップアラウンドします。"

