# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"<span>10.4.4 How Completion Alternatives Are Chosen<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#How-Completion-Alternatives-Are-Chosen\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>10.4.4 完了代替案の選定方法<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#How-"
"Completion-Alternatives-Are-Chosen\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion-style\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion-style\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"Completion commands work by narrowing a large list of possible completion "
"alternatives to a smaller subset that matches what you have typed in the "
"minibuffer.  In <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Completion-Example.html\">Completion "
"Example</a>, we gave a simple example of such matching.  The procedure of "
"determining what constitutes a match is quite intricate.  Emacs attempts to "
"offer plausible completions under most circumstances."
msgstr ""
"補完コマンドは、考えられる補完候補の膨大なリストを、ミニバッファに入力した内"
"容に一致するより小さなサブセットへと絞り込むことで動作します。<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Completion-Example.html\">補完の例</a>では、このような"
"マッチングの簡単な例を挙げました。何をもってマッチングとするかを決定する手順"
"は非常に複雑です。Emacsは、ほとんどの状況において、妥当な補完候補を提示しよう"
"とします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"Emacs performs completion using one or more <em class=\"dfn\">completion "
"styles</em>&mdash;sets of criteria for matching minibuffer text to "
"completion alternatives.  During completion, Emacs tries each completion "
"style in turn.  If a style yields one or more matches, that is used as the "
"list of completion alternatives.  If a style produces no matches, Emacs "
"falls back on the next style."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、1つ以上の<em class=\"dfn\">補完スタイル</em>&mdash;ミニバッファのテ"
"キストを補完候補と照合するための基準セット&mdash;を用いて補完を行います。補完"
"処理中、Emacsは各補完スタイルを順に試行します。あるスタイルで1つ以上の一致が"
"見つかった場合、それが補完候補のリストとして採用されます。あるスタイルで一致"
"が見つからなかった場合、Emacsは次のスタイルへと移ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion_002dstyles\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion_002dstyles\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"The list variable <code class=\"code\">completion-styles</code> specifies "
"the completion styles to use.  Each list element is either the name of a "
"completion style (a Lisp symbol) or a list starting with the name of a "
"completion style followed by <code class=\"code\">let</code>-style list of "
"bindings which will be in effect for that completion style.  Multiple "
"elements of <code class=\"code\">completion-styles</code> can name the same "
"completion style with different variable bindings."
msgstr ""
"リスト変数 <code class=\"code\">completion-styles</code> は、使用する補完スタ"
"イルを指定します。各リスト要素は、補完スタイルの名前（Lispシンボル）か、ある"
"いは補完スタイルの名前で始まり、その後にその補完スタイルで適用される <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> 形式のバインディングリストが続くリストのいずれかで"
"す。<code class=\"code\">completion-styles</code> の複数の要素で、異なる変数"
"バインディングを用いて同一の補完スタイルを指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"The available style symbols are stored in the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-styles-alist</code> (see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Completion-"
"Variables.html#Completion-Variables\">Completion Variables</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>).  The default "
"completion styles are (in order):"
