"basic_002c-completion-style\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-basic_002c-completion-style\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">basic</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"basic_002c-completion-style\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"A matching completion alternative must have the same beginning as the text "
"in the minibuffer before point.  Furthermore, if there is any text in the "
"minibuffer after point, the rest of the completion alternative must contain "
"that text as a substring."
msgstr ""
"一致する補完候補は、ミニバッファのポイント位置より前のテキストと同じ先頭部分"
"を持つ必要があります。さらに、ポイント位置より後にミニバッファ内にテキストが"
"ある場合、補完候補の残りの部分はそのテキストを部分文字列として含まなければな"
"りません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-partial_002dcompletion_002c-"
"completion-style\"></a> <a id=\"index-partial-completion\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">partial-completion</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-partial-completion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-partial_002dcompletion_002c-"
"completion-style\"></a> <a id=\"index-partial-completion\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">partial-completion</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-partial-completion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"This aggressive completion style divides the minibuffer text into words "
"separated by hyphens or spaces, and completes each word separately.  (For "
"example, when completing command names, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">em-l-m</"
"samp>&rsquo; completes to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">emacs-lisp-mode</"
"samp>&rsquo;.)"
msgstr ""
"このアグレッシブな補完スタイルでは、ミニバッファのテキストをハイフンやスペー"
"スで区切られた単語に分割し、各単語を個別に補完します。（例えば、コマンド名を"
"補完する場合、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">em-l-m</samp>&rsquo;は&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">emacs-lisp-mode</samp>&rsquo;に補完されます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"Furthermore, a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; in the minibuffer "
"text is treated as a <em class=\"dfn\">wildcard</em>&mdash;it matches any "
"string of characters at the corresponding position in the completion "
"alternative."
msgstr ""
"さらに、ミニバッファのテキスト内の「<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>」は<em "
"class=\"dfn\">ワイルドカード</em>として扱われます――補完候補の対応する位置にあ"
"る任意の文字列に一致します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"completion_002dpcm_002dleading_002dwildcard\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"completion_002dpcm_002dleading_002dwildcard\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">completion-pcm-leading-wildcard</code> is set to "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code>, this style always acts as if a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">wildcard</em> is present at the start of each word in the "
"minibuffer text, similar to the <code class=\"code\">substring</code> "
"style.  For example, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">l-ode</samp>&rsquo; will "
"complete to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">emacs-lisp-mode</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">completion-pcm-leading-wildcard</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> に設定されている場合、このスタイルは <code "
"class=\"code\">substring</code> スタイルと同様に、ミニバッファのテキスト内の"
"各単語の先頭に <em class=\"dfn\">ワイルドカード</em> が存在するかのように常に"
"動作します。例えば、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">l-ode</samp>&rsquo; は "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">emacs-lisp-mode</samp>&rsquo; に補完されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-emacs22_002c-completion-style\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">emacs22</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"emacs22_002c-completion-style\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-emacs22_002c-completion-style\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">emacs22</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"emacs22_002c-completion-style\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"This completion style is similar to <code class=\"code\">basic</code>, "
"except that it ignores the text in the minibuffer after point.  It is so-"
"named because it corresponds to the completion behavior in Emacs 22."
msgstr ""
"この補完スタイルは <code class=\"code\">basic</code> に似ていますが、ポイント"
"以降のミニバッファ内のテキストを無視する点が異なります。Emacs 22 の補完動作に"
"対応しているため、このように命名されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"The following additional completion styles are also defined, and you can add "
"them to <code class=\"code\">completion-styles</code> if you wish (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Customization.html\">Customization</a>):"
msgstr ""
"以下の追加の完了スタイルも定義されており、必要に応じて <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-styles</code> に追加することができます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Customization.html\">カスタマイズ</a> を参照してくださ"
"い）："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-substring_002c-completion-style\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">substring</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"substring_002c-completion-style\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-substring_002c-completion-style\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">substring</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"substring_002c-completion-style\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"A matching completion alternative must contain the text in the minibuffer "
"before point, and the text in the minibuffer after point, as substrings (in "
"that same order)."
msgstr ""
"マッチング補完候補には、ポイント前のミニバッファ内のテキストと、ポイント後の"
"ミニバッファ内のテキストが、部分文字列として（同じ順序で）含まれている必要が"
"あります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"Thus, if the text in the minibuffer is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foobar</"
"samp>&rsquo;, with point between &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</"
"samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">bar</samp>&rsquo;, that matches "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">a</var>foo<var "
"class=\"var\">b</var>bar<var class=\"var\">c</var></samp>&rsquo;, where <var "
"class=\"var\">a</var>, <var class=\"var\">b</var>, and <var class=\"var\">c</"
"var> can be any string including the empty string."
msgstr ""
"したがって、ミニバッファ内のテキストが &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foobar</"
"samp>&rsquo; で、ポイントが &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; と "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">bar</samp>&rsquo; の間にある場合、それは &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">a</var>foo<var class=\"var\">b</"
"var>bar<var class=\"var\">c</var></samp>&rsquo; にマッチします。ここで <var "
"class=\"var\">a</var>、<var class=\"var\">b</var>、<var class=\"var\">c</"
"var> は、空文字列を含む任意の文字列となり得ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-flex_002c-completion-style\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">flex</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-flex_002c-"
"completion-style\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-flex_002c-completion-style\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">flex</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-flex_002c-"
"completion-style\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"This aggressive completion style, also known as <code class=\"code\">flx</"
"code> or <code class=\"code\">fuzzy</code> or <code class=\"code\">scatter</"
"code> completion, attempts to complete using in-order substrings.  For "
"example, it can consider &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; to "
"match &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">frodo</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">fbarbazoo</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">flx</code>、<code class=\"code\">fuzzy</code>、または"
"<code class=\"code\">scatter</code>補完としても知られるこのアグレッシブな補完"
"方式は、順序通りの部分文字列を用いて補完を試みます。例えば、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo;が&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">frodo</"
"samp>&rsquo;や&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">fbarbazoo</samp>&rsquo;にマッチする"
"かどうかを検討します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-initials_002c-completion-style\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">initials</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"initials_002c-completion-style\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-initials_002c-completion-style\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">initials</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"initials_002c-completion-style\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"This very aggressive completion style attempts to complete acronyms and "
"initialisms.  For example, when completing command names, it matches &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">lch</samp>&rsquo; to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">list-"
"command-history</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"この非常にアグレッシブな補完スタイルは、頭字語やイニシャリズムを補完しようと"
"します。例えば、コマンド名を補完する際、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">lch</"
"samp>&rsquo; を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">list-command-history</"
"samp>&rsquo; にマッチさせます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"There is also a very simple completion style called <code "
"class=\"code\">emacs21</code>.  In this style, if the text in the minibuffer "
"is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foobar</samp>&rsquo;, only matches starting "
"with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foobar</samp>&rsquo; are considered."
msgstr ""
"また、<code class=\"code\">emacs21</code> という非常にシンプルな補完スタイル"
"もあります。このスタイルでは、ミニバッファ内のテキストが &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">foobar</samp>&rsquo; の場合、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">foobar</samp>&rsquo; で始まるマッチのみが考慮されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion-Styles.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"completion_002dcategory_002doverrides\"></a>"
