#: build/html/emacs/Completion.html
msgid ""
"<span>10.4 Completion<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Completion-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>10.4 完了<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Completion-1\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion.html
msgid ""
"You can often use a feature called <em class=\"dfn\">completion</em> to help "
"enter arguments.  This means that after you type part of the argument, Emacs "
"can fill in the rest, or some of it, based on what was typed so far."
msgstr ""
"引数の入力を補助するために、<em class=\"dfn\">補完</em>という機能がよく利用で"
"きます。これは、引数の一部を入力した後に、それまでに入力した内容に基づいて、"
"Emacsが残りの部分、あるいはその一部を補完してくれるというものです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion-alternative\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completion-alternative\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Completion.html
msgid ""
"When completion is available, certain keys (usually <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</"
"kbd>, <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>, and <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>) are "
"rebound in the minibuffer to special completion commands (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion-Commands.html\">Completion Commands</a>).  "
"These commands attempt to complete the text in the minibuffer, based on a "
"set of <em class=\"dfn\">completion alternatives</em> provided by the "
"command that requested the argument.  You can usually type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">?</kbd> to have Emacs pop up a buffer (named &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">*Completions*</samp>&rsquo;) displaying the relevant "
"completion alternatives.  As described in more detail below, you can "
"navigate this buffer and choose the desired completion from it."
msgstr ""
"補完が可能な場合、特定のキー（通常は <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd>、<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>）がミニバッファ内で特別"
"な補完コマンドに再割り当てされます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion-"
"Commands.html\">補完コマンド</a>を参照）。これらのコマンドは、引数を要求した"
"コマンドによって提供された一連の<em class=\"dfn\">補完候補</em>に基づき、ミニ"
"バッファ内のテキストを補完しようとします。通常、<kbd class=\"kbd\">?</kbd> と"
"入力すると、Emacs が関連する補完候補を表示するバッファ（名称は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">*Completions*</samp>&rsquo;）をポップアップ表示します。後述す"
