# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Configuration-Registers.html
msgid ""
"You can save the window configuration of the selected frame in a register, "
"or even the configuration of all windows in all frames, and restore the "
"configuration later.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-"
"Convenience.html\">Convenience Features for Window Handling</a>, for "
"information about window configurations."
msgstr ""
"選択したフレームのウィンドウ構成をレジスタに保存したり、あるいは全フレームの"
"全ウィンドウの構成を保存したりして、後でその構成を復元することができます。"
"ウィンドウ構成に関する情報については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-"
"Convenience.html\">ウィンドウ操作の便利な機能</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Configuration-Registers.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r w <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r w <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Configuration-Registers.html
msgid ""
"Save the state of the selected frame&rsquo;s windows in register <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var> (<code class=\"code\">window-configuration-to-"
"register</code>).  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-frameset\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"選択中のフレームのウィンドウの状態をレジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</var> "
"(<code class=\"code\">window-configuration-to-register</code>) に保存しま"
"す。  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-frameset\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Configuration-Registers.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r f <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r f <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Configuration-Registers.html
msgid ""
"Save the state of all frames, including all their windows (a.k.a.  <em "
"class=\"dfn\">frameset</em>), in register <var class=\"var\">r</var> (<code "
"class=\"code\">frameset-to-register</code>)."
msgstr ""
"すべてのウィンドウを含む全フレームの状態（別名 <em class=\"dfn\">frameset</"
"em>）を、レジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</var> (<code class=\"code\">frameset-"
"to-register</code>) に保存します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Configuration-Registers.html
msgid ""
"Use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r j <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd> to restore a "
"window or frame configuration.  This is the same command used to restore a "
"cursor position.  When you restore a frame configuration, any existing "
"frames not included in the configuration become invisible.  If you wish to "
"delete these frames instead, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x r j <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r j <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd> を使用して、ウィ"
"ンドウやフレームの設定を復元します。これはカーソル位置を復元する場合と同じコ"
"マンドです。フレームの設定を復元すると、設定に含まれていない既存のフレームは"
"非表示になります。これらのフレームを代わりに削除したい場合は、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x r j <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd> を使用してくださ"
"い。"

