# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Continuation-Lines.html
msgid ""
"Sometimes, a line of text in the buffer&mdash;a <em class=\"dfn\">logical "
"line</em>&mdash;is too long to fit in the window, and Emacs displays it as "
"two or more <em class=\"dfn\">screen lines</em>, or <em class=\"dfn\">visual "
"lines</em>.  This is called <em class=\"dfn\">line wrapping</em> or <em "
"class=\"dfn\">continuation</em>, and the long logical line is called a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">continued line</em>.  On a graphical display, Emacs indicates "
"line wrapping with small bent arrows in the left and right window fringes.  "
"On a text terminal, Emacs indicates line wrapping by displaying a &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; character at the right margin."
msgstr ""
"バッファ内のテキスト行（<em class=\"dfn\">論理行</em>）が長すぎてウィンドウに"
"収まりきらない場合、Emacsはそれを2つ以上の<em class=\"dfn\">画面行</em>、ある"
"いは<em class=\"dfn\">ビジュアル行</em>として表示します。これは<em "
"class=\"dfn\">行折り返し</em>または<em class=\"dfn\">継続</em>と呼ばれ、長い"
"論理行は<em class=\"dfn\">継続行</em>と呼ばれます。グラフィカルディスプレイで"
"は、Emacsはウィンドウの左右のフリンジに小さな折れ曲がった矢印を表示して行折り"
"返しを示します。テキスト端末では、Emacsは右マージンに&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo;文字を表示して行折り返しを示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Continuation-Lines.html
msgid ""
"Most commands that act on lines act on logical lines, not screen lines.  For "
"instance, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> kills a logical line.  As described "
"earlier, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">next-line</"
"code>) and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">previous-line</"
"code>) are special exceptions: they move point down and up, respectively, by "
"one screen line (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Moving-Point.html\">Changing "
"the Location of Point</a>)."
msgstr ""
"行に対して作用するコマンドの多くは、画面行ではなく論理行に対して作用します。"
"例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> は論理行を消去します。前述の通り、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">next-line</code>) および <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">previous-line</code>) は特殊な"
"例外であり、それぞれポイントを画面行1行分、下および上に移動させます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Moving-Point.html\">ポイントの位置変更</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Continuation-Lines.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line-truncation_002c-and-fringes\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line-truncation_002c-and-fringes\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Continuation-Lines.html
msgid ""
"Emacs can optionally <em class=\"dfn\">truncate</em> long logical lines "
"instead of continuing them.  This means that every logical line occupies a "
"single screen line; if it is longer than the width of the window, the rest "
"of the line is not displayed.  On a graphical display, a truncated line is "
"indicated by a small straight arrow in the right fringe; on a text terminal, "
"it is indicated by a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo; character "
"in the right margin.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Line-"
"Truncation.html\">Line Truncation</a>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、長い論理行を継続させる代わりに、任意で<em class=\"dfn\">切り詰める"
"</em>ことができます。これは、各論理行が1画面行分を占めることを意味し、行が"
"ウィンドウの幅を超える場合、残りの部分は表示されません。グラフィカルディスプ"
"レイでは、切り詰められた行は右フリンジにある小さな直線矢印で示され、テキスト"
"端末では、右マージンにある&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo;文字で示"
"されます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Line-Truncation.html\">行の切り詰め</a>を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Continuation-Lines.html
msgid ""
"By default, continued lines are wrapped at the right window edge.  Since the "
"wrapping may occur in the middle of a word, continued lines can be difficult "
"to read.  The usual solution is to break your lines before they get too "
"long, by inserting newlines.  If you prefer, you can make Emacs insert a "
"newline automatically when a line gets too long, by using Auto Fill mode.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Filling.html\">Filling Text</a>."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、続きの行はウィンドウの右端で折り返されます。折り返しが単語の"
"途中で起こることがあるため、続きの行は読みにくくなる場合があります。一般的な"
"対処法は、改行を挿入して行が長くなりすぎる前に折り返すことです。あるいは、"
"Auto Fillモードを使用して、行が長くなりすぎたときにEmacsが自動的に改行を挿入"
"するように設定することもできます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Filling.html\">テ"
"キストの折り返し</a>を参照してください。"

