# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"Emacs is a collaborative project and we encourage contributions from anyone "
"and everyone."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは共同プロジェクトであり、どなたでも貢献していただけることを歓迎していま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid "There are many ways to contribute to Emacs:"
msgstr "Emacsに貢献する方法は数多くあります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"find and report bugs; see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Bugs.html\">Reporting "
"Bugs</a>."
msgstr ""
"バグを発見して報告してください。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Bugs.html\">バグの"
"報告</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"answer questions on the Emacs user mailing list <a class=\"url\" "
"href=\"https://lists.gnu.org/mailman/listinfo/help-gnu-emacs\">https://"
"lists.gnu.org/mailman/listinfo/help-gnu-emacs</a>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsユーザーメーリングリスト <a class=\"url\" href=\"https://lists.gnu.org/"
"mailman/listinfo/help-gnu-emacs\">https://lists.gnu.org/mailman/listinfo/"
"help-gnu-emacs</a> で質問に答えてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"write documentation, either on the <a class=\"uref\" href=\"https://"
"www.emacswiki.org/\">wiki</a>, or in the Emacs source repository (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Sending-Patches.html\">Sending Patches for GNU Emacs</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"ドキュメントを、<a class=\"uref\" href=\"https://www.emacswiki.org/\">wiki</"
"a>またはEmacsのソースリポジトリに作成してください（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Sending-Patches.html\">GNU Emacsへのパッチ送信</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"check if existing bug reports are fixed in newer versions of Emacs <a "
"class=\"url\" href=\"https://debbugs.gnu.org/cgi/pkgreport.cgi?"
"which=pkg&amp;data=emacs\">https://debbugs.gnu.org/cgi/pkgreport.cgi?"
"which=pkg&amp;data=emacs</a>."
msgstr ""
"既存のバグレポートが最新バージョンのEmacsで修正されているか確認してください "
"<a class=\"url\" href=\"https://debbugs.gnu.org/cgi/pkgreport.cgi?"
"which=pkg&amp;data=emacs\">https://debbugs.gnu.org/cgi/pkgreport.cgi?"
"which=pkg&amp;data=emacs</a>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid "fix existing bug reports."
msgstr "既存のバグレポートを修正する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"implement a feature listed in the <samp class=\"file\">etc/TODO</samp> file "
"in the Emacs distribution, and submit a patch."
msgstr ""
"Emacsディストリビューションの<samp class=\"file\">etc/TODO</samp>ファイルに記"
"載されている機能を実装し、パッチを提出してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid "implement a new feature, and submit a patch."
msgstr "新機能を実装し、パッチを提出してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"develop a package that works with Emacs, and publish it on your own or in "
"GNU ELPA (<a class=\"url\" href=\"https://elpa.gnu.org/\">https://"
"elpa.gnu.org/</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Emacsで動作するパッケージを開発し、自前またはGNU ELPA (<a class=\"url\" "
"href=\"https://elpa.gnu.org/\">https://elpa.gnu.org/</a>) で公開してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid "port Emacs to a new platform, but that is not common nowadays."
msgstr ""
"Emacsを新しいプラットフォームに移植することですが、最近ではあまり一般的ではあ"
"りません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"If you would like to work on improving Emacs, please contact the maintainers "
"at <a class=\"url\" href=\"https://lists.gnu.org/mailman/listinfo/emacs-"
"devel\">the emacs-devel mailing list</a>.  You can ask for suggested "
"projects or suggest your own ideas."
msgstr ""
"Emacsの改善に取り組みたい方は、<a class=\"url\" href=\"https://lists.gnu.org/"
"mailman/listinfo/emacs-devel\">emacs-develメーリングリスト</a>のメンテナーま"
"でご連絡ください。提案プロジェクトをリクエストしたり、ご自身のアイデアを提案"
"したりすることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"If you have a feature request or a suggestion for how to improve Emacs, the "
"best place to send it is to <a class=\"url\" href=\"https://lists.gnu.org/"
"mailman/listinfo/bug-gnu-emacs\">bug-gnu-emacs</a> .  Please explain as "
"clearly as possible what change you would like to see, and why and how you "
"think it would improve Emacs."
msgstr ""
"Emacsへの機能要望や改善案がある場合は、<a class=\"url\" href=\"https://"
"lists.gnu.org/mailman/listinfo/bug-gnu-emacs\">bug-gnu-emacs</a> へお送りいた"
"だくのが最適です。どのような変更を希望されるのか、またその理由と、それがどの"
"ようにEmacsの改善につながるとお考えなのかを、できるだけ分かりやすくご説明くだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"If you have already written an improvement, please tell us about it.  If you "
"have not yet started work, it is useful to contact <a class=\"url\" "
"href=\"https://lists.gnu.org/mailman/listinfo/emacs-devel\">emacs-devel</a> "
"before you start; it might be possible to suggest ways to make your "
"extension fit in better with the rest of Emacs."
msgstr ""
"すでに改良案を作成された場合は、ぜひお知らせください。まだ作業に着手されてい"
"ない場合は、開始前に <a class=\"url\" href=\"https://lists.gnu.org/mailman/"
"listinfo/emacs-devel\">emacs-devel</a> に連絡しておくと有用です。拡張機能を"
"Emacsの他の部分によりうまく適合させるための方法を提案できるかもしれません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"When implementing a feature, please follow the Emacs coding standards; see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coding-Standards.html\">Coding Standards</a>.  In "
"addition, substantial contributions require a copyright assignment to the "
"FSF; see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Copyright-Assignment.html\">Copyright "
"Assignment</a>."
msgstr ""
"機能を実装する際は、Emacsのコーディング規約に従ってください。詳細は<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coding-Standards.html\">コーディング規約</a>を参照して"
"ください。また、実質的な貢献を行う場合は、FSFへの著作権譲渡が必要です。詳細は"
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Copyright-Assignment.html\">著作権譲渡</a>を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"The development version of Emacs can be downloaded from the repository where "
"it is actively maintained by a group of developers.  See the Emacs project "
"page <a class=\"url\" href=\"https://savannah.gnu.org/projects/emacs/"
"\">https://savannah.gnu.org/projects/emacs/</a> for access details."
msgstr ""
"Emacsの開発版は、開発者グループによって活発にメンテナンスされているリポジトリ"
"からダウンロードできます。アクセス方法の詳細については、Emacsプロジェクトペー"
"ジ <a class=\"url\" href=\"https://savannah.gnu.org/projects/emacs/"
"\">https://savannah.gnu.org/projects/emacs/</a> をご覧ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"It is important to write your patches based on the current working version.  "
"If you start from an older version, your patch may be outdated (so that "
"maintainers will have a hard time applying it), or changes in Emacs may have "
"made your patch unnecessary.  After you have downloaded the repository "
"source, you should read the file <samp class=\"file\">INSTALL.REPO</samp> "
"for build instructions (they differ to some extent from a normal build)."
msgstr ""
"パッチは現在の動作バージョンに基づいて作成することが重要です。古いバージョン"
"から作成すると、パッチが古くなり（メンテナーが適用する際に苦労する可能性があ"
"ります）、あるいはEmacsの変更によってパッチが不要になっている場合があります。"
"リポジトリのソースをダウンロードした後は、ビルド手順についてファイル <samp "
"class=\"file\">INSTALL.REPO</samp> を参照してください（通常のビルドとは若干異"
"なります）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Contributing.html
msgid ""
"If you would like to make more extensive contributions, see the <samp "
"class=\"file\">CONTRIBUTE</samp> file in the Emacs source tree for "
"information on how to be an Emacs developer.  That file is distributed as "
"part of the source tarball of every released Emacs version, and can also be "
"found on-line in the <a class=\"url\" href=\"https://git.savannah.gnu.org/"
"cgit/emacs.git/tree/CONTRIBUTE\">Emacs on-line source repository</a>.  If "
"you cloned the Emacs repository, per the instructions in <a class=\"url\" "
"href=\"https://savannah.gnu.org/projects/emacs/\">https://savannah.gnu.org/"
"projects/emacs/</a>, you will find this file in the top directory of the "
"source Emacs tree."
msgstr ""
"より広範な貢献を行いたい場合は、Emacs開発者になる方法に関する情報について、"
"Emacsソースツリー内の<samp class=\"file\">CONTRIBUTE</samp>ファイルを参照して"
"ください。このファイルは、リリース済みのすべてのEmacsバージョンのソース"
"tarballの一部として配布されているほか、<a class=\"url\" href=\"https://"
"git.savannah.gnu.org/cgit/emacs.git/tree/CONTRIBUTE\">Emacsオンラインソースリ"
"ポジトリ</a>でも公開されています。<a class=\"url\" href=\"https://"
"savannah.gnu.org/projects/emacs/\">https://savannah.gnu.org/projects/emacs/</"
"a>の手順に従ってEmacsリポジトリをクローンした場合は、このファイルがEmacsソー"
"スツリーの最上位ディレクトリにあります。"

