# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Copying-Between-Branches.html
msgid "Copy a single revision to branch checked out in this working tree."
msgstr ""
"単一のリビジョンを、このワーキングツリーでチェックアウトされているブランチに"
"コピーします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
