# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Copyright-Assignment.html
msgid ""
"The FSF (Free Software Foundation) is the copyright holder for GNU Emacs.  "
"The FSF is a nonprofit with a worldwide mission to promote computer user "
"freedom and to defend the rights of all free software users.  For general "
"information, see the website <a class=\"url\" href=\"https://www.fsf.org/"
"\">https://www.fsf.org/</a>."
msgstr ""
"FSF（フリーソフトウェア財団）は、GNU Emacsの著作権保持者です。FSFは、コン"
"ピュータ利用者の自由を促進し、すべてのフリーソフトウェア利用者の権利を守ると"
"いう世界的な使命を掲げる非営利団体です。一般的な情報については、ウェブサイト "
"<a class=\"url\" href=\"https://www.fsf.org/\">https://www.fsf.org/</a> をご"
"覧ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Copyright-Assignment.html
msgid ""
"Generally speaking, for non-trivial contributions to GNU Emacs and packages "
"stored in GNU ELPA, we require that the copyright be assigned to the FSF.  "
"For the reasons behind this, see <a class=\"url\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"licenses/why-assign.html\">https://www.gnu.org/licenses/why-assign.html</a>."
msgstr ""
"一般的に、GNU EmacsおよびGNU ELPAに格納されているパッケージへの非自明な貢献に"
"ついては、著作権をFSFに譲渡することを求めています。その理由については、<a "
"class=\"url\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/why-assign.html\">https://"
"www.gnu.org/licenses/why-assign.html</a>をご参照ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Copyright-Assignment.html
msgid ""
"Copyright assignment is a simple process.  Residents of many countries can "
"do it entirely electronically.  To get started, follow the instructions in "
"the file <samp class=\"file\">etc/copyright-assign.txt</samp> in the Emacs "
"distribution.  We can answer any questions you may have (or point you to the "
"people with the answers) at the <a class=\"email\" href=\"mailto:emacs-"
"devel@gnu.org\">emacs-devel@gnu.org</a> mailing list."
msgstr ""
"著作権譲渡の手続きは簡単です。多くの国の居住者は、完全に電子的に行うことがで"
"きます。手続きを開始するには、Emacsディストリビューションに含まれるファイル "
"<samp class=\"file\">etc/copyright-assign.txt</samp> の指示に従ってください。"
"ご不明な点がございましたら、<a class=\"email\" href=\"mailto:emacs-"
"devel@gnu.org\">emacs-devel@gnu.org</a> メーリングリストにて回答いたします"
"（または、回答可能な担当者をご案内いたします）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Copyright-Assignment.html
msgid ""
"(Please note: general discussion about why some GNU projects ask for a "
"copyright assignment is off-topic for emacs-devel.  See gnu-misc-discuss "
"instead.)"
msgstr ""
"（ご注意：一部のGNUプロジェクトがなぜ著作権譲渡を求めるのかという一般的な議論"
"は、emacs-develの趣旨に合いません。代わりにgnu-misc-discussをご参照くださ"
"い。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Copyright-Assignment.html
msgid ""
"A copyright disclaimer is also a possibility, but we prefer an assignment.  "
"Note that the disclaimer, like an assignment, involves you sending signed "
"paperwork to the FSF (simply saying &ldquo;this is in the public "
"domain&rdquo; is not enough).  Also, a disclaimer cannot be applied to "
"future work, it has to be repeated each time you want to send something new."
msgstr ""
"著作権の放棄という選択肢もありますが、私たちは譲渡を希望しています。なお、放"
"棄も譲渡と同様に、署名済みの書類をFSFに送付する必要があります（単に「これはパ"
"ブリックドメインです」と伝えるだけでは不十分です）。また、放棄は今後の作品に"
"適用することはできず、新しい作品を送るたびに改めて行う必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Copyright-Assignment.html
msgid ""
"We can accept small changes (roughly, fewer than 15 lines) without an "
"assignment.  This is a cumulative limit (e.g., three separate 5 line "
"patches) over all your contributions."
msgstr ""
"アサインメントなしで、小規模な変更（概ね15行未満）であれば受け付け可能です。"
"これは全貢献分を通じた累積的な上限となります（例：5行のパッチを3件個別に提出"
"する場合など）。"

