msgid ""
"to your init file.  Alternatively, you can change how the cursor looks when "
"it blinks off by customizing the list variable <code class=\"code\">blink-"
"cursor-alist</code>.  Each element in the list should have the form <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">on-type</var> . <var class=\"var\">off-"
