# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"To see a description of a Custom theme, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">?</kbd> on "
"its line in the <samp class=\"file\">*Custom Themes*</samp> buffer; or type "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x describe-theme</kbd> anywhere in Emacs and enter the "
"theme name."
msgstr ""
"カスタムテーマの説明を表示するには、<samp class=\"file\">*Custom Themes*</"
"samp>バッファの該当行に<kbd class=\"kbd\">?</kbd>と入力するか、Emacs内の任意"
"の場所で<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x describe-theme</kbd>と入力してテーマ名を指定し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-theme_002dchoose_002dvariant\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-theme_002dchoose_002dvariant\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"Some themes have variants (most often just two: light and dark).  You can "
"switch to another variant using <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x theme-choose-variant</"
"kbd>.  If the currently active theme has only one other variant, it will be "
"selected; if there are more variants, the command will prompt you which one "
"to switch to."
msgstr ""
"テーマによってはバリエーション（多くの場合、ライトとダークの2種類）がありま"
"す。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x theme-choose-variant</kbd> を使用して別のバリエー"
"ションに切り替えることができます。現在有効なテーマに他に1つのバリエーションし"
"かない場合はそれが自動的に選択されます。複数のバリエーションがある場合は、コ"
"マンドがどのバリエーションに切り替えるかを確認します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Custom-Themes.html
msgid ""
"Note that <code class=\"code\">theme-choose-variant</code> only works if a "
"single theme is active."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">theme-choose-variant</code> は単一のテーマが有効な"
"場合にのみ動作します。"

