# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Customization-Groups.html
msgid ""
"Customization settings are organized into <em class=\"dfn\">customization "
"groups</em>.  These groups are collected into bigger groups, all the way up "
"to a master group called <code class=\"code\">Emacs</code>."
msgstr ""
"カスタマイズ設定は<em class=\"dfn\">カスタマイズグループ</em>に整理されていま"
"す。これらのグループはさらに大きなグループにまとめられ、最終的には<code "
"class=\"code\">Emacs</code>と呼ばれるマスターグループに至ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Customization-Groups.html
