# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Customization-Groups.html
msgid ""
"The main part of this buffer shows the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Emacs</"
"samp>&rsquo; customization group, which contains several other groups "
"(&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Editing</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Convenience</samp>&rsquo;, etc.).  The contents of those "
"groups are not listed here, only one line of documentation each."
