# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Customization-Groups.html
msgid ""
"The <em class=\"dfn\">state</em> of the group indicates whether setting in "
"that group has been edited, set, or saved.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Changing-a-Variable.html\">Changing a Variable</a>."
