# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Dabbrev-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<span>31.8 Customizing Dynamic Abbreviation<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Customizing-Dynamic-Abbreviation\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>31.8 動的略語のカスタマイズ<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Customizing-Dynamic-Abbreviation\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dabbrev-Customization.html
msgid ""
"Normally, dynamic abbrev expansion ignores case when searching for "
"expansions.  That is, the expansion need not agree in case with the word you "
"are expanding."
msgstr ""
"通常、動的な略語展開では、展開候補の検索時に大文字・小文字は区別されません。"
"つまり、展開後の文字列は、展開元の単語と大文字・小文字が一致している必要はあ"
"りません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dabbrev-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dabbrev_002dcase_002dfold_002dsearch\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dabbrev_002dcase_002dfold_002dsearch\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dabbrev-Customization.html
msgid ""
"This feature is controlled by the variable <code class=\"code\">dabbrev-case-"
"fold-search</code>.  If it is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, case is ignored "
"in this search; if it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the word and the "
"expansion must match in case.  If the value is <code class=\"code\">case-"
"fold-search</code> (the default), then the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code> controls whether to ignore case while "
"searching for expansions (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-"
"Search.html\">Lax Matching During Searching</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この機能は変数 <code class=\"code\">dabbrev-case-fold-search</code> によって"
"制御されます。値が <code class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、この検索では大文字小"
"文字が区別されません。値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、単語と展開"
"結果は大文字小文字が一致している必要があります。値が <code "
"class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code>（デフォルト）の場合、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code> によって展開結果の検索時に大文字小文字"
"を区別するかどうかが制御されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-"
"Search.html\">検索時の緩いマッチング</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dabbrev-Customization.html
msgid ""
"Normally, dynamic abbrev expansion preserves the case pattern <em "
"class=\"emph\">of the dynamic abbrev you are expanding</em>, by converting "
"the expansion to that case pattern."
msgstr ""
"通常、動的略語展開では、展開結果をその大文字・小文字パターンに変換すること"
"で、<em class=\"emph\">展開対象の動的略語</em>の大文字・小文字パターンを保持"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dabbrev-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dabbrev_002dcase_002dreplace\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dabbrev_002dcase_002dreplace\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dabbrev-Customization.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">dabbrev-case-replace</code> controls "
"whether to preserve the case pattern of the dynamic abbrev.  If it is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, the dynamic abbrev&rsquo;s case pattern is "
"preserved in most cases; if it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"expansion is always copied verbatim.  If the value is <code "
"class=\"code\">case-replace</code> (the default), then the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">case-replace</code> controls whether to copy the expansion "
"verbatim (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Replacement-and-Lax-"
"Matches.html\">Replace Commands and Lax Matches</a>)."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">dabbrev-case-replace</code> は、動的略記の大文字・"
"小文字パターンを保持するかどうかを制御します。値が <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> の場合、ほとんどの場合で動的略記の大文字・小文字パターンが保持されま"
"す。値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、展開内容は常にそのままコピー"
"されます。値が <code class=\"code\">case-replace</code>（デフォルト）の場合、"
"変数 <code class=\"code\">case-replace</code> が展開内容をそのままコピーする"
"かどうかを制御します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Replacement-and-Lax-"
"Matches.html\">置換コマンドと緩いマッチ</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dabbrev-Customization.html
msgid ""
"However, if the expansion contains a complex mixed case pattern, and the "
"dynamic abbrev matches this pattern as far as it goes, then the expansion is "
"always copied verbatim, regardless of those variables.  Thus, for example, "
"if the buffer contains <code class=\"code\">variableWithSillyCasePattern</"
"code>, and you type <kbd class=\"kbd\">v a M-/</kbd>, it copies the "
"expansion verbatim including its case pattern."
msgstr ""
"ただし、展開内容に複雑な大文字・小文字の混在パターンが含まれており、動的な略"
"記が可能な限りそのパターンに一致する場合、それらの変数に関わらず、展開内容は"
"常にそのままコピーされます。したがって、例えばバッファに <code "
"class=\"code\">variableWithSillyCasePattern</code> が含まれており、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">v a M-/</kbd> と入力した場合、大文字・小文字のパターンも含めて"
"展開内容がそのままコピーされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dabbrev-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dabbrev_002dabbrev_002dchar_002dregexp\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dabbrev_002dabbrev_002dchar_002dregexp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dabbrev-Customization.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">dabbrev-abbrev-char-regexp</code>, if non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, controls which characters are considered "
"part of a word, for dynamic expansion purposes.  The regular expression must "
"match just one character, never two or more.  The same regular expression "
"also determines which characters are part of an expansion.  The (default)  "
"value <code class=\"code\">nil</code> has a special meaning: dynamic abbrevs "
"(i.e. the word at point) are made of word characters, but their expansions "
"are looked for as sequences of word and symbol characters.  This is "
"generally appropriate for expanding symbols in a program source and also for "
"human-readable text in many languages, but may not be what you want in a "
"text buffer that includes unusual punctuation characters; in that case, the "
"value <code class=\"code\">&quot;\\\\sw&quot;</code> might produce better "
"results."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">dabbrev-abbrev-char-regexp</code> は、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、動的展開においてどの文字を単語の一部と"
"みなすかを制御します。正規表現は単一の文字にのみ一致しなければならず、2文字以"
"上に一致してはなりません。また、同じ正規表現が、どの文字を展開の一部とするか"
"も決定します。（デフォルトの）値 <code class=\"code\">nil</code> には特別な意"
"味があります。動的な略語（すなわちカーソル位置にある単語）は単語文字で構成さ"
"れますが、その展開は単語文字と記号文字のシーケンスとして検索されます。これは"
"一般的に、プログラムソース内の記号の展開や、多くの言語における人間が読めるテ"
"キストに適していますが、特殊な句読点文字を含むテキストバッファでは意図した結"
"果にならない場合があります。その場合は、値 <code class=\"code\">&quot;\\"
"\\sw&quot;</code> の方がより良い結果を得られる可能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dabbrev-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dabbrev_002dabbrev_002dskip_002dleading_002dregexp\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dabbrev_002dabbrev_002dskip_002dleading_002dregexp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dabbrev-Customization.html
msgid ""
"In shell scripts and makefiles, a variable name is sometimes prefixed with "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo; and sometimes not.  Major modes "
"for this kind of text can customize dynamic abbrev expansion to handle "
"optional prefixes by setting the variable <code class=\"code\">dabbrev-"
"abbrev-skip-leading-regexp</code>.  Its value should be a regular expression "
"that matches the optional prefix that dynamic abbrev expression should "
"ignore.  The default is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, which means no "
"characters should be skipped."
msgstr ""
"シェルスクリプトやmakefileでは、変数名の先頭に &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo; が付く場合と付かない場合があります。この種のテ"
"キスト向けのメジャーモードでは、変数 <code class=\"code\">dabbrev-abbrev-"
"skip-leading-regexp</code> を設定することで、動的略記展開をカスタマイズし、省"
"略可能な接頭辞を扱えるようにできます。その値には、動的略記式が無視すべき省略"
"可能な接頭辞に一致する正規表現を指定します。デフォルトは <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> で、これは文字を一切スキップしないことを意味しま"
"す。"

