# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Display-Format.html
msgid ""
"You can customize the way dates are displayed in the diary, mode lines, and "
"messages by setting <code class=\"code\">calendar-date-display-form</code>.  "
"This variable holds a list of expressions that can involve the variables "
"<code class=\"code\">month</code>, <code class=\"code\">day</code>, and "
"<code class=\"code\">year</code>, which are all numbers in string form, and "
"<code class=\"code\">monthname</code> and <code class=\"code\">dayname</"
"code>, which are both alphabetic strings.  In the American style, the "
"default value of this list is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">calendar-date-display-form</code> を設定することで、ダイ"
"アリー、モードライン、およびメッセージにおける日付の表示形式をカスタマイズで"
"きます。この変数には、すべて文字列形式の数値である変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">month</code>、<code class=\"code\">day</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">year</code> と、ともに英字文字列である変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">monthname</code> および <code class=\"code\">dayname</code> を"
"含むことができる式のリストが格納されます。米国式では、このリストのデフォルト"
"値は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Display-Format.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "((if dayname (concat dayname &quot;, &quot;)) monthname &quot; &quot; day &quot;, &quot; year)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Display-Format.html
msgid "while in the European style this value is the default:"
msgstr "一方、欧州スタイルではこの値がデフォルトとなります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Display-Format.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "((if dayname (concat dayname &quot;, &quot;)) day &quot; &quot; monthname &quot; &quot; year)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Display-Format.html
msgid "The default ISO date representation is:"
msgstr "ISO日付の既定の表記形式は以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Display-Format.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"((format &quot;%s-%.2d-%.2d&quot; year (string-to-number month)\n"
"         (string-to-number day)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Display-Format.html
msgid "Another typical American format is:"
msgstr "もう一つの典型的なアメリカ式フォーマットは以下の通りです："

