# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Formats.html
msgid ""
"<span>33.10.3 Date Formats<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Date-"
"Formats-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>33.10.3 日付形式<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Date-Formats-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Formats.html
msgid ""
"Here are some sample diary entries, illustrating different ways of "
"formatting a date.  The examples all show dates in American order (month, "
"day, year), but Calendar mode supports European order (day, month, year) and "
"ISO order (year, month, day) as options."
msgstr ""
"日付のさまざまな表記方法を示す、日記の記入例をいくつかご紹介します。いずれの"
"例も米国式（月、日、年）で表記されていますが、カレンダーモードでは欧州式"
"（日、月、年）およびISO式（年、月、日）も選択可能です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Formats.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4/20/12  Switch-over to new tabulation system\n"
"apr. 25  Start tabulating annual results\n"
"4/30  Results for April are due\n"
"*/25  Monthly cycle finishes\n"
"Friday  Don't leave without backing up files\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Formats.html
msgid ""
"The first entry appears only once, on April 20, 2012.  The second and third "
"appear every year on the specified dates, and the fourth uses a wildcard "
"(asterisk) for the month, so it appears on the 25th of every month.  The "
"final entry appears every week on Friday."
msgstr ""
"1件目は2012年4月20日に1回のみ表示されます。2件目と3件目は指定された日付に毎年"
"表示され、4件目は月にワイルドカード（アスタリスク）が使用されているため、毎月"
"25日に表示されます。最後の項目は毎週金曜日に表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Formats.html
msgid ""
"You can use just numbers to express a date, as in &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">month</var>/<var class=\"var\">day</var></"
"samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">month</var>/"
"<var class=\"var\">day</var>/<var class=\"var\">year</var></samp>&rsquo;.  "
"This must be followed by a nondigit.  In the date itself, <var "
"class=\"var\">month</var> and <var class=\"var\">day</var> are numbers of "
"one or two digits.  The optional <var class=\"var\">year</var> is also a "
"number, and may be abbreviated to the last two digits; that is, you can use "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">11/12/2012</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">11/12/12</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"日付の表記には、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">month</var>/"
"<var class=\"var\">day</var></samp>&rsquo; や &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">month</var>/<var class=\"var\">day</var>/"
"<var class=\"var\">year</var></samp>&rsquo; のように数字のみを用いることがで"
"きます。この後には、数字以外の文字が続く必要があります。日付自体において、"
"<var class=\"var\">month</var> と <var class=\"var\">day</var> は1桁または2桁"
"の数字です。省略可能な <var class=\"var\">year</var> も数字であり、下2桁に省"
"略して表記できます。つまり、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">11/12/2012</"
"samp>&rsquo; や &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">11/12/12</samp>&rsquo; のように記"
"述できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Formats.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dabbrev_002dlength\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dmonth_002dabbrev_002darray\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-calendar_002dday_002dabbrev_002darray\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dabbrev_002dlength\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dmonth_002dabbrev_002darray\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-calendar_002dday_002dabbrev_002darray\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Formats.html
msgid ""
"Dates can also have the form &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var "
"class=\"var\">monthname</var> <var class=\"var\">day</var></samp>&rsquo; or "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">monthname</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">day</var>, <var class=\"var\">year</var></samp>&rsquo;, where "
"the month&rsquo;s name can be spelled in full or abbreviated (with or "
"without a period).  The preferred abbreviations for month and day names can "
"be set using the variables <code class=\"code\">calendar-abbrev-length</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">calendar-month-abbrev-array</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-day-abbrev-array</code>.  The default is to use the "
"first three letters of a name as its abbreviation.  Case is not significant."
msgstr ""
"日付は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">monthname</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">day</var></samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">monthname</var> <var class=\"var\">day</"
"var>, <var class=\"var\">year</var></samp>&rsquo; という形式をとることもあ"
"り、その場合、月の名称は正式名称で表記することも、略記（ピリオドの有無を問わ"
"ず）することも可能です。月名および日名の推奨略記は、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-abbrev-length</code>、<code class=\"code\">calendar-"
"month-abbrev-array</code>、<code class=\"code\">calendar-day-abbrev-array</"
"code> を使用して設定できます。デフォルトでは、名称の最初の3文字が略記として用"
"いられます。大文字と小文字は区別されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Formats.html
msgid ""
"A date may be <em class=\"dfn\">generic</em>; that is, partially "
"unspecified.  Then the entry applies to all dates that match the "
"specification.  If the date does not contain a year, it is generic and "
"applies to any year.  Alternatively, <var class=\"var\">month</var>, <var "
"class=\"var\">day</var>, or <var class=\"var\">year</var> can be &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;; this matches any month, day, or year, "
"respectively.  Thus, a diary entry &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">3/*/*</"
"samp>&rsquo; matches any day in March of any year; so does &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">march *</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"日付は<em class=\"dfn\">汎用</em>、つまり部分的に未指定である場合があります。"
"その場合、そのエントリは指定に一致するすべての日付に適用されます。日付に年が"
"含まれていない場合は汎用となり、任意の年に適用されます。あるいは、<var "
"class=\"var\">month</var>、<var class=\"var\">day</var>、または<var "
"class=\"var\">year</var>を&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;とするこ"
"ともでき、これらはそれぞれ任意の月、日、または年に一致します。したがって、日"
"記エントリ&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">3/*/*</samp>&rsquo;は任意の年の3月の任"
"意の日に一致します。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">march *</samp>&rsquo;も同様で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Formats.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002ddate_002dstyle\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dset_002ddate_002dstyle\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002ddate_002dstyle\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dset_002ddate_002dstyle\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Formats.html
msgid ""
"If you prefer the European style of writing dates (in which the day comes "
"before the month), or the ISO style (in which the order is year, month, "
"day), type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x calendar-set-date-style</kbd> while in the "
"calendar, or customize the variable <code class=\"code\">calendar-date-"
"style</code>.  This affects how diary dates are interpreted, date display, "
"and the order in which some commands expect their arguments to be given."
msgstr ""
"日付の表記形式として、欧州式（日が月の前に来る形式）またはISO形式（年、月、日"
"の順）を好む場合は、カレンダー画面で <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x calendar-set-"
"date-style</kbd> と入力するか、変数 <code class=\"code\">calendar-date-"
"style</code> をカスタマイズしてください。これにより、日記の日付の解釈や日付の"
"表示、および一部のコマンドが引数を期待する順序が影響を受けます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Date-Formats.html
msgid ""
"You can use the name of a day of the week as a generic date which applies to "
"any date falling on that day of the week.  You can abbreviate the day of the "
"week as described above, or spell it in full; case is not significant."
msgstr ""
"曜日名を、その曜日に該当するあらゆる日付に適用される汎用的な日付として使用で"
"きます。曜日名は、前述のように略記することも、正式名称で表記することも可能で"
"す。大文字・小文字は区別されません。"

