# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid ""
"<span>33.11 Daylight Saving Time<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Daylight-"
"Saving-Time\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>33.11 夏時間<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Daylight-Saving-Time\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-daylight-saving-time\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-daylight-saving-time\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid ""
"Emacs understands the difference between standard time and daylight saving "
"time&mdash;the times given for sunrise, sunset, solstices, equinoxes, and "
"the phases of the moon take that into account.  The rules for daylight "
"saving time vary from place to place and have also varied historically from "
"year to year.  To do the job properly, Emacs needs to know which rules to "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは標準時と夏時間の違いを認識しています。日の出、日の入り、至点、分点、お"
"よび月の満ち欠けに示される時刻には、それが考慮されています。夏時間の規則は地"
"域によって異なりますし、歴史的にも年によって異なってきました。適切に処理を行"
"うためには、Emacsはどの規則を適用すべきかを知る必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002ddaylight_002dsavings_002dstarts\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-calendar_002ddaylight_002dsavings_002dends\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002ddaylight_002dsavings_002dstarts\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-calendar_002ddaylight_002dsavings_002dends\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid ""
"Some operating systems keep track of the rules that apply to the place where "
"you are; on these systems, Emacs gets the information it needs from the "
"system automatically.  If some or all of this information is missing, Emacs "
"fills in the gaps with the rules currently used in Cambridge, "
"Massachusetts.  If the resulting rules are not what you want, you can tell "
"Emacs the rules to use by setting certain variables: <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-savings-starts</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-savings-ends</code>."
msgstr ""
"一部のオペレーティングシステムでは、現在地に適用されるルールを管理しており、"
"こうしたシステムではEmacsが必要な情報をシステムから自動的に取得します。これら"
"の情報の一部または全部が不足している場合、Emacsはマサチューセッツ州ケンブリッ"
"ジで現在使用されているルールを用いてその不足分を補います。その結果得られた"
"ルールが希望通りでない場合は、特定の変数 <code class=\"code\">calendar-"
"daylight-savings-starts</code> および <code class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-"
"savings-ends</code> を設定することで、Emacsに使用するルールを指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid ""
"These values should be Lisp expressions that refer to the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">year</code>, and evaluate to the Gregorian date on which "
"daylight saving time starts or (respectively) ends, in the form of a list "
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">month</var> <var class=\"var\">day</"
"var> <var class=\"var\">year</var>)</code>.  The values should be <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if your area does not use daylight saving time."
msgstr ""
"これらの値は、変数 <code class=\"code\">year</code> を参照する Lisp 式とし、"
"夏時間が開始または（それぞれ）終了するグレゴリオ暦の日付をリスト <code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">month</var> <var class=\"var\">day</var> "
"<var class=\"var\">year</var>)</code> の形式で評価する必要があります。お住ま"
"いの地域で夏時間が導入されていない場合は、値は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> とします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid ""
"Emacs uses these expressions to determine the starting date of daylight "
"saving time for the holiday list and for correcting times of day in the "
"solar and lunar calculations."
msgstr ""
"Emacsはこれらの式を用いて、祝日リストの夏時間開始日の決定や、太陽・月の計算に"
"おける時刻の補正を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid "The values for Cambridge, Massachusetts are as follows:"
msgstr "マサチューセッツ州ケンブリッジの値は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(calendar-nth-named-day 2 0 3 year)\n"
"(calendar-nth-named-day 1 0 11 year)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid ""
"That is, the second 0th day (Sunday) of the third month (March) in the year "
"specified by <code class=\"code\">year</code>, and the first Sunday of the "
"eleventh month (November) of that year.  If daylight saving time were "
"changed to start on October 1, you would set <code class=\"code\">calendar-"
"daylight-savings-starts</code> to this:"
msgstr ""
"つまり、<code class=\"code\">year</code> で指定された年の3月（March）の2回目"
"の0日目（日曜日）と、その年の11月（November）の最初の日曜日です。  もしサマー"
"タイムが10月1日開始に変更された場合、<code class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-"
"savings-starts</code> を次のように設定することになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(list 10 1 year)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid ""
"If there is no daylight saving time at your location, or if you want all "
"times in standard time, set <code class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-savings-"
"starts</code> and <code class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-savings-ends</code> "
"to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"お住まいの地域で夏時間が適用されない場合、またはすべての時刻を標準時で表示し"
"たい場合は、<code class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-savings-starts</code> と "
"<code class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-savings-ends</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002ddaylight_002dtime_002doffset\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002ddaylight_002dtime_002doffset\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-time-offset</code> "
"specifies the difference between daylight saving time and standard time, "
"measured in minutes.  The value for Cambridge, Massachusetts is 60."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-time-offset</code> は、夏時間と標"
"準時の差を分単位で表します。マサチューセッツ州ケンブリッジの値は 60 です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002ddaylight_002dsavings_002dends_002dtime\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002ddaylight_002dsavings_002dends_002dtime\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Daylight-Saving.html
msgid ""
"Finally, the two variables <code class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-savings-"
"starts-time</code> and <code class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-savings-ends-"
"time</code> specify the number of minutes after midnight local time when the "
"transition to and from daylight saving time should occur.  For Cambridge, "
"Massachusetts both variables&rsquo; values are 120."
msgstr ""
"最後に、2つの変数 <code class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-savings-starts-"
"time</code> と <code class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-savings-ends-time</"
"code> は、現地時間の午前0時から何分後に夏時間への移行および復帰を行うかを指定"
"します。マサチューセッツ州ケンブリッジでは、両変数の値はともに120です。"

