# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Deletion-and-Killing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-killing-text\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-cutting-text\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-deletion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-killing-text\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-cutting-text\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-deletion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Deletion-and-Killing.html
msgid ""
"Most commands which erase text from the buffer save it in the kill ring (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Kill-Ring.html\">The Kill Ring</a>).  These are "
"known as <em class=\"dfn\">kill</em> commands, and their names normally "
"contain the word &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">kill</samp>&rsquo; (e.g., <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-line</code>).  The kill ring stores several recent "
"kills, not just the last one, so killing is a very safe operation: you "
"don&rsquo;t have to worry much about losing text that you previously "
"killed.  The kill ring is shared by all buffers, so text that is killed in "
"one buffer can be yanked into another buffer."
msgstr ""
"バッファからテキストを消去するコマンドの多くは、それをキルリングに保存します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Kill-Ring.html\">キルリング</a>を参照）。これらは"
"<em class=\"dfn\">キル</em>コマンドと呼ばれ、その名称には通常「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">kill</samp>」という語が含まれます（例：<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-line</code>）。キルリングには直近のキルが複数回保存されて"
"おり、単に最後の1件だけが保存されるわけではないため、キル操作は非常に安全で"
"す。以前にキルしたテキストを失うことをあまり心配する必要はありません。キルリ"
"ングはすべてのバッファで共有されているため、あるバッファでキルされたテキスト"
"を別のバッファにヤンクすることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Deletion-and-Killing.html
msgid ""
"When you use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-/</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">undo</code>) "
"to undo a kill command (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Undo.html\">Undo</a>), "
"that brings the killed text back into the buffer, but does not remove it "
"from the kill ring."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-/</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">undo</code>) を使用してキ"
"ルコマンドを取り消すと（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Undo.html\">Undo</a> を参"
"照）、キルされたテキストがバッファに戻りますが、キルリングからは削除されませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Deletion-and-Killing.html
msgid ""
"On graphical displays, killing text also copies it to the system clipboard.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Cut-and-Paste.html\">&ldquo;Cut and "
"Paste&rdquo; Operations on Graphical Displays</a>."
msgstr ""
"グラフィカルディスプレイでは、テキストをキルするとシステムクリップボードにも"
"コピーされます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Cut-and-Paste.html\">「グラフィカル"
"ディスプレイにおける『切り取りと貼り付け』操作」</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Deletion-and-Killing.html
msgid ""
"Commands that erase text but do not save it in the kill ring are known as "
"<em class=\"dfn\">delete</em> commands; their names usually contain the word "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">delete</samp>&rsquo;.  These include <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-d</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">delete-char</code>) and <kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">delete-backward-char</code>), "
"which delete only one character at a time, and those commands that delete "
"only spaces or newlines.  Commands that can erase significant amounts of "
"nontrivial data generally do a kill operation instead."
msgstr ""
"テキストを消去するが、キルリングに保存しないコマンドは<em "
"class=\"dfn\">delete</em>コマンドと呼ばれ、その名称には通常&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">delete</samp>&rsquo;という語が含まれる。これには、一度に1文字"
"のみを削除する<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-d</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">delete-"
"char</code>)や<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">delete-"
"backward-char</code>)、およびスペースや改行のみを削除するコマンドが含まれる。"
"相当量の非自明なデータを消去できるコマンドは、一般的に代わりにキル操作を行"
"う。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Deletion-and-Killing.html
msgid ""
"You can also use the mouse to kill and yank.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Cut-and-Paste.html\">&ldquo;Cut and Paste&rdquo; Operations on "
"Graphical Displays</a>."
msgstr ""
"マウスを使って切り取りやドラッグを行うこともできます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Cut-and-Paste.html\">「グラフィカルディスプレイ上での『切り取りと貼り"
"付け』操作」</a>を参照してください。"

