# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Deletion.html
msgid ""
"We have already described the basic deletion commands <kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">delete-backward-char</code>), "
"<kbd class=\"key\">delete</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">delete-forward-char</"
