# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Display.html
msgid ""
"If you primarily store your calendar data outside of Emacs, but still want "
"to see it in the Emacs calendar and diary, you can do so by including an "
"iCalendar file from your diary file."
msgstr ""
"カレンダーデータを主にEmacs外で管理しつつ、Emacsのカレンダーやダイアリーでも"
"確認したい場合は、ダイアリーファイルからiCalendarファイルを取り込むことで実現"
"できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Display.html
msgid ""
"Suppose, for example, that you download your calendar from an external "
"server to a file called <samp class=\"file\">Appointments.ics</samp>.  Then "
"you can include this file in your diary by writing a line like"
msgstr ""
"例えば、外部サーバーから<samp class=\"file\">Appointments.ics</samp>という"
"ファイルにカレンダーをダウンロードしたとしましょう。その場合、次のような行を"
"記述することで、このファイルを日記に組み込むことができます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Display.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "#include &quot;path/to/Appointments.ics&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Display.html
msgid ""
"in your diary file.  You must also set up some hooks to display the data in "
"that file as diary entries and mark them in the calendar:"
msgstr ""
"日記ファイル内です。また、そのファイル内のデータを日記エントリとして表示し、"
"カレンダーにマークするためのフックもいくつか設定する必要があります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Display.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(add-hook 'diary-mark-entries-hook\n"
"          #'diary-mark-included-diary-files)\n"
"(add-hook 'diary-nongregorian-marking-hook\n"
"          #'diary-icalendar-mark-entries)\n"
"(add-hook 'diary-list-entries-hook\n"
"          #'diary-include-other-diary-files)\n"
"(add-hook 'diary-nongregorian-listing-hook\n"
"          #'diary-icalendar-display-entries)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Display.html
msgid ""
"Events, tasks, and journal entries in <samp class=\"file\">Appointments.ics</"
"samp> will then show up on the appropriate days when you display the diary "
"from the calendar.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Displaying-the-"
"Diary.html\">Displaying the Diary</a>."
msgstr ""
"これにより、<samp class=\"file\">Appointments.ics</samp> 内のイベント、タス"
"ク、日記エントリは、カレンダーから日記を表示した際に、該当する日付に表示され"
"るようになります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Displaying-the-Diary.html\">日記の"
"表示</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Display.html
msgid ""
"The advantage of doing this is that you don&rsquo;t need to synchronize the "
"data between the calendar server and your diary file.  This is simpler and "
"more reliable than regularly importing and exporting between diary and "
"iCalendar format."
msgstr ""
"この方法の利点は、カレンダーサーバーと日記ファイルの間でデータを同期させる必"
"要がない点です。これは、日記形式とiCalendar形式の間で定期的にインポート・エク"
"スポートを行うよりも、シンプルで信頼性が高くなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Display.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"diary_002dicalendar_002dmailcap_002dviewer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"diary_002dicalendar_002dmailcap_002dviewer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Display.html
msgid ""
"You can also display iCalendar attachments in email messages without "
"importing them to your diary file using the function <code "
"class=\"code\">diary-icalendar-mailcap-viewer</code>.  You can add this "
"function, for example, to the variable <code class=\"code\">mailcap-user-"
"mime-data</code>; see its docstring for more information."
msgstr ""
"また、<code class=\"code\">diary-icalendar-mailcap-viewer</code> 関数を使用す"
"れば、iCalendar 添付ファイルをダイアリーファイルにインポートすることなく、"
"メールメッセージ内に表示することも可能です。この関数は、例えば変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">mailcap-user-mime-data</code> に追加できます。詳細については、"
"そのドキュメント文字列を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Display.html
msgid ""
"Displaying iCalendar entries uses the same infrastructure as importing them, "
"so customizing the import format will also change the format of the "
"displayed entries.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Diary-iCalendar-"
"Import.html\">Importing iCalendar data as Diary Entries</a>."
msgstr ""
