# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Export.html
msgid ""
"iCalendar export depends on a number of user-customizable variables, which "
"are in the <code class=\"code\">diary-icalendar-export</code> customization "
"group.  You can review and customize these variables with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-group</kbd>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Customization-Groups.html\">Customization Groups</a>."
msgstr ""
"iCalendarエクスポートは、<code class=\"code\">diary-icalendar-export</code>カ"
