# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Import.html
msgid ""
"You can customize the format of the imported diary entries by writing your "
"own formatting functions.  It is convenient (but not required) to express "
"such functions as templates called <em class=\"dfn\">skeletons</em>."
msgstr ""
"独自の書式設定関数を記述することで、インポートした日記エントリの書式をカスタ"
"マイズできます。こうした関数を<em class=\"dfn\">スケルトン</em>と呼ばれるテン"
"プレートとして表現すると便利です（必須ではありません）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Import.html
msgid ""
"For example, suppose you only want to import the date, time, summary, and "
"location of each calendar event, and to write them on a single line like:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、各カレンダーイベントの日付、時刻、概要、場所だけをインポートして、次"
"のように1行に書き出したいとします。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Import.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "2025/11/11 Summary @ Some Location\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Import.html
msgid ""
"Then you could write the import formatting function as a skeleton and set it "
"to the value of <code class=\"code\">diary-icalendar-vevent-format-function</"
"code> as follows:"
msgstr ""
"すると、インポートフォーマット関数をスケルトンとして記述し、次のように <code "
"class=\"code\">diary-icalendar-vevent-format-function</code> の値に設定できま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Import.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(require 'skeleton)\n"
"\n"
"(defun simple-vevent (_)\n"
"  &quot;Format a VEVENT summary and location on a single line&quot;\n"
"  (skeleton-insert\n"
"    '(nil\n"
"      ical-start-to-end &amp; &quot; &quot; &amp; ical-summary &amp; &quot; &quot;\n"
"      (when ical-location &quot;@ &quot;) &amp; ical-location &quot;\\n&quot;)))\n"
"\n"
"(setopt diary-icalendar-vevent-format-function #'simple-vevent)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Import.html
msgid ""
"The variables <code class=\"code\">ical-start-to-end</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">ical-summary</code> and <code class=\"code\">ical-location</"
"code> in this example are dynamically bound to appropriate values when the "
"skeleton is called.  See the docstring of <code class=\"code\">diary-"
"icalendar-vevent-format-function</code> for more information."
msgstr ""
"この例における変数 <code class=\"code\">ical-start-to-end</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">ical-summary</code>、<code class=\"code\">ical-location</"
"code> は、スケルトンが呼び出された際に適切な値に動的にバインドされます。詳細"
"については、<code class=\"code\">diary-icalendar-vevent-format-function</"
"code> のドキュメント文字列を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diary-iCalendar-Import.html
msgid ""
"Any errors encountered during import will be reported in a buffer named "
"<samp class=\"file\">*icalendar-errors*</samp>.  You can review these errors "
"with the <code class=\"code\">next-error</code> command.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Compilation-Mode.html\">Compilation Mode</a>.  If you "
"regularly need to import malformed iCalendar data, there are several hooks "
"available for this purpose; see the <code class=\"code\">icalendar-parser</"
"code> customization group."
msgstr ""
"インポート中に発生したエラーは、<samp class=\"file\">*icalendar-errors*</"
"samp> という名前のバッファに報告されます。これらのエラーは <code "
"class=\"code\">next-error</code> コマンドで確認できます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Compilation-Mode.html\">コンパイルモード</a> を参照してください。形式"
"不備のある iCalendar データを定期的にインポートする必要がある場合は、そのため"
"のフックがいくつか用意されています。<code class=\"code\">icalendar-parser</"
"code> カスタマイズグループを参照してください。"

