# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Diff-mode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-diff_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-patches_002c-editing\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Diff-mode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-diff_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-patches_002c-editing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Diff mode is a major mode used for the output of <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"diff</kbd> and other similar commands.  This kind of output is called a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">patch</em>, because it can be passed to the <code "
"class=\"command\">patch</code> command to automatically apply the specified "
"changes.  To select Diff mode manually, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x diff-"
"mode</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"Diffモードは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x diff</kbd>やその他の同様のコマンドの出力"
"に使用される主要なモードです。この種の出力は、<code class=\"command\">patch</"
"code>コマンドに渡して指定した変更を自動的に適用できるため、<em class=\"dfn\">"
"パッチ</em>と呼ばれます。Diffモードを手動で選択するには、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x diff-mode</kbd>と入力してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-hunk_002c-diff\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-hunk_002c-diff\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"The changes specified in a patch are grouped into <em class=\"dfn\">hunks</"
"em>, which are contiguous chunks of text that contain one or more changed "
"lines.  Hunks usually also include unchanged lines to provide context for "
"the changes.  Each hunk is preceded by a <em class=\"dfn\">hunk header</em>, "
"which specifies the old and new line numbers where the hunk&rsquo;s changes "
"occur.  Diff mode highlights each hunk header, to distinguish it from the "
"actual contents of the hunk."
msgstr ""
"パッチで指定された変更は<em class=\"dfn\">ハンク</em>としてまとめられます。ハ"
"ンクとは、1つ以上の変更行を含む連続したテキストの塊のことです。通常、変更のコ"
"ンテキストを提供するために、変更のない行も含まれます。各ハンクの前には<em "
"class=\"dfn\">ハンクヘッダー</em>があり、そこではハンクの変更が発生した旧行番"
"号と新行番号が指定されます。Diffモードでは、各ハンクヘッダーをハイライト表示"
"し、ハンクの実際の内容と区別します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"The first hunk in a patch is preceded by a file header, which shows the "
"names of the new and the old versions of the file, and their time stamps.  "
"If a patch shows changes for more than one file, each file has such a header "
"before the first hunk of that file&rsquo;s changes."
msgstr ""
"パッチ内の最初のハンクの前にはファイルヘッダーがあり、そこにはファイルの新旧"
"バージョンの名称とタイムスタンプが記載されています。パッチで複数のファイルの"
"変更が示されている場合、各ファイルの変更内容の最初のハンクの前に、同様のヘッ"
"ダーが配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"diff_002dupdate_002don_002dthe_002dfly\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"diff_002dupdate_002don_002dthe_002dfly\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"You can edit a Diff mode buffer like any other buffer.  (If it is read-only, "
"you need to make it writable first; see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Misc-"
"Buffer.html\">Miscellaneous Buffer Operations</a>.)  Whenever you edit a "
"hunk, Diff mode attempts to automatically correct the line numbers in the "
"hunk headers, to ensure that the patch remains correct, and could still be "
"applied by <code class=\"command\">patch</code>.  To disable automatic line "
"number correction, change the variable <code class=\"code\">diff-update-on-"
"the-fly</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"Diffモードのバッファは、他のバッファと同様に編集できます。（読み取り専用の場"
"合は、あらかじめ書き込み可能にする必要があります。<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Misc-Buffer.html\">各種バッファ操作</a>を参照してください。）ハンクを"
"編集するたびに、Diffモードはパッチの正確性を維持し、<code "
"class=\"command\">patch</code>で引き続き適用できるように、ハンクヘッダー内の"
"行番号を自動的に修正しようとします。行番号の自動修正を無効にするには、変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">diff-update-on-the-fly</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に変更してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Diff mode arranges for hunks to be treated as compiler error messages by "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-g M-n</kbd> and other commands that handle error "
"messages (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Compilation-Mode.html\">Compilation "
"Mode</a>).  Thus, you can use the compilation-mode commands to visit the "
"corresponding source locations."
msgstr ""
"Diffモードでは、ハンクが<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-g M-n</kbd>やエラーメッセージを"
"扱うその他のコマンドによってコンパイラのエラーメッセージとして処理されるよう"
"になります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Compilation-Mode.html\">コンパイルモー"
"ド</a>を参照）。これにより、コンパイルモードのコマンドを使用して、対応する"
"ソース箇所を参照できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"In addition, Diff mode provides the following commands to navigate, "
"manipulate and apply parts of patches:"
msgstr ""
"さらに、Diffモードでは、パッチの一部を移動・操作・適用するための以下のコマン"
"ドが用意されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-diff_002dhunk_002dnext\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-diff_002dhunk_002dnext\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-diff_002dhunk_002dnext\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-diff_002dhunk_002dnext\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Move to the next hunk-start (<code class=\"code\">diff-hunk-next</code>).  "
"With prefix argument <var class=\"var\">n</var>, move forward to the <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>th next hunk."
msgstr ""
"次のハンク開始位置 (<code class=\"code\">diff-hunk-next</code>) へ移動する。"
"接頭辞引数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> を指定すると、<var class=\"var\">n</"
"var> 番目の次のハンクへ移動する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diff_002drefine\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diff_002drefine\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"By default, Diff mode automatically <em class=\"dfn\">refines</em> hunks as "
"Emacs displays them, highlighting their changes with better granularity.  "
"Alternatively, if you set <code class=\"code\">diff-refine</code> to the "
"symbol <code class=\"code\">navigation</code>, Diff mode only refines the "
"hunk you move to with this command or with <code class=\"code\">diff-hunk-"
"prev</code>.  Finally, you can set <code class=\"code\">diff-refine</code> "
"to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> and manually refine hunks using <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-b</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">diff-refine-hunk</code>), "
"described below."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、DiffモードはEmacsの表示に合わせてハンクを自動的に<em "
"class=\"dfn\">精緻化</em>し、変更箇所をよりきめ細かくハイライトします。あるい"
"は、<code class=\"code\">diff-refine</code>にシンボル<code "
"class=\"code\">navigation</code>を設定すれば、Diffモードはこのコマンドまたは"
"<code class=\"code\">diff-hunk-prev</code>で移動したハンクのみを精緻化しま"
"す。最後に、<code class=\"code\">diff-refine</code>を<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>に設定し、後述する<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-b</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">diff-refine-hunk</code>)を用いて手動でハンクを精緻化す"
"ることも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-shadow-cursor-_0028Diff-mode_0029\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"smerge_002drefine_002dshadow_002dcursor\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-shadow-cursor-_0028Diff-mode_0029\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"smerge_002drefine_002dshadow_002dcursor\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"By default, refining a hunk in any way displays a <em class=\"dfn\">shadow "
"cursor</em> at one of the two edges of the refined region, to better show "
"where the refined region starts or ends.  This can be controlled by "
"customizing the variable <code class=\"code\">smerge-refine-shadow-cursor</"
