# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Diff-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Split the hunk at point (<code class=\"code\">diff-split-hunk</code>) into "
"two separate hunks.  This inserts a hunk header and modifies the header of "
"the current hunk.  This command is useful for manually editing patches, and "
"only works with the <em class=\"dfn\">unified diff format</em> produced by "
"the <samp class=\"option\">-u</samp> or <samp class=\"option\">--unified</"
"samp> options to the <code class=\"command\">diff</code> program.  If you "
"need to split a hunk in the <em class=\"dfn\">context diff format</em> "
"produced by the <samp class=\"option\">-c</samp> or <samp class=\"option\">--"
"context</samp> options to <code class=\"command\">diff</code>, first convert "
"the buffer to the unified diff format with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-u</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"ハンクを点 (<code class=\"code\">diff-split-hunk</code>) で2つの個別のハンク"
"に分割します。これにより、ハンクヘッダーが挿入され、現在のハンクのヘッダーが"
"変更されます。このコマンドはパッチを手動で編集する際に便利であり、<code "
"class=\"command\">diff</code> プログラムの <samp class=\"option\">-u</samp> "
"または <samp class=\"option\">--unified</samp> オプションで生成される <em "
"class=\"dfn\">unified diff 形式</em> でのみ動作します。<code "
"class=\"command\">diff</code> の <samp class=\"option\">-c</samp> または "
"<samp class=\"option\">--context</samp> オプションで生成される <em "
"class=\"dfn\">context diff 形式</em> のハンクを分割する必要がある場合は、ま"
"ず <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-u</kbd> でバッファを unified diff 形式に変換して"
"ください。"

