#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"<span>20.8 File Directories<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#File-"
"Directories\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>20.8 ファイルディレクトリ<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#File-"
"Directories\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file-directory\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-directory-listing\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-file-directory\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-directory-listing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"The file system groups files into <em class=\"dfn\">directories</em>.  A <em "
"class=\"dfn\">directory listing</em> is a list of all the files in a "
"directory.  Emacs provides commands to create and delete directories, and to "
"make directory listings in brief format (file names only) and verbose format "
"(sizes, dates, and other attributes included).  Emacs also includes a "
"directory browser feature called Dired, which you can invoke with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x d</kbd>; see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Dired.html\">Dired, "
"the Directory Editor</a>."
msgstr ""
"ファイルシステムでは、ファイルが<em class=\"dfn\">ディレクトリ</em>にまとめら"
"れます。<em class=\"dfn\">ディレクトリ一覧</em>とは、ディレクトリ内のすべての"
"ファイルのリストのことです。Emacsには、ディレクトリの作成・削除や、ディレクト"
"リ一覧を簡潔形式（ファイル名のみ）および詳細形式（サイズ、日付、その他の属性"
"を含む）で表示するためのコマンドが用意されています。また、EmacsにはDiredと呼"
"ばれるディレクトリブラウザ機能が搭載されており、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x d</"
"kbd>で呼び出すことができます。詳細は<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Dired.html\">Dired, the Directory Editor</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-d <var class=\"var\">dir-or-pattern</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-d <var class=\"var\">dir-or-pattern</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"Display a brief directory listing (<code class=\"code\">list-directory</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"簡潔なディレクトリ一覧を表示します (<code class=\"code\">list-directory</"
"code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
