"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x C-d <var class=\"var\">dir-or-pattern</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid "Display a verbose directory listing."
msgstr "詳細なディレクトリ一覧を表示する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x make-directory <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">dirname</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x make-directory <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">dirname</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid "Create a new directory named <var class=\"var\">dirname</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">dirname</var>という名前の新しいディレクトリを作成してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x delete-directory <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">dirname</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x delete-directory <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">dirname</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"Delete the directory named <var class=\"var\">dirname</var>.  If it "
"isn&rsquo;t empty, you will be asked whether you want to delete it "
"recursively."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">dirname</var> という名前のディレクトリを削除します。空でな"
"い場合は、再帰的に削除するかどうかを確認されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-list_002ddirectory\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dd\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-list_002ddirectory\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dd\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"The command to display a directory listing is <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-d</"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">list-directory</code>).  It reads using the "
"minibuffer a file name which is either a directory to be listed or a "
"wildcard-containing pattern for the files to be listed.  For example,"
msgstr ""
"ディレクトリ一覧を表示するコマンドは <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-d</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">list-directory</code>) です。これは、一覧表示対象のディレクト"
"リ、またはワイルドカードを含むファイル検索パターンのいずれかであるファイル名"
"を、ミニバッファを用いて読み込みます。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "C-x C-d /u2/emacs/etc <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"lists all the files in directory <samp class=\"file\">/u2/emacs/etc</samp>.  "
"Here is an example of specifying a file name pattern:"
msgstr ""
"ディレクトリ <samp class=\"file\">/u2/emacs/etc</samp> 内のすべてのファイルを"
"一覧表示します。以下に、ファイル名のパターンを指定する例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "C-x C-d /u2/emacs/src/*.c <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"Normally, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-d</kbd> displays a brief directory "
"listing containing just file names.  A numeric argument (regardless of "
"value) tells it to make a verbose listing including sizes, dates, and owners "
"(like &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ls -l</samp>&rsquo;)."
msgstr ""
"通常、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-d</kbd> はファイル名のみを含む簡潔なディレクト"
"リ一覧を表示します。数値引数（値に関わらず）を指定すると、サイズ、日付、所有"
"者を含む詳細な一覧を表示します（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ls -l</"
"samp>&rsquo; のように）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"list_002ddirectory_002dbrief_002dswitches\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-list_002ddirectory_002dverbose_002dswitches\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"list_002ddirectory_002dbrief_002dswitches\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-list_002ddirectory_002dverbose_002dswitches\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"The text of a directory listing is mostly obtained by running <code "
"class=\"code\">ls</code> in an inferior process.  Two Emacs variables "
"control the switches passed to <code class=\"code\">ls</code>: <code "
"class=\"code\">list-directory-brief-switches</code> is a string giving the "
"switches to use in brief listings (<code class=\"code\">&quot;-CF&quot;</"
"code> by default), and <code class=\"code\">list-directory-verbose-switches</"
"code> is a string giving the switches to use in a verbose listing (<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;-l&quot;</code> by default)."
msgstr ""
"ディレクトリ一覧のテキストは、主に下位プロセスで <code class=\"code\">ls</"
"code> を実行することで取得されます。<code class=\"code\">ls</code> に渡される"
"スイッチは、2つの Emacs 変数によって制御されます。<code class=\"code\">list-"
"directory-brief-switches</code> は簡易一覧で使用するスイッチを指定する文字列"
"（デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">&quot;-CF&quot;</code>）であり、<code "
"class=\"code\">list-directory-verbose-switches</code> は詳細一覧で使用するス"
"イッチを指定する文字列（デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">&quot;-l&quot;</"
"code>）です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"In verbose directory listings, Emacs adds information about the amount of "
"free space on the disk that contains the directory."
msgstr ""
"詳細なディレクトリ一覧では、Emacsはそのディレクトリが格納されているディスクの"
"空き容量に関する情報を追加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directories.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x delete-directory</kbd> prompts for a "
"directory&rsquo;s name using the minibuffer, and deletes the directory if it "
"is empty.  If the directory is not empty, you will be asked whether you want "
"to delete it recursively.  On systems that have a &ldquo;Trash&rdquo; (or "
"&ldquo;Recycle Bin&rdquo;) feature, you can make this command move the "
"specified directory to the Trash instead of deleting it outright, by "
"changing the variable <code class=\"code\">delete-by-moving-to-trash</code> "
"to <code class=\"code\">t</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Misc-File-"
"Ops.html\">Miscellaneous File Operations</a>, for more information about "
"using the Trash."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x delete-directory</kbd> は、ミニバッファを使用"
"してディレクトリ名の入力を求め、ディレクトリが空であればそれを削除します。"
"ディレクトリが空でない場合は、再帰的に削除するかどうかを確認するメッセージが"
"表示されます。「ゴミ箱」（または「リサイクルビン」）機能を備えたシステムで"
"は、変数 <code class=\"code\">delete-by-moving-to-trash</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> に変更することで、このコマンドに指定したディレクトリ"
"を直接削除させるのではなく、ゴミ箱に移動させることができます。ゴミ箱の使用方"
"法の詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Misc-File-Ops.html\">その他の"
"ファイル操作</a> を参照してください。"

