"add_002ddir_002dlocal_002dvariable\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-delete_002ddir_002dlocal_002dvariable\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-copy_002dfile_002dlocals_002dto_002ddir_002dlocals\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directory-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Instead of editing the <samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp> file by "
"hand, you can use the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x add-dir-local-variable</"
"kbd>.  This prompts for a mode or subdirectory, and for variable and value, "
"and adds the entry defining the directory-local variable.  <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x delete-dir-local-variable</kbd> deletes an entry.  <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x copy-file-locals-to-dir-locals</kbd> copies the file-local "
"variables in the current file into <samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</"
"samp>, or <samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals-2.el</samp> if that file is also "
"present."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp> ファイルを手動で編集する代わりに、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x add-dir-local-variable</kbd> コマンドを使用できます。"
"このコマンドは、モードまたはサブディレクトリ、および変数と値の指定を求め、"
"ディレクトリローカル変数を定義するエントリを追加します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x delete-dir-local-variable</kbd> はエントリを削除します。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x copy-file-locals-to-dir-locals</kbd> は、現在のファイル内の"
"ファイルローカル変数を <samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp> に、または"
"そのファイルも存在する場合には <samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals-2.el</samp> "
"にコピーします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directory-Variables.html
msgid ""
"With a prefix argument, all three commands prompt for the file you want to "
"modify.  Although it doesn&rsquo;t have to exist, you must enter a valid "
"filename, either <samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp> or <samp "
"class=\"file\">.dir-locals-2.el</samp>."
msgstr ""
"接頭辞引数を指定すると、3つのコマンドすべてで変更対象のファイルの指定が求めら"
"れます。ファイルが必ずしも存在する必要はありませんが、<samp "
"class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp> または <samp class=\"file\">.dir-"
"locals-2.el</samp> のいずれかの有効なファイル名を入力する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Directory-Variables.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002ddirlocals\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002ddirlocals\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Directory-Variables.html
msgid ""
"There&rsquo;s also a command to pop up an Easy Customization buffer (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Easy-Customization.html\">Easy Customization "
"Interface</a>) to edit directory local variables, <code "
"class=\"code\">customize-dirlocals</code>."
msgstr ""
"また、ディレクトリのローカル変数を編集するためのEasy Customizationバッファ"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Easy-Customization.html\">Easy Customization "
"Interface</a>を参照）を表示するコマンドもあります、<code "
"class=\"code\">customize-dirlocals</code>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Directory-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dir_002dlocals_002dset_002dclass_002dvariables\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
