# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"You can flag a file for deletion by moving to the line describing the file "
"and typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dired-flag-file-"
"deletion</code>).  The deletion flag is visible as a &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">D</samp>&rsquo; at the beginning of the line.  This command "
"moves point to the next line, so that repeated <kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> "
"commands flag successive files.  A numeric prefix argument serves as a "
"repeat count; a negative count means to flag preceding files."
msgstr ""
"ファイルの説明行に移動して <kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">dired-flag-file-deletion</code>) と入力することで、そのファイ"
"ルを削除対象としてマークできます。削除フラグは、行頭の &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">D</samp>&rsquo; として表示されます。このコマンドはポイントを次"
"の行に移動させるため、<kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> コマンドを繰り返すことで連続"
"するファイルをマークできます。数値の接頭辞引数は繰り返し回数として機能し、負"
"の値を指定すると直前のファイルをマークします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"If the region is active, the <kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> command flags all "
"files in the region for deletion; in this case, the command does not move "
"point, and ignores any prefix argument."
msgstr ""
"リージョンがアクティブな場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> コマンドはリージョン"
"内のすべてのファイルを削除対象としてマークします。この場合、コマンドはポイン"
"トを移動させず、接頭辞引数も無視します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-u-_0028Dired-deletion_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-DEL-_0028Dired_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-u-_0028Dired-deletion_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-DEL-_0028Dired_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"The reason for flagging files for deletion, rather than deleting files "
"immediately, is to reduce the danger of deleting a file accidentally.  Until "
"you direct Dired to delete the flagged files, you can remove deletion flags "
"using the commands <kbd class=\"kbd\">u</kbd> and <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</"
"kbd>.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">u</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dired-unmark</code>) "
"works just like <kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd>, but removes flags rather than "
"making flags.  <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dired-"
"unmark-backward</code>) moves upward, removing flags; it is like <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">u</kbd> with argument &minus;1.  A numeric prefix argument to "
"either command serves as a repeat count, with a negative count meaning to "
"unflag in the opposite direction.  If the region is active, these commands "
"instead unflag all files in the region, without moving point."
msgstr ""
"ファイルを即座に削除するのではなく、削除対象としてフラグを立てる理由は、誤っ"
"てファイルを削除してしまう危険を減らすためです。Diredにフラグ付きファイルの削"
"除を指示するまでは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">u</kbd> および <kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> コマンドで削除フラグを解除できます。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">u</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dired-unmark</code>) は <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> と同様に動作しますが、フラグを立てるのではなく解除しま"
"す。<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dired-unmark-"
"backward</code>) は上方向に移動しながらフラグを解除するもので、引数 &minus;1 "
"を指定した <kbd class=\"kbd\">u</kbd> と同様の動作をします。いずれのコマンド"
"においても、数値の接頭辞引数は繰り返し回数として機能し、負の回数を指定すると"
"逆方向にフラグを解除します。リージョンがアクティブな場合、これらのコマンドは"
"ポイントを移動させず、代わりにリージョン内のすべてのファイルのフラグを解除し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-x-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002ddo_002dflagged_002ddelete\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-x-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002ddo_002dflagged_002ddelete\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"To delete flagged files, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">x</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">dired-do-flagged-delete</code>).  This command displays a "
"list of all the file names flagged for deletion, and requests confirmation "
"with <kbd class=\"kbd\">yes</kbd>.  If you confirm, Dired deletes the "
"flagged files, then deletes their lines from the text of the Dired buffer.  "
"The Dired buffer, with somewhat fewer lines, remains selected."
msgstr ""
"フラグ付きのファイルを削除するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">x</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">dired-do-flagged-delete</code>) と入力します。このコマンドは、"
"削除対象としてフラグが立てられたすべてのファイル名の一覧を表示し、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">yes</kbd> で確認を求めます。確認すると、Dired はフラグ付きの"
"ファイルを削除し、続いて Dired バッファのテキストからその行を削除します。行数"
"がわずかに減少した状態の Dired バッファは、引き続き選択されたままとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"If you answer <kbd class=\"kbd\">no</kbd> or quit with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"g</kbd> when asked to confirm, you return immediately to Dired, with the "
"deletion flags still present in the buffer, and no files actually deleted."
msgstr ""
"確認を求められた際に <kbd class=\"kbd\">no</kbd> と回答するか <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> で終了すると、バッファに削除フラグが残ったまま直ちに "
"Dired に戻り、実際にファイルが削除されることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recursive-deletion\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002drecursive_002ddeletes\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recursive-deletion\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002drecursive_002ddeletes\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"You can delete empty directories just like other files, but normally Dired "
"cannot delete directories that are nonempty.  However, if the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-recursive-deletes</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then Dired is allowed to delete nonempty "
"directories including all their contents.  That can be somewhat risky.  If "
"the value of the variable is <code class=\"code\">always</code>, Dired will "
"delete nonempty directories recursively, which is even more risky."
msgstr ""
"空のディレクトリは他のファイルと同様に削除できますが、通常、Diredは中身がある"
"ディレクトリを削除できません。ただし、変数 <code class=\"code\">dired-"
"recursive-deletes</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Dired"
"は中身を含む空でないディレクトリを削除できます。これは少々リスクを伴う場合が"
"あります。変数の値が <code class=\"code\">always</code> の場合、Diredは空でな"
"いディレクトリを再帰的に削除するため、さらにリスクが高くなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"Even if you have set <code class=\"code\">dired-recursive-deletes</code> to "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, you might want sometimes to delete "
"directories recursively without being asked for confirmation for all of "
"them.  For example, you may want that when you have marked many directories "
"for deletion and you are very sure that all of them can safely be deleted.  "
"For every nonempty directory you are asked for confirmation to delete, if "
"you answer <code class=\"code\">all</code>, then all the remaining "
"directories will be deleted without any further questions."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">dired-recursive-deletes</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定していても、すべてのディレクトリに対して確認"
"を求められることなく、再帰的にディレクトリを削除したい場合があるでしょう。例"
"えば、多くのディレクトリを削除対象として指定し、それらすべてを安全に削除でき"
"ると確信している場合などが考えられます。空でないディレクトリごとに削除の確認"
"が求められた際、<code class=\"code\">all</code> と回答すれば、残りのすべての"
"ディレクトリが追加の確認なしに削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"delete_002dby_002dmoving_002dto_002dtrash_002c-and-Dired\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"delete_002dby_002dmoving_002dto_002dtrash_002c-and-Dired\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"If you change the variable <code class=\"code\">delete-by-moving-to-trash</"
"code> to <code class=\"code\">t</code>, the above deletion commands will "
"move the affected files or directories into the operating system&rsquo;s "
"Trash, instead of deleting them outright.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Misc-"
"File-Ops.html\">Miscellaneous File Operations</a>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">delete-by-moving-to-trash</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> に変更すると、上記の削除コマンドは、対象のファイルや"
"ディレクトリを完全に削除するのではなく、オペレーティングシステムのゴミ箱に移"
"動します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Misc-File-Ops.html\">その他のファイル操作"
"</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Deletion.html
msgid ""
"An alternative way of deleting files is to mark them with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">m</kbd> and delete with <kbd class=\"kbd\">D</kbd>, see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Operating-on-Files.html\">Operating on Files</a>."
msgstr ""
"ファイルを削除する別の方法として、<kbd class=\"kbd\">m</kbd> でマークし、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">D</kbd> で削除する方法があります。<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Operating-on-Files.html\">ファイルの操作</a>を参照してください。"

