# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Navigation.html
msgid ""
"All the usual Emacs cursor motion commands are available in Dired buffers.  "
"The keys <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> are "
"redefined to run <code class=\"code\">dired-next-line</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-previous-line</code>, respectively, and they put the "
"cursor at the beginning of the file name on the line, rather than at the "
"beginning of the line."
msgstr ""
"Diredバッファでも、通常のEmacsカーソル移動コマンドがすべて利用可能です。キー "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> はそれぞれ "
"<code class=\"code\">dired-next-line</code> と <code class=\"code\">dired-"
"previous-line</code> を実行するように再定義されており、行頭ではなくその行の"
"ファイル名の先頭にカーソルを移動させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Navigation.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SPC-_0028Dired_0029\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SPC-_0028Dired_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Navigation.html
msgid ""
"For extra convenience, <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> in Dired are equivalent to <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</"
"kbd>.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">p</kbd> is equivalent to <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</"
"kbd>.  (Moving by lines is so common in Dired that it deserves to be easy to "
"type.)  <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> (move up and unflag) is also often "
"useful simply for moving up (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Dired-"
"Deletion.html\">Deleting Files with Dired</a>)."
msgstr ""
"さらに利便性を高めるため、Dired では <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> と同等です。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">p</kbd> は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> と同等です。（Dired で"
"は行単位での移動が非常に頻繁に行われるため、簡単に入力できるようになっていま"
"す。）<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>（上に移動してフラグを解除）も、単に上に移"
"動したい場合に便利です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Dired-"
"Deletion.html\">Dired によるファイルの削除</a> を参照）。"

