# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Navigation.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s f C-s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dired-isearch-"
"filenames</code>) performs a forward incremental search in the Dired buffer, "
"looking for matches only amongst the file names and ignoring the rest of the "
"text in the buffer.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s f M-C-s</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">dired-isearch-filenames-regexp</code>)  does the same, using "
"a regular expression search.  If you change the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-isearch-filenames</code> to <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>, then the usual search commands also limit themselves to the file "
"names; for instance, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> behaves like <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-s f C-s</kbd>.  If the value is <code class=\"code\">dwim</"
"code>, then search commands match the file names only when point was on a "
"file name initially.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Search.html\">Searching "
"and Replacement</a>, for information about incremental search."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s f C-s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dired-isearch-"
"filenames</code>) は Dired バッファ内で前方インクリメンタル検索を行い、ファイ"
"ル名のみを対象に照合し、バッファ内のそれ以外のテキストは無視します。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-s f M-C-s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dired-isearch-"
"filenames-regexp</code>) も同様に、正規表現検索を用いて検索を行います。変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">dired-isearch-filenames</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> に変更すると、通常の検索コマンドもファイル名のみに限"
"定されます。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> は <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s f "
"C-s</kbd> と同様に動作します。値が <code class=\"code\">dwim</code> の場合、"
"検索コマンドは、最初にポイントがファイル名上にあった場合にのみファイル名を照"
"合します。インクリメンタル検索に関する情報については、<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Search.html\">検索と置換</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Navigation.html
msgid ""
"Some additional navigation commands are available when the Dired buffer "
"includes several directories.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Subdirectory-"
