# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-g-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-revert_002dbuffer-_0028Dired_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-g-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-revert_002dbuffer-_0028Dired_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"Type <kbd class=\"kbd\">g</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</code>) "
"to update the contents of the Dired buffer, based on changes in the files "
"and directories listed.  This preserves all marks except for those on files "
"that have vanished.  Hidden subdirectories are updated but remain hidden."
msgstr ""
"タイプ <kbd class=\"kbd\">g</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">revert-buffer</"
"code>) を指定すると、リストされたファイルやディレクトリの変更に基づいて "
"Dired バッファの内容を更新します。これにより、消滅したファイルに設定されてい"
"たマークを除き、すべてのマークが保持されます。非表示のサブディレクトリは更新"
"されますが、引き続き非表示のままとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-l-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002ddo_002dredisplay\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-l-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002ddo_002dredisplay\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"To update only some of the files, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">l</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">dired-do-redisplay</code>).  Like the Dired file-operating "
"commands, this command operates on the next <var class=\"var\">n</var> files "
"(or previous &minus;<var class=\"var\">n</var> files), or on the marked "
"files if any, or on the current file.  Updating the files means reading "
"their current status, then updating their lines in the buffer to indicate "
"that status."
msgstr ""
"一部のファイルのみを更新するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">l</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">dired-do-redisplay</code>) と入力します。Diredのファイル操作コ"
"マンドと同様に、このコマンドは次の <var class=\"var\">n</var> 個のファイル"
"（または前の &minus;<var class=\"var\">n</var> 個のファイル）、マークされた"
"ファイル（あれば）、あるいは現在のファイルに対して動作します。ファイルを更新"
"するとは、現在の状態を読み取り、バッファ内の該当行を更新してその状態を反映さ"
"せることを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"If you use <kbd class=\"kbd\">l</kbd> on a subdirectory header line, it "
"updates the contents of the corresponding subdirectory."
msgstr ""
"サブディレクトリのヘッダー行で <kbd class=\"kbd\">l</kbd> を使用すると、対応"
"するサブディレクトリの内容が更新されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dired_002dauto_002drevert_002dbuffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dired_002dauto_002drevert_002dbuffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"If you use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x d</kbd> or some other Dired command to "
"visit a directory that is already being shown in a Dired buffer, Dired "
"switches to that buffer but does not update it.  If the buffer is not up-to-"
"date, Dired displays a warning telling you to type <kbd class=\"kbd\">g</"
"kbd> to update it.  You can also tell Emacs to revert each Dired buffer "
"automatically when you revisit it, by setting the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-auto-revert-buffer</code> to a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x d</kbd> やその他の Dired コマンドを使用して、すでに "
"Dired バッファに表示されているディレクトリに移動した場合、Dired はそのバッ"
"ファに切り替えますが、内容は更新しません。バッファが最新の状態でない場合、"
"Dired は更新するために <kbd class=\"kbd\">g</kbd> と入力するよう警告を表示し"
"ます。また、変数 <code class=\"code\">dired-auto-revert-buffer</code> に "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を設定することで、各 Dired バッファに"
"再アクセスした際に自動的に元の状態に戻すよう Emacs に指示することもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-k-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002ddo_002dkill_002dlines\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-k-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002ddo_002dkill_002dlines\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"To delete <em class=\"emph\">file lines</em> from the buffer&mdash;without "
"actually deleting the files&mdash;type <kbd class=\"kbd\">k</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">dired-do-kill-lines</code>).  Like the file-operating "
"commands, this command operates on the next <var class=\"var\">n</var> "
"files, or on the marked files if any.  However, it does not operate on the "
"current file, since otherwise mistyping <kbd class=\"kbd\">k</kbd> could be "
"annoying."
msgstr ""
"バッファから<em class=\"emph\">ファイル行</em>を削除する（実際のファイル自体"
"は削除しない）には、<kbd class=\"kbd\">k</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dired-"
"do-kill-lines</code>) と入力します。ファイル操作コマンドと同様に、このコマン"
"ドは次の <var class=\"var\">n</var> 個のファイル、またはマークされたファイル"
"（あれば）に対して動作します。ただし、現在のファイルに対しては動作しません。"
"そうしないと、<kbd class=\"kbd\">k</kbd> の入力ミスが煩わしくなる可能性がある"
"ためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"If you use <kbd class=\"kbd\">k</kbd> to kill the line for a directory file "
"which you had inserted in the Dired buffer as a subdirectory (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Subdirectories-in-Dired.html\">Subdirectories in "
"Dired</a>), it removes the subdirectory listing as well.  Typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u k</kbd> on the header line for a subdirectory also removes "
"the subdirectory line from the Dired buffer."
msgstr ""
"Diredバッファにサブディレクトリとして挿入したディレクトリファイルの行を <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">k</kbd> で削除すると（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Subdirectories-"
"in-Dired.html\">Diredにおけるサブディレクトリ</a>を参照）、そのサブディレクト"
"リの一覧も同時に削除されます。また、サブディレクトリのヘッダー行で <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u k</kbd> と入力しても、Diredバッファからそのサブディレクトリ"
"の行が削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"The <kbd class=\"kbd\">g</kbd> command brings back any individual lines that "
"you have killed in this way, but not subdirectories&mdash;you must use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">i</kbd> to reinsert a subdirectory."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">g</kbd> コマンドを使用すると、この方法で削除した個々の行を"
"復元できますが、サブディレクトリは復元できません。サブディレクトリを再挿入す"
"るには <kbd class=\"kbd\">i</kbd> を使用する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Dired-sorting\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-sorting-Dired-buffer\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-s-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-dired_002dsort_002dtoggle_002dor_002dedit\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Dired-sorting\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-sorting-Dired-buffer\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-s-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-dired_002dsort_002dtoggle_002dor_002dedit\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"The files in a Dired buffers are normally listed in alphabetical order by "
"file names.  Alternatively Dired can sort them by date/time.  The Dired "
"command <kbd class=\"kbd\">s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dired-sort-toggle-"
"or-edit</code>) switches between these two sorting modes.  The mode line in "
"a Dired buffer indicates which way it is currently sorted&mdash;by name, or "
"by date."
msgstr ""
"Diredバッファ内のファイルは、通常、ファイル名のアルファベット順に並びます。あ"
"るいは、Diredでは日時順に並べ替えることも可能です。Diredコマンド <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dired-sort-toggle-or-edit</"
"code>) で、これら2つのソートモードを切り替えます。Diredバッファのモード行に"
"は、現在どちらの順（名前順か日時順か）でソートされているかが表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Updating.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u s <var class=\"var\">switches</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> lets you specify a new value for <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-listing-switches</code>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u s <var class=\"var\">switches</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> を使用すると、<code class=\"code\">dired-"
"listing-switches</code> に新しい値を指定できます。"

