# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-Visiting.html
msgid ""
"Open the file described on the current line, with superuser, or root, "
"permissions (<code class=\"code\">tramp-dired-find-file-with-sudo</code>).  "
"If called with a <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> prefix argument, it prompts "
"for another Tramp method to use other than the default, <samp "
"class=\"option\">sudo</samp>.  See <a data-manual=\"tramp\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/tramp/Ad_002dhoc-"
"multi_002dhops.html#Ad_002dhoc-multi_002dhops\">Tramp</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Tramp Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"現在の行で指定されたファイルを、スーパーユーザーまたはroot権限で開きます "
"(<code class=\"code\">tramp-dired-find-file-with-sudo</code>)。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> プレフィックス引数を指定して呼び出された場合は、デ"
"フォルトの <samp class=\"option\">sudo</samp> 以外の Tramp メソッドの使用を促"
"します。<cite class=\"cite\">The Tramp Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"tramp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"tramp/Ad_002dhoc-multi_002dhops.html#Ad_002dhoc-multi_002dhops\">Tramp</a> を"
"参照してください。"

