# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-and-Find.html
msgid ""
"You can select a set of files for display in a Dired buffer more flexibly by "
"using the <code class=\"command\">find</code> utility to choose the files."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"command\">find</code>ユーティリティを使用してファイルを選択する"
"ことで、Diredバッファに表示するファイルセットをより柔軟に指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-and-Find.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-find_002dname_002ddired\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-find_002dname_002ddired\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-and-Find.html
msgid ""
"To search for files with names matching a wildcard pattern use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x find-name-dired</kbd>.  It reads arguments <var "
"class=\"var\">directory</var> and <var class=\"var\">pattern</var>, and "
"chooses all the files in <var class=\"var\">directory</var> or its "
"subdirectories whose individual names match <var class=\"var\">pattern</var>."
msgstr ""
"ワイルドカードパターンに一致するファイル名を検索するには、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x find-name-dired</kbd>を使用します。これは引数<var "
"class=\"var\">directory</var>および<var class=\"var\">pattern</var>を読み込"
"み、<var class=\"var\">directory</var>またはそのサブディレクトリ内にある個々"
"のファイル名が<var class=\"var\">pattern</var>に一致するすべてのファイルを選"
"択します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-and-Find.html
msgid ""
"The files thus chosen are displayed in a Dired buffer, in which the ordinary "
"Dired commands are available."
msgstr ""
"このように選択されたファイルはDiredバッファに表示され、そこでは通常のDiredコ"
"マンドが利用可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-and-Find.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-find_002dgrep_002ddired\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-find_002dgrep_002ddired\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-and-Find.html
msgid ""
"If you want to test the contents of files, rather than their names, use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x find-grep-dired</kbd>.  This command reads two minibuffer "
"arguments, <var class=\"var\">directory</var> and <var class=\"var\">regexp</"
"var>; it chooses all the files in <var class=\"var\">directory</var> or its "
"subdirectories that contain a match for <var class=\"var\">regexp</var>.  It "
"works by running the programs <code class=\"command\">find</code> and <code "
"class=\"command\">grep</code>.  See also <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x grep-find</"
"kbd>, in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Grep-Searching.html\">Searching with Grep "
"under Emacs</a>.  Remember to write the regular expression for <code "
"class=\"command\">grep</code>, not for Emacs.  (An alternative method of "
"showing files whose contents match a given regexp is the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">% g <var class=\"var\">regexp</var></kbd> command, see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Marks-vs-Flags.html\">Dired Marks vs. Flags</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"ファイル名ではなくファイルの内容をテストしたい場合は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"find-grep-dired</kbd> を使用してください。このコマンドは、2つのミニバッファ引"
"数 <var class=\"var\">directory</var> と <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> を読"
"み込み、<var class=\"var\">directory</var> またはそのサブディレクトリ内にある"
"ファイルのうち、<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> に一致するものをすべて選択し"
"ます。これは、プログラム <code class=\"command\">find</code> と <code "
"class=\"command\">grep</code> を実行することで動作します。また、<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Grep-Searching.html\">Emacs での Grep による検索</a> に"
"ある <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x grep-find</kbd> も参照してください。<code "
"class=\"command\">grep</code> 用の正規表現は、Emacs 用ではなくファイル用に記"
"述することを忘れないでください。（指定した正規表現に一致する内容を持つファイ"
"ルを表示する別の方法として <kbd class=\"kbd\">% g <var class=\"var\">regexp</"
"var></kbd> コマンドがあります。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Marks-vs-"
"Flags.html\">Dired のマークとフラグ</a> を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-and-Find.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-find_002ddired\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-find_002ddired\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-and-Find.html
msgid ""
"The most general command in this series is <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x find-"
"dired</kbd>, which lets you specify any condition that <code "
"class=\"command\">find</code> can test.  It takes two minibuffer arguments, "
"<var class=\"var\">directory</var> and <var class=\"var\">find-args</var>; "
"it runs <code class=\"command\">find</code> in <var class=\"var\">directory</"
"var>, passing <var class=\"var\">find-args</var> to tell <code "
"class=\"command\">find</code> what condition to test.  To use this command, "
"you need to know how to use <code class=\"command\">find</code>."
msgstr ""
"このシリーズで最も汎用的なコマンドは <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x find-dired</kbd> "
"で、<code class=\"command\">find</code> で判定可能なあらゆる条件を指定できま"
"す。このコマンドは2つのミニバッファ引数 <var class=\"var\">directory</var> "
"と <var class=\"var\">find-args</var> を受け取り、<var "
"class=\"var\">directory</var> 内で <code class=\"command\">find</code> を実行"
"し、<var class=\"var\">find-args</var> を渡して <code "
"class=\"command\">find</code> にどの条件を判定すべきかを伝えます。このコマン"
"ドを使用するには、<code class=\"command\">find</code> の使い方を知っておく必"
"要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dired-and-Find.html
