#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
msgid ""
"<span>51.3.11 Disabling Commands<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Disabling-"
"Commands\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>51.3.11 コマンドの無効化<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Disabling-"
"Commands\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-disabled-command\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-disabled-command\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
msgid ""
"Disabling a command means that invoking it interactively asks for "
"confirmation from the user.  The purpose of disabling a command is to "
"prevent users from executing it by accident; we do this for commands that "
"might be confusing to the uninitiated."
msgstr ""
"コマンドを無効化するとは、対話的に呼び出した際にユーザーに確認を求めるように"
"なることを意味します。コマンドを無効化する目的は、ユーザーが誤って実行してし"
"まうのを防ぐことであり、不慣れな人にとって紛らわしい可能性のあるコマンドに対"
"してこの措置を講じます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
msgid ""
"Attempting to invoke a disabled command interactively in Emacs displays a "
"window containing the command&rsquo;s name, its documentation, and some "
"instructions on what to do immediately; then Emacs asks for input saying "
"whether to execute the command as requested, enable it and execute it, or "
"cancel.  If you decide to enable the command, you must then answer another "
"question&mdash;whether to do this permanently, or just for the current "
"session.  (Enabling permanently works by automatically editing your "
"initialization file.)  You can also type <kbd class=\"kbd\">!</kbd> to "
"enable <em class=\"emph\">all</em> commands, for the current session only."
msgstr ""
"Emacsで無効なコマンドを対話的に実行しようとすると、コマンド名、ドキュメント、"
"および直ちに行うべき操作に関する指示を含むウィンドウが表示されます。その後、"
"Emacsは、要求通りにコマンドを実行するか、有効にして実行するか、あるいはキャン"
"セルするかを問う入力を求めます。コマンドを有効にすることに決めた場合は、さら"
"に別の質問――これを恒久的に行うか、あるいは現在のセッションのみで行うか――に答"
"える必要があります。（恒久的に有効にするには、初期化ファイルが自動的に編集さ"
"れます。）また、<kbd class=\"kbd\">!</kbd> と入力することで、現在のセッション"
"に限り<em class=\"emph\">すべて</em>のコマンドを有効にすることもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
msgid ""
"The direct mechanism for disabling a command is to put a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">disabled</code> property on "
"the Lisp symbol for the command.  Here is the Lisp program to do this:"
msgstr ""
"コマンドを無効化する直接的な方法は、そのコマンドのLispシンボルに<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> <code class=\"code\">disabled</code>以外のプロパ"
"ティを設定することです。これを行うためのLispプログラムを以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(put 'delete-region 'disabled t)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
msgid ""
"If the value of the <code class=\"code\">disabled</code> property is a "
"string, that string is included in the message displayed when the command is "
"used:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">disabled</code> プロパティの値が文字列の場合、その文字列"
"はコマンド使用時に表示されるメッセージに含まれます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(put 'delete-region 'disabled\n"
"     &quot;It's better to use `kill-region' instead.\\n&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-command_002dquery\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-command_002dquery\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
msgid ""
"As a less heavy-handed alternative to disabling commands, you may want to be "
"queried before executing a command.  For instance, to be queried before "
"executing the <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&gt;</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">end-of-"
"buffer</code>)  command, you could put something like the following in your "
"init file:"
msgstr ""
"コマンドを無効化する手法よりも控えめな代替案として、コマンド実行前に確認を求"
"めるという方法があります。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&gt;</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">end-of-buffer</code>) コマンドの実行前に確認を行うには、init"
"ファイルに以下のような記述を追加します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(command-query\n"
" 'end-of-buffer\n"
" &quot;Do you really want to go to the end of the buffer?&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
msgid ""
"By default, you&rsquo;ll be queried with a <kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd>/<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> question, but if you give a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value to the third, optional argument, "
"you&rsquo;ll be queried with <kbd class=\"kbd\">yes</kbd>/<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">no</kbd> instead."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは <kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd>/<kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> の質問が"
"投げられますが、3番目のオプション引数に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外"
"の値を指定すると、代わりに <kbd class=\"kbd\">yes</kbd>/<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">no</kbd> の質問が投げられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-disable_002dcommand\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-enable_002dcommand\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-disable_002dcommand\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-enable_002dcommand\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
msgid ""
"You can make a command disabled either by editing the initialization file "
"directly, or with the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x disable-command</kbd>, "
"which edits the initialization file for you.  Likewise, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x enable-command</kbd> edits the initialization file to enable a command "
"permanently.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The Emacs "
"Initialization File</a>."
msgstr ""
"コマンドを無効にするには、初期化ファイルを直接編集するか、初期化ファイルを編"
"集してくれる <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x disable-command</kbd> コマンドを使用しま"
"す。同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x enable-command</kbd> は初期化ファイルを編"
"集して、コマンドを恒久的に有効にします。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Init-"
"File.html\">Emacs 初期化ファイル</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
msgid ""
"If Emacs was invoked with the <samp class=\"option\">-q</samp> or <samp "
"class=\"option\">--no-init-file</samp> options (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Initial-Options.html\">Initial Options</a>), it will not edit your "
"initialization file.  Doing so could lose information because Emacs has not "
"read your initialization file."
msgstr ""
"Emacsを<samp class=\"option\">-q</samp>または<samp class=\"option\">--no-"
"init-file</samp>オプション（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Initial-Options.html\">"
"初期オプション</a>を参照）付きで起動した場合、初期化ファイルは編集されませ"
"ん。そうすると、Emacsが初期化ファイルを読み込んでいないため、情報が失われる可"
"能性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Disabling.html
msgid ""
"Whether a command is disabled is independent of what key is used to invoke "
"it; disabling also applies if the command is invoked using <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd>.  However, disabling a command has no effect on "
"calling it as a function from Lisp programs."
msgstr ""
"コマンドが無効かどうかは、どのキーで呼び出すかとは無関係であり、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> を用いて呼び出す場合も無効になります。ただし、コマン"
"ドを無効にしても、Lisp プログラムから関数として呼び出す場合には影響はありませ"
"ん。"

