#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"This section describes variables that control miscellaneous aspects of the "
"appearance of the Emacs screen.  Beginning users can skip it."
msgstr ""
"本節では、Emacs画面の外観に関するさまざまな要素を制御する変数について説明しま"
"す。初心者の方は読み飛ばして構いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display_002dline_002dnumbers\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-number-lines-in-a-buffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display-line-numbers\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display_002dline_002dnumbers\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-number-lines-in-a-buffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display-line-numbers\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"If you want to have Emacs display line numbers for every line in the buffer, "
"customize the buffer-local variable <code class=\"code\">display-line-"
"numbers</code>; it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> by default.  This "
"variable can have several different values to support various modes of line-"
"number display:"
msgstr ""
"バッファの全行に行番号を表示させたい場合は、バッファローカル変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">display-line-numbers</code> をカスタマイズしてください。デフォ"
"ルトでは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となっています。この変数には、行番号"
"表示のさまざまなモードに対応させるため、複数の異なる値を設定できます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"Display (an absolute) line number before each non-continuation screen line "
"that displays buffer text.  If the line is a continuation line, or if the "
"entire screen line displays a display or an overlay string, that line will "
"not be numbered."
msgstr ""
"バッファテキストを表示する継続行以外の各画面行の前に、（絶対）行番号を表示し"
"ます。当該行が継続行である場合、または画面行全体に表示文字列やオーバーレイ文"
"字列が表示される場合は、その行に行番号は付与されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html build/html/emacs/Fortran-Comments.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">relative</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">relative</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"Display relative line numbers before non-continuation lines which show "
"buffer text.  The line numbers are relative to the line showing point, so "
"the numbers grow both up and down as lines become farther from the current "
"line."
msgstr ""
"バッファテキストを表示する非継続行の前に、相対行番号を表示します。行番号はポ"
"イントが表示されている行を基準とするため、行が現在の行から離れるにつれて、番"
"号は上下に変動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">visual</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">visual</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"This value causes Emacs to count lines visually: only lines actually shown "
"on the display will be counted (disregarding any lines in invisible parts of "
"text), and lines which wrap to consume more than one screen line will be "
"numbered that many times.  The displayed numbers are relative, as with <code "
"class=\"code\">relative</code> value above.  This is handy in modes that "
"fold text, such as Outline mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Outline-"
"Mode.html\">Outline Mode</a>), and when you need to move by exact number of "
"screen lines."
msgstr ""
"この値を指定すると、Emacsは行数を視覚的にカウントします。つまり、ディスプレイ"
"に実際に表示されている行のみがカウントされ（テキストの非表示部分にある行は無"
"視されます）、複数行にわたって表示される行は、その回数分だけ番号が振られま"
"す。表示される番号は、前述の <code class=\"code\">relative</code> 値と同様に"
"相対的なものです。これは、アウトラインモード（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Outline-Mode.html\">アウトラインモード</a> を参照）のようにテキストを"
"折りたたむモードや、正確な画面行数単位で移動する必要がある場合に便利です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid "anything else"
msgstr "その他"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"Any other non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value is treated as <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値はすべて<code class=\"code\">t</code>"
"として扱われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-global_002ddisplay_002dline_002dnumbers_002dmode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dtype\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-global_002ddisplay_002dline_002dnumbers_002dmode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dtype\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x display-line-numbers-mode</kbd> provides "
"a convenient way to turn on display of line numbers.  This mode has a "
"globalized variant, <code class=\"code\">global-display-line-numbers-mode</"
"code>.  The user option <code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-type</"
"code> controls which sub-mode of line-number display, described above, these "
"modes will activate."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x display-line-numbers-mode</kbd> を使用する"
"と、行番号表示を簡単に有効にできます。このモードには、グローバル版の <code "
"class=\"code\">global-display-line-numbers-mode</code> があります。ユーザーオ"
"プション <code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-type</code> では、前述の行"
"番号表示のサブモードのうち、どのモードを有効にするかを制御します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"Note that line numbers are not displayed in the minibuffer and in the "
"tooltips, even if you turn on <code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-"
"mode</code> globally."
msgstr ""
"なお、グローバルに <code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-mode</code> を有"
"効にしても、ミニバッファやツールチップには行番号が表示されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dcurrent_002dabsolute\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dcurrent_002dabsolute\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"When Emacs displays relative line numbers, you can control the number "
"displayed before the current line, the line showing point.  By default, "
"Emacs displays the absolute number of the current line there, even though "
"all the other line numbers are relative.  If you customize the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-current-absolute</code> to a <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value, the number displayed for the current line "
"will be zero.  This is handy if you don&rsquo;t care about the number of the "
"current line, and want to leave more horizontal space for text in large "
"buffers."
msgstr ""
"Emacsで相対行番号が表示される際、ポイントが表示されている現在の行の前に表示す"
"る行番号を制御できます。デフォルトでは、他の行番号はすべて相対的であるにもか"
"かわらず、Emacsはそこに現在の行の絶対行番号を表示します。変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-current-absolute</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の値にカスタマイズすると、現在の行に表示される番号"
"は 0 になります。これは、現在の行番号を気にせず、大きなバッファでテキスト用の"
"水平方向のスペースをより広く確保したい場合に便利です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dwiden\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dwiden\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"In a narrowed buffer (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Narrowing.html\">Narrowing</a>) lines are normally numbered starting "
"at the beginning of the narrowing.  However, if you customize the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-widen</code> to a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value, line numbers will disregard any narrowing "
"and will start at the first character of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"ナローイングされたバッファ（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Narrowing.html\">Narrowing</a>を参照）では、通常、ナローイングの開始位"
"置から行番号が振られます。ただし、変数 <code class=\"code\">display-line-"
"numbers-widen</code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値にカスタマイ"
"ズすると、行番号はナローイングを無視し、バッファの先頭文字から振られるように"
"なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002doffset\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002doffset\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"If the value of <code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-offset</code> is "
"non-zero, it is added to each absolute line number, and lines are counted "
"from the beginning of the buffer, as if <code class=\"code\">display-line-"
"numbers-widen</code> were non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  It has no "
"effect when set to zero, or when line numbers are not absolute."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-offset</code> の値が 0 以外の場合、"
"その値が各絶対行番号に加算され、あたかも <code class=\"code\">display-line-"
"numbers-widen</code> が non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> であるかのよう"
"に、バッファの先頭から行番号がカウントされます。この値が 0 に設定されている場"
"合や、行番号が絶対ではない場合には、効果はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dwidth_002dstart\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dgrow_002donly\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dwidth\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dwidth_002dstart\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dgrow_002donly\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dline_002dnumbers_002dwidth\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"In selective display mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Selective-"
"Display.html\">Selective Display</a>), and other modes that hide many lines "
"from display (such as Outline and Org modes), you may wish to customize the "
"variables <code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-width-start</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-grow-only</code>, or set <code "
"class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-width</code> to a large enough value, to "
"avoid occasional miscalculations of space reserved for the line numbers."
msgstr ""
"選択的表示モード（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Selective-Display.html\">選択的表"
"示</a>を参照）や、多くの行を非表示にするその他のモード（アウトラインモードや"
"Orgモードなど）では、行番号用に確保されたスペースの計算が時折誤るのを防ぐた"
"め、変数 <code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-width-start</code> と "
"<code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-grow-only</code> をカスタマイズした"
"り、<code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-width</code> を十分に大きな値に"
"設定したりすることがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line_002dnumber-face\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line_002dnumber-face\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"The line numbers are displayed in a special face <code class=\"code\">line-"
"number</code>.  The current line number is displayed in a different face, "
"<code class=\"code\">line-number-current-line</code>, so you can make the "
"current line&rsquo;s number have a distinct appearance, which will help "
"locating the line showing point.  Additional faces <code class=\"code\">line-"
"number-major-tick</code> and <code class=\"code\">line-number-minor-tick</"
"code> can be used to highlight the line numbers of lines which are a "
"multiple of certain numbers.  Customize <code class=\"code\">display-line-"
"numbers-major-tick</code> and <code class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-"
"minor-tick</code> respectively to set those numbers."
msgstr ""
"行番号は専用のフォント <code class=\"code\">line-number</code> で表示されま"
"す。現在の行番号は別のフォント <code class=\"code\">line-number-current-"
"line</code> で表示されるため、現在の行番号を際立たせることができ、ポイントが"
"表示されている行を特定するのに役立ちます。さらに、追加のフォント <code "
"class=\"code\">line-number-major-tick</code> と <code class=\"code\">line-"
"number-minor-tick</code> を使用して、特定の数値の倍数にあたる行の行番号を強調"
"表示できます。これらの数値を設定するには、それぞれ <code "
"class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-major-tick</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">display-line-numbers-minor-tick</code> をカスタマイズしてくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line_002dspacing\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line_002dspacing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">line-spacing</code> controls the vertical "
"spacing between lines.  It can be set to an integer (specifying pixels) or a "
"float (specifying spacing relative to the default frame font height).  You "
"can also set this variable to a cons cell of integers or floats, such as "
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">top</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">bottom</var>)</code>.  When set to a cons cell, the spacing is "
"distributed above and below the line, allowing for text to be vertically "
"centered within the line height. See also <a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Line-"
"Height.html#Line-Height\">Line Height</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs "
"Lisp Reference Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">line-spacing</code> は、行間の垂直方向の間隔を制御"
"します。整数（ピクセル指定）または浮動小数点数（デフォルトのフレームフォント"
"高さに対する相対的な間隔指定）で設定できます。また、<code "
"class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">top</var> . <var class=\"var\">bottom</"
"var>)</code> のように、整数や浮動小数点数のコンスセルをこの変数に設定すること"
"も可能です。コンスセルを設定した場合、間隔は行の上下に分散されるため、行の高"
"さ内でテキストを垂直方向に中央揃えにすることができます。<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Line-Height.html#Line-Height\">Line Height</a> も参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-visible_002dbell\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-visible_002dbell\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"If the variable <code class=\"code\">visible-bell</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs attempts to make the whole screen blink "
"when it would normally make an audible bell sound.  This variable has no "
"effect if your terminal does not have a way to make the screen blink."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">visible-bell</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、Emacs は通常であればベル音を鳴らすところを、画面全体を点滅"
"させようとします。この変数は、ターミナルに画面を点滅させる機能がない場合には"
"効果がありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-echo_002dkeystrokes\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-echo_002dkeystrokes\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">echo-keystrokes</code> controls the "
"echoing of multi-character keys; its value is the number of seconds of pause "
"required to cause echoing to start, or zero, meaning don&rsquo;t echo at "
"all.  The value takes effect when there is something to echo.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Echo-Area.html\">The Echo Area</a>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">echo-keystrokes</code> は複数文字キーのエコー動作を"
"制御します。その値は、エコーを開始させるために必要な待機秒数、または全くエ"
"コーさせないことを意味する 0 です。値は、エコーすべき内容がある場合に適用され"
"ます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Echo-Area.html\">エコーエリア</a> を参照してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-echo_002dkeystrokes_002dhelp\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-echo_002dkeystrokes_002dhelp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"If the variable <code class=\"code\">echo-keystrokes-help</code> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> (the default), the multi-character key "
"sequence echo shown according to <code class=\"code\">echo-keystrokes</code> "
"will include a short help text about keys which will invoke <code "
"class=\"code\">describe-prefix-bindings</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Misc-Help.html\">Other Help Commands</a>) to show the list of "
"commands for the prefix you already typed.  For a related help facility, see "
"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Key-Help.html#which_002dkey\">which-key</a>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">echo-keystrokes-help</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外（デフォルト）の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">echo-keystrokes</code> に従って表示されるマルチ文字キーシーケ"
"ンスのエコーには、既に入力したプレフィックスに対応するコマンド一覧を表示する"
"ために <code class=\"code\">describe-prefix-bindings</code> （<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Misc-Help.html\">その他のヘルプコマンド</a> を参照）を"
"呼び出すキーに関する短いヘルプテキストが含まれます。関連するヘルプ機能につい"
"ては、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Key-Help.html#which_002dkey\">which-key</a> を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse-pointer\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-hourglass-pointer-display\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-display_002dhourglass\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-hourglass_002ddelay\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse-pointer\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-hourglass-pointer-display\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-display_002dhourglass\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-hourglass_002ddelay\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"On graphical displays, Emacs displays the mouse pointer as an hourglass if "
"Emacs is busy.  To disable this feature, set the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">display-hourglass</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  "
"The variable <code class=\"code\">hourglass-delay</code> determines the "
"number of seconds of busy time before the hourglass is shown; the default is "
"1."
msgstr ""
"グラフィカルディスプレイでは、Emacsがビジー状態のとき、マウスポインタが砂時計"
"として表示されます。この機能を無効にするには、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">display-hourglass</code> に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を"
"設定してください。変数 <code class=\"code\">hourglass-delay</code> は、砂時計"
"が表示されるまでのビジー時間の秒数を決定します。デフォルト値は 1 です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-make_002dpointer_002dinvisible\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-make_002dpointer_002dinvisible\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"If the mouse pointer lies inside an Emacs frame, Emacs makes it invisible "
"each time you type a character to insert text, to prevent it from obscuring "
"the text.  (To be precise, the hiding occurs when you type a self-inserting "
"character.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Inserting-Text.html\">Inserting "
"Text</a>.)  Moving the mouse pointer makes it visible again.  To disable "
"this feature, set the variable <code class=\"code\">make-pointer-invisible</"
"code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"マウスポインタがEmacsフレーム内にある場合、テキストを挿入するために文字を入力"
"するたびに、テキストが隠れないようEmacsはポインタを非表示にします。（正確に"
"は、自己挿入文字を入力したときに非表示になります。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Inserting-Text.html\">テキストの挿入</a>を参照してください。）マウスポ"
"インタを動かすと、再び表示されるようになります。この機能を無効にするには、変"
"数 <code class=\"code\">make-pointer-invisible</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-underline_002dminimum_002doffset\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"x_002dunderline_002dat_002ddescent_002dline\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-underline_002dminimum_002doffset\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"x_002dunderline_002dat_002ddescent_002dline\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"On graphical displays, the variable <code class=\"code\">underline-minimum-"
"offset</code> determines the minimum distance between the baseline and "
"underline, in pixels, for underlined text.  By default, the value is 1; "
"increasing it may improve the legibility of underlined text for certain "
"fonts.  (However, Emacs will never draw the underline below the current line "
"area.)  The variable <code class=\"code\">x-underline-at-descent-line</code> "
"determines how to draw underlined text.  The default is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, which means to draw it at the baseline level of "
"the font; if you change it to <code class=\"code\">t</code>, Emacs draws the "
"underline at the same height as the font&rsquo;s descent line.  (If non-"
"default line spacing was specified for the underlined text, see <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Line-Height.html#Line-Height\">Line Height</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>, Emacs draws the "
"underline below the additional spacing.)"
msgstr ""
"グラフィカルディスプレイでは、変数 <code class=\"code\">underline-minimum-"
"offset</code> が、下線付きテキストのベースラインと下線の間の最小距離（ピクセ"
"ル単位）を決定します。デフォルト値は 1 で、これを大きくすると、特定のフォント"
"において下線付きテキストの可読性が向上する場合があります。（ただし、Emacs が"
"現在の行領域より下に下線を描画することはありません。）変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">x-underline-at-descent-line</code> は、下線付きテキストの描画"
"方法を決定します。デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で、これはフォ"
"ントのベースラインレベルで描画することを意味します。これを <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> に変更すると、Emacs はフォントのディセントラインと同"
"じ高さに下線を描画します。（下線付きテキストにデフォルト以外の行間隔が指定さ"
"れている場合は、<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> "
"の <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Line-Height.html#Line-Height\">Line Height</a> を参照してくだ"
"さい。その場合、Emacs は追加の間隔の下に下線を描画します。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-overline_002dmargin\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-overline_002dmargin\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">overline-margin</code> specifies the "
"vertical position of an overline above the text, including the height of the "
"overline itself, in pixels; the default is 2."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">overline-margin</code> は、オーバーライン自体の高さ"
"を含め、テキスト上方のオーバーラインの垂直位置をピクセル単位で指定します。デ"
"フォルト値は 2 です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"tty_002dsuppress_002dbold_002dinverse_002ddefault_002dcolors\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"tty_002dsuppress_002dbold_002dinverse_002ddefault_002dcolors\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"On some text terminals, bold face and inverse video together result in text "
"that is hard to read.  Call the function <code class=\"code\">tty-suppress-"
"bold-inverse-default-colors</code> with a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> argument to suppress the effect of bold-face in this case."
msgstr ""
"一部のテキスト端末では、太字と反転表示が組み合わさると、文字が読みづらくなり"
"ます。このような場合に太字の効果を抑制するには、<code class=\"code\">tty-"
"suppress-bold-inverse-default-colors</code> 関数を <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の引数で呼び出してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002draw_002dbytes_002das_002dhex\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002draw_002dbytes_002das_002dhex\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Display-Custom.html
msgid ""
"Raw bytes are displayed in octal format by default, for example a byte with "
"a decimal value of 128 is displayed as <code class=\"code\">\\200</code>.  "
"To change display to the hexadecimal format of <code class=\"code\">\\x80</"
"code>, set the variable <code class=\"code\">display-raw-bytes-as-hex</code> "
"to <code class=\"code\">t</code>.  Care may be needed when interpreting a "
"raw byte when copying text from a terminal containing an Emacs session, or "
"when a terminal&rsquo;s <code class=\"code\">escape-glyph</code> face looks "
"like the default face.  For example, by default Emacs displays the four "
"characters &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">2</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo;, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; with the same characters it "
"displays a byte with decimal value 128.  The problem can be worse with hex "
"displays, where the raw byte 128 followed by the character &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">7</samp>&rsquo; is displayed as <code class=\"code\">\\x807</"
"code>, which Emacs Lisp reads as the single character U+0807 SAMARITAN "
"LETTER IT; this confusion does not occur with the corresponding octal "
"display <code class=\"code\">\\2007</code> because octal escapes contain at "
"most three digits."
msgstr ""
"生バイトはデフォルトで8進数形式で表示されます。例えば、10進数値が128のバイト"
"は <code class=\"code\">\\200</code> と表示されます。表示形式を16進数形式の "
"<code class=\"code\">\\x80</code> に変更するには、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">display-raw-bytes-as-hex</code> に <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> を設定します。Emacsセッションが動作しているターミナルからテキストをコ"
"ピーする場合や、ターミナルの <code class=\"code\">escape-glyph</code> フェイ"
"スがデフォルトのフェイスに見える場合など、生バイトを解釈する際には注意が必要"
"です。例えば、デフォルトではEmacsは、10進数値128のバイトを表示するのと同じ文"
"字を用いて、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">2</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo;、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; の4文字を表示します。16進数表示で"
"はこの問題がさらに悪化することがあり、生バイト128に続いて文字 &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">7</samp>&rsquo; が表示されると <code class=\"code\">\\x807</"
"code> として表示され、Emacs Lispはこれを単一の文字 U+0807 SAMARITAN LETTER "
"IT として読み取ります。8進数のエスケープシーケンスには最大3桁の数字しか含まれ"
"ないため、対応する8進数表示 <code class=\"code\">\\2007</code> ではこのような"
"混乱は起こりません。"

