# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"Displaying the diary entries with <kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">diary-view-entries</code>) shows in a separate buffer the "
"diary entries for the selected date in the calendar.  The mode line of the "
"new buffer shows the date of the diary entries.  Holidays are shown either "
"in the buffer or in the mode line, depending on the display method you "
"choose (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Diary-Display.html\">Diary Display</"
"a>).  If you specify a numeric argument with <kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd>, it "
"shows all the diary entries for that many successive days.  Thus, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">2 d</kbd> displays all the entries for the selected date and "
"for the following day."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">diary-view-entries</code>) "
"で日記エントリを表示すると、カレンダーで選択した日付の日記エントリが別のバッ"
"ファに表示されます。新しいバッファのモードラインには、日記エントリの日付が表"
"示されます。祝日は、選択した表示方法に応じて、バッファまたはモードラインのい"
"ずれかに表示されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Diary-Display.html\">日記の表"
"示</a>を参照）。<kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> で数値引数を指定すると、その日数分"
"連続したすべての日記エントリが表示されます。したがって、<kbd class=\"kbd\">2 "
"d</kbd> では、選択した日付と翌日のすべてのエントリが表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"Another way to display the diary entries for a date is to click <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> on the date, and then choose <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">Diary entries</kbd> from the menu that appears.  If the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">calendar-view-diary-initially-flag</code> is "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, creating the calendar lists the diary "
"entries for the current date (provided the current date is visible)."
msgstr ""
"特定の日付の日記エントリを表示するもう一つの方法は、日付の<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd>をクリックし、表示されたメニューから<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">Diary entries</kbd>を選択することです。変数<code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-view-diary-initially-flag</code>が<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>でない場合、カレンダーを作成すると現在の日付の日記エ"
"ントリが一覧表示されます（現在の日付が表示されている場合に限ります）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-m-_0028Calendar-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dmark_002dentries\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dmark_002ddiary_002dentries_002dflag\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-m-_0028Calendar-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dmark_002dentries\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dmark_002ddiary_002dentries_002dflag\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"To get a broader view of which days are mentioned in the diary, use the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">m</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">diary-mark-entries</code>) "
"command.  This marks the dates that have diary entries in a different face.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Calendar-Customizing.html\">diary-entry-marker</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"日記にどの日付が記載されているかをより広範囲に把握するには、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">m</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">diary-mark-entries</code>) コマン"
"ドを使用してください。これにより、日記のエントリがある日付が異なる書体で表示"
"されます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Calendar-Customizing.html\">diary-entry-"
"marker</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"This command applies both to the months that are currently visible and to "
"those that subsequently become visible after scrolling.  To turn marking off "
"and erase the current marks, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">u</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-unmark</code>), which also turns off holiday marks "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Holidays.html\">Holidays</a>).  If the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">calendar-mark-diary-entries-flag</code> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, creating or updating the calendar marks "
"diary dates automatically."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、現在表示されている月と、スクロール後に順次表示される月の両方"
"に適用されます。マークをオフにして現在のマークを消去するには、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">u</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">calendar-unmark</code>) と入力し"
"てください。これにより祝日マークもオフになります（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Holidays.html\">祝日</a>を参照）。変数 <code class=\"code\">calendar-"
"mark-diary-entries-flag</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、カレンダーマークのダイアリー日付が自動的に作成または更新されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dnonmarking_002dsymbol\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dnonmarking_002dsymbol\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"To prevent an individual diary entry from being marked in the calendar, "
"insert the string that <code class=\"code\">diary-nonmarking-symbol</code> "
"specifies (the default is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&amp;</samp>&rsquo;) "
"at the beginning of the entry, before the date.  This has no effect on "
"display of the entry in the diary buffer; it only affects marks on dates in "
"the calendar.  Nonmarking entries can be useful for generic entries that "
"would otherwise mark many different dates."
msgstr ""
"個別の日記エントリがカレンダー上でマークされるのを防ぐには、<code "
"class=\"code\">diary-nonmarking-symbol</code> で指定される文字列（デフォルト"
"は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&amp;</samp>&rsquo;）を、エントリの冒頭、日付"
"の前に挿入してください。これは日記バッファにおけるエントリの表示には影響せ"
"ず、カレンダー上の日付へのマークにのみ影響します。マークしないエントリは、そ"
"のままでは多くの異なる日付にマークが付いてしまうような汎用的なエントリに有用"
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-s-_0028Calendar-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dshow_002dall_002dentries\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-s-_0028Calendar-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dshow_002dall_002dentries\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"To see the full diary file, rather than just some of the entries, use the "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">diary-show-all-entries</"
"code>) command."
msgstr ""
"一部のエントリだけでなく、日記ファイル全体を表示するには、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">diary-show-all-entries</code>) コ"
"マンドを使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary-1\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-diary_002dnumber_002dof_002dentries\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary-1\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-diary_002dnumber_002dof_002dentries\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x diary</kbd> displays the diary entries "
"for the current date, independently of the calendar display, and optionally "
"for the next few days as well; the variable <code class=\"code\">diary-"
"number-of-entries</code> specifies how many days to include.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Diary-Customizing.html\">diary-number-of-entries</a>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x diary</kbd> は、カレンダー表示とは独立して、"
"当日の日記エントリを表示し、オプションでその後数日間分も表示します。変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">diary-number-of-entries</code> で、含める日数を指定しま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Diary-Customizing.html\">diary-number-of-"
"entries</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"If you put <code class=\"code\">(diary)</code> in your <samp "
"class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> file, this automatically displays a window with "
"the day&rsquo;s diary entries when you start Emacs."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> ファイルに <code class=\"code\">(diary)</"
"code> を記述しておくと、Emacs の起動時にその日の日記エントリを表示するウィン"
"ドウが自動的に表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dmail_002dentries\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dmail_002ddays\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dmail_002dentries\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dmail_002ddays\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Displaying-the-Diary.html
msgid ""
"Some people like to receive email notifications of events in their diary.  "
"To send such mail to yourself, use the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x diary-"
"mail-entries</kbd>.  A prefix argument specifies how many days (starting "
"with today) to check; otherwise, the variable <code class=\"code\">diary-"
"mail-days</code> says how many days."
msgstr ""
"日記のイベントに関するメール通知を受け取りたいという方もいらっしゃいます。そ"
"のようなメールを自分宛てに送信するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x diary-mail-"
"entries</kbd> コマンドを使用してください。接頭辞引数で（本日から数えて）何日"
"間確認するかを指定します。指定しない場合は、変数 <code class=\"code\">diary-"
"mail-days</code> で日数が指定されます。"

