# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Distrib.html
msgid ""
"GNU Emacs is <em class=\"dfn\">free software</em>; this means that everyone "
"is free to use it and free to redistribute it under certain conditions.  GNU "
"Emacs is not in the public domain; it is copyrighted and there are "
"restrictions on its distribution, but these restrictions are designed to "
"permit everything that a good cooperating citizen would want to do.  What is "
"not allowed is to try to prevent others from further sharing any version of "
"GNU Emacs that they might get from you.  The precise conditions are found in "
"the GNU General Public License that comes with Emacs and also appears in "
"this manual<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF1\" href=\"#FOOT1\"><sup>1</sup></"
"a>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Copying.html\">GNU GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"GNU Emacsは<em class=\"dfn\">フリーソフトウェア</em>です。これは、誰もが自由"
"に利用でき、また一定の条件下で自由に再配布できることを意味します。GNU Emacsは"
"パブリックドメインではなく、著作権で保護されており、配布には制限があります"
"が、これらの制限は、良識ある協力的な市民が行いたいと思うあらゆる行為を認める"
"ように設計されています。禁止されているのは、他者があなたから入手したGNU Emacs"
"のいかなるバージョンについても、さらなる共有を妨げようとする行為です。具体的"
"な条件は、Emacsに付属し、本マニュアルにも記載されているGNU一般公衆ライセンス"
"<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF1\" href=\"#FOOT1\"><sup>1</sup></a>に規定され"
"ています。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Copying.html\">GNU GENERAL PUBLIC "
"LICENSE</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Distrib.html
msgid ""
"One way to get a copy of GNU Emacs is from someone else who has it.  You "
"need not ask for our permission to do so, or tell anyone else; just copy "
"it.  If you have access to the Internet, you can get the latest distribution "
"version of GNU Emacs by anonymous FTP; see <a class=\"url\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs\">https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs</a> on our "
"website for more information."
msgstr ""
"GNU Emacsを入手する方法の一つは、既に所有している人から譲り受けることです。そ"
