# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Navigation.html
msgid ""
"In DocView mode, you can scroll the current page using the usual Emacs "
"movement keys: <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd>, "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd>, and the arrow "
"keys."
msgstr ""
"DocViewモードでは、通常のEmacs移動キーである<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd>、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd>、および矢印キーを使って、現在のページをスクロールでき"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Navigation.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-doc_002dview_002dcontinuous\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-doc_002dview_002dcontinuous\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Navigation.html
msgid ""
"By default, the line-motion keys <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> stop scrolling at the beginning and end of the "
"current page, respectively.  However, if you change the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">doc-view-continuous</code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> value, then <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> displays the previous page if "
"you are already at the beginning of the current page, and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> displays the next page if you are at the end of the "
"current page."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、行移動キー <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> は、それぞれ現在のページの先頭と末尾でスクロールを停"
"止します。ただし、変数 <code class=\"code\">doc-view-continuous</code> を "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に変更すると、すでに現在のページの先"
"頭にいる場合は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> が前のページを表示し、現在のペー"
"ジの末尾にいる場合は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> が次のページを表示します。"

