# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Navigation.html
msgid ""
"You can also display the next page by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd>, "
"<kbd class=\"key\">PageDown</kbd>, <kbd class=\"key\">next</kbd> or <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x ]</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">doc-view-next-page</code>).  "
"To display the previous page, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">p</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"key\">PageUp</kbd>, <kbd class=\"key\">prior</kbd> or <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x [</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">doc-view-previous-page</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"また、<kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd>、<kbd class=\"key\">PageDown</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">next</kbd>、または<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x ]</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">doc-view-next-page</code>) と入力することで、次のページを表示"
"できます。前のページを表示するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">p</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">PageUp</kbd>、<kbd class=\"key\">prior</kbd>、または<kbd "
