# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Navigation.html
msgid ""
"You can save the current page to a register with <kbd class=\"kbd\">m</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">doc-view-page-to-register</code>) (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Registers.html\">Registers</a>).  However, these "
"registers are not shared across buffers and stay local to the DocView "
"buffer.  You can later jump to the saved page with <kbd class=\"kbd\">'</"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">doc-view-jump-to-register</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在のページを <kbd class=\"kbd\">m</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">doc-view-"
"page-to-register</code>) でレジスタに保存できます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Registers.html\">レジスタ</a>を参照）。ただし、これらのレジスタはバッ"
"ファ間で共有されず、DocView バッファ内に限定されます。保存したページには、後"
"で <kbd class=\"kbd\">'</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">doc-view-jump-to-"
"register</code>) でジャンプできます。"

