#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Slicing.html
msgid ""
"<span>39.3 DocView Slicing<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#DocView-"
"Slicing-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>39.3 DocView スライシング<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#DocView-"
"Slicing-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Slicing.html
msgid ""
"Documents often have wide margins for printing.  They are annoying when "
"reading the document on the screen, because they use up screen space and can "
"cause inconvenient scrolling."
msgstr ""
"文書には印刷用に広い余白が設けられていることがよくあります。画面上で文書を読"
"む際、画面スペースを占有し、スクロールに手間がかかるため、煩わしく感じられま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Slicing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-doc_002dview_002dset_002dslice\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"doc_002dview_002dset_002dslice_002dusing_002dmouse\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-doc_002dview_002dset_002dslice\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"doc_002dview_002dset_002dslice_002dusing_002dmouse\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Slicing.html
msgid ""
"With DocView you can hide these margins by selecting a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">slice</em> of pages to display.  A slice is a rectangle within "
"the page area; once you specify a slice in DocView, it applies to whichever "
"page you look at."
msgstr ""
"DocViewでは、表示するページの<em class=\"dfn\">スライス</em>を選択すること"
"で、これらの余白を非表示にできます。スライスとはページ領域内の矩形のことで、"
"DocViewでスライスを指定すると、閲覧中のどのページにも適用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Slicing.html
msgid ""
"To specify the slice numerically, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">c s</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">doc-view-set-slice</code>); then enter the top left pixel "
"position and the slice&rsquo;s width and height."
msgstr ""
"スライスを数値で指定するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">c s</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">doc-view-set-slice</code>) と入力し、次に左上のピクセル位置と"
"スライスの幅・高さを入力してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Slicing.html
msgid ""
"A more convenient graphical way to specify the slice is with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">c m</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">doc-view-set-slice-using-"
"mouse</code>), where you use the mouse to select the slice.  Simply press "
"and hold the left mouse button at the upper-left corner of the region you "
"want to have in the slice, then move the mouse pointer to the lower-right "
"corner and release the button."
msgstr ""
"スライスを指定するより便利なグラフィカルな方法として <kbd class=\"kbd\">c m</"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">doc-view-set-slice-using-mouse</code>) があり、マ"
"ウスを使ってスライスを選択します。スライスに含めたい領域の左上隅でマウスの左"
"ボタンを押したまま、マウスポインタを右下隅まで移動させ、ボタンを離してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Slicing.html
msgid ""
"The most convenient way is to set the optimal slice by using BoundingBox "
"information automatically determined from the document by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">c b</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">doc-view-set-slice-from-"
"bounding-box</code>)."
msgstr ""
"最も便利な方法は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">c b</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">doc-"
"view-set-slice-from-bounding-box</code>) と入力してドキュメントから自動的に判"
"定される BoundingBox 情報を用いて、最適なスライスを設定することです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Slicing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-doc_002dview_002dreset_002dslice\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-doc_002dview_002dreset_002dslice\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/DocView-Slicing.html
msgid ""
"To cancel the selected slice, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">c r</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">doc-view-reset-slice</code>).  Then DocView shows the entire "
"page including its entire margins."
msgstr ""
"選択したスライスをキャンセルするには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">c r</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">doc-view-reset-slice</code>) と入力してください。すると、"
"DocView に余白を含むページ全体が表示されます。"

