# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"<span>31.7 Dynamic Abbrev Expansion<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Dynamic-Abbrev-Expansion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>31.7 動的略語展開<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Dynamic-Abbrev-"
"Expansion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"The abbrev facility described above operates automatically as you insert "
"text, but all abbrevs must be defined explicitly.  By contrast, <em "
"class=\"dfn\">dynamic abbrevs</em> allow the meanings of abbreviations to be "
"determined automatically from the contents of the buffer, but dynamic abbrev "
"expansion happens only when you request it explicitly."
msgstr ""
"前述の略語機能は、テキストを挿入すると自動的に動作しますが、すべての略語は明"
"示的に定義しておく必要があります。これに対し、<em class=\"dfn\">動的略語</em>"
"では、バッファの内容から略語の意味を自動的に決定できますが、動的略語の展開は"
"明示的に要求した場合にのみ行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002d_002f\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dM_002d_002f\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-dabbrev_002dexpand\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dabbrev_002dcompletion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002d_002f\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dM_002d_002f\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-dabbrev_002dexpand\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dabbrev_002dcompletion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"Expand the word in the buffer before point as a <em class=\"dfn\">dynamic "
"abbrev</em>, by searching for words starting with that abbreviation (<code "
"class=\"code\">dabbrev-expand</code>)."
msgstr ""
"ポイント前のバッファ内の単語を、その略語で始まる単語（<code "
"class=\"code\">dabbrev-expand</code>）を検索することで<em class=\"dfn\">動的"
"略語</em>として展開します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-/</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-/</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"Complete the word before point as a dynamic abbrev (<code "
"class=\"code\">dabbrev-completion</code>)."
msgstr ""
"point の前の単語を動的な略語 (<code class=\"code\">dabbrev-completion</"
"code>) として補完してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dabbrev_002dlimit\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dabbrev_002dlimit\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"For example, if the buffer contains &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">does this "
"follow </samp>&rsquo; and you type <kbd class=\"kbd\">f o M-/</kbd>, the "
"effect is to insert &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">follow</samp>&rsquo; because "
"that is the last word in the buffer that starts with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">fo</samp>&rsquo;.  A numeric argument to <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd> says to take the second, third, etc. distinct "
"expansion found looking backward from point.  Repeating <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd> searches for an alternative expansion by looking "
"farther back.  After scanning all the text before point, it searches the "
"text after point.  The variable <code class=\"code\">dabbrev-limit</code>, "
"if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, specifies how far away in the buffer "
"to search for an expansion."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dabbrev_002dcheck_002dall_002dbuffers\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-dabbrev_002dcheck_002dother_002dbuffers\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-dabbrev_002dignored_002dbuffer_002dmodes\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dabbrev_002dcheck_002dall_002dbuffers\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-dabbrev_002dcheck_002dother_002dbuffers\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-dabbrev_002dignored_002dbuffer_002dmodes\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"After scanning the current buffer, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd> normally "
"searches other buffers.  The variables <code class=\"code\">dabbrev-check-"
"all-buffers</code> and <code class=\"code\">dabbrev-check-other-buffers</"
"code> can be used to determine which other buffers, if any, are searched.  "
"Buffers that have major modes derived from any of the modes in <code "
"class=\"code\">dabbrev-ignored-buffer-modes</code> are ignored."
msgstr ""
"現在のバッファをスキャンした後、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd> は通常、他のバッ"
"ファを検索します。変数 <code class=\"code\">dabbrev-check-all-buffers</code> "
"および <code class=\"code\">dabbrev-check-other-buffers</code> を使用して、他"
"にどのバッファを検索するか（もしあれば）を指定できます。<code "
"class=\"code\">dabbrev-ignored-buffer-modes</code> のいずれかのモードから派生"
"したメジャーモードを持つバッファは無視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dabbrev_002dignored_002dbuffer_002dnames\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-dabbrev_002dignored_002dbuffer_002dregexps\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dabbrev_002dignored_002dbuffer_002dnames\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-dabbrev_002dignored_002dbuffer_002dregexps\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"For finer control over which buffers to scan, customize the variables <code "
"class=\"code\">dabbrev-ignored-buffer-names</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">dabbrev-ignored-buffer-regexps</code>.  The value of the "
"former is a list of buffer names to skip.  The value of the latter is a list "
"of regular expressions; if a buffer&rsquo;s name matches any of these "
"regular expressions, dynamic abbrev expansion skips that buffer."
msgstr ""
"スキャン対象のバッファをより細かく制御するには、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">dabbrev-ignored-buffer-names</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">dabbrev-ignored-buffer-regexps</code> をカスタマイズしてくださ"
"い。前者の値は、スキップするバッファ名のリストです。後者の値は正規表現のリス"
"トであり、バッファ名がこれらの正規表現のいずれかに一致した場合、動的略記展開"
"はそのバッファをスキップします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"A negative argument to <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd>, as in <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u - M-/</kbd>, says to search first for expansions after "
"point, then other buffers, and consider expansions before point only as a "
"last resort.  If you repeat the <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd> to look for "
"another expansion, do not specify an argument.  Repeating <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd> cycles through all the expansions after point and "
"then the expansions before point."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd> に対する負の引数（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u - M-/</"
"kbd> など）は、まずポイント以降の展開を検索し、次に他のバッファを検索し、ポイ"
"ント以前の展開は最終手段としてのみ検討することを指定します。別の展開を探すた"
"めに <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd> を繰り返す場合は、引数を指定しないでくださ"
"い。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd> を繰り返すと、ポイント以降のすべての展開と、"
"その後ポイント以前の展開を順に巡回します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"After you have expanded a dynamic abbrev, you can copy additional words that "
"follow the expansion in its original context.  Simply type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> M-/</kbd> for each additional "
"word you want to copy.  The spacing and punctuation between words is copied "
"along with the words."
msgstr ""
"動的略語を展開した後、その展開に続く追加の単語を元の文脈のままコピーできま"
"す。コピーしたい追加単語ごとに <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">SPC</"
"kbd> M-/</kbd> と入力するだけです。単語間のスペースや句読点も、単語と一緒にコ"
"ピーされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"You can control the way <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd> determines the word to "
"expand and how to expand it, see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Dabbrev-"
"Customization.html\">Customizing Dynamic Abbreviation</a>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd> が展開する単語をどのように決定し、どのように展開"
"するかを制御できます。詳細は <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Dabbrev-"
"Customization.html\">動的略語のカスタマイズ</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-/</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dabbrev-"
"completion</code>) performs completion of a dynamic abbrev.  Instead of "
"trying the possible expansions one by one, it finds all of them, then "
"inserts the text that they have in common.  If they have nothing in common, "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-/</kbd> displays a list of completions, from which "
"you can select a choice in the usual manner.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Completion.html\">Completion</a>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-/</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dabbrev-"
"completion</code>) は、動的略語の補完を行います。考えられる展開候補を一つずつ"
"試すのではなく、すべての候補を特定し、それらに共通するテキストを挿入します。"
"共通する部分がない場合は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-/</kbd> が補完候補の一覧を表"
"示し、そこから通常の方法で選択できます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Completion.html\">Completion</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Dynamic-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"Dynamic abbrev expansion is completely independent of Abbrev mode; the "
"expansion of a word with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd> is completely "
"independent of whether it has a definition as an ordinary abbrev."
msgstr ""
"動的略語展開は略語モードとは完全に独立しており、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-/</kbd> "
"による単語の展開は、それが通常の略語として定義されているかどうかとは完全に無"
"関係です。"

