# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Early-Init-File.html
msgid ""
"Most customizations for Emacs should be put in the normal init file.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The Emacs Initialization File</a>.  "
"However, it is sometimes necessary to have customizations take effect during "
"Emacs startup earlier than the normal init file is processed.  Such "
"customizations can be put in the early init file, <samp "
"class=\"file\">~/.config/emacs/early-init.el</samp> or <samp "
"class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/early-init.el</samp>.  This file is loaded before "
"the package system and GUI is initialized, so in it you can customize "
"variables that affect the package initialization process, such as <code "
"class=\"code\">package-enable-at-startup</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">package-load-list</code>, and <code class=\"code\">package-"
"user-dir</code>.  Note that variables like <code class=\"code\">package-"
"archives</code> which only affect the installation of new packages, and not "
"the process of making already-installed packages available, may be "
"customized in the regular init file.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Package-"
"Installation.html\">Package Installation</a>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsのカスタマイズの大部分は、通常のinitファイルに記述すべきです。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">Emacs初期化ファイル</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。ただし、通常のinitファイルが処理されるよりも早い、Emacs起動時にカスタマ"
"イズを反映させる必要がある場合があります。そのようなカスタマイズは、初期init"
"ファイルである<samp class=\"file\">~/.config/emacs/early-init.el</samp>または"
"<samp class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/early-init.el</samp>に記述できます。このファ"
"イルはパッケージシステムやGUIが初期化される前に読み込まれるため、<code "
"class=\"code\">package-enable-at-startup</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">package-load-list</code>、<code class=\"code\">package-user-"
"dir</code>など、パッケージの初期化プロセスに影響を与える変数をカスタマイズで"
"きます。なお、<code class=\"code\">package-archives</code>のように新規パッ"
"ケージのインストールにのみ影響し、既にインストール済みのパッケージを利用可能"
"にするプロセスには影響しない変数は、通常のinitファイルでカスタマイズできる点"
"に注意してください。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Package-Installation.html\">パッ"
"ケージのインストール</a>を参照してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Early-Init-File.html
msgid ""
"We do not recommend that you move into <samp class=\"file\">early-init.el</"
"samp> customizations that can be left in the normal init files.  That is "
"because the early init file is read before the GUI is initialized, so "
"customizations related to GUI features will not work reliably in <samp "
"class=\"file\">early-init.el</samp>.  By contrast, the normal init files are "
"read after the GUI is initialized.  If you must have customizations in the "
"early init file that rely on GUI features, make them run off hooks provided "
"by the Emacs startup, such as <code class=\"code\">window-setup-hook</code> "
"or <code class=\"code\">tty-setup-hook</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Hooks.html\">Hooks</a>."
msgstr ""

