# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Easy-Customization.html
msgid ""
"Emacs has many <em class=\"dfn\">settings</em> which you can change.  Most "
"settings are <em class=\"dfn\">customizable variables</em> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Variables.html\">Variables</a>), which are also "
"called <em class=\"dfn\">user options</em>.  There is a huge number of "
"customizable variables, controlling numerous aspects of Emacs behavior; the "
"variables documented in this manual are listed in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Variable-Index.html\">Variable Index</a>.  A separate class of "
"settings are the <em class=\"dfn\">faces</em>, which determine the fonts, "
"colors, and other attributes of text (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Faces.html\">Text Faces</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Emacsには、変更可能な<em class=\"dfn\">設定</em>が数多くあります。ほとんどの"
"設定は<em class=\"dfn\">カスタマイズ可能な変数</em>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Variables.html\">変数</a>を参照）であり、これらは<em class=\"dfn\">"
"ユーザーオプション</em>とも呼ばれます。Emacsの動作の多岐にわたる側面を制御す"
"るカスタマイズ可能な変数は膨大な数に及び、本マニュアルで解説されている変数は"
"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Variable-Index.html\">変数索引</a>に一覧されていま"
"す。また、別の種類の設定として<em class=\"dfn\">フェイス</em>があり、これはテ"
"キストのフォントや色、その他の属性を決定します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Faces.html\">テキストフェイス</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
