# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Easy-Customization.html
msgid ""
"To browse and alter settings (both variables and faces), type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x customize</kbd>.  This creates a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">customization buffer</em>, which lets you navigate through a "
"logically organized list of settings, edit and set their values, and save "
"them permanently."
msgstr ""
"設定（変数とフェイスの両方）を閲覧・変更するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"customize</kbd> と入力してください。これにより<em class=\"dfn\">カスタマイズ"
"バッファ</em>が作成され、論理的に整理された設定リストを辿って値を編集・設定"
"し、恒久的に保存できるようになります。"

