msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-echo-area\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Echo-Area.html
msgid ""
"The line at the very bottom of the frame is the <em class=\"dfn\">echo area</"
"em>.  It is used to display small amounts of text for various purposes."
msgstr ""
"フレームの最下部にある線は<em class=\"dfn\">エコーエリア</em>です。さまざまな"
"目的で少量のテキストを表示するために使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Echo-Area.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-echoing\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-echoing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Echo-Area.html
msgid ""
"The echo area is so-named because one of the things it is used for is <em "
"class=\"dfn\">echoing</em>, which means displaying the characters of a multi-"
"character command as you type.  Single-character commands are not echoed.  "
"Multi-character commands (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keys.html\">Keys</"
"a>) are echoed if you pause for more than a second in the middle of a "
"command.  Emacs then echoes all the characters of the command so far, to "
"prompt you for the rest.  Once echoing has started, the rest of the command "
"echoes immediately as you type it.  This behavior is designed to give "
"confident users fast response, while giving hesitant users maximum feedback."
msgstr ""
"エコーエリアがそう呼ばれるのは、そこで行われる機能の一つに<em class=\"dfn\">"
"エコー</em>（複数文字のコマンドを入力する際に、その文字を表示すること）がある"
"ためです。単一文字のコマンドはエコーされません。複数文字のコマンド（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keys.html\">キー</a>を参照）は、コマンドの途中で1秒以"
"上間を置くとエコーされます。するとEmacsは、それまでのコマンドのすべての文字を"
"エコーし、残りの入力を促します。一度エコーが始まると、それ以降のコマンドは入"
"力すると同時に即座にエコーされます。この動作は、熟練したユーザーに迅速なレス"
"ポンスを提供する一方で、ためらいがちなユーザーには最大限のフィードバックを与"
"えるように設計されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Echo-Area.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-error-message\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-echo-area-message\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-error-message\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-echo-area-message\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Echo-Area.html
msgid ""
"The echo area is also used to display an <em class=\"dfn\">error message</"
"em> when a command cannot do its job.  Error messages may be accompanied by "
"beeping or by flashing the screen."
msgstr ""
"エコー領域は、コマンドが処理を実行できなかった際に<em class=\"dfn\">エラー"
"メッセージ</em>を表示するためにも使用されます。エラーメッセージには、ビープ音"
"や画面の点滅が伴う場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Echo-Area.html
msgid ""
"Some commands display informative messages in the echo area to tell you what "
"the command has done, or to provide you with some specific information.  "
"These <em class=\"dfn\">informative</em> messages, unlike error messages, "
"are not accompanied with a beep or flash.  For example, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x =</kbd> (hold down <kbd class=\"key\">Ctrl</kbd> and type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">x</kbd>, then let go of <kbd class=\"key\">Ctrl</kbd> and type "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">=</kbd>) displays a message describing the character at "
"point, its position in the buffer, and its current column in the window.  "
"Commands that take a long time often display messages ending in &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">...</samp>&rsquo; while they are working (sometimes also "
"indicating how much progress has been made, as a percentage), and add &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">done</samp>&rsquo; when they are finished."
msgstr ""
"一部のコマンドは、コマンドが何を行ったかを知らせたり、特定の情報を提供したり"
"するために、エコー領域に情報メッセージを表示します。これらの<em "
"class=\"dfn\">情報</em>メッセージは、エラーメッセージとは異なり、ビープ音や点"
"滅を伴いません。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x =</kbd>（<kbd "
"class=\"key\">Ctrl</kbd>を押したまま<kbd class=\"kbd\">x</kbd>を入力し、次に"
"<kbd class=\"key\">Ctrl</kbd>を離して<kbd class=\"kbd\">=</kbd>を入力する）で"
"は、ポイントにある文字、バッファ内での位置、およびウィンドウ内での現在の列を"
"説明するメッセージが表示されます。処理に時間がかかるコマンドは、実行中に末尾"
"が&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">...</samp>&rsquo;となるメッセージを表示し（場合"
"によっては進捗率をパーセントで示すこともあります）、完了時に&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">done</samp>&rsquo;を追加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Echo-Area.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_002aMessages_002a-buffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-saved-echo-area-messages\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-messages-saved-from-echo-area\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-message_002dlog_002dmax\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_002aMessages_002a-buffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-saved-echo-area-messages\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-messages-saved-from-echo-area\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-message_002dlog_002dmax\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Echo-Area.html
msgid ""
"Informative echo area messages are saved in a special buffer named <samp "
"class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp>.  (We have not explained buffers yet; see "
"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Buffers.html\">Using Multiple Buffers</a>, for more "
"information about them.)  If you miss a message that appeared briefly on the "
"screen, you can switch to the <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> buffer "
"to see it again.  The <samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> buffer is "
"limited to a certain number of lines, specified by the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">message-log-max</code>.  (We have not explained variables "
"either; see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Variables.html\">Variables</a>, for more "
"information about them.)  Beyond this limit, one line is deleted from the "
"beginning whenever a new message line is added at the end."
msgstr ""
"情報系のエコーエリアメッセージは、<samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> とい"
"う名前の専用バッファに保存されます。（バッファについてはまだ説明していませ"
"ん。詳細については、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Buffers.html\">複数のバッファの使"
"用</a>を参照してください。）画面に一瞬表示されたメッセージを見逃した場合は、"
"<samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> バッファに切り替えて再度確認できます。"
"<samp class=\"file\">*Messages*</samp> バッファは、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">message-log-max</code> で指定される一定の行数に制限されていま"
"す。（変数についてもまだ説明していません。詳細については、<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Variables.html\">変数</a>を参照してください。）この制限を超えると、末"
"尾に新しいメッセージ行が追加されるたびに、先頭から1行が削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Echo-Area.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Display-Custom.html\">Customization of Display</"
"a>, for options that control how Emacs uses the echo area."
msgstr ""
"Emacsのエコーエリアの使用方法を制御するオプションについては、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Display-Custom.html\">表示のカスタマイズ</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Echo-Area.html
msgid ""
"The echo area is also used to display the <em class=\"dfn\">minibuffer</em>, "
"a special window where you can input arguments to commands, such as the name "
"of a file to be edited.  When the minibuffer is in use, the text displayed "
"in the echo area begins with a <em class=\"dfn\">prompt string</em>, and the "
"active cursor appears within the minibuffer, which is temporarily considered "
"the selected window.  You can always get out of the minibuffer by typing "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Minibuffer.html\">The Minibuffer</a>."
msgstr ""
"エコーエリアは、<em class=\"dfn\">ミニバッファ</em>の表示にも使用されます。ミ"
