# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Edit-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Edit the last 300 keystrokes as a keyboard macro (<code "
