# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Edit-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kmacro_002dedit_002dmacro\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-C_002de\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-RET\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kmacro_002dedit_002dmacro\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-C_002de\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-RET\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Edit-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"You can edit the last keyboard macro by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-"
"e</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">kmacro-edit-macro</code>).  This formats the macro "
"definition in a buffer and enters a specialized major mode for editing it.  "
"Type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h m</kbd> once in that buffer to display details "
"of how to edit the macro.  When you are finished editing, type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-e</kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-edit-macro</"
"code>) と入力することで、直前のキーボードマクロを編集できます。これにより、"
"バッファ内でマクロ定義が整形され、編集用の専用メジャーモードに入ります。その"
"バッファ内で <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h m</kbd> を1回入力すると、マクロの編集方法"
"の詳細が表示されます。編集が完了したら、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c</kbd> と入"
"力してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Edit-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-edmacro_002dinsert_002dkey\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"edmacro_002dset_002dmacro_002dto_002dregion_002dlines\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-edmacro_002dinsert_002dkey\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"edmacro_002dset_002dmacro_002dto_002dregion_002dlines\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Edit-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">edmacro-mode</code>, the major mode used by <code "
"class=\"code\">kmacro-edit-macro</code>, provides commands for more easily "
"editing the formatted macro.  Use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-q</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">edmacro-insert-key</code>) to insert the next key sequence "
"that you type into the buffer using the correct format, similar to <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-q</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">quoted-insert</code>).  Use "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-r</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">edmacro-set-macro-to-"
"region-lines</code>) to replace the macro&rsquo;s text with the text in the "
"region.  If the region does not begin at the start of a line or if it does "
"not end at the end of a line, the region is extended to include complete "
"lines.  If the region ends at the beginning of a line, that final line is "
"excluded."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">kmacro-edit-macro</code> で使用されるメジャーモードであ"
"る <code class=\"code\">edmacro-mode</code> は、書式設定済みマクロをより簡単"
"に編集するためのコマンドを提供します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-q</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">quoted-insert</code>) と同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-q</"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">edmacro-insert-key</code>) を使用すると、次に入力"
"したキーシーケンスを正しい形式でバッファに挿入できます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"c C-r</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">edmacro-set-macro-to-region-lines</code>) "
"を使用すると、マクロのテキストをリージョン内のテキストで置き換えることができ"
"ます。リージョンが行頭で始まっていない場合や、行末で終わっていない場合は、完"
"全な行が含まれるようにリージョンが拡張されます。リージョンが行頭で終わってい"
"る場合、その最後の行は除外されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Edit-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-edit_002dkbd_002dmacro\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-e\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-edit_002dkbd_002dmacro\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-e\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Edit-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"You can edit a named keyboard macro or a macro bound to a key by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">edit-kbd-macro</code>).  "
"Follow that with the keyboard input that you would use to invoke the "
"macro&mdash;<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x e</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var></kbd> or some other key sequence."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">edit-kbd-macro</"
"code>) と入力することで、名前付きのキーボードマクロやキーに割り当てられたマク"
"ロを編集できます。その後に、マクロを呼び出す際に使用するキーボード入力&mdash;"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x e</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var></kbd>、あるいはその他のキーシーケンス&mdash;を続けて"
"入力してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Edit-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kmacro_002dedit_002dlossage\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"edmacro_002dreverse_002dmacro_002dlines\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-l\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kmacro_002dedit_002dlossage\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"edmacro_002dreverse_002dmacro_002dlines\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-l\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Edit-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"You can edit the last 300 keystrokes as a macro by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k l</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-edit-lossage</"
"code>).  By default, your most recent keystrokes are listed at the bottom of "
"the buffer.  To list a macro&rsquo;s key sequences in reverse order, set "
"<code class=\"code\">edmacro-reverse-macro-lines</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k l</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-edit-"
"lossage</code>) と入力することで、直近300回のキー入力をマクロとして編集できま"
"す。デフォルトでは、直近のキー入力がバッファの下部に一覧表示されます。マクロ"
"のキーシーケンスを逆順に表示するには、<code class=\"code\">edmacro-reverse-"
"macro-lines</code> を <code class=\"code\">t</code> に設定してください。"

