# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/EditorConfig-support.html
msgid ""
"The <a class=\"uref\" href=\"https://editorconfig.org/\">EditorConfig "
"standard</a> is an alternative to the <samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</"
"samp> files, which can control only a very small number of variables, but "
"has the advantage of being editor-neutral, not specific to Emacs.  Those "
"settings are stored in files named <samp class=\"file\">.editorconfig</"
"samp>, and affect the files in that directory and its subdirectories."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"uref\" href=\"https://editorconfig.org/\">EditorConfig標準</a>は、"
"ごく少数の変数しか制御できない<samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp>ファ"
"イルに代わる手法であり、Emacsに限定されずエディタに依存しないという利点があり"
"ます。これらの設定は<samp class=\"file\">.editorconfig</samp>という名前のファ"
"イルに保存され、そのディレクトリおよびそのサブディレクトリ内のファイルに適用"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/EditorConfig-support.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-editorconfig_002dmode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-enable_002dlocal_002dvariables_002c-and-"
"EditorConfig-settings\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-editorconfig_002dmode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-enable_002dlocal_002dvariables_002c-and-"
"EditorConfig-settings\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/EditorConfig-support.html
msgid ""
"If you want Emacs to obey the settings from <samp "
"class=\"file\">.editorconfig</samp> files, you need to enable the <code "
"class=\"code\">editorconfig-mode</code> global minor mode.  This is usually "
"all that is needed: when the mode is activated, whenever a file is visited, "
"Emacs will look for <samp class=\"file\">.editorconfig</samp> in the "
"file&rsquo;s directory and its parent directories, just as it does for <samp "
"class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp>.  When both <samp "
"class=\"file\">.editorconfig</samp> and <samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</"
"samp> files are found, their settings are combined, and in case of a "
"conflict, the setting coming from the file closest in the directory "
"hierarchy takes precedence.  If they are equally close, <samp "
"class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp> takes precedence.  In terms of "
"security, the <samp class=\"file\">.editorconfig</samp> settings are subject "
"to the same checks as those coming from <samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</"
"samp> and from file-local variables (and also honor <code "
"class=\"code\">enable-local-variables</code>).  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Safe-File-Variables.html\">Safety of File Variables</a>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsに<samp class=\"file\">.editorconfig</samp>ファイルの設定を適用させたい"
"場合は、<code class=\"code\">editorconfig-mode</code>グローバルマイナーモード"
"を有効にする必要があります。通常、これだけで十分です。このモードが有効になる"
"と、ファイルを開くたびに、Emacsは<samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp>の"
"場合と同様に、ファイルのディレクトリおよびその親ディレクトリ内で<samp "
"class=\"file\">.editorconfig</samp>を探します。<samp "
"class=\"file\">.editorconfig</samp>と<samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</"
"samp>の両方のファイルが見つかった場合、それらの設定が統合され、競合が生じた場"
"合は、ディレクトリ階層においてより近いファイルの設定が優先されます。両者が等"
"しく近い場合は、<samp class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp>が優先されます。セ"
"キュリティ面では、<samp class=\"file\">.editorconfig</samp>の設定は、<samp "
"class=\"file\">.dir-locals.el</samp>やファイルローカル変数からの設定と同様の"
"チェック対象となります（また、<code class=\"code\">enable-local-variables</"
"code>も適用されます）。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Safe-File-Variables.html\">"
"ファイル変数の安全性</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/EditorConfig-support.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-indent_005fsize-setting-of-"
"EditorConfig\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"editorconfig_002dindent_002dsize_002dvars\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-editorconfig_002dindentation_002dalist\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-indent_005fsize-setting-of-"
"EditorConfig\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"editorconfig_002dindent_002dsize_002dvars\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-editorconfig_002dindentation_002dalist\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/EditorConfig-support.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">indent_size</code> setting of the EditorConfig "
"standard does not correspond to a fixed variable in Emacs, but instead needs "
"to set different variables depending on the major mode.  Ideally all major "
"modes should set the corresponding <code class=\"code\">editorconfig-indent-"
"size-vars</code>, but if you use a major mode in which <code "
"class=\"code\">indent_size</code> does not take effect because the major "
"mode does not yet support it, you can customize the <code "
"class=\"code\">editorconfig-indentation-alist</code> variable to tell Emacs "
"which variables need to be set in that major mode."
msgstr ""
"EditorConfig 標準の <code class=\"code\">indent_size</code> 設定は、Emacs の"
"固定変数に対応するものではなく、メジャーモードに応じて異なる変数を設定する必"
"要があります。理想的には、すべてのメジャーモードが対応する <code "
"class=\"code\">editorconfig-indent-size-vars</code> を設定すべきですが、メ"
"ジャーモードがまだ対応していないために <code class=\"code\">indent_size</"
"code> が機能しない場合は、そのメジャーモードでどの変数を設定すべきかを Emacs "
"に伝えるために、<code class=\"code\">editorconfig-indentation-alist</code> 変"
"数をカスタマイズできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/EditorConfig-support.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-trim_005ftrailing_005fwhitespace-"
"setting-of-EditorConfig\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"editorconfig_002dtrim_002dwhitespaces_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-delete_002dtrailing_002dwhitespace_002c-and-EditorConfig-"
"settings\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-trim_005ftrailing_005fwhitespace-"
"setting-of-EditorConfig\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"editorconfig_002dtrim_002dwhitespaces_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-delete_002dtrailing_002dwhitespace_002c-and-EditorConfig-"
"settings\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/EditorConfig-support.html
msgid ""
"Similarly, there are several different ways to trim whitespace at the end of "
"lines.  When the EditorConfig <code class=\"code\">trim_trailing_whitespace</"
"code> setting is used, by default <code class=\"code\">editorconfig-mode</"
"code> simply calls <code class=\"code\">delete-trailing-whitespace</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Useless-Whitespace.html\">Useless Whitespace</"
"a>) every time you save your file.  If you prefer some other behavior, you "
"can customize <code class=\"code\">editorconfig-trim-whitespaces-mode</code> "
"to the minor mode of your preference, such as <code class=\"code\">ws-butler-"
"mode</code>."
msgstr ""
"同様に、行末の空白文字をトリミングする方法もいくつかあります。EditorConfig "
"の <code class=\"code\">trim_trailing_whitespace</code> 設定を使用している場"
"合、デフォルトでは <code class=\"code\">editorconfig-mode</code> はファイルを"
"保存するたびに単に <code class=\"code\">delete-trailing-whitespace</code> を"
"呼び出します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Useless-Whitespace.html\">Useless "
"Whitespace</a> を参照）。別の動作を希望する場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">editorconfig-trim-whitespaces-mode</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">ws-butler-mode</code> など、好みのマイナーモードに合わせてカス"
"タマイズできます。"

