#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Electric-C.html
msgid ""
"<span>28.12.2 Electric C Characters<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Electric-C-Characters\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>28.12.2 電気C文字<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Electric-C-"
"Characters\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Electric-C.html
msgid ""
"In C mode and related modes, certain printing characters are <em "
"class=\"dfn\">electric</em>&mdash;in addition to inserting themselves, they "
"also reindent the current line, and optionally also insert newlines.  The "
"electric characters are <kbd class=\"kbd\">{</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">}</"
"kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">:</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">#</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">;</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">,</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">&lt;</"
"kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">&gt;</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">/</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">*</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">(</kbd>, and <kbd class=\"kbd\">)</"
"kbd>."
msgstr ""
"Cモードおよび関連モードでは、特定の印刷文字が<em class=\"dfn\">エレクトリック"
"</em>となります。これらの文字は、自身を挿入するだけでなく、現在の行を再インデ"
"ントし、オプションで改行も挿入します。エレクトリック文字は、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">{</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">}</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">:</"
"kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">#</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">;</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">,</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">&lt;</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">&gt;"
"</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">/</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">*</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">(</kbd>、および<kbd class=\"kbd\">)</kbd>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Electric-C.html
msgid ""
"You might find electric indentation inconvenient if you are editing "
"chaotically indented code.  If you are new to CC Mode, you might find it "
"disconcerting.  You can toggle electric action with the command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-l</kbd>; when it is enabled, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">/<var class=\"var\">c</var>l</samp>&rsquo; appears in the "
"mode line after the mode name (where <var class=\"var\">c</var>, if present, "
"is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">/</samp>&rsquo;, depending on whether the comment style is "
"block or line).  See <a data-manual=\"ccmode\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/ccmode/Minor-Modes.html#Minor-Modes\">Minor "
"Modes</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The CC Mode Manual</cite>, for more about "
"mode-line indicators in CC Mode."
msgstr ""
"インデントが乱雑なコードを編集する場合、電動インデントが不便に感じられるかも"
"しれません。CCモードを使い始めたばかりの方には、違和感があるかもしれません。"
"電動アクションはコマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-l</kbd> で切り替え可能で"
"す。有効にすると、モード名の後のモードラインに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/"
"<var class=\"var\">c</var>l</samp>&rsquo; と表示されます（<var "
"class=\"var\">c</var> が存在する場合は、コメントスタイルがブロックか行かに応"
"じて &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">/</samp>&rsquo; となります）。CCモードにおけるモードラインのイ"
"ンジケーターの詳細については、<cite class=\"cite\">The CC Mode Manual</cite> "
"の <a data-manual=\"ccmode\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/ccmode/Minor-Modes.html#Minor-Modes\">Minor Modes</a> を参照"
"してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Electric-C.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"c_002dtoggle_002delectric_002dstate\"></a> <a id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dl-"
"_0028C-mode_0029\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-l</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dc-C_002dl-_0028C-mode_0029\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"c_002dtoggle_002delectric_002dstate\"></a> <a id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dl-"
"_0028C-mode_0029\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-l</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dc-C_002dl-_0028C-mode_0029\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Electric-C.html
msgid ""
"Toggle electric action (<code class=\"code\">c-toggle-electric-state</"
"code>).  With a positive prefix argument, this command enables electric "
"action, with a negative one it disables it."
msgstr ""
"エレクトリックアクションの切り替え (<code class=\"code\">c-toggle-electric-"
"state</code>)。接頭辞引数が正の場合はエレクトリックアクションを有効にし、負の"
"場合は無効にします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Electric-C.html
msgid ""
"Electric characters insert newlines only when, in addition to the electric "
"state, the <em class=\"dfn\">auto-newline</em> feature is enabled (indicated "
"by &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/<var class=\"var\">c</var>la</samp>&rsquo; "
"in the mode line after the mode name).  You can turn this feature on or off "
"with the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-a</kbd>:"
msgstr ""
"電動文字が改行を挿入するのは、電動状態に加えて<em class=\"dfn\">auto-"
"newline</em>機能が有効になっている場合のみです（モード名の後のモードラインに"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/<var class=\"var\">c</var>la</samp>&rsquo;と表示"
"されます）。この機能は、コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-a</kbd> で有効また"
"は無効にできます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
