#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Emergency-Escape.html
msgid ""
"<span>53.7 Emergency Escape<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Emergency-"
"Escape-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>53.7 非常脱出<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Emergency-Escape-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Emergency-Escape.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-emergency-escape\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-emergency-escape\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Emergency-Escape.html
msgid ""
"On text terminals, the <em class=\"dfn\">emergency escape</em> feature "
"suspends Emacs immediately if you type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> a second "
"time before Emacs can actually respond to the first one by quitting.  This "
"is so you can always get out of GNU Emacs no matter how badly it might be "
"hung.  When things are working properly, Emacs recognizes and handles the "
"first <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> so fast that the second one won&rsquo;t "
"trigger emergency escape.  However, if some problem prevents Emacs from "
"handling the first <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> properly, then the second "
"one will get you back to the shell."
msgstr ""
"テキスト端末では、<em class=\"dfn\">緊急エスケープ</em>機能により、Emacsが1回"
"目の入力に応答して終了する前に2回目の<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd>を入力する"
"と、直ちにEmacsが一時停止します。これは、GNU Emacsがどれほど深刻な状態でハン"
"グしていても、常にそこから脱出できるようにするためです。正常に動作している場"
"合、Emacsは1回目の<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd>を非常に高速に認識して処理する"
"ため、2回目の入力で緊急エスケープがトリガーされることはありません。しかし、何"
"らかの問題でEmacsが1回目の<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd>を適切に処理できない場"
"合、2回目の入力によってシェルに戻ることになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Emergency-Escape.html
msgid ""
"When you resume Emacs after a suspension caused by emergency escape, it "
"reports the resumption and asks a question or two before going back to what "
"it had been doing:"
msgstr ""
"緊急エスケープによる中断からEmacsを再開すると、再開を通知し、1、2問の質問を投"
"げかけた後、元の処理に戻ります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Emergency-Escape.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Emacs is resuming after an emergency escape.\n"
"Auto-save? (y or n)\n"
"Abort (and dump core)? (y or n)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Emergency-Escape.html
msgid ""
"Answer each question with <kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd> or <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> followed by <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"各質問には <kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> の後"
"に <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> を続けて回答してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Emergency-Escape.html
msgid ""
"Saying <kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd> to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Auto-save?</"
"samp>&rsquo; causes immediate auto-saving of all modified buffers in which "
"auto-saving is enabled.  Saying <kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> skips this.  This "
"question is omitted if Emacs is in a state where auto-saving cannot be done "
"safely."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd> を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Auto-save?</"
"samp>&rsquo; に指定すると、自動保存が有効なすべての変更済みバッファが即座に自"
"動保存されます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> を指定すると、この処理はスキップさ"
"れます。Emacs が安全に自動保存できない状態にある場合、この質問は省略されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Emergency-Escape.html
msgid ""
"Saying <kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd> to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Abort (and "
"dump core)?</samp>&rsquo; causes Emacs to crash, dumping core.  This is to "
"enable a wizard to figure out why Emacs was failing to quit in the first "
"place.  Execution does not continue after a core dump."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd> を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Abort (and dump "
"core)?</samp>&rsquo; に指定すると、Emacs がクラッシュしてコアダンプが発生しま"
"す。これは、ウィザードがそもそもなぜ Emacs が終了できなかったのかを突き止めら"
"れるようにするためです。コアダンプが発生すると、実行は続行されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Emergency-Escape.html
msgid ""
"If you answer this question <kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd>, Emacs execution "
"resumes.  With luck, Emacs will ultimately do the requested quit.  If not, "
"each subsequent <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> invokes emergency escape again."
msgstr ""
"この質問 <kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> に回答すると、Emacs の実行が再開されま"
"す。うまくいけば、最終的に Emacs は要求された終了処理を行います。そうでない場"
"合は、それ以降の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> ごとに再度緊急エスケープが呼び"
"出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Emergency-Escape.html
msgid ""
"If Emacs is not really hung, just slow, you may invoke the double <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> feature without really meaning to.  Then just resume "
"and answer <kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> to both questions, and you will get "
"back to the former state.  The quit you requested will happen by and by."
msgstr ""
"Emacsが完全にフリーズしているのではなく、単に動作が遅いだけの場合、意図せずダ"
"ブル <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> 機能が呼び出されることがあります。その場合"
"は、そのまま再開して両方の質問に <kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> と回答すれば、元"
"の状態に戻ります。リクエストした終了処理は、いずれ実行されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Emergency-Escape.html
msgid ""
"Emergency escape is active only for text terminals.  On graphical displays, "
"you can use the mouse to kill Emacs or switch to another program."
msgstr ""
"緊急脱出機能はテキスト端末でのみ有効です。グラフィカルディスプレイでは、マウ"
"スを使ってEmacsを終了させたり、別のプログラムに切り替えたりできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Emergency-Escape.html
msgid ""
"On MS-DOS, you must type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">Break</"
"kbd></kbd> (twice) to cause emergency escape&mdash;but there are cases where "
"it won&rsquo;t work, when a system call hangs or when Emacs is stuck in a "
"tight loop in C code."
msgstr ""
"MS-DOSでは、緊急脱出を行うために <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">Break</kbd></kbd> を（2回）入力する必要があります&mdash;ただ"
"し、システムコールがハングしたり、EmacsがCコードのタイトなループに陥ったりし"
"た場合には、機能しないことがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Emergency-Escape.html
msgid ""
"Emergency escape is not available in graphical frames, or in text-mode "
"frames where the terminal emulator supports the Kitty Keyboard Protocol and "
"you have not disabled use of that protocol (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Terminal-Init.html\">Terminal-specific Initialization</a>)."
msgstr "グラフィカルフレーム、またはターミナルエミュレータがKitty Keyboard Protocolをサポートしており、かつ同プロトコルの使用を無効にしていないテキストモードフレームでは、緊急エスケープは利用できません（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Terminal-Init.html\">ターミナル固有の初期化</a>を参照）。"

