#: build/html/emacs/Enriched-Indentation.html
msgid ""
"<span>27.14.5 Indentation in Enriched Text<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Indentation-in-Enriched-Text\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>27.14.5 リッチテキストにおけるインデント<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Indentation-in-Enriched-Text\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Enriched-Indentation.html
msgid ""
"In Enriched mode, you can specify different amounts of indentation for the "
"right or left margin of a paragraph or a part of a paragraph.  These margins "
"also affect fill commands such as <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Filling.html\">Filling Text</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Enrichedモードでは、段落または段落の一部の右マージンや左マージンに、それぞれ"
"異なるインデント量を指定できます。これらのマージンは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"q</kbd> などの塗りつぶしコマンドにも影響します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Filling.html\">テキストの塗りつぶし</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Enriched-Indentation.html
msgid ""
"The Indentation submenu of Text Properties offers commands for specifying "
"indentation:"
msgstr ""
"「テキストプロパティ」の「インデント」サブメニューには、インデントを指定する"
"ためのコマンドが用意されています："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Enriched-Indentation.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-increase_002dleft_002dmargin\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-C_002dx-TAB-_0028Enriched-mode_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">Indent More</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"C_002dx-TAB-_0028Enriched-mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-increase_002dleft_002dmargin\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-C_002dx-TAB-_0028Enriched-mode_0029\"></a><span><code "
