# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Enriched-Indentation.html
msgid ""
"Indent the region by 4 columns (<code class=\"code\">increase-left-margin</"
"code>).  In Enriched mode, this command is also available on <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd>; if you supply a "
"numeric argument, that says how many columns to add to the margin (a "
