#: build/html/emacs/Enriched-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<span>27.14.7 Setting Other Text Properties<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Setting-Other-Text-Properties\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>27.14.7 その他のテキストプロパティの設定<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Setting-Other-Text-Properties\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Enriched-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The Special Properties submenu of Text Properties has entries for adding or "
"removing four other text properties: <code class=\"code\">read-only</code>, "
"(which disallows alteration of the text), <code class=\"code\">invisible</"
"code> (which hides text), <code class=\"code\">intangible</code> (which "
"disallows moving point within the text), and <code class=\"code\">charset</"
"code> (which is important for selecting a proper font to display a "
"character).  The &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Remove Special</samp>&rsquo; "
"menu item removes all of these special properties from the text in the "
"region."
msgstr ""
"「テキストプロパティ」の「特殊プロパティ」サブメニューには、他の4つのテキスト"
"プロパティを追加または削除するための項目があります：<code "
"class=\"code\">read-only</code>（テキストの変更を禁止）、<code "
"class=\"code\">invisible</code>（テキストを非表示にする）、<code "
"class=\"code\">intangible</code>（テキスト内でのポイント移動を禁止）、および"
"<code class=\"code\">charset</code>（文字を表示するための適切なフォントを選択"
"する際に重要）。「<samp class=\"samp\">Remove Special</samp>」メニュー項目"
"は、リージョン内のテキストからこれらすべての特殊プロパティを削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Enriched-Properties.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">invisible</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">intangible</code> properties are not saved."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">invisible</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">intangible</code> プロパティは保存されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Enriched-Properties.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"enriched_002dallow_002deval_002din_002ddisplay_002dprops\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-security_002c-when-displaying-enriched-"
"text\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"enriched_002dallow_002deval_002din_002ddisplay_002dprops\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-security_002c-when-displaying-enriched-"
"text\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Enriched-Properties.html
msgid ""
"Enriched mode also supports saving and restoring <code "
"class=\"code\">display</code> properties (see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Display-"
"Property.html#Display-Property\">Display Property</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">the Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>), which affect how "
"text is displayed on the screen, and also allow displaying images and "
"strings that come from sources other than buffer text.  The <code "
"class=\"code\">display</code> properties also support execution of arbitrary "
"Lisp forms as part of processing the property for display, thus providing a "
"means to dynamically tailor the display to some conditions that can only be "
"known at display time.  Since execution of arbitrary Lisp opens Emacs to "
"potential attacks, especially when the source of enriched text is outside of "
"Emacs or even outside of your system (e.g., if it was received in an email "
"message), such execution is by default disabled in Enriched mode.  You can "
"enable it by customizing the variable <code class=\"code\">enriched-allow-"
"eval-in-display-props</code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"Enrichedモードでは、画面上のテキスト表示に影響を与える<code "
"class=\"code\">display</code>プロパティ（<cite class=\"cite\">Emacs Lisp "
"Reference Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Display-Property.html#Display-"
"Property\">Display Property</a>を参照）の保存と復元もサポートしており、バッ"
"ファテキスト以外のソースから得られる画像や文字列の表示も可能です。また、"
"<code class=\"code\">display</code>プロパティでは、表示用プロパティの処理の一"
"環として任意のLispフォームを実行できるため、表示時にのみ判明する条件に応じ"
"て、表示内容を動的に調整することが可能です。任意のLispの実行は、特にエンリッ"
"チドテキストのソースがEmacs外、あるいはシステム外（例：電子メールで受信した場"
"合など）である場合に、Emacsを潜在的な攻撃にさらす可能性があるため、Enriched"
"モードではデフォルトでこの実行機能が無効になっています。変数<code "
"class=\"code\">enriched-allow-eval-in-display-props</code>を<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値にカスタマイズすることで、この機能を有効にで"
"きます。"

