msgstr ""
"<span>C.4 環境変数<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Environment-"
"Variables\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Environment.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-environment-variables\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-environment-variables\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Environment.html
msgid ""
"The <em class=\"dfn\">environment</em> is a feature of the operating system; "
"it consists of a collection of variables with names and values.  Each "
"variable is called an <em class=\"dfn\">environment variable</em>; "
"environment variable names are case-sensitive, and it is conventional to use "
"upper case letters only.  The values are all text strings."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">環境</em>はオペレーティングシステムの機能であり、名前と値を"
"持つ変数の集合で構成されています。各変数は<em class=\"dfn\">環境変数</em>と呼"
"ばれます。環境変数の名前は大文字と小文字を区別し、通常は大文字のみが使用され"
"ます。値はすべてテキスト文字列です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Environment.html
msgid ""
"What makes the environment useful is that subprocesses inherit the "
"environment automatically from their parent process.  This means you can set "
"up an environment variable in your login shell, and all the programs you run "
"(including Emacs) will automatically see it.  Subprocesses of Emacs (such as "
"shells, compilers, and version control programs) inherit the environment "
"from Emacs, too."
msgstr ""
"環境が有用なのは、サブプロセスが親プロセスから自動的に環境を継承する点にあり"
"ます。つまり、ログインシェルで環境変数を設定すれば、実行するすべてのプログラ"
"ム（Emacsを含む）がそれを自動的に認識できるということです。Emacsのサブプロセ"
"ス（シェル、コンパイラ、バージョン管理プログラムなど）も同様に、Emacsから環境"
"を継承します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Environment.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-setenv\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-getenv\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"initial_002denvironment\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-setenv\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-getenv\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"initial_002denvironment\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Environment.html
msgid ""
"Inside Emacs, the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x getenv</kbd> reads the name "
"of an environment variable, and prints its value in the echo area.  <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x setenv</kbd> sets a variable in the Emacs environment, and "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-x setenv</kbd> removes a variable.  (Environment "
"variable substitutions with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo; work "
"in the value just as in file names; see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"File-"
"Names.html#File-Names-with-_0024\">File Names with $</a>.)  The variable "
"<code class=\"code\">initial-environment</code> stores the initial "
"environment inherited by Emacs."
msgstr ""
"Emacs内では、コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x getenv</kbd> は環境変数の名前を"
"読み取り、その値をエコーエリアに出力します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x setenv</"
"kbd> はEmacs環境に変数を設定し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-x setenv</kbd> は変"
"数を削除します。（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo; による環境変数"
"の置換は、ファイル名と同様に値に対しても機能します。<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"File-Names.html#File-Names-with-_0024\">$ を含むファイル名</a>を参照し"
"てください。）変数 <code class=\"code\">initial-environment</code> には、"
"Emacsが継承した初期環境が格納されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Environment.html
msgid ""
"The way to set environment variables outside of Emacs depends on the "
"operating system, and especially the shell that you are using.  For example, "
"here&rsquo;s how to set the environment variable <code "
"class=\"env\">ORGANIZATION</code> to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">not very "
"much</samp>&rsquo; using Bash:"
msgstr ""
"Emacs外で環境変数を設定する方法は、オペレーティングシステム、特に使用している"
"シェルによって異なります。例えば、Bashを使って環境変数 <code "
"class=\"env\">ORGANIZATION</code> を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">not very "
"much</samp>&rsquo; に設定する方法は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Environment.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "export ORGANIZATION=&quot;not very much&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Environment.html
msgid "and here&rsquo;s how to do it in csh or tcsh:"
msgstr "それでは、cshまたはtcshでのやり方は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Environment.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "setenv ORGANIZATION &quot;not very much&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Environment.html
msgid ""
"When Emacs is using the X Window System, various environment variables that "
"control X work for Emacs as well.  See the X documentation for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
