# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Error-in-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"If your string is not found at all, the echo area says &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Failing I-Search</samp>&rsquo;, and the cursor moves past the "
"place where Emacs found as much of your string as it could.  Thus, if you "
"search for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FOOT</samp>&rsquo;, and there is no "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FOOT</samp>&rsquo;, you might see the cursor "
"after the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>&rsquo; in &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOOL</samp>&rsquo;.  In the echo area, the part of the search "
"string that failed to match is highlighted using the face <code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-fail</code>."
msgstr ""
"文字列が全く見つからない場合、エコーエリアには &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Failing I-Search</samp>&rsquo; と表示され、カーソルは Emacs が"
"可能な限り文字列を検出できた位置を通り過ぎます。したがって、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOOT</samp>&rsquo; を検索し、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOOT</samp>&rsquo; が存在しない場合、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOOL</samp>&rsquo; 内の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FOO</"
"samp>&rsquo; の後にカーソルが表示されることがあります。エコーエリアでは、検索"
"文字列の中で一致しなかった部分がフェイス <code class=\"code\">isearch-fail</"
"code> でハイライトされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Error-in-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"At this point, there are several things you can do.  If your string was "
"mistyped, use <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> to cancel a previous input item "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-Isearch.html\">Basics of Incremental "
"Search</a>), <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-d</kbd> to erase one character at a "
"time, or <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-e</kbd> to edit it.  If you like the place you "
"have found, you can type <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> to remain there.  Or "
"you can type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd>, which removes from the search "
"string the characters that could not be found (the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">T</samp>&rsquo; in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FOOT</"
"samp>&rsquo;), leaving those that were found (the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>&rsquo; in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FOOT</"
"samp>&rsquo;).  A second <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> at that point cancels "
"the search entirely, returning point to where it was when the search started."
msgstr ""
"この時点で、いくつかの操作が可能です。文字列の入力に誤りがあった場合は、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> で直前の入力項目を取り消し（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Basic-Isearch.html\">インクリメンタル検索の基本</a>を参照）、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-d</kbd> で1文字ずつ消去し、あるいは <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"e</kbd> で編集することができます。見つかった箇所が気に入った場合は、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力してその位置に留まることができます。あるいは "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> と入力すれば、検索文字列から見つからなかった文字"
"（<samp class=\"samp\">FOOT</samp> 内の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">T</"
"samp>&rsquo;）を削除し、見つかった文字（<samp class=\"samp\">FOOT</samp> 内"
"の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>&rsquo;）だけを残すことができます。"
"その状態で再度 <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> と入力すると、検索が完全にキャン"
"セルされ、カーソルが検索開始時の位置に戻ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Error-in-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quitting-_0028in-search_0029\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dg-_0028Incremental-"
"search_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quitting-_0028in-search_0029\"></a> "
