msgstr ""
"<span>51.2.1 変数の確認と設定<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Examining-"
"and-Setting-Variables\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-setting-variables\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-setting-variables\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html build/html/emacs/Help-Summary.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h v <var class=\"var\">var</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h v <var class=\"var\">var</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid ""
"Display the value and documentation of variable <var class=\"var\">var</var> "
"(<code class=\"code\">describe-variable</code>)."
msgstr ""
"変数 <var class=\"var\">var</var> (<code class=\"code\">describe-variable</"
"code>) の値とドキュメントを表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x set-variable <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">var</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x set-variable <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">var</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid ""
"Change the value of variable <var class=\"var\">var</var> to <var "
"class=\"var\">value</var>."
msgstr ""
"変数<var class=\"var\">var</var>の値を<var class=\"var\">value</var>に変更し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid ""
"To examine the value of a variable, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h v</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">describe-variable</code>).  This reads a variable name "
"using the minibuffer, with completion, and displays both the value and the "
"documentation of the variable.  For example,"
msgstr ""
"変数の値を確認するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h v</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">describe-variable</code>) を使用します。これにより、ミニバッ"
"ファを用いて補完機能付きで変数名が読み込まれ、その変数の値とドキュメントの両"
"方が表示されます。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "C-h v fill-column <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid "displays something like this:"
msgstr "次のような表示になります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"fill-column is a variable defined in &lsquo;C source code&rsquo;.\n"
"Its value is 70\n"
"\n"
"  Automatically becomes buffer-local when set.\n"
"  This variable is safe as a file local variable if its value\n"
"  satisfies the predicate &lsquo;integerp&rsquo;.\n"
"  Probably introduced at or before Emacs version 18.\n"
"\n"
"Documentation:\n"
"Column beyond which automatic line-wrapping should happen.\n"
"Interactively, you can set the buffer local value using C-x f.\n"
"\n"
"You can customize this variable.\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid ""
"The line that says &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">You can customize the "
"variable</samp>&rsquo; indicates that this variable is a user option.  <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h v</kbd> is not restricted to user options; it allows non-"
"customizable variables too."
msgstr ""
"「<samp class=\"samp\">You can customize the variable</samp>」と記述された行"
"は、この変数がユーザーオプションであることを示しています。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h v</kbd>はユーザーオプションに限定されず、カスタマイズ不可能"
"な変数も指定可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-set_002dvariable\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-set_002dvariable\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid ""
"The most convenient way to set a specific customizable variable is with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x set-variable</kbd>.  This reads the variable name with the "
"minibuffer (with completion), and then reads a Lisp expression for the new "
"value using the minibuffer a second time (you can insert the old value into "
"the minibuffer for editing via <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd>).  For example,"
msgstr ""
"特定のカスタマイズ可能な変数を設定する最も便利な方法は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x set-variable</kbd> を使用することです。これにより、ミニバッファ（補完機能付"
"き）で変数名が読み込まれ、次に再度ミニバッファを使用して新しい値となる Lisp "
"式が読み込まれます（<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> を使えば、編集用に古い値をミ"
"ニバッファに挿入できます）。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "M-x set-variable <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> fill-column <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> 75 <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid "sets <code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> to 75."
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> を 75 に設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x set-variable</kbd> is limited to customizable "
"variables, but you can set any variable with a Lisp expression like this:"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x set-variable</kbd> はカスタマイズ可能な変数に限定され"
"ていますが、次のような Lisp 式を用いて任意の変数を設定できます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq fill-column 75)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid ""
"To execute such an expression, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-:</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">eval-expression</code>)  and enter the expression in the "
"minibuffer (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lisp-Eval.html\">Evaluating Emacs "
"Lisp Expressions</a>).  Alternatively, go to the <samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> buffer, type in the expression, and then "
"type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lisp-"
"Interaction.html\">Lisp Interaction Buffers</a>)."
msgstr ""
"このような式を実行するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-:</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">eval-expression</code>) と入力し、ミニバッファに式を入力してく"
"ださい（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lisp-Eval.html\">Emacs Lisp式の評価</a>を参"
"照）。あるいは、<samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> バッファに移動して式を"
"入力し、その後 <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> と入力してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lisp-Interaction.html\">Lispインタラクションバッファ</"
"a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid ""
"Setting variables, like all means of customizing Emacs except where "
"otherwise stated, affects only the current Emacs session.  The only way to "
"alter the variable in future sessions is to put something in your "
"initialization file (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The "
"Emacs Initialization File</a>)."
msgstr ""
"特に断りのない限り、Emacsをカスタマイズするあらゆる手段と同様に、変数の設定は"
"現在のEmacsセッションにのみ影響します。今後のセッションで変数を変更する唯一の"
"方法は、初期化ファイルに記述することです（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-"
"File.html\">Emacs初期化ファイル</a>を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-setopt\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-setopt\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid ""
"If you&rsquo;re setting a customizable variable, and you don&rsquo;t want to "
"use the Customize interface, you can use the <code class=\"code\">setopt</"
"code> macro.  For instance:"
msgstr ""
"カスタマイズ可能な変数を設定し、カスタマイズインターフェースを使用したくない"
"場合は、<code class=\"code\">setopt</code> マクロを使用できます。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
#, no-wrap
msgid " M-: (setopt fill-column 75) <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid "Or, if you want to do this in your initialization file:"
msgstr "あるいは、初期化ファイルで次のように記述することも可能です："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
#, no-wrap
msgid " (setopt fill-column 75)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid ""
"This works the same as <code class=\"code\">setq</code>, but if the variable "
"has any special setter functions, they will be run automatically when using "
"<code class=\"code\">setopt</code>.  You can also use <code "
"class=\"code\">setopt</code> on other, non-customizable variables, but this "
"is less efficient than using <code class=\"code\">setq</code>."
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">setq</code> と同様に動作しますが、変数に特殊な"
"セッター関数が定義されている場合、<code class=\"code\">setopt</code> を使用す"
"るとそれらが自動的に実行されます。また、カスタマイズ不可能な他の変数に対して "
"<code class=\"code\">setopt</code> を使用することもできますが、これは <code "
"class=\"code\">setq</code> を使用するよりも効率が劣ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-setopt_002dlocal\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-setopt_002dlocal\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Examining.html
msgid ""
"There is also a buffer-local version of <code class=\"code\">setopt</code>, "
"called <code class=\"code\">setopt-local</code>, that you can use to set "
"buffer specific values for customizable options, for example, in mode hooks "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Hooks.html\">Hooks</a>)."
msgstr ""
"また、<code class=\"code\">setopt</code> のバッファローカル版である <code "
"class=\"code\">setopt-local</code> もあり、これを使用して、例えばモードフック"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Hooks.html\">Hooks</a> を参照）などのカスタマイズ"
"可能なオプションに対して、バッファ固有の値を設定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
