"variable has any special setter functions, they will be run automatically "
"when using <code class=\"code\">setopt-local</code>.  You can also use <code "
"class=\"code\">setopt-local</code> on other, non-customizable variables, but "
"this is less efficient than using <code class=\"code\">setq-local</code>."
msgstr ""
