#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Executing-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"<span>29.7 Executing Lisp Expressions<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Executing-Lisp-Expressions\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>29.7 Lisp式の実行<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Executing-Lisp-"
"Expressions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Executing-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"Emacs has major modes for several variants of Lisp.  They use the same "
"editing commands as other programming language modes (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Programs.html\">Editing Programs</a>).  In addition, they provide "
"special commands for executing Lisp expressions."
msgstr ""
"Emacsには、いくつかのLisp派生言語に対応したメジャーモードが用意されています。"
"これらは、他のプログラミング言語モードと同じ編集コマンドを使用します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Programs.html\">プログラムの編集</a>を参照）。さらに、"
"Lisp式を実行するための専用コマンドも提供されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Executing-Lisp.html
msgid "Emacs Lisp mode"
msgstr "Emacs Lispモード"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Executing-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"The mode for editing Emacs Lisp source files.  It defines <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-x</kbd> to evaluate the current top-level Lisp "
"expression.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Lisp-Eval.html\">Evaluating Emacs "
"Lisp Expressions</a>."
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lispソースファイルを編集するためのモード。現在のトップレベルのLisp式を"
"評価する<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-x</kbd>を定義します。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Lisp-Eval.html\">Emacs Lisp式の評価</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Executing-Lisp.html
msgid "Lisp Interaction mode"
msgstr "Lisp対話モード"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Executing-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"The mode for an interactive Emacs Lisp session.  It defines <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> to evaluate the expression before point and insert "
"its value in the buffer.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Lisp-"
"Interaction.html\">Lisp Interaction Buffers</a>."
msgstr ""
"インタラクティブなEmacs Lispセッション用のモード。ポイント直前の式を評価し、"
"その値をバッファに挿入する<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd>を定義します。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Lisp-Interaction.html\">Lisp Interaction Buffers</a>を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Executing-Lisp.html
msgid "Lisp mode"
msgstr "Lispモード"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Executing-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"The mode for editing source files of programs that run in Lisps other than "
"Emacs Lisp.  It defines <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-x</kbd> to evaluate the "
"current top-level expression in an external Lisp.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"External-Lisp.html\">Running an External Lisp</a>."
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lisp以外のLispで動作するプログラムのソースファイルを編集するためのモー"
"ド。外部Lispで現在のトップレベル式を評価する<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-x</kbd>を"
"定義します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"External-Lisp.html\">外部Lispの実行</a>"
"を参照してください。"

