#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Expanding-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"<span>31.3 Controlling Abbrev Expansion<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Controlling-Abbrev-Expansion\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>31.3 略語展開の制御<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Controlling-"
"Abbrev-Expansion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Expanding-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"When Abbrev mode is enabled, an abbrev expands whenever it is present in the "
"buffer just before point and you type a self-inserting whitespace or "
"punctuation character (<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>, comma, etc.).  More "
"precisely, any character that is not a word constituent expands an abbrev, "
"and any word-constituent character can be part of an abbrev.  The most "
"common way to use an abbrev is to insert it and then insert a punctuation or "
"whitespace character to expand it."
msgstr ""
"略語モードが有効な場合、ポイント直前のバッファに略語が存在し、かつ自己挿入型"
"の空白文字や句読点文字（<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>、カンマなど）を入力する"
"と、その略語が展開されます。より正確には、単語構成文字ではないあらゆる文字が"
"略語を展開し、単語構成文字は略語の一部となり得ます。略語の最も一般的な使い方"
"は、略語を挿入した後に句読点や空白文字を入力して展開することです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Expanding-Abbrevs.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-abbrev_002dall_002dcaps\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-abbrev_002dall_002dcaps\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Expanding-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"Abbrev expansion preserves case: &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</"
"samp>&rsquo; expands to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">find outer otter</"
"samp>&rsquo;, and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Foo</samp>&rsquo; to &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Find outer otter</samp>&rsquo;.  &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>&rsquo; expands to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Find "
"Outer Otter</samp>&rsquo; by default, but if you change the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">abbrev-all-caps</code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> value, it expands to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FIND OUTER OTTER</"
"samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"略語展開では大文字・小文字が保持されます。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</"
"samp>&rsquo;は&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">find outer otter</samp>&rsquo;に、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Foo</samp>&rsquo;は&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Find outer otter</samp>&rsquo;に展開されます。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>&rsquo;はデフォルトでは&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Find Outer Otter</samp>&rsquo;に展開されますが、変数<code "
"class=\"code\">abbrev-all-caps</code>を<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の"
"値に変更すると、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FIND OUTER OTTER</samp>&rsquo;に"
"展開されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
