msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-expand_002dregion_002dabbrevs\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-expand_002dregion_002dabbrevs\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Expanding-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x expand-region-abbrevs</kbd> searches through the "
"region for defined abbrevs, and for each one found offers to replace it with "
"its expansion.  This command is useful if you have typed in text using "
"abbrevs but forgot to turn on Abbrev mode first.  It may also be useful "
"together with a special set of abbrev definitions for making several global "
"replacements at once.  This command is effective even if Abbrev mode is not "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x expand-region-abbrevs</kbd> はリージョン内から定義済み"
"の略語を検索し、見つかった略語ごとにその展開形への置換を提案します。このコマ"
"ンドは、略語を使ってテキストを入力したものの、事前に略語モードを有効にし忘れ"
"た場合に便利です。また、特別な略語定義セットと組み合わせて、複数のグローバル"
"な置換を一度に行う際にも有用です。このコマンドは、略語モードが有効になってい"
"なくても動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Expanding-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code> performs the "
"expansion by calling the function that <code class=\"code\">abbrev-expand-"
"function</code> specifies.  By changing this function you can make arbitrary "
"changes to the abbrev expansion.  See <a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Abbrev-"
"Expansion.html#Abbrev-Expansion\">Abbrev Expansion</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">expand-abbrev</code> は、<code "
"class=\"code\">abbrev-expand-function</code> が指定する関数を呼び出すことで展"
"開を行います。この関数を変更することで、略語展開を任意に変更できます。<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Abbrev-Expansion.html#Abbrev-Expansion\">Abbrev Expansion</a> を参照し"
"てください。"

