# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Expressions.html
msgid ""
"Each programming language mode has its own definition of a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">balanced expression</em>.  Balanced expressions typically "
"include individual symbols, numbers, and string constants, as well as pieces "
"of code enclosed in a matching pair of delimiters.  The following commands "
"deal with balanced expressions (in Emacs, such expressions are referred to "
"internally as <em class=\"dfn\">sexps</em><a class=\"footnote\" "
"id=\"DOCF16\" href=\"#FOOT16\"><sup>16</sup></a>)."
msgstr ""
"各プログラミング言語モードには、<em class=\"dfn\">バランス式</em>に関する独自"
"の定義があります。バランス式には通常、個々の記号、数値、文字列定数のほか、対"
"応する一対のデリミタで囲まれたコード部分が含まれます。以下のコマンドはバラン"
"ス式を扱います（Emacsでは、こうした式は内部的に<em class=\"dfn\">sexps</em>と"
"呼ばれます<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF16\" href=\"#FOOT16\"><sup>16</"
"sup></a>）。"

