msgstr ""
"<span>33.13.9 おしゃれな日記表示<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Fancy-"
"Diary-Display-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fancy-Diary-Display.html
msgid "The following features only work with the fancy diary display."
msgstr "以下の機能は、凝った日記表示でのみ動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fancy-Diary-Display.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sorting-diary-entries\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sorting-diary-entries\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fancy-Diary-Display.html
msgid ""
"You can use the normal hook <code class=\"code\">diary-list-entries-hook</"
"code> to sort each day&rsquo;s diary entries by their time of day.  "
"Here&rsquo;s how:"
msgstr ""
"通常のフック <code class=\"code\">diary-list-entries-hook</code> を使えば、各"
"日の日記エントリを時間帯順に並べ替えることができます。手順は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fancy-Diary-Display.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dsort_002dentries\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dsort_002dentries\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Fancy-Diary-Display.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(add-hook 'diary-list-entries-hook 'diary-sort-entries t)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fancy-Diary-Display.html
msgid ""
"For each day, this sorts diary entries that begin with a recognizable time "
"of day according to their times.  Diary entries without times come first "
"within each day.  Note how the sort command is placed at the end of the hook "
"list, in case earlier members of the list change the order of the diary "
"entries, or add items."
msgstr ""
"各日について、認識可能な時間帯で始まる日記エントリを時刻順に並べ替えます。時"
"刻の記載がない日記エントリは、各日の中で最初に表示されます。リストの先行する"
"項目によって日記エントリの順序が変更されたり、項目が追加されたりした場合に備"
"え、ソートコマンドがフックリストの末尾に配置されている点にご注目ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fancy-Diary-Display.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dcomment_002dstart\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dcomment_002dstart\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fancy-Diary-Display.html
msgid ""
"You can write &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">comments</samp>&rsquo; in diary "
"entries, by setting the variables <code class=\"code\">diary-comment-start</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">diary-comment-end</code> to strings that "
"delimit comments.  The fancy display does not print comments.  You might "
"want to put meta-data for the use of other packages (e.g., the appointment "
"package, see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Appointments.html\">Appointments</"
"a>)  inside comments."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">diary-comment-start</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">diary-comment-end</code> にコメントを区切る文字列を設定するこ"
"とで、日記のエントリに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">comments</samp>&rsquo; と"
"記述できます。凝った表示形式ではコメントは出力されません。他のパッケージ"
"（例：予約パッケージ、<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Appointments.html\">Appointments</a> を参照）で利用するためのメタデー"
"タを、コメント内に記述しておくと便利でしょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fancy-Diary-Display.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dinclude_002dstring\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dinclude_002dstring\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fancy-Diary-Display.html
msgid ""
"Your main diary file can include other files.  This permits a group of "
"people to share a diary file for events that apply to all of them.  Lines in "
"the diary file starting with <code class=\"code\">diary-include-string</"
"code>:"
msgstr ""
"メインのダイアリーファイルには、他のファイルを含めることができます。これによ"
"り、グループのメンバー全員が共通して該当するイベントについて、ダイアリーファ"
"イルを共有することが可能になります。ダイアリーファイル内で <code "
"class=\"code\">diary-include-string</code> で始まる行は："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Fancy-Diary-Display.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "#include &quot;<var class=\"var\">filename</var>&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fancy-Diary-Display.html
msgid ""
"include the diary entries from the file <var class=\"var\">filename</var> in "
"the fancy diary buffer.  The include mechanism is recursive, so that "
"included files can include other files, and so on (you must be careful not "
"to have a cycle of inclusions, of course).  Here is how to enable the "
"include facility:"
msgstr ""
"ファイル <var class=\"var\">filename</var> の日記エントリをファンシー日記バッ"
"ファに取り込みます。取り込み機構は再帰的であるため、取り込まれたファイルがさ"
"らに別のファイルを取り込む、といった処理が可能です（もちろん、取り込みの循環"
"が発生しないよう注意が必要です）。取り込み機能を有効にする方法は以下の通りで"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fancy-Diary-Display.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"diary_002dlist_002dentries_002dhook\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-diary_002dmark_002dentries_002dhook\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-diary_002dinclude_002dother_002ddiary_002dfiles\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"diary_002dmark_002dincluded_002ddiary_002dfiles\"></a>"
