# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Conveniences.html
msgid ""
"<span>20.18 Convenience Features for Finding Files<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Convenience-Features-for-Finding-Files\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>20.18 ファイルを探すための便利な機能<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Convenience-Features-for-Finding-Files\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Conveniences.html
msgid ""
"In this section, we introduce some convenient facilities for finding "
"recently-opened files, reading file names from a buffer."
msgstr ""
"本節では、最近オープンしたファイルを探したり、バッファからファイル名を読み"
"取ったりする際に便利な機能をいくつか紹介します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Conveniences.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recentf_002dmode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recentf_002dmode-1\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recentf_002dopen\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-recentf_002dsave_002dlist\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-recentf_002dedit_002dlist\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recentf_002dmode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recentf_002dmode-1\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recentf_002dopen\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-recentf_002dsave_002dlist\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-recentf_002dedit_002dlist\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Conveniences.html
msgid ""
"If you enable Recentf mode, with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x recentf-mode</kbd>, "
"Emacs maintains a list of recently opened files.  To open a file from this "
"list, use the <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x recentf-open</kbd> command.  When this "
"mode is enabled, the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">File</samp>&rsquo; menu "
"will include a submenu that you can use to visit one of these files.  <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x recentf-save-list</kbd> saves the current <code "
"class=\"code\">recentf-list</code> to a file, and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"recentf-edit-list</kbd> edits it."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x recentf-mode</kbd> で Recentf モードを有効にすると、"
"Emacs は最近開いたファイルのリストを保持します。このリストからファイルを開く"
"には、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x recentf-open</kbd> コマンドを使用します。この"
"モードが有効な場合、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">File</samp>&rsquo; メニュー"
"に、これらのファイルのいずれかに移動するためのサブメニューが表示されます。"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x recentf-save-list</kbd> は現在の <code "
"class=\"code\">recentf-list</code> をファイルに保存し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x recentf-edit-list</kbd> はそれを編集します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Conveniences.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"remote_002dfile_002dname_002daccess_002dtimeout\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"remote_002dfile_002dname_002daccess_002dtimeout\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Conveniences.html
msgid ""
"If you use remote files, you might also consider customizing <code "
"class=\"code\">remote-file-name-access-timeout</code>, which is the number "
"of seconds after which the check whether a remote file shall be used in "
"Recentf is stopped.  This prevents Emacs being blocked."
msgstr ""
"リモートファイルを使用する場合、Recentfでリモートファイルを使用するかどうかの"
"判定を停止する秒数である <code class=\"code\">remote-file-name-access-"
"timeout</code> のカスタマイズも検討してみてください。これにより、Emacsがブ"
"ロックされるのを防ぐことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Conveniences.html
msgid ""
"The <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x ffap</kbd> command generalizes <code "
"class=\"code\">find-file</code> with more powerful heuristic defaults (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"FFAP.html\">Finding Files and URLs at Point</a>), "
"often based on the text at point.  Partial Completion mode offers other "
"features extending <code class=\"code\">find-file</code>, which can be used "
"with <code class=\"code\">ffap</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Completion-Options.html\">Completion Options</a>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x ffap</kbd> コマンドは、より強力なヒューリスティックな"
