# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid ""
"You can use the <em class=\"dfn\">file name cache</em> to make it easy to "
"locate a file by name, without having to remember exactly where it is "
"located.  When typing a file name in the minibuffer, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">file-cache-"
"minibuffer-complete</code>) completes it using the file name cache.  If you "
"repeat <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd>, that cycles "
"through the possible completions of what you had originally typed.  "
"(However, note that the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></"
"kbd> character cannot be typed on most text terminals.)"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ファイル名キャッシュ</em>を利用すれば、ファイルの正確な保存"
"場所を覚えておかなくても、ファイル名から簡単にファイルを探し出すことができま"
"す。ミニバッファにファイル名を入力している際、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">file-cache-minibuffer-"
"complete</code>) を押すと、ファイル名キャッシュを用いて補完が行われます。"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> を繰り返すと、最初に"
"入力した内容から考えられる補完候補を順に切り替えて表示します。（ただし、ほと"
"んどのテキスト端末では <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></"
"kbd> 文字を入力できない点にご注意ください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid ""
"The file name cache does not fill up automatically.  Instead, you load file "
"names into the cache using these commands:"
msgstr ""
"ファイル名キャッシュは自動的に一杯になることはありません。代わりに、以下のコ"
"マンドを使用してファイル名をキャッシュに読み込みます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"file_002dcache_002dadd_002ddirectory\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"file_002dcache_002dadd_002ddirectory\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x file-cache-add-directory <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> "
"<var class=\"var\">directory</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x file-cache-add-directory <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> "
"<var class=\"var\">directory</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid ""
"Add each file name in <var class=\"var\">directory</var> to the file name "
"cache."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">directory</var> 内の各ファイル名をファイル名キャッシュに追"
"加する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x file-cache-add-directory-using-find <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var class=\"var\">directory</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x file-cache-add-directory-using-find <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var class=\"var\">directory</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid ""
"Add each file name in <var class=\"var\">directory</var> and all of its "
"nested subdirectories to the file name cache."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">directory</var> 内の各ファイル名と、その配下にあるすべての"
"サブディレクトリをファイル名キャッシュに追加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x file-cache-add-directory-using-locate <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var class=\"var\">directory</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x file-cache-add-directory-using-locate <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var class=\"var\">directory</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid ""
"Add each file name in <var class=\"var\">directory</var> and all of its "
"nested subdirectories to the file name cache, using <code "
"class=\"command\">locate</code> to find them all."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"command\">locate</code> を使用してすべてを特定し、<var "
"class=\"var\">directory</var> 内の各ファイル名およびその配下にあるすべてのサ"
"ブディレクトリをファイル名キャッシュに追加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x file-cache-add-directory-list <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd> <var class=\"var\">variable</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x file-cache-add-directory-list <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd> <var class=\"var\">variable</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid ""
"Add each file name in each directory listed in <var class=\"var\">variable</"
"var> to the file name cache.  <var class=\"var\">variable</var> should be a "
"Lisp variable whose value is a list of directories, like <code "
"class=\"code\">load-path</code>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">variable</var> に列挙されている各ディレクトリ内の各ファイ"
"ル名を、ファイル名キャッシュに追加します。<var class=\"var\">variable</var> "
"は、<code class=\"code\">load-path</code> と同様にディレクトリのリストを値と"
"する Lisp 変数である必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x file-cache-clear-cache <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x file-cache-clear-cache <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid "Clear the cache; that is, remove all file names from it."
msgstr ""
"キャッシュをクリアしてください。つまり、そこからすべてのファイル名を削除して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-Name-Cache.html
msgid ""
"The file name cache is not persistent: it is kept and maintained only for "
"the duration of the Emacs session.  You can view the contents of the cache "
"with the <code class=\"code\">file-cache-display</code> command."
msgstr ""
"ファイル名キャッシュは永続的ではなく、Emacsセッションの間のみ保持・管理されま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">file-cache-display</code>コマンドでキャッシュの内容"
"を確認できます。"

