# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/File-and-Buffer-Registers.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r F <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r F <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-and-Buffer-Registers.html
msgid ""
"Store the currently visited file or directory in register <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var> (<code class=\"code\">file-to-register</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在アクセス中のファイルまたはディレクトリをレジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</"
"var> (<code class=\"code\">file-to-register</code>) に格納します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/File-and-Buffer-Registers.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r B <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r B <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-and-Buffer-Registers.html
msgid ""
"Store the currently visited buffer in register <var class=\"var\">r</var> "
"(<code class=\"code\">buffer-to-register</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在訪問中のバッファをレジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</var> (<code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-to-register</code>) に格納する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-and-Buffer-Registers.html
msgid ""
"If you visit certain files or buffers frequently, you can visit them more "
"conveniently if you put their names in registers."
msgstr ""
"特定のファイルやバッファに頻繁にアクセスする場合、それらの名前をレジスタに格"
"納しておくと、より便利にアクセスできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/File-and-Buffer-Registers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-r-F\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-file_002dto_002dregister\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-r-F\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-file_002dto_002dregister\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-and-Buffer-Registers.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r F</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">file-to-"
"register</code>), followed by a character <kbd class=\"kbd\"><var "
"class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>, saves a reference to the currently visited file "
"in register <var class=\"var\">r</var>.  You can then visit the file using "
"<code class=\"code\">jump-to-register</code> by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x r j</kbd> <var class=\"var\">r</var>. With a prefix argument, <code "
"class=\"code\">file-to-register</code> prompts for a file name to store in "
"the register."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r F</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">file-to-register</"
"code>) と入力し、続けて文字 <kbd class=\"kbd\"><var class=\"var\">r</var></"
"kbd> を入力すると、現在開いているファイルへの参照がレジスタ <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var> に保存されます。その後、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r j</"
"kbd> と <var class=\"var\">r</var> を入力することで、<code "
"class=\"code\">jump-to-register</code> を用いてそのファイルを開くことができま"
"す。接頭辞引数を指定すると、<code class=\"code\">file-to-register</code> はレ"
"ジスタに保存するファイル名の入力を求めます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/File-and-Buffer-Registers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-r-B\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer_002dto_002dregister\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-r-B\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer_002dto_002dregister\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-and-Buffer-Registers.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r B</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">buffer-to-"
"register</code>), followed by a character <kbd class=\"kbd\"><var "
"class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>, saves a reference to the currently visited "
"buffer in register <var class=\"var\">r</var>.  You can then revisit the "
"buffer using <code class=\"code\">jump-to-register</code>. With a prefix "
"argument, <code class=\"code\">buffer-to-register</code> prompts for a "
"buffer name to store in the register."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r B</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">buffer-to-register</"
"code>) と入力し、続けて文字 <kbd class=\"kbd\"><var class=\"var\">r</var></"
"kbd> を入力すると、現在アクセス中のバッファへの参照がレジスタ <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var> に保存されます。その後、<code class=\"code\">jump-to-"
"register</code> を使用してそのバッファに再度アクセスできます。接頭辞引数を指"
"定すると、<code class=\"code\">buffer-to-register</code> でレジスタに保存する"
"バッファ名の入力が求められます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/File-and-Buffer-Registers.html
msgid ""
"If you store a buffer name which is visiting a file in a register, and the "
"buffer is then closed, the register is automatically converted to a file "
"reference, allowing you to quickly re-open the closed file."
msgstr ""
"ファイルを参照しているバッファ名をレジスタに格納し、その後そのバッファを閉じ"
"ると、レジスタは自動的にファイル参照に変換されるため、閉じたファイルを迅速に"
"再オープンできます。"

