# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">fill-"
"paragraph</code>) <em class=\"dfn\">fills</em> the current paragraph.  It "
"redistributes the line breaks within the paragraph, and deletes any excess "
"space and tab characters occurring within the paragraph, in such a way that "
"the lines end up fitting within a certain maximum width.  Like Auto Fill "
"mode, this and other filling commands usually break lines at space "
"characters, but for CJK characters these commands can break a line between "
"almost any two characters, and they can also obey the kinsoku rules.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Auto-Fill.html\">Auto Fill Mode</a>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">fill-paragraph</"
"code>) は、現在の段落を<em class=\"dfn\">埋めます</em>。段落内の改行を再配分"
"し、段落内に存在する余分なスペースやタブ文字を削除することで、各行が一定の最"
"大幅に収まるようにします。オートフィルモードと同様に、このコマンドやその他の"
"埋めコマンドは通常、スペース文字で改行しますが、CJK文字の場合、これらのコマン"
"ドはほぼ任意の2文字の間で改行することができ、また禁則ルールに従うこともありま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Auto-Fill.html\">オートフィルモード</a>を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fill_002dregion\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fill_002dregion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Normally, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd> acts on the paragraph where point is, "
"but if point is between paragraphs, it acts on the paragraph after point.  "
"If the region is active, it acts instead on the text in the region.  You can "
"also call <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x fill-region</kbd> to specifically fill the "
"text in the region."
msgstr ""
"通常、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd>はpointがある段落に作用しますが、pointが段"
"落間にある場合は、pointの後の段落に作用します。領域がアクティブな場合は、代わ"
"りにその領域内のテキストに作用します。また、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x fill-"
"region</kbd>を呼び出して、その領域内のテキストを明示的に塗りつぶすこともでき"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fill_002dregion_002das_002dparagraph\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-fill_002dregion_002das_002dparagraph_002dfunction\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fill_002dregion_002das_002dparagraph\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-fill_002dregion_002das_002dparagraph_002dfunction\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd> and <code class=\"code\">fill-region</code> use "
"the usual Emacs criteria for finding paragraph boundaries (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Paragraphs.html\">Paragraphs</a>).  For more control, "
"you can use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x fill-region-as-paragraph</kbd>, which "
"refills everything between point and mark as a single paragraph.  The "
"behavior of this command is controlled by the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">fill-region-as-paragraph-function</code>.  By default, it "
"deletes any blank lines within the region, so separate blocks of text end up "
"combined into one block."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd> と <code class=\"code\">fill-region</code> は、"
"段落境界を検出するための通常の Emacs の基準を用います（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Paragraphs.html\">Paragraphs</a> を参照）。より詳細な制御を行うには、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x fill-region-as-paragraph</kbd> を使用できます。これに"
"より、ポイントとマークの間にあるすべてが単一の段落として再構成されます。この"
"コマンドの動作は変数 <code class=\"code\">fill-region-as-paragraph-function</"
"code> によって制御されます。デフォルトでは、リージョン内の空行が削除されるた"
"め、個別のテキストブロックが一つのブロックにまとめられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-justification\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-justification\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid ""
"A numeric argument to <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd> tells it to <em "
"class=\"dfn\">justify</em> the text as well as filling it.  This means that "
"extra spaces are inserted to make the right margin line up exactly at the "
"fill column.  To remove the extra spaces, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd> "
"with no argument.  (Likewise for <code class=\"code\">fill-region</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd> に数値引数を指定すると、テキストの塗りつぶしに加"
"えて<em class=\"dfn\">右寄せ</em>も行われます。つまり、右マージンが塗りつぶし"
"列と正確に揃うように、余分なスペースが挿入されます。この余分なスペースを取り"
"除くには、引数なしで <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd> を使用してください。"
"（<code class=\"code\">fill-region</code> についても同様です。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fill_002dcolumn\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-f\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-set_002dfill_002dcolumn\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fill_002dcolumn\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-f\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-set_002dfill_002dcolumn\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid ""
"The maximum line width for filling is specified by the buffer-local variable "
"<code class=\"code\">fill-column</code>.  The default value (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Locals.html\">Local Variables</a>) is 70.  The "
"easiest way to set <code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> in the current "
"buffer is to use the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x f</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">set-fill-column</code>).  With a numeric argument, it uses "
"that as the new fill column.  With just <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> as "
"argument, it sets <code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> to the current "
"horizontal position of point.  Note that, by its very nature, <code "
"class=\"code\">fill-column</code> is measured in column units; the actual "
"position of that column on a graphical display depends on the font being "
"used.  In particular, using variable-pitch fonts will cause the <code "
"class=\"code\">fill-column</code> occupy different horizontal positions on "
"display in different lines."
msgstr ""
"塗りつぶしの最大行幅は、バッファローカル変数 <code class=\"code\">fill-"
"column</code> で指定されます。デフォルト値（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Locals.html\">ローカル変数</a> を参照）は 70 です。現在のバッファで "
"<code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> を設定する最も簡単な方法は、コマンド "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x f</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">set-fill-column</code>) "
"を使用することです。数値引数を指定すると、それを新しい塗りつぶし列として使用"
"します。引数に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> のみを指定すると、<code "
"class=\"code\">fill-column</code> に point の現在の水平位置が設定されます。な"
"お、<code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> はその性質上、列単位で計測される"
"ため、グラフィカルディスプレイ上での実際の列の位置は、使用されているフォント"
"によって異なります。特に、可変ピッチフォントを使用すると、<code "
"class=\"code\">fill-column</code> はディスプレイ上の行によって異なる水平位置"
"を占めることになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unfilling\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-unfill_002dparagraph\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unfilling\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-unfill_002dparagraph\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x unfill-paragraph</kbd> is the inverse of "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd>.  It joins up the lines of the current "
"paragraph.  Using this command is like starting on the last line of the "
"paragraph and repeatedly typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-^</kbd> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Indentation-Commands.html\">Indentation Commands</a>) "
"until all the lines are joined.  With a numeric prefix argument, apply the "
"operation to that many paragraphs.  For example, with a numeric prefix "
"argument of 2, join all the lines in this paragraph and all the lines in the "
"next paragraph, but preserve the separation of the two paragraphs.  When "
"there is no prefix argument, it acts on an active region just like <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x unfill-paragraph</kbd> は <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd> の逆の操作です。現在の段落の各行を結合します。このコ"
"マンドを使用するのは、段落の最終行から開始し、すべての行が結合されるまで "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-^</kbd> を繰り返し入力するようなものです（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Indentation-Commands.html\">インデントコマンド</a> を"
"参照）。数値の接頭辞引数を指定すると、その数だけ段落に対して操作が適用されま"
"す。例えば、数値の接頭辞引数に 2 を指定すると、この段落のすべての行と次の段落"
"のすべての行を結合しますが、2つの段落の区切りは維持されます。接頭辞引数がない"
"場合は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-q</kbd> と同様にアクティブリージョンに対して作用"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-centering\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-center_002dline\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-centering\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-center_002dline\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x center-line</kbd> centers the current "
"line within the current fill column.  With an argument <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var>, it centers <var class=\"var\">n</var> lines individually and moves "
"past them.  This binding is made by Text mode and is available only in that "
"and related modes (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-Mode.html\">Text Mode</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x center-line</kbd> は、現在の行を現在のフィル"
"列の中央に配置します。引数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> を指定すると、<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> 行を個別に中央に配置し、その後次の行へ移動します。この"
"バインディングはテキストモードで設定されており、同モードおよび関連モードでの"
"み利用可能です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-Mode.html\">テキストモード</a>"
"を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fill-Commands.html
msgid ""
"By default, Emacs considers a period followed by two spaces or by a newline "
"as the end of a sentence; a period followed by just one space indicates an "
"abbreviation, not the end of a sentence.  Accordingly, the fill commands "
"will not break a line after a period followed by just one space.  If you set "
"the variable <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-double-space</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the fill commands will break a line after a "
"period followed by one space, and put just one space after each period.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Sentences.html\">Sentences</a>, for other effects "
"and possible drawbacks of this."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、Emacsはピリオドの後に2つのスペースまたは改行が続く場合を文末"
"とみなします。ピリオドの後にスペースが1つだけ続く場合は、文末ではなく略語であ"
"ることを示します。したがって、フィルコマンドはピリオドの後にスペースが1つだけ"
"続く箇所で改行しません。変数 <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-double-space</"
"code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定すると、フィルコマンドはピリオ"
"ドの後にスペースが1つだけ続く箇所で改行し、各ピリオドの後にスペースを1つだけ"
"挿入するようになります。これによるその他の効果や考えられるデメリットについて"
"は、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Sentences.html\">Sentences</a> を参照してくださ"
"い。"

