"This subsection describes the commands that find references to identifiers "
"and perform various queries about identifiers.  Each such reference could "
"<em class=\"emph\">define</em> an identifier, e.g., provide the "
"implementation of a program subunit or the text of a document section; or it "
"could <em class=\"emph\">use</em> the identifier, e.g., call a function or a "
"method, assign a value to a variable, mention a chapter in a cross-"
"reference, etc."
msgstr ""
