# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fine-Points-of-Emerge.html
msgid ""
"During the merge, you mustn&rsquo;t try to edit the A and B buffers "
"yourself.  Emerge modifies them temporarily, but ultimately puts them back "
"the way they were."
msgstr ""
"マージ中は、AおよびBバッファを自身で編集しようとしてはいけません。Emergeはこ"
"れらを一時的に変更しますが、最終的には元の状態に戻します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fine-Points-of-Emerge.html
msgid ""
"You can have any number of merges going at once&mdash;just don&rsquo;t use "
"any one buffer as input to more than one merge at once, since the temporary "
"changes made in these buffers would get in each other&rsquo;s way."
msgstr ""
"同時にいくつでもマージを実行できます。ただし、あるバッファを一度に複数のマー"
"ジの入力として使用しないでください。これらのバッファに加えられた一時的な変更"
"が、互いに干渉してしまうためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fine-Points-of-Emerge.html
msgid ""
"Starting Emerge can take a long time because it needs to compare the files "
"fully.  Emacs can&rsquo;t do anything else until <code class=\"code\">diff</"
"code> finishes.  Perhaps in the future someone will change Emerge to do the "
"comparison in the background when the input files are large&mdash;then you "
"could keep on doing other things with Emacs until Emerge is ready to accept "
"commands."
msgstr ""
"Emergeの起動には、ファイルを完全に比較する必要があるため、時間がかかることが"
"あります。<code class=\"code\">diff</code>が完了するまで、Emacsは他の処理を行"
"うことができません。将来的には、入力ファイルが大きい場合にバックグラウンドで"
"比較を行うようEmergeが変更されるかもしれません。そうなれば、Emergeがコマンド"
"を受け付けられる状態になるまで、Emacsで他の作業を続けることができるようになり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fine-Points-of-Emerge.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-emerge_002dstartup_002dhook\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-emerge_002dstartup_002dhook\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fine-Points-of-Emerge.html
msgid ""
"After setting up the merge, Emerge runs the hook <code class=\"code\">emerge-"
"startup-hook</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Hooks.html\">Hooks</a>."
msgstr ""
"マージの設定後、Emergeはフック <code class=\"code\">emerge-startup-hook</"
"code> を実行します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Hooks.html\">フック</a>を参照し"
"てください。"

