# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"Font Lock mode uses several specifically named faces to do its job, "
"including <code class=\"code\">font-lock-string-face</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-comment-face</code>, and others.  The easiest way "
"to find them all is to use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-group <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> font-lock-faces <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>.  "
"You can then use that customization buffer to customize the appearance of "
"these faces.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Face-"
"Customization.html\">Customizing Faces</a>."
msgstr ""
"Font Lockモードでは、<code class=\"code\">font-lock-string-face</code>や"
"<code class=\"code\">font-lock-comment-face</code>など、個別に名前が付けられ"
"た複数のフェイスを使用して動作します。これらをすべて見つける最も簡単な方法"
"は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-group <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> font-"
"lock-faces <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>を使用することです。その後、この"
"カスタマイズバッファを使用して、これらのフェイスの外観をカスタマイズできま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Face-Customization.html\">フェイスのカスタマイズ"
"</a>を参照してください。"

