#: build/html/emacs/Fonts.html
msgid ""
"The third way to specify a font is to use an <em class=\"dfn\">XLFD</em> "
"(<em class=\"dfn\">X Logical Font Description</em>).  This is the "
"traditional method for specifying fonts under X, and is also supported on MS-"
"Windows.  Each XLFD consists of fourteen words or numbers, separated by "
"dashes, like this:"
msgstr ""
"フォントを指定する3つ目の方法は、<em class=\"dfn\">XLFD</em>（<em "
"class=\"dfn\">X Logical Font Description</em>）を使用することです。これはXに"
"おける従来のフォント指定方法であり、MS-Windowsでもサポートされています。各"
"XLFDは、次のようにハイフンで区切られた14個の単語または数値で構成されていま"
"す："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Fonts.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "-misc-fixed-medium-r-semicondensed--13-*-*-*-c-60-iso8859-1\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fonts.html
msgid ""
"A wildcard character (&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;) in an "
"XLFD matches any sequence of characters (including none), and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?</samp>&rsquo; matches any single character.  However, "
"matching is implementation-dependent, and can be inaccurate when wildcards "
"match dashes in a long name.  For reliable results, supply all 14 dashes and "
"use wildcards only within a field.  Case is insignificant in an XLFD.  The "
"syntax for an XLFD is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"XLFDにおけるワイルドカード文字（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;）"
"は任意の文字列（空文字列を含む）に一致し、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?</"
"samp>&rsquo;は任意の1文字に一致します。ただし、マッチングは実装に依存するた"
"め、長い名前の中でワイルドカードがハイフンに一致した場合、不正確な結果となる"
"ことがあります。確実な結果を得るには、14個のハイフンをすべて指定し、ワイルド"
"カードはフィールド内でのみ使用してください。XLFDでは大文字と小文字は区別され"
"ません。XLFDの構文は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Fonts.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"-<var class=\"var\">maker</var>-<var class=\"var\">family</var>-<var class=\"var\">weight</var>-<var class=\"var\">slant</var>-<var class=\"var\">widthtype</var>-<var class=\"var\">style</var>...\n"
"...-<var class=\"var\">pixels</var>-<var class=\"var\">height</var>-<var class=\"var\">horiz</var>-<var class=\"var\">vert</var>-<var class=\"var\">spacing</var>-<var class=\"var\">width</var>-<var class=\"var\">registry</var>-<var class=\"var\">encoding</var>\n"
msgstr ""

