# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fonts.html
msgid ""
"The font height on the screen, measured in tenths of a printer&rsquo;s "
"point.  This is the point size of the font, times ten.  For a given vertical "
"resolution, <var class=\"var\">height</var> and <var class=\"var\">pixels</"
"var> are proportional; therefore, it is common to specify just one of them "
"and use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; for the other."
msgstr ""
"画面上のフォント高さ（プリンターのポイントの10分の1単位で測定）。これはフォン"
"トのポイントサイズに10を掛けた値である。所定の垂直解像度において、<var "
"class=\"var\">height</var>と<var class=\"var\">pixels</var>は比例関係にあるた"
"め、通常はどちらか一方のみを指定し、もう一方には&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;を用いるのが一般的である。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Fonts.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">horiz</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">horiz</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fonts.html
msgid ""
"The horizontal resolution, in pixels per inch, of the screen for which the "
"font is intended."
msgstr ""
"そのフォントが想定されている画面の、1インチあたりのピクセル数で表される水平解"
"像度。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Fonts.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">vert</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">vert</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fonts.html
msgid ""
"The vertical resolution, in pixels per inch, of the screen for which the "
"font is intended.  Normally the resolution of the fonts on your system is "
"the right value for your screen; therefore, you normally specify &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; for this and <var class=\"var\">horiz</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"フォントが想定されている画面の垂直解像度（1インチあたりのピクセル数）。通常、"
"システム上のフォントの解像度が画面に適した値となるため、通常はこれに &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; を、<var class=\"var\">horiz</var> を指"
"定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Fonts.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">spacing</var>"
