# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fonts.html
msgid ""
"This is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">m</samp>&rsquo; (monospace), &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">p</samp>&rsquo; (proportional) or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">c</samp>&rsquo; (character cell)."
msgstr ""
"これは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">m</samp>&rsquo;（等幅）、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">p</samp>&rsquo;（プロポーショナル）、または &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">c</samp>&rsquo;（文字セル）です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Fonts.html
msgid "<var class=\"var\">width</var>"
msgstr "<var class=\"var\">width</var>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fonts.html
msgid "The average character width, in pixels, multiplied by ten."
msgstr "平均文字幅（ピクセル）に10を乗じた値。"

