#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/ForIndent-Num.html
msgid ""
"<span>28.14.2.3 Line Numbers<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Line-"
"Numbers\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>28.14.2.3 行番号<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Line-Numbers\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ForIndent-Num.html
msgid ""
"If a number is the first non-whitespace in the line, Fortran indentation "
"assumes it is a line number and moves it to columns 0 through 4.  (Columns "
"always count from 0 in Emacs, but setting <code class=\"code\">column-number-"
"indicator-zero-based</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> can change "
"that, see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Optional-Mode-Line.html\">Optional Mode "
"Line Features</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"ある数値が行内で最初の非空白文字である場合、Fortranのインデント処理はその数値"
"を行番号とみなし、0列目から4列目に移動させます。（Emacsでは列番号は常に0から"
"始まりますが、<code class=\"code\">column-number-indicator-zero-based</code>"
"を<code class=\"code\">nil</code>に設定することでこれを変更できます。詳細は"
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Optional-Mode-Line.html\">オプションモードの行機能"
"</a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ForIndent-Num.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dline_002dnumber_002dindent\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dline_002dnumber_002dindent\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ForIndent-Num.html
msgid ""
"Line numbers of four digits or less are normally indented one space.  The "
"variable <code class=\"code\">fortran-line-number-indent</code> controls "
"this; it specifies the maximum indentation a line number can have.  The "
"default value of the variable is 1.  Fortran mode tries to prevent line "
"number digits passing column 4, reducing the indentation below the specified "
"maximum if necessary.  If <code class=\"code\">fortran-line-number-indent</"
"code> has the value 5, line numbers are right-justified to end in column 4."
msgstr ""
"4桁以下の行番号は、通常1スペース分インデントされます。変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">fortran-line-number-indent</code> でこれを制御でき、行番号に適"
"用できる最大インデント量を指定します。この変数のデフォルト値は 1 です。"
"Fortran モードでは、行番号の桁が4列目を超えるのを防ぐようになっており、必要に"
"応じてインデント量を指定した最大値未満に縮小します。<code "
"class=\"code\">fortran-line-number-indent</code> の値が 5 の場合、行番号は4列"
"目で終わるように右詰めされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ForIndent-Num.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002delectric_002dline_002dnumber\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002delectric_002dline_002dnumber\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ForIndent-Num.html
msgid ""
"Simply inserting a line number is enough to indent it according to these "
"rules.  As each digit is inserted, the indentation is recomputed.  To turn "
"off this feature, set the variable <code class=\"code\">fortran-electric-"
"line-number</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"行番号を挿入するだけで、これらの規則に従ってインデントされます。各桁が挿入さ"
"れるたびに、インデントが再計算されます。この機能を無効にするには、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">fortran-electric-line-number</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を設定してください。"

