#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-ChangeLog.html
msgid ""
"<span>30.3.2 Format of ChangeLog<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Format-of-"
"ChangeLog-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>30.3.2 ChangeLogの形式<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Format-of-"
"ChangeLog-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-ChangeLog.html
msgid ""
"A change log entry starts with a header line that contains the current date, "
"your name (taken from the variable <code class=\"code\">add-log-full-name</"
"code>), and your email address (taken from the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">add-log-mailing-address</code>).  Aside from these header "
"lines, every line in the change log starts with a space or a tab.  The bulk "
"of the entry consists of <em class=\"dfn\">items</em>, each of which starts "
"with a line starting with whitespace and a star.  Here are two entries, both "
"dated in May 1993, with two items and one item respectively."
msgstr ""
"変更履歴のエントリは、現在の日付、氏名（変数 <code class=\"code\">add-log-"
"full-name</code> から取得）、およびメールアドレス（変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">add-log-mailing-address</code> から取得）を含むヘッダー行で始"
"まります。これらのヘッダー行を除き、変更履歴のすべての行はスペースまたはタブ"
"で始まります。エントリの大部分は<em class=\"dfn\">項目</em>で構成されており、"
"各項目は空白文字とアスタリスクで始まる行から始まります。以下に、ともに1993年5"
"月の日付で、それぞれ2つの項目と1つの項目を持つ2つのエントリを示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-ChangeLog.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1993-05-25  Richard Stallman  &lt;rms@gnu.org&gt;\n"
"\n"
"        * man.el: Rename symbols 'man-*' to 'Man-*'.\n"
"        (manual-entry): Make prompt string clearer.\n"
"\n"
"        * simple.el (blink-matching-paren-distance):\n"
"        Change default to 12,000.\n"
"\n"
"1993-05-24  Richard Stallman  &lt;rms@gnu.org&gt;\n"
"\n"
"        * vc.el (minor-mode-map-alist): Don't use it if it's void.\n"
"        (vc-cancel-version): Doc fix.\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-ChangeLog.html
msgid ""
"One entry can describe several changes; each change should have its own "
"item, or its own line in an item.  Normally there should be a blank line "
"between items.  When items are related (parts of the same change, in "
"different places), group them by leaving no blank line between them.  Such a "
"multi-item entry often begins with a single line of text that succintly "
"summarizes the whole changeset.  The entry may also contain additional "
"explanatory text between the summary line and the first change item; the "
"explanatory text should also be bounded by blank lines.  Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"1つのエントリで複数の変更を記述できます。各変更は個別の項目とするか、同一項目"
"内の別行として記述してください。通常、項目間には空行を1行入れる必要がありま"
"す。項目同士が関連している場合（同一変更の異なる箇所など）は、空行を挟まずに"
"まとめてください。このような複数項目からなるエントリは、多くの場合、変更セッ"
"ト全体を簡潔にまとめた1行のテキストから始まります。また、要約行と最初の変更項"
"目の間に、追加の説明テキストを記載することも可能です。この説明テキストも空行"
"で挟むようにしてください。以下に例を示します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-ChangeLog.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2026-02-27  Sean Whitton  &lt;spwhitton@spwhitton.name&gt;\n"
"\n"
"        New 'log-outstanding' value for vc-log-view-type\n"
"\n"
"        This fixes vc-hg-print-log's choice of -r arguments to 'hg log'.\n"
"\n"
"        * lisp/vc/vc.el (vc-log-view-type): New 'log-outstanding' value.\n"
"        (vc-log-outstanding): Pass it.\n"
"        * lisp/vc/vc-git.el (vc-git-log-view-mode):\n"
"        * lisp/vc/vc-hg.el (vc-hg-print-log, vc-hg-log-view-mode): Treat\n"
"        'log-outstanding' the same as 'log-outgoing'.\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-ChangeLog.html
msgid ""
"If you include one or more change log files in a software package that is "
"distributed to others, you should put a copyright notice and permission "
"notice at the end of each change log file.  Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"他者に配布するソフトウェアパッケージに1つ以上の変更履歴ファイルを含める場合"
"は、各変更履歴ファイルの末尾に著作権表示および利用許諾表示を記載してくださ"
"い。以下に例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-ChangeLog.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Copyright 1997--1998, 2025--2026 Free Software Foundation, Inc.\n"
"Copying and distribution of this file, with or without modification, are\n"
"permitted provided the copyright notice and this notice are preserved.\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-ChangeLog.html
msgid "Of course, you should substitute the proper years and copyright holder."
msgstr "もちろん、適切な年号と著作権者に置き換えてください。"

