#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-Diary-File.html
msgid ""
"<span>33.10.1 The Diary File<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-Diary-"
"File\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>33.10.1 日記ファイル<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-Diary-"
"File\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-Diary-File.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary-file\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dfile\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary-file\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dfile\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-Diary-File.html
msgid ""
"Your <em class=\"dfn\">diary file</em> is a file that records events "
"associated with particular dates.  The name of the diary file is specified "
"by the variable <code class=\"code\">diary-file</code>.  The default is "
"<samp class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/diary</samp>, though for compatibility with "
"older versions Emacs will use <samp class=\"file\">~/diary</samp> if it "
"exists."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">日記ファイル</em>とは、特定の日付に関連付けられた出来事を記"
"録するファイルのことです。日記ファイルの名前は変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">diary-file</code> で指定されます。デフォルトは <samp "
"class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/diary</samp> ですが、旧バージョンとの互換性のため、"
"Emacs は <samp class=\"file\">~/diary</samp> が存在する場合はそちらを使用しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-Diary-File.html
msgid ""
"Each entry in the diary file describes one event and consists of one or more "
"lines.  An entry always begins with a date specification at the left "
"margin.  The rest of the entry is simply text to describe the event.  If the "
"entry has more than one line, then the lines after the first must begin with "
"whitespace to indicate they continue a previous entry.  Lines that do not "
"begin with valid dates and do not continue a preceding entry are ignored.  "
"Here&rsquo;s an example:"
msgstr ""
"日記ファイルの各エントリは1つの出来事を記述するもので、1行以上で構成されま"
"す。エントリは常に左端の余白にある日付指定から始まります。エントリの残りの部"
"分は、単にその出来事を記述するテキストです。エントリが複数行にわたる場合、2行"
"目以降は、それが前のエントリの続きであることを示すために、先頭に空白文字を置"
"く必要があります。有効な日付で始まらず、かつ前のエントリの続きでもない行は無"
"視されます。以下に例を示します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-Diary-File.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"12/22/2015  Twentieth wedding anniversary!\n"
"10/22       Ruth's birthday.\n"
"* 21, *:    Payday\n"
"Tuesday--weekly meeting with grad students at 10am\n"
"         Supowit, Shen, Bitner, and Kapoor to attend.\n"
"1/13/89     Friday the thirteenth!!\n"
"thu 4pm     squash game with Lloyd.\n"
"mar 16      Dad's birthday\n"
"April 15, 2016 Income tax due.\n"
"* 15        time cards due.\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-Diary-File.html
msgid ""
"This example uses extra spaces to align the event descriptions of most of "
"the entries.  Such formatting is purely a matter of taste."
msgstr ""
"この例では、ほとんどの項目のイベント説明を揃えるために余分なスペースを入れて"
"います。このような書式設定は、あくまで好みの問題です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-Diary-File.html
msgid ""
"You can also use a format where the first line of a diary entry consists "
"only of the date or day name (with no following blanks or punctuation).  For "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"また、日記の1行目を日付や曜日のみ（その後に空白や句読点を入れない）とする形式"
"も使えます。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-Diary-File.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"02/11/2012\n"
"      Bill B. visits Princeton today\n"
"      2pm Cognitive Studies Committee meeting\n"
"      2:30-5:30 Liz at Lawrenceville\n"
"      4:00pm Dentist appt\n"
"      7:30pm Dinner at George's\n"
"      8:00-10:00pm concert\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Format-of-Diary-File.html
msgid ""
"This entry will have a different appearance if you use the simple diary "
"display (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Diary-Display.html\">Diary Display</"
"a>).  The simple diary display omits the date line at the beginning; only "
"the continuation lines appear.  This style of entry looks neater when you "
"display just a single day&rsquo;s entries, but can cause confusion if you "
"ask for more than one day&rsquo;s entries."
msgstr ""
"シンプルな日記表示（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Diary-Display.html\">日記表示</"
"a>を参照）を使用すると、このエントリの見た目が変わります。シンプルな日記表示"
"では、冒頭の日付行が省略され、続きの行のみが表示されます。この形式のエントリ"
"は、1日分のみを表示する場合にはよりすっきりと見えますが、複数日分のエントリを"
"表示させる場合には混乱を招く可能性があります。"

