#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Autofill.html
msgid ""
"<span>28.14.4 Auto Fill in Fortran Mode<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Auto-Fill-in-Fortran-Mode\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>28.14.4 Fortranモードにおけるオートフィル<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Auto-Fill-in-Fortran-Mode\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Autofill.html
msgid ""
"Fortran mode has specialized support for Auto Fill mode, which is a minor "
"mode that automatically splits statements as you insert them when they "
"become too wide.  Splitting a statement involves making continuation lines "
"using <code class=\"code\">fortran-continuation-string</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"ForIndent-Cont.html\">Continuation Lines</a>).  This "
"splitting happens when you type <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">SPC</"
"kbd></kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>, or <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd>, and also in the Fortran "
"indentation commands.  You activate Auto Fill in Fortran mode in the normal "
"way.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Auto-Fill.html\">Auto Fill Mode</a>."
msgstr ""
"Fortranモードでは、Auto Fillモードに特化したサポートが提供されています。Auto "
"Fillモードは、ステートメントの挿入時に幅が広がりすぎた場合に、自動的にステー"
"トメントを分割するマイナーモードです。ステートメントの分割は、<code "
"class=\"code\">fortran-continuation-string</code> を使用して継続行を作成する"
"ことで行われます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"ForIndent-Cont.html\">継続行</a>"
"を参照）。この分割は、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>、または <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> を入力した際や、Fortranのイ"
"ンデントコマンドを使用した際にも行われます。FortranモードでAuto Fillを有効に"
"する方法は、通常の手順と同様です。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Auto-"
"Fill.html\">Auto Fillモード</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Autofill.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dbreak_002dbefore_002ddelimiters\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dbreak_002dbefore_002ddelimiters\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Autofill.html
msgid ""
"Auto Fill breaks lines at spaces or delimiters when the lines get longer "
"than the desired width (the value of <code class=\"code\">fill-column</"
"code>).  The delimiters (besides whitespace) that Auto Fill can break at are "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">=</samp>&rsquo;, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&gt;</samp>&rsquo;, and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  The line break comes after the delimiter if the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">fortran-break-before-delimiters</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Otherwise (and by default), the break comes "
"before the delimiter."
msgstr ""
"Auto Fill は、行が指定した幅（<code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> の値）"
"を超えると、スペースや区切り文字で行を折り返します。Auto Fill が折り返すこと"
"ができる区切り文字（空白文字を除く）は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">+</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">/</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">=</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;"
"</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&gt;</samp>&rsquo;、および "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">,</samp>&rsquo; です。変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">fortran-break-before-delimiters</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、行折り返しは区切り文字の後に行われます。そ"
"れ以外の場合（およびデフォルト）では、折り返しは区切り文字の前に行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Autofill.html
msgid ""
"To enable Auto Fill in all Fortran buffers, add <code class=\"code\">auto-"
"fill-mode</code> to <code class=\"code\">fortran-mode-hook</code>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Hooks.html\">Hooks</a>."
msgstr ""
"すべてのFortranバッファでオートフィルを有効にするには、<code "
"class=\"code\">auto-fill-mode</code>を<code class=\"code\">fortran-mode-"
"hook</code>に追加してください。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Hooks.html\">Hooks</"
"a>を参照してください。"

