"href=\"#Checking-Columns-in-Fortran\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>28.14.5 Fortranでの列のチェック<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Checking-Columns-in-Fortran\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Columns.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fortran_002dline_002dlength\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fortran_002dline_002dlength\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Columns.html
msgid ""
"In standard Fortran 77, anything beyond column 72 is ignored.  Most "
"compilers provide an option to change this (for example, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-ffixed-line-length-N</samp>&rsquo; in gfortran).  Customize "
"the variable <code class=\"code\">fortran-line-length</code> to change the "
"line length in Fortran mode.  Anything beyond this point is font-locked as a "
"comment.  (Unless it is inside a string: strings that extend beyond <code "
"class=\"code\">fortran-line-length</code> will confuse font-lock.)"
msgstr ""
"標準的なFortran 77では、72列目以降の内容は無視されます。ほとんどのコンパイラ"
"では、これを変更するためのオプションが用意されています（例：gfortranの&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">-ffixed-line-length-N</samp>&rsquo;）。Fortranモードで"
"は、変数<code class=\"code\">fortran-line-length</code>をカスタマイズして行長"
"を変更できます。この位置以降の内容は、コメントとしてfont-lockされます。（ただ"
"し、文字列内である場合は除きます。<code class=\"code\">fortran-line-length</"
"code>を超える文字列は、font-lockを混乱させます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Columns.html build/html/emacs/TeX-Print.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-r</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-r</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Columns.html
msgid ""
"Display a column ruler momentarily above the current line (<code "
"class=\"code\">fortran-column-ruler</code>)."
msgstr ""
