# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Columns.html
msgid ""
"Delete all text in column <code class=\"code\">fortran-line-length</code> "
"and beyond."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">fortran-line-length</code>列以降のすべてのテキストを削除"
"してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Columns.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dr-_0028Fortran-"
"mode_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dcolumn_002druler\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dr-_0028Fortran-"
"mode_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dcolumn_002druler\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Columns.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-r</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">fortran-"
"column-ruler</code>) shows a column ruler momentarily above the current "
"line.  The comment ruler is two lines of text that show you the locations of "
"columns with special significance in Fortran programs.  Square brackets show "
"the limits of the columns for line numbers, and curly brackets show the "
"limits of the columns for the statement body.  Column numbers appear above "
"them."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-r</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">fortran-"
"column-ruler</code>) を実行すると、現在の行の上に一時的に列ルーラーが表示され"
"ます。コメントルーラーは2行のテキストで、Fortranプログラムにおいて特別な意味"
"を持つ列の位置を示します。角括弧は行番号の列の範囲を、波括弧はステートメント"
"本体の列の範囲を示します。その上には列番号が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Columns.html
msgid ""
"Note that the column numbers count from zero, as always in GNU Emacs (but "
"customizing <code class=\"code\">column-number-indicator-zero-based</code> "
"can change column display to match that of Fortran; see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Optional-Mode-Line.html\">Optional Mode Line Features</a>.)  As a "
"result, the numbers may be one less than those you are familiar with; but "
"the positions they indicate in the line are standard for Fortran."
msgstr ""
"なお、列番号はGNU Emacsの慣例通り0から始まります（ただし、<code "
"class=\"code\">column-number-indicator-zero-based</code>をカスタマイズするこ"
"とで、列の表示をFortranに合わせることも可能です。詳細は<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Optional-Mode-Line.html\">オプションのモードライン機能</a>を参照してく"
"ださい）。そのため、番号は使い慣れているものより1つ少なくなっている場合があり"
"ますが、行内で示す位置はFortranの標準仕様となっています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Columns.html
msgid ""
