"fortran_002dwindow_002dcreate\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Columns.html
msgid ""
"You can also split the window horizontally and continue editing with the "
"split in place.  To do this, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-c C-w</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">M-x fortran-window-create</code>).  By editing in this window "
"you can immediately see when you make a line too wide to be correct Fortran."
msgstr ""
"また、ウィンドウを水平方向に分割し、その状態のまま編集を続けることもできま"
"す。これを行うには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-c C-w</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">M-x fortran-window-create</code>) を使用してください。このウィ"
"ンドウで編集すれば、行が広すぎて正しいFortranになっていない箇所をすぐに確認で"
"きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Columns.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dstrip_002dsequence_002dnos\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dstrip_002dsequence_002dnos\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Columns.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x fortran-strip-sequence-nos</kbd> deletes "
"all text in column <code class=\"code\">fortran-line-length</code> and "
"beyond, on all lines in the current buffer.  This is the easiest way to get "
