# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Comments.html
msgid ""
"Align the text at a fixed column, which is the sum of <code "
"class=\"code\">fortran-comment-line-extra-indent</code> and the minimum "
"statement indentation.  This is the default."
msgstr ""
"テキストを、<code class=\"code\">fortran-comment-line-extra-indent</code>と最"
"小ステートメントインデントの和となる固定列に揃えます。これがデフォルトです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Comments.html
msgid ""
"The minimum indentation is <code class=\"code\">fortran-minimum-statement-"
"indent-tab</code> for tab format continuation line style and <code "
"class=\"code\">fortran-minimum-statement-indent-fixed</code> for fixed form "
"style."
msgstr ""
"最小インデントは、タブ形式の継続行スタイルでは<code class=\"code\">fortran-"
"minimum-statement-indent-tab</code>、固定形式スタイルでは<code "
"class=\"code\">fortran-minimum-statement-indent-fixed</code>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Comments.html
msgid ""
"Align the text as if it were a line of code, but with an additional <code "
"class=\"code\">fortran-comment-line-extra-indent</code> columns of "
"indentation."
msgstr ""
"テキストをコードの1行であるかのように揃え、さらに<code "
"class=\"code\">fortran-comment-line-extra-indent</code>列分のインデントを加え"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Comments.html
msgid "Don&rsquo;t move text in full-line comments automatically."
msgstr "行全体のコメント内のテキストを自動的に移動させない。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Comments.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dcomment_002dindent_002dchar\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dcomment_002dindent_002dchar\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Comments.html
msgid ""
"In addition, you can specify the character to be used to indent within full-"
"line comments by setting the variable <code class=\"code\">fortran-comment-"
"indent-char</code> to the single-character string you want to use."
msgstr ""
"さらに、変数 <code class=\"code\">fortran-comment-indent-char</code> に使用し"
"たい1文字の文字列を設定することで、行全体のコメント内でインデントに使用する文"
"字を指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Comments.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fortran_002ddirective_002dre\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fortran_002ddirective_002dre\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Comments.html
msgid ""
"Compiler directive lines, or preprocessor lines, have much the same "
"appearance as comment lines.  It is important, though, that such lines never "
"be indented at all, no matter what the value of <code class=\"code\">fortran-"
"comment-indent-style</code>.  The variable <code class=\"code\">fortran-"
"directive-re</code> is a regular expression that specifies which lines are "
"directives.  Matching lines are never indented, and receive distinctive font-"
"locking."
msgstr ""
"コンパイラディレクティブ行（またはプリプロセッサ行）は、コメント行とほぼ同様"
"の見た目をしています。ただし、<code class=\"code\">fortran-comment-indent-"
"style</code>の値にかかわらず、こうした行には一切インデントを付けてはならない"
"点に注意してください。変数<code class=\"code\">fortran-directive-re</code>"
"は、どの行がディレクティブであるかを指定する正規表現です。マッチした行にはイ"
"ンデントが付かず、特徴的なフォントロックが適用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Comments.html
msgid ""
"The normal Emacs comment command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x ;</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">comment-set-column</code>)  has not been redefined.  If you "
"use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">!</samp>&rsquo; comments, this command can "
"be used with them.  Otherwise, it is useless in Fortran mode."
msgstr ""
"通常のEmacsコメントコマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x ;</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">comment-set-column</code>) は再定義されていません。&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">!</samp>&rsquo; コメントを使用している場合は、このコマン"
"ドを併用できます。そうでない場合、Fortranモードでは役に立ちません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Comments.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dc-_003b-_0028Fortran-"
"mode_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dcomment_002dregion\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dcomment_002dregion-1\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dc-_003b-_0028Fortran-"
"mode_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dcomment_002dregion\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"fortran_002dcomment_002dregion-1\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Fortran-Comments.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c ;</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">fortran-"
"comment-region</code>) turns all the lines of the region into comments by "
"inserting the string &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c$$$</samp>&rsquo; at the "
"front of each one.  With a numeric argument, it turns the region back into "
"live code by deleting &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c$$$</samp>&rsquo; from "
"the front of each line in it.  The string used for these comments can be "
"controlled by setting the variable <code class=\"code\">fortran-comment-"
"region</code>.  Note that here we have an example of a command and a "
"variable with the same name; these two uses of the name never conflict "
"because in Lisp and in Emacs it is always clear from the context which one "
"is meant."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c ;</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">fortran-"
"comment-region</code>) は、リージョン内の各行の先頭に文字列 &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">c$$$</samp>&rsquo; を挿入することで、その行をすべてコメントに"
"変換します。数値引数を指定すると、リージョン内の各行の先頭から &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">c$$$</samp>&rsquo; を削除し、リージョンを再び実行可能なコード"
"に戻します。これらのコメントに使用される文字列は、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">fortran-comment-region</code> を設定することで制御できます。な"
"お、ここでは同じ名前を持つコマンドと変数の例を挙げていますが、Lisp および "
"Emacs では文脈からどちらを指しているかが常に明確であるため、これら2つの用法が"
"衝突することはありません。"

