# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Commands.html
msgid "The following commands are used to delete and operate on frames:"
msgstr "フレームの削除や操作には、以下のコマンドを使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-delete_002dframe\"></a> <a id=\"index-"
"C_002dx-5-0\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 0</kbd><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-5-0\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-delete_002dframe\"></a> <a id=\"index-"
"C_002dx-5-0\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 0</kbd><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-5-0\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Delete the selected frame (<code class=\"code\">delete-frame</code>).  This "
"signals an error if there is only one frame."
msgstr ""
"選択されたフレーム (<code class=\"code\">delete-frame</code>) を削除します。"
"フレームが1つしかない場合は、エラーとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-undelete_002dframe\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-undelete_002dframe_002dmode\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-5-u\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 u</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-5-u\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-undelete_002dframe\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-undelete_002dframe_002dmode\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-5-u\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 u</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-5-u\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Commands.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">undelete-frame-mode</code> is enabled, undelete "
"one of the 16 most recently deleted frames.  Without a prefix argument, "
"undelete the most recently deleted frame.  With a numerical prefix argument "
"between 1 and 16, where 1 is the most recently deleted frame, undelete the "
"corresponding deleted frame."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">undelete-frame-mode</code> を有効にすると、直近に削除さ"
"れた16個のフレームのうち1つを復元します。接頭辞引数を指定しない場合は、直近に"
"削除されたフレームを復元します。1から16までの数値の接頭辞引数を指定した場合"
"（1を直近に削除されたフレームとする）、対応する削除済みフレームを復元します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-C_002dz-_0028X-windows_0029\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"z</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dz-_0028X-"
"windows_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-C_002dz-_0028X-windows_0029\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
