# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Minimize (or iconify) the selected Emacs frame (<code class=\"code\">suspend-"
"frame</code>).  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Exiting.html\">Exiting Emacs</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"選択したEmacsフレーム（<code class=\"code\">suspend-frame</code>）を最小化"
"（またはアイコン化）します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Exiting.html\">Emacsから"
"の終了</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-other_002dframe\"></a> <a id=\"index-"
