"link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-5-o\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Select another frame, and raise it.  If you repeat this command, it cycles "
"through all the frames on your terminal."
msgstr ""
"別のフレームを選択して、上に上げます。この操作を繰り返すと、ターミナル上のす"
"べてのフレームが順に切り替わります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-delete_002dother_002dframes\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-5-1\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 1</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-5-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-delete_002dother_002dframes\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-5-1\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 1</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-5-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Commands.html
msgid "Delete all frames on the current terminal, except the selected one."
msgstr "現在の端末で、選択中のフレーム以外のすべてのフレームを削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-toggle_002dframe_002dmaximized\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-M_002dF10\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">F10</kbd></kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"M_002dF10\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-toggle_002dframe_002dmaximized\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-M_002dF10\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
