msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-frame-size_002c-specifying-"
"default\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"For example, you can add the following lines to your init file (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The Emacs Initialization File</a>) "
"to set the default frame width to 90 character columns, the default frame "
"height to 40 character rows, and the default font to &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Monospace-10</samp>&rsquo;:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、initファイル（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">Emacsの初期"
"化ファイル</a>を参照）に以下の行を追加することで、デフォルトのフレーム幅を90"
"文字列、デフォルトのフレーム高さを40文字行、デフォルトのフォントを&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Monospace-10</samp>&rsquo;に設定できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Parameters.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(add-to-list 'default-frame-alist '(width  . 90))\n"
"(add-to-list 'default-frame-alist '(height . 40))\n"
"(add-to-list 'default-frame-alist '(font . &quot;Monospace-10&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"For a list of frame parameters and their effects, see <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Frame-Parameters.html#Frame-Parameters\">Frame Parameters</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"フレームパラメータの一覧とその効果については、<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs "
"Lisp Reference Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Frame-"
"Parameters.html#Frame-Parameters\">Frame Parameters</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Frame-Parameters.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-initial_002dframe_002dalist\"></a>"
