# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/GNU-Free-Documentation-License.html
msgid ""
"This License applies to any manual or other work, in any medium, that "
"contains a notice placed by the copyright holder saying it can be "
"distributed under the terms of this License.  Such a notice grants a world-"
"wide, royalty-free license, unlimited in duration, to use that work under "
"the conditions stated herein.  The &ldquo;Document&rdquo;, below, refers to "
"any such manual or work.  Any member of the public is a licensee, and is "
"addressed as &ldquo;you&rdquo;.  You accept the license if you copy, modify "
"or distribute the work in a way requiring permission under copyright law."
msgstr ""
"本ライセンスは、いかなる媒体であっても、著作権者が本ライセンスの条件に基づき"
"頒布可能である旨の通知を付したあらゆるマニュアルその他の著作物に適用されま"
"す。当該通知は、本規約に定める条件の下で当該著作物を利用するための、全世界的"
"かつロイヤリティフリーで、期間の制限のないライセンスを付与するものです。以下"
"における「ドキュメント」とは、このようなマニュアルまたは著作物を指します。一"
"般公衆の誰もがライセンシーであり、「あなた」と称されます。著作権法に基づく許"
"諾を必要とする方法で著作物を複製、改変、または頒布する場合、あなたは本ライセ"
"ンスに同意したものとみなされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/GNU-Free-Documentation-License.html
msgid ""
"A &ldquo;Modified Version&rdquo; of the Document means any work containing "
"the Document or a portion of it, either copied verbatim, or with "
"modifications and/or translated into another language."
msgstr ""
"本文書の「改変版」とは、本文書またはその一部を、逐語的に複製したもの、あるい"
"は改変を加えたもの、および／または他言語に翻訳したものを含むあらゆる著作物を"
"いう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/GNU-Free-Documentation-License.html
msgid ""
"A &ldquo;Secondary Section&rdquo; is a named appendix or a front-matter "
"section of the Document that deals exclusively with the relationship of the "
"publishers or authors of the Document to the Document&rsquo;s overall "
"subject (or to related matters) and contains nothing that could fall "
"directly within that overall subject.  (Thus, if the Document is in part a "
"textbook of mathematics, a Secondary Section may not explain any "
"mathematics.)  The relationship could be a matter of historical connection "
"with the subject or with related matters, or of legal, commercial, "
"philosophical, ethical or political position regarding them."
msgstr ""
"「二次セクション」とは、文書の出版社または著者と、文書の全体的な主題（または"
"関連事項）との関係のみを扱う、文書の名称付き付録または前付セクションであり、"
"当該全体的な主題に直接該当する内容を一切含まないものをいう。（したがって、文"
"書の一部が数学の教科書である場合、二次セクションで数学の解説を行ってはならな"
"い。）この関係は、主題または関連事項との歴史的なつながり、あるいはそれらに関"
"する法的、商業的、哲学的、倫理的、または政治的な立場に関するものである場合が"
"ある。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/GNU-Free-Documentation-License.html
msgid ""
"The &ldquo;Invariant Sections&rdquo; are certain Secondary Sections whose "
"titles are designated, as being those of Invariant Sections, in the notice "
"that says that the Document is released under this License.  If a section "
"does not fit the above definition of Secondary then it is not allowed to be "
"designated as Invariant.  The Document may contain zero Invariant Sections.  "
