# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/GTK-Resource-Basics.html
msgid ""
"<span>D.5.1 GTK+ Resource Basics<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#GTK_002b-"
"Resource-Basics\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>D.5.1 GTK+ リソースの基本<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#GTK_002b-"
"Resource-Basics\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/GTK-Resource-Basics.html
msgid ""
"In a GTK+ 2 resource file (usually <samp class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/gtkrc</"
"samp>), the simplest kind of a resource setting simply assigns a value to a "
"variable.  For example, putting the following line in the resource file "
"changes the font on all GTK+ widgets to &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">courier-12</samp>&rsquo;:"
msgstr ""
"GTK+ 2のリソースファイル（通常は <samp class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/gtkrc</"
"samp>）において、最も単純なリソース設定は、単に変数に値を代入するものです。例"
"えば、リソースファイルに以下の行を記述すると、すべてのGTK+ウィジェットのフォ"
"ントが &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">courier-12</samp>&rsquo; に変更されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/GTK-Resource-Basics.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "gtk-font-name = &quot;courier 12&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/GTK-Resource-Basics.html
msgid ""
"Note that in this case the font name must be supplied as a GTK font pattern "
"(also called a <em class=\"dfn\">Pango font name</em>), not as a Fontconfig-"
"style font name or XLFD.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Fonts.html\">Fonts</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"なお、この場合、フォント名は Fontconfig 形式のフォント名や XLFD ではなく、"
"GTK フォントパターン（<em class=\"dfn\">Pango フォント名</em> とも呼ばれま"
"す）として指定する必要があります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Fonts.html\">フォ"
"ント</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/GTK-Resource-Basics.html
msgid ""
"To customize widgets you first define a <em class=\"dfn\">style</em>, and "
"then apply the style to the widgets.  Here is an example that sets the font "
"for menus (&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#</samp>&rsquo; characters indicate "
"comments):"
msgstr ""
"ウィジェットをカスタマイズするには、まず<em class=\"dfn\">スタイル</em>を定義"
"し、そのスタイルをウィジェットに適用します。以下に、メニューのフォントを設定"
"する例を示します（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#</samp>&rsquo;文字はコメントを"
"示します）："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/GTK-Resource-Basics.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# <span class=\"r\">Define the style &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">my_style</samp>&rsquo;.</span>\n"
"style &quot;my_style&quot;\n"
"{\n"
"  font_name = &quot;helvetica bold 14&quot;\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"# <span class=\"r\">Specify that widget type &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*emacs-menuitem*</samp>&rsquo; uses &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">my_style</samp>&rsquo;.</span>\n"
"widget &quot;*emacs-menuitem*&quot; style &quot;my_style&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/GTK-Resource-Basics.html
msgid ""
"The widget name in this example contains wildcards, so the style is applied "
"to all widgets matching &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*emacs-menuitem*</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  The widgets are named by the way they are contained, from the "
"outer widget to the inner widget.  Here is another example that applies "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">my_style</samp>&rsquo; specifically to the Emacs "
"menu bar:"
msgstr ""
"この例のウィジェット名にはワイルドカードが含まれているため、スタイルは "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*emacs-menuitem*</samp>&rsquo; に一致するすべての"
"ウィジェットに適用されます。ウィジェットの名前は、外側のウィジェットから内側"
"のウィジェットへと、入れ子になった順に付けられています。以下に、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">my_style</samp>&rsquo; を特にEmacsのメニューバーに適用する別の"
"例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/GTK-Resource-Basics.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "widget &quot;Emacs.pane.menubar.*&quot; style &quot;my_style&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/GTK-Resource-Basics.html
msgid ""
"Here is a more elaborate example, showing how to change the parts of the "
"scroll bar:"
msgstr ""
"スクロールバーの各パーツを変更する方法を示す、より詳細な例を以下に挙げます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/GTK-Resource-Basics.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"style &quot;scroll&quot;\n"
"{\n"
"  fg[NORMAL] = &quot;red&quot;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;# <span class=\"r\">Arrow color.</span>\n"
"  bg[NORMAL] = &quot;yellow&quot;&nbsp;&nbsp;# <span class=\"r\">Thumb and background around arrow.</span>\n"
"  bg[ACTIVE] = &quot;blue&quot;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;# <span class=\"r\">Trough color.</span>\n"
"  bg[PRELIGHT] = &quot;white&quot;&nbsp;# <span class=\"r\">Thumb color when the mouse is over it.</span>\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"widget &quot;*verticalScrollBar*&quot; style &quot;scroll&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

