# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/General-Calendar.html
msgid ""
"To display the number of days elapsed since the start of the year, or the "
"number of days remaining in the year, type the <kbd class=\"kbd\">p d</kbd> "
"command (<code class=\"code\">calendar-print-day-of-year</code>).  This "
"displays both of those numbers in the echo area.  The count of days elapsed "
"includes the selected date.  The count of days remaining does not include "
"that date."
msgstr ""
"年初からの経過日数、または年内の残り日数を表示するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">p "
"d</kbd>コマンド（<code class=\"code\">calendar-print-day-of-year</code>）を入"
"力します。これにより、これら両方の数値がエコーエリアに表示されます。経過日数"
"には選択した日付が含まれます。残り日数にはその日付は含まれません。"

