# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Glossary.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-</kbd> in the name of a character is an abbreviation "
