# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Glossary.html
msgid ""
"A click event is the kind of input event (q.v.) generated when you press a "
"mouse button and release it without moving the mouse.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Mouse-Buttons.html\">Rebinding Mouse Buttons</a>."
msgstr ""
"クリックイベントとは、マウスを動かさずにボタンを押して離すことで発生する入力"
