# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Gnus-Summary-Buffer.html
msgid "The following commands are available in the Gnus summary buffer:"
msgstr "Gnusのサマリーバッファでは、以下のコマンドが使用可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Gnus-Summary-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"gnus_002dsummary_002dnext_002dpage\"></a> <a id=\"index-SPC-_0028Gnus-"
"Summary-mode_0029\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">SPC</"
"kbd></kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-SPC-_0028Gnus-Summary-"
"mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"gnus_002dsummary_002dnext_002dpage\"></a> <a id=\"index-SPC-_0028Gnus-"
"Summary-mode_0029\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">SPC</"
"kbd></kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-SPC-_0028Gnus-Summary-"
"mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Gnus-Summary-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"If there is no article selected, select the article on the current line and "
"display its article buffer.  Otherwise, try scrolling the selected article "
"buffer in its window; on reaching the end of the buffer, select the next "
"unread article (<code class=\"code\">gnus-summary-next-page</code>)."
msgstr ""
"記事が選択されていない場合は、現在の行にある記事を選択し、その記事バッファを"
"表示します。そうでない場合は、選択中の記事バッファをウィンドウ内でスクロール"
"し、バッファの末尾に達したら、次に未読の記事 (<code class=\"code\">gnus-"
"summary-next-page</code>) を選択します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Gnus-Summary-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"Thus, you can read through all articles by repeatedly typing <kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"このように、<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>を繰り返し入力することで、すべての記"
"事を読み通すことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Gnus-Summary-Buffer.html
msgid ""
