#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Grep-Searching.html
msgid ""
"<span>29.4 Searching with Grep under Emacs<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Searching-with-Grep-under-Emacs\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>29.4 EmacsでGrepを使って検索する<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Searching-with-Grep-under-Emacs\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Grep-Searching.html
msgid ""
"Just as you can run a compiler from Emacs and then visit the lines with "
"compilation errors, you can also run <code class=\"command\">grep</code> and "
"then visit the lines on which matches were found.  This works by treating "
"the matches reported by <code class=\"command\">grep</code> as if they were "
"errors.  The output buffer uses Grep mode, which is a variant of Compilation "
"mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Compilation-Mode.html\">Compilation "
"Mode</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Emacsからコンパイラを実行してコンパイルエラーのある行を参照できるのと同様に、"
"<code class=\"command\">grep</code>を実行してマッチが見つかった行を参照するこ"
"ともできます。これは、<code class=\"command\">grep</code>が報告するマッチをエ"
"ラーとして扱うことで実現しています。出力バッファには、Compilationモードの派生"
"であるGrepモードが使用されています（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Compilation-"
"Mode.html\">Compilationモード</a>を参照）。"

