# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Grep-Searching.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x grep-find</kbd> (also available as <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x find-grep</kbd>) is similar to <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"grep</kbd>, but it supplies a different initial default for the "
"command&mdash;one that runs both <code class=\"code\">find</code> and <code "
"class=\"command\">grep</code>, so as to search every file in a directory "
"tree.  See also the <code class=\"code\">find-grep-dired</code> command, in "
"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Dired-and-Find.html\">Dired and <code "
"class=\"code\">find</code></a>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x grep-find</kbd>（<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x find-"
"grep</kbd> としても利用可能）は <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x grep</kbd> に似ていま"
"すが、コマンドに対して異なる初期デフォルト値を提供します。具体的には、<code "
"class=\"code\">find</code> と <code class=\"command\">grep</code> の両方を実"
"行することで、ディレクトリツリー内のすべてのファイルを検索します。また、<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Dired-and-Find.html\">Dired と <code "
"class=\"code\">find</code></a> にあるコマンド <code class=\"code\">find-grep-"
"dired</code> も参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Grep-Searching.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lgrep\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-rgrep\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"zrgrep\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lgrep\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-rgrep\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"zrgrep\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Grep-Searching.html
msgid ""
"The commands <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x lgrep</kbd> (local grep) and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x rgrep</kbd> (recursive grep) are more user-friendly "
"versions of <code class=\"command\">grep</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">grep-find</code>, which prompt separately for the regular "
"expression to match, the files to search, and the base directory for the "
"search.  Case sensitivity of the search is controlled by the current value "
"of <code class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code>.  The command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x zrgrep</kbd> is similar to <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x rgrep</"
"kbd>, but it calls <code class=\"command\">zgrep</code> instead of <code "
"class=\"command\">grep</code> to search the contents of gzipped files."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x lgrep</kbd>（ローカル grep）および <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x rgrep</kbd>（再帰的 grep）は、マッチさせる正規表現、検索対"
"象ファイル、および検索のベースディレクトリを個別に入力させる <code "
"class=\"command\">grep</code> および <code class=\"code\">grep-find</code> "
"の、より使いやすいバージョンです。検索時の大文字小文字の区別は、<code "
"class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code> の現在の値によって制御されます。コマン"
"ド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x zrgrep</kbd> は <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x rgrep</kbd> "
"と同様ですが、gzip 圧縮ファイルの内容を検索する際、<code "
"class=\"command\">grep</code> の代わりに <code class=\"command\">zgrep</"
"code> を呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Grep-Searching.html
msgid ""
"These commands build the shell commands based on the variables <code "
"class=\"code\">grep-template</code> (for <code class=\"code\">lgrep</code>) "
"and <code class=\"code\">grep-find-template</code> (for <code "
"class=\"code\">rgrep</code>).  The files to search can use aliases defined "
"in the variable <code class=\"code\">grep-files-aliases</code>."
msgstr ""
"これらのコマンドは、変数 <code class=\"code\">grep-template</code>（<code "
"class=\"code\">lgrep</code> 用）および <code class=\"code\">grep-find-"
"template</code>（<code class=\"code\">rgrep</code> 用）に基づいてシェルコマン"
"ドを生成します。検索対象のファイルには、変数 <code class=\"code\">grep-files-"
"aliases</code> で定義されたエイリアスを使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Grep-Searching.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"grep_002dfind_002dignored_002ddirectories\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"grep_002dfind_002dignored_002ddirectories\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Grep-Searching.html
msgid ""
"Directories listed in the variable <code class=\"code\">grep-find-ignored-"
"directories</code> are automatically skipped by <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"rgrep</kbd>.  The default value includes the data directories used by "
"various version control systems."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">grep-find-ignored-directories</code> に列挙されてい"
"るディレクトリは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x rgrep</kbd> によって自動的にスキップ"
"されます。デフォルト値には、さまざまなバージョン管理システムで使用されるデー"
"タディレクトリが含まれています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Grep-Searching.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-grep_002dfind_002dabbreviate\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"grep_002dfind_002dtoggle_002dabbreviation\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-grep_002dfind_002dabbreviate\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"grep_002dfind_002dtoggle_002dabbreviation\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Grep-Searching.html
msgid ""
"By default, the shell commands constructed for <code class=\"code\">lgrep</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">rgrep</code>, and <code class=\"code\">zgrep</"
"code> are abbreviated for display by concealing the part that contains a "
"long list of files and directories to ignore.  You can reveal the concealed "
"part by clicking on the button with ellipsis, which represents them.  You "
"can also interactively toggle viewing the concealed part by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x grep-find-toggle-abbreviation</kbd>.  To disable this "
"abbreviation of the shell commands, customize the option <code "
"class=\"code\">grep-find-abbreviate</code> to a <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> value."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、<code class=\"code\">lgrep</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">rgrep</code>、および<code class=\"code\">zgrep</code>用に構成"
"されたシェルコマンドは、無視するファイルやディレクトリの長いリストが含まれる"
"部分を非表示にすることで、表示用に省略されます。これらの部分を表す省略記号付"
"きのボタンをクリックすることで、非表示部分を表示できます。また、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x grep-find-toggle-abbreviation</kbd>と入力することで、非表示"
"部分の表示をインタラクティブに切り替えることも可能です。シェルコマンドのこの"
"省略表示を無効にするには、オプション<code class=\"code\">grep-find-"
"abbreviate</code>を<code class=\"code\">nil</code>の値に設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Grep-Searching.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"grep_002dchange_002dto_002dgrep_002dedit_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-Grep-Edit-mode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-mode_002c-Grep-Edit\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"grep_002dchange_002dto_002dgrep_002dedit_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-Grep-Edit-mode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-mode_002c-Grep-Edit\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Grep-Searching.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">e</kbd> in the <samp class=\"file\">*grep*</samp> "
"buffer makes the buffer writable and enters the Grep Edit mode.  Similar to "
"Occur Edit mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Other-Repeating-"
"Search.html\">Other Search-and-Loop Commands</a>), you can edit the matching "
"lines reported by <code class=\"code\">grep</code> and have those changes "
"reflected in the buffer visiting the originating file.  Type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c</kbd> to leave the Grep Edit mode and return to the "
"Grep mode."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*grep*</samp> バッファに <kbd class=\"kbd\">e</kbd> と入"
"力すると、バッファが書き込み可能になり、Grep Edit モードに入ります。Occur "
"Edit モード（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Other-Repeating-Search.html\">その他の"
"検索・ループコマンド</a> を参照）と同様に、<code class=\"code\">grep</code> "
"で表示された一致行を編集でき、その変更は元のファイルを参照しているバッファに"
"反映されます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c</kbd> と入力すると、Grep Edit モード"
"を終了して Grep モードに戻ります。"

