#: build/html/emacs/Header-Editing.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-b</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">message-"
"goto-body</code>) moves point to just after the header separator "
"line&mdash;that is, to the beginning of the body."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-b</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">message-goto-"
"body</code>) は、ポイントをヘッダー区切り線の直後&mdash;つまり、本文の先頭に"
"移動します。"

