# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Help-Mode.html
msgid ""
"By default, many links in the help buffer are displayed surrounded by quote "
"characters.  If the <code class=\"code\">help-clean-buttons</code> user "
"option is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, these quote characters are "
"removed from the buffer."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、ヘルプバッファ内の多くのリンクが引用符で囲まれて表示されま"
"す。ユーザーオプション <code class=\"code\">help-clean-buttons</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、バッファからこれらの引用符が削除"
"されます。"

