# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Help-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Help buffers produced by some Help commands (like <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h b</"
"kbd>, which shows a long list of key bindings) are divided into pages by the "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^L</samp>&rsquo; character.  In such buffers, "
"the <kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">help-goto-next-page</"
"code>) command will take you to the next start of page, and the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">p</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">help-goto-previous-page</code>) "
"command will take you to the previous start of page.  This way you can "
"quickly navigate between the different kinds of documentation in a help "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"一部のヘルプコマンド（キーバインドの長い一覧を表示する <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"h b</kbd> など）によって生成されるヘルプバッファは、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">^L</samp>&rsquo; 文字でページ分けされています。このようなバッ"
"ファでは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">help-goto-next-"
"page</code>) コマンドで次のページ先頭へ、<kbd class=\"kbd\">p</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">help-goto-previous-page</code>) コマンドで前のページ先頭へ移動"
"できます。これにより、ヘルプバッファ内の異なる種類のドキュメント間を素早く移"
"動できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
