# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Help.html
msgid ""
"If you are looking for a certain feature, but don&rsquo;t know what it is "
"called or where to look, we recommend three methods.  First, try apropos "
"commands, then try searching the manual index, then look in the FAQ and the "
"package keywords, and finally try listing external packages."
msgstr ""
"特定の機能を探しているものの、その名称や探し方がよくわからない場合は、3つの方"
"法をお勧めします。まず、aproposコマンドを試し、次にマニュアルの索引を検索し、"
"続いてFAQやパッケージのキーワードを確認し、最後に外部パッケージを一覧表示して"
"みてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Help.html
msgid ""
"This searches for commands whose names match the argument <var "
"class=\"var\">topics</var>.  The argument can be a keyword, a list of "
"keywords separated by whitespace, or a regular expression (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regexps.html\">Syntax of Regular Expressions</a>).  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Apropos.html\">Apropos</a>."
msgstr ""
"引数 <var class=\"var\">topics</var> に一致する名前のコマンドを検索します。引"
"数には、キーワード、空白区切りのキーワードリスト、または正規表現を指定できま"
"す（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regexps.html\">正規表現の構文</a>を参照）。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Apropos.html\">Apropos</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Help.html
msgid ""
"Similar, but searches the <em class=\"emph\">text</em> of the documentation "
"strings rather than the names of commands and functions."
msgstr ""
"類似していますが、コマンドや関数の名前ではなく、ドキュメント文字列の<em "
"class=\"emph\">テキスト</em>を検索します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
