#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Hiding-Subdirectories.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Hiding</em> a subdirectory means to make it invisible, "
"except for its header line."
msgstr ""
"サブディレクトリを<em class=\"dfn\">非表示</em>にするとは、ヘッダー行を除いて"
