# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Hiding-Subdirectories.html
msgid ""
"Hide or show the subdirectory that point is in, and move point to the next "
"subdirectory (<code class=\"code\">dired-hide-subdir</code>).  This is a "
"toggle.  A numeric argument serves as a repeat count."
msgstr ""
"pointが位置するサブディレクトリを表示または非表示にし、pointを次のサブディレ"
"クトリに移動します (<code class=\"code\">dired-hide-subdir</code>)。これはト"
"グル操作です。数値引数は繰り返し回数として指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Hiding-Subdirectories.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002d_0024-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-dired_002dhide_002dall\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-$</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-dired_002dhide_002dall\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002d_0024-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-dired_002dhide_002dall\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-$</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-dired_002dhide_002dall\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Hiding-Subdirectories.html
msgid ""
"Hide all subdirectories in this Dired buffer, leaving only their header "
"lines (<code class=\"code\">dired-hide-all</code>).  Or, if any subdirectory "
"is currently hidden, make all subdirectories visible again.  You can use "
"this command to get an overview in very deep directory trees or to move "
"quickly to subdirectories far away."
msgstr ""
"このDiredバッファ内のすべてのサブディレクトリを非表示にし、ヘッダー行（<code "
"class=\"code\">dired-hide-all</code>）のみを表示します。あるいは、現在非表示"
"になっているサブディレクトリがある場合、すべてのサブディレクトリを再度表示し"
"ます。このコマンドを使えば、非常に深いディレクトリツリーの全体像を把握した"
"り、遠く離れたサブディレクトリへ素早く移動したりできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Hiding-Subdirectories.html
msgid ""
"Ordinary Dired commands never consider files inside a hidden subdirectory.  "
"For example, the commands to operate on marked files ignore files in hidden "
"directories even if they are marked.  Thus you can use hiding to temporarily "
"exclude subdirectories from operations without having to remove the Dired "
"marks on files in those subdirectories."
msgstr ""
"通常のDiredコマンドでは、隠しサブディレクトリ内のファイルは考慮されません。例"
"えば、マーク済みファイルを操作するコマンドは、たとえマークされていても、隠し"
"ディレクトリ内のファイルを無視します。したがって、サブディレクトリ内のファイ"
"ルからDiredマークを削除することなく、非表示機能を利用して、一時的にサブディレ"
"クトリを操作対象から除外することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Hiding-Subdirectories.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Subdirectories-in-Dired.html\">Subdirectories "
"in Dired</a>, for how to insert a subdirectory listing, and see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Dired-Updating.html\">Updating the Dired Buffer</a>, "
"for how to delete it."
msgstr ""
