# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Highlight-Interactively.html
msgid ""
"Extract regexp/face pairs from comments in the current buffer (<code "
"class=\"code\">hi-lock-find-patterns</code>).  Thus, you can enter patterns "
"interactively with <code class=\"code\">highlight-regexp</code>, store them "
"into the file with <code class=\"code\">hi-lock-write-interactive-patterns</"
"code>, edit them (perhaps including different faces for different "
"parenthesized parts of the match), and finally use this command (<code "
"class=\"code\">hi-lock-find-patterns</code>) to have Hi Lock highlight the "
"edited patterns."
msgstr ""
"現在のバッファ（<code class=\"code\">hi-lock-find-patterns</code>）内のコメン"
"トから正規表現とフェイスのペアを抽出します。これにより、<code "
"class=\"code\">highlight-regexp</code>でインタラクティブにパターンを入力し、"
"<code class=\"code\">hi-lock-write-interactive-patterns</code>でそれらをファ"
"イルに保存し、編集（マッチした括弧内の部分ごとに異なるフェイスを適用する場合"
"など）を行い、最後にこのコマンド（<code class=\"code\">hi-lock-find-"
"patterns</code>）を使用して、Hi Lockで編集済みのパターンをハイライト表示させ"
"ることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/Highlight-Interactively.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"hi_002dlock_002dfile_002dpatterns_002dpolicy\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"hi_002dlock_002dfile_002dpatterns_002dpolicy\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Highlight-Interactively.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">hi-lock-file-patterns-policy</code> "
"controls whether Hi Lock mode should automatically extract and highlight "
"patterns found in a file when it is visited.  Its value can be <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> (never highlight), <code class=\"code\">ask</code> "
"(query the user), or a function.  If it is a function, <code "
"class=\"code\">hi-lock-find-patterns</code> calls it with the patterns as "
"argument; if the function returns non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"patterns are used.  The default is <code class=\"code\">ask</code>.  Note "
"that patterns are always highlighted if you call <code class=\"code\">hi-"
"lock-find-patterns</code> directly, regardless of the value of this variable."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">hi-lock-file-patterns-policy</code> は、Hi Lock "
"モードがファイルにアクセスした際に、ファイル内で見つかったパターンを自動的に"
"抽出してハイライトするかどうかを制御します。その値には、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>（決してハイライトしない）、<code "
"class=\"code\">ask</code>（ユーザーに問い合わせる）、または関数を指定できま"
"す。関数の場合、<code class=\"code\">hi-lock-find-patterns</code> はパターン"
"を引数としてその関数を呼び出し、関数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の"
"値を返した場合にパターンが使用されます。デフォルトは <code "
"class=\"code\">ask</code> です。なお、この変数の値に関わらず、<code "
"class=\"code\">hi-lock-find-patterns</code> を直接呼び出した場合は常にパター"
"ンがハイライトされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/Highlight-Interactively.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-hi_002dlock_002dexclude_002dmodes\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-hi_002dlock_002dexclude_002dmodes\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Highlight-Interactively.html
msgid ""
"Also, <code class=\"code\">hi-lock-find-patterns</code> does nothing if the "
"current major mode&rsquo;s symbol is a member of the list <code "
"class=\"code\">hi-lock-exclude-modes</code>."
