# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/History-References.html
msgid ""
"Various shells, including csh and bash, support <em class=\"dfn\">history "
"references</em> that begin with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">!</samp>&rsquo; "
"and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo;.  Shell mode recognizes "
"these constructs, and can perform the history substitution for you."
msgstr ""
"cshやbashをはじめとする各種シェルは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">!</"
"samp>&rsquo;および&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo;で始まる<em "
"class=\"dfn\">履歴参照</em>をサポートしています。シェルモードはこれらの構文を"
"認識し、履歴置換を実行できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/History-References.html
msgid ""
"If you insert a history reference and type <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd>, "
"this searches the input history for a matching command, performs "
"substitution if necessary, and places the result in the buffer in place of "
"the history reference.  For example, you can fetch the most recent command "
"beginning with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">mv</samp>&rsquo; with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">! m v <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd>.  You can edit the "
"command if you wish, and then resubmit the command to the shell by typing "
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"履歴参照を挿入して <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> と入力すると、入力履歴から一"
"致するコマンドが検索され、必要に応じて置換が行われ、その結果が履歴参照に代"
"わってバッファに配置されます。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">! m v <kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> を使って &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">mv</"
"samp>&rsquo; で始まる直近のコマンドを取得できます。必要に応じてコマンドを編集"
"し、その後 <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力してコマンドをシェルに再送信で"
"きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/History-References.html
msgid ""
