# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
msgid ""
"Each of the holiday variables is a list of <em class=\"dfn\">holiday forms</"
"em>, each form describing a holiday (or sometimes a list of holidays).  Here "
"is a table of the possible kinds of holiday form.  Day numbers and month "
"numbers count starting from 1, but <em class=\"dfn\">dayname</em> numbers "
"count Sunday as 0.  The argument <var class=\"var\">string</var> is always "
"the description of the holiday, as a string."
msgstr ""
"各祝日変数は<em class=\"dfn\">祝日形式</em>のリストであり、各形式は1つの祝日"
"（または場合によっては複数の祝日のリスト）を記述します。以下に、考えられる祝"
"日形式の種類をまとめた表を示します。日番号と月番号は1から数えますが、<em "
"class=\"dfn\">dayname</em>番号では日曜日を0として数えます。引数<var "
"class=\"var\">string</var>は常に、文字列としての祝日の説明となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">(holiday-fixed <var class=\"var\">month</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">day</var> <var class=\"var\">string</var>)</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(holiday-fixed <var class=\"var\">month</var> <var "
"class=\"var\">day</var> <var class=\"var\">string</var>)</code>"

