# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
msgid ""
"&amp;optional <var class=\"var\">day</var>)  The <var class=\"var\">k</"
