# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
msgid ""
"For example, suppose you want to add Bastille Day, celebrated in France on "
"July 14 (i.e., the fourteenth day of the seventh month).  You can do this as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、フランスで7月14日（すなわち7月14日）に祝われる革命記念日を追加したい"
"とします。次のように行うことができます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq holiday-other-holidays '((holiday-fixed 7 14 &quot;Bastille Day&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
msgid ""
"Many holidays occur on a specific day of the week, at a specific time of "
"month.  Here is a holiday form describing Hurricane Supplication Day, "
"celebrated in the Virgin Islands on the fourth Monday in July:"
msgstr ""
"多くの祝日は、特定の曜日や月の特定の日に設けられています。以下は、バージン諸"
"島で7月の第4月曜日に祝われる「ハリケーン祈願の日」について記した祝日フォーム"
"です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(holiday-float 7 1 4 &quot;Hurricane Supplication Day&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
msgid ""
"Here the 7 specifies July, the 1 specifies Monday (Sunday is 0, Tuesday is "
"2, and so on), and the 4 specifies the fourth occurrence in the month (1 "
"specifies the first occurrence, 2 the second occurrence, &minus;1 the last "
"occurrence, &minus;2 the second-to-last occurrence, and so on)."
msgstr ""
"ここで、7は7月を、1は月曜日を（日曜日は0、火曜日は2、以下同様）、4は月内の4回"
"目を表します（1は1回目、2は2回目、&minus;1は最後の回、&minus;2は最後から2回"
"目、以下同様）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
msgid ""
"You can specify holidays that occur on fixed days of the "
"Bah&aacute;&rsquo;&iacute;, Chinese, Hebrew, Islamic, and Julian calendars "
"too.  For example,"
msgstr ""
"グレゴリオ暦、中国暦、ヘブライ暦、イスラム暦、ユリウス暦の固定日にあたる祝日"
"も指定できます。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq holiday-other-holidays\n"
"      '((holiday-hebrew 10 2 &quot;Last day of Hanukkah&quot;)\n"
"        (holiday-islamic 3 12 &quot;Mohammed's Birthday&quot;)\n"
"        (holiday-julian 4 2 &quot;Jefferson's Birthday&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
msgid ""
"adds the last day of Hanukkah (since the Hebrew months are numbered with 1 "
"starting from Nisan), the Islamic feast celebrating Mohammed&rsquo;s "
"birthday (since the Islamic months are numbered from 1 starting with "
"Muharram), and Thomas Jefferson&rsquo;s birthday, which is 2 April 1743 on "
"the Julian calendar."
msgstr ""
"ハヌカーの最終日（ヘブライ暦の月はニサン月から1として数えられるため）、ムハン"
"マドの生誕を祝うイスラム教の祝祭（イスラム暦の月はムハッラム月から1として数え"
"られるため）、そしてユリウス暦で1743年4月2日にあたるトーマス・ジェファーソン"
"の誕生日が追加される。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
msgid ""
"To include a holiday conditionally, use either Emacs Lisp&rsquo;s <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> or the <code class=\"code\">holiday-sexp</code> "
"form.  For example, American presidential elections occur on the first "
"Tuesday after the first Monday in November of years divisible by 4:"
msgstr ""
"祝日を条件付きで含めるには、Emacs Lispの<code class=\"code\">if</code>または"
"<code class=\"code\">holiday-sexp</code>形式のいずれかを使用してください。例"
"えば、アメリカ大統領選挙は、4で割り切れる年の11月最初の月曜日の後の最初の火曜"
"日に行われます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(holiday-sexp '(if (zerop (% year 4))\n"
"                   (calendar-gregorian-from-absolute\n"
"                    (1+ (calendar-dayname-on-or-before\n"
"                          1 (+ 6 (calendar-absolute-from-gregorian\n"
"                                  (list 11 1 year)))))))\n"
"              &quot;US Presidential Election&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Examples.html build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid "or"
msgstr "または"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if (zerop (% displayed-year 4))\n"
"    (holiday-fixed 11\n"
"           (calendar-extract-day\n"
"             (calendar-gregorian-from-absolute\n"
"               (1+ (calendar-dayname-on-or-before\n"
"                     1 (+ 6 (calendar-absolute-from-gregorian\n"
"                              (list 11 1 displayed-year)))))))\n"
"           &quot;US Presidential Election&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
msgid ""
"Some holidays just don&rsquo;t fit into any of these forms because special "
"calculations are involved in their determination.  In such cases you must "
"write a Lisp function to do the calculation.  To include eclipses, for "
"example, add <code class=\"code\">(eclipses)</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">holiday-other-holidays</code> and write an Emacs Lisp "
"function <code class=\"code\">eclipses</code> that returns a (possibly "
"empty) list of the relevant Gregorian dates among the range visible in the "
"calendar window, with descriptive strings, like this:"
msgstr ""
"祝日の中には、決定に特別な計算が伴うため、これらのいずれの形式にも当てはまら"
"ないものがあります。そのような場合は、計算を行うためのLisp関数を記述する必要"
"があります。例えば、食を含めるには、<code class=\"code\">holiday-other-"
"holidays</code> に <code class=\"code\">(eclipses)</code> を加え、カレンダー"
"ウィンドウで表示されている範囲内の該当するグレゴリオ暦の日付を、説明用の文字"
"列とともに（空の場合もあり）リストとして返すEmacs Lisp関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">eclipses</code> を次のように記述します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Holiday-Customizing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(((6 4 2012) &quot;Lunar Eclipse&quot;) ((11 13 2012) &quot;Solar Eclipse&quot;) ... )\n"
msgstr ""

