"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-a-_0028Calendar-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dlist_002dholidays\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holidays.html
msgid ""
"To get even more detailed information, use the <kbd class=\"kbd\">a</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">calendar-list-holidays</code>) command, which displays "
"a separate buffer containing a list of all holidays in the current calendar "
"range.  You can use <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> and <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</"
"kbd> in the calendar window to scroll that list up and down, respectively."
msgstr ""
"さらに詳細な情報を取得するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">a</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-list-holidays</code>) コマンドを使用してください。こ"
"れにより、現在のカレンダー範囲内のすべての祝日の一覧を含む別バッファが表示さ"
"れます。カレンダーウィンドウで <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> および <kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> を使用すると、それぞれその一覧を上下にスクロールでき"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Holidays.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-holidays-1\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dview_002dholidays_002dinitially_002dflag\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-holidays-1\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dview_002dholidays_002dinitially_002dflag\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holidays.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x holidays</kbd> displays the list of "
"holidays for the current month and the preceding and succeeding months; this "
"works even if you don&rsquo;t have a calendar window.  If the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-view-holidays-initially-flag</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, creating the calendar displays holidays in this "
"way.  If you want the list of holidays centered around a different month, "
"use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-x holidays</kbd>, which prompts for the month "
"and year."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x holidays</kbd> は、当月および前後の月の祝日一"
"覧を表示します。これは、カレンダーウィンドウが開いていない場合でも動作しま"
"す。変数 <code class=\"code\">calendar-view-holidays-initially-flag</code> "
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、カレンダーを作成するとこのよう"
"に祝日が表示されます。別の月を中心とした祝日一覧を表示したい場合は、月と年の"
"入力を求める <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-x holidays</kbd> を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holidays.html
msgid ""
"The holidays known to Emacs include United States holidays and the major "
"Bah&aacute;&rsquo;&iacute;, Chinese, Christian, Islamic, and Jewish "
"holidays; also the solstices and equinoxes."
msgstr ""
"Emacsで認識される祝日には、米国の祝日のほか、主要な仏教、中国、キリスト教、イ"
"スラム教、ユダヤ教の祝日、さらには至点や分点が含まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Holidays.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-list_002dholidays\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-holiday_002dlist\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-list_002dholidays\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-holiday_002dlist\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holidays.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x holiday-list</kbd> displays the list of "
"holidays for a range of years.  This function asks you for the starting and "
"stopping years, and allows you to choose all the holidays or one of several "
"categories of holidays.  You can use this command even if you don&rsquo;t "
"have a calendar window."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x holiday-list</kbd> は、指定した期間の祝日一覧"
"を表示します。この機能では、開始年と終了年を入力でき、すべての祝日、または複"
"数のカテゴリーからいずれか一つを選択して表示することが可能です。カレンダー"
"ウィンドウが開いていない状態でも、このコマンドを使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Holidays.html
msgid ""
"The dates used by Emacs for holidays are based on <em class=\"emph\">current "
"practice</em>, not historical fact.  For example Veteran&rsquo;s Day began "
"in 1919, but is shown in earlier years."
msgstr ""
"Emacsが祝日に使用している日付は、歴史的事実ではなく<em class=\"emph\">現在の"
"慣行</em>に基づいています。例えば、退役軍人の日は1919年に始まりましたが、それ"
"以前の年にも表示されています。"

