"<em class=\"dfn\">hungry deletion</em>.  This deletes all the contiguous "
"whitespace either before point or after point in a single operation.  <em "
"class=\"dfn\">Whitespace</em> here includes tabs and newlines, but not "
"comments or preprocessor commands."
msgstr ""
