#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
msgid ""
"<span>21.7.2 Fast minibuffer selection<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Fast-minibuffer-selection\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>21.7.2 高速なミニバッファ選択<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Fast-"
"minibuffer-selection\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-icomplete_002dmode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Icomplete-mode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-icomplete_002dmode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Icomplete-mode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
msgid ""
"Icomplete mode provides a convenient way to quickly select an element among "
"the possible completions in a minibuffer.  When enabled, typing in the "
"minibuffer continuously displays a list of possible completions that match "
"the string you have typed."
msgstr ""
"Icompleteモードを使用すると、ミニバッファ内の候補の中から要素を素早く選択でき"
"ます。このモードを有効にすると、ミニバッファで入力を続けるたびに、入力した文"
"字列に一致する候補の一覧が順次表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
msgid ""
"At any time, you can type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> to select the first "
"completion in the list.  So the way to select a particular completion is to "
"make it the first in the list.  There are two ways to do this.  You can type "
"more of the completion name and thus narrow down the list, excluding "
"unwanted completions above the desired one.  Alternatively, you can use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-.</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-,</kbd> to rotate the list "
"until the desired buffer is first."
msgstr ""
"いつでも <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> と入力することで、リスト内の最初の補完"
"項目を選択できます。つまり、特定の補完項目を選択するには、それをリストの先頭"
"に持ってくればよいということです。これには2つの方法があります。補完項目名をさ"
"らに入力してリストを絞り込み、目的の項目より上にある不要な補完項目を除外する"
"方法です。あるいは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-.</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-,</"
"kbd> を使ってリストを回転させ、目的のバッファを先頭に持ってくる方法もありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> will select the "
"first completion in the list, like <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> but without "
"exiting the minibuffer, so you can edit it further.  This is typically used "
"when entering a file name, where <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> can be used a few times to descend in the "
"hierarchy of directories."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> は <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> と同様にリスト内の最初の補完項目を選択しますが、ミニ"
"バッファを離脱しないため、さらに編集を加えることができます。これは通常、ファ"
"イル名を入力する際に使用され、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</"
"kbd></kbd> を数回使うことでディレクトリ階層を辿ることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
msgid ""
"To enable Icomplete mode for the minibuffer, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"icomplete-mode</kbd>, or customize the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">icomplete-mode</code> to <code class=\"code\">t</code> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Easy-Customization.html\">Easy Customization "
"Interface</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ミニバッファで Icomplete モードを有効にするには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"icomplete-mode</kbd> と入力するか、変数 <code class=\"code\">icomplete-mode</"
"code> を <code class=\"code\">t</code> にカスタマイズしてください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Easy-Customization.html\">Easy Customization "
"Interface</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
msgid ""
"You can also additionally enable Icomplete mode for <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-"
"i</kbd> (the command <code class=\"code\">completion-at-point</code>) by "
"customizing the variable <code class=\"code\">icomplete-in-buffer</code> to "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code>.  For in-buffer completion, the <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-auto-help</code> variable controls when Icomplete "
"mode&rsquo;s display of possible completions appears.  The default value of "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> means that the display of possible completions "
"appears when you first type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-i</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"また、変数 <code class=\"code\">icomplete-in-buffer</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> にカスタマイズすることで、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-i</"
"kbd> に対しても Icomplete モード（コマンド <code class=\"code\">completion-"
"at-point</code>）を有効にできます。バッファ内での補完では、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">completion-auto-help</code> によって Icomplete モードの候補表"
"示が表示されるタイミングが制御されます。<code class=\"code\">t</code> のデ"
"フォルト値では、最初に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-i</kbd> と入力した際に候補表示"
"が現れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
msgid ""
"By default, when you press <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-i</kbd>, both Icomplete "
"mode&rsquo;s in-buffer display of possible completions and the <samp "
"class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> buffer appear.  If you are using <code "
"class=\"code\">icomplete-in-buffer</code>, then you may wish to suppress "
"this appearance of the <samp class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> buffer.  To "
"do that, add the following to your initialization file (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The Emacs Initialization File</a>):"
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-i</kbd> を押すと、Icomplete モードの両"
"方における補完候補のバッファ内表示と <samp class=\"file\">*Completions*</"
"samp> バッファが表示されます。<code class=\"code\">icomplete-in-buffer</"
"code> を使用している場合、この <samp class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> バッ"
"ファの表示を抑制したいこともあるでしょう。その場合は、初期化ファイルに以下を"
"追加してください（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">Emacs 初期化ファ"
"イル</a> を参照）："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(advice-add 'completion-at-point :after #'minibuffer-hide-completions)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fido_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-fido-mode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fido_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-fido-mode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
msgid ""
"An alternative to Icomplete mode is Fido mode.  This is very similar to "
"Icomplete mode, but retains some functionality from a popular extension "
"called Ido mode (in fact the name is derived from &ldquo;Fake Ido&rdquo;).  "
"Among other things, in Fido mode, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd> are also used to rotate the completions list, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> can be used to delete files and kill buffers in-"
"list.  Another noteworthy aspect is that <code class=\"code\">flex</code> is "
"used as the default completion style (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Completion-Styles.html\">How Completion Alternatives Are Chosen</"
"a>).  To change this, add the following to your initialization file (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The Emacs Initialization File</a>):"
msgstr ""
"Icompleteモードの代替手段として、Fidoモードがあります。これはIcompleteモード"
"と非常に似ていますが、Idoモードという人気の拡張機能の機能の一部を継承していま"
"す（実際、その名称は「Fake Ido」に由来しています）。Fidoモードでは、とりわけ"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd>と<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd>が補完リストの切り"
"替えに使用され、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd>でファイルの削除やリスト内のバッ"
"ファの終了が可能です。もう一つの特筆すべき点は、<code class=\"code\">flex</"
"code>がデフォルトの補完スタイルとして使用されていることです（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion-Styles.html\">補完の代替手段の選び方</a>を"
"参照）。これを変更するには、初期化ファイルに以下を追加してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">Emacs初期化ファイル</a>を参照）："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun my-icomplete-styles ()\n"
"  (setq-local completion-styles '(initials flex)))\n"
"(add-hook 'icomplete-minibuffer-setup-hook 'my-icomplete-styles)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
msgid ""
"To enable Fido mode, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x fido-mode</kbd>, or "
"customize the variable <code class=\"code\">fido-mode</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Easy-"
"Customization.html\">Easy Customization Interface</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Fidoモードを有効にするには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x fido-mode</kbd>と入力する"
"か、変数<code class=\"code\">fido-mode</code>を<code class=\"code\">t</code>"
"にカスタマイズしてください（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Easy-"
"Customization.html\">簡単カスタマイズインターフェース</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-icomplete_002dvertical_002dmode\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Icomplete-vertical-mode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-icomplete_002dvertical_002dmode\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Icomplete-vertical-mode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
msgid ""
"Icomplete mode and Fido mode display the possible completions on the same "
"line as the prompt by default.  To display the completion candidates "
"vertically under the prompt, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x icomplete-vertical-"
"mode</kbd>, or customize the variable <code class=\"code\">icomplete-"
"vertical-mode</code> to <code class=\"code\">t</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Easy-Customization.html\">Easy Customization "
"Interface</a>)."
msgstr ""
"IcompleteモードおよびFidoモードでは、デフォルトで補完候補がプロンプトと同じ行"
"に表示されます。補完候補をプロンプトの下に縦方向に表示するには、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x icomplete-vertical-mode</kbd>と入力するか、変数<code "
"class=\"code\">icomplete-vertical-mode</code>を<code class=\"code\">t</code>"
"にカスタマイズしてください（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Easy-"
"Customization.html\">Easy Customization Interface</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Icomplete.html
