#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Identifier-Search.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">e</kbd> in the <samp class=\"file\">*xref*</samp> "
"buffer makes the buffer writable and enters the Xref Edit mode.  Similar to "
"Occur Edit mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Other-Repeating-"
"Search.html\">Other Search-and-Loop Commands</a>), you can edit the matching "
"lines reported by Xref backend and have those changes reflected in the "
"buffer visiting the originating file.  Type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c</kbd> "
"to leave the Xref Edit mode and return to the Xref mode."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*xref*</samp> バッファに <kbd class=\"kbd\">e</kbd> と入"
"力すると、バッファが書き込み可能になり、Xref Edit モードに入ります。Occur "
"Edit モード（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Other-Repeating-Search.html\">その他の"
"検索・ループコマンド</a> を参照）と同様に、Xref バックエンドが報告した一致行"
"を編集でき、その変更は元のファイルを参照しているバッファに反映されます。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c</kbd> と入力すると、Xref Edit モードを終了し、Xref モー"
"ドに戻ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Identifier-Search.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tags_002dsearch\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tags_002dsearch\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Identifier-Search.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x tags-search</kbd> reads a regexp using the "
"minibuffer, then searches for matches in all the files in the selected tags "
"table, one file at a time.  It displays the name of the file being searched "
"so you can follow its progress.  As soon as it finds an occurrence, <code "
"class=\"code\">tags-search</code> returns.  This command requires tags "
"tables to be available (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Tags-"
"Tables.html\">Tags Tables</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x tags-search</kbd> はミニバッファを使用して正規表現を読"
"み込み、選択されたタグテーブル内のすべてのファイルから、1ファイルずつ一致箇所"
"を検索します。検索中のファイル名が表示されるため、進捗状況を確認できます。一"
"致箇所が見つかるとすぐに、<code class=\"code\">tags-search</code> が戻りま"
"す。このコマンドを使用するには、タグテーブルが利用可能である必要があります"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Tags-Tables.html\">タグテーブル</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Identifier-Search.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fileloop_002dcontinue\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fileloop_002dcontinue\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Identifier-Search.html
msgid ""
"Having found one match with <code class=\"code\">tags-search</code>, you "
"probably want to find all the rest.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x fileloop-"
"continue</kbd> resumes the <code class=\"code\">tags-search</code>, finding "
"one more match.  This searches the rest of the current buffer, followed by "
"the remaining files of the tags table."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">tags-search</code> で1件のマッチが見つかったため、おそら"
"く残りのすべても探したいはずです。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x fileloop-continue</"
"kbd> は <code class=\"code\">tags-search</code> を再開し、さらに1件のマッチを"
"見つけます。これにより、現在のバッファの残りの部分と、続いてタグテーブルの残"
"りのファイルが検索されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Identifier-Search.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tags_002dquery_002dreplace\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tags_002dquery_002dreplace\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Identifier-Search.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x tags-query-replace</kbd> performs a single <code "
"class=\"code\">query-replace-regexp</code> through all the files in the tags "
"table.  It reads a regexp to search for and a string to replace with, just "
"like ordinary <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x query-replace-regexp</kbd>.  It "
"searches much like <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x tags-search</kbd>, but repeatedly, "
"processing matches according to your input.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Query-Replace.html\">Query Replace</a>, for more information on query "
"replace."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x tags-query-replace</kbd> は、タグテーブル内のすべての"
"ファイルに対して単一の <code class=\"code\">query-replace-regexp</code> を実"
"行します。通常の <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x query-replace-regexp</kbd> と同様に、"
"検索用の正規表現と置換後の文字列を読み込みます。検索方法は <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x tags-search</kbd> とほぼ同様ですが、繰り返し実行され、入力"
"に応じて一致箇所を処理します。クエリ置換の詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Query-Replace.html\">Query Replace</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Identifier-Search.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tags_002dcase_002dfold_002dsearch\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case_002dsensitivity-and-tags-"
"search\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tags_002dcase_002dfold_002dsearch\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case_002dsensitivity-and-tags-"
"search\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Identifier-Search.html
msgid ""
"You can control the case-sensitivity of tags search commands by customizing "
"the value of the variable <code class=\"code\">tags-case-fold-search</"
"code>.  The default is to use the same setting as the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-"
"Search.html\">Lax Matching During Searching</a>)."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">tags-case-fold-search</code> の値をカスタマイズする"
"ことで、タグ検索コマンドの大文字・小文字の区別を制御できます。デフォルトで"
"は、<code class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code> の値と同じ設定が使用されます"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">検索時の緩いマッチング</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Identifier-Search.html
msgid ""
"It is possible to get through all the files in the tags table with a single "
"invocation of <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x tags-query-replace</kbd>.  But often it "
"is useful to exit temporarily, which you can do with any input event that "
"has no special query replace meaning.  You can resume the query replace "
"subsequently by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x fileloop-continue</kbd>; this "
"command resumes the last tags search or replace command that you did.  For "
"instance, to skip the rest of the current file, you can type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-&gt;&nbsp;M-x&nbsp;fileloop-continue</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x tags-query-replace</kbd> を一度呼び出すだけで、タグ"
"テーブル内のすべてのファイルを処理することが可能です。しかし、一時的に終了し"
"たい場面も多く、その場合は特別なクエリ置換の意味を持たない任意の入力イベント"
"で終了できます。その後、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x fileloop-continue</kbd> と入力"
"することでクエリ置換を再開できます。このコマンドは、直前に行ったタグの検索ま"
"たは置換コマンドを再開します。例えば、現在のファイルの残りの部分をスキップす"
"るには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&gt;&nbsp;M-x&nbsp;fileloop-continue</kbd> と入"
"力します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Identifier-Search.html
msgid ""
"Note that the commands described above carry out much broader searches than "
"the <code class=\"code\">xref-find-definitions</code> family.  The <code "
"class=\"code\">xref-find-definitions</code> commands search only for "
"definitions of identifiers that match your string or regexp.  The commands "
"<code class=\"code\">xref-find-references</code>, <code class=\"code\">tags-"
"search</code>, and <code class=\"code\">tags-query-replace</code> find every "
"occurrence of the identifier or regexp, as ordinary search commands and "
"replace commands do in the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"なお、上述のコマンドは、<code class=\"code\">xref-find-definitions</code> 系"
"よりもはるかに広範な検索を行う点にご注意ください。<code class=\"code\">xref-"
"find-definitions</code> コマンドは、指定した文字列または正規表現に一致する識"
"別子の定義のみを検索します。<code class=\"code\">xref-find-references</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">tags-search</code>、および <code "
"class=\"code\">tags-query-replace</code> コマンドは、現在のバッファにおける通"
"常の検索コマンドや置換コマンドと同様に、識別子または正規表現のすべての出現箇"
"所を検索します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Identifier-Search.html
msgid ""
"As an alternative to <code class=\"code\">xref-find-references</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">tags-search</code>, you can run <code "
"class=\"command\">grep</code> as a subprocess and have Emacs show you the "
"matching lines one by one.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Grep-"
"Searching.html\">Searching with Grep under Emacs</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">xref-find-references</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">tags-search</code> の代替として、<code "
"class=\"command\">grep</code> をサブプロセスとして実行し、Emacs に一致する行"
"を1行ずつ表示させることもできます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Grep-"
"Searching.html\">Emacs での Grep による検索</a> を参照してください。"

