#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Image-Mode.html
msgid ""
"To resize the image manually you can use the command <code "
"class=\"code\">image-transform-fit-to-window</code> bound to <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">s w</kbd> that fits the image to both the window height and "
"width.  To scale the image to a percentage of its original size, use the "
"command <code class=\"code\">image-transform-set-percent</code> bound to "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">s p</kbd>.  To scale the image specifying a scale factor, "
"use the command <code class=\"code\">image-transform-set-scale</code> bound "
