# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Image_002dDired.html
msgid ""
"If you have the <code class=\"command\">exiftool</code> program installed, "
"you can set the <abbr class=\"acronym\">EXIF</abbr> &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ImageDescription</samp>&rsquo; tag of an image file by "
"invoking the <code class=\"code\">image-dired-thumbnail-set-image-"
"description</code> command with point at the thumbnail of the image file.  "
"This command prompts for the description of the image, and adds the <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">EXIF</abbr> tag to it."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"command\">exiftool</code>プログラムがインストールされている場合"
"は、画像ファイルのサムネイルをポイントした状態で<code class=\"code\">image-"
"dired-thumbnail-set-image-description</code>コマンドを実行することで、画像"
"ファイルの<abbr class=\"acronym\">EXIF</abbr> &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ImageDescription</samp>&rsquo;タグを設定できます。このコマンド"
"は画像の説明の入力を求め、そこに<abbr class=\"acronym\">EXIF</abbr>タグを追加"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Image_002dDired.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
