# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Incremental-Search.html
msgid ""
"The principal search command in Emacs is <em class=\"dfn\">incremental</em>: "
"it begins searching as soon as you type the first character of the search "
"string.  As you type in the search string, Emacs shows you where the string "
"(as you have typed it so far) would be found.  When you have typed enough "
"characters to identify the place you want, you can stop.  Depending on what "
"you plan to do next, you may or may not need to terminate the search "
"explicitly with <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsの主要な検索コマンドは<em class=\"dfn\">インクリメンタル</em>方式です。"
"検索文字列の最初の1文字を入力した時点で、すぐに検索が開始されます。検索文字列"
"を入力するにつれて、Emacsは（これまでに入力した内容で）その文字列がどこに見つ"
"かるかを表示します。目的の箇所を特定するのに十分な文字数を入力したら、そこで"
"終了できます。次に何を行う予定かによって、<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>を用い"
"て明示的に検索を終了させる必要がある場合と、そうでない場合があります。"

