# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Indent-Convenience.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tab_002dalways_002dindent\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tab_002dalways_002dindent\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indent-Convenience.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">tab-always-indent</code> tweaks the "
"behavior of the <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">indent-"
"for-tab-command</code>) command.  The default value, <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>, gives the behavior described in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Indentation.html\">Indentation</a>.  If you change the value to the "
"symbol <code class=\"code\">complete</code>, then <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</"
"kbd> first tries to indent the current line, and if the line was already "
"indented, it tries to complete the text at point (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Symbol-Completion.html\">Completion for Symbol Names</a>).  If the "
"value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> "
"indents the current line only if point is at the left margin or in the "
"line&rsquo;s indentation; otherwise, it inserts a tab character."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">tab-always-indent</code> は、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">indent-for-tab-command</code>) "
"コマンドの動作を調整します。デフォルト値の <code class=\"code\">t</code> で"
"は、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Indentation.html\">インデント</a> で説明されてい"
"る動作になります。値を記号 <code class=\"code\">complete</code> に変更する"
"と、<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> はまず現在の行をインデントしようとし、すでに"
"インデントされている場合は、ポイントにあるテキストを補完しようとします（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Symbol-Completion.html\">記号名の補完</a> を参照）。値"
"が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> はポ"
"イントが左マージンにあるか、または行のインデント内にある場合にのみ現在の行を"
"インデントし、それ以外の場合はタブ文字を挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Indent-Convenience.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tab_002dfirst_002dcompletion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tab_002dfirst_002dcompletion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indent-Convenience.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">tab-always-indent</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">complete</code>, whether to expand or indent can be further "
"customized via the <code class=\"code\">tab-first-completion</code> "
"variable.  For instance, if that variable is <code class=\"code\">eol</"
"code>, only complete if point is at the end of a line.  See <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Mode_002dSpecific-Indent.html#Mode_002dSpecific-Indent\">Mode-Specific "
"Indent</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>, "
"for further details."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">tab-always-indent</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">complete</code> である場合、展開するかインデントするかは "
"<code class=\"code\">tab-first-completion</code> 変数でさらにカスタマイズでき"
"ます。例えば、この変数が <code class=\"code\">eol</code> であれば、point が行"
"末にある場合にのみ完了します。詳細については、<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs "
"Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Mode_002dSpecific-"
"Indent.html#Mode_002dSpecific-Indent\">Mode-Specific Indent</a> を参照してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Indent-Convenience.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Electric-Indent-mode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mode_002c-Electric-Indent\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-electric_002dindent_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Electric-Indent-mode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mode_002c-Electric-Indent\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-electric_002dindent_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indent-Convenience.html
msgid ""
"Electric Indent mode is a global minor mode that automatically indents the "
"line after every <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> you type.  This mode is "
"enabled by default.  To toggle this minor mode, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"electric-indent-mode</kbd>.  To toggle the mode in a single buffer, use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x electric-indent-local-mode</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"Electric Indentモードは、<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>を入力するたびに自動的に"
"行をインデントするグローバルマイナーモードです。このモードはデフォルトで有効"
"になっています。このマイナーモードを切り替えるには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"electric-indent-mode</kbd>と入力してください。単一のバッファ内でモードを切り"
"替えるには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x electric-indent-local-mode</kbd>を使用して"
"ください。"

