"Apart from the <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">indent-for-tab-command</code>)  command, Emacs provides a "
"variety of commands to perform indentation in other ways."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">indent-for-tab-command</code>) コマンドのほか、Emacsでは別の方"
"法でインデントを行うためのさまざまなコマンドが用意されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-split_002dline\"></a> <a id=\"index-"
"C_002dM_002do\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-o</kbd><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-C_002dM_002do\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-split_002dline\"></a> <a id=\"index-"
"C_002dM_002do\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-o</kbd><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-C_002dM_002do\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Split the current line at point (<code class=\"code\">split-line</code>).  "
"The text on the line after point becomes a new line, indented to the same "
"column where point is located.  This command first moves point forward over "
"any spaces and tabs.  Afterward, point is positioned before the inserted "
"newline."
msgstr ""
"現在の行をポイント (<code class=\"code\">split-line</code>) で分割します。ポ"
"イント以降の行のテキストは新しい行となり、ポイントがある位置と同じ列にインデ"
"ントされます。このコマンドはまず、スペースやタブを越えてポイントを前方に移動"
"させます。その後、ポイントは挿入された改行の前に配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-back_002dto_002dindentation\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-M_002dm\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-m</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-M_002dm\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-back_002dto_002dindentation\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-M_002dm\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-m</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-M_002dm\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Move (forward or back) to the first non-whitespace character on the current "
"line (<code class=\"code\">back-to-indentation</code>).  If there are no non-"
"whitespace characters on the line, move to the end of the line."
msgstr ""
"現在の行の最初の非空白文字（<code class=\"code\">back-to-indentation</code>）"
"へ移動（前方または後方）します。行に非空白文字がない場合は、行末へ移動しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tab_002dto_002dtab_002dstop\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-M_002di\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-i</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-M_002di\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-tab_002dto_002dtab_002dstop\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-M_002di\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-i</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-M_002di\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Indent whitespace at point, up to the next tab stop (<code "
"class=\"code\">tab-to-tab-stop</code>).  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Tab-"
"Stops.html\">Tab Stops</a>."
msgstr ""
"現在の位置から次のタブストップ（<code class=\"code\">tab-to-tab-stop</code>）"
"までの空白をインデントします。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Tab-Stops.html\">タブ"
"ストップ</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-indent_002drelative\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x indent-"
"relative</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"indent_002drelative\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-indent_002drelative\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x indent-"
"relative</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"indent_002drelative\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Insert whitespace at point, until point is aligned with the first non-"
"whitespace character on the previous line (actually, the last non-blank "
"line).  If point is already farther right than that, run <code "
"class=\"code\">tab-to-tab-stop</code> instead&mdash;unless called with a "
"numeric argument, in which case do nothing."
msgstr ""
"ポイントを、前の行（実際には最後の非空白行）の最初の非空白文字と揃うまで空白"
"文字で埋めます。ポイントがすでにそれより右にある場合は、代わりに <code "
"class=\"code\">tab-to-tab-stop</code> を実行します&mdash;ただし、数値引数を指"
"定して呼び出された場合は何もしません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-delete_002dindentation\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-M_002d_005e\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-^</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-M_002d_005e\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-delete_002dindentation\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-M_002d_005e\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-^</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-M_002d_005e\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Merge the previous and the current line (<code class=\"code\">delete-"
"indentation</code>).  This joins the two lines cleanly, by replacing any "
"indentation at the front of the current line, together with the line "
"boundary, with a single space."
msgstr ""
"直前の行と現在の行（<code class=\"code\">delete-indentation</code>）をマージ"
"します。これにより、現在の行の先頭にあるインデントと行境界を単一のスペースに"
"置き換えることで、2つの行をきれいに結合します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"As a special case (useful for Lisp code), the single space is omitted if the "
"characters to be joined are consecutive opening and closing parentheses, or "
"if the junction follows another newline."
msgstr ""
"特殊なケース（Lispコードで有用）として、結合する文字が連続する開き括弧と閉じ"
"括弧である場合、あるいは接合部が別の改行の後に続く場合には、単一のスペースは"
"省略されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If there is a fill prefix, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-^</kbd> deletes the fill "
"prefix if it appears after the newline that is deleted.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Fill-Prefix.html\">The Fill Prefix</a>."
msgstr ""
"フィルプレフィックスがある場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-^</kbd> は、削除される改"
"行の後にフィルプレフィックスが出現していれば、それを削除します。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Fill-Prefix.html\">フィルプレフィックス</a>を参照してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"With a prefix argument, join the current line to the following line.  If the "
"region is active, and no prefix argument is given, join all lines in the "
"region instead."
msgstr ""
"プレフィックス引数が指定された場合は、現在の行を次の行に結合します。リージョ"
"ンがアクティブで、プレフィックス引数が指定されていない場合は、代わりにリー"
"ジョン内のすべての行を結合します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-indent_002dregion\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dM_002d_005c\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-\\</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dM_002d_005c\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-indent_002dregion\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dM_002d_005c\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-\\</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dM_002d_005c\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Indent all the lines in the region, as though you had typed <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> at the beginning of each "
"line (<code class=\"code\">indent-region</code>)."
msgstr ""
"各行の先頭に <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> と入力した"
"かのように、リージョン内のすべての行をインデントしてください（<code "
"class=\"code\">indent-region</code>）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If a numeric argument is supplied, indent every line in the region to that "
"column number."
msgstr ""
"数値引数が指定された場合、リージョン内のすべての行をその列番号までインデント"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Indentation-Commands.html
msgid ""
