# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-indirect-buffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-base-buffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-indirect-buffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-base-buffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"An <em class=\"dfn\">indirect buffer</em> shares the text of some other "
"buffer, which is called the <em class=\"dfn\">base buffer</em> of the "
"indirect buffer.  In some ways it is a buffer analogue of a symbolic link "
"between files."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">間接バッファ</em>は、別のバッファのテキストを共有しており、"
"そのバッファは間接バッファの<em class=\"dfn\">ベースバッファ</em>と呼ばれま"
"す。ある意味では、ファイル間のシンボリックリンクに相当するバッファと言えま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-make_002dindirect_002dbuffer\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x make-indirect-buffer <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var class=\"var\">base-"
"buffer</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var class=\"var\">indirect-name</"
"var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dindirect_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-make_002dindirect_002dbuffer\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x make-indirect-buffer <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var class=\"var\">base-"
"buffer</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var class=\"var\">indirect-name</"
"var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-make_002dindirect_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Create an indirect buffer named <var class=\"var\">indirect-name</var> with "
"base buffer <var class=\"var\">base-buffer</var>.  <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-clone_002dindirect_002dbuffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"ベースバッファ <var class=\"var\">base-buffer</var> を用いて、<var "
"class=\"var\">indirect-name</var> という名前の間接バッファを作成します。  <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-clone_002dindirect_002dbuffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x clone-indirect-buffer <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x clone-indirect-buffer <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid "Create an indirect buffer that is a twin copy of the current buffer."
msgstr "現在のバッファのツインコピーとなる間接バッファを作成する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"clone_002dindirect_002dbuffer_002dother_002dwindow\"></a> <a id=\"index-"
"C_002dx-4-c\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 c</kbd><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-4-c\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"clone_002dindirect_002dbuffer_002dother_002dwindow\"></a> <a id=\"index-"
"C_002dx-4-c\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 c</kbd><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-4-c\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Create an indirect buffer that is a twin copy of the current buffer, and "
"select it in another window (<code class=\"code\">clone-indirect-buffer-"
"other-window</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在のバッファのツインコピーとなる間接バッファを作成し、別のウィンドウで選択"
"します (<code class=\"code\">clone-indirect-buffer-other-window</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"The text of the indirect buffer is always identical to the text of its base "
"buffer; changes made by editing either one are visible immediately in the "
"other.  &ldquo;Text&rdquo; here includes both the characters and their text "
"properties.  But in all other respects, the indirect buffer and its base "
"buffer are completely separate.  They can have different names, different "
"values of point, different narrowing, different markers, different overlays, "
"different major modes, and different local variables."
msgstr ""
"間接バッファのテキストは、常にそのベースバッファのテキストと同一であり、どち"
"らか一方を編集して加えた変更は、もう一方にも即座に反映されます。ここでの「テ"
"キスト」には、文字とそのテキストプロパティの両方が含まれます。しかし、それ以"
"外のあらゆる点において、間接バッファとそのベースバッファは完全に独立していま"
"す。両者は、異なる名前、異なるポイント値、異なるナローイング、異なるマー"
"カー、異なるオーバーレイ、異なるメジャーモード、および異なるローカル変数を持"
"つことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"An indirect buffer cannot visit a file, but its base buffer can.  If you try "
"to save the indirect buffer, that actually works by saving the base buffer.  "
"Killing the base buffer effectively kills the indirect buffer, but killing "
"an indirect buffer has no effect on its base buffer."
msgstr ""
"間接バッファはファイルにアクセスできませんが、そのベースバッファは可能です。"
"間接バッファを保存しようとすると、実際にはベースバッファを保存することで実現"
"されます。ベースバッファを破棄すると実質的に間接バッファも破棄されますが、間"
"接バッファを破棄してもそのベースバッファには影響しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"One way to use indirect buffers is to display multiple views of an outline.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Outline-Views.html\">Viewing One Outline in "
"Multiple Views</a>."
msgstr ""
"間接バッファの活用方法の一つに、アウトラインを複数のビューで表示する方法があ"
"ります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Outline-Views.html\">1つのアウトラインを複数"
"のビューで表示する</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"A quick and handy way to make an indirect buffer is with the command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 c</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">clone-indirect-buffer-"
"other-window</code>).  It creates and selects an indirect buffer whose base "
"buffer is the current buffer.  With a numeric argument, it prompts for the "
"name of the indirect buffer; otherwise it uses the name of the current "
"buffer, with a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;<var class=\"var\">n</var>&gt;"
"</samp>&rsquo; suffix added."
msgstr ""
"間接バッファを手軽かつ迅速に作成するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 c</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">clone-indirect-buffer-other-window</code>) コマンドを使"
"用します。これにより、現在のバッファをベースバッファとする間接バッファが作成"
"され、選択されます。数値引数を指定すると間接バッファ名の入力が求められ、指定"
"しない場合は現在のバッファ名に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>&gt;</samp>&rsquo; という接尾辞を付けたものが使用されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"The more general way to make an indirect buffer is with the command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x make-indirect-buffer</kbd>.  It creates an indirect buffer "
"named <var class=\"var\">indirect-name</var> from a buffer <var "
"class=\"var\">base-buffer</var>, prompting for both using the minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"間接バッファを作成するより一般的な方法は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x make-"
"indirect-buffer</kbd> コマンドを使用することです。これにより、バッファ <var "
"class=\"var\">base-buffer</var> から <var class=\"var\">indirect-name</var> "
"という名前の間接バッファが作成され、ミニバッファを用いて両方の入力が求められ"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"clone_002dindirect_002dbuffer_002dhook\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"clone_002dindirect_002dbuffer_002dhook\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"The functions that create indirect buffers run the hook <code "
"class=\"code\">clone-indirect-buffer-hook</code> after creating the indirect "
"buffer.  When this hook runs, the newly created indirect buffer is the "
"current buffer."
msgstr ""
"間接バッファを作成する関数は、間接バッファの作成後にフック <code "
"class=\"code\">clone-indirect-buffer-hook</code> を実行します。このフックが実"
"行される際、新たに作成された間接バッファが現在のバッファとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"Note: When a modification is made to the text of a buffer, the modification "
"hooks are run only in the base buffer, because most of the functions on "
"those hooks are not prepared to work correctly in indirect buffers.  So if "
"you need a modification hook function in an indirect buffer, you need to "
"manually add that function to the hook <em class=\"emph\">in the base "
"buffer</em> and then make the function operate in the desired indirect "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"注意：バッファのテキストに変更が加えられた際、変更フックはベースバッファでの"
"み実行されます。これは、これらのフックに含まれる関数の多くが、間接バッファで"
"正しく動作するように設計されていないためです。したがって、間接バッファで変更"
"フック関数が必要な場合は、<em class=\"emph\">ベースバッファの</em>フックにそ"
"の関数を手動で追加した上で、目的の間接バッファでその関数が動作するようにする"
"必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Indirect-Buffers.html
