# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Examples.html
msgid "Make <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-v</kbd> undefined."
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-v</kbd> を undefined にする。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Examples.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-global-unset &quot;C-x C-v&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Examples.html
msgid ""
"One reason to undefine a key is so that you can make it a prefix.  Simply "
"defining <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-v <var class=\"var\">anything</var></kbd> "
"will make <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-v</kbd> a prefix, but <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-v</kbd> must first be freed of its usual non-prefix "
"definition."
msgstr ""
"キーを未定義にする理由の一つは、それをプレフィックスにできるようにするためで"
"す。単に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-v <var class=\"var\">anything</var></kbd> "
"を定義すれば <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-v</kbd> はプレフィックスになりますが、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-v</kbd> については、まず通常の非プレフィックスとして"
"の定義を解除する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Examples.html
msgid ""
"Make &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo; have the syntax of "
