"<span>51.3.6 Rebinding Keys in Your Init File<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Rebinding-Keys-in-Your-Init-File\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>51.3.6 Initファイルでのキーの再割り当て<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Rebinding-Keys-in-Your-Init-File\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rebinding-major-mode-keys\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-key-rebinding_002c-permanent\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rebinding-keys_002c-permanently\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rebinding-major-mode-keys\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-key-rebinding_002c-permanent\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rebinding-keys_002c-permanently\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"If you have a set of key bindings that you like to use all the time, you can "
"specify them in your initialization file by writing Lisp code.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The Emacs Initialization File</a>, "
"for a description of the initialization file."
msgstr ""
"常に使用したいキーバインドのセットがある場合は、初期化ファイルにLispコードを"
"記述することで指定できます。初期化ファイルの説明については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">Emacs初期化ファイル</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keymap_002dglobal_002dset-1\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keymap_002dglobal_002dset-1\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"The recommended way to write a key binding using Lisp is to use either the "
"<code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code> or the <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> functions.  For example, here&rsquo;s how "
"to bind <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-z</kbd> to the <code class=\"code\">shell</"
"code> command in the global keymap (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Interactive-Shell.html\">Interactive Subshell</a>):"
msgstr ""
"Lispでキーバインドを記述する際の推奨方法は、<code class=\"code\">keymap-"
"global-set</code> または <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> 関数のいずれ"
"かを使用することです。例えば、グローバルキーマップで <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-z</"
"kbd> を <code class=\"code\">shell</code> コマンドにバインドする方法は以下の"
"通りです（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Interactive-Shell.html\">インタラクティ"
"ブ・サブシェル</a>を参照）："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-global-set &quot;C-z&quot; 'shell)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-key-sequence-syntax\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-key-sequence-syntax\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"The first argument to <code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code> "
"describes the key sequence.  It is a string made of a series of characters "
"separated by spaces, with each character corresponding to a key.  Keys with "
"modifiers can be specified by prepending the modifier, such as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">C-</samp>&rsquo; for Control, or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">M-</samp>&rsquo; for Meta.  Special keys, such as <kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> and <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>, can be specified "
"within angle brackets as in <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></"
"kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code> の第1引数はキーシーケンスを記述"
"します。これはスペースで区切られた一連の文字からなる文字列であり、各文字が1つ"
"のキーに対応します。修飾子付きのキーは、修飾子を先頭に付加することで指定で"
"き、例えば Control には &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C-</samp>&rsquo;、Meta に"
"は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">M-</samp>&rsquo; のように記述します。<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> や <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> などの特殊キーは、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> や <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> のように山括弧で囲んで指定で"
"きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"The single-quote before the command name that is being bound to the key "
"sequence, <code class=\"code\">shell</code> in the above example, marks it "
"as a constant symbol rather than a variable.  If you omit the quote, Emacs "
"would try to evaluate <code class=\"code\">shell</code> as a variable.  This "
"will probably cause an error; it certainly isn&rsquo;t what you want."
msgstr ""
"キーシーケンスにバインドされるコマンド名の前にあるシングルクォート（上記の例"
"では <code class=\"code\">shell</code>）は、それを変数ではなく定数シンボルと"
"して指定します。クォートを省略すると、Emacsは <code class=\"code\">shell</"
"code> を変数として評価しようとします。これはおそらくエラーの原因になります"
"し、間違いなく意図した動作ではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"Here are some additional examples, including binding function keys and mouse "
"events:"
msgstr ""
"ファンクションキーやマウスイベントのバインドなど、追加の例をいくつか挙げま"
"す："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keymap-global-set &quot;C-c y&quot; 'clipboard-yank)\n"
"(keymap-global-set &quot;C-M-q&quot; 'query-replace)\n"
"(keymap-global-set &quot;&lt;f5&gt;&quot; 'flyspell-mode)\n"
"(keymap-global-set &quot;C-&lt;f5&gt;&quot; 'display-line-numbers-mode)\n"
"(keymap-global-set &quot;C-&lt;right&gt;&quot; 'forward-sentence)\n"
"(keymap-global-set &quot;&lt;mouse-2&gt;&quot; 'mouse-save-then-kill)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-binding-key-to-string\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-binding-key-to-string\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"Key sequences can also be bound directly to Lisp strings rather than "
"commands.  Such strings are written using the same syntax as key sequences.  "
"For example, to bind <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c h</kbd> to the string &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">hello</samp>&rsquo;:"
msgstr ""
"キーシーケンスは、コマンドではなくLisp文字列に直接バインドすることも可能で"
"す。こうした文字列は、キーシーケンスと同じ構文で記述します。例えば、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c h</kbd>を文字列&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">hello</"
"samp>&rsquo;にバインドするには："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-global-set &quot;C-c h&quot; &quot;h e l l o&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"Since this is somewhat cumbersome to write, the convenience function <code "
"class=\"code\">key-description</code> can be used instead:"
msgstr ""
"これは記述がやや煩雑なため、代わりに利便性関数 <code class=\"code\">key-"
"description</code> を使うことができます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-global-set &quot;C-c h&quot; (key-description &quot;hello&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"Non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> characters can be specified "
"directly in the string.  To bind to, for example, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ol&aacute;</samp>&rsquo;, use:"
msgstr ""
"非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字は、文字列内で直接指定できます。  "
"例えば &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ol&aacute;</samp>&rsquo; にバインドするに"
"は、次のようにします。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-global-set &quot;C-c h&quot; (key-description &quot;ol&aacute;&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"However, be aware that language and coding systems may cause problems with "
"key bindings for non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> characters (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-Non_002dASCII.html\">Non-<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> Characters in Init Files</a>).  Writing the "
"binding directly with the Unicode codepoint avoids these problems (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"International-Chars.html\">Introduction to "
"International Character Sets</a> for how to determine the codepoint of a "
"character from within Emacs):"
msgstr ""
"ただし、言語やコーディング体系によっては、非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</"
"abbr>文字のキーバインドに問題が生じる可能性があることに注意してください（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-Non_002dASCII.html\">Initファイルにおける非<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字</a>を参照）。Unicodeコードポイントを用いて"
"直接バインドを記述すれば、こうした問題を回避できます（Emacs内で文字のコードポ"
"イントを特定する方法については、<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"International-"
"Chars.html\">国際文字セット入門</a>を参照してください）："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-global-set &quot;C-c h&quot; (key-description &quot;ol\\u00E1&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-global_002dset_002dkey\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-define_002dkey\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-global_002dset_002dkey\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-define_002dkey\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use the low level functions <code "
"class=\"code\">define-key</code> and <code class=\"code\">global-set-key</"
"code>.  For example, to bind <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-z</kbd> to the <code "
"class=\"code\">shell</code> command, as in the above example, using these "
"low-level functions, use:"
msgstr ""
"あるいは、低レベル関数 <code class=\"code\">define-key</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">global-set-key</code> を使用することもできます。例えば、上記の"
"例のように <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-z</kbd> を <code class=\"code\">shell</code> "
"コマンドにバインドするには、これらの低レベル関数を用いて次のように記述しま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(global-set-key (kbd &quot;C-z&quot;) 'shell)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kbd\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kbd\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html
msgid ""
"There are various ways to specify the key sequence but the simplest is to "
"use the function <code class=\"code\">kbd</code> as shown in the example "
"above.  <code class=\"code\">kbd</code> takes a single string argument that "
"is a textual representation of a key sequence, and converts it into a form "
"suitable for low-level functions such as <code class=\"code\">global-set-"
"key</code>.  For more details about binding keys using Lisp, see <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Keymaps.html#Keymaps\">Keymaps</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs "
"Lisp Reference Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"キーシーケンスを指定する方法はいくつかありますが、最も簡単なのは、上記の例の"
"ように関数 <code class=\"code\">kbd</code> を使用することです。<code "
"class=\"code\">kbd</code> は、キーシーケンスをテキスト形式で表した単一の文字"
"列引数を受け取り、それを <code class=\"code\">global-set-key</code> などの低"
"レベル関数に適した形式に変換します。Lisp を用いたキーバインドの詳細について"
"は、<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Keymaps.html#Keymaps\">Keymaps</a> を参照してください。"

