# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"Lisp string syntax is the same as C string syntax with a few extra "
"features.  Use a double-quote character to begin and end a string constant."
msgstr ""
"Lispの文字列構文はCの文字列構文と同様ですが、いくつかの追加機能があります。文"
"字列定数の開始と終了にはダブルクォート文字を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"In a string, you can include newlines and special characters literally.  But "
"often it is cleaner to use backslash sequences for them: &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\n</samp>&rsquo; for newline, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\b</samp>&rsquo; for backspace, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\r</samp>&rsquo; for carriage return, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\t</samp>&rsquo; for tab, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\f</"
"samp>&rsquo; for formfeed (control-L), &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\e</"
"samp>&rsquo; for escape, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\</samp>&rsquo; for "
"a backslash, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\&quot;</samp>&rsquo; for a double-"
"quote, or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\<var class=\"var\">ooo</var></"
"samp>&rsquo; for the character whose octal code is <var class=\"var\">ooo</"
"var>.  Backslash and double-quote are the only characters for which "
"backslash sequences are mandatory."
msgstr ""
"文字列内では、改行や特殊文字をリテラルとして記述できます。しかし、バックス"
"ラッシュシーケンスを使用する方が簡潔な場合が多いです。具体的には、改行に "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\n</samp>&rsquo;、バックスペースに &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\b</samp>&rsquo;、キャリッジリターンに &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\r</samp>&rsquo;、タブに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\t</"
"samp>&rsquo;、フォームフィード（control-L）に &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\f</samp>&rsquo;、エスケープに &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\e</samp>&rsquo;、バックスラッシュに &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\\\</samp>&rsquo;、ダブルクォートに &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\&quot;</samp>&rsquo;、あるいは8進数コードが <var "
"class=\"var\">ooo</var> である文字に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\<var "
"class=\"var\">ooo</var></samp>&rsquo; を使用します。バックスラッシュシーケン"
"スが必須となるのは、バックスラッシュとダブルクォートのみです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\C-</samp>&rsquo; can be used as a prefix for a "
"control character, as in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\C-s</samp>&rsquo; for "
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> control-S, and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\M-</samp>&rsquo; can be used as a prefix for a Meta "
"character, as in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\M-a</samp>&rsquo; for <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">Meta</kbd>-A</kbd> or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\M-\\C-a</samp>&rsquo; for <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">Ctrl</kbd>-<kbd class=\"key\">Meta</kbd>-A</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\C-</samp>&rsquo;は、<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>のcontrol-Sを表す&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\C-s</samp>&rsquo;のように、制御文字の接頭辞として使用でき、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\M-</samp>&rsquo;は、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">Meta</kbd>-A</kbd>を表す&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\M-a</"
"samp>&rsquo;や<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">Ctrl</kbd>-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">Meta</kbd>-A</kbd>を表す&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\M-\\C-a</"
"samp>&rsquo;のように、Meta文字の接頭辞として使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Init-Non_002dASCII.html\">Non-<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> Characters in Init Files</a>, for information "
"about including non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> in your init file."
msgstr ""
"initファイルに非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字を含める方法について"
"は、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Init-Non_002dASCII.html\">Initファイルにおける非"
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-syntax\"></a> <a id=\"index-"
"Lisp-character-syntax\"></a><span>Characters:<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-Lisp-character-syntax\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-syntax\"></a> <a id=\"index-"
"Lisp-character-syntax\"></a><span>文字:<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-Lisp-character-syntax\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"Lisp character constant syntax consists of a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?</"
"samp>&rsquo; followed by either a character or an escape sequence starting "
"with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo;.  Examples: <code "
"class=\"code\">?x</code>, <code class=\"code\">?\\n</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">?\\&quot;</code>, <code class=\"code\">?\\)</code>.  Note "
"that strings and characters are not interchangeable in Lisp; some contexts "
"require one and some contexts require the other."
msgstr ""
"Lispの文字定数の構文は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?</samp>&rsquo; に続き、"
"文字または &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; で始まるエスケープ"
"シーケンスが配置される形式となっています。例：<code class=\"code\">?x</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">?\\n</code>, <code class=\"code\">?\\&quot;</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">?\\)</code>。なお、Lispでは文字列と文字は相互に置"
"き換え可能ではなく、文脈によって一方が必要とされる場合と他方が必要とされる場"
"合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Init-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Init-Non_002dASCII.html\">Non-<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> Characters in Init Files</a>, for information "
"about binding commands to keys which send non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</"
"abbr> characters."
msgstr ""
"非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字を送信するキーにコマンドをバインド"
"する方法については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Init-Non_002dASCII.html\">Init"
"ファイルにおける非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。"

