# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Initial-Options.html
msgid ""
"Don&rsquo;t communicate directly with the window system, disregarding the "
"<code class=\"env\">DISPLAY</code> environment variable even if it is set.  "
"This means that Emacs uses the terminal from which it was launched for all "
"its display and input."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウシステムと直接通信せず、<code class=\"env\">DISPLAY</code> 環境変数"
"が設定されていてもそれを無視します。つまり、Emacs はすべての表示および入力"
"に、起動元のターミナルを使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Initial-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-batch-mode\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-batch</"
