# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Input-Methods.html
msgid ""
"Another facility for typing characters not on your keyboard is by using <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x 8 <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">insert-char</code>) to insert a single character based on its "
"Unicode name or code-point; see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Inserting-"
"Text.html\">Inserting Text</a>."
msgstr ""
"キーボードにない文字を入力するもう一つの方法は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 8 "
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">insert-char</code>) "
"を使用して、Unicode名またはコードポイントに基づいて単一の文字を挿入することで"
"す。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Inserting-Text.html\">テキストの挿入</a>を参照し"
"てください。"

