# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid ""
"<span>24.1 Introduction to International Character Sets<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Introduction-to-International-Character-Sets\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>24.1 国際文字セット入門<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Introduction-"
"to-International-Character-Sets\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid ""
"The users of international character sets and scripts have established many "
"more-or-less standard coding systems for storing files.  These coding "
"systems are typically <em class=\"dfn\">multibyte</em>, meaning that "
"sequences of two or more bytes are used to represent individual non-<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> characters."
msgstr ""
"国際的な文字セットやスクリプトの利用者は、ファイルを保存するためのほぼ標準的"
"な符号化方式を確立してきた。これらの符号化方式は通常<em class=\"dfn\">マルチ"
"バイト</em>であり、2バイト以上のシーケンスを用いて個々の非<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字を表現する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Unicode\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Unicode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid ""
"Internally, Emacs uses its own multibyte character encoding, which is a "
"superset of the <em class=\"dfn\">Unicode</em> standard.  This internal "
"encoding allows characters from almost every known script to be intermixed "
"in a single buffer or string.  Emacs translates between the multibyte "
"character encoding and various other coding systems when reading and writing "
"files, and when exchanging data with subprocesses."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは内部的に、<em class=\"dfn\">Unicode</em>標準のスーパーセットである独自"
"のマルチバイト文字エンコーディングを使用しています。この内部エンコーディング"
"により、既知のほぼすべての文字体系の文字を、単一のバッファや文字列内で混在さ"
"せることができます。Emacsは、ファイルの読み書きやサブプロセスとのデータ交換を"
"行う際、このマルチバイト文字エンコーディングとその他のさまざまな符号化方式と"
"の間で変換を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-h\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-view_002dhello_002dfile\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-undisplayable-characters\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-_003f-in-display\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-h\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-view_002dhello_002dfile\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-undisplayable-characters\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-_003f-in-display\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h h</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">view-hello-"
"file</code>) displays the file <samp class=\"file\">etc/HELLO</samp>, which "
"illustrates various scripts by showing how to say &ldquo;hello&rdquo; in "
"many languages.  If some characters can&rsquo;t be displayed on your "
"terminal, they appear as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?</samp>&rsquo; or as "
"hollow boxes (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Undisplayable-"
"Characters.html\">Undisplayable Characters</a>)."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h h</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">view-hello-"
"file</code>) はファイル <samp class=\"file\">etc/HELLO</samp> を表示します。"
"このファイルでは、多くの言語で「hello」と言う方法を示すことで、さまざまなスク"
"リプトを紹介しています。端末で表示できない文字がある場合、それらは \"<samp "
"class=\"samp\">?</samp>\" または白抜きのボックスとして表示されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Undisplayable-Characters.html\">表示不能文字</a>を参照"
"してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid ""
"Keyboards, even in the countries where these character sets are used, "
"generally don&rsquo;t have keys for all the characters in them.  You can "
"insert characters that your keyboard does not support, using <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x 8 <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">insert-char</code>).  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Inserting-"
"Text.html\">Inserting Text</a>.  Shorthands are available for some common "
"characters; for example, you can insert a left single quotation mark <code "
"class=\"t\">‘</code> by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 8 [</kbd>, or in "
"Electric Quote mode, usually by simply typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">`</kbd>.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Quotation-Marks.html\">Quotation Marks</a>.  "
"Emacs also supports various <em class=\"dfn\">input methods</em>, typically "
"one for each script or language, which make it easier to type characters in "
"the script.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Input-Methods.html\">Input "
"Methods</a>."
msgstr ""
"キーボードには、こうした文字セットが使用されている国であっても、通常はすべて"
"の文字に対応するキーが備わっているわけではありません。キーボードがサポートし"
"ていない文字は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 8 <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">insert-char</code>) を使用して挿入できます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Inserting-Text.html\">テキストの挿入</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。一部の一般的な文字には短縮表記が用意されています。例えば、左シングル"
"クォートマーク <code class=\"t\">‘</code> は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 8 [</"
"kbd> と入力することで挿入でき、Electric Quote モードでは通常、単に <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">`</kbd> と入力するだけで挿入できます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Quotation-Marks.html\">引用符</a>を参照してください。また、Emacs はさ"
"まざまな <em class=\"dfn\">入力メソッド</em>（通常は各スクリプトや言語ごとに1"
"つ）をサポートしており、これによりそのスクリプトの文字をより簡単に入力できま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Input-Methods.html\">入力メソッド</a>を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-RET\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-RET\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid ""
"The prefix key <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> is "
"used for commands that pertain to multibyte characters, coding systems, and "
"input methods."
msgstr ""
"プレフィックスキー <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> "
"は、マルチバイト文字、符号化方式、および入力メソッドに関するコマンドに使用さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-_003d_002c-and-international-"
"characters\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"what_002dcursor_002dposition_002c-and-international-characters\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-_003d_002c-and-international-"
"characters\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"what_002dcursor_002dposition_002c-and-international-characters\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x =</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">what-cursor-"
"position</code>) shows information about the character at point.  In "
"addition to the character position, which was described in <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Position-Info.html\">Cursor Position Information</a>, this command "
"displays how the character is encoded.  For instance, it displays the "
"following line in the echo area for the character &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">c</samp>&rsquo;:"
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x =</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">what-cursor-"
"position</code>) は、ポイントにある文字に関する情報を表示します。<a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Position-Info.html\">カーソル位置情報</a> で説明した文字"
"位置に加え、このコマンドでは文字がどのようにエンコードされているかも表示され"
"ます。例えば、文字 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">c</samp>&rsquo; の場合、エコー"
"エリアに以下の行が表示されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
#: build/html/emacs/Position-Info.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Char: c (99, #o143, #x63) point=28062 of 36168 (78%) column=53\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid ""
"The four values after &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Char:</samp>&rsquo; "
"describe the character that follows point, first by showing it and then by "
"giving its character code in decimal, octal and hex.  For a non-<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> multibyte character, these are followed by "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">file</samp>&rsquo; and the character&rsquo;s "
"representation, in hex, in the buffer&rsquo;s coding system, if that coding "
"system encodes the character safely and with a single byte (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Coding-Systems.html\">Coding Systems</a>).  If the "
"character&rsquo;s encoding is longer than one byte, Emacs shows &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">file ...</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Char:</samp>&rsquo; に続く4つの値は、point の後に"
"続く文字を、まず文字自体を表示し、次にその文字コードを10進数、8進数、16進数で"
"示すことで記述します。非<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>マルチバイト文字"
"の場合、これらに続いて &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">file</samp>&rsquo; と、"
"バッファの符号化方式でその文字を安全に、かつ単一バイトで符号化できる場合の、"
"当該符号化方式による16進数での文字表現が表示されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Coding-Systems.html\">符号化方式</a>を参照）。文字の符号化が1バイトを"
"超える場合、Emacs は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">file ...</samp>&rsquo; を表"
"示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eight_002dbit-character-set\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-raw-bytes\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eight_002dbit-character-set\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-raw-bytes\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/International-Chars.html
msgid ""
"On rare occasions, Emacs encounters <em class=\"dfn\">raw bytes</em>: single "
"bytes whose values are in the range 128 (0200 octal) through 255 (0377 "
"octal), which Emacs cannot interpret as part of a known encoding of some non-"
"ASCII character.  Such raw bytes are treated as if they belonged to a "
"special character set <code class=\"code\">eight-bit</code>; Emacs displays "
"them as escaped octal codes (this can be customized; see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Display-Custom.html\">Customization of Display</a>).  In this case, "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x =</kbd> shows &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">raw-byte</"
"samp>&rsquo; instead of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">file</samp>&rsquo;.  In "
"addition, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x =</kbd> shows the character codes of raw "
"bytes as if they were in the range <code class=\"code\">#x3FFF80..#x3FFFFF</"
"code>, which is where Emacs maps them to distinguish them from Unicode "
"characters in the range <code class=\"code\">#x0080..#x00FF</code>."
msgstr ""

