# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Isearch-Yank.html
msgid ""
"In many cases, you will want to use text at or near point as your search "
"string.  The commands described in this subsection let you do that "
"conveniently."
msgstr ""
"多くの場合、検索文字列として「point」またはその付近のテキストを使用したいと思"
"うでしょう。本サブセクションで説明するコマンドを使えば、それを便利に行うこと"
"ができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Isearch-Yank.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dw-_0028Incremental-"
"search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dyank_002dword_002dor_002dchar\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dw-_0028Incremental-"
"search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dyank_002dword_002dor_002dchar\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Isearch-Yank.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-w</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-word-or-"
"char</code>) appends the next character or word at point to the search "
"string.  This is an easy way to search for another occurrence of the text at "
"point.  (The decision of whether to copy a character or a word is "
"heuristic.)  With a prefix numeric argument of <var class=\"var\">n</var>, "
"append the next <var class=\"var\">n</var> characters or words."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-w</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-word-or-"
"char</code>) は、ポイントにある次の文字または単語を検索文字列に追加します。こ"
"れは、ポイントにあるテキストの別の出現箇所を検索する簡単な方法です。（文字を"
"コピーするか単語をコピーするかの判断はヒューリスティックに行われます。）接頭"
"辞に数値引数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> を指定すると、次の <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> 個の文字または単語が追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Isearch-Yank.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dM_002dw-_0028Incremental-"
"search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dyank_002dsymbol_002dor_002dchar\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dM_002dw-_0028Incremental-"
"search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dyank_002dsymbol_002dor_002dchar\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Isearch-Yank.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-w</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-symbol-or-"
"char</code>) appends the next character or symbol at point to the search "
"string.  This is an easy way to search for another occurrence of the symbol "
"at point.  (The decision of whether to copy a character or a symbol is "
"heuristic.)  With a prefix numeric argument of <var class=\"var\">n</var>, "
"append the next <var class=\"var\">n</var> characters or symbols."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-w</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-symbol-or-"
"char</code>) は、ポイントにある次の文字または記号を検索文字列に追加します。こ"
"れは、ポイントにある記号の別の出現箇所を検索する簡単な方法です。（文字と記号"
"のどちらをコピーするかの判断はヒューリスティックです。）接頭辞の数値引数に "
"<var class=\"var\">n</var> を指定すると、次の <var class=\"var\">n</var> 個の"
"文字または記号が追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Isearch-Yank.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002ds-C_002de-_0028Incremental-"
"search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dyank_002dline\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002ds-C_002de-_0028Incremental-"
"search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dyank_002dline\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Isearch-Yank.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s C-e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-line</"
"code>) appends the rest of the current line to the search string.  If point "
"is already at the end of a line, it appends the next line.  With a prefix "
"argument <var class=\"var\">n</var>, it appends the next <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> lines."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s C-e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-line</"
"code>) は、現在の行の残りを検索文字列に追記します。point がすでに行末にある場"
"合は、次の行を追記します。接頭辞引数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> を指定する"
"と、次の <var class=\"var\">n</var> 行を追記します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Isearch-Yank.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dM_002dz-_0028Incremental-"
"search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dyank_002duntil_002dchar\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dM_002dz-_0028Incremental-"
"search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dyank_002duntil_002dchar\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Isearch-Yank.html
msgid ""
"Similarly, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-z</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-"
"until-char</code>) appends to the search string everything from point until "
"the next occurrence of a specified character (not including that "
"character).  This is especially useful for keyboard macros, for example in "
"programming languages or markup languages in which that character marks a "
"token boundary.  With a prefix numeric argument of <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var>, the command appends everything from point to the <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var>th occurrence of the specified character."
msgstr ""
"同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-z</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-"
"until-char</code>) は、ポイントから指定された文字の次の出現箇所まで（その文字"
"自体は含まない）のすべてを検索文字列に追加します。これは、例えばその文字が"
"トークン境界を示すプログラミング言語やマークアップ言語におけるキーボードマク"
"ロなどで特に有用です。接頭辞に数値引数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> を指定する"
"と、コマンドはポイントから指定された文字の <var class=\"var\">n</var> 番目の"
"出現箇所までをすべて追加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Isearch-Yank.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dy-_0028Incremental-"
