"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Isearch-Yank.html
msgid ""
"Within incremental search, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-yank-kill</code>)  appends the current kill to the "
"search string.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-y</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-"
"yank-pop</code>), if called after <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd> during "
"incremental search, replaces that appended text with an earlier kill, "
"similar to the usual <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-y</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">yank-"
"pop</code>) command.  Clicking <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> in the echo "
"area appends the current X selection (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Primary-"
"Selection.html\">Cut and Paste with Other Window Applications</a>) to the "
"search string (<code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-x-selection</code>)."
msgstr ""
"インクリメンタル検索において、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-yank-kill</code>) は現在のキルを検索文字列に追加しま"
"す。インクリメンタル検索中に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd> の後に <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-y</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-pop</code>) を呼び"
"出すと、通常の <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-y</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">yank-pop</"
"code>) コマンドと同様に、追加されたテキストがより前のキルに置き換えられます。"
"エコー領域で <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> をクリックすると、現在の X 選択"
"範囲（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Primary-Selection.html\">他のウィンドウアプリ"
"ケーションでの切り取りと貼り付け</a> を参照）を検索文字列に追加します (<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-yank-x-selection</code>)。"

