# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Isearch-Yank.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-d</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-del-char</"
"code>) deletes the last character from the search string, and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-y</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-char</code>)  "
"appends the character after point to the search string.  An alternative "
"method to add the character after point is to enter the minibuffer with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-e</kbd> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Repeat-"
"Isearch.html\">Repeating Incremental Search</a>) and type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</"
"kbd></kbd> at the end of the search string in the minibuffer.  Each <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</"
"kbd></kbd> you type adds another character following point to the search "
"string."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-d</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-del-char</"
"code>) は検索文字列の最後の文字を削除し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-y</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-char</code>) はポイント以降の文字を検索文"
"字列に追加します。ポイント以降の文字を追加する別の方法として、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-e</kbd> でミニバッファに入り（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Repeat-Isearch.html\">インクリメンタル検索の繰り返し</a>を参照）、ミニ"
"バッファ内の検索文字列の末尾に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> または <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd> と入力する方法があります。"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd> を入力するたびに、ポイント以降の文字がもう1文"
"字検索文字列に追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Isearch-Yank.html
msgid ""
"Normally, when the search is case-insensitive, text yanked into the search "
"string is converted to lower case, so that the search remains case-"
"insensitive (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">case folding</"
"a>).  However, if the value of the variable <code class=\"code\">search-"
"upper-case</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">search-"
"upper-case</a>) is other than <code class=\"code\">not-yanks</code>, that "
"disables this down-casing."
msgstr ""
"通常、検索が大文字小文字を区別しない場合、検索文字列に取り込まれたテキストは"
"小文字に変換され、検索の大文字小文字非区別性が維持されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">ケースフォールディング</a>を参照）。"
"ただし、変数 <code class=\"code\">search-upper-case</code>（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">search-upper-case</a>を参照）の値が "
"<code class=\"code\">not-yanks</code> 以外の場合、この小文字化は無効になりま"
"す。"

