# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"This section describes <em class=\"dfn\">key bindings</em>, which map keys "
"to commands, and <em class=\"dfn\">keymaps</em>, which record key bindings.  "
"It also explains how to customize key bindings, which is done by editing "
"your init file (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-"
"Rebinding.html\">Rebinding Keys in Your Init File</a>)."
msgstr ""
"本節では、キーをコマンドに割り当てる<em class=\"dfn\">キーバインド</em>と、"
"キーバインドを記録する<em class=\"dfn\">キーマップ</em>について解説します。ま"
"た、initファイルを編集してキーバインドをカスタマイズする方法についても説明し"
"ます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-Rebinding.html\">initファイルでのキーの"
"再割り当て</a>を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Bindings.html
