#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Help.html
msgid ""
"The help commands to get information about a key sequence are <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h c</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-key-briefly</code>) "
"and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h k</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-key</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"キーシーケンスに関する情報を取得するヘルプコマンドは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h "
"c</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-key-briefly</code>) および <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h k</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-key</code>) です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Help.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-c\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-c\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Help.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h c <var class=\"var\">key</var></kbd> displays in the "
"echo area the name of the command that <var class=\"var\">key</var> is bound "
"to.  For example, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h c C-f</kbd> displays &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">forward-char</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h c <var class=\"var\">key</var></kbd> は、エコー領域に "
"<var class=\"var\">key</var> がバインドされているコマンド名を表示します。例え"
"ば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h c C-f</kbd> は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">forward-char</samp>&rsquo; と表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Help.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-documentation-string\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-k\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-documentation-string\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-k\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Help.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h k <var class=\"var\">key</var></kbd> is similar but "
"gives more information: it displays a help buffer containing the "
"command&rsquo;s <em class=\"dfn\">documentation string</em>, which describes "
"exactly what the command does."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h k <var class=\"var\">key</var></kbd> も同様ですが、よ"
"り多くの情報を表示します。コマンドの<em class=\"dfn\">ドキュメント文字列</em>"
"を含むヘルプバッファを表示し、そこではコマンドが具体的にどのような動作を行う"
"かが説明されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Help.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-K\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"Info_002dgoto_002demacs_002dkey_002dcommand_002dnode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-K\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"Info_002dgoto_002demacs_002dkey_002dcommand_002dnode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Help.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h K <var class=\"var\">key</var></kbd> displays the "
"section of the Emacs manual that describes the command corresponding to <var "
"class=\"var\">key</var>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h K <var class=\"var\">key</var></kbd> は、<var "
"class=\"var\">key</var> に対応するコマンドについて解説している Emacs マニュア"
"ルの箇所を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Help.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h c</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h k</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h K</kbd> work for any sort of key sequences, including "
"function keys, menus, and mouse events (except that <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h "
"c</kbd> ignores mouse movement events).  For instance, after <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h k</kbd> you can select a menu item from the menu bar, to "
"view the documentation string of the command it runs."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h c</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h k</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h K</kbd>は、ファンクションキー、メニュー、マウスイベントな"
"ど、あらゆる種類のキーシーケンスで動作します（ただし、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h "
"c</kbd>はマウス移動イベントを無視します）。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h k</"
"kbd>の後にメニューバーからメニュー項目を選択すると、実行されるコマンドのド"
"キュメント文字列を表示できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Help.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-w\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-where_002dis\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-w\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-where_002dis\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Help.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h w <var class=\"var\">command</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> lists the keys that are bound to <var "
"class=\"var\">command</var>.  It displays the list in the echo area.  If it "
"says the command is not on any key, that means you must use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> to run it.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h w</kbd> runs the "
"command <code class=\"code\">where-is</code>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h w <var class=\"var\">command</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> は <var class=\"var\">command</var> に割り当て"
"られているキーを一覧表示します。この一覧はエコーエリアに表示されます。コマン"
"ドがどのキーにも割り当てられていないと表示された場合は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x</kbd> を使用して実行する必要があります。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h w</kbd> はコ"
"マンド <code class=\"code\">where-is</code> を実行します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
