# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Help.html
msgid ""
"Some modes in Emacs use various buttons (see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/"
"Buttons.html#Buttons\">Buttons</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp "
"Reference Manual</cite>) and widgets (see <a data-manual=\"widget\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/widget/"
"Introduction.html#Introduction\">Introduction</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">Emacs Widgets</cite>) that can be clicked to perform some "
"action.  To find out what function is ultimately invoked by these buttons, "
"Emacs provides the <code class=\"code\">button-describe</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">widget-describe</code> commands, that should be run with "
"point over the button."
msgstr ""
"Emacsの一部のモードでは、クリックすることで何らかの操作を実行できる各種ボタン"
"（<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Buttons.html#Buttons\">Buttons</a>を参照）やウィジェット（<cite "
"class=\"cite\">Emacs Widgets</cite>の<a data-manual=\"widget\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/widget/"
"Introduction.html#Introduction\">Introduction</a>を参照）が使用されます。これ"
"らのボタンによって最終的にどの関数が呼び出されるかを確認するには、ボタン上に"
"ポイントを置いた状態で<code class=\"code\">button-describe</code>および<code "
"class=\"code\">widget-describe</code>コマンドを実行します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Help.html
msgid "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"which_002dkey\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"which_002dkey\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Key-Help.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x which-key</kbd> is a global minor mode which helps in "
"discovering keymaps.  It displays keybindings following your currently "
"entered incomplete command (prefix), in a popup."
