# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Counter.html
msgid ""
"<span>19.3 The Keyboard Macro Counter<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-"
"Keyboard-Macro-Counter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>19.3 キーボードマクロカウンター<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-"
"Keyboard-Macro-Counter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Counter.html
msgid ""
"Each keyboard macro has an associated counter, which is initialized to 0 "
"when you start defining the macro.  This <em class=\"dfn\">current counter</"
"em> allows you to insert a number into the buffer that depends on the number "
"of times the macro has been called.  The counter is normally incremented "
"each time its value is inserted into the buffer."
msgstr ""
"各キーボードマクロには対応するカウンタがあり、マクロの定義を開始する際に0に初"
"期化されます。この<em class=\"dfn\">現在のカウンタ</em>を使用すると、マクロが"
"呼び出された回数に応じた数値をバッファに挿入できます。通常、カウンタの値が"
"バッファに挿入されるたびにインクリメントされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Counter.html
msgid ""
"In addition to the current counter, keyboard macros also maintain the <em "
"class=\"dfn\">previous counter</em>, which records the value the current "
"counter had last time it was incremented or set.  Note that incrementing the "
"current counter by zero, e.g., with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u&nbsp;0&nbsp;C-"
"x&nbsp;C-k&nbsp;C-i</kbd>, also records the value of the current counter as "
"the previous counter value."
msgstr ""
"現在のカウンタに加えて、キーボードマクロは<em class=\"dfn\">前回のカウンタ</"
"em>も保持しており、ここには現在のカウンタが最後にインクリメントまたは設定され"
"た際の値が記録されます。なお、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u&nbsp;0&nbsp;C-x&nbsp;C-"
"k&nbsp;C-i</kbd> などで現在のカウンタを 0 加算した場合も、現在のカウンタの値"
"が前回のカウンタ値として記録される点に注意してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Counter.html
msgid ""
"In a keyboard macro definition, insert the keyboard macro counter value in "
"the buffer (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-start-macro-or-insert-counter</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"キーボードマクロの定義において、キーボードマクロカウンタの値をバッファに挿入"
"します (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-start-macro-or-insert-counter</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Counter.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-i</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-i</kbd>"

