# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid ""
"In a keyboard macro, you can create an effect similar to that of <code "
"class=\"code\">query-replace</code>, in that the macro asks you each time "
"around whether to make a change."
msgstr ""
"キーボードマクロでは、マクロがその都度変更を行うかどうかを確認するという、"
"<code class=\"code\">query-replace</code>と同様の効果を実現できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x q</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x q</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid ""
"When this point is reached during macro execution, ask for confirmation "
"(<code class=\"code\">kbd-macro-query</code>)."
msgstr ""
"マクロ実行中にこの時点に達したら、確認を求める（<code class=\"code\">kbd-"
"macro-query</code>）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-q\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-kbd_002dmacro_002dquery\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-q\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-kbd_002dmacro_002dquery\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid ""
"While defining the macro, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x q</kbd> at the point "
"where you want the query to occur.  During macro definition, the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x q</kbd> does nothing, but when you run the macro later, "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x q</kbd> asks you interactively whether to continue."
msgstr ""
"マクロを定義する際、クエリを実行させたい箇所に型 <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x q</"
"kbd> を指定します。マクロ定義時には <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x q</kbd> は何もしま"
"せんが、後でマクロを実行すると、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x q</kbd> が続行するかど"
"うかを対話的に確認します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid "The valid responses when <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x q</kbd> asks are:"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x q</kbd> が問い合わせた際の有効な応答は以下の通りです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> (or <kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd>)"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>（または<kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd>）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid "Continue executing the keyboard macro."
msgstr "キーボードマクロの実行を継続します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> (or <kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd>)"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>（または<kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd>）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid ""
"Skip the remainder of this repetition of the macro, and start right away "
"with the next repetition."
msgstr ""
"このマクロの繰り返しの残りの処理はスキップし、すぐに次の繰り返しを開始してく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> (or <kbd class=\"kbd\">q</kbd>)"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>（または<kbd class=\"kbd\">q</kbd>）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid "Skip the remainder of this repetition and cancel further repetitions."
msgstr ""
"この繰り返しの残りをスキップし、以降の繰り返しをキャンセルしてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid ""
"Enter a recursive editing level, in which you can perform editing which is "
"not part of the macro.  When you exit the recursive edit using <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-c</kbd>, you are asked again how to continue with the "
"keyboard macro.  If you type a <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> at this time, "
"the rest of the macro definition is executed.  It is up to you to leave "
"point and the text in a state such that the rest of the macro will do what "
"you want."
msgstr ""
"再帰的な編集レベルに入ると、マクロに含まれない編集を行うことができます。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-c</kbd> を使用して再帰的な編集を抜けると、キーボードマクロ"
"をどのように続行するか改めて問われます。このとき <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</"
"kbd> と入力すると、マクロ定義の残りの部分が実行されます。ポイントとテキスト"
"を、マクロの残りの処理が意図した通りに動作する状態にしておくことは、ユーザー"
"の判断に委ねられています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Query.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x q</kbd>, which is <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x q</kbd> "
"with a prefix argument, performs a completely different function.  It enters "
"a recursive edit reading input from the keyboard, both when you type it "
"during the definition of the macro, and when it is executed from the macro.  "
"During definition, the editing you do inside the recursive edit does not "
"become part of the macro.  During macro execution, the recursive edit gives "
"you a chance to do some particularized editing on each repetition.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Recursive-Edit.html\">Recursive Editing Levels</a>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x q</kbd>（接頭辞引数を伴う<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"q</kbd>）は、全く異なる機能を果たします。これは、マクロの定義時に入力する場合"
"と、マクロから実行される場合の両方において、キーボードからの入力を読み取る再"
"帰的編集に入ります。定義時には、再帰的編集内で行った編集内容はマクロの一部に"
"はなりません。マクロの実行時には、再帰的編集によって、繰り返しごとに特定の編"
"集を行うことができます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Recursive-Edit.html\">再帰的"
"編集レベル</a>を参照してください。"

