#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"<span>19.2 The Keyboard Macro Ring<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-"
"Keyboard-Macro-Ring\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>19.2 キーボードマクロリング<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-"
"Keyboard-Macro-Ring\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"All defined keyboard macros are recorded in the <em class=\"dfn\">keyboard "
"macro ring</em>.  There is only one keyboard macro ring, shared by all "
"buffers."
msgstr ""
"定義済みのキーボードマクロはすべて<em class=\"dfn\">キーボードマクロリング</"
"em>に記録されます。キーボードマクロリングは1つのみで、すべてのバッファで共有"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-k</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-k</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"Execute the keyboard macro at the head of the ring (<code "
"class=\"code\">kmacro-end-or-call-macro-repeat</code>)."
msgstr ""
"リングの先頭（<code class=\"code\">kmacro-end-or-call-macro-repeat</code>）で"
"キーボードマクロを実行する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-n</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-n</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"Rotate the keyboard macro ring to the next macro (defined earlier)  (<code "
"class=\"code\">kmacro-cycle-ring-next</code>)."
msgstr ""
"キーボードマクロリングを次のマクロ（先に定義されたもの） (<code "
"class=\"code\">kmacro-cycle-ring-next</code>) に回転させる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-p</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-p</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"Rotate the keyboard macro ring to the previous macro (defined later)  (<code "
"class=\"code\">kmacro-cycle-ring-previous</code>)."
msgstr ""
"キーボードマクロリングを前のマクロ（後述） (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-"
"cycle-ring-previous</code>) に回転させる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"All commands which operate on the keyboard macro ring use the same <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k</kbd> prefix.  Most of these commands can be executed "
"and repeated immediately after each other without repeating the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k</kbd> prefix.  For example,"
msgstr ""
"キーボードマクロリングを操作するすべてのコマンドには、共通の <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k</kbd> プレフィックスが使用されます。これらのコマンドの"
"多くは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k</kbd> プレフィックスを繰り返さなくても、直"
"後に実行したり繰り返したりすることができます。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "C-x C-k C-p C-p C-k C-k C-k C-n C-n C-k C-p C-k C-d\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"will rotate the keyboard macro ring to the second-previous macro, execute "
"the resulting head macro three times, rotate back to the original head "
"macro, execute that once, rotate to the previous macro, execute that, and "
"finally delete it from the macro ring."
msgstr ""
"キーボードのマクロリングを前々のマクロに回転させ、その結果得られたヘッドマク"
"ロを3回実行し、元のヘッドマクロに戻してそれを1回実行し、前のマクロに回転させ"
"てそれを実行し、最後にマクロリングから削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"kmacro_002dend_002dor_002dcall_002dmacro_002drepeat\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-C_002dk\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"kmacro_002dend_002dor_002dcall_002dmacro_002drepeat\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-C_002dk\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-k</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">kmacro-end-or-call-macro-repeat</code>)  executes the "
"keyboard macro at the head of the macro ring.  You can repeat the macro "
"immediately by typing another <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd>, or you can "
"rotate the macro ring immediately by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> or "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-k</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-"
"end-or-call-macro-repeat</code>) は、マクロリングの先頭にあるキーボードマクロ"
"を実行します。別の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> を入力することですぐにマクロ"
"を繰り返すことができるほか、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> または <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> を入力することですぐにマクロリングを回転させることが"
"できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"When a keyboard macro is being defined, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-k</kbd> "
"behaves like <kbd class=\"key\">F4</kbd> except that, immediately afterward, "
"you can use most key bindings of this section without the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k</kbd> prefix.  For instance, another <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> will re-execute the macro."
msgstr ""
"キーボードマクロを定義する際、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-k</kbd>は<kbd "
"class=\"key\">F4</kbd>と同様に動作しますが、その直後には、本セクションのほと"
"んどのキーバインドを<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k</kbd>というプレフィックスなし"
"で使用できます。例えば、別の<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd>を指定すると、マクロ"
"が再実行されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"kmacro_002dcycle_002dring_002dnext\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-C_002dn\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-kmacro_002dcycle_002dring_002dprevious\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-C_002dp\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"kmacro_002dcycle_002dring_002dnext\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-C_002dn\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-kmacro_002dcycle_002dring_002dprevious\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-C_002dp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"The commands <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-n</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">kmacro-cycle-ring-next</code>) and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k "
"C-p</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-cycle-ring-previous</code>) rotate "
"the macro ring, bringing the next or previous keyboard macro to the head of "
"the macro ring.  The definition of the new head macro is displayed in the "
"echo area.  You can continue to rotate the macro ring immediately by "
"repeating just <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> "
"until the desired macro is at the head of the ring.  To execute the new "
"macro ring head immediately, just type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-n</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-"
"cycle-ring-next</code>) および <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k C-p</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">kmacro-cycle-ring-previous</code>) はマクロリングを回転させ、"
"次または前のキーボードマクロをマクロリングの先頭に移動させます。新しい先頭マ"
"クロの定義はエコーエリアに表示されます。目的のマクロがリングの先頭に来るま"
"で、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> を繰り返すだ"
"けで、すぐにマクロリングの回転を続けることができます。新しいマクロリングの先"
"頭を即座に実行するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> と入力してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"Note that Emacs treats the head of the macro ring as the last defined "
"keyboard macro.  For instance, <kbd class=\"key\">F4</kbd> will execute that "
"macro, and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k n</kbd> will give it a name."
msgstr ""
"なお、Emacsではマクロリングの先頭を最後に定義されたキーボードマクロとして扱い"
"ます。例えば、<kbd class=\"key\">F4</kbd> はそのマクロを実行し、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k n</kbd> はそのマクロに名前を付けます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kmacro_002dring_002dmax\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kmacro_002dring_002dmax\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Ring.html
msgid ""
"The maximum number of macros stored in the keyboard macro ring is determined "
"by the customizable variable <code class=\"code\">kmacro-ring-max</code>."
msgstr ""
"キーボードのマクロリングに格納できるマクロの最大数は、カスタマイズ可能な変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">kmacro-ring-max</code> によって決まります。"

