msgstr ""
"<span>19.7 キーボードマクロの段階的な編集<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Stepwise-Editing-a-Keyboard-Macro\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"kmacro_002dstep_002dedit_002dmacro\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-SPC\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"kmacro_002dstep_002dedit_002dmacro\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dk-SPC\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"You can interactively replay and edit the last keyboard macro, one command "
"at a time, by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</"
"kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-step-edit-macro</code>).  Unless you "
"quit the macro using <kbd class=\"kbd\">q</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</"
"kbd>, the edited macro replaces the last macro on the macro ring."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">kmacro-step-edit-macro</code>) と入力することで、直前のキー"
"ボードマクロを1コマンドずつ対話的に再生・編集できます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">q</"
"kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> でマクロを終了させない限り、編集後の"
"マクロがマクロリング上の直前のマクロを上書きします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"This macro editing feature shows the last macro in the minibuffer together "
"with the first (or next) command to be executed, and prompts you for an "
"action.  You can enter <kbd class=\"kbd\">?</kbd> to get a summary of your "
"options.  These actions are available:"
msgstr ""
"このマクロ編集機能では、ミニバッファ内の最後のマクロと、次に実行される（また"
"は直後の）コマンドが表示され、操作が求められます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">?</kbd> "
"と入力すると、選択肢の概要を確認できます。利用可能な操作は以下の通りです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd> execute the "
"current command, and advance to the next command in the keyboard macro."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> および <kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd> は現在のコマン"
"ドを実行し、キーボードマクロの次のコマンドへと進みます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd>, and <kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> skip and delete the current command."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd>、および<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>は、現在のコマンドをスキップして削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">f</kbd> skips the current command in this execution of "
"the keyboard macro, but doesn&rsquo;t delete it from the macro."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">f</kbd> は、今回のキーボードマクロ実行において現在のコマン"
"ドをスキップしますが、マクロから削除することはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> executes the current command, as well as all "
"similar commands immediately following the current command; for example, "
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> may be used to insert a sequence of characters "
"(corresponding to a sequence of <code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</"
"code> commands)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> は、現在のコマンドに加え、その直後に続くすべての"
"類似コマンドを実行します。例えば、<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> を使用して一連"
"の文字（一連の <code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code> コマンドに相"
"当）を挿入することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">c</kbd> continues execution (without further editing) "
"until the end of the keyboard macro.  If execution terminates normally, the "
"edited macro replaces the original keyboard macro."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">c</kbd> は、キーボードマクロの終了まで（さらなる編集を行う"
"ことなく）実行を継続します。正常に実行が終了した場合、編集後のマクロが元の"
"キーボードマクロを置き換えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> skips and deletes the rest of the keyboard "
"macro, terminates step-editing, and replaces the original keyboard macro "
"with the edited macro."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> キーボードマクロの残りの部分をスキップして削除"
"し、ステップ編集を終了し、元のキーボードマクロを編集後のマクロで置き換えま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">q</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> cancels the step-"
"editing of the keyboard macro; discarding any changes made to the keyboard "
"macro."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">q</kbd> および <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> は、キーボード"
"マクロのステップ編集を取り消し、キーボードマクロに加えられた変更をすべて破棄"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">i <var class=\"var\">key</var>&hellip; C-j</kbd> reads "
"and executes a series of key sequences (not including the final <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd>), and inserts them before the current command in the "
"keyboard macro, without advancing over the current command."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">i <var class=\"var\">key</var>&hellip; C-j</kbd> は一連の"
"キーシーケンス（最後の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> を除く）を読み取って実行"
"し、現在のコマンドをスキップすることなく、キーボードマクロ内の現在のコマンド"
"の前にそれらを挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">I <var class=\"var\">key</var>&hellip;</kbd> reads one "
"key sequence, executes it, and inserts it before the current command in the "
"keyboard macro, without advancing over the current command."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">I <var class=\"var\">key</var>&hellip;</kbd> は1つのキー"
"シーケンスを読み取り、それを実行して、現在のコマンドをスキップすることなく、"
"キーボードマクロ内の現在のコマンドの前に挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">r <var class=\"var\">key</var>&hellip; C-j</kbd> reads "
"and executes a series of key sequences (not including the final <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd>), and replaces the current command in the keyboard "
"macro with them, advancing over the inserted key sequences."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">r <var class=\"var\">key</var>&hellip; C-j</kbd> は一連の"
"キーシーケンス（最後の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> を除く）を読み取って実行"
"し、キーボードマクロ内の現在のコマンドをそれに置き換えた上で、挿入されたキー"
"シーケンスを順に処理します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">R <var class=\"var\">key</var>&hellip;</kbd> reads one "
"key sequence, executes it, and replaces the current command in the keyboard "
"macro with that key sequence, advancing over the inserted key sequence."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">R <var class=\"var\">key</var>&hellip;</kbd> は1つのキー"
"シーケンスを読み取り、それを実行して、キーボードマクロ内の現在のコマンドをそ"
"のキーシーケンスに置き換え、挿入されたキーシーケンスをスキップします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">a <var class=\"var\">key</var>&hellip; C-j</kbd> executes "
"the current command, then reads and executes a series of key sequences (not "
"including the final <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd>), and inserts them after "
"the current command in the keyboard macro; it then advances over the current "
"command and the inserted key sequences."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">a <var class=\"var\">key</var>&hellip; C-j</kbd> は現在の"
"コマンドを実行し、次に一連のキーシーケンス（最後の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</"
"kbd> を除く）を読み込んで実行し、それらをキーボードマクロ内の現在のコマンドの"
"後に挿入します。その後、現在のコマンドと挿入されたキーシーケンスを順に処理し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Keyboard-Macro-Step_002dEdit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">A <var class=\"var\">key</var>&hellip; C-j</kbd> executes "
"the rest of the commands in the keyboard macro, then reads and executes a "
"series of key sequences (not including the final <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</"
"kbd>), and appends them at the end of the keyboard macro; it then terminates "
"the step-editing and replaces the original keyboard macro with the edited "
"macro."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">A <var class=\"var\">key</var>&hellip; C-j</kbd> は、キー"
"ボードマクロ内の残りのコマンドを実行し、一連のキーシーケンス（最後の <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> を除く）を読み込んで実行し、それらをキーボードマクロ"
"の末尾に追加します。その後、ステップ編集を終了し、元のキーボードマクロを編集"
"後のマクロに置き換えます。"

