#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h2>
#: build/html/emacs/Keys.html
msgid ""
"<span>3 Keys<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Keys-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>3つの鍵<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Keys-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keys.html
msgid ""
"Some Emacs commands are invoked by just one input event; for example, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> moves forward one character in the buffer.  Other "
"commands take two or more input events to invoke, such as <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 C-f</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsの一部のコマンドは、わずか1回の入力イベントで呼び出されます。例えば、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd>はバッファ内で1文字分前方に移動します。一方、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd>や<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 C-f</kbd>のよう"
"に、呼び出すのに2回以上の入力イベントを必要とするコマンドもあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Keys.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-key\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-key-sequence\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"complete-key\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-prefix-key\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-key\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-key-sequence\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"complete-key\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-prefix-key\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keys.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">key sequence</em>, or <em class=\"dfn\">key</em> for "
"short, is a sequence of one or more input events that is meaningful as a "
"unit.  If a key sequence invokes a command, we call it a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">complete key</em>; for example, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd>, "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 C-f</kbd> are "
"all complete keys.  If a key sequence isn&rsquo;t long enough to invoke a "
"command, we call it a <em class=\"dfn\">prefix key</em>; from the preceding "
"example, we see that <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"4</kbd> are prefix keys.  Every key sequence is either a complete key or a "
"prefix key."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">キーシーケンス</em>（略して<em class=\"dfn\">キー</em>）と"
"は、一つ以上の入力イベントが連なり、一つの単位として意味を持つものです。キー"
"シーケンスがコマンドを呼び出す場合、それを<em class=\"dfn\">完全キー</em>と呼"
"びます。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</"
"kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 C-f</kbd>はいずれも完全キーです。キーシーケン"
"スがコマンドを呼び出すのに十分な長さでない場合、それを<em class=\"dfn\">プレ"
"フィックスキー</em>と呼びます。前述の例から、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd>と"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4</kbd>がプレフィックスキーであることがわかります。す"
"べてのキーシーケンスは、完全キーかプレフィックスキーのいずれかです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keys.html
msgid ""
"A prefix key combines with the following input event to make a longer key "
"sequence.  For example, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd> is a prefix key, so "
"typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd> alone does not invoke a command; "
"instead, Emacs waits for further input (if you pause for longer than a "
"second, it echoes the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd> key to prompt for that "
"input; see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Echo-Area.html\">The Echo Area</a>).  "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd> combines with the next input event to make a "
"two-event key sequence, which could itself be a prefix key (such as <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x 4</kbd>), or a complete key (such as <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x C-f</kbd>).  There is no limit to the length of key sequences, but in "
"practice they are seldom longer than three or four input events."
msgstr ""
"プレフィックスキーは、後続の入力イベントと組み合わさることで、より長いキー"
"シーケンスを形成します。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd> はプレフィックス"
"キーであるため、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd> だけを入力してもコマンドは実行さ"
"れません。代わりに、Emacs はさらなる入力を待機します（1秒以上待機すると、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd> キーをエコー表示してその入力を促します。詳細は "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Echo-Area.html\">エコーエリア</a> を参照してくださ"
"い）。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd> は次の入力イベントと組み合わさって2イベン"
"トのキーシーケンスとなり、それ自体がプレフィックスキー（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x 4</kbd> など）、あるいは完全なキー（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd> など）"
"となる場合があります。キーシーケンスの長さに制限はありませんが、実際には3〜4"
"イベントを超えることは滅多にありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keys.html
msgid ""
"You can&rsquo;t add input events onto a complete key.  For example, because "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> is a complete key, the two-event sequence <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-f C-k</kbd> is two key sequences, not one."
msgstr ""
"完全キーに入力イベントを追加することはできません。例えば、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd>は完全キーであるため、2つのイベントからなるシーケンス"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f C-k</kbd>は、1つのキーシーケンスではなく2つのキーシー"
"ケンスとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Keys.html
msgid ""
"By default, the prefix keys in Emacs are <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x @</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x a</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x r</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x t</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x v</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x 5</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 6</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>, and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-g</kbd>.  (<kbd "
"class=\"key\">F1</kbd> and <kbd class=\"key\">F2</kbd> are aliases for <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 6</kbd>.)  This list is "
"not cast in stone; if you customize Emacs, you can make new prefix keys.  "
"You could even eliminate some of the standard ones, though this is not "
"recommended for most users; for example, if you remove the prefix definition "
"of <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4</kbd>, then <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 C-f</kbd> "
"becomes an invalid key sequence.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-"
"Bindings.html\">Customizing Key Bindings</a>."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、Emacsのプレフィックスキーは <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd>、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x</kbd>、<kbd "
