# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x k</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code>) "
"kills one buffer, whose name you specify in the minibuffer.  The default, "
"used if you type just <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> in the minibuffer, is to "
"kill the current buffer.  If you kill the current buffer, another buffer "
"becomes current: one that was current in the recent past but is not "
"displayed in any window now.  If you ask to kill a file-visiting buffer that "
"is modified, then you must confirm with <kbd class=\"kbd\">yes</kbd> before "
"the buffer is killed."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x k</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code>) は、"
"ミニバッファで指定した名前のバッファを1つ破棄します。ミニバッファに単に <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力した場合に適用されるデフォルトの動作は、現在の"
"バッファを破棄することです。現在のバッファを破棄すると、別のバッファが現在の"
"バッファになります。それは、直近では現在のバッファであったが、現在はいずれの"
"ウィンドウにも表示されていないバッファです。変更が加えられたファイル閲覧用"
"バッファの破棄を指示する場合は、バッファが破棄される前に <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">yes</kbd> で確認する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Buffer.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dsome_002dbuffers\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dsome_002dbuffers\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x kill-some-buffers</kbd> asks about each "
"buffer, one by one.  An answer of <kbd class=\"kbd\">yes</kbd> means to kill "
"the buffer, just like <code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code>.  This command "
"ignores buffers whose names begin with a space, which are used internally by "
"Emacs."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x kill-some-buffers</kbd> は、各バッファについ"
"て一つずつ問い合わせます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">yes</kbd> と回答すると、<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code> と同様にそのバッファを破棄します。このコマ"
"ンドは、Emacs が内部的に使用している、名前がスペースで始まるバッファを無視し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dmatching_002dbuffers\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"kill_002dmatching_002dbuffers_002dno_002dask\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dmatching_002dbuffers\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"kill_002dmatching_002dbuffers_002dno_002dask\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x kill-matching-buffers</kbd> prompts for a "
"regular expression and kills all buffers whose names match that expression.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Regexps.html\">Syntax of Regular Expressions</"
"a>.  Like <code class=\"code\">kill-some-buffers</code>, it asks for "
"confirmation before each kill.  This command normally ignores buffers whose "
"names begin with a space, which are used internally by Emacs.  To kill "
"internal buffers as well, call <code class=\"code\">kill-matching-buffers</"
"code> with a prefix argument.  The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;kill-"
"matching-buffers-no-ask</kbd> works like <code class=\"code\">kill-matching-"
"buffers</code>, but doesn&rsquo;t ask for confirmation before killing each "
"matching buffer."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x kill-matching-buffers</kbd> は正規表現の入力"
"を求め、その正規表現に一致する名前を持つすべてのバッファを消去します。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Regexps.html\">正規表現の構文</a>を参照してください。"
"<code class=\"code\">kill-some-buffers</code> と同様に、各バッファを消去する"
"前に確認を求めます。このコマンドは通常、Emacs が内部的に使用している、名前が"
"スペースで始まるバッファを無視します。内部バッファも消去するには、プレフィッ"
"クス引数を指定して <code class=\"code\">kill-matching-buffers</code> を呼び出"
"してください。コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;kill-matching-buffers-no-"
"ask</kbd> は <code class=\"code\">kill-matching-buffers</code> と同様に動作し"
"ますが、一致する各バッファを消去する前に確認を求めません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"The Buffer Menu feature is also convenient for killing various buffers.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Several-Buffers.html\">Operating on Several "
"Buffers</a>."
msgstr ""
"バッファメニュー機能は、さまざまなバッファを終了させる際にも便利です。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Several-Buffers.html\">複数のバッファの操作</a>を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Buffer.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dbuffer_002dhook\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dbuffer_002dhook\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"If you want to do something special every time a buffer is killed, you can "
"add hook functions to the hook <code class=\"code\">kill-buffer-hook</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Hooks.html\">Hooks</a>)."
msgstr ""
"バッファが破棄されるたびに何か特別な処理を行いたい場合は、フック <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-buffer-hook</code> にフック関数を追加できます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Hooks.html\">フック</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Buffer.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-clean_002dbuffer_002dlist\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-clean_002dbuffer_002dlist\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"If you run one Emacs session for a period of days, as many people do, it can "
"fill up with buffers that you used several days ago.  The command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x clean-buffer-list</kbd> is a convenient way to purge them; "
"it kills all the unmodified buffers that you have not used for a long time.  "
"An ordinary buffer is killed if it has not been displayed for three days; "
"however, you can specify certain buffers that should never be killed "
"automatically, and others that should be killed if they have been unused for "
"a mere hour.  These defaults, and other aspects of this command&rsquo;s "
"behavior, can be controlled by customizing several options described in the "
"doc string of <code class=\"code\">clean-buffer-list</code>."
msgstr ""
"多くの人がそうしているように、数日間にわたって1つのEmacsセッションを起動し続"
"けると、数日前に使用したバッファで溢れてしまうことがあります。コマンド <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x clean-buffer-list</kbd> は、これらを消去するのに便利な方法"
"であり、長期間使用されていない未変更のバッファをすべて破棄します。通常のバッ"
"ファは、3日間表示されていない場合に破棄されます。ただし、絶対に自動的に破棄す"
"べきではない特定のバッファや、わずか1時間未使用だっただけで破棄すべきバッファ"
"を指定することも可能です。これらのデフォルト設定や、このコマンドの動作に関す"
"るその他の側面は、<code class=\"code\">clean-buffer-list</code> のドキュメン"
"ト文字列に記載されているいくつかのオプションをカスタマイズすることで制御でき"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Midnight-mode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-midnight_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-midnight_002dhook\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Midnight-mode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-midnight_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-midnight_002dhook\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"You can also have this buffer purging done for you, once a day, by enabling "
"Midnight mode.  Midnight mode operates each day at midnight; at that time, "
"it runs <code class=\"code\">clean-buffer-list</code>, or whichever "
"functions you have placed in the normal hook <code class=\"code\">midnight-"
"hook</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Hooks.html\">Hooks</a>).  To "
"enable Midnight mode, use the Customization buffer to set the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">midnight-mode</code> to <code class=\"code\">t</code>.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Easy-Customization.html\">Easy Customization "
"Interface</a>."
msgstr ""
"また、「Midnightモード」を有効にすることで、このバッファのパージを1日1回実行"
"させることも可能です。Midnightモードは毎日深夜0時に動作し、そのタイミングで"
"<code class=\"code\">clean-buffer-list</code>、または通常のフック<code "
