"Killing\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dread_002donly_002dok\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-read_002donly-text_002c-killing\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dread_002donly_002dok\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-read_002donly-text_002c-killing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Options.html
msgid ""
"Some specialized buffers contain <em class=\"dfn\">read-only text</em>, "
"which cannot be modified and therefore cannot be killed.  The kill commands "
"work specially in a read-only buffer: they move over text and copy it to the "
"kill ring, without actually deleting it from the buffer.  Normally, they "
"also beep and display an error message when this happens.  But if you set "
"the variable <code class=\"code\">kill-read-only-ok</code> to a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value, they just print a message in the echo area "
"to explain why the text has not been erased."
msgstr ""
"一部の特殊なバッファには<em class=\"dfn\">読み取り専用テキスト</em>が含まれて"
"おり、これは変更できないため、キルすることもできません。キルコマンドは読み取"
"り専用バッファにおいて特殊な動作をします。具体的には、テキスト上を移動してキ"
"ルリングにコピーしますが、バッファから実際に削除することはありません。通常、"
"このような場合にはビープ音が鳴り、エラーメッセージが表示されます。しかし、変"
"数 <code class=\"code\">kill-read-only-ok</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を設定すると、テキストが消去されなかった理"
"由を説明するメッセージがエコー領域に出力されるだけになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dtransform_002dfunction\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dtransform_002dfunction\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Options.html
msgid ""
"Before saving the kill to the kill ring, you can transform the string using "
"<code class=\"code\">kill-transform-function</code>.  It&rsquo;s called with "
"the string to be killed, and it should return the string you want to be "
"saved.  It can also return <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, in which case "
"the string won&rsquo;t be saved to the kill ring.  For instance, if you "
"never want to save a pure white space string to the kill ring, you can say:"
msgstr ""
"キルをキルリングに保存する前に、<code class=\"code\">kill-transform-"
"function</code> を使って文字列を変換できます。この関数はキル対象の文字列を引"
"数として呼び出され、保存したい文字列を返す必要があります。また、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返すこともでき、その場合は文字列はキルリングに保"
"存されません。例えば、純空白文字列を絶対にキルリングに保存したくない場合は、"
"次のように記述できます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Options.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq kill-transform-function\n"
"      (lambda (string)\n"
"        (and (not (string-blank-p string))\n"
"             string)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"kill_002ddo_002dnot_002dsave_002dduplicates\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"kill_002ddo_002dnot_002dsave_002dduplicates\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Options.html
msgid ""
"If you change the variable <code class=\"code\">kill-do-not-save-duplicates</"
"code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, identical subsequent "
"kills yield a single kill-ring entry, without duplication."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">kill-do-not-save-duplicates</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に変更すると、それ以降の同一キルは重複せ"
"ず、単一のキルリングエントリとして記録されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"kill_002dring_002ddeindent_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"kill_002dring_002ddeindent_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Options.html
msgid ""
"If you enable the minor mode <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-deindent-mode</"
"code>, text saved to the kill-ring will have its indentation decreased by "
"the amount of indentation of the first saved line.  That is, if the first "
"line of the saved text was indented <var class=\"var\">n</var> columns, this "
"mode will remove that number of columns from the indentation of each saved "
"line."
msgstr ""
"マイナーモード <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-deindent-mode</code> を有効にす"
"ると、キルリングに保存されるテキストのインデントが、最初に保存された行のイン"
"デント量分だけ減少します。つまり、保存されたテキストの1行目が <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> 列分インデントされていた場合、このモードでは保存される"
"各行のインデントからその列数分が差し引かれます。"

