#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Ring.html
msgid ""
"<span>14.2.1 The Kill Ring<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-Kill-"
"Ring\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>14.2.1 キルリング<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-Kill-Ring\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Ring.html
msgid ""
"The <em class=\"dfn\">kill ring</em> is a list of blocks of text that were "
"previously killed.  There is only one kill ring, shared by all buffers, so "
"you can kill text in one buffer and yank it in another buffer.  This is the "
"usual way to move text from one buffer to another.  (There are several other "
"methods: for instance, you could store the text in a register; see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Registers.html\">Registers</a>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Accumulating-Text.html\">Accumulating Text</a>, for some other ways "
"to move text around.)"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">キルリング</em>とは、以前にキルされたテキストブロックのリス"
"トのことです。キルリングは全バッファで共有される単一のものであり、あるバッ"
"ファでテキストをキルし、それを別のバッファにヤンクすることができます。これ"
"が、あるバッファから別のバッファへテキストを移動させる一般的な方法です。（他"
"にもいくつかの方法があります。例えば、テキストをレジスタに格納することも可能"
"です。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Registers.html\">レジスタ</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。また、テキストを移動させるその他の方法については、<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Accumulating-Text.html\">テキストの蓄積</a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Ring.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dring_002dmax\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dring_002dmax\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Ring.html
msgid ""
"The maximum number of entries in the kill ring is controlled by the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">kill-ring-max</code>.  The default is 120.  If you make "
"a new kill when this limit has been reached, Emacs makes room by deleting "
"the oldest entry in the kill ring."
msgstr ""
"キルリングの最大エントリ数は変数 <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-max</code> で"
"制御されます。デフォルト値は 120 です。この上限に達した状態で新たにキルを行う"
"と、Emacs はキルリング内の最も古いエントリを削除して空き容量を確保します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Ring.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dring\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dring\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kill-Ring.html
msgid ""
"The actual contents of the kill ring are stored in a variable named <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-ring</code>; you can view the entire contents of the "
"kill ring with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h v kill-ring</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"キルリングの実際の内容は<code class=\"code\">kill-ring</code>という名前の変数"
"に格納されており、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h v kill-ring</kbd>でキルリングの全内"
"容を確認できます。"

