"Kill an entire line at once (<code class=\"code\">kill-whole-line</code>)"
msgstr "1行丸ごと削除 (<code class=\"code\">kill-whole-line</code>)"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Killing-by-Lines.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dk\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-kill_002dline\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dk\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-kill_002dline\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Killing-by-Lines.html
msgid ""
"The simplest kill command is <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-line</code>).  If used at the end of a line, it kills "
"the line-ending newline character, merging the next line into the current "
"one (thus, a blank line is entirely removed).  Otherwise, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> kills all the text from point up to the end of the "
"line; if point was originally at the beginning of the line, this leaves the "
"line blank."
msgstr ""
"最もシンプルなキルコマンドは <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-line</code>) です。行末で使用した場合、行末の改行文字が削"
"除され、次の行が現在の行に統合されます（これにより、空行は完全に削除されま"
"す）。それ以外の場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> はポイントから行末までのす"
"べてのテキストを削除します。ポイントがもともと行頭にあった場合、行は空になり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Killing-by-Lines.html
msgid ""
"Spaces and tabs at the end of the line are ignored when deciding which case "
"applies.  As long as point is after the last non-whitespace character in the "
"line, you can be sure that <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> will kill the "
"newline.  To kill an entire non-blank line, go to the beginning and type "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> twice."
msgstr ""
"どのケースが適用されるかを判断する際、行末のスペースやタブは無視されます。ポ"
"イントが行内の最後の非空白文字の後にある限り、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> で"
"改行が削除されることは間違いありません。空白以外の行全体を削除するには、行頭"
"に移動して <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> を2回入力してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Killing-by-Lines.html
msgid ""
"In this context, &ldquo;line&rdquo; means a logical text line, not a screen "
"line (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Continuation-Lines.html\">Continuation "
"Lines</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ここでの「行」とは、画面行ではなく論理テキスト行を指します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Continuation-Lines.html\">継続行</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Killing-by-Lines.html
msgid ""
"When <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> is given a positive argument <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var>, it kills <var class=\"var\">n</var> lines and the "
"newlines that follow them (text on the current line before point is not "
"killed).  With a negative argument &minus;<var class=\"var\">n</var>, it "
"kills <var class=\"var\">n</var> lines preceding the current line, together "
"with the text on the current line before point.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</"
"kbd> with an argument of zero kills the text before point on the current "
"line."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> に正の引数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> を指定する"
"と、<var class=\"var\">n</var> 行とそれに続く改行が削除されます（ポイントより"
"前の現在の行のテキストは削除されません）。負の引数 &minus;<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> を指定すると、現在の行より前の <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var> 行と、ポイントより前の現在の行のテキストが削除されます。引数が 0 の "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> は、現在の行のポイントより前のテキストを削除しま"
"す。"

