# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Killing-by-Lines.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-S-backspace</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kill-whole-"
"line</code>) kills a whole line including its newline, regardless of the "
"position of point within the line.  Note that many text terminals will "
"prevent you from typing the key sequence <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-S-backspace</"
"kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-S-backspace</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kill-whole-"
"line</code>) は、行内でのポイントの位置に関わらず、改行を含む行全体を削除しま"
"す。なお、多くのテキスト端末では、キーシーケンス <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-S-"
"backspace</kbd> の入力が禁止されている点に注意してください。"

