# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Kmacro-Menu.html
msgid ""
"Mark the macro on the current line, then move point to the next line (<code "
"class=\"code\">kmacro-menu-mark</code>).  Marked macros are indicated by the "
