"set_002dlanguage_002denvironment_002dhook\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Language-Environments.html
msgid ""
"You can customize any language environment with the normal hook <code "
"class=\"code\">set-language-environment-hook</code>.  The command <code "
"class=\"code\">set-language-environment</code> runs that hook after setting "
"up the new language environment.  The hook functions can test for a specific "
"language environment by checking the variable <code class=\"code\">current-"
"language-environment</code>.  This hook is where you should put non-default "
"settings for specific language environments, such as coding systems for "
"keyboard input and terminal output, the default input method, etc."
msgstr ""
"通常のフック <code class=\"code\">set-language-environment-hook</code> を使え"
"ば、任意の言語環境をカスタマイズできます。コマンド <code class=\"code\">set-"
"language-environment</code> は、新しい言語環境をセットアップした後にそのフッ"
"クを実行します。フック関数では、変数 <code class=\"code\">current-language-"
"environment</code> を確認することで、特定の言語環境を判定できます。キーボード"
"入力やターミナル出力用の文字コード体系、デフォルトの入力メソッドなど、特定の"
"言語環境向けのデフォルト以外の設定は、このフックに記述してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Language-Environments.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"exit_002dlanguage_002denvironment_002dhook\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"exit_002dlanguage_002denvironment_002dhook\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Language-Environments.html
msgid ""
"Before it starts to set up the new language environment, <code "
"class=\"code\">set-language-environment</code> first runs the hook <code "
"class=\"code\">exit-language-environment-hook</code>.  This hook is useful "
"for undoing customizations that were made with <code class=\"code\">set-"
"language-environment-hook</code>.  For instance, if you set up a special key "
"binding in a specific language environment using <code class=\"code\">set-"
"language-environment-hook</code>, you should set up <code "
"class=\"code\">exit-language-environment-hook</code> to restore the normal "
"binding for that key."
msgstr ""
"新しい言語環境のセットアップを開始する前に、<code class=\"code\">set-"
"language-environment</code>はまずフック<code class=\"code\">exit-language-"
"environment-hook</code>を実行します。このフックは、<code class=\"code\">set-"
"language-environment-hook</code>で行ったカスタマイズを元に戻す際に便利です。"
"例えば、<code class=\"code\">set-language-environment-hook</code>を使用して特"
"定の言語環境で特殊なキーバインドを設定した場合は、そのキーの通常のバインドを"
"復元するために<code class=\"code\">exit-language-environment-hook</code>を設"
"定する必要があります。"

