# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lax-Search.html
msgid ""
"Normally, you&rsquo;d want search commands to disregard certain minor "
"differences between the search string you type and the text being searched.  "
"For example, sequences of whitespace characters of different length are "
"usually perceived as equivalent; letter-case differences usually don&rsquo;t "
"matter; etc.  This is known as <em class=\"dfn\">character equivalence</em>."
msgstr ""
"通常、検索コマンドには、入力する検索文字列と検索対象のテキストとの間にある特"
"定の些細な差異を無視させたいものです。例えば、長さの異なる空白文字の連続は通"
"常同等とみなされますし、大文字・小文字の違いも通常は問題になりません。これは"
"<em class=\"dfn\">文字の等価性</em>として知られています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lax-Search.html
