# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lax-Search.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-c</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s c</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-toggle-case-fold</code>)  within an incremental "
"search toggles the case sensitivity of that search.  The effect does not "
"extend beyond the current incremental search, but it does override the "
"effect of adding or removing an upper-case letter in the current search."
msgstr ""
"インクリメンタル検索内で <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-c</kbd> または <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-s c</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-toggle-case-fold</"
"code>) と入力すると、その検索の大文字・小文字の区別が切り替わります。この効果"
"は現在のインクリメンタル検索の範囲外には及びませんが、現在の検索において大文"
"字を追加または削除した際の効果は上書きされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lax-Search.html
msgid ""
"Several related variables control case-sensitivity of searching and matching "
"for specific commands or activities.  For instance, <code "
"class=\"code\">tags-case-fold-search</code> controls case sensitivity for "
"<code class=\"code\">find-tag</code>.  To find these variables, do <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x apropos-variable <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> case-fold-"
"search <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"特定のコマンドやアクティビティの検索・照合における大文字小文字の区別を制御す"
"る関連変数がいくつかあります。例えば、<code class=\"code\">tags-case-fold-"
"search</code>は<code class=\"code\">find-tag</code>の大文字小文字の区別を制御"
"します。これらの変数を探すには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x apropos-variable <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> case-fold-search <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>を"
"実行してください。"

