# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Eval.html
msgid ""
"Evaluate the Emacs Lisp expression before point, and print the value in the "
"echo area (<code class=\"code\">eval-last-sexp</code>)."
msgstr ""
"ポイント直前のEmacs Lisp式を評価し、その値をエコーエリアに出力します (<code "
"class=\"code\">eval-last-sexp</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
