#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
msgid ""
"<span>28.3.3 Customizing Lisp Indentation<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Customizing-Lisp-Indentation\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>28.3.3 Lispのインデントのカスタマイズ<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Customizing-Lisp-Indentation\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customizing-Lisp-indentation\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customizing-Lisp-indentation\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
msgid ""
"The indentation pattern for a Lisp expression can depend on the function "
"called by the expression.  For each Lisp function, you can choose among "
"several predefined patterns of indentation, or define an arbitrary one with "
"a Lisp program."
msgstr ""
"Lisp式のインデントパターンは、その式で呼び出される関数によって異なる場合があ"
"ります。各Lisp関数について、あらかじめ定義された複数のインデントパターンから"
"選択するか、Lispプログラムを用いて任意のパターンを定義することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
msgid ""
"The standard pattern of indentation is as follows: the second line of the "
"expression is indented under the first argument, if that is on the same line "
"as the beginning of the expression; otherwise, the second line is indented "
"underneath the function name.  Each following line is indented under the "
"previous line whose nesting depth is the same."
msgstr ""
"インデントの標準的なパターンは以下の通りです。式の2行目は、第1引数が式の先頭"
"と同じ行にある場合はその引数の下に、そうでない場合は関数名の下にインデントさ"
"れます。それ以降の各行は、ネストの深さが同じである前の行の下にインデントされ"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lisp_002dindent_002doffset\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lisp_002dindent_002doffset\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
msgid ""
"If the variable <code class=\"code\">lisp-indent-offset</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it overrides the usual indentation pattern for "
"the second line of an expression, so that such lines are always indented "
"<code class=\"code\">lisp-indent-offset</code> more columns than the "
"containing list."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">lisp-indent-offset</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、式の2行目における通常のインデントパター"
"ンが上書きされ、当該行は常に包含するリストよりも <code class=\"code\">lisp-"
"indent-offset</code> 列分多くインデントされるようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lisp_002dbody_002dindent\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lisp_002dbody_002dindent\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
msgid ""
"Certain functions override the standard pattern.  Functions whose names "
"start with <code class=\"code\">def</code> treat the second lines as the "
"start of a <em class=\"dfn\">body</em>, by indenting the second line <code "
"class=\"code\">lisp-body-indent</code> additional columns beyond the open-"
"parenthesis that starts the expression."
msgstr ""
"一部の関数は標準パターンを上書きします。名前が <code class=\"code\">def</"
"code> で始まる関数は、式の開始となる開き括弧からさらに <code "
"class=\"code\">lisp-body-indent</code> 列分インデントすることで、2行目を <em "
"class=\"dfn\">body</em> の開始として扱います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lisp_002dindent_002dfunction-"
"property\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lisp_002dindent_002dfunction-"
"property\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
msgid ""
"You can override the standard pattern in various ways for individual "
"functions, according to the <code class=\"code\">lisp-indent-function</code> "
"property of the function name.  This is normally done for macro definitions, "
"using the <code class=\"code\">declare</code> construct.  See <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Defining-Macros.html#Defining-Macros\">Defining Macros</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"関数名の <code class=\"code\">lisp-indent-function</code> プロパティに応じ"
"て、個々の関数において標準パターンをさまざまな方法でオーバーライドできます。"
"通常、これは <code class=\"code\">declare</code> 構文を用いてマクロ定義時に行"
"われます。<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a "
"data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Defining-Macros.html#Defining-Macros\">Defining Macros</a> を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
msgid ""
"In Emacs Lisp, lists are usually indented as if they are function-like forms:"
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lispでは、リストは通常、関数のような形式であるかのようにインデントされ"
"ます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq foo '(bar zot\n"
"                gazonk))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
msgid ""
"However, if you add a space after the opening parenthesis, this tells Emacs "
"that it&rsquo;s a data list instead of a piece of code, and Emacs will then "
"indent it like this:"
msgstr ""
"ただし、開き括弧の後にスペースを入れると、これがコードではなくデータリストで"
"あることをEmacsに伝えることになり、Emacsは次のようにインデントします："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Indent.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq foo '( bar zot\n"
"             gazonk))\n"
msgstr ""

