#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Interaction.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lisp_002dinteraction_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lisp_002dinteraction_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Interaction.html
msgid ""
"When Emacs starts up, it contains a buffer named <samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>, which is provided for evaluating Emacs Lisp "
"expressions interactively.  Its major mode is Lisp Interaction mode.  You "
"can also enable Lisp Interaction mode by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x lisp-"
"interaction-mode</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsの起動時には、Emacs Lisp式を対話的に評価するための<samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>という名前のバッファが用意されています。そのメ"
"ジャーモードはLisp Interactionモードです。また、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x lisp-"
"interaction-mode</kbd>と入力することでもLisp Interactionモードを有効にできま"
"す。"

