# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lisp-Interaction.html
msgid ""
"If you kill the <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> buffer, you can "
"recreate it with the <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x scratch-buffer</kbd> command."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>バッファを削除すると、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x scratch-buffer</kbd>コマンドで再作成できます。"

