#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Locals.html
msgid ""
"Mark variable <var class=\"var\">var</var> so that setting it will make it "
"local to the buffer that is current at that time."
msgstr ""
