#: build/html/emacs/Looking-Up-Identifiers.html
msgid ""
"If you switch away of the window showing the <samp class=\"file\">*xref*</"
"samp> buffer which displays several candidates, you can move from one "
"candidate to another using the commands <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-g&nbsp;M-n</"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">next-error</code>) and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"g&nbsp;M-p</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">previous-error</code>).  See <a "
