# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Looking-Up-Identifiers.html
msgid ""
"To go back to places <em class=\"emph\">from where</em> you&rsquo;ve "
"displayed the definition, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-,</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">xref-go-back</code>).  It jumps back to the point of the last "
"invocation of <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-.</kbd>.  Thus you can find and examine "
"the definition of something with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-.</kbd> and then "
"return to where you were with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-,</kbd>.  <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-,</kbd> allows you to retrace the steps you made forward in "
"the history of places, all the way to the first place in history, where you "
"first invoked <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-.</kbd>, or to any place in-between."
msgstr ""
"定義を表示した<em class=\"emph\">場所</em>に戻るには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-,"
"</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">xref-go-back</code>) を使用します。これにより、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-.</kbd> が最後に呼び出された時点まで戻ります。したがっ"
"て、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-.</kbd> で何らかの定義を探して調べ、その後 <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-,</kbd> で元の場所に戻ることができます。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-,</kbd> を使用すると、場所の履歴を遡って、最初に <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-.</kbd> を呼び出した歴史上の最初の場所、あるいはその間の任意"
"の場所まで戻ることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Looking-Up-Identifiers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dM_002d_002c\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-xref_002dgo_002dforward\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dM_002d_002c\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-xref_002dgo_002dforward\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Looking-Up-Identifiers.html
msgid ""
"If you previously went back too far with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-,</kbd>, or "
"want to re-examine a place from which you went back, you can use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-,</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">xref-go-forward</code>) to "
"go forward again.  This is similar to using <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-.</kbd>, "
"except that you don&rsquo;t need on each step to move point to the "
"identifier whose definition you want to look up.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-,</"
"kbd> allows you to retrace all the steps you made back in the history of "
"places, all the way to the last place in history, where you invoked <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-,</kbd>, or to any place in-between."
msgstr ""
"以前に <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-,</kbd> で戻りすぎた場合や、戻った場所を再調査し"
"たい場合は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-,</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">xref-go-"
"forward</code>) を使用して再び進むことができます。これは <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-.</kbd> を使用する場合と似ていますが、各ステップで定義を調べ"
"たい識別子にポイントを移動させる必要がない点が異なります。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-,</kbd> を使用すると、場所の履歴において戻ったすべてのス"
"テップを、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-,</kbd> を呼び出した履歴上の最後の場所、あるい"
"はその間の任意の場所まで遡ることができます。"

