#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Lunar-Phases.html
msgid ""
"<span>33.8 Phases of the Moon<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Phases-of-"
"the-Moon\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>33.8 月の満ち欠け<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Phases-of-the-"
"Moon\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Lunar-Phases.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-phases-of-the-moon\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-moon_002c-phases-of\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-phases-of-the-moon\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-moon_002c-phases-of\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lunar-Phases.html
msgid ""
"The calendar commands described in this section display the dates and times "
"of the phases of the moon (new moon, first quarter, full moon, last "
"quarter).  This feature is useful for debugging problems that depend on the "
"phase of the moon."
msgstr ""
"本節で説明するカレンダーコマンドは、月の満ち欠け（新月、第1四半期、満月、第4"
"四半期）の日時を表示します。この機能は、月の満ち欠けに依存する問題のデバッグ"
"に役立ちます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Lunar-Phases.html
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Directory-Commands.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lunar-Phases.html
msgid ""
"Display the dates and times for all the quarters of the moon for the visible "
"period shown (<code class=\"code\">calendar-lunar-phases</code>)."
msgstr ""
"表示されている観測期間（<code class=\"code\">calendar-lunar-phases</code>）に"
"おける、月の全四半期の日付と時刻を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Lunar-Phases.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x lunar-phases</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x lunar-phases</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lunar-Phases.html
msgid ""
"Display dates and times of the quarters of the moon for three months around "
"today&rsquo;s date."
msgstr "本日の前後3か月間の月の四分相の日時を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Lunar-Phases.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M-_0028Calendar-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dlunar_002dphases\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M-_0028Calendar-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dlunar_002dphases\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lunar-Phases.html
msgid ""
"Within the calendar, use the <kbd class=\"kbd\">M</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-lunar-phases</code>)  command to display a separate "
"buffer of the phases of the moon for the current visible range.  The dates "
"and times listed are accurate to within a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"カレンダー内では、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">calendar-"
"lunar-phases</code>) コマンドを使用して、現在見えている範囲の月の満ち欠けを別"
"バッファに表示できます。表示される日付と時刻は、数分の誤差範囲内で正確です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Lunar-Phases.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lunar_002dphases\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lunar_002dphases\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lunar-Phases.html
msgid ""
"Outside the calendar, use the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x lunar-phases</"
"kbd> to display the list of the phases of the moon for the current month and "
"the preceding and succeeding months.  For information about a different "
"month, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-x lunar-phases</kbd>, which prompts for "
"the month and year."
msgstr ""
"カレンダー以外では、コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x lunar-phases</kbd> を使用"
"して、当月および前後の月の月の満ち欠けの一覧を表示できます。別の月に関する情"
"報を確認するには、月と年の入力を求める <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-x lunar-"
"phases</kbd> を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Lunar-Phases.html
msgid ""
"The dates and times given for the phases of the moon are given in local time "
"(corrected for daylight saving, when appropriate).  See the discussion in "
"the previous section (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Sunrise_002fSunset.html\">Times of Sunrise and Sunset</a>)."
msgstr ""
"月の満ち欠けについて記載されている日付と時刻は、現地時間（適宜、夏時間補正済"
"み）です。前節の解説（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Sunrise_002fSunset.html\">日"
"の出・日の入り時刻</a>を参照）をご覧ください。"

