# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"Every Emacs command has a name that you can use to run it.  For convenience, "
"many commands also have key bindings.  You can run those commands by typing "
"the keys, or run them by name.  Most Emacs commands have no key bindings, so "
"the only way to run them is by name.  (See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-"
"Bindings.html\">Customizing Key Bindings</a>, for how to set up key "
"bindings.)"
msgstr ""
"すべてのEmacsコマンドには、実行に使用できる名前があります。利便性のため、多く"
"のコマンドにはキーバインドも設定されています。これらのコマンドは、キーを入力"
"するか、名前を指定して実行できます。ほとんどのEmacsコマンドにはキーバインドが"
"設定されていないため、名前で指定して実行するしかありません。（キーバインドの"
"設定方法については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-Bindings.html\">キーバインド"
"のカスタマイズ</a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"By convention, a command name consists of one or more words, separated by "
"hyphens; for example, <code class=\"code\">auto-fill-mode</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">manual-entry</code>.  Command names mostly use complete "
"English words to make them easier to remember."
msgstr ""
"慣例として、コマンド名はハイフンで区切られた1つ以上の単語で構成されます。例え"
"ば、<code class=\"code\">auto-fill-mode</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">manual-entry</code> などです。コマンド名は、覚えやすくするた"
"め、主に完全な英単語が用いられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dx\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dx\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"To run a command by name, start with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd>, type the "
"command name, then terminate it with <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>.  <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> uses the minibuffer to read the command name.  The "
"string &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">M-x</samp>&rsquo; appears at the "
"beginning of the minibuffer as a <em class=\"dfn\">prompt</em> to remind you "
"to enter a command name to be run.  <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> exits the "
"minibuffer and runs the command.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Minibuffer.html\">The Minibuffer</a>, for more information on the "
"minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"コマンド名を指定して実行するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> で始め、コマン"
"ド名を入力し、最後に <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> で終了します。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> はミニバッファを使用してコマンド名を読み取ります。ミ"
"ニバッファの先頭には、実行するコマンド名の入力を促す <em class=\"dfn\">プロン"
"プト</em> として文字列 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">M-x</samp>&rsquo; が表示さ"
"れます。<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> でミニバッファを終了し、コマンドを実行し"
"ます。ミニバッファの詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Minibuffer.html\">ミニバッファ</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"You can use completion to enter the command name.  For example, to invoke "
"the command <code class=\"code\">forward-char</code>, you can type"
msgstr ""
"補完機能を使ってコマンド名を入力できます。例えば、<code "
"class=\"code\">forward-char</code> コマンドを実行するには、次のように入力しま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "M-x forward-char <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "M-x forw <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> c <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"Note that <code class=\"code\">forward-char</code> is the same command that "
"you invoke with the key <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd>.  The existence of a "
"key binding does not stop you from running the command by name."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">forward-char</code>はキー<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</"
"kbd>で実行するのと同じコマンドです。キーバインドが存在していても、コマンド名"
"で実行することを妨げるものではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-obsolete-command\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-obsolete-command\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"When <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> completes on commands, it ignores the "
"commands that were declared <em class=\"dfn\">obsolete</em> in any previous "
"major version of Emacs; for these, you will have to type their full name.  "
"Commands that were marked obsolete in the current version of Emacs are "
"listed.  (Obsolete commands are those for which newer, better alternatives "
"exist, and which are slated for removal in some future Emacs release.)"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> がコマンドの補完を完了する際、Emacs の以前のメ"
"ジャーバージョンで <em class=\"dfn\">廃止</em> と宣言されたコマンドは無視され"
"ます。これらのコマンドについては、正式名称を入力する必要があります。現在の "
"Emacs バージョンで廃止とマークされたコマンドが一覧表示されます。（廃止コマン"
"ドとは、より新しく優れた代替手段が存在し、将来の Emacs リリースで削除される予"
"定のコマンドのことです。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"read_002dextended_002dcommand_002dpredicate\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"read_002dextended_002dcommand_002dpredicate\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"In addition, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> completion can exclude commands "
"that are not relevant to, and generally cannot work with, the current "
"buffer&rsquo;s major mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Major-"
"Modes.html\">Major Modes</a>) and minor modes (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Minor-Modes.html\">Minor Modes</a>).  By default, no commands are "
"excluded, but you can customize the option <code class=\"code\">read-"
"extended-command-predicate</code> to exclude those irrelevant commands from "
"completion results."
msgstr ""
"さらに、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> 補完では、現在のバッファのメジャーモード"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Major-Modes.html\">メジャーモード</a>を参照）およ"
"びマイナーモード（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minor-Modes.html\">マイナーモード"
"</a>を参照）に関連がなく、一般的にそれらでは動作しないコマンドを除外できま"
"す。デフォルトでは除外されるコマンドはありませんが、オプション <code "
"class=\"code\">read-extended-command-predicate</code> をカスタマイズすること"
"で、こうした無関係なコマンドを補完結果から除外できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dS_002dx\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dX\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dS_002dx\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dX\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"Conversely, Emacs can exclude all commands except those that are "
"particularly relevant to the current buffer.  The <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-S-x</"
"kbd> (that&rsquo;s &ldquo;meta shift x&rdquo;) command works just like <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd>, but instead of listing all (or most) of the "
"commands Emacs knows about, it will only list the commands that have been "
"marked as &ldquo;belonging&rdquo; to the current major mode, or any enabled "
"minor modes."
msgstr ""
"逆に、Emacsは現在のバッファに特に関連のあるコマンド以外をすべて除外することが"
"できます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-S-x</kbd>（いわゆる「meta shift x」）コマンド"
"は<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd>と同様に動作しますが、Emacsが認識しているすべて"
"の（あるいはほとんどの）コマンドを列挙する代わりに、現在のメジャーモードや有"
"効化されているマイナーモードに「属する」とマークされたコマンドのみを列挙しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"To cancel the <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> and not run a command, type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> instead of entering the command name.  This takes "
"you back to command level."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd>をキャンセルしてコマンドを実行しない場合は、コマ"
"ンド名を入力する代わりに<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd>と入力してください。これ"
"により、コマンドレベルに戻ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"To pass a numeric argument to the command you are invoking with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd>, specify the numeric argument before <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd>.  The argument value appears in the prompt while the "
"command name is being read, and finally <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> passes "
"the argument to that command.  For example, to pass the numeric argument of "
"42 to the command <code class=\"code\">forward-char</code> you can type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u 42 M-x forward-char <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> で呼び出すコマンドに数値引数を渡すには、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> の前にその数値引数を指定します。引数の値はコマンド名"
"の読み込み中にプロンプトに表示され、最終的に <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> が"
"そのコマンドに引数を渡します。例えば、コマンド <code class=\"code\">forward-"
"char</code> に数値引数 42 を渡すには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u 42 M-x forward-"
"char <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> と入力します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-suggest_002dkey_002dbindings\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-suggest_002dkey_002dbindings\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"When the command you run with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> has a key "
"binding, Emacs mentions this in the echo area after running the command.  "
"For example, if you type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x forward-word</kbd>, the "
"message says that you can run the same command by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-f</kbd>.  You can turn off these messages by setting the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">suggest-key-bindings</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The value of <code class=\"code\">suggest-key-"
"bindings</code> can also be a number, in which case Emacs will show the "
"binding for that many seconds before removing it from display.  The default "
"behavior is to display the binding for 2 seconds."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> で実行するコマンドにキーバインドが設定されている"
"場合、Emacs はコマンド実行後のエコーエリアにその旨を表示します。例えば、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x forward-word</kbd> と入力すると、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-f</"
"kbd> と入力することで同じコマンドを実行できるというメッセージが表示されます。"
"変数 <code class=\"code\">suggest-key-bindings</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を設定することで、これらのメッセージを非表示にでき"
"ます。また、<code class=\"code\">suggest-key-bindings</code> に数値を指定する"
"ことも可能で、その場合は Emacs がそのバインドを指定された秒数だけ表示した後、"
"表示から削除します。デフォルトの動作では、バインドが 2 秒間表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"Additionally, when <code class=\"code\">suggest-key-bindings</code> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the completion list of <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x</kbd> shows equivalent key bindings for all commands that have them."
msgstr ""
"さらに、<code class=\"code\">suggest-key-bindings</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> ではない場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> の補完リ"
"ストには、キーバインドが設定されているすべてのコマンドに対して同等のキーバイ"
"ンドが表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"extended_002dcommand_002dsuggest_002dshorter\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"extended_002dcommand_002dsuggest_002dshorter\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"Commands that don&rsquo;t have key bindings, can still be invoked after "
"typing less than their full name at the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">M-x</"
"samp>&rsquo; prompt.  Emacs mentions such shorthands in the echo area if "
"they are significantly shorter than the full command name, and <code "
"class=\"code\">extended-command-suggest-shorter</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The setting of <code class=\"code\">suggest-key-"
"bindings</code> affects these hints as well."
msgstr ""
"キーバインドが割り当てられていないコマンドであっても、「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">M-x</samp>」プロンプトでフル名より短く入力すれば呼び出すことが"
"できます。Emacsは、こうした短縮形がフルコマンド名よりも大幅に短く、かつ<code "
"class=\"code\">extended-command-suggest-shorter</code>が非<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>である場合に、エコーエリアにそれらのヒントを表示しま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">suggest-key-bindings</code>の設定も、これらのヒント"
"に影響します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"In this manual, when we speak of running a command by name, we often omit "
"the <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> that terminates the name.  Thus we might "
"say <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x auto-fill-mode</kbd> rather than <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;auto-fill-mode&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd>.  We mention the <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> only for emphasis, such "
"as when the command is followed by arguments."
msgstr ""
"本マニュアルでは、コマンド名を指定して実行する場合、名前を区切る<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd>を省略することがよくあります。したがって、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;auto-fill-mode&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
"ではなく<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x auto-fill-mode</kbd>と表記することがあります。"
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>については、コマンドの後に引数が続く場合など、強"
"調したい場合にのみ記載します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-execute_002dextended_002dcommand\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-execute_002dextended_002dcommand\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/M_002dx.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> works by running the command <code "
"class=\"code\">execute-extended-command</code>, which is responsible for "
"reading the name of another command and invoking it."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd>は、別のコマンド名を読み取ってそれを呼び出す役割"
"を持つコマンド<code class=\"code\">execute-extended-command</code>を実行する"
"ことで動作します。"

