# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mac-_002f-GNUstep-Customization.html
msgid ""
"There are a few customization options that are specific to the Nextstep "
"port.  For example, they affect things such as the modifier keys and the "
"fullscreen behavior.  To see all such options, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"customize-group <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> ns <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"Nextstepポート固有のカスタマイズオプションがいくつかあります。例えば、修飾"
"キーやフルスクリーン時の動作などに影響します。こうしたオプションをすべて表示"
"するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-group <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd> ns <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> を使用してください。"

