# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mac-_002f-GNUstep-Customization.html
msgid ""
"The value of each variable is either a symbol, describing the key for any "
"purpose, or a list of the form <code class=\"code\">(:ordinary <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> :function <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> :mouse "
"<var class=\"var\">symbol</var>)</code>, which describes the modifier when "
"used with ordinary keys, function keys (that do not produce a character, "
"such as arrow keys), and mouse clicks."
msgstr ""
"各変数の値は、任意の目的におけるキーを表すシンボルか、あるいは <code "
"class=\"code\">(:ordinary <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> :function <var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> :mouse <var class=\"var\">symbol</var>)</code> と"
"いう形式のリストのいずれかであり、後者は通常のキー、ファンクションキー（矢印"
"キーなど文字を出力しないもの）、およびマウスクリックと併用される際の修飾子を"
"表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mac-_002f-GNUstep-Customization.html
msgid ""
"If the <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> is one of <code "
"class=\"code\">control</code>, <code class=\"code\">meta</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">alt</code>, <code class=\"code\">super</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">hyper</code>, this describes the Emacs modifier it "
"represents.  If <var class=\"var\">symbol</var> is <code "
"class=\"code\">none</code>, Emacs does not use the key, which retains its "
"standard behavior.  For instance, the <kbd class=\"key\">Option</kbd> key in "
"macOS is then used for composing additional characters."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">symbol</var> が <code class=\"code\">control</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">meta</code>、<code class=\"code\">alt</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">super</code>、または <code class=\"code\">hyper</code> のいず"
"れかである場合、これはそれが表す Emacs 修飾キーを示します。<var "
"class=\"var\">symbol</var> が <code class=\"code\">none</code> である場合、"
"Emacs はそのキーを使用せず、標準的な動作が維持されます。例えば、macOS におけ"
"る <kbd class=\"key\">Option</kbd> キーは、追加の文字を合成するために使用され"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mac-_002f-GNUstep-Customization.html
msgid ""
"The variables for right-hand keys, like <code class=\"code\">ns-right-"
"alternate-modifier</code>, may also be set to <code class=\"code\">left</"
"code>, which means to use the same behavior as the corresponding left-hand "
"key."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">ns-right-alternate-modifier</code> などの右キー用変数"
"は、<code class=\"code\">left</code> に設定することもでき、これは対応する左"
"キーと同じ動作を行うことを意味します。"

