"ns_002dconfirm_002dquit\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mac-_002f-GNUstep-Customization.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies whether to display a graphical confirmation dialog "
"on quitting."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、終了時にグラフィカルな確認ダイアログを表示するかどうかを指定しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mac-_002f-GNUstep-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-ns_002dauto_002dhide_002dmenu_002dbar\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">ns-auto-hide-menu-bar</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-ns_002dauto_002dhide_002dmenu_002dbar\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-ns_002dauto_002dhide_002dmenu_002dbar\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">ns-auto-hide-menu-bar</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-ns_002dauto_002dhide_002dmenu_002dbar\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mac-_002f-GNUstep-Customization.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies whether the macOS menu bar is hidden when an Emacs "
"frame is selected.  If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> the menu bar is "
"not shown unless the mouse pointer is moved near to the top of the screen."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、Emacsフレームを選択した際にmacOSのメニューバーを非表示にするかど"
"うかを指定します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、マウスポインタ"
"を画面上部に移動させない限り、メニューバーは表示されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mac-_002f-GNUstep-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-ns_002duse_002dnative_002dfullscreen\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">ns-use-native-fullscreen</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-ns_002duse_002dnative_002dfullscreen\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-ns_002duse_002dnative_002dfullscreen\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">ns-use-native-fullscreen</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-ns_002duse_002dnative_002dfullscreen\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mac-_002f-GNUstep-Customization.html
msgid ""
"This variable controls whether to use native, or non-native fullscreen.  "
"Native fullscreen is only available on macOS 10.7 and above."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、ネイティブフルスクリーンを使用するか、非ネイティブフルスクリーン"
"を使用するかを制御します。ネイティブフルスクリーンはmacOS 10.7以降でのみ利用"
"可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Mac-_002f-GNUstep-Customization.html
