# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"You can define <em class=\"dfn\">mail aliases</em>, which are short mnemonic "
"names that stand for one or more mailing addresses.  By default, mail "
"aliases are defined in the file <samp class=\"file\">~/.mailrc</samp>.  You "
"can specify a different file name to use, by setting the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">mail-personal-alias-file</code>."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">メールエイリアス</em>を定義できます。これは、1つ以上のメー"
"ルアドレスを表す短い覚えやすい名称です。デフォルトでは、メールエイリアスは"
"ファイル <samp class=\"file\">~/.mailrc</samp> で定義されています。変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">mail-personal-alias-file</code> を設定することで、別の"
"ファイル名を指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"To define an alias in <samp class=\"file\">~/.mailrc</samp>, write a line "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">~/.mailrc</samp> でエイリアスを定義するには、次のような"
"行を記述します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "alias <var class=\"var\">nick</var> <var class=\"var\">fulladdresses</var>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"This means that <var class=\"var\">nick</var> should expand into <var "
"class=\"var\">fulladdresses</var>, where <var class=\"var\">fulladdresses</"
"var> can be either a single address, or multiple addresses separated with "
"spaces.  For instance, to make <code class=\"code\">maingnu</code> stand for "
"<code class=\"code\">gnu@gnu.org</code> plus a local address of your own, "
"put in this line:"
msgstr ""
"つまり、<var class=\"var\">nick</var>は<var class=\"var\">fulladdresses</var>"
"に展開されるはずであり、ここで<var class=\"var\">fulladdresses</var>は単一の"
"アドレス、またはスペースで区切られた複数のアドレスのいずれかになります。例え"
"ば、<code class=\"code\">maingnu</code>を<code class=\"code\">gnu@gnu.org</"
"code>と独自のローカルアドレスの和として表すには、次の行を記述します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "alias maingnu gnu@gnu.org local-gnu\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"If an address contains a space, quote the whole address with a pair of "
"double quotes, like this:"
msgstr ""
"アドレスにスペースが含まれる場合は、次のようにダブルクォートでアドレス全体を"
"囲んでください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "alias jsmith &quot;John Q. Smith &lt;none@example.com&gt;&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"Note that you need not include double quotes around individual parts of the "
"address, such as the person&rsquo;s full name.  Emacs puts them in if they "
"are needed.  For instance, it inserts the above address as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;John Q. Smith&quot; &lt;none@example.com&gt;</"
"samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"なお、氏名などのアドレスの個々の部分をダブルクォートで囲む必要はありません。"
"必要に応じて、Emacsが自動的に挿入します。例えば、上記のアドレスは &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;John Q. Smith&quot; &lt;none@example.com&gt;</"
"samp>&rsquo; として挿入されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rebuild_002dmail_002dabbrevs\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-merge_002dmail_002dabbrevs\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rebuild_002dmail_002dabbrevs\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-merge_002dmail_002dabbrevs\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"After editing the <samp class=\"file\">~/.mailrc</samp> file, or if the file "
"was modified outside of Emacs, you can update the mail aliases used by a "
"running Emacs session with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;rebuild-mail-"
"abbrevs&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>.  This prompts for the name "
"of the file to use, the default being the value of <code class=\"code\">mail-"
"personal-alias-file</code>.  A similar command <code class=\"code\">merge-"
"mail-abbrevs</code> prompts for a file with mail aliases, then merges the "
"aliases in that file with the existing ones."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">~/.mailrc</samp> ファイルを編集した後、あるいは Emacs 外"
"でファイルが変更された場合は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;rebuild-mail-"
"abbrevs&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> を使用して実行中の Emacs セッ"
"ションで使用されているメールエイリアスを更新できます。このコマンドでは使用す"
"るファイル名の入力が求められ、デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">mail-"
"personal-alias-file</code> の値となります。同様のコマンドである <code "
"class=\"code\">merge-mail-abbrevs</code> は、メールエイリアスが記載されたファ"
"イルの入力を求め、そのファイル内のエイリアスを既存のものとマージします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-define_002dmail_002dabbrev\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-define_002dmail_002dabbrev\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use Emacs commands to define mail aliases.  The "
"command <code class=\"code\">define-mail-abbrev</code> prompts for the alias "
"and the full address, and defines the alias to expand to the full address.  "
"Emacs will save the added aliases whenever it offers to save all files (for "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x s</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-c</kbd>), like it "
"does with other abbrevs (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Saving-"
"Abbrevs.html\">Saving Abbrevs</a>)."
msgstr ""
"あるいは、Emacsコマンドを使用してメールエイリアスを定義することもできます。コ"
"マンド <code class=\"code\">define-mail-abbrev</code> はエイリアスと完全なア"
"ドレスの入力を求め、そのエイリアスが完全なアドレスに展開されるように定義しま"
"す。Emacsは、他の略語と同様に（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Saving-"
"Abbrevs.html\">略語の保存</a>を参照）、すべてのファイルを保存するよう促すたび"
"に（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x s</kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-c</kbd> の"
"場合）、追加したエイリアスを保存します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"Emacs also recognizes include commands in <samp class=\"file\">~/.mailrc</"
"samp>.  They look like this:"
msgstr ""
"Emacsは<samp class=\"file\">~/.mailrc</samp>内のincludeコマンドも認識します。"
"形式は以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "source <var class=\"var\">filename</var>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"The <samp class=\"file\">~/.mailrc</samp> file is not unique to Emacs; many "
"other mail-reading programs use it for mail aliases, and it can contain "
"various other commands.  However, Emacs ignores everything except alias "
"definitions and include commands."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">~/.mailrc</samp> ファイルは Emacs 特有のものではなく、他"
"の多くのメール閲覧プログラムでもメールエイリアスとして使用されており、他にも"
"さまざまなコマンドを含めることができます。ただし、Emacs はエイリアス定義と "
"include コマンド以外のすべてを無視します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mail_002dabbrev_002dinsert_002dalias\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mail_002dabbrev_002dinsert_002dalias\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"Mail aliases expand as abbrevs&mdash;that is to say, as soon as you type a "
"word-separator character after an alias (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Abbrevs.html\">Abbrevs</a>).  This expansion takes place only within "
"the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">To</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">From</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">CC</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">BCC</samp>&rsquo;, and &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Reply-To</samp>&rsquo; header fields (plus their &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Resent-</samp>&rsquo; variants); it does not take place "
"in other header fields, such as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Subject</"
"samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"メールエイリアスは略語として展開されます。つまり、エイリアスの後に単語区切り"
"文字を入力するとすぐに展開されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Abbrevs.html\">"
"略語</a>を参照）。この展開は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">To</samp>&rsquo;、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">From</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">CC</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">BCC</"
"samp>&rsquo;、および&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Reply-To</samp>&rsquo;のヘッ"
"ダーフィールド（およびその&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Resent-</samp>&rsquo;バ"
"リアント）内でのみ行われ、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Subject</samp>&rsquo;な"
"どの他のヘッダーフィールドでは行われません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"You can also insert an aliased address directly, using the command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x mail-abbrev-insert-alias</kbd>.  This reads an alias name, "
"with completion, and inserts its definition at point."
msgstr ""
"また、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x mail-abbrev-insert-alias</kbd> コマンドを使用し"
"て、エイリアス付きのアドレスを直接挿入することもできます。これにより、補完機"
"能を用いてエイリアス名を読み込み、その定義をポイントに挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mail_002dabbrev_002dcomplete_002dalias\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mail_002dabbrev_002dcomplete_002dalias\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mail-Aliases.html
msgid ""
"The command <code class=\"code\">mail-abbrev-complete-alias</code> completes "
"on the mail alias preceding point."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <code class=\"code\">mail-abbrev-complete-alias</code> は、ポイント"
"より前のメールエイリアスを補完します。"

