# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Major-Modes.html
msgid ""
"The value of the buffer-local variable <code class=\"code\">major-mode</"
"code> is a symbol with the same name as the major mode command (e.g., <code "
"class=\"code\">lisp-mode</code>).  This variable is set automatically; you "
