"specifies Fundamental mode.  You can change this default value via the "
"Customization interface (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Easy-"
"Customization.html\">Easy Customization Interface</a>), or by adding a line "
"like this to your init file (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-"
"File.html\">The Emacs Initialization File</a>):"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">major-mode</code> のデフォルト値は、メジャーモードが指定"
