# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Managing-Projects.html
msgid ""
"Normally Emacs automatically adds and removes projects to and from the <code "
"class=\"code\">project-list-file</code>, but sometimes you may want to "
"manually edit the available projects.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x project-"
"remember-project</kbd> remembers the current project, and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x project-forget-project</kbd> prompts you to choose one of "
"the available projects, and then removes it from the file."
msgstr ""
"通常、Emacsは<code class=\"code\">project-list-file</code>にプロジェクトを自"
"動的に追加・削除しますが、利用可能なプロジェクトを手動で編集したい場合もあり"
"ます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x project-remember-project</kbd>は現在のプロジェク"
"トを記憶し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x project-forget-project</kbd>は利用可能なプ"
"ロジェクトの中から1つを選択するよう促した後、それをファイルから削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Managing-Projects.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-project_002dlist_002dexclude\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-project_002dlist_002dexclude\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Managing-Projects.html
msgid ""
"The user option <code class=\"code\">project-list-exclude</code> may be set "
"to always ignore certain projects from being remembered and saved to <code "
"class=\"code\">project-list-file</code>.  It is a list of regular "
"expressions and predicate functions for project roots and objects.  The "
"regexp is matched against the project root, and the predicate should take "
"the project object as the only argument and return non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if the project should <em class=\"emph\">not</em> "
"be saved to <code class=\"code\">project-list-file</code>."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーオプション <code class=\"code\">project-list-exclude</code> を設定す"
"ると、特定のプロジェクトが記憶および <code class=\"code\">project-list-file</"
"code> への保存対象から常に除外されます。これは、プロジェクトルートおよびオブ"
"ジェクト用の正規表現と述語関数のリストです。正規表現はプロジェクトルートに対"
"して照合され、述語関数はプロジェクトオブジェクトを唯一の引数として受け取り、"
"プロジェクトを <code class=\"code\">project-list-file</code> に保存<em "
"class=\"emph\">しない</em>べき場合に non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返"
"す必要があります。"

