msgstr ""
"<span>13.4 マークリング<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-Mark-Ring\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mark-ring\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mark-ring\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid ""
"Each buffer remembers previous locations of the mark, in the <em "
"class=\"dfn\">mark ring</em>.  Commands that set the mark also push the old "
"mark onto this ring.  One of the uses of the mark ring is to remember spots "
"that you may want to go back to."
msgstr ""
"各バッファは、<em class=\"dfn\">マークリング</em>にマークの以前の位置を記録し"
"ています。マークを設定するコマンドは、古いマークもこのリングにプッシュしま"
"す。マークリングの用途の一つは、戻りたい箇所を記憶しておくことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</"
"kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</"
"kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid "Set the mark, pushing it onto the mark ring, without activating it."
msgstr "マークを、作動させずにマークリングに押し当ててセットしてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid ""
"Move point to where the mark was, and restore the mark from the ring of "
"former marks."
msgstr ""
"ポイントをマークがあった位置に移動し、過去のマークの輪からマークを復元する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dSPC-C_002dSPC\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dSPC-C_002dSPC\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> is handy when you want to use the mark to "
"remember a position to which you may wish to return.  It pushes the current "
"point onto the mark ring, without activating the mark (which would cause "
"Emacs to highlight the region).  This is actually two consecutive "
"invocations of <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">set-mark-command</code>); the first <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> sets the mark, and the "
"second <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> deactivates "
"it.  (When Transient Mark mode is off, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> instead "
"activates Transient Mark mode temporarily; see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Disabled-Transient-Mark.html\">Disabling Transient Mark Mode</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> は、マークを使って戻りたい位置を記憶しておきた"
"い場合に便利です。これは、マークを有効にすることなく（有効にすると Emacs が"
"リージョンをハイライトします）、現在のポイントをマークリングにプッシュしま"
"す。これは実際には <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">set-mark-command</code>) を2回連続して呼び出したもので"
"あり、1回目の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> でマー"
"クを設定し、2回目の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> "
"でそれを無効にします。（一時マークモードがオフの場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> は代わりに"
"一時マークモードを一時的に有効にします。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Disabled-"
"Transient-Mark.html\">一時マークモードの無効化</a> を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002du-C_002dSPC\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002du-C_002dSPC\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid ""
"To return to a marked position, use <code class=\"code\">set-mark-command</"
"code> with a prefix argument: <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>.  This moves point to where the mark was, and "
"deactivates the mark if it was active.  Each subsequent <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> jumps to a prior position stored in "
"the mark ring.  The positions you move through in this way are not lost; "
"they go to the end of the ring."
msgstr ""
"マークした位置に戻るには、接頭辞引数を指定して <code class=\"code\">set-mark-"
"command</code> を使用します：<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>。これによりポイントがマークされていた位置に移動"
"し、マークが有効だった場合は無効になります。その後の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u "
"C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> は、マークリングに保存されている前の位置"
"へとジャンプします。このように移動した位置は失われず、リングの末尾へと移動し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"set_002dmark_002dcommand_002drepeat_002dpop\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"set_002dmark_002dcommand_002drepeat_002dpop\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid ""
"If you set <code class=\"code\">set-mark-command-repeat-pop</code> to non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then immediately after you type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>, you can type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> instead of <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> to cycle through the "
"mark ring.  By default, <code class=\"code\">set-mark-command-repeat-pop</"
"code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">set-mark-command-repeat-pop</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外を設定すれば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> と入力した直後に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-"
"<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> の代わりに <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> と入力してマークリングを循環させることができま"
"す。デフォルトでは、<code class=\"code\">set-mark-command-repeat-pop</code> "
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となっています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid ""
"Each buffer has its own mark ring.  All editing commands use the current "
"buffer&rsquo;s mark ring.  In particular, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> always stays in the same buffer."
msgstr ""
"各バッファには独自のマークリングがあります。すべての編集コマンドは、現在の"
"バッファのマークリングを使用します。特に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>は常に同じバッファ内に留まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mark_002dring_002dmax\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mark_002dring_002dmax\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">mark-ring-max</code> specifies the maximum "
"number of entries to keep in the mark ring.  This defaults to 16 entries.  "
"If that many entries exist and another one is pushed, the earliest one in "
"the list is discarded.  Repeating <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> cycles through the positions currently in the "
"ring."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">mark-ring-max</code> は、マークリングに保持するエン"
"トリの最大数を指定します。デフォルトは16エントリです。これだけの数のエントリ"
"が存在し、さらに別のエントリがプッシュされると、リストの中で最も古いエントリ"
"が破棄されます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> "
"を繰り返すと、現在リング内にある位置を順に巡回します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark-Ring.html
msgid ""
"If you want to move back to the same place over and over, the mark ring may "
"not be convenient enough.  If so, you can record the position in a register "
"for later retrieval (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Position-"
"Registers.html\">Saving Positions in Registers</a>)."
msgstr ""
"同じ場所に何度も戻りたい場合、マークリングでは不便かもしれません。その場合"
"は、後で参照できるようにレジスタに位置を記録しておくことができます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Position-Registers.html\">レジスタへの位置の保存</a>を"
"参照）。"

