#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h2>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark.html
msgid ""
"<span>13 The Mark and the Region<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-Mark-"
"and-the-Region\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>13 しるしと地方<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-Mark-and-the-"
"Region\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mark\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-setting-a-mark\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"region\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mark\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-setting-a-mark\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"region\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark.html
msgid ""
"Emacs, like many other applications, lets you select some arbitrary part of "
"the buffer text and invoke commands that operate on such <em "
"class=\"dfn\">selected text</em>.  In Emacs, we call the selected text <em "
"class=\"dfn\">the region</em>; its handling is very similar to that of "
"selected text in other programs, but there are also important differences."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、他の多くのアプリケーションと同様に、バッファテキストの任意の部分を"
"選択し、その<em class=\"dfn\">選択テキスト</em>に対して動作するコマンドを実行"
"できます。Emacsでは、選択テキストのことを<em class=\"dfn\">リージョン</em>と"
"呼びます。その扱いは他のプログラムにおける選択テキストと非常に似ていますが、"
"重要な相違点もあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-active-region\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-activating-the-mark\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-active-region\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-activating-the-mark\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark.html
msgid ""
"The region is the portion of the buffer between <em class=\"dfn\">the mark</"
"em> and the current <em class=\"dfn\">point</em>.  You define a region by "
"setting the mark somewhere (with, for instance, the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"SPC</kbd> command), and then moving point to where you want the region to "
"end.  (Or you can use the mouse to define a region.)"
msgstr ""
"リージョンとは、<em class=\"dfn\">マーク</em>と現在の<em class=\"dfn\">ポイン"
"ト</em>の間にあるバッファの領域のことです。マークを任意の場所に設定し（例え"
"ば <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-SPC</kbd> コマンドを使用）、次にポイントをリージョン"
"の終了位置に移動させることで、リージョンを定義します。（あるいは、マウスを"
"使ってリージョンを定義することもできます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark.html
msgid ""
"The region always extends between point and the mark, no matter which of "
"them comes earlier in the text; each time you move point, the region changes."
msgstr ""
"テキスト内でどちらが先に来ても、領域は常にポイントとマークの間に広がります。"
"ポイントを移動させるたびに、領域も変化します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark.html
msgid ""
"Setting the mark at a position in the text <em class=\"dfn\">activates</em> "
"it.  When the mark is active, we say also that the region is active; Emacs "
"indicates its extent by highlighting the text within it, using the <code "
"class=\"code\">region</code> face (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Face-"
"Customization.html\">Customizing Faces</a>)."
msgstr ""
"マークをテキスト内のある位置に設定すると、その位置が<em class=\"dfn\">アク"
"ティブ</em>になります。マークがアクティブな状態を、リージョンがアクティブであ"
"るとも言います。Emacsは、<code class=\"code\">region</code>フェイスを用いて"
"リージョン内のテキストをハイライトすることで、その範囲を示します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Face-Customization.html\">フェイスのカスタマイズ</a>を"
"参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mark.html
