#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Marking-Objects.html
msgid ""
"Here are commands for placing point and the mark around a textual object "
"such as a word, list, paragraph or page:"
msgstr ""
"単語、リスト、段落、ページなどのテキストオブジェクトの周囲に点やマークを配置"
"するためのコマンドは以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Marking-Objects.html build/html/emacs/Words.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-@</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-@</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Marking-Objects.html
msgid ""
"Set mark at the end of the next word (<code class=\"code\">mark-word</"
"code>).  This does not move point."
msgstr ""
"次の単語の末尾にマークを設定します (<code class=\"code\">mark-word</code>)。"
"これによりポイントは移動しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Marking-Objects.html
msgid ""
"Set mark after end of following balanced expression (<code "
"class=\"code\">mark-sexp</code>).  This does not move point."
msgstr ""
"後続のバランス式 (<code class=\"code\">mark-sexp</code>) の末尾の後にマークを"
"設定します。これによりポイントは移動しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Marking-Objects.html build/html/emacs/Paragraphs.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-h</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-h</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Marking-Objects.html
msgid ""
"Move point to the beginning of the current paragraph, and set mark at the "
"end (<code class=\"code\">mark-paragraph</code>)."
msgstr ""
"ポイントを現在の段落の先頭に移動し、末尾にマークを設定する (<code "
"class=\"code\">mark-paragraph</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Marking-Objects.html build/html/emacs/Moving-by-Defuns.html
#: build/html/emacs/Other-C-Commands.html
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Make-Summary.html
