# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Matching.html
msgid ""
"By default, this mode is switched on in all buffers that are meant for "
"editing, but is not enabled in buffers that show data.  This is controlled "
"by the <code class=\"code\">show-paren-predicate</code> user option."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、このモードは編集用のすべてのバッファで有効になっていますが、"
"データを表示するバッファでは有効になりません。これはユーザーオプション <code "
"class=\"code\">show-paren-predicate</code> で制御されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Matching.html
msgid ""
"To customize the mode, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;customize-group&nbsp;"
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>&nbsp;paren-showing</kbd>.  The customizable "
"options which control the operation of this mode include:"
msgstr ""
"モードをカスタマイズするには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;customize-"
"group&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>&nbsp;paren-showing</kbd>と入力してく"
"ださい。このモードの動作を制御するカスタマイズ可能なオプションには、以下が含"
"まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Matching.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"show_002dparen_002dhighlight_002dopenparen\"></a> <code class=\"code\">show-"
"paren-highlight-openparen</code> controls whether to highlight an open paren "
"when point is just before it, and hence its position is marked by the cursor "
"anyway.  The default is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> (yes)."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"show_002dparen_002dhighlight_002dopenparen\"></a> <code class=\"code\">show-"
"paren-highlight-openparen</code> は、ポイントが開き括弧の直前にある場合にその"
"括弧をハイライトするかどうかを制御します。これにより、いずれにせよその位置が"
"カーソルで示されます。デフォルトは non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> (yes) "
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Matching.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-show_002dparen_002dstyle\"></a> <code "
"class=\"code\">show-paren-style</code> controls whether just the two parens, "
"or also the text between them get highlighted.  The valid options here are "
"<code class=\"code\">parenthesis</code> (show the matching paren), <code "
"class=\"code\">expression</code> (highlight the entire expression enclosed "
"by the parens), and <code class=\"code\">mixed</code> (highlight the "
"matching paren if it is visible in the window, the expression otherwise)."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-show_002dparen_002dstyle\"></a> <code "
"class=\"code\">show-paren-style</code> は、2つの括弧のみを強調表示するか、あ"
"るいはその間のテキストも含めて強調表示するかを制御します。ここで指定可能なオ"
"プションは、<code class=\"code\">parenthesis</code>（対応する括弧を表示）、"
"<code class=\"code\">expression</code>（括弧で囲まれた式全体を強調表示）、お"
"よび <code class=\"code\">mixed</code>（ウィンドウ内に表示されている場合は対"
"応する括弧を、そうでない場合は式を強調表示）です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Matching.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"show_002dparen_002dwhen_002dpoint_002dinside_002dparen\"></a> <code "
"class=\"code\">show-paren-when-point-inside-paren</code>, when non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, causes highlighting also when point is inside of "
"the parentheses.  The default is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"show_002dparen_002dwhen_002dpoint_002dinside_002dparen\"></a> <code "
"class=\"code\">show-paren-when-point-inside-paren</code> で非<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、point が括弧内にあるときにもハイライトされ"
"ます。デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Matching.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"show_002dparen_002dwhen_002dpoint_002din_002dperiphery\"></a> <code "
"class=\"code\">show-paren-when-point-in-periphery</code>, when non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, causes highlighting also when point is in "
"whitespace at the beginning of a line and there is a paren at the first or "
