# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mayan-Calendar.html
msgid ""
"To understand these commands, you need to understand the Mayan calendars.  "
"The <em class=\"dfn\">long count</em> is a counting of days with these units:"
msgstr ""
"これらの命令を理解するには、マヤ暦について知る必要があります。<em "
"class=\"dfn\">ロングカウント</em>とは、以下の単位を用いて日数を数えるもので"
"す："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Mayan-Calendar.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1 kin = 1 day&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1 uinal = 20 kin&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1 tun = 18 uinal\n"
"1 katun = 20 tun&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1 baktun = 20 katun\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mayan-Calendar.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-g-m-_0028Calendar-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dmayan_002dgoto_002dlong_002dcount_002ddate\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-g-m-_0028Calendar-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dmayan_002dgoto_002dlong_002dcount_002ddate\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mayan-Calendar.html
msgid ""
"Thus, the long count date 12.16.11.16.6 means 12 baktun, 16 katun, 11 tun, "
"16 uinal, and 6 kin.  The Emacs calendar can handle Mayan long count dates "
"as early as 7.17.18.13.3, but no earlier.  When you use the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">g m l</kbd> command, type the Mayan long count date with the "
"baktun, katun, tun, uinal, and kin separated by periods."
msgstr ""
"したがって、ロングカウントの日付 12.16.11.16.6 は、12 baktun、16 katun、11 "
"tun、16 uinal、6 kin を意味します。Emacsのカレンダーでは、早ければ "
"7.17.18.13.3 までのマヤ・ロングカウント日付を扱うことができますが、それ以前の"
"ものは扱えません。<kbd class=\"kbd\">g m l</kbd> コマンドを使用する際は、"
"baktun、katun、tun、uinal、kin をピリオドで区切ってマヤ・ロングカウント日付を"
"入力してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mayan-Calendar.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dmayan_002dprevious_002dtzolkin_002ddate\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dmayan_002dnext_002dtzolkin_002ddate\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Mayan-tzolkin-calendar\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dmayan_002dprevious_002dtzolkin_002ddate\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dmayan_002dnext_002dtzolkin_002ddate\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Mayan-tzolkin-calendar\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mayan-Calendar.html
msgid ""
"The Mayan tzolkin calendar is a cycle of 260 days formed by a pair of "
"independent cycles of 13 and 20 days.  Since this cycle repeats endlessly, "
"Emacs provides commands to move backward and forward to the previous or next "
"point in the cycle.  Type <kbd class=\"kbd\">g m p t</kbd> to go to the "
"previous tzolkin date; Emacs asks you for a tzolkin date and moves point to "
"the previous occurrence of that date.  Similarly, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">g "
"m n t</kbd> to go to the next occurrence of a tzolkin date."
msgstr ""
"マヤのツォルキン暦は、13日と20日の独立した2つのサイクルからなる260日の周期で"
"す。この周期は無限に繰り返されるため、Emacsでは周期内の直前または次の時点へ前"
"後に移動するためのコマンドが用意されています。<kbd class=\"kbd\">g m p t</"
"kbd> と入力すると直前のツォルキン日付に移動します。Emacsはツォルキン日付の入"
"力を求め、その日付が前回現れた時点へポイントを移動させます。同様に、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">g m n t</kbd> と入力すると次のツォルキン日付の出現時点へ移動し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mayan-Calendar.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dmayan_002dprevious_002dhaab_002ddate\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dmayan_002dnext_002dhaab_002ddate\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Mayan-haab-calendar\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dmayan_002dprevious_002dhaab_002ddate\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dmayan_002dnext_002dhaab_002ddate\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Mayan-haab-calendar\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mayan-Calendar.html
msgid ""
"The Mayan haab calendar is a cycle of 365 days arranged as 18 months of 20 "
"days each, followed by a 5-day monthless period.  Like the tzolkin cycle, "
"this cycle repeats endlessly, and there are commands to move backward and "
"forward to the previous or next point in the cycle.  Type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">g m p h</kbd> to go to the previous haab date; Emacs asks you "
"for a haab date and moves point to the previous occurrence of that date.  "
"Similarly, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">g m n h</kbd> to go to the next "
"occurrence of a haab date."
msgstr ""
"マヤのハアブ暦は、20日ずつの18か月と、その後に続く5日間の月なし期間からなる"
"365日の周期です。ツォルキン周期と同様に、この周期は無限に繰り返され、周期内の"
"前の時点や次の時点へ前後に移動するためのコマンドが用意されています。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">g m p h</kbd> と入力すると前のハアブ日付に移動します。Emacsがハ"
"アブ日付の入力を求め、その日付の直前の出現箇所にポイントを移動させます。同様"
"に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">g m n h</kbd> と入力するとハアブ日付の次の出現箇所に移"
"動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mayan-Calendar.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dmayan_002dnext_002dcalendar_002dround_002ddate\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Mayan-calendar-round\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dmayan_002dnext_002dcalendar_002dround_002ddate\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Mayan-calendar-round\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mayan-Calendar.html
msgid ""
"The Maya also used the combination of the tzolkin date and the haab date.  "
"This combination is a cycle of about 52 years called a <em "
"class=\"emph\">calendar round</em>.  If you type <kbd class=\"kbd\">g m p c</"
"kbd>, Emacs asks you for both a haab and a tzolkin date and then moves point "
"to the previous occurrence of that combination.  Use <kbd class=\"kbd\">g m "
"n c</kbd> to move point to the next occurrence of a combination.  These "
"commands signal an error if the haab/tzolkin date combination you have typed "
"is impossible."
msgstr ""
"マヤ人はまた、ツォルキン暦の日付とハアブ暦の日付を組み合わせて使用していまし"
"た。この組み合わせは約52年の周期となり、<em class=\"emph\">カレンダーラウンド"
"</em>と呼ばれます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">g m p c</kbd> と入力すると、Emacsはハア"
"ブ暦とツォルキン暦の両方の日付を要求し、その後、その組み合わせが前回出現した"
"箇所にポイントを移動させます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">g m n c</kbd> を使用すると、"
"次の出現箇所にポイントを移動できます。入力したハアブ暦とツォルキン暦の日付の"
"組み合わせがあり得ない場合、これらのコマンドはエラーを通知します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mayan-Calendar.html
msgid ""
"Emacs uses strict completion (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion-"
"Exit.html\">Completion Exit</a>)  whenever it asks you to type a Mayan name, "
"so you don&rsquo;t have to worry about spelling."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、マヤの名前の入力を求められるたびに厳密な補完（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Completion-Exit.html\">Completion Exit</a>を参照）が行われるため、綴り"
"を気にする必要はありません。"

