#: build/html/emacs/Memory-Full.html
msgid ""
"<span>53.4 Running out of Memory<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Running-"
"out-of-Memory\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>53.4 メモリ不足<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Running-out-of-"
"Memory\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Memory-Full.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-memory-full\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-out-of-memory\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-memory-full\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-out-of-memory\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Memory-Full.html
msgid ""
"If you get the error message &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Virtual memory "
"exceeded</samp>&rsquo;, save your modified buffers with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">save-some-buffers</code>).  This method of "
"saving them has the smallest need for additional memory.  Emacs keeps a "
"reserve of memory which it makes available when this error happens; that "
"should be enough to enable <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x s</kbd> to complete its "
"work.  When the reserve has been used, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">!MEM FULL!"
"</samp>&rsquo; appears at the beginning of the mode line, indicating there "
"is no more reserve."
msgstr ""
"エラーメッセージ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Virtual memory exceeded</"
"samp>&rsquo; が表示された場合は、変更したバッファを <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">save-some-buffers</code>) として保存してくださ"
"い。この保存方法は、追加メモリの必要量が最も少なくて済みます。Emacs はこのエ"
"ラーが発生した際に利用できるよう、メモリの予備を確保しており、それで <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x s</kbd> が処理を完了させるのに十分なはずです。予備を使い切"
"ると、モードラインの先頭に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">!MEM FULL!</"
"samp>&rsquo; が表示され、予備がもうないことを示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Memory-Full.html
msgid ""
"Once you have saved your modified buffers, you can exit this Emacs session "
"and start another, or you can use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x kill-some-buffers</"
"kbd> to free space in the current Emacs job.  If this frees up sufficient "
"space, Emacs will refill its memory reserve, and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">!MEM FULL!</samp>&rsquo; will disappear from the mode line.  "
"That means you can safely go on editing in the same Emacs session."
msgstr ""
"変更したバッファを保存したら、このEmacsセッションを終了して別のセッションを開"
"始するか、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x kill-some-buffers</kbd> を使用して現在の"
"Emacsジョブの空き領域を確保できます。これで十分な空き領域が確保されると、"
"Emacsはメモリリザーブを再充填し、モードラインから &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">!MEM FULL!</samp>&rsquo; が消えます。これにより、同じEmacsセッ"
"ション内で引き続き安全に編集を行うことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Memory-Full.html
msgid ""
"Do not use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x buffer-menu</kbd> to save or kill buffers "
"when you run out of memory, because the Buffer Menu needs a fair amount of "
"memory itself, and the reserve supply may not be enough."
msgstr ""
"メモリ不足時にバッファを保存または破棄する目的で <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"buffer-menu</kbd> を使用しないでください。バッファメニュー自体にかなりのメモ"
"リが必要であり、予備のメモリでは不足する可能性があるためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Memory-Full.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-out-of-memory-killer_002c-"
"GNU_002fLinux\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-OOM-killer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-out-of-memory-killer_002c-"
"GNU_002fLinux\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-OOM-killer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Memory-Full.html
msgid ""
"On GNU/Linux systems, Emacs does not normally get notified about out-of-"
"memory situations; instead, the OS can kill the Emacs process when it runs "
"out of memory.  This feature is known as the <em class=\"dfn\">out-of-memory "
"killer</em>, or <em class=\"dfn\"><abbr class=\"acronym\">OOM</abbr> killer</"
"em>.  When this behavior is in effect, Emacs is unable to detect the out-of-"
"memory situation in time, and won&rsquo;t be able to let you save your "
"buffer as described above.  However, it is possible to turn off this "
"behavior of the OS, and thus allow Emacs a chance to handle the out-of-"
"memory situation in a more useful manner, before it is killed.  To do that, "
"become the super user, edit the file <code class=\"code\">/etc/sysctl.conf</"
"code> to contain the lines shown below, and then invoke the command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">sysctl&nbsp;-p</kbd> from the shell prompt:"
msgstr ""
"GNU/Linuxシステムでは、通常、Emacsはメモリ不足の状態を通知されません。その代"
"わりに、メモリが不足するとOSがEmacsプロセスを強制終了させることがあります。こ"
"の機能は<em class=\"dfn\">out-of-memory killer</em>、または<em "
"class=\"dfn\"><abbr class=\"acronym\">OOM</abbr> killer</em>として知られてい"
"ます。この動作が有効になっている場合、Emacsはメモリ不足の状態を適時に検知でき"
"ず、前述のようにバッファを保存することができなくなります。しかし、OSのこの動"
"作を無効にすることで、Emacsが強制終了される前に、より有用な方法でメモリ不足に"
"対処する機会を与えることができます。そのためには、スーパーユーザーになり、"
"ファイル <code class=\"code\">/etc/sysctl.conf</code> を編集して以下に示す行"
"を記述し、シェルプロンプトからコマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">sysctl&nbsp;-p</"
"kbd> を実行してください："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Memory-Full.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"vm.overcommit_memory=2\n"
"vm.overcommit_ratio=0\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Memory-Full.html
msgid ""
"Please note that the above setting affects all the processes on the system, "
"and in general the behavior of the system under memory pressure, not just "
"the Emacs process alone."
msgstr ""
"なお、上記の設定はシステム上のすべてのプロセスに影響し、一般的にはEmacsプロセ"
"ス単体ではなく、メモリ負荷下におけるシステム全体の挙動に影響を及ぼす点にご留"
"意ください。"

