#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Merge-Bases.html
msgid ""
"Report diffs of changes on a branch since it diverged from another (<code "
"class=\"code\">vc-diff-mergebase</code>)."
msgstr ""
"あるブランチが別のブランチから分岐して以降の変更差分を報告します (<code "
"class=\"code\">vc-diff-mergebase</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
