msgid ""
"<span>10.2 Minibuffers for File Names<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Minibuffers-for-File-Names\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>10.2 ファイル名用ミニバッファ<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Minibuffers-for-File-Names\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Minibuffer-File.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-default-directory\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-default-directory\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Minibuffer-File.html
msgid ""
"Commands such as <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">find-"
"file</code>) use the minibuffer to read a file name argument (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-Files.html\">Files</a>).  When the minibuffer "
"is used to read a file name, it typically starts out with some initial text "
"ending in a slash.  This is the <em class=\"dfn\">default directory</em>.  "
"For example, it may start out like this:"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">find-file</code>) など"
"のコマンドでは、ミニバッファを使用してファイル名引数を読み込みます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Basic-Files.html\">ファイル</a>を参照）。ミニバッファ"
"でファイル名を読み込む際、通常はスラッシュで終わる初期テキストが表示されま"
"す。これが<em class=\"dfn\">デフォルトディレクトリ</em>です。例えば、次のよう"
"に始まることがあります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Minibuffer-File.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find file: /u2/emacs/src/\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Minibuffer-File.html
msgid ""
"Here, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Find file: </samp>&rsquo; is the prompt "
"and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/u2/emacs/src/</samp>&rsquo; is the default "
"directory.  If you now type <kbd class=\"kbd\">buffer.c</kbd> as input, that "
"specifies the file <samp class=\"file\">/u2/emacs/src/buffer.c</samp>.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"File-Names.html\">File Names</a>, for information "
"about the default directory."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Find file: </samp>&rsquo;がプロンプト、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">/u2/emacs/src/</samp>&rsquo;がデフォルトディレク"
"トリです。ここで入力として<kbd class=\"kbd\">buffer.c</kbd>と入力すると、ファ"
"イル<samp class=\"file\">/u2/emacs/src/buffer.c</samp>が指定されます。デフォ"
"ルトディレクトリに関する情報については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"File-"
"Names.html\">ファイル名</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Minibuffer-File.html
msgid ""
"Alternative defaults for the file name you may want are available by typing "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd>, see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Minibuffer-"
"History.html\">Minibuffer History</a>."
msgstr ""
"ファイル名の代替デフォルト値は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> と入力することで"
"指定可能です。詳細は <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Minibuffer-History.html\">ミニ"
"バッファ履歴</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Minibuffer-File.html
msgid ""
"You can specify a file in the parent directory with <samp class=\"file\">..</"
"samp>: <samp class=\"file\">/a/b/../foo.el</samp> is equivalent to <samp "
"class=\"file\">/a/foo.el</samp>.  Alternatively, you can use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd></kbd> to kill directory names "
