#: build/html/emacs/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid ""
"While in the minibuffer, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-p</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">previous-history-element</code>)  moves through the "
"minibuffer history list, one item at a time.  Each <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-p</"
"kbd> fetches an earlier item from the history list into the minibuffer, "
"replacing its existing contents.  Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">next-history-element</code>) moves through the minibuffer "
"history list in the opposite direction, fetching later entries into the "
"minibuffer."
msgstr ""
"ミニバッファ内では、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-p</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">previous-history-element</code>) によってミニバッファの履歴リ"
"ストを1項目ずつ辿ることができます。各 <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-p</kbd> は、履歴リ"
"ストからより前の項目をミニバッファに取得し、既存の内容を上書きします。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">next-history-element</code>) を"
"入力すると、ミニバッファの履歴リストを逆方向に辿り、より後のエントリをミニ"
"バッファに取得します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
