#: build/html/emacs/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-future-history\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-future-history\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid ""
"If you type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> in the minibuffer when there are no "
"later entries in the minibuffer history (e.g., if you haven&rsquo;t "
"previously typed <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-p</kbd>), Emacs tries fetching from a "
"list of default arguments: values that you are likely to enter.  You can "
"think of this as moving through the <em class=\"dfn\">future history</em>.  "
"Searching forward through minibuffer history (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Isearch-Minibuffer.html\">Searching the Minibuffer</a>) includes the "
"&ldquo;future history&rdquo; as well."
msgstr ""
"ミニバッファ履歴に後続のエントリがない場合（例えば、以前に <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-p</kbd> と入力していない場合など）、ミニバッファに <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> と入力すると、Emacs はデフォルト引数のリスト（入力す"
"る可能性が高い値）から取得を試みます。これは、<em class=\"dfn\">将来の履歴</"
"em> を辿っていると考えることができます。ミニバッファ履歴を前方に検索する操作"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Isearch-Minibuffer.html\">ミニバッファの検索</a> "
"を参照）には、この「将来の履歴」も含まれます。"

