# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid ""
"The arrow keys <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> work like <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-p</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd>, but if the current "
"history item is longer than a single line, they allow you to move to the "
"previous or next line of the current history item before going to the "
"previous or next history item."
msgstr ""
"矢印キー <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd> と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> は <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-p</"
"kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> と同様に動作しますが、現在の履歴項目が1"
"行より長い場合は、前後の履歴項目へ移動する前に、現在の履歴項目の直前または直"
"後の行へ移動することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid ""
"If you edit the text inserted by the <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-p</kbd> or <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> minibuffer history commands, this does not change "
"its entry in the history list.  However, the edited argument does go at the "
"end of the history list when you submit it."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-p</kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> のミニバッ"
"ファ履歴コマンドで挿入されたテキストを編集しても、履歴リスト内のエントリは変"
"更されません。ただし、編集した引数を送信すると、履歴リストの末尾に追加されま"
"す。"

