"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-history_002ddelete_002dduplicates\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Minibuffer-History.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">history-delete-duplicates</code> specifies "
"whether to delete duplicates in history.  If it is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, adding a new element deletes from the list all "
"other elements that are equal to it.  The default is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">history-delete-duplicates</code> は、履歴内の重複を"
"削除するかどうかを指定します。値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場"
"合、新しい要素を追加すると、リスト内のそれと等しい他のすべての要素が削除され"
"ます。デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

