# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Misc-Dired-Features.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002dfree_002dspace\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002dfree_002dspace\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Misc-Dired-Features.html
msgid ""
"By default, Dired displays the available space on the directory&rsquo;s disk "
"on the first line of that directory&rsquo;s listing, following the directory "
"name.  You can control this display by customizing the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-free-space</code>.  Its default value is <code "
"class=\"code\">first</code>, which produces the available space after the "
"directory name.  If you customize it to the value <code "
"class=\"code\">separate</code> instead, Dired will display the disk space "
"information on a separate line, following the line with the directory name, "
"and will include in that line the space used by the files in the current "
"directory as well as the available disk space.  If you set this to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the available disk space information will not be "
"displayed at all."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、Diredはディレクトリ一覧の1行目、ディレクトリ名の後に、その"
"ディレクトリが配置されているディスクの空き容量を表示します。変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-free-space</code> をカスタマイズすることで、この表示を制"
"御できます。デフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">first</code> で、この場合は"
"ディレクトリ名の後に空き容量が表示されます。代わりに <code "
"class=\"code\">separate</code> にカスタマイズすると、Diredはディレクトリ名の"
"行の後に、ディスク容量情報を別行で表示し、その行に現在のディレクトリ内のファ"
"イルが使用している容量とディスクの空き容量の両方を記載します。これを <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定すると、ディスクの空き容量情報は一切表示され"
"なくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Misc-Dired-Features.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002dcheck_002dsymlinks\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002dcheck_002dsymlinks\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Misc-Dired-Features.html
msgid ""
"Dired fontifies the items in the Dired buffer.  If the <code "
"class=\"code\">default-directory</code> of that buffer is remote, this might "
"be expensive for symbolic links, because their <code class=\"code\">file-"
"truename</code> needs to be accessed.  To avoid slowdown in Dired due to "
"this, set user option <code class=\"code\">dired-check-symlinks</code> to "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> for remote directories which suffer from a "
"slow connection.  It can be declared as connection-local variable to match "
"how a remote system is connectable (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Connection-"
"Variables.html\">Per-Connection Local Variables</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Diredはバッファ内の項目をフォント表示します。バッファの<code "
"class=\"code\">default-directory</code>がリモートである場合、シンボリックリン"
"クの<code class=\"code\">file-truename</code>にアクセスする必要があるため、処"
"理負荷が高くなる可能性があります。これによるDiredの動作低下を防ぐため、接続速"
"度が遅いリモートディレクトリについては、ユーザーオプション<code "
"class=\"code\">dired-check-symlinks</code>を<code class=\"code\">nil</code>に"
"設定してください。これは、リモートシステムが接続可能である仕組みに合わせて、"
"connection-local変数として宣言できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Connection-"
"Variables.html\">接続ごとのローカル変数</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Misc-Dired-Features.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_002b-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002dcreate_002ddirectory\"></a>"
msgstr ""
