"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002dcreate_002ddirectory\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Misc-Dired-Features.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">+</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">dired-create-"
"directory</code>) reads a directory&rsquo;s name, and creates that "
"directory.  It signals an error if the directory already exists."
