# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Misc-Help.html
msgid ""
"Each Emacs major mode typically redefines a few keys and makes other changes "
"in how editing works.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h m</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">describe-mode</code>)  displays documentation on the current "
"major mode, which normally describes the commands and features that are "
"changed in this mode, and also its key bindings."
msgstr ""
"各Emacsメジャーモードでは通常、いくつかのキーが再定義され、編集動作にその他の"
"変更が加えられます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h m</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">describe-mode</code>) は現在のメジャーモードに関するドキュメン"
"トを表示します。通常、そこにはそのモードで変更されるコマンドや機能、および"
"キーバインドが記載されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
