# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Misc-Help.html
msgid ""
"You can get a list of subcommands for a particular prefix key by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">?</kbd>, or <kbd "
"class=\"key\">F1</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-prefix-bindings</"
"code>) after the prefix key.  (There are a few prefix keys for which not all "
"of these keys work&mdash;those that provide their own bindings for that "
"key.  One of these prefix keys is <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>, because <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> C-h</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> ?</kbd> are actually <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-h</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">mark-defun</code>) and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-?</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">xref-find-references</code>), "
"respectively.  However, <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>&nbsp;"
"<kbd class=\"key\">F1</kbd></kbd> works fine.)"
msgstr ""
"特定のプレフィックスキーのサブコマンド一覧は、プレフィックスキーの後に <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">?</kbd>、または <kbd "
"class=\"key\">F1</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-prefix-bindings</"
"code>) と入力することで取得できます。（これらのキーがすべて機能しないプレ"
"フィックスキーがいくつかあります。具体的には、そのキーに対して独自のバイン"
"ディングを提供しているものです。その一つが <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> で、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> C-h</kbd> と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> ?</kbd> は実際にはそれぞれ <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-h</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">mark-defun</code>) と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-?</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">xref-find-references</code>) で"
"あるためです。ただし、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>&nbsp;"
"<kbd class=\"key\">F1</kbd></kbd> は問題なく動作します。）"

