# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mode-Line-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"You can use mouse clicks on window mode lines to select and manipulate "
"windows."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウモードの線をマウスでクリックすることで、ウィンドウの選択や操作が可"
"能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mode-Line-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"Some areas of the mode line, such as the buffer name, and major and minor "
"mode names, have their own special mouse bindings.  These areas are "
"highlighted when you hold the mouse over them, and information about the "
"special bindings will be displayed (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Tooltips.html\">Tooltips</a>).  This section&rsquo;s commands do not "
"apply in those areas."
msgstr ""
"モードラインの一部（バッファ名やメジャー・マイナーモード名など）には、独自の"
"特別なマウスバインドが設定されています。これらの領域にマウスカーソルを合わせ"
"るとハイライト表示され、特別なバインドに関する情報が表示されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Tooltips.html\">ツールチップ</a>を参照）。本セクション"
"のコマンドは、これらの領域には適用されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mode-Line-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-mouse_002d1-_0028mode-line_0029\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002d1-_0028mode-line_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-mouse_002d1-_0028mode-line_0029\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002d1-_0028mode-line_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mode-Line-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> on a mode line selects the window it "
"belongs to.  By dragging <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> on the mode line, "
"you can move it, thus changing the height of the windows above and below.  "
"Changing heights with the mouse in this way never deletes windows, it just "
"refuses to make any window smaller than the minimum height."
msgstr ""
"モードライン上の <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> は、それが属するウィンドウ"
"を選択します。モードライン上の <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> をドラッグし"
"て移動させると、上下にあるウィンドウの高さが変更されます。このようにマウスで"
"高さを変更してもウィンドウが削除されることはなく、単にどのウィンドウも最小高"
"さより小さくなることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mode-Line-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-mouse_002d2-_0028mode-line_0029\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002d2-_0028mode-line_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-mouse_002d2-_0028mode-line_0029\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002d2-_0028mode-line_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mode-Line-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> on a mode line expands that window to fill "
"its frame."
msgstr ""
"モードライン上の <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> は、そのウィンドウをフレー"
"ムいっぱいに拡大します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mode-Line-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-mouse_002d3-_0028mode-line_0029\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002d3-_0028mode-line_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-mouse_002d3-_0028mode-line_0029\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002d3-_0028mode-line_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mode-Line-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> on a mode line deletes the window it "
"belongs to.  If the frame has only one window, it does nothing."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> モードライン上では、それが属するウィンドウが"
"削除されます。フレームにウィンドウが1つしかない場合は、何も行われません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mode-Line-Mouse.html build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-mouse-2</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-mouse-2</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mode-Line-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-mouse-2</kbd> on a mode line splits that window, "
"producing two side-by-side windows with the boundary running through the "
"click position (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Split-Window.html\">Splitting "
"Windows</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-mouse-2</kbd> モードライン上でそのウィンドウを分割し、ク"
"リック位置を境界として2つのウィンドウを左右に並べて表示します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Split-Window.html\">ウィンドウの分割</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mode-Line-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002d1-_0028scroll-bar_0029\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002d1-_0028scroll-bar_0029\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mode-Line-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"Furthermore, by clicking and dragging <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> on "
"the divider between two side-by-side mode lines, you can move the vertical "
"boundary to the left or right."
msgstr ""
"さらに、左右に並んだ2本のモードラインの区切り線にある <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> をクリックしてドラッグすると、垂直方向の境界を左"
"右に移動できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mode-Line-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"Note that resizing windows is affected by the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">window-resize-pixelwise</code>, see <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Split-Window.html\">Splitting Windows</a>."
msgstr ""
"なお、ウィンドウのサイズ変更は <code class=\"code\">window-resize-pixelwise</"
"code> の値の影響を受けます。<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Split-Window.html\">ウィ"
"ンドウの分割</a> を参照してください。"

