# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Modifying-Fontsets.html
msgid ""
"Fontsets do not always have to be created from scratch.  If only minor "
"changes are required it may be easier to modify an existing fontset, usually "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">fontset-default</samp>&rsquo;.  Modifying &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">fontset-default</samp>&rsquo; will also affect other "
"fontsets that use it as a fallback, so can be an effective way of fixing "
"problems with the fonts that Emacs chooses for a particular script."
msgstr ""
"フォントセットを必ずしも一から作成する必要はありません。軽微な変更で済む場合"
"は、既存のフォントセット（通常は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">fontset-"
"default</samp>&rsquo;）を修正する方が簡単かもしれません。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">fontset-default</samp>&rsquo; を修正すると、それをフォールバッ"
"クとして使用している他のフォントセットにも影響が及ぶため、特定のスクリプトに"
"対して Emacs が選択するフォントの問題を解決する有効な手段となり得ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Modifying-Fontsets.html
msgid ""
"Fontsets can be modified using the function <code class=\"code\">set-fontset-"
"font</code>, specifying a character, a charset, a script, or a range of "
"characters to modify the font for, and a font specification for the font to "
"be used.  Some examples are:"
msgstr ""
"フォントセットは、関数 <code class=\"code\">set-fontset-font</code> を使用し"
"て変更できます。この関数では、フォントを変更する対象の文字、文字セット、スク"
"リプト、または文字範囲と、使用するフォントの指定を行います。具体例は以下の通"
"りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Modifying-Fontsets.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; Prefer a big5 font for han characters.\n"
"(set-fontset-font &quot;fontset-default&quot;\n"
"                  'han (font-spec :registry &quot;big5&quot;)\n"
"                  nil 'prepend)\n"
"\n"
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-emoji-font\"></a>;; Use &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot; for the emoji script (this is the default).\n"
"(set-fontset-font &quot;fontset-default&quot; 'emoji\n"
"                  '(&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot; . &quot;iso10646-1&quot;)\n"
"                  nil 'prepend)\n"
"\n"
";; Display the &quot;heart&quot; character using a color font.\n"
"(set-fontset-font &quot;fontset-default&quot;\n"
"                  #x2764 &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;)\n"
"\n"
";; Use MyPrivateFont for the Unicode private use area.\n"
"(set-fontset-font &quot;fontset-default&quot;  '(#xe000 . #xf8ff)\n"
"                  &quot;MyPrivateFont&quot;)\n"
"\n"
";; Use Liberation Mono for latin-3 charset.\n"
"(set-fontset-font &quot;fontset-default&quot; 'iso-8859-3\n"
"                  &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;)\n"
"\n"
";; Use DejaVu Sans Mono as a fallback in fontset-startup\n"
";; before resorting to fontset-default.\n"
"(set-fontset-font &quot;fontset-startup&quot; nil &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;\n"
"                  nil 'append)\n"
msgstr ""

