msgstr ""
"<span>D.4 モチーフメニュー X リソース<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Motif-Menu-X-Resources\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Menu-X-Resources-_0028Motif-"
"widgets_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Motif-Widget-X-"
"Resources\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Menu-X-Resources-_0028Motif-"
"widgets_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Motif-Widget-X-"
"Resources\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid ""
"If Emacs is compiled with the X toolkit support using Motif or LessTif "
"widgets, you can use X resources to customize the appearance of the menu bar "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Menu-Bar.html\">The Menu Bar</a>), pop-up "
"menus, and dialog boxes (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Dialog-"
"Boxes.html\">Using Dialog Boxes</a>).  However, the resources are organized "
"differently from Lucid widgets."
msgstr ""
"EmacsをMotifまたはLessTifウィジェットを用いてXツールキットサポート付きでコン"
"パイルした場合、Xリソースを使用してメニューバー（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Menu-Bar.html\">メニューバー</a>を参照）、ポップアップメニュー、および"
"ダイアログボックス（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Dialog-Boxes.html\">ダイアログ"
"ボックスの使用</a>を参照）の外観をカスタマイズできます。ただし、リソースの構"
"成はLucidウィジェットとは異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid ""
"The resource names for the menu bar are in the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">pane.menubar</samp>&rsquo; class, and they must be specified "
"in this form:"
msgstr ""
"メニューバーのリソース名は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">pane.menubar</"
"samp>&rsquo; クラスに属しており、以下の形式で指定する必要があります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Emacs.pane.menubar.<var class=\"var\">subwidget</var>.<var class=\"var\">resource</var>: <var class=\"var\">value</var>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid ""
"For pop-up menus, the resources are in the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">menu*</samp>&rsquo; class, instead of &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">pane.menubar</samp>&rsquo;.  For dialog boxes, they are in "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">dialog</samp>&rsquo;.  In each case, each "
"individual menu string is a subwidget; the subwidget&rsquo;s name is the "
"same as the menu item string.  For example, the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">File</samp>&rsquo; menu in the menu bar is a subwidget named "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">emacs.pane.menubar.File</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"ポップアップメニューの場合、リソースは &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">pane.menubar</samp>&rsquo; ではなく &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">menu*</samp>&rsquo; クラスに配置されます。ダイアログボックスの"
"場合は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">dialog</samp>&rsquo; に配置されます。いず"
"れの場合も、個々のメニュー文字列はサブウィジェットとなり、そのサブウィジェッ"
"トの名前はメニュー項目の文字列と同じになります。例えば、メニューバーの "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">File</samp>&rsquo; メニューは、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">emacs.pane.menubar.File</samp>&rsquo; という名前のサブウィ"
"ジェットです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid ""
"Typically, you want to specify the same resources for the whole menu bar.  "
"To do this, use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; instead of a "
"specific subwidget name.  For example, to specify the font &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">8x16</samp>&rsquo; for all menu bar items, including "
"submenus, write this:"
msgstr ""
"通常、メニューバー全体に同じリソースを指定します。そのためには、特定のサブ"
"ウィジェット名の代わりに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; を使用し"
"ます。例えば、サブメニューを含むすべてのメニューバー項目にフォント &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">8x16</samp>&rsquo; を指定するには、次のように記述しま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Emacs.pane.menubar.*.fontList: 8x16\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid ""
"Each item in a submenu also has its own name for X resources; for example, "
"the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">File</samp>&rsquo; submenu has an item named "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Save (current buffer)</samp>&rsquo;.  A resource "
"specification for a submenu item looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"サブメニュー内の各アイテムにも、Xリソース用の固有の名前があります。例えば、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">File</samp>&rsquo;サブメニューには&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Save (current buffer)</samp>&rsquo;という名前のアイテムがあり"
"ます。サブメニューアイテムのリソース指定は、次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Emacs.pane.menubar.popup_*.<var class=\"var\">menu</var>.<var class=\"var\">item</var>.<var class=\"var\">resource</var>: <var class=\"var\">value</var>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid ""
"For example, here&rsquo;s how to specify the font for the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Save (current buffer)</samp>&rsquo; item:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、「<samp class=\"samp\">Save (current buffer)</samp>」項目のフォントを"
"指定する方法は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Emacs.pane.menubar.popup_*.File.Save (current buffer).fontList: 8x16\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid ""
"For an item in a second-level submenu, such as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Complete Word</samp>&rsquo; under &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Spell Checking</samp>&rsquo; under &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Tools</samp>&rsquo;, the resource fits this template:"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Tools</samp>&rsquo;配下の&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Spell Checking</samp>&rsquo;配下の&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Complete Word</samp>&rsquo;のように、第2レベルのサブメニューに"
"ある項目の場合、リソースはこのテンプレートに該当します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Emacs.pane.menubar.popup_*.popup_*.<var class=\"var\">menu</var>.<var class=\"var\">resource</var>: <var class=\"var\">value</var>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid "For example,"
msgstr "例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Emacs.pane.menubar.popup_*.popup_*.Spell Checking.Complete Word: <var class=\"var\">value</var>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid "(This should be one long line.)"
msgstr "（これは1行であるべきです。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid ""
"If you want the submenu items to look different from the menu bar itself, "
"you must first specify the resource for all of them, then override the value "
"for submenus alone.  Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"サブメニューの項目をメニューバー本体とは異なる見た目にしたい場合は、まずすべ"
"ての項目に対してリソースを指定し、その後サブメニューのみの値を上書きする必要"
"があります。以下に例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Emacs.pane.menubar.*.fontList: 9x18\n"
"Emacs.pane.menubar.popup_*.fontList: 8x16\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid ""
"To specify resources for the LessTif file-selection box, use &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">fsb*</samp>&rsquo;, like this:"
msgstr ""
"LessTifのファイル選択ボックスにリソースを指定するには、次のように&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">fsb*</samp>&rsquo;を使用します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Emacs.fsb*.fontList: 8x16\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid "Here is a list of resources for LessTif menu bars and pop-up menus:"
msgstr ""
"LessTifのメニューバーおよびポップアップメニューに関するリソースの一覧です："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Motif-Resources.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">armColor</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">armColor</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
