# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"<span>28.12.1 C Mode Motion Commands<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#C-"
"Mode-Motion-Commands\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>28.12.1 Cモード動作コマンド<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#C-Mode-"
"Motion-Commands\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"This section describes commands for moving point, in C mode and related "
"modes."
msgstr ""
"本節では、Cモードおよび関連モードにおける点移動コマンドについて説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-c_002dend_002dof_002ddefun\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-c_002dbeginning_002dof_002ddefun\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">C-M-a</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"c_002dbeginning_002dof_002ddefun\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-c_002dend_002dof_002ddefun\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-c_002dbeginning_002dof_002ddefun\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">C-M-a</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"c_002dbeginning_002dof_002ddefun\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">C-M-e</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">C-M-e</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"Move point to the beginning or end of the current function or top-level "
"definition.  In languages with enclosing scopes (such as C++&rsquo;s "
"classes) the <em class=\"dfn\">current function</em> is the immediate one, "
"possibly inside a scope.  Otherwise it is the one defined by the least "
"enclosing braces.  (By contrast, <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-defun</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">end-of-defun</code> search for braces in "
"column zero.)  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Moving-by-Defuns.html\">Moving "
"by Defuns</a>."
msgstr ""
"ポイントを現在の関数またはトップレベル定義の先頭または末尾に移動します。包含"
"スコープを持つ言語（C++のクラスなど）では、<em class=\"dfn\">現在の関数</em>"
"とは、スコープ内にある可能性のある直近の関数を指します。それ以外の場合は、最"
"も外側の波括弧によって定義される関数となります。（対照的に、<code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-defun</code> と <code class=\"code\">end-of-"
"defun</code> は0列目の波括弧を検索します。）<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Moving-"
"by-Defuns.html\">Defunsによる移動</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-c_002dup_002dconditional\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002du-_0028C-mode_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">C-c C-u</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"C_002dc-C_002du-_0028C-mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-c_002dup_002dconditional\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002du-_0028C-mode_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">C-c C-u</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"C_002dc-C_002du-_0028C-mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"Move point back to the containing preprocessor conditional, leaving the mark "
"behind.  A prefix argument acts as a repeat count.  With a negative "
"argument, move point forward to the end of the containing preprocessor "
"conditional."
msgstr ""
"ポイントを包含するプリプロセッサ条件文に戻し、マークを残しておく。接頭辞引数"
"は繰り返し回数として機能する。負の引数を指定すると、ポイントを包含するプリプ"
"ロセッサ条件文の末尾まで進める。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#elif</samp>&rsquo; is equivalent to &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">#else</samp>&rsquo; followed by &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#if</samp>&rsquo;, so the function will stop at a &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">#elif</samp>&rsquo; when going backward, but not when "
"going forward."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#elif</samp>&rsquo;は&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#else</samp>&rsquo;に続いて&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#if</"
"samp>&rsquo;が来るのと同等であるため、この関数は逆方向に辿る際は&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">#elif</samp>&rsquo;で停止しますが、順方向に辿る際は停止しませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-c_002dbackward_002dconditional\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dp-_0028C-mode_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">C-c C-p</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"C_002dc-C_002dp-_0028C-mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-c_002dbackward_002dconditional\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dp-_0028C-mode_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">C-c C-p</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"C_002dc-C_002dp-_0028C-mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"Move point back over a preprocessor conditional, leaving the mark behind.  A "
"prefix argument acts as a repeat count.  With a negative argument, move "
"forward."
msgstr ""
"プリプロセッサの条件式を越えてポイントを戻し、マークを残す。接頭辞引数は繰り"
"返し回数として機能する。負の引数を指定すると、前方に移動する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-c_002dforward_002dconditional\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dn-_0028C-mode_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">C-c C-n</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"C_002dc-C_002dn-_0028C-mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-c_002dforward_002dconditional\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dn-_0028C-mode_0029\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">C-c C-n</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"C_002dc-C_002dn-_0028C-mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"Move point forward across a preprocessor conditional, leaving the mark "
"behind.  A prefix argument acts as a repeat count.  With a negative "
"argument, move backward."
msgstr ""
"プリプロセッサの条件式をまたいでポイントを前方に移動し、マークを残します。接"
"頭辞引数は繰り返し回数として機能します。負の引数を指定すると、後方に移動しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"c_002dbeginning_002dof_002dstatement\"></a> <a id=\"index-M_002da-_0028C-"
"mode_0029\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">M-a</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-M_002da-_0028C-mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"c_002dbeginning_002dof_002dstatement\"></a> <a id=\"index-M_002da-_0028C-"
"mode_0029\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">M-a</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#index-M_002da-_0028C-mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"Move point to the beginning of the innermost C statement (<code "
"class=\"code\">c-beginning-of-statement</code>).  If point is already at the "
"beginning of a statement, move to the beginning of the preceding statement.  "
"With prefix argument <var class=\"var\">n</var>, move back <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> &minus; 1 statements."
msgstr ""
"ポイントを最内側のC文（<code class=\"code\">c-beginning-of-statement</code>）"
"の先頭に移動します。ポイントが既に文の先頭にある場合は、直前の文の先頭に移動"
"します。接頭辞引数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> を指定すると、<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> &minus; 1 文分戻ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"In comments or in strings which span more than one line, this command moves "
"by sentences instead of statements."
msgstr ""
"コメントや複数行にわたる文字列において、このコマンドはステートメント単位では"
"なく文単位で移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-c_002dend_002dof_002dstatement\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-M_002de-_0028C-mode_0029\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">M-e</"
"code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-M_002de-_0028C-mode_0029\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-c_002dend_002dof_002dstatement\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-M_002de-_0028C-mode_0029\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">M-e</"
"code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-M_002de-_0028C-mode_0029\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Motion-in-C.html
msgid ""
"Move point to the end of the innermost C statement or sentence; like <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> except that it moves in the other direction (<code "
"class=\"code\">c-end-of-statement</code>)."
msgstr ""
"ポイントを最内層のC文または文の末尾に移動します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd>"
"と同様ですが、逆方向（<code class=\"code\">c-end-of-statement</code>）に移動"
"します。"

