msgstr ""
"<span>23.21 マウス回避<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Mouse-"
"Avoidance-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-avoiding-mouse-in-the-way-of-your-"
"typing\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse-avoidance\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-avoiding-mouse-in-the-way-of-your-"
"typing\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse-avoidance\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid ""
"On graphical terminals, the mouse pointer may obscure the text in the Emacs "
"frame.  Emacs provides two methods to avoid this problem."
msgstr ""
"グラフィカル端末では、マウスポインタがEmacsフレーム内のテキストを覆い隠してし"
"まうことがあります。Emacsでは、この問題を回避するための2つの方法が用意されて"
"います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid ""
"Firstly, Emacs hides the mouse pointer each time you type a self-inserting "
"character, if the pointer lies inside an Emacs frame; moving the mouse "
"pointer makes it visible again.  To disable this feature, set the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">make-pointer-invisible</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Display-"
"Custom.html\">Customization of Display</a>."
msgstr ""
"まず、Emacsでは、ポインタがEmacsフレーム内にある場合、自己挿入文字を入力する"
"たびにマウスポインタが非表示になります。マウスポインタを移動させると、再び表"
"示されるようになります。この機能を無効にするには、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">make-pointer-invisible</code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> に設定してください。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Display-Custom.html\">表示"
"のカスタマイズ</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002davoidance_002dmode-1\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002davoidance_002dmode-1\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid ""
"Secondly, you can use Mouse Avoidance mode, a minor mode, to keep the mouse "
"pointer away from point.  To use Mouse Avoidance mode, customize the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">mouse-avoidance-mode</code>.  You can set this "
"to various values to move the mouse in several ways:"
msgstr ""
"次に、マイナーモードである「マウス回避モード」を使用して、マウスポインタをポ"
"イントから遠ざけることができます。マウス回避モードを使用するには、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-avoidance-mode</code> を設定してください。この値をさまざ"
"まな値に設定することで、マウスを多様な方法で移動させることができます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">banish</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">banish</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid ""
"Move the pointer to a corner of the frame on any key-press.  You can "
"customize the variable <code class=\"code\">mouse-avoidance-banish-position</"
"code> to specify where the pointer goes when it is banished."
msgstr ""
"キーを押すたびに、ポインタをフレームの隅に移動させます。変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-avoidance-banish-position</code> をカスタマイズすること"
"で、ポインタが追い出された際の移動先を指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">exile</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">exile</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid ""
"Banish the pointer only if the cursor gets too close, and allow it to return "
"once the cursor is out of the way."
msgstr ""
"カーソルが近づきすぎた場合にのみポインタを退避させ、カーソルが離れたら復帰で"
"きるようにする。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">jump</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">jump</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid ""
"If the cursor gets too close to the pointer, displace the pointer by a "
"random distance and direction."
msgstr ""
"カーソルがポインタに近づきすぎた場合は、ポインタをランダムな距離と方向に移動"
"させる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">animate</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">animate</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid ""
"As <code class=\"code\">jump</code>, but shows steps along the way for "
"illusion of motion."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">jump</code>と同様だが、動きの錯覚を生み出すための途中の"
"手順を示している。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">cat-and-mouse</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">cat-and-mouse</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid "The same as <code class=\"code\">animate</code>."
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">animate</code>と同じ。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">proteus</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">proteus</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid ""
"As <code class=\"code\">animate</code>, but changes the shape of the mouse "
"pointer too."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">animate</code>と同様ですが、マウスポインタの形状も変わり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002davoidance_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002davoidance_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Avoidance.html
msgid ""
"You can also use the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x mouse-avoidance-mode</"
"kbd> to enable the mode.  Whenever Mouse Avoidance mode moves the mouse, it "
