#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"The most basic mouse command is <code class=\"code\">mouse-set-point</code>, "
"which is invoked by clicking with the left mouse button, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd>, in the text area of a window.  This moves point "
"to the position where you clicked.  If that window was not the selected "
"window, it becomes the selected window.  You can also activate a region by "
"double-clicking <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Word-and-Line-Mouse.html\">Mouse Commands for Words and Lines</a>)."
msgstr ""
"最も基本的なマウスコマンドは <code class=\"code\">mouse-set-point</code> で、"
"ウィンドウのテキスト領域で左マウスボタン <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> を"
"クリックすることで実行されます。これにより、ポイントがクリックした位置に移動"
"します。そのウィンドウが選択されていなかった場合は、選択状態になります。ま"
"た、<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> をダブルクリックすることで領域をアクティ"
"ブにすることもできます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Word-and-Line-Mouse.html\">"
"単語および行のマウスコマンド</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"x_002dmouse_002dclick_002dfocus_002dignore_002dposition\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"x_002dmouse_002dclick_002dfocus_002dignore_002dposition\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Normally, if the frame you clicked in was not the selected frame, it is made "
"the selected frame, in addition to selecting the window and setting the "
"cursor.  On the X Window System, you can change this by setting the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">x-mouse-click-focus-ignore-position</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>.  In that case, the initial click on an unselected "
"frame just selects the frame, without doing anything else; clicking again "
"selects the window and sets the cursor position."
msgstr ""
"通常、クリックしたフレームが選択済みでなかった場合、ウィンドウの選択とカーソ"
"ルの設定に加えて、そのフレームが選択済みとなります。X Window Systemでは、変"
"数 <code class=\"code\">x-mouse-click-focus-ignore-position</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> に設定することで、この動作を変更できます。この場合、"
"未選択のフレームを最初にクリックすると、それ以外の操作は行われず単にそのフ"
"レームが選択されるだけとなり、再度クリックするとウィンドウが選択され、カーソ"
"ル位置が設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002c-dragging\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002dset_002dregion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002c-dragging\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002dset_002dregion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Holding down <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> and dragging the mouse over a "
"stretch of text activates the region around that text (<code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-set-region</code>), placing the mark where you started "
"holding down the mouse button, and point where you release it (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mark.html\">The Mark and the Region</a>).  In "
"addition, the text in the region becomes the primary selection (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Primary-Selection.html\">Cut and Paste with Other "
"Window Applications</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> を押したままテキストの範囲上でマウスをドラッ"
"グすると、そのテキスト周辺のリージョン (<code class=\"code\">mouse-set-"
"region</code>) がアクティブになり、マウスボタンを押し始めた位置にマークが、ボ"
"タンを離した位置にポイントが配置されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Mark.html\">マークとリージョン</a> を参照）。さらに、そのリージョン内"
"のテキストがプライマリ選択範囲となります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Primary-"
"Selection.html\">他のウィンドウアプリケーションでの切り取りと貼り付け</a> を"
"参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mouse_002ddrag_002dcopy_002dregion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mouse_002ddrag_002dcopy_002dregion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If you change the variable <code class=\"code\">mouse-drag-copy-region</"
"code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, dragging the mouse "
"over a stretch of text also adds the text to the kill ring.  The default is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">mouse-drag-copy-region</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に変更すると、テキストの範囲をマウスでド"
"ラッグした際にもそのテキストがキルリングに追加されます。デフォルトは <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is <code class=\"code\">non-empty</code>, only copy to the "
"kill ring if the region is non-empty.  For instance, if you mouse drag an "
"area that is less than a half a character, you&rsquo;d normally get the "
"empty string in your kill ring, but with <code class=\"code\">non-empty</"
"code>, this short mouse drag won&rsquo;t affect the kill ring."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">non-empty</code> の場合、リージョンが空でない"
"場合にのみキルリングにコピーされます。例えば、1文字の半分未満の範囲をマウスで"
"ドラッグした場合、通常はキルリングに空文字列が格納されますが、<code "
"class=\"code\">non-empty</code> を指定すると、この短いマウスドラッグはキルリ"
"ングに影響を与えません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mouse_002dshift_002dadjust_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mouse_002dshift_002dadjust_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If you activate the Mouse-Shift-Adjust minor mode, clicking the left mouse "
"button with the <kbd class=\"kbd\">Shift</kbd> modifier (<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">S-down-mouse-1</kbd>)  adjusts (extends or shrinks, depending "
"on where you click) the already selected region."
msgstr ""
"Mouse-Shift-Adjust マイナーモードを有効にすると、<kbd class=\"kbd\">Shift</"
"kbd> 修飾キー (<kbd class=\"kbd\">S-down-mouse-1</kbd>) を押しながらマウスの"
"左ボタンをクリックすることで、すでに選択されている領域を調整（クリックした位"
"置に応じて拡大または縮小）できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mouse_002dscroll_002dmin_002dlines\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mouse_002dscroll_002dmin_002dlines\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If you move the mouse off the top or bottom of the window while dragging, "
"the window scrolls at a steady rate until you move the mouse back into the "
"window.  This way, you can select regions that don&rsquo;t fit entirely on "
"the screen.  The number of lines scrolled per step depends on how far away "
"from the window edge the mouse has gone; the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-scroll-min-lines</code> specifies a minimum step size."
msgstr ""
"ドラッグ中にマウスをウィンドウの上端または下端から離すと、マウスを再びウィン"
"ドウ内に戻すまで、ウィンドウが一定の速度でスクロールします。これにより、画面"
"に収まりきらない領域を選択できます。1ステップあたりにスクロールされる行数は、"
"マウスがウィンドウの端からどれだけ離れたかによって異なります。変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-scroll-min-lines</code> で最小ステップサイズを指定しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mouse_002ddrag_002dmode_002dline_002dbuffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"mouse_002ddrag_002dmode_002dline_002dbuffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If you enable the option <code class=\"code\">mouse-drag-mode-line-buffer</"
"code> and dragging files is supported by the window system, then dragging "
"the mouse on the buffer name portion of the mode line will drag that "
"buffer&rsquo;s file to another program or frame."
msgstr ""
"オプション <code class=\"code\">mouse-drag-mode-line-buffer</code> を有効に"
"し、ウィンドウシステムがファイルのドラッグ操作をサポートしている場合、モード"
"ラインのバッファ名部分でマウスをドラッグすると、そのバッファのファイルが別の"
"プログラムやフレームにドラッグされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002dyank_002dprimary\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002dyank_002dat_002dclick\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002dyank_002dprimary\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002dyank_002dat_002dclick\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Clicking with the middle mouse button, <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd>, "
"moves point to the position where you clicked and inserts the contents of "
"the primary selection (<code class=\"code\">mouse-yank-primary</code>).  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Primary-Selection.html\">Cut and Paste with Other "
"Window Applications</a>.  This behavior is consistent with other X "
"applications.  Alternatively, you can rebind <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</"
"kbd> to <code class=\"code\">mouse-yank-at-click</code>, which performs a "
"yank at the position you click."
msgstr ""
"マウスの中ボタン <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> をクリックすると、ポイント"
"がクリックした位置に移動し、プライマリセレクションの内容 (<code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-yank-primary</code>) が挿入されます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Primary-Selection.html\">他のウィンドウアプリケーションでの切り取りと"
"貼り付け</a> を参照してください。この動作は、他の X アプリケーションと同様で"
"す。あるいは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> を <code class=\"code\">mouse-"
"yank-at-click</code> に再バインドすることで、クリックした位置でヤンクを行うこ"
"ともできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002dyank_002dat_002dpoint\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002dyank_002dat_002dpoint\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If you change the variable <code class=\"code\">mouse-yank-at-point</code> "
"to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</"
"kbd> does not move point; it inserts the text at point, regardless of where "
"you clicked or even which of the frame&rsquo;s windows you clicked on.  This "
"variable affects both <code class=\"code\">mouse-yank-primary</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">mouse-yank-at-click</code>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">mouse-yank-at-point</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に変更すると、<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</"
"kbd> はポイントを移動させません。どこでクリックしたか、あるいはフレームのどの"
"ウィンドウをクリックしたかにかかわらず、ポイントにテキストを挿入します。この"
"変数は <code class=\"code\">mouse-yank-primary</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-yank-at-click</code> の両方に影響します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002dsave_002dthen_002dkill\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002dsave_002dthen_002dkill\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Clicking with the right mouse button, <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd>, runs "
"the command <code class=\"code\">mouse-save-then-kill</code>.  This performs "
"several actions depending on where you click and the status of the region:"
msgstr ""
"マウスの右ボタン <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> をクリックすると、コマンド "
"<code class=\"code\">mouse-save-then-kill</code> が実行されます。これにより、"
"クリックした位置や領域の状態に応じて、いくつかの処理が行われます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If no region is active, clicking <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> activates "
"the region, placing the mark where point was and point at the clicked "
"position."
msgstr ""
"アクティブな領域がない場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> をクリックすると"
"領域がアクティブになり、point があった位置にマークが、クリックした位置に "
"point が配置されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If a region is active, clicking <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> adjusts the "
"nearer end of the region by moving it to the clicked position.  The adjusted "
"region&rsquo;s text is copied to the kill ring; if the text in the original "
"region was already on the kill ring, it replaces it there."
msgstr ""
"リージョンがアクティブな状態で <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> をクリックす"
"ると、リージョンの近い方の端がクリックした位置に移動して調整されます。調整後"
"のリージョンのテキストはキルリングにコピーされ、元のリージョンのテキストが既"
"にキルリングにあった場合は、それが置き換えられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If you originally specified the region using a double or triple <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd>, so that the region is defined to consist of "
"entire words or lines (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Word-and-Line-"
"Mouse.html\">Mouse Commands for Words and Lines</a>), then adjusting the "
"region with <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> also proceeds by entire words "
"or lines."
msgstr ""
"もともとダブルまたはトリプルの <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> を用いて領域"
"を指定し、領域が単語や行単位で定義されるようにしていた場合（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Word-and-Line-Mouse.html\">単語および行用のマウスコマ"
"ンド</a> を参照）、<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> で領域を調整する際も、同"
"様に単語や行単位で処理が行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If you use <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> a second time consecutively, at "
"the same place, that kills the region already selected.  Thus, the simplest "
"way to kill text with the mouse is to click <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> "
"at one end, then click <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> twice at the other "
"end.  To copy the text into the kill ring without deleting it from the "
"buffer, press <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> just once&mdash;or just drag "
"across the text with <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd>.  Then you can copy it "
"elsewhere by yanking it."
msgstr ""
"同じ場所で <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> を2回連続して使用すると、すでに選"
"択されているリージョンが解除されます。したがって、マウスでテキストを解除する"
"最も簡単な方法は、一方の端で <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> をクリックし、"
"もう一方の端で <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> を2回クリックすることです。"
"バッファから削除せずにテキストをキルリングにコピーするには、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> を1回だけ押すか、あるいは <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> でテキスト上をドラッグします。その後、ヤンクする"
"ことで別の場所にコピーできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">mouse-save-then-kill</code> command also obeys the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">mouse-drag-copy-region</code> (described "
"above).  If the value is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then whenever "
"the command sets or adjusts the active region, the text in the region is "
"also added to the kill ring.  If the latest kill ring entry had been added "
"the same way, that entry is replaced rather than making a new entry."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">mouse-save-then-kill</code> コマンドは、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-drag-copy-region</code>（前述）にも従います。値が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、コマンドがアクティブ領域を設定または調"
"整するたびに、その領域内のテキストもキルリングに追加されます。最新のキルリン"
"グエントリが同様の方法で追加されていた場合は、新しいエントリを作成するのでは"
"なく、そのエントリが置き換えられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Mouse-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Whenever you set the region using any of the mouse commands described above, "
"the mark will be deactivated by any subsequent unshifted cursor motion "
"command, in addition to the usual ways of deactivating the mark.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Shift-Selection.html\">Shift Selection</a>."
msgstr ""
"上述のマウスコマンドのいずれかでリージョンを設定すると、通常の解除方法に加え"
"て、その後にシフトキーを押さずにカーソルを移動させるコマンドを実行するたび"
"に、マークが解除されます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Shift-Selection.html\">シ"
"フト選択</a>を参照してください。"

