# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Moving-Point.html
msgid ""
"Use the current column of point as the <em class=\"dfn\">semipermanent goal "
"column</em> (<code class=\"code\">set-goal-column</code>) in the current "
"buffer.  When a semipermanent goal column is in effect, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"n</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">&lt;prior&gt;</"
"kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">&lt;next&gt;</kbd> always try to move to this "
"column, or as close as possible to it, after moving vertically.  The goal "
"column remains in effect until canceled."
msgstr ""
"現在のポイント列を、カレントバッファの<em class=\"dfn\">半永続ゴール列</em> "
"(<code class=\"code\">set-goal-column</code>) として使用します。半永続ゴール"
"列が有効な場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd>、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">&lt;prior&gt;</kbd>、および<kbd class=\"kbd\">&lt;next&gt;"
"</kbd>は、垂直方向に移動した後、常にこの列、あるいは可能な限りその付近へ移動"
"しようとします。ゴール列は、キャンセルされるまで有効のままとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Moving-Point.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x C-n</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x C-n</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Moving-Point.html
msgid ""
"Cancel the goal column.  Henceforth, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> try to preserve the horizontal position, as usual."
msgstr ""
"ゴール列をキャンセルする。以降、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> は通常通り、水平位置を維持するようにする。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Moving-Point.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line_002dmove_002dvisual\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line_002dmove_002dvisual\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Moving-Point.html
msgid ""
"When a line of text in the buffer is longer than the width of the window, "
"Emacs usually displays it on two or more <em class=\"dfn\">screen lines</"
"em>, a.k.a. <em class=\"dfn\">visual lines</em>.  For convenience, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> move point by "
"screen lines, as do the equivalent keys <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">down</kbd></kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">up</"
"kbd></kbd>.  You can force these commands to move according to <em "
"class=\"dfn\">logical lines</em> (i.e., according to the text lines in the "
"buffer)  by setting the variable <code class=\"code\">line-move-visual</"
"code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>; if a logical line occupies "
"multiple screen lines, the cursor then skips over the additional screen "
"lines.  For details, see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Continuation-"
"Lines.html\">Continuation Lines</a>.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Variables.html\">Variables</a>, for how to set variables such as "
"<code class=\"code\">line-move-visual</code>."
msgstr ""
"バッファ内のテキスト行がウィンドウの幅を超える場合、Emacsは通常、それを2つ以"
"上の<em class=\"dfn\">スクリーン行</em>（別名<em class=\"dfn\">ビジュアル行</"
"em>）にわたって表示します。利便性のため、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd>と<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd>はポイントをスクリーン行単位で移動させ、対応するキーで"
"ある<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">down</kbd></kbd>と<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">up</kbd></kbd>も同様の動作をします。変数"
"<code class=\"code\">line-move-visual</code>に<code class=\"code\">nil</code>"
"を設定することで、これらのコマンドを<em class=\"dfn\">論理行</em>（すなわち"
"バッファ内のテキスト行）に従って移動させるように強制できます。論理行が複数の"
"スクリーン行にまたがる場合、カーソルはその追加のスクリーン行をスキップしま"
"す。詳細については、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Continuation-Lines.html\">継続行"
"</a>を参照してください。<code class=\"code\">line-move-visual</code>などの変"
"数の設定方法については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Variables.html\">変数</a>を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Moving-Point.html
msgid ""
"Unlike <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd>, most "
"of the Emacs commands that work on lines work on <em class=\"emph\">logical</"
"em> lines.  For instance, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">move-beginning-of-line</code>) and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-e</"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">move-end-of-line</code>) respectively move to the "
"beginning and end of the logical line.  Whenever we encounter commands that "
"work on screen lines, such as <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd>, we will point these out."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> とは異なり、行単"
"位で動作する Emacs コマンドの多くは、<em class=\"emph\">論理</em> 行単位で動"
"作します。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">move-"
"beginning-of-line</code>) や <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-e</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">move-end-of-line</code>) は、それぞれ論理行の先頭と末尾に移動"
"します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> のよう"
"に、画面行単位で動作するコマンドがある場合は、その都度明記します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Moving-Point.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-track_002deol\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-track_002deol\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Moving-Point.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">line-move-visual</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, you can also set the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">track-eol</code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"value.  Then <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd>, "
"when starting at the end of the logical line, move to the end of the next "
"logical line.  Normally, <code class=\"code\">track-eol</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">line-move-visual</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> の場合、変数 <code class=\"code\">track-eol</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を設定することもできます。すると、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-p</kbd> は、論理行の末尾から"
"開始する場合、次の論理行の末尾に移動します。通常、<code class=\"code\">track-"
"eol</code> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Moving-Point.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"next_002dline_002dadd_002dnewlines\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"next_002dline_002dadd_002dnewlines\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Moving-Point.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> normally stops at the end of the buffer when "
"you use it on the last line in the buffer.  However, if you set the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">next-line-add-newlines</code> to a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> on the last "
"line of a buffer creates an additional line at the end and moves down into "
"it."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> は、バッファの最終行で使用すると、通常はバッファ"
"の末尾で停止します。ただし、変数 <code class=\"code\">next-line-add-"
"newlines</code> に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を設定すると、バッ"
"ファの最終行にある <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> は末尾に追加の行を作成し、そ"
"こに移動します。"

