# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Moving-by-Parens.html
msgid ""
"To move <em class=\"emph\">down</em> in the parenthesis structure, use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-d</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">down-list</code>).  In Lisp "
"mode, where &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">(</samp>&rsquo; is the only opening "
