# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Moving-by-Sentences.html
msgid ""
"The commands to move to the beginning and end of the current sentence are "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">backward-sentence</code>) "
"and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</"
"code>).  If you repeat one of these commands, or use a positive numeric "
"argument, each repetition moves to the next sentence in the direction of "
"motion."
msgstr ""
"現在の文の先頭および末尾へ移動するコマンドは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">backward-sentence</code>) および <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code>) です。これらのコマンド"
"のいずれかを繰り返したり、正の数値引数を指定したりすると、繰り返すたびに移動"
"方向に沿って次の文へと移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Moving-by-Sentences.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> with a negative argument &minus;<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> moves forward <var class=\"var\">n</var> times to the "
"next end of a sentence.  Likewise, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-e</kbd> with a "
"negative argument moves back to the start of a sentence."
msgstr ""
"負の引数を持つ <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> &minus;<var class=\"var\">n</"
"var> は、文の次の末尾まで <var class=\"var\">n</var> 回前方に移動します。同様"
"に、負の引数を持つ <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-e</kbd> は、文の先頭まで戻ります。"

