#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/emacs/Multiple-Displays.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"multiple_002dterminals_002dmerge_002dkeyboards\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"multiple_002dterminals_002dmerge_002dkeyboards\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Multiple-Displays.html
msgid ""
"In this situation, you may prefer to have the different frames behave as "
"though they had been created with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 2</kbd> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Creating-Frames.html\">Creating Frames</a>).  In that "
"case, starting a recursive edit in one frame does not mean that keyboard "
"input into other frames is blocked.  Customize the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">multiple-terminals-merge-keyboards</code> to a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value to achieve this."
msgstr ""
"このような状況では、各フレームを <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 2</kbd> で作成され"
"たかのように動作させたい場合があります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Creating-"
"Frames.html\">フレームの作成</a>を参照）。その場合、あるフレームで再帰的な編"
"集を開始しても、他のフレームへのキーボード入力がブロックされることはありませ"
"ん。これを実現するには、変数 <code class=\"code\">multiple-terminals-merge-"
"keyboards</code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に設定してくださ"
"い。"

