# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Multithreaded-debugging-in-GDB\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Non_002dstop-debugging-in-GDB\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Multithreaded-debugging-in-GDB\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Non_002dstop-debugging-in-GDB\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"In GDB&rsquo;s <em class=\"dfn\">all-stop mode</em>, whenever your program "
"stops, all execution threads stop.  Likewise, whenever you restart the "
"program, all threads start executing.  See <a data-manual=\"gdb\" "
"href=\"https://sourceware.org/gdb/current/onlinedocs/gdb.html/All_002dStop-"
"Mode.html#All_002dStop-Mode\">All-Stop Mode</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The "
"GNU debugger</cite>.  For some multi-threaded targets, GDB supports a "
"further mode of operation, called <em class=\"dfn\">non-stop mode</em>, in "
"which you can examine stopped program threads in the debugger while other "
"threads continue to execute freely.  See <a data-manual=\"gdb\" "
"href=\"https://sourceware.org/gdb/current/onlinedocs/gdb.html/Non_002dStop-"
"Mode.html#Non_002dStop-Mode\">Non-Stop Mode</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The "
"GNU debugger</cite>.  Versions of GDB prior to 7.0 do not support non-stop "
"mode, and it does not work on all targets."
msgstr ""
"GDBの<em class=\"dfn\">全停止モード</em>では、プログラムが停止するたびに、す"
"べての実行スレッドが停止します。同様に、プログラムを再開するたびに、すべての"
"スレッドの実行が開始されます。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU debugger</cite>の"
"<a data-manual=\"gdb\" href=\"https://sourceware.org/gdb/current/onlinedocs/"
"gdb.html/All_002dStop-Mode.html#All_002dStop-Mode\">全停止モード</a>を参照し"
"てください。一部のマルチスレッドターゲットでは、GDBは<em class=\"dfn\">非停止"
"モード</em>と呼ばれるさらなる動作モードをサポートしており、このモードでは、他"
"のスレッドが自由に実行を継続している間に、デバッガで停止したプログラムスレッ"
"ドを調査できます。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU debugger</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"gdb\" href=\"https://sourceware.org/gdb/current/onlinedocs/gdb.html/"
"Non_002dStop-Mode.html#Non_002dStop-Mode\">非停止モード</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。GDB 7.0より前のバージョンでは非停止モードはサポートされておらず、またすべ"
"てのターゲットで動作するわけではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-gdb_002dnon_002dstop_002dsetting\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-gdb_002dnon_002dstop_002dsetting\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">gdb-non-stop-setting</code> determines "
"whether Emacs runs GDB in all-stop mode or non-stop mode.  The default is "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code>, which means it tries to use non-stop mode if "
"that is available.  If you change the value to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, or if non-stop mode is unavailable, Emacs runs GDB in all-stop mode.  "
"The variable takes effect when Emacs begins a debugging session; if you "
"change its value, you should restart any active debugging session."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">gdb-non-stop-setting</code> は、Emacs が GDB を全停"
"止モードで実行するか非停止モードで実行するかを決定します。デフォルトは <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> で、これは非停止モードが利用可能な場合にそれを使用し"
"ようとすることを意味します。値を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に変更する"
"か、非停止モードが利用できない場合、Emacs は GDB を全停止モードで実行します。"
"この変数は Emacs がデバッグセッションを開始する際に有効になります。値を変更し"
"た場合は、実行中のデバッグセッションを再起動してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"gdb_002dswitch_002dwhen_002danother_002dstopped\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"gdb_002dswitch_002dwhen_002danother_002dstopped\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"When a thread stops in non-stop mode, Emacs usually switches to that "
"thread.  If you don&rsquo;t want Emacs to do this switch if another stopped "
"thread is already selected, change the variable <code class=\"code\">gdb-"
"switch-when-another-stopped</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"ノンストップモードでスレッドが停止すると、通常 Emacs はそのスレッドに切り替え"
"ます。すでに別の停止中のスレッドが選択されている場合に Emacs にこの切り替えを"
"行わせたくない場合は、変数 <code class=\"code\">gdb-switch-when-another-"
"stopped</code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に変更してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-gdb_002dswitch_002dreasons\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-gdb_002dswitch_002dreasons\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"Emacs can decide whether or not to switch to the stopped thread depending on "
"the reason which caused the stop.  Customize the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">gdb-switch-reasons</code> to select the stop reasons which "
"will cause a thread switch."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、停止の原因に応じて、停止したスレッドに切り替えるかどうかを判断できま"
"す。変数 <code class=\"code\">gdb-switch-reasons</code> をカスタマイズして、"
"スレッド切り替えのトリガーとなる停止理由を選択してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-gdb_002dstopped_002dfunctions\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-gdb_002dstopped_002dfunctions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">gdb-stopped-functions</code> allows you to "
"execute your functions whenever some thread stops."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">gdb-stopped-functions</code> を使用すると、いずれか"
"のスレッドが停止した際に関数を実行できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"In non-stop mode, you can switch between different modes for GUD execution "
"control commands."
msgstr ""
"ノンストップモードでは、GUD実行制御コマンドの異なるモードを切り替えることがで"
"きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"gdb_002dgud_002dcontrol_002dall_002dthreads\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"gdb_002dgud_002dcontrol_002dall_002dthreads\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid "<em class=\"dfn\">Non-stop/A</em>"
msgstr "<em class=\"dfn\">ノンストップ/A</em>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">gdb-gud-control-all-threads</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> (the default value), interruption and continuation "
"commands apply to all threads, so you can halt or continue all your threads "
"with one command using <code class=\"code\">gud-stop-subjob</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">gud-cont</code>, respectively.  The &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Go</samp>&rsquo; button is shown on the tool bar when at "
"least one thread is stopped, whereas &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Stop</"
"samp>&rsquo; button is shown when at least one thread is running."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">gdb-gud-control-all-threads</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>（デフォルト値）の場合、中断および再開コマンドはすべて"
"のスレッドに適用されるため、<code class=\"code\">gud-stop-subjob</code> と "
"<code class=\"code\">gud-cont</code> をそれぞれ使用することで、1つのコマンド"
"ですべてのスレッドを停止または再開できます。少なくとも1つのスレッドが停止して"
"いるときはツールバーに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Go</samp>&rsquo; ボタンが"
"表示され、少なくとも1つのスレッドが実行中であるときは &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Stop</samp>&rsquo; ボタンが表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid "<em class=\"dfn\">Non-stop/T</em>"
msgstr "<em class=\"dfn\">ノンストップ/T</em>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">gdb-gud-control-all-threads</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, only the current thread is stopped/continued.  "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Go</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Stop</samp>&rsquo; buttons on the GUD tool bar are shown "
"depending on the state of current thread."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">gdb-gud-control-all-threads</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、現在のスレッドのみが停止/再開されます。GUD"
"ツールバーの「<samp class=\"samp\">Go</samp>」および「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Stop</samp>」ボタンは、現在のスレッドの状態に応じて表示されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"You can change the current value of <code class=\"code\">gdb-gud-control-all-"
"threads</code> from the tool bar or from &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">GUD-"
"&gt;GDB-MI</samp>&rsquo; menu."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">gdb-gud-control-all-threads</code>の現在の値は、ツール"
"バーまたは「<samp class=\"samp\">GUD-&gt;GDB-MI</samp>」メニューから変更でき"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid "Stepping commands always apply to the current thread."
msgstr "ステップコマンドは常に現在のスレッドに適用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"In non-stop mode, you can interrupt/continue your threads without selecting "
"them.  Hitting <kbd class=\"kbd\">i</kbd> in threads buffer interrupts "
"thread under point, <kbd class=\"kbd\">c</kbd> continues it, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">s</kbd> steps through.  More such commands may be added in the "
"future."
msgstr ""
"ノンストップモードでは、スレッドを選択することなく、中断や続行が可能です。ス"
"レッドバッファで <kbd class=\"kbd\">i</kbd> を押すとポイント位置のスレッドが"
"中断され、<kbd class=\"kbd\">c</kbd> で続行、<kbd class=\"kbd\">s</kbd> でス"
"テップ実行されます。今後、このようなコマンドがさらに追加される可能性がありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Multithreaded-Debugging.html
msgid ""
"Note that when you interrupt a thread, it stops with the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">signal received</samp>&rsquo; reason.  If that reason is "
"included in your <code class=\"code\">gdb-switch-reasons</code> (it is by "
"default), Emacs will switch to that thread."
msgstr ""
"なお、スレッドを中断すると、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">signal received</"
"samp>&rsquo; という理由で停止します。この理由が <code class=\"code\">gdb-"
"switch-reasons</code> に含まれている場合（デフォルトでは含まれています）、"
"Emacs はそのスレッドに切り替えます。"

