# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"The function type, if known, is expressed with a <em class=\"dfn\">function "
"type specifier</em> (see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Type-Specifiers.html#Type-"
"Specifiers\">Type Specifiers</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp "
"Reference Manual</cite>), it will be specified if the type was manually "
"declared by a Lisp program or inferred by the compiler.  Note that function "
"type inference works only when native compilation is enabled (see <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/native-compilation.html#native-compilation\">native compilation</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"関数型が判明している場合は、<em class=\"dfn\">関数型指定子</em>（<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Type-Specifiers.html#Type-Specifiers\">Type Specifiers</a>を参照）を用"
"いて表現されます。この型がLispプログラムによって手動で宣言されたか、あるいは"
"コンパイラによって推論された場合に指定されます。なお、関数型の推論は、ネイ"
"ティブコンパイルが有効な場合にのみ機能します（<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs "
"Lisp Reference Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/native-"
"compilation.html#native-compilation\">native compilation</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"help_002denable_002dsymbol_002dautoload\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"help_002denable_002dsymbol_002dautoload\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"If you request help for an autoloaded function whose <code "
"class=\"code\">autoload</code> form (see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/"
"Autoload.html#Autoload\">Autoload</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp "
"Reference Manual</cite>)  doesn&rsquo;t provide a doc string, the <samp "
"class=\"file\">*Help*</samp> buffer won&rsquo;t have any doc string to "
"display.  In that case, if <code class=\"code\">help-enable-symbol-autoload</"
"code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs will try to load the "
"file in which the function is defined to see whether there&rsquo;s a doc "
"string there."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">autoload</code> 形式（<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs "
"Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/"
"Autoload.html#Autoload\">Autoload</a> を参照）で doc string が提供されていな"
"いオートロード関数についてヘルプをリクエストした場合、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*Help*</samp> バッファに表示すべき doc string は存在しません。"
"その際、<code class=\"code\">help-enable-symbol-autoload</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外であれば、Emacs はその関数が定義されているファ"
"イルをロードし、そこに doc string があるかどうかを確認しようとします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-shortdoc\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-shortdoc\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"You can get an overview of functions relevant for a particular topic by "
"using the <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x shortdoc</kbd> command.  This will prompt "
"you for an area of interest, e.g., <code class=\"code\">string</code>, and "
"pop you to a buffer where many of the functions relevant for handling "
"strings are listed."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x shortdoc</kbd> コマンドを使用すると、特定のトピックに"
"関連する関数の概要を確認できます。これにより、<code class=\"code\">string</"
"code> のように関心のある分野の入力が求められ、文字列処理に関連する多くの関数"
"が一覧表示されたバッファに移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"You can also request that documentation of functions and commands shown in "
"<samp class=\"file\">*Help*</samp> buffers popped by <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h "
"f</kbd> includes examples of their use.  To that end, add the following to "
"your initialization file (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The "
"Emacs Initialization File</a>):"
msgstr ""
"また、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd> によってポップされた <samp "
"class=\"file\">*Help*</samp> バッファに表示されている関数やコマンドのドキュメ"
"ントに、その使用例を含めるようリクエストすることも可能です。そのためには、初"
"期化ファイル（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">Emacs 初期化ファイル"
"</a> を参照）に以下を追加してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(add-hook 'help-fns-describe-function-functions\n"
"          #'shortdoc-help-fns-examples-function)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-v\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-describe_002dvariable\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-v\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-describe_002dvariable\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h v</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-variable</"
"code>) is like <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd> but describes Lisp variables "
"instead of Lisp functions.  Its default is the Lisp symbol around or before "
"point, if that is the name of a defined Lisp variable.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Variables.html\">Variables</a>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h v</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-variable</"
"code>) は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd> と同様ですが、Lisp 関数ではなく "
"Lisp 変数を表します。デフォルトでは、ポイントの周囲または直前にある Lisp シン"
"ボルが指定され、それが定義済みの Lisp 変数の名前である場合に適用されます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Variables.html\">変数</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"Help buffers that describe Emacs variables and functions normally have "
"hyperlinks to the corresponding source code, if you have the source files "
"installed (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Hyperlinking.html\">Hyperlinking "
"and Web Navigation Features</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Emacsの変数や関数を記述するヘルプバッファには、ソースファイルがインストールさ"
"れていれば、通常、対応するソースコードへのハイパーリンクが設定されています"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Hyperlinking.html\">ハイパーリンクとウェブナビ"
"ゲーション機能</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-F\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-Info_002dgoto_002demacs_002dcommand_002dnode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-F\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-Info_002dgoto_002demacs_002dcommand_002dnode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"To find a command&rsquo;s documentation in a manual, use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h F</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">Info-goto-emacs-command-"
"node</code>).  This knows about various manuals, not just the Emacs manual, "
"and finds the right one."
msgstr ""
"マニュアルでコマンドのドキュメントを探すには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h F</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">Info-goto-emacs-command-node</code>) を使用します。これ"
"はEmacsマニュアルに限らず、さまざまなマニュアルを把握しており、適切なものを探"
"し出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-o\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-describe_002dsymbol\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-o\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-describe_002dsymbol\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h o</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-symbol</code>) "
"is like <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h v</kbd>, "
"but it describes any symbol, be it a function, a variable, or a face.  If "
"the symbol has more than one definition, like it has both definition as a "
"function and as a variable, this command will show the documentation of all "
"of them, one after the other."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h o</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-symbol</code>) "
"は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h v</kbd> と同様で"
"すが、関数、変数、フェイスなど、あらゆるシンボルを記述できます。シンボルに、"
"関数としての定義と変数としての定義の両方があるなど、複数の定義が存在する場"
"合、このコマンドはそれらすべてのドキュメントを順に表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dh-4-s\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
