# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h 4 s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">help-find-source</"
"code>) switch to a buffer visiting the source definition of what is being "
"described in the help buffer."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h 4 s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">help-find-source</"
"code>) ヘルプバッファで説明されている内容のソース定義を参照するバッファに切り"
"替えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completions_002ddetailed\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-completions_002ddetailed\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Name-Help.html
msgid ""
"If the <code class=\"code\">completions-detailed</code> user option is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, some commands provide details about the "
"possible values when displaying completions.  For instance, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h o TAB</kbd> will then include the first line of the doc "
"string, and will also say whether each symbol is a function or a variable "
"(and so on).  Which details are included varies depending on the command "
"used."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーオプション <code class=\"code\">completions-detailed</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、一部のコマンドでは補完表示時に取り得る"
"値の詳細が表示されます。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h o TAB</kbd> を指定する"
"と、docstring の1行目が含まれるほか、各シンボルが関数か変数か（など）も表示さ"
"れます。表示される詳細内容は、使用するコマンドによって異なります。"

