# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Narrowing</em> means focusing in on some portion of the "
"buffer, making the rest temporarily inaccessible.  The portion which you can "
"still get to is called the <em class=\"dfn\">accessible portion</em>.  "
"Canceling the narrowing, which makes the entire buffer once again "
"accessible, is called <em class=\"dfn\">widening</em>.  The bounds of "
"narrowing in effect in a buffer are called the buffer&rsquo;s <em "
"class=\"dfn\">restriction</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ナローイング</em>とは、バッファの一部に焦点を絞り、残りの部"
"分を一時的にアクセス不能にすることを指します。引き続きアクセス可能な部分は、"
"<em class=\"dfn\">アクセス可能領域</em>と呼ばれます。ナローイングを解除して"
"バッファ全体を再びアクセス可能にすることを、<em class=\"dfn\">ワイドニング</"
"em>と呼びます。バッファにおいて実際に適用されているナローイングの範囲を、バッ"
"ファの<em class=\"dfn\">制限</em>と呼びます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"Narrowing can make it easier to concentrate on a single subroutine or "
"paragraph by eliminating clutter.  It can also be used to limit the range of "
"operation of a replace command or repeating keyboard macro."
msgstr ""
"絞り込みを行うことで、不要な要素を排除し、単一のサブルーチンや段落に集中しや"
"すくなります。また、置換コマンドや繰り返し実行されるキーボードマクロの動作範"
"囲を制限する際にも活用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n n</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n n</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"Narrow down to between point and mark (<code class=\"code\">narrow-to-"
"region</code>)."
msgstr ""
"pointとmarkの間（<code class=\"code\">narrow-to-region</code>）に絞り込む。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n w</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n w</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"Widen to make the entire buffer accessible again (<code "
"class=\"code\">widen</code>)."
msgstr ""
"バッファ全体に再度アクセスできるように幅を広げる (<code "
"class=\"code\">widen</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n p</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n p</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"Narrow down to the current page (<code class=\"code\">narrow-to-page</code>)."
msgstr "現在のページ (<code class=\"code\">narrow-to-page</code>) に絞り込む。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n d</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n d</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"Narrow down to the current defun (<code class=\"code\">narrow-to-defun</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在の defun (<code class=\"code\">narrow-to-defun</code>) に絞り込む。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"When you have narrowed down to a part of the buffer, that part appears to be "
"all there is.  You can&rsquo;t see the rest, you can&rsquo;t move into it "
"(motion commands won&rsquo;t go outside the accessible part), you "
"can&rsquo;t change it in any way.  However, it is not gone, and if you save "
"the file all the inaccessible text will be saved.  The word &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Narrow</samp>&rsquo; appears in the mode line whenever "
"narrowing is in effect."
msgstr ""
"バッファの一部に絞り込むと、その部分だけが存在しているように見えます。残りの"
"部分は見えず、そこに移動することもできず（移動コマンドはアクセス可能な範囲外"
"には効きません）、どのような方法でも変更することはできません。しかし、消えて"
"しまったわけではなく、ファイルを保存すれば、アクセス不能なテキストもすべて保"
"存されます。絞り込みが有効な間は、モードラインに「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Narrow</samp>」という単語が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-n-n\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-narrow_002dto_002dregion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-n-n\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-narrow_002dto_002dregion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"The primary narrowing command is <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n n</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">narrow-to-region</code>).  It sets the current buffer&rsquo;s "
"restrictions so that the text in the current region remains accessible, but "
"all text before the region or after the region is inaccessible.  Point and "
"mark do not change."
msgstr ""
"主要な狭域化コマンドは <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n n</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">narrow-to-region</code>) です。これにより、現在のバッファの制"
"限が設定され、現在のリージョン内のテキストにはアクセス可能なまま、リージョン"
"より前または後のすべてのテキストにはアクセスできなくなります。ポイントとマー"
"クは変更されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-n-p\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-narrow_002dto_002dpage\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-n-d\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"narrow_002dto_002ddefun\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-n-p\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-narrow_002dto_002dpage\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-n-d\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"narrow_002dto_002ddefun\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"Alternatively, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n p</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">narrow-to-page</code>) to narrow down to the current page.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Pages.html\">Pages</a>, for the definition of a "
"page.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n d</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">narrow-to-"
"defun</code>) narrows down to the defun containing point (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Defuns.html\">Top-Level Definitions, or Defuns</a>)."
msgstr ""
"あるいは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n p</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">narrow-to-"
"page</code>) を使用して現在のページに絞り込みます。ページの定義については、"
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Pages.html\">Pages</a> を参照してください。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x n d</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">narrow-to-defun</code>) "
"は、point を含む defun に絞り込みます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Defuns.html\">Top-Level Definitions, or Defuns</a> を参照してくださ"
"い）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-n-w\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-widen\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-n-w\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-widen\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"The way to cancel narrowing is to widen with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n w</"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">widen</code>).  This makes all text in the buffer "
"accessible again."
msgstr ""
"ナローイングを解除するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x n w</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">widen</code>) でワイドにします。これにより、バッファ内のすべて"
"のテキストに再びアクセスできるようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"You can get information on what part of the buffer you are narrowed down to "
"using the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x =</kbd> command.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Position-Info.html\">Cursor Position Information</a>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x =</kbd>コマンドを使用すると、バッファのどの範囲に絞り"
"込まれているかの情報を取得できます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Position-"
"Info.html\">カーソル位置情報</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Narrowing.html
msgid ""
"Because narrowing can easily confuse users who do not understand it, <code "
"class=\"code\">narrow-to-region</code> is normally a disabled command.  "
"Attempting to use this command asks for confirmation and gives you the "
"option of enabling it; if you enable the command, confirmation will no "
"longer be required for it.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Disabling.html\">Disabling Commands</a>."
msgstr ""
"絞り込みは、仕組みを理解していないユーザーを混乱させやすいため、通常 <code "
"class=\"code\">narrow-to-region</code> は無効化されたコマンドとなっています。"
"このコマンドを使用しようとすると確認が求められ、有効化するかどうかの選択肢が"
"表示されます。コマンドを有効化すると、以降は確認が不要になります。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Disabling.html\">コマンドの無効化</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。"

