"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-TLS\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-Transport-Layer-Security\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-STARTTLS\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"Whenever Emacs establishes any network connection, it passes the established "
"connection to the <em class=\"dfn\">Network Security Manager</em> (<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr>).  <abbr class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr> is "
"responsible for enforcing the network security under your control.  "
"Currently, this works by using the Transport Layer Security (<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">TLS</abbr>) features."
msgstr ""
"Emacsがネットワーク接続を確立するたびに、その接続を<em class=\"dfn\">Network "
"Security Manager</em> (<abbr class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr>) に渡します。<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr>は、ユーザーが管理するネットワークセキュリティの"
"適用を担います。現在は、トランスポート層セキュリティ (<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">TLS</abbr>) 機能を用いてこれが実現されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-network_002dsecurity_002dlevel\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-network_002dsecurity_002dlevel\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">network-security-level</code> variable determines "
"the security level that <abbr class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr> enforces.  If its "
"value is <code class=\"code\">low</code>, no security checks are performed.  "
"This is not recommended, and will basically mean that your network "
"connections can&rsquo;t be trusted.  However, the setting can be useful in "
"limited circumstances, as when testing network issues."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">network-security-level</code> 変数は、<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr> が適用するセキュリティレベルを決定します。値が "
"<code class=\"code\">low</code> の場合、セキュリティチェックは行われません。"
"これは推奨されず、実質的にネットワーク接続が信頼できないことを意味します。た"
"だし、ネットワークの問題をテストする場合など、限定的な状況ではこの設定が有用"
"な場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"If this variable is <code class=\"code\">medium</code> (which is the "
"default), a number of checks will be performed.  If as result <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr> determines that the network connection might "
"not be trustworthy, it will make you aware of that, and will ask you what to "
"do about the network connection."
msgstr ""
"この変数が <code class=\"code\">medium</code>（デフォルト値）の場合、複数の"
"チェックが実行されます。その結果、<abbr class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr> がネット"
"ワーク接続の信頼性に疑問があると判断した場合、その旨を通知し、ネットワーク接"
"続に対してどのような対応を取るべきかを尋ねます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"You can decide to register a permanent security exception for an unverified "
"connection, a temporary exception, or refuse the connection entirely."
msgstr ""
"未検証の接続に対して、恒久的なセキュリティ例外を登録するか、一時的な例外を設"
"定するか、あるいは接続を完全に拒否するかを選択できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"network_002dsecurity_002dprotocol_002dchecks\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"network_002dsecurity_002dprotocol_002dchecks\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"In addition to the basic certificate correctness checks, several <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">TLS</abbr> algorithm checks are available.  Some "
"encryption technologies that were previously thought to be secure have shown "
"themselves to be fragile, so Emacs (by default) warns you about some of "
"these problems."
msgstr ""
"基本的な証明書の正当性チェックに加え、いくつかの<abbr class=\"acronym\">TLS</"
"abbr>アルゴリズムチェックが利用可能です。以前は安全と考えられていた一部の暗号"
"化技術に脆弱性があることが判明したため、Emacsでは（デフォルトで）こうした問題"
"の一部について警告を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"The protocol network checks is controlled via the <code "
"class=\"code\">network-security-protocol-checks</code> variable."
msgstr ""
"プロトコルネットワークのチェックは、<code class=\"code\">network-security-"
"protocol-checks</code>変数で制御されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"It&rsquo;s an alist where the first element of each association is the name "
"of the check, and the second element is the security level where the check "
"should be used."
msgstr ""
"各関連付けの第1要素がチェック名、第2要素がそのチェックを適用すべきセキュリ"
"ティレベルとなるリストです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"An element like <code class=\"code\">(rc4 medium)</code> will result in the "
"function <code class=\"code\">nsm-protocol-check--rc4</code> being called "
"like thus: <code class=\"code\">(nsm-protocol-check--"
"rc4&nbsp;host&nbsp;port&nbsp;status&nbsp;settings)</code>.  The function "
"should return non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the connection should "
"proceed and <code class=\"code\">nil</code> otherwise."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(rc4 medium)</code> のような要素がある場合、関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">nsm-protocol-check--rc4</code> は <code class=\"code\">(nsm-"
"protocol-check--rc4&nbsp;host&nbsp;port&nbsp;status&nbsp;settings)</code> の"
"ように呼び出されます。この関数は、接続を進める場合は non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を、そうでない場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"Below is a list of the checks done on the default <code "
"class=\"code\">medium</code> level."
msgstr ""
"以下は、デフォルトの <code class=\"code\">medium</code> レベルで実施された"
"チェックの一覧です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid "unable to verify a <abbr class=\"acronym\">TLS</abbr> certificate"
msgstr "<abbr class=\"acronym\">TLS</abbr>証明書の検証ができません"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"If the connection is a <abbr class=\"acronym\">TLS</abbr>, <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">SSL</abbr> or <abbr class=\"acronym\">STARTTLS</abbr> "
"connection, <abbr class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr> will check whether the "
"certificate used to establish the identity of the server we&rsquo;re "
"connecting to can be verified."
msgstr ""
"接続が<abbr class=\"acronym\">TLS</abbr>、<abbr class=\"acronym\">SSL</"
"abbr>、または<abbr class=\"acronym\">STARTTLS</abbr>接続である場合、<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr>は、接続先サーバーの身元を立証するために使用され"
"る証明書が検証可能かどうかを確認します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"While an invalid certificate is often the cause for concern (there could be "
"a Man-in-the-Middle hijacking your network connection and stealing your "
"password), there may be valid reasons for going ahead with the connection "
"anyway.  For instance, the server may be using a self-signed certificate, or "
"the certificate may have expired.  It&rsquo;s up to you to determine whether "
"it&rsquo;s acceptable to continue with the connection."
msgstr ""
"無効な証明書は懸念材料となることが多いですが（中間者攻撃によってネットワーク"
"接続を乗っ取られ、パスワードを盗まれる可能性があります）、それでも接続を続行"
"すべき正当な理由がある場合もあります。例えば、サーバーが自己署名証明書を使用"
"していたり、証明書の有効期限が切れていたりする場合などです。接続を続行しても"
"差し支えないかの判断は、ご自身に委ねられています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid "a self-signed certificate has changed"
msgstr "自己署名証明書が変更されました"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"If you&rsquo;ve previously accepted a self-signed certificate, but it has "
"now changed, that could mean that the server has just changed the "
"certificate, but it might also mean that the network connection has been "
"hijacked."
msgstr ""
"以前に自己署名証明書を受理していたものの、現在それが変更されている場合、サー"
"バーが証明書を変更しただけである可能性もありますが、ネットワーク接続が乗っ取"
"られた可能性もあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid "previously encrypted connection now unencrypted"
msgstr "以前は暗号化されていた接続が、現在は暗号化されていない"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"If the connection is unencrypted, but it was encrypted in previous sessions, "
"this might mean that there is a proxy between you and the server that strips "
"away <abbr class=\"acronym\">STARTTLS</abbr> announcements, leaving the "
"connection unencrypted.  This is usually very suspicious."
msgstr ""
"接続が暗号化されていないものの、以前のセッションでは暗号化されていた場合、ク"
"ライアントとサーバーの間に<abbr class=\"acronym\">STARTTLS</abbr>通知を除去す"
"るプロキシが存在し、接続が暗号化されていない状態になっている可能性がありま"
"す。これは通常、非常に不審な状況です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid "talking to an unencrypted service when sending a password"
msgstr "パスワード送信時に暗号化されていないサービスと通信すること"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"When connecting to an <abbr class=\"acronym\">IMAP</abbr> or <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">POP3</abbr> server, these should usually be encrypted, "
"because it&rsquo;s common to send passwords over these connections.  "
"Similarly, if you&rsquo;re sending email via <abbr class=\"acronym\">SMTP</"
"abbr> that requires a password, you usually want that connection to be "
"encrypted.  If the connection isn&rsquo;t encrypted, <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr> will warn you."
msgstr ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">IMAP</abbr>または<abbr class=\"acronym\">POP3</abbr>"
"サーバーに接続する場合、これらの接続ではパスワードを送信することが一般的であ"
"るため、通常は暗号化する必要があります。同様に、パスワードを必要とする<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">SMTP</abbr>経由でメールを送信する場合も、通常はその接続を暗"
"号化することが望ましいです。接続が暗号化されていない場合、<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr>が警告を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid "Diffie-Hellman low prime bits"
msgstr "ディフィー・ヘルマン低素数ビット"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"When doing the public key exchange, the number of prime bits should be high "
"enough to ensure that the channel can&rsquo;t be eavesdropped on by third "
"parties.  If this number is too low, Emacs will warn you.  (This is the "
"<code class=\"code\">diffie-hellman-prime-bits</code> check in <code "
"class=\"code\">network-security-protocol-checks</code>)."
msgstr ""
"公開鍵交換を行う際、チャネルが第三者に盗聴されないことを確実にするため、素数"
"ビット数は十分に多く設定する必要があります。この数値が低すぎる場合、Emacsが警"
"告を表示します。（これは<code class=\"code\">network-security-protocol-"
"checks</code>における<code class=\"code\">diffie-hellman-prime-bits</code>の"
"チェックです）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid "<abbr class=\"acronym\">RC4</abbr> stream cipher"
msgstr "<abbr class=\"acronym\">RC4</abbr>ストリーム暗号"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"The <abbr class=\"acronym\">RC4</abbr> stream cipher is believed to be of "
"low quality and may allow eavesdropping by third parties.  (This is the "
"<code class=\"code\">rc4</code> check in <code class=\"code\">network-"
"security-protocol-checks</code>)."
msgstr ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">RC4</abbr>ストリーム暗号は品質が低く、第三者による盗"
"聴を許してしまう可能性があると考えられています。  （これは<code "
"class=\"code\">network-security-protocol-checks</code>における<code "
"class=\"code\">rc4</code>のチェックです）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">SHA1</abbr> in the host certificate or in "
"intermediate certificates"
msgstr "ホスト証明書または中間証明書内の<abbr class=\"acronym\">SHA1</abbr>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"It is believed that if an intermediate certificate uses the <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">SHA1</abbr> hashing algorithm, then third parties can "
"issue certificates pretending to be that issuing instance.  These "
"connections are therefore vulnerable to man-in-the-middle attacks.  (These "
"are the <code class=\"code\">signature-sha1</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">intermediate-sha1</code> checks in <code "
"class=\"code\">network-security-protocol-checks</code>)."
msgstr ""
"中間証明書に<abbr class=\"acronym\">SHA1</abbr>ハッシュアルゴリズムが使用され"
"ている場合、第三者がその発行機関を装った証明書を発行できると考えられていま"
"す。そのため、これらの接続は中間者攻撃に対して脆弱です。（これらは<code "
"class=\"code\">network-security-protocol-checks</code>における<code "
"class=\"code\">signature-sha1</code>および<code class=\"code\">intermediate-"
"sha1</code>のチェックです）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">SSL1</abbr>, <abbr class=\"acronym\">SSL2</abbr> and "
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">SSL3</abbr>"
msgstr ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">SSL1</abbr>、<abbr class=\"acronym\">SSL2</abbr>、"
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">SSL3</abbr>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"The protocols older than <abbr class=\"acronym\">TLS1.0</abbr> are believed "
"to be vulnerable to a variety of attacks, and you may want to avoid using "
"these if what you&rsquo;re doing requires higher security.  (This is the "
"<code class=\"code\">version</code> check in <code class=\"code\">network-"
"security-protocol-checks</code>)."
msgstr ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">TLS1.0</abbr>より古いプロトコルは、さまざまな攻撃に対"
"して脆弱であると考えられており、より高いセキュリティが求められる用途では、こ"
"れらの使用を避けるのがよいでしょう。（これが<code class=\"code\">network-"
"security-protocol-checks</code>における<code class=\"code\">version</code>の"
"チェックです）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid "Triple DES (or <abbr class=\"acronym\">3DES</abbr>) cipher"
msgstr "トリプルDES（または<abbr class=\"acronym\">3DES</abbr>）暗号"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"The <abbr class=\"acronym\">3DES</abbr> stream cipher provides at most 112 "
"bits of effective security, and a major security vulnerability in it was "
"disclosed in 2016 (CVE-2016-2183).  It has been deprecated by NIST in all "
"applications from late 2023 onwards.  (This is the <code class=\"code\">3des-"
"cipher</code> check in <code class=\"code\">network-security-protocol-"
"checks</code>)."
msgstr ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">3DES</abbr>ストリーム暗号が提供する実効セキュリティは"
"最大112ビットであり、2016年には重大なセキュリティ脆弱性が公表されました"
"（CVE-2016-2183）。NISTは2023年後半以降、すべてのアプリケーションにおいて同暗"
"号を非推奨としています。（これは<code class=\"code\">network-security-"
"protocol-checks</code>における<code class=\"code\">3des-cipher</code>のチェッ"
"クです）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">network-security-level</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">high</code>, the following checks will be made, in addition "
"to the above:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">network-security-level</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">high</code> の場合、上記に加えて以下のチェックが行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid "a validated certificate changes the public key"
msgstr "検証済み証明書は公開鍵を変更する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"Servers change their keys occasionally, and that is normally nothing to be "
"concerned about.  However, if you are worried that your network connections "
"are being hijacked by agencies who have access to pliable Certificate "
"Authorities which issue new certificates for third-party services, you may "
"want to keep track of these changes."
msgstr ""
"サーバーは時折キーを変更しますが、通常は特に気にする必要はありません。ただ"
"し、サードパーティサービス向けの新規証明書を発行する、操作可能な認証局にアク"
"セスできる機関によってネットワーク接続が乗っ取られることを懸念される場合は、"
"こうした変更を追跡しておくとよいでしょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"Finally, if <code class=\"code\">network-security-level</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">paranoid</code>, you will also be notified the first time "
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr> sees any new certificate.  This will "
"allow you to inspect all the certificates from all the connections that "
"Emacs makes."
msgstr ""
"最後に、<code class=\"code\">network-security-level</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">paranoid</code> である場合、<abbr class=\"acronym\">NSM</"
"abbr> が初めて新しい証明書を検知した際にも通知が届きます。これにより、Emacs "
"が行うすべての接続から得られるすべての証明書を確認できるようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"The following additional variables can be used to control details of <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr> operation:"
msgstr ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr>の動作の詳細を制御するには、以下の追加変数"
"を使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-nsm_002dsettings_002dfile\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">nsm-"
"settings-file</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"nsm_002dsettings_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-nsm_002dsettings_002dfile\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">nsm-"
"settings-file</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"nsm_002dsettings_002dfile\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"This is the file where <abbr class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr> stores details "
"about connections.  It defaults to <samp class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/network-"
"security.data</samp>."
msgstr ""
"これは、<abbr class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr>が接続に関する詳細情報を格納する"
"ファイルです。デフォルト値は<samp class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/network-"
"security.data</samp>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-nsm_002dsave_002dhost_002dnames\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">nsm-save-host-names</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-nsm_002dsave_002dhost_002dnames\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-nsm_002dsave_002dhost_002dnames\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">nsm-save-host-names</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-nsm_002dsave_002dhost_002dnames\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Network-Security.html
msgid ""
"By default, host names will not be saved for non-<code "
"class=\"code\">STARTTLS</code> connections.  Instead a host/port hash is "
"used to identify connections.  This means that one can&rsquo;t casually read "
"the settings file to see what servers the user has connected to.  If this "
"variable is <code class=\"code\">t</code>, <abbr class=\"acronym\">NSM</"
"abbr> will also save host names in the <code class=\"code\">nsm-settings-"
"file</code>."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、<code class=\"code\">STARTTLS</code> 以外の接続についてはホス"
"ト名が保存されません。代わりに、ホスト/ポートハッシュを用いて接続を識別しま"
"す。つまり、設定ファイルを気軽に読み取って、ユーザーがどのサーバーに接続した"
"かを確認することはできません。この変数が <code class=\"code\">t</code> の場"
"合、<abbr class=\"acronym\">NSM</abbr> は <code class=\"code\">nsm-settings-"
"file</code> にもホスト名を保存します。"

