# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Not-Exiting-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">isearch-allow-scroll</code> feature also affects "
"some other commands, such as <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 2</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">split-window-below</code>) and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x ^</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">enlarge-window</code>), which don&rsquo;t exactly "
"scroll but do affect where the text appears on the screen.  In fact, it "
"affects any command that has a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> <code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-scroll</code> property.  So you can control which "
"commands are affected by changing these properties."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">isearch-allow-scroll</code> 機能は、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x 2</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">split-window-below</code>) "
"や <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x ^</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">enlarge-window</"
"code>) といった他のいくつかのコマンドにも影響を与えます。これらは厳密にはスク"
"ロールではありませんが、画面上のテキストの表示位置には影響を及ぼします。実"
"際、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> や <code class=\"code\">isearch-scroll</"
"code> 以外のプロパティを持つあらゆるコマンドに影響します。したがって、これら"
"のプロパティを変更することで、どのコマンドに影響が出るかを制御できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Not-Exiting-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"For example, to make <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h l</kbd> usable within an "
"incremental search in all future Emacs sessions, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h "
"c</kbd> to find what command it runs (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Key-"
"Help.html\">Documentation for a Key</a>), which is <code class=\"code\">view-"
"lossage</code>.  Then you can put the following line in your init file (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The Emacs Initialization File</"
"a>):"
msgstr ""
"例えば、今後のすべてのEmacsセッションにおいて、インクリメンタル検索内で<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h l</kbd>を使えるようにするには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h c</"
"kbd>を使用してそれがどのコマンドを実行するかを確認し（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Key-Help.html\">キーのドキュメント</a>を参照）、それが<code "
"class=\"code\">view-lossage</code>であることを調べます。その後、initファイル"
"に以下の行を記述します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">Emacs初期"
"化ファイル</a>を参照）："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Not-Exiting-Isearch.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(put 'view-lossage 'isearch-scroll t)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Not-Exiting-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"This feature can be applied to any command that doesn&rsquo;t permanently "
"change point, the buffer contents, the match data, the current buffer, or "
"the selected window and frame.  The command must not itself attempt an "
"incremental search.  This feature is disabled if <code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-allow-scroll</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> (which it is by default)."
msgstr ""
"この機能は、ポイント、バッファの内容、マッチデータ、現在のバッファ、または選"
"択中のウィンドウやフレームを恒久的に変更しないあらゆるコマンドに適用できま"
"す。コマンド自体がインクリメンタル検索を試みてはなりません。<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-allow-scroll</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> である場合（デフォルトではそうなります）、この機能は無効になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/Not-Exiting-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-isearch_002dallow_002dmotion\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dmotion_002dchanges_002ddirection\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-isearch_002dallow_002dmotion\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dmotion_002dchanges_002ddirection\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Not-Exiting-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"Likewise, if you change the variable <code class=\"code\">isearch-allow-"
"motion</code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, this enables "
"the use of the keyboard motion commands <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&lt;</kbd>, "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&gt;</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-v</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-v</kbd>, to move respectively to the first occurrence of the "
"current search string in the buffer, the last one, the first one after the "
"current window, and the last one before the current window.  The search "
"direction does not change when these motion commands are used, unless you "
"change the variable <code class=\"code\">isearch-motion-changes-direction</"
"code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, in which case the "
"search direction is forward after <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&lt;</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-v</kbd>, and backward after <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&gt;</kbd> "
"and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-v</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"同様に、変数 <code class=\"code\">isearch-allow-motion</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に変更すると、キーボードの移動コマンド "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&lt;</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&gt;</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-v</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-v</kbd> が使用可能になり、それ"
"ぞれバッファ内の現在の検索文字列の最初の出現箇所、最後の出現箇所、現在のウィ"
"ンドウ以降の最初の出現箇所、および現在のウィンドウより前の最後の出現箇所へ移"
"動できます。これらの移動コマンドを使用しても検索方向は変わりませんが、変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">isearch-motion-changes-direction</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に変更した場合は例外となり、その場合の検索"
"方向は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&lt;</kbd> および <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-v</kbd> "
"の後は前方へ、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&gt;</kbd> および <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-v</"
"kbd> の後は後方となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
