"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-isearch_002dmove-property\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Not-Exiting-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-on-move</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, you can extend the search string without using the "
"shift key for cursor motion commands, but it applies only for certain motion "
"command that have the <code class=\"code\">isearch-move</code> property on "
"their symbols."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">isearch-yank-on-move</code> が <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> の場合、カーソル移動コマンドでシフトキーを使わずに検索文字列を拡張でき"
"ますが、これはシンボルに <code class=\"code\">isearch-move</code> プロパティ"
"を持つ特定の移動コマンドにのみ適用されます。"

