msgstr ""
"<span>15.5 レジスタへの数値の格納<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Keeping-"
"Numbers-in-Registers\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Number-Registers.html
