"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-saving-number-in-a-register\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Number-Registers.html
msgid ""
"There are commands to store a number in a register, to insert the number in "
"the buffer in decimal, and to increment it.  These commands can be useful in "
"keyboard macros (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keyboard-"
"Macros.html\">Keyboard Macros</a>)."
msgstr ""
"レジスタに数値を格納したり、バッファに10進数で数値を挿入したり、その数値をイ"
"ンクリメントしたりするコマンドがあります。これらのコマンドは、キーボードマク"
"ロ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keyboard-Macros.html\">キーボードマクロ</a>を参"
"照）で便利に活用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Number-Registers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-number_002dto_002dregister\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-r-n\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u <var "
"class=\"var\">number</var> C-x r n <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-r-n\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-number_002dto_002dregister\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-r-n\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u <var "
"class=\"var\">number</var> C-x r n <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-r-n\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Number-Registers.html
msgid ""
"Store <var class=\"var\">number</var> into register <var class=\"var\">r</"
"var> (<code class=\"code\">number-to-register</code>)."
msgstr ""
"レジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</var> (<code class=\"code\">number-to-"
"register</code>) に <var class=\"var\">number</var> を格納する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Number-Registers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-increment_002dregister\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-r-_002b\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u <var "
"class=\"var\">number</var> C-x r + <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-r-_002b\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-increment_002dregister\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dx-r-_002b\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u <var "
"class=\"var\">number</var> C-x r + <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dx-r-_002b\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Number-Registers.html
msgid ""
"If <var class=\"var\">r</var> contains a number, increment the number in "
"that register by <var class=\"var\">number</var>.  Note that command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x r +</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">increment-register</code>) "
"behaves differently if <var class=\"var\">r</var> contains text.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-Registers.html\">Saving Text in Registers</a>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">r</var> に数値が含まれている場合、そのレジスタの数値を "
"<var class=\"var\">number</var> だけインクリメントします。なお、<var "
"class=\"var\">r</var> にテキストが含まれている場合、コマンド <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x r +</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">increment-register</code>) "
"の動作が異なります。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Text-Registers.html\">レジスタへ"
"のテキストの保存</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Number-Registers.html
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangle-Registers.html
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r i <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r i <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Number-Registers.html
msgid ""
"Insert the number from register <var class=\"var\">r</var> into the buffer."
msgstr "レジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</var> の数値をバッファに挿入する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Number-Registers.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r i</kbd> is the same command used to insert any "
"other sort of register contents into the buffer.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r "
"+</kbd> with no numeric argument increments the register value by 1; <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x r n</kbd> with no numeric argument stores zero in the "
"register."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r i</kbd> は、他のあらゆる種類のレジスタ内容をバッファ"
"に挿入する際に用いられるものと同じコマンドです。数値引数を伴わない <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x r +</kbd> はレジスタ値を1インクリメントし、数値引数を伴わな"
"い <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r n</kbd> はレジスタに0を格納します。"

