# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"<span>6.2 Using Emacs with Virtual Keyboards<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Using-Emacs-with-Virtual-Keyboards\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>6.2 仮想キーボードを使用したEmacsの利用<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Using-Emacs-with-Virtual-Keyboards\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-virtual-keyboards\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-on_002dscreen-keyboards\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-virtual-keyboards\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-on_002dscreen-keyboards\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"When there is no physical keyboard attached to a system, its windowing "
"system might provide an on-screen keyboard, widely known as a &ldquo;virtual "
"keyboard&rdquo;, containing rows of clickable buttons that send keyboard "
"input to the application, much as a real keyboard would."
msgstr ""
"システムに物理キーボードが接続されていない場合、そのウィンドウシステムは、"
"「仮想キーボード」として広く知られる画面上のキーボードを提供することがありま"
"す。これには、実際のキーボードと同様にアプリケーションへキーボード入力を送信"
"する、クリック可能なボタンが行状に配置されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"This virtual keyboard is hidden when the focused program is not requesting "
"text input as it occupies scarce space on display, and programs are "
"therefore enjoined to display it once they are ready to accept keyboard "
"input.  Systems running X detect when the presence of the virtual keyboard "
"is warranted, but on others such as Android Emacs is responsible for "
"displaying it when need be, generally in reaction to a touch screen "
"&ldquo;tap&rdquo; gesture (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Touchscreens.html\">Using Emacs on Touchscreens</a>) or the "
"minibuffer being brought into use (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Minibuffer.html\">The Minibuffer</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この仮想キーボードは、フォーカスされているプログラムがテキスト入力を要求して"
"いないときは非表示となります。画面上の限られたスペースを占有するためであり、"
"したがってプログラムは、キーボード入力を受け付ける準備が整った時点でこれを表"
"示することが義務付けられています。Xを搭載しているシステムでは、仮想キーボード"
"の表示が必要なタイミングを検知しますが、Androidなどの他のシステムでは、通常、"
"タッチスクリーンの「タップ」操作（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Touchscreens.html\">タッチスクリーンでのEmacsの使用</a>を参照）や、ミ"
"ニバッファが利用可能になった際（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer.html\">"
"ミニバッファ</a>を参照）に反応して、Emacsが必要に応じて表示を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"touch_002dscreen_002dset_002dpoint_002dcommands\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"touch_002dscreen_002dset_002dpoint_002dcommands\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"When a &ldquo;tap&rdquo; gesture results in a command being executed, Emacs "
"checks whether the command is meant to set the point by searching for it in "
"the list <code class=\"code\">touch-screen-set-point-commands</code>.  If it "
"is, and the text beneath the new point is not read-only, the virtual "
"keyboard is activated, in anticipation of the user input there."
msgstr ""
"「タップ」操作によってコマンドが実行される際、Emacsはリスト <code "
"class=\"code\">touch-screen-set-point-commands</code> の中からそのコマンドを"
"検索し、ポイントを設定することを目的としたものかどうかを確認します。該当する"
"コマンドであり、かつ新しいポイントより下のテキストが読み取り専用でない場合"
"は、ユーザー入力に備えて仮想キーボードが有効化されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"The default value of <code class=\"code\">touch-screen-set-point-commands</"
"code> holds only the command <code class=\"code\">mouse-set-point</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mouse-Commands.html\">Mouse Commands for "
"Editing</a>), which is the default binding of <code class=\"code\">mouse-1</"
"code>, and therefore of touchscreen tap gestures as well."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">touch-screen-set-point-commands</code> のデフォルト値に"
"はコマンド <code class=\"code\">mouse-set-point</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Mouse-Commands.html\">編集用マウスコマンド</a>を参照）のみが割り当てら"
"れており、これは <code class=\"code\">mouse-1</code> のデフォルトバインディン"
"グであり、したがってタッチスクリーンのタップジェスチャーのデフォルトバイン"
"ディングでもあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"touch_002dscreen_002ddisplay_002dkeyboard\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"touch_002dscreen_002ddisplay_002dkeyboard\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"The user option <code class=\"code\">touch-screen-display-keyboard</code> "
"compels Emacs to display the virtual keyboard on all tap gestures even if "
"the text is read only; it may also be set buffer locally, in which case "
"Emacs will always display the keyboard in response to a tap on a window "
"displaying the buffer it is set in."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーオプション <code class=\"code\">touch-screen-display-keyboard</code> "
"を指定すると、テキストが読み取り専用であっても、すべてのタップジェスチャで "
"Emacs が仮想キーボードを表示するようになります。また、バッファ単位で設定する"
"ことも可能で、その場合は、そのバッファが表示されているウィンドウ上でタップが"
"行われるたびに、Emacs は常にキーボードを表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"There are moreover several functions that display or hide the on-screen "
"keyboard.  For more details, See <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/On_002dScreen-"
"Keyboards.html#On_002dScreen-Keyboards\">On-Screen Keyboards</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"さらに、画面上のキーボードを表示または非表示にする関数がいくつか用意されてい"
"ます。詳細については、<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</"
"cite>の<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/elisp/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html#On_002dScreen-"
"Keyboards\">画面上のキーボード</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quitting_002c-without-a-keyboard\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quitting_002c-without-a-keyboard\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"Since it may not be possible for Emacs to display the virtual keyboard while "
"it is executing a command, Emacs implements a feature on window systems "
"frequently equipped with no physical keyboard, by which two rapid clicks of "
"a hardware button that is always present on the device induces a quit.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Quitting.html\">Quitting and Aborting</a>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsがコマンドを実行している間に仮想キーボードを表示できない場合があるため、"
"物理的なキーボードを備えていないことが多いウィンドウシステムにおいて、デバイ"
"スに常に搭載されているハードウェアボタンを2回素早くクリックすることで終了させ"
"る機能を実装しています。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Quitting.html\">終了と中断</"
"a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-x_002dquit_002dkeysym\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-android_002dquit_002dkeycode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-x_002dquit_002dkeysym\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-android_002dquit_002dkeycode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"No such button is enabled on X, but one can be configured through the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">x-quit-keysym</code>, whereas the default key "
"is the volume down button on Android, which is also configurable through a "
"variable, <code class=\"code\">android-quit-keycode</code>."
msgstr ""
"Xではそのようなボタンは有効になっていませんが、変数 <code class=\"code\">x-"
"quit-keysym</code> で設定可能です。一方、デフォルトのキーはAndroidの音量ダウ"
"ンボタンであり、こちらも変数 <code class=\"code\">android-quit-keycode</"
"code> で設定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text-conversion_002c-keyboards\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text-conversion_002c-keyboards\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"Most input methods designed to work with virtual keyboards edit text "
"differently from desktop input methods."
msgstr ""
"仮想キーボード向けに設計された入力メソッドの多くは、デスクトップ向けの入力メ"
"ソッドとはテキストの編集方法が異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"On a conventional desktop windowing system, an input method will simply "
"display the contents of any ongoing character composition on screen, and "
"send key events reflecting its contents to Emacs after it is confirmed by "
"the user."
msgstr ""
"従来のデスクトップウィンドウシステムでは、入力メソッドは単に進行中の文字入力"
"内容を画面に表示し、ユーザーによって確定された後、その内容を反映したキーイベ"
"ントをEmacsに送信します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"By contrast, virtual keyboard input methods directly perform edits to the "
"selected window of each frame; this is known as &ldquo;text "
"conversion&rdquo;, or &ldquo;string conversion&rdquo; under the X Window "
"System."
msgstr ""
"これに対し、仮想キーボードによる入力方式では、各フレームの選択されたウィンド"
"ウに対して直接編集が行われます。これは「テキスト変換」、あるいはX Window "
"Systemでは「文字列変換」と呼ばれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"Emacs enables these input methods whenever the buffer local value of <code "
"class=\"code\">text-conversion-style</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, that is to say, generally inside derivatives of <code "
"class=\"code\">text-mode</code> and <code class=\"code\">prog-mode</code>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、バッファローカル値 <code class=\"code\">text-conversion-style</"
"code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、すなわち一般的に "
"<code class=\"code\">text-mode</code> や <code class=\"code\">prog-mode</"
"code> の派生内において、これらの入力メソッドが利用可能になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"Text conversion is performed asynchronously whenever Emacs receives a "
"request to perform the conversion from the input method, and Emacs is not "
"currently reading a key sequence for which one prefix key has already been "
"read (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keys.html\">Keys</a>).  After the "
"conversion completes, a <code class=\"code\">text-conversion</code> event is "
"sent.  See <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Misc-Events.html#Misc-Events\">Misc Events</a> "
"in <cite class=\"cite\">the Emacs Reference Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"テキスト変換は、Emacsが入力メソッドから変換のリクエストを受信し、かつ既にいず"
"れかのプレフィックスキーが読み取られたキーシーケンスを現在読み取っていない場"
"合に、非同期で実行されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Keys.html\">Keys</a>を"
"参照）。変換が完了すると、<code class=\"code\">text-conversion</code>イベント"
"が送信されます。<cite class=\"cite\">Emacsリファレンスマニュアル</cite>の<a "
"data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Misc-Events.html#Misc-Events\">Misc Events</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text_002dconversion_002dface\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text_002dconversion_002dface\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"If the input method needs to work on a region of the buffer, then the region "
"is designated the &ldquo;composing region&rdquo; (or &ldquo;preconversion "
"region&rdquo;).  The variable <code class=\"code\">text-conversion-face</"
"code> controls whether to display the composing region in a distinctive "
"face, and if so, which face to employ."
msgstr ""
"入力メソッドがバッファの特定領域で動作する必要がある場合、その領域は「合成領"
"域」（または「事前変換領域」）として指定されます。変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">text-conversion-face</code> は、合成領域を専用のフェイスで表示"
"するかどうか、および表示する場合にどのフェイスを使用するかを制御します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/On_002dScreen-Keyboards.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"nav-button\"><span class=\"nav-label\">Previous: </span><span "
"class=\"nav-link\"><a href=\"Touchscreens.html\">Using Emacs on "
"Touchscreens</a></span></span>, <span class=\"nav-button\"><span class=\"nav-"
