msgid ""
"<span>32.7 Operating on Files<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Operating-on-"
"Files-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>32.7 ファイルの操作<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Operating-on-"
"Files-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-operating-on-files-in-Dired\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-operating-on-files-in-Dired\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"This section describes the basic Dired commands to operate on one file or "
"several files.  Many of these commands are capital letters; all of them use "
"the minibuffer, either to read an argument or to ask for confirmation, "
"before they act.  All of them let you specify the files to manipulate in "
"these ways:"
msgstr ""
"本節では、1つのファイルまたは複数のファイルを操作するためのDiredの基本コマン"
"ドについて説明します。これらのコマンドの多くは大文字で表記されており、いずれ"
"も実行前に、引数の読み取りや確認を求めるためにミニバッファを使用します。ま"
"た、いずれのコマンドでも、以下のような方法で操作対象のファイルを指定できま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"If you give the command a numeric prefix argument <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var>, it operates on the next <var class=\"var\">n</var> files, starting "
"with the current file.  (If <var class=\"var\">n</var> is negative, the "
"command operates on the &minus;<var class=\"var\">n</var> files preceding "
"the current line.)"
msgstr ""
"コマンドに数値のプレフィックス引数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> を指定すると、"
"現在のファイルから始まる次の <var class=\"var\">n</var> 個のファイルに対して"
"処理が行われます。（<var class=\"var\">n</var> が負の値の場合、コマンドは現在"
"の行より前の &minus;<var class=\"var\">n</var> 個のファイルに対して処理を行い"
"ます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"Otherwise, if some files are marked with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</"
"samp>&rsquo;, the command operates on all those files."
msgstr ""
"そうでない場合、一部のファイルに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; "
"が指定されていれば、コマンドはそれらすべてのファイルに対して処理を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid "Otherwise, the command operates on the current file only."
msgstr "それ以外の場合、コマンドは現在のファイルに対してのみ動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"Certain other Dired commands, such as <kbd class=\"kbd\">!</kbd> and the "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; commands, use the same "
"conventions to decide which files to work on."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">!</kbd>や&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;コマン"
"ドなど、その他の一部のDiredコマンドでも、どのファイルを操作するかを決定するた"
"めに同様の規約が用いられています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"In addition to Dired commands described here, you can also invoke Version "
"Control (VC) commands on one or more files shown in a Dired buffer.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Version-Control.html\">Version Control</a>."
msgstr ""
"ここで説明するDiredコマンドに加えて、Diredバッファに表示されている1つ以上の"
"ファイルに対してバージョン管理（VC）コマンドを実行することもできます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Version-Control.html\">バージョン管理</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002ddwim_002dtarget\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-two-directories-_0028in-Dired_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002ddwim_002dtarget\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-two-directories-_0028in-Dired_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"Commands which ask for a destination directory, such as those which copy and "
"rename files or create links for them, try to guess the default target "
"directory for the operation.  Normally, they suggest the Dired "
"buffer&rsquo;s default directory, but if the option <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-dwim-target</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, and if there is another Dired buffer displayed in some window, that "
"other buffer&rsquo;s directory is suggested instead.  You can customize "
"<code class=\"code\">dired-dwim-target</code> to prefer either the next "
"window with a Dired buffer, or the most recently used window with a Dired "
"buffer, or to use any other function.  When the value is a function, it will "
"be called with no arguments and is expected to return a list of directories "
"which will be used as defaults (i.e., default target and &ldquo;future "
"history&rdquo;)."
msgstr ""
"ファイルのコピーやリネーム、あるいはリンクの作成など、宛先ディレクトリを指定"
"するコマンドは、その操作のデフォルトの対象ディレクトリを推測しようとします。"
"通常はDiredバッファのデフォルトディレクトリが候補となりますが、オプション "
"<code class=\"code\">dired-dwim-target</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外であり、かついずれかのウィンドウに別のDiredバッファが表示されている"
"場合は、代わりにそのバッファのディレクトリが候補となります。<code "
"class=\"code\">dired-dwim-target</code> をカスタマイズすることで、次にDired"
"バッファがあるウィンドウ、直近で使用したDiredバッファのあるウィンドウ、あるい"
"はその他の任意の関数を優先させることができます。値が関数である場合、その関数"
"は引数なしで呼び出され、デフォルト（すなわちデフォルトの対象および「future "
"history」）として使用されるディレクトリのリストを返すことが期待されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid "Here are the file-manipulating Dired commands that operate on files."
msgstr "ファイルを操作するDiredのファイル操作コマンドは以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-copying-files-_0028in-Dired_0029\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-dired_002ddo_002dcopy\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C <var "
"class=\"var\">new</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-dired_002ddo_002dcopy\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-copying-files-_0028in-Dired_0029\"></a> "
"<a id=\"index-dired_002ddo_002dcopy\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C <var "
"class=\"var\">new</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-dired_002ddo_002dcopy\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"Copy the specified files (<code class=\"code\">dired-do-copy</code>).  The "
"argument <var class=\"var\">new</var> is the directory to copy into, or (if "
"copying a single file) the new name.  This is like the shell command <code "
"class=\"code\">cp</code>."
msgstr ""
"指定したファイル (<code class=\"code\">dired-do-copy</code>) をコピーします。"
"引数 <var class=\"var\">new</var> はコピー先のディレクトリ、または（単一の"
"ファイルをコピーする場合）新しいファイル名です。これはシェルコマンド <code "
"class=\"code\">cp</code> と同様です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dired_002dcreate_002ddestination_002ddirs\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dired_002dcreate_002ddestination_002ddirs\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"The option <code class=\"code\">dired-create-destination-dirs</code> "
"controls whether Dired should create non-existent directories in the "
"destination while copying/renaming files.  The default value <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> means Dired never creates such missing "
"directories; the value <code class=\"code\">always</code>, means Dired "
"automatically creates them; the value <code class=\"code\">ask</code> means "
"Dired asks you for confirmation before creating them."
msgstr ""
"オプション <code class=\"code\">dired-create-destination-dirs</code> は、ファ"
"イルのコピーやリネーム時に、Dired がコピー先に存在しないディレクトリを作成す"
"るかどうかを制御します。デフォルト値の <code class=\"code\">nil</code> は、"
"Dired がそのような不足しているディレクトリを一切作成しないことを意味します。"
"値 <code class=\"code\">always</code> は、Dired が自動的に作成することを意味"
"し、値 <code class=\"code\">ask</code> は、作成前に確認を求めることを意味しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dired_002dcreate_002ddestination_002ddirs_002don_002dtrailing_002ddirsep\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dired_002dcreate_002ddestination_002ddirs_002don_002dtrailing_002ddirsep\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"If the option <code class=\"code\">dired-create-destination-dirs-on-trailing-"
"dirsep</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> in addition to <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-create-destination-dirs</code>, a trailing directory "
"separator at the destination directory is treated specially.  In that case, "
"when copying to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">test/</samp>&rsquo; and no "
"directory &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">test</samp>&rsquo; exists already, it "
"will be created and the specified source files or directories are copied "
"into the newly created directory."
msgstr ""
"オプション <code class=\"code\">dired-create-destination-dirs-on-trailing-"
"dirsep</code> が <code class=\"code\">dired-create-destination-dirs</code> に"
"加えて <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外である場合、コピー先ディレクトリの"
"末尾にあるディレクトリ区切り文字は特別な扱いを受けます。この場合、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">test/</samp>&rsquo; にコピーする際にディレクトリ &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">test</samp>&rsquo; が既に存在しないときは、そのディレク"
"トリが作成され、指定されたソースファイルまたはディレクトリが新規作成された"
"ディレクトリにコピーされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dired_002dcopy_002dpreserve_002dtime\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dired_002dcopy_002dpreserve_002dtime\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">dired-copy-preserve-time</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, then copying with this command preserves the "
"modification time of the old file in the copy, like &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">cp -p</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">dired-copy-preserve-time</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、このコマンドでコピーすると、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">cp -p</samp>&rsquo; のように、コピー先ファイルに元のファ"
"イルの更新日時が保持されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002drecursive_002dcopies\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recursive-copying\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002drecursive_002dcopies\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recursive-copying\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">dired-recursive-copies</code> controls "
"whether to copy directories recursively (like &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cp "
"-r</samp>&rsquo;).  The default is <code class=\"code\">top</code>, which "
"means to ask before recursively copying a directory."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">dired-recursive-copies</code> は、ディレクトリを再"
"帰的にコピーするかどうか（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cp -r</samp>&rsquo; の"
"ように）を制御します。デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">top</code> で、これは"
"ディレクトリを再帰的にコピーする前に確認を行うことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002dcopy_002ddereference\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-follow-symbolic-links\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dereference-symbolic-links\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dired_002dcopy_002ddereference\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-follow-symbolic-links\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dereference-symbolic-links\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">dired-copy-dereference</code> controls "
"whether to copy symbolic links as links or after dereferencing (like &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">cp -L</samp>&rsquo;).  The default is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, which means that the symbolic links are copied by "
"creating new ones."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">dired-copy-dereference</code> は、シンボリックリン"
"クをリンクとしてコピーするか、参照解除した後にコピーするか（&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">cp -L</samp>&rsquo; のように）を制御します。デフォルトは "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> で、これはシンボリックリンクを新規に作成して"
"コピーすることを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dired_002dkeep_002dmarker_002dcopy\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"dired_002dkeep_002dmarker_002dcopy\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">dired-keep-marker-copy</code> user option controls "
"how this command handles file marking.  The default is to mark all new "
"copies of files with a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C</samp>&rsquo; mark."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">dired-keep-marker-copy</code> ユーザーオプションは、この"
"コマンドによるファイルマーキングの処理方法を制御します。デフォルトでは、ファ"
"イルのすべての新規コピーに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C</samp>&rsquo; マーク"
"が付与されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-D-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-dired_002ddo_002ddelete\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">D</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-dired_002ddo_002ddelete\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-D-_0028Dired_0029\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-dired_002ddo_002ddelete\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">D</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-dired_002ddo_002ddelete\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Operating-on-Files.html
msgid ""
"Delete the specified files (<code class=\"code\">dired-do-delete</code>).  "
"This is like the shell command <code class=\"code\">rm</code>."
msgstr ""
"指定したファイル (<code class=\"code\">dired-do-delete</code>) を削除します。"
