# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"<span>16.19 Optional Mode Line Features<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Optional-Mode-Line-Features\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>16.19 オプションのモードライン機能<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Optional-Mode-Line-Features\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer-size-display\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display-of-buffer-size\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-size_002dindication_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-buffer-size-display\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display-of-buffer-size\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-size_002dindication_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"The buffer percentage <var class=\"var\">pos</var> indicates the percentage "
"of the buffer above the top of the window.  You can additionally display the "
"size of the buffer by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x size-indication-mode</"
"kbd> to turn on Size Indication mode.  The size will be displayed "
"immediately following the buffer percentage like this:"
msgstr ""
"バッファ割合 <var class=\"var\">pos</var> は、ウィンドウの上端より上にある"
"バッファの割合を示します。また、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x size-indication-mode</"
"kbd> と入力してサイズ表示モードをオンにすると、バッファのサイズも併せて表示で"
"きます。サイズは、バッファ割合の直後に次のように表示されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "<var class=\"var\">pos</var> of <var class=\"var\">size</var>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"Here <var class=\"var\">size</var> is the human readable representation of "
"the number of characters in the buffer, which means that &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">k</samp>&rsquo; for 10^3, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">M</"
"samp>&rsquo; for 10^6, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">G</samp>&rsquo; for 10^9, "
"etc., are used to abbreviate."
msgstr ""
"ここで <var class=\"var\">size</var> はバッファ内の文字数を人間が読み取りやす"
"い形式で表したものであり、つまり 10^3 には \"<samp class=\"samp\">k</"
"samp>\"、10^6 には \"<samp class=\"samp\">M</samp>\"、10^9 には \"<samp "
"class=\"samp\">G</samp>\" といった表記が略記として用いられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line-number-display\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display-of-current-line-number\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line_002dnumber_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line-number-display\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display-of-current-line-number\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-line_002dnumber_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"The current line number of point appears in the mode line when Line Number "
"mode is enabled.  Use the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x line-number-mode</"
"kbd> to turn this mode on and off; normally it is on.  The line number "
"appears after the buffer percentage <var class=\"var\">pos</var>, with the "
"letter &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">L</samp>&rsquo; to indicate what it is."
msgstr ""
"「行番号」モードが有効な場合、現在の行番号がモードラインに表示されます。コマ"
"ンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x line-number-mode</kbd> でこのモードのオン/オフを"
"切り替えられます。通常はオンになっています。行番号はバッファのパーセンテージ "
"<var class=\"var\">pos</var> の後に表示され、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">L</"
"samp>&rsquo; という文字でその種類が示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Column-Number-mode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mode_002c-Column-Number\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-column_002dnumber_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Column-Number-mode\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mode_002c-Column-Number\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-column_002dnumber_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"Similarly, you can display the current column number by turning on Column "
"Number mode with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x column-number-mode</kbd>.  The "
"column number is indicated by the letter &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  However, when both of these modes are enabled, the line and "
"column numbers are displayed in parentheses, the line number first, rather "
"than with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">L</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">C</samp>&rsquo;.  For example: &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(561,2)</samp>&rsquo;.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Minor-"
"Modes.html\">Minor Modes</a>, for more information about minor modes and "
"about how to use these commands."
msgstr ""
"同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x column-number-mode</kbd> で列番号モードを有効"
"にすると、現在の列番号を表示できます。列番号は文字 &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">C</samp>&rsquo; で示されます。ただし、これら両方のモードが有効"
"な場合、行番号と列番号は括弧内に表示され、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">L</"
"samp>&rsquo; や &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C</samp>&rsquo; ではなく、まず行"
"番号が表示されます。例えば：&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">(561,2)</"
"samp>&rsquo;。マイナーモードの詳細やこれらのコマンドの使用方法については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Minor-Modes.html\">マイナーモード</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"column_002dnumber_002dindicator_002dzero_002dbased\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"column_002dnumber_002dindicator_002dzero_002dbased\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"In Column Number mode, the displayed column number counts from zero starting "
"at the left margin of the window.  If you would prefer for the displayed "
"column number to count from one, you may set <code class=\"code\">column-"
"number-indicator-zero-based</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"列番号モードでは、表示される列番号はウィンドウの左端から0始まりでカウントされ"
"ます。表示される列番号を1始まりにしたい場合は、<code class=\"code\">column-"
"number-indicator-zero-based</code>を<code class=\"code\">nil</code>に設定して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-narrowing_002c-and-line-number-"
"display\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-narrowing_002c-and-line-number-"
"display\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"If you have narrowed the buffer (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Narrowing.html\">Narrowing</a>), the displayed line number is "
"relative to the accessible portion of the buffer.  Thus, it isn&rsquo;t "
"suitable as an argument to <code class=\"code\">goto-line</code>.  (The "
"command <code class=\"code\">what-line</code> shows the line number relative "
"to the whole file.)  You can use <code class=\"code\">goto-line-relative</"
"code> command to move point to the line relative to the accessible portion "
"of the narrowed buffer."
msgstr ""
"バッファを狭めた場合（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Narrowing.html\">狭め</a>を参"
"照）、表示される行番号はバッファのアクセス可能な範囲を基準としています。その"
"ため、<code class=\"code\">goto-line</code> の引数としては適していません。"
"（<code class=\"code\">what-line</code> コマンドは、ファイル全体を基準とした"
"行番号を表示します。）<code class=\"code\">goto-line-relative</code> コマンド"
"を使用すると、ポイントを狭めたバッファのアクセス可能な範囲を基準とした行に移"
"動できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"line_002dnumber_002ddisplay_002dlimit\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"line_002dnumber_002ddisplay_002dlimit\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"If the buffer is very large (larger than the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">line-number-display-limit</code>), Emacs won&rsquo;t compute "
"the line number, because that would be too slow; therefore, the line number "
"won&rsquo;t appear on the mode-line.  To remove this limit, set <code "
"class=\"code\">line-number-display-limit</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"バッファが非常に大きい場合（<code class=\"code\">line-number-display-limit</"
"code> の値より大きい場合）、処理速度が著しく低下するため、Emacs は行番号を計"
"算しません。そのため、モードラインに行番号は表示されません。この制限を解除す"
"るには、<code class=\"code\">line-number-display-limit</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"line_002dnumber_002ddisplay_002dlimit_002dwidth\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"line_002dnumber_002ddisplay_002dlimit_002dwidth\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"Line-number computation can also be slow if the lines in the buffer are too "
"long.  For this reason, Emacs doesn&rsquo;t display line numbers if the "
"average width, in characters, of lines near point is larger than the value "
"of <code class=\"code\">line-number-display-limit-width</code>.  The default "
"value is 200 characters."
msgstr ""
"バッファ内の行が長すぎる場合、行番号の計算に時間がかかることがあります。この"
"ため、Emacsでは、ポイント付近の行の平均幅（文字数）が <code "
"class=\"code\">line-number-display-limit-width</code> の値を超える場合、行番"
"号を表示しません。デフォルト値は200文字です。"

