# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"Emacs can optionally display the time and system load in all mode lines.  To "
"enable this feature, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x display-time</kbd> or "
"customize the option <code class=\"code\">display-time-mode</code>.  The "
"information added to the mode line looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、オプションですべてのモードラインに時刻とシステム負荷を表示できま"
"す。この機能を有効にするには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x display-time</kbd> と入"
"力するか、オプション <code class=\"code\">display-time-mode</code> をカスタマ"
"イズしてください。モードラインに追加される情報は、次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "<var class=\"var\">hh</var>:<var class=\"var\">mm</var>PM <var class=\"var\">l.ll</var>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dtime_002d24hr_002dformat\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"display_002dtime_002d24hr_002dformat\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Optional-Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"Here <var class=\"var\">hh</var> and <var class=\"var\">mm</var> are the "
"hour and minute, followed always by &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">AM</"
"samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">PM</samp>&rsquo;.  <var "
"class=\"var\">l.ll</var> is the average number, collected for the last few "
"minutes, of processes in the whole system that were either running or ready "
"to run (i.e., were waiting for an available processor).  (Some fields may be "
"missing if your operating system cannot support them.)  If you prefer time "
"display in 24-hour format, set the variable <code class=\"code\">display-"
"time-24hr-format</code> to <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"ここで <var class=\"var\">hh</var> と <var class=\"var\">mm</var> は時と分を"
"表し、その後には必ず &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">AM</samp>&rsquo; または "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">PM</samp>&rsquo; が続きます。<var "
"class=\"var\">l.ll</var> は、システム全体で実行中または実行可能（すなわち、利"
"用可能なプロセッサを待機中）であったプロセスの、直近数分で集計された平均数で"
"す。（オペレーティングシステムがサポートしていない場合、一部のフィールドが表"
"示されないことがあります。）24時間表記での表示を希望する場合は、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">display-time-24hr-format</code> に <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> を設定してください。"

