# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Org-Authoring.html
msgid ""
"To export several files at once to a specific directory, either locally or "
"over the network, you must define a list of projects through the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">org-publish-project-alist</code>.  See its "
"documentation for details."
