# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Org-Mode.html
msgid ""
"You can move an entire entry up or down in the buffer, including its body "
"lines and subtree (if any), by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">org-metaup</code>) or "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">org-metadown</code>) on the heading line.  Similarly, you can "
"promote or demote a heading line with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">org-metaleft</code>) "
"and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">org-metaright</code>).  These commands execute their global "
"bindings if invoked on a body line."
msgstr ""
"見出し行で <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">UP</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">org-metaup</code>) または <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DOWN</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">org-metadown</code>) と"
"入力すると、本文行やサブツリー（ある場合）を含むエントリ全体をバッファ内で上"
"下に移動できます。同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">LEFT</"
"kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">org-metaleft</code>) および <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">org-metaright</code>) で見出し行を昇格または降格させることがで"
"きます。これらのコマンドを本文行で実行した場合、グローバルバインディングが実"
"行されます。"

