#: build/html/emacs/Other-C-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-c_002dcontext_002dline_002dbreak\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x c-context-line-break</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-c_002dcontext_002dline_002dbreak\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-c_002dcontext_002dline_002dbreak\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x c-context-line-break</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-c_002dcontext_002dline_002dbreak\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-C-Commands.html
msgid ""
"This command inserts a line break and indents the new line in a manner "
"appropriate to the context.  In normal code, it does the work of <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">newline</code>), in a C preprocessor line it additionally "
"inserts a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; at the line break, "
"and within comments it&rsquo;s like <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-j</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">c-indent-new-comment-line</code>)."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、文脈に応じて改行を挿入し、新しい行をインデントします。通常の"
"コードでは <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">newline</code>) と同様の動作をし、Cプリプロセッサの行ではさら"
"に改行位置に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; を挿入し、コメント"
"内では <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-j</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">c-indent-new-"
"comment-line</code>) と同様の動作をします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-C-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">c-context-line-break</code> isn&rsquo;t bound to a key "
"by default, but it needs a binding to be useful.  The following code will "
"bind it to <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>.  We use "
"<code class=\"code\">c-initialization-hook</code> here to make sure the "
"keymap is loaded before we try to change it."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">c-context-line-break</code> はデフォルトではキーにバイン"
"ドされていませんが、利用するにはバインドが必要です。以下のコードでは、これを "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> にバインドします。ここ"
"では、キーマップを変更する前に確実に読み込まれるよう、<code class=\"code\">c-"
"initialization-hook</code> を使用しています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-C-Commands.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun my-bind-clb ()\n"
"  (keymap-set c-mode-base-map &quot;RET&quot;\n"
"              'c-context-line-break))\n"
"(add-hook 'c-initialization-hook 'my-bind-clb)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-C-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Put mark at the end of a function definition, and put point at the beginning "
"(<code class=\"code\">c-mark-function</code>)."
msgstr ""
"関数定義の末尾にマークを付け、先頭にポイントを置きます (<code "
"class=\"code\">c-mark-function</code>)。"

