# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-C-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Run the C preprocessor on the text in the region, and show the result, which "
"includes the expansion of all the macro calls (<code class=\"code\">c-macro-"
"expand</code>).  The buffer text before the region is also included in "
"preprocessing, for the sake of macros defined there, but the output from "
"this part isn&rsquo;t shown."
msgstr ""
"リージョン内のテキストに対してCプリプロセッサを実行し、すべてのマクロ呼び出し"
"の展開結果（<code class=\"code\">c-macro-expand</code>）を含む結果を表示しま"
"す。リージョン前のバッファテキストも、そこで定義されたマクロのためにプリプロ"
"セスの対象となりますが、この部分の出力は表示されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-C-Commands.html
msgid ""
"When you are debugging C code that uses macros, sometimes it is hard to "
"figure out precisely how the macros expand.  With this command, you "
"don&rsquo;t have to figure it out; you can see the expansions."
msgstr ""
"マクロを使用したCコードをデバッグする際、マクロが具体的にどのように展開される"
"のかを把握するのが難しいことがあります。このコマンドを使えば、わざわざ調べる"
"必要はなく、展開結果を確認できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-C-Commands.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002d_005c-_0028C-"
"mode_0029\"></a> <a id=\"index-c_002dbackslash_002dregion\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-\\</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
