msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002d_005c-_0028C-"
"mode_0029\"></a> <a id=\"index-c_002dbackslash_002dregion\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-\\</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"c_002dbackslash_002dregion\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-C-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Insert or align &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; characters at "
"the ends of the lines of the region (<code class=\"code\">c-backslash-"
"region</code>).  This is useful after writing or editing a C macro "
"definition."
msgstr ""
"領域 (<code class=\"code\">c-backslash-region</code>) の各行の末尾に '<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\</samp>' 文字を挿入または揃えます。これは、Cマクロの定義を記"
"述または編集した後に便利です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-C-Commands.html
msgid ""
"If a line already ends in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo;, this "
"command adjusts the amount of whitespace before it.  Otherwise, it inserts a "
"new &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo;.  However, the last line in "
"the region is treated specially; no &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</"
"samp>&rsquo; is inserted on that line, and any &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; there is deleted."
msgstr ""
"行がすでに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; で終わっている場合、"
"このコマンドはその前の空白量を調整します。そうでない場合は、新たに &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; を挿入します。ただし、リージョン内の最"
"終行は特別に扱われ、その行には &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; "
"は挿入されず、存在する &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; は削除さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-C-Commands.html
