"They all ignore case in matching, if the pattern contains no upper-case "
"letters and <code class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Aside from <code class=\"code\">multi-occur</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">multi-occur-in-matching-buffers</code>, which "
"always search the whole buffer, all of the commands operate on the text from "
"point to the end of the buffer, or on the region if it is active."
msgstr ""
