# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-Repeating-Search.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">e</kbd> in the <samp class=\"file\">*Occur*</samp> "
"buffer makes the buffer writable and enters the Occur Edit mode, in which "
"you can edit the matching lines and have those edits reflected in the text "
"in the originating buffer.  Type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c</kbd> to leave "
"the Occur Edit mode and return to the Occur mode."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*Occur*</samp> バッファに <kbd class=\"kbd\">e</kbd> と"
"入力すると、バッファが書き込み可能になり、Occur Edit モードに入ります。この"
"モードでは、一致する行を編集でき、その編集内容が元のバッファのテキストにも反"
"映されます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c</kbd> と入力すると、Occur Edit モード"
"を終了して Occur モードに戻ります。"

