"<a id=\"index-how_002dmany\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x how-many</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-how_002dmany\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-Repeating-Search.html
msgid ""
"Prompt for a regexp, and print the number of matches for it in the buffer "
"after point.  If the region is active, this operates on the region instead."
msgstr ""
"正規表現を指定し、ポイント以降のバッファ内でのマッチ数を表示します。リージョ"
"ンが有効な場合は、代わりにそのリージョンに対して処理が行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-Repeating-Search.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-flush_002dlines\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x flush-"
"lines</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-flush_002dlines\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-flush_002dlines\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x flush-"
"lines</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-flush_002dlines\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-Repeating-Search.html
msgid ""
"Prompt for a regexp, and delete each line that contains a match for it, "
"operating on the text after point.  When the command finishes, it prints the "
"number of deleted matching lines."
msgstr ""
"正規表現を指定し、ポイント以降のテキストを対象に、それに一致する行をそれぞれ"
"削除します。コマンドの実行が完了すると、削除された一致行の数が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-Repeating-Search.html
msgid ""
"This command deletes the current line if it contains a match starting after "
"point.  If the region is active, it operates on the region instead; if a "
"line partially contained in the region contains a match entirely contained "
"in the region, it is deleted."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、現在の行にポイント以降でマッチする部分が含まれている場合、そ"
"の行を削除します。リージョンが有効な場合は、代わりにリージョンに対して動作"
"し、リージョンに部分的に含まれる行に、リージョンに完全に含まれるマッチ部分が"
"含まれている場合、その行が削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-Repeating-Search.html
msgid ""
"If a match is split across lines, <code class=\"code\">flush-lines</code> "
"deletes all those lines.  It deletes the lines before starting to look for "
"the next match; hence, it ignores a match starting on the same line at which "
"another match ended."
msgstr ""
"マッチが複数行にまたがる場合、<code class=\"code\">flush-lines</code> はそれ"
"らすべての行を削除します。次のマッチを探し始める前に行を削除するため、別の"
"マッチが終了したのと同じ行から始まるマッチは無視されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-Repeating-Search.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-keep_002dlines\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x keep-lines</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-keep_002dlines\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-keep_002dlines\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x keep-lines</"
"kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-keep_002dlines\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-Repeating-Search.html
msgid ""
"Prompt for a regexp, and delete each line that <em class=\"emph\">does not</"
"em> contain a match for it, operating on the text after point.  If point is "
"not at the beginning of a line, this command always keeps the current line.  "
"If the region is active, the command operates on the region instead; it "
"never deletes lines that are only partially contained in the region (a "
"newline that ends a line counts as part of that line)."
msgstr ""
"正規表現を指定し、ポイント以降のテキストを対象に、その正規表現に<em "
"class=\"emph\">一致しない</em>各行を削除します。ポイントが行頭にない場合、こ"
"のコマンドは常に現在の行を保持します。リージョンが有効な場合は、代わりにリー"
"ジョンを対象に処理が行われます。リージョンに部分的にしか含まれていない行が削"
"除されることはありません（行末の改行は、その行の一部としてカウントされま"
"す）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-Repeating-Search.html
msgid "If a match is split across lines, this command keeps all those lines."
msgstr ""
"マッチが複数行にわたる場合、このコマンドはそれらすべての行を保持します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-Repeating-Search.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-kill_002dmatching_002dlines\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"kill-matching-lines</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"kill_002dmatching_002dlines\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-kill_002dmatching_002dlines\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"kill-matching-lines</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"kill_002dmatching_002dlines\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-Repeating-Search.html
msgid ""
"Like <code class=\"code\">flush-lines</code>, but also add the matching "
"lines to the kill ring.  The command adds the matching lines to the kill "
"ring as a single string, including the newlines that separated the lines."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">flush-lines</code>と同様ですが、一致する行もキルリングに"
"追加します。このコマンドは、行を区切る改行を含む単一の文字列として、一致する"
"行をキルリングに追加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-Repeating-Search.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-copy_002dmatching_002dlines\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"copy-matching-lines</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"copy_002dmatching_002dlines\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-copy_002dmatching_002dlines\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"copy-matching-lines</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"copy_002dmatching_002dlines\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Other-Repeating-Search.html
msgid ""
"Like <code class=\"code\">kill-matching-lines</code>, but the matching lines "
"are not removed from the buffer."
