#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Format.html
msgid ""
"<span>27.9.2 Format of Outlines<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Format-of-"
"Outlines\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>27.9.2 アウトラインの形式<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Format-of-"
"Outlines\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Format.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-heading-lines-_0028Outline-"
"mode_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-body-lines-"
"_0028Outline-mode_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-heading-lines-_0028Outline-"
"mode_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-body-lines-"
"_0028Outline-mode_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Format.html
msgid ""
"Outline mode assumes that the lines in the buffer are of two types: <em "
"class=\"dfn\">heading lines</em> and <em class=\"dfn\">body lines</em>.  A "
"heading line represents a topic in the outline.  Heading lines start with "
"one or more asterisk (&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;) "
"characters; the number of asterisks determines the depth of the heading in "
"the outline structure.  Thus, a heading line with one &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; is a major topic; all the heading lines with "
"two &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;s between it and the next one-"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; heading are its subtopics; and "
"so on.  Any line that is not a heading line is a body line.  Body lines "
"belong with the preceding heading line.  Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"アウトラインモードでは、バッファ内の行が<em class=\"dfn\">見出し行</em>と<em "
"class=\"dfn\">本文行</em>の2種類であると想定します。見出し行は、アウトライン"
"におけるトピックを表します。見出し行は1つ以上のアスタリスク（&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;）文字で始まり、アスタリスクの数によってアウト"
"ライン構造における見出しの階層が決まります。したがって、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;が1つの見出し行は大トピックとなり、その次の"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;見出しとの間に&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo;が2つあるすべての見出し行はその下位トピックとな"
"り、以下同様です。見出し行ではない行はすべて本文行となります。本文行は、直前"
"の見出し行に属します。以下に例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Format.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* Food\n"
"This is the body,\n"
"which says something about the topic of food.\n"
"\n"
"** Delicious Food\n"
"This is the body of the second-level header.\n"
"\n"
"** Distasteful Food\n"
"This could have\n"
"a body too, with\n"
"several lines.\n"
"\n"
"*** Dormitory Food\n"
"\n"
"* Shelter\n"
"Another first-level topic with its header line.\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Format.html
msgid ""
"A heading line together with all following body lines is called collectively "
"an <em class=\"dfn\">entry</em>.  A heading line together with all following "
"deeper heading lines and their body lines is called a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">subtree</em>."
msgstr ""
"見出し行と、それに続くすべての本文行を合わせて、総称して<em class=\"dfn\">エ"
"ントリ</em>と呼びます。見出し行と、それに続くすべての下位見出し行およびそれら"
"の本文行を合わせて、<em class=\"dfn\">サブツリー</em>と呼びます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Format.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-outline_002dregexp\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-outline_002dregexp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Format.html
msgid ""
"You can customize the criterion for distinguishing heading lines by setting "
"the variable <code class=\"code\">outline-regexp</code>.  (The recommended "
"ways to do this are in a major mode function or with a file local "
"variable.)  Any line whose beginning has a match for this regexp is "
"considered a heading line.  Matches that start within a line (not at the "
"left margin) do not count."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">outline-regexp</code> を設定することで、見出し行を"
"判別する基準をカスタマイズできます。（推奨される方法は、メジャーモード関数内"
"で行うか、ファイルローカル変数を使用することです。）行頭がこの正規表現に一致"
"する行は、すべて見出し行とみなされます。行内（左マージン以外）から開始する一"
"致はカウントされません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Format.html
msgid ""
"The length of the matching text determines the level of the heading; longer "
"matches make a more deeply nested level.  Thus, for example, if a text "
"formatter has commands &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@chapter</samp>&rsquo;, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@section</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">@subsection</samp>&rsquo; to divide the document into "
"chapters and sections, you could make those lines count as heading lines by "
"setting <code class=\"code\">outline-regexp</code> to &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;@chap\\\\|@\\\\(sub\\\\)*section&quot;</samp>&rsquo;.  "
"Note the trick: the two words &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">chapter</"
"samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">section</samp>&rsquo; are "
"equally long, but by defining the regexp to match only &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">chap</samp>&rsquo; we ensure that the length of the text "
"matched on a chapter heading is shorter, so that Outline mode will know that "
"sections are contained in chapters.  This works as long as no other command "
"starts with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@chap</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"一致するテキストの長さによって見出しのレベルが決まり、一致するテキストが長い"
"ほど、より深い階層になります。例えば、テキストフォーマッタに文書を章や節に分"
"割するためのコマンド &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@chapter</samp>&rsquo;、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@section</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">@subsection</samp>&rsquo; がある場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">outline-regexp</code> を &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;@chap\\\\|@\\\\(sub\\\\)*section&quot;</samp>&rsquo; に"
"設定することで、これらの行を見出し行として扱うことができます。ここでの工夫に"
"注目してください。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">chapter</samp>&rsquo; と "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">section</samp>&rsquo; という2つの単語は等しい長さ"
"ですが、正規表現を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">chap</samp>&rsquo; にのみ一致"
"するように定義することで、章見出しに一致するテキストの長さが短くなり、アウト"
"ラインモードが節が章に含まれていることを認識できるようになります。これは、他"
"に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@chap</samp>&rsquo; で始まるコマンドがない限り"
"有効です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Format.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-outline_002dsearch_002dfunction\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-outline_002dsearch_002dfunction\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Format.html
msgid ""
"Instead of setting the variable <code class=\"code\">outline-regexp</code>, "
"you can set the variable <code class=\"code\">outline-search-function</code> "
"to a function that matches the current heading and searches for the next one "
"(see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/elisp/Outline-Minor-Mode.html#Outline-Minor-Mode\">Outline "
"Minor Mode</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">the Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</"
"cite>)."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">outline-regexp</code> を設定する代わりに、変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">outline-search-function</code> に、現在の見出しに一致"
"し、次の見出しを検索する関数を設定できます（<cite class=\"cite\">Emacs Lisp "
"リファレンスマニュアル</cite> の <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Outline-Minor-"
"Mode.html#Outline-Minor-Mode\">Outline Minor Mode</a> を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Format.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-outline_002dlevel\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-outline_002dlevel\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Format.html
msgid ""
"You can explicitly specify a rule for calculating the level of a heading "
"line by setting the variable <code class=\"code\">outline-level</code>.  The "
"value of <code class=\"code\">outline-level</code> should be a function that "
"takes no arguments and returns the level of the current heading.  The "
"recommended ways to set this variable are in a major mode command or with a "
"file local variable."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">outline-level</code> を設定することで、見出し行のレ"
"ベルを計算するためのルールを明示的に指定できます。<code "
"class=\"code\">outline-level</code> の値は、引数を取らずに現在の見出しのレベ"
"ルを返す関数である必要があります。この変数を設定する推奨方法は、メジャーモー"
"ドコマンドまたはファイルローカル変数を使用することです。"

