#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"<span>27.9.4 Outline Visibility Commands<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Outline-Visibility-Commands\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>27.9.4 アウトライン表示コマンド<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Outline-Visibility-Commands\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"Outline mode provides several commands for temporarily hiding or revealing "
"parts of the buffer, based on the outline structure.  These commands are not "
"undoable; their effects are simply not recorded by the undo mechanism, so "
"you can undo right past them (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Undo.html\">Undo</a>)."
msgstr ""
"アウトラインモードでは、アウトライン構造に基づいて、バッファの一部を一時的に"
"非表示または表示するためのコマンドがいくつか用意されています。これらのコマン"
"ドは元に戻せません。単にアンドゥ機構によって効果が記録されないだけですので、"
"その直後でアンドゥを行うことができます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Undo.html\">アンドゥ</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"Many of these commands act on the current heading line.  If point is on a "
"heading line, that is the current heading line; if point is on a body line, "
"the current heading line is the nearest preceding header line."
msgstr ""
"これらのコマンドの多くは、現在の見出し行に対して動作します。ポイントが見出し"
"行にある場合、それが現在の見出し行となります。ポイントが本文行にある場合、現"
"在の見出し行は直前の最も近い見出し行となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"Make the current heading line&rsquo;s body invisible (<code "
"class=\"code\">outline-hide-entry</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在の見出し行の本文を非表示にする (<code class=\"code\">outline-hide-entry</"
"code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"Reveal the current entry and its parent hierarchy (<code "
"class=\"code\">outline-show-entry-and-parents</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在のエントリとその親階層 (<code class=\"code\">outline-show-entry-and-"
"parents</code>) を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-d</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-d</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"Make everything under the current heading invisible, not including the "
"heading itself (<code class=\"code\">outline-hide-subtree</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在の見出し配下にあるものをすべて、見出し自体を除いて不可視にする (<code "
"class=\"code\">outline-hide-subtree</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"Make everything under the current heading visible, including body, "
"subheadings, and their bodies (<code class=\"code\">outline-show-subtree</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在の見出し配下にあるものすべて（本文、小見出し、およびその本文を含む <code "
"class=\"code\">outline-show-subtree</code>）を可視にする。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"Make the body of the current heading line, and of all its subheadings, "
"invisible (<code class=\"code\">outline-hide-leaves</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在の見出し行およびそのすべての小見出しの本文を非表示にする (<code "
"class=\"code\">outline-hide-leaves</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles-in-Picture.html build/html/emacs/TeX-Print.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-k</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-k</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"Make all subheadings of the current heading line, at all levels, visible "
"(<code class=\"code\">outline-show-branches</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在の見出し行にあるすべての小見出しを、階層を問わず表示する (<code "
"class=\"code\">outline-show-branches</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-i</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-i</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"Make immediate subheadings (one level down) of the current heading line "
"visible (<code class=\"code\">outline-show-children</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在の見出し行の直下の小見出し（1階層下）を表示可能にする (<code "
"class=\"code\">outline-show-children</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-t</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-t</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"Make all body lines in the buffer invisible (<code class=\"code\">outline-"
"hide-body</code>)."
msgstr ""
"バッファ内のすべてのボディラインを非表示にする (<code class=\"code\">outline-"
"hide-body</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-a</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-a</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"Make all lines in the buffer visible (<code class=\"code\">outline-show-all</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"バッファ内のすべての行を表示可能にする (<code class=\"code\">outline-show-"
"all</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"Hide everything except the top <var class=\"var\">n</var> levels of heading "
"lines (<code class=\"code\">outline-hide-sublevels</code>)."
msgstr ""
"見出し行の最上位 <var class=\"var\">n</var> レベル（<code "
"class=\"code\">outline-hide-sublevels</code>）以外をすべて非表示にする。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Outline-Visibility.html
msgid ""
"Hide everything except for the heading or body that point is in, plus the "
"headings leading up from there to the top level of the outline (<code "
