# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Package-Installation.html
msgid ""
"The value of this variable is an alist of package archives recognized by the "
"Emacs package manager."
msgstr ""
"この変数の値は、Emacsパッケージマネージャが認識するパッケージアーカイブの"
"alistです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Package-Installation.html
msgid ""
"Each alist element corresponds to one archive, and should have the form "
"<code class=\"code\">(<var class=\"var\">id</var> . <var "
"class=\"var\">location</var>)</code>, where <var class=\"var\">id</var> is "
"the name of the archive (a string) and <var class=\"var\">location</var> is "
"its <em class=\"dfn\">base location</em> (a string)."
msgstr ""
"alistの各要素は1つのアーカイブに対応し、<code class=\"code\">(<var "
"class=\"var\">id</var> . <var class=\"var\">location</var>)</code> という形式"
"である必要があります。ここで、<var class=\"var\">id</var> はアーカイブ名（文"
"字列）、<var class=\"var\">location</var> はその<em class=\"dfn\">ベースロ"
"ケーション</em>（文字列）です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Package-Installation.html
msgid ""
"If the base location starts with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">http:</"
"samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">https:</samp>&rsquo;, it is "
"treated as an HTTP(S) URL, and packages are downloaded from this archive via "
"HTTP(S) (as is the case for the default GNU archive)."
msgstr ""
"ベースロケーションが &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">http:</samp>&rsquo; または "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">https:</samp>&rsquo; で始まる場合、それは "
"HTTP(S) URL として扱われ、パッケージはこのアーカイブから HTTP(S) 経由でダウン"
"ロードされます（デフォルトの GNU アーカイブの場合と同様です）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Package-Installation.html
msgid ""
"Otherwise, the base location should be a directory name.  In this case, "
"Emacs retrieves packages from this archive via ordinary file access.  Such "
"local archives are mainly useful for testing."
msgstr ""
"それ以外の場合、ベースとなる場所はディレクトリ名である必要があります。この場"
"合、Emacsは通常のファイルアクセスを通じてこのアーカイブからパッケージを取得し"
"ます。このようなローカルアーカイブは、主にテスト用途に有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Package-Installation.html
msgid ""
