#: build/html/emacs/Package-Menu.html
msgid ""
"Mark the package on the current line for installation (<code "
"class=\"code\">package-menu-mark-install</code>).  If the package status is "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">available</samp>&rsquo;, this adds an &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">I</samp>&rsquo; character to the start of the line; "
"typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">x</kbd> (see below) will download and install the "
"package."
msgstr ""
