#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"<span>27.4 Pages<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Pages-1\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>27.4 ページ<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Pages-1\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-pages\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-formfeed-character\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-pages\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-formfeed-character\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"Within some text files, text is divided into <em class=\"dfn\">pages</em> "
"delimited by the <em class=\"dfn\">formfeed character</em> (<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> code 12, also denoted as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">control-L</samp>&rsquo;), which is displayed in Emacs as the "
"escape sequence &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^L</samp>&rsquo; (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Text-Display.html\">How Text Is Displayed</a>).  "
"Traditionally, when such text files are printed to hardcopy, each formfeed "
"character forces a page break.  Most Emacs commands treat it just like any "
"other character, so you can insert it with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-q C-l</kbd>, "
"delete it with <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>, etc.  In addition, Emacs "
"provides commands to move over pages and operate on them."
msgstr ""
"一部のテキストファイルでは、テキストが<em class=\"dfn\">フォームフィード文字"
"</em>（<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>コード12、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">control-L</samp>&rsquo;とも表記）で区切られた<em "
"class=\"dfn\">ページ</em>に分かれており、Emacsではエスケープシーケンス&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">^L</samp>&rsquo;として表示されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Text-Display.html\">テキストの表示方法</a>を参照）。従来、このようなテ"
"キストファイルをハードコピーに印刷する場合、フォームフィード文字が現れるたび"
"にページ区切りが強制されていました。ほとんどのEmacsコマンドはこれを他の文字と"
"同様に扱うため、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-q C-l</kbd>で挿入したり、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>で削除したりすることなどが可能です。さらに、Emacsには"
"ページ間を移動したり、ページを操作したりするためのコマンドが用意されていま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x what-page</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x what-page</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid "Display the page number of point, and the line number within that page."
msgstr "ポイントのページ番号と、そのページ内の行番号を表示してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"Move point to previous page boundary (<code class=\"code\">backward-page</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"ポイントを前のページ境界 (<code class=\"code\">backward-page</code>) に移動し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"Move point to next page boundary (<code class=\"code\">forward-page</code>)."
msgstr ""
"ポイントを次のページ境界（<code class=\"code\">forward-page</code>）に移動し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"Put point and mark around this page (or another page) (<code "
"class=\"code\">mark-page</code>)."
msgstr ""
"このページ（または別のページ）の周囲に点とマークを配置します (<code "
"class=\"code\">mark-page</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x l</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x l</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"Count the lines in this page (<code class=\"code\">count-lines-page</code>)."
msgstr ""
"このページ内の行数（<code class=\"code\">count-lines-page</code>）を数えてく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-what_002dpage\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-what_002dpage\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x what-page</kbd> counts pages from the beginning of "
"the file, and counts lines within the page, showing both numbers in the echo "
"area."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x what-page</kbd> はファイルの先頭からページ数をカウント"
"し、ページ内の行数をカウントして、両方の数値を echo 領域に表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-_005b\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-_005d\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-forward_002dpage\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"backward_002dpage\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-_005b\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-_005d\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-forward_002dpage\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"backward_002dpage\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"The <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x [</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">backward-page</"
"code>) command moves point to immediately after the previous page "
"delimiter.  If point is already right after a page delimiter, it skips that "
"one and stops at the previous one.  A numeric argument serves as a repeat "
"count.  The <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x ]</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">forward-"
"page</code>)  command moves forward past the next page delimiter."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x [</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">backward-page</code>) コ"
"マンドは、ポイントを直前のページ区切りの直後へ移動します。ポイントがすでに"
"ページ区切りの直後にある場合は、その区切りをスキップして直前の区切りで停止し"
"ます。数値引数は繰り返し回数として指定します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x ]</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">forward-page</code>) コマンドは、次のページ区切りを越え"
"て前方へ移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dp\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mark_002dpage\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dp\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mark_002dpage\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"The <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-p</kbd> command (<code class=\"code\">mark-"
"page</code>) puts point at the beginning of the current page (after that "
"page delimiter at the front), and the mark at the end of the page (after the "
"page delimiter at the end)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-p</kbd> コマンド (<code class=\"code\">mark-page</"
"code>) は、ポイントを現在のページの先頭（先頭にあるページ区切りの後）に、マー"
"クをページの末尾（末尾にあるページ区切りの後）に配置します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-p C-w</kbd> is a handy way to kill a page to move "
"it elsewhere.  If you move to another page delimiter with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x [</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x ]</kbd>, then yank the "
"killed page, all the pages will be properly delimited once again.  Making "
"sure this works as expected is the reason <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-p</kbd> "
"includes only the following page delimiter in the region."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-p C-w</kbd> は、ページを切り離して別の場所に移動させ"
"るのに便利な方法です。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x [</kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x ]</kbd> で別のページ区切りに移動し、切り離したページをヤンクすれば、すべて"
"のページが再び適切に区切られます。これが期待通りに動作することを確実にするた"
"め、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-p</kbd> ではリージョン内に次のページ区切りのみが"
"含まれています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"A numeric argument to <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-p</kbd> specifies which page "
"to go to, relative to the current one.  Zero means the current page, one "
"means the next page, and &minus;1 means the previous one."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-p</kbd> の数値引数で、現在のページを基準としてどの"
"ページに移動するかを指定します。0 は現在のページ、1 は次のページ、&minus;1 は"
"前のページを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-l\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-count_002dlines_002dpage\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-l\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-count_002dlines_002dpage\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"The <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x l</kbd> command (<code class=\"code\">count-lines-"
"page</code>) is good for deciding where to break a page in two.  It displays "
"in the echo area the total number of lines in the current page, and then "
"divides it up into those preceding the current line and those following, as "
"in"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x l</kbd> コマンド (<code class=\"code\">count-lines-"
"page</code>) は、ページをどこで2つに分けるかを決めるのに便利です。エコー領域"
"に現在のページの総行数を表示し、それを現在の行より前と後の行に分割します。例"
"えば次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Page has 96 (72+25) lines\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"Notice that the sum is off by one; this is correct if point is not at the "
"beginning of a line."
msgstr ""
"合計が1ずれていることに注意してください。点が行頭にない場合は、これで正解とな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-page_002ddelimiter\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-page_002ddelimiter\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pages.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">page-delimiter</code> controls where pages "
"begin.  Its value is a regular expression that matches the beginning of a "
"line that separates pages (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Regexps.html\">Syntax of Regular Expressions</a>).  The normal value "
"of this variable is <code class=\"code\">&quot;^\\f&quot;</code>, which "
"matches a formfeed character at the beginning of a line."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">page-delimiter</code> は、ページの開始位置を制御し"
"ます。その値は正規表現であり、ページを区切る行の先頭に一致します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regexps.html\">正規表現の構文</a>を参照）。この変数の"
"通常の値は <code class=\"code\">&quot;^\\f&quot;</code> であり、行の先頭にあ"
"るフォームフィード文字に一致します。"

