# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Paragraphs.html
msgid ""
"The precise definition of a paragraph boundary is controlled by the "
"variables <code class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">paragraph-start</code>.  The value of <code "
"class=\"code\">paragraph-start</code> is a regular expression that should "
"match lines that either start or separate paragraphs (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Regexps.html\">Syntax of Regular Expressions</a>).  The value of "
"<code class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</code> is another regular expression "
"that should match lines that separate paragraphs without being part of any "
"paragraph (for example, blank lines).  Lines that start a new paragraph and "
"are contained in it must match only <code class=\"code\">paragraph-start</"
"code>, not <code class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</code>.  For example, in "
"Fundamental mode, <code class=\"code\">paragraph-start</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;\\f\\\\|[&nbsp;\\t]*$&quot;</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</code> is <code class=\"code\">&quot;"
"[&nbsp;\\t\\f]*$&quot;</code>."
msgstr ""
"段落境界の厳密な定義は、変数 <code class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</code> "
"と <code class=\"code\">paragraph-start</code> によって制御されます。<code "
"class=\"code\">paragraph-start</code> の値は正規表現であり、段落の開始または"
"区切りとなる行に一致する必要があります（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Regexps.html\">正規表現の構文</a>を参照）。<code "
"class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</code> の値は別の正規表現であり、いずれの段"
"落にも属さず段落を区切る行（例えば空行）に一致する必要があります。新しい段落"
"を開始し、その段落に含まれる行は、<code class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</"
"code> ではなく <code class=\"code\">paragraph-start</code> にのみ一致する必要"
"があります。例えば、Fundamental モードでは、<code class=\"code\">paragraph-"
"start</code> は <code class=\"code\">&quot;\\f\\\\|[&nbsp;\\t]*$&quot;</"
"code> であり、<code class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;[&nbsp;\\t\\f]*$&quot;</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Paragraphs.html
msgid ""
"Note that <code class=\"code\">paragraph-start</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</code> are matched against the text at the "
"left margin, which is not necessarily the beginning of the line, so these "
"regexps should not use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo; as an "
"anchor, to ensure that the paragraph functions will work equally within a "
"region of text indented by a margin setting."
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">paragraph-start</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">paragraph-separate</code> は左マージンのテキストにマッチします"
"が、このテキストは必ずしも行頭であるとは限りません。そのため、マージン設定に"
"よってインデントされたテキスト領域内でも段落機能が同様に動作するよう、これら"
"の正規表現ではアンカーとして &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo; を使"
"用すべきではありません。"

