# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Parentheses.html
msgid ""
"When talking about these facilities, the term &ldquo;parenthesis&rdquo; also "
"includes braces, brackets, or whatever delimiters are defined to match in "
"pairs.  The major mode controls which delimiters are significant, through "
"the syntax table (see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Syntax-Tables.html#Syntax-"
"Tables\">Syntax Tables</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference "
"Manual</cite>).  In Lisp, only parentheses count; in C, these commands apply "
"to braces and brackets too."
msgstr ""
"これらの構文要素について述べる際、「括弧」という用語には、ブレースやブラケッ"
"ト、あるいはペアで対応するように定義されたあらゆる区切り文字も含まれます。メ"
"ジャーモードは、構文テーブル（<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference "
"Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Syntax-Tables.html#Syntax-Tables\">Syntax "
"Tables</a>を参照）を通じて、どの区切り文字が有効かを制御します。Lispでは括弧"
"のみが対象となりますが、C言語では、これらのコマンドはブレースやブラケットにも"
"適用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Parentheses.html
msgid ""
