msgstr ""
"<span>16.13.2 パーサーベースのFont Lock<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-font_002dlock-via-tree_002dsitter\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-parser_002dbased-font_002dlock\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-font_002dlock-via-tree_002dsitter\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-parser_002dbased-font_002dlock\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"If your Emacs was built with the tree-sitter library, it can use the results "
"of parsing the buffer text by that library for the purposes of "
"fontification.  This is usually faster and more accurate than the "
"&ldquo;traditional&rdquo; methods described in the previous subsection, "
"since the tree-sitter library provides full-blown parsers for programming "
"languages and other kinds of formatted text which it supports.  Major modes "
"which utilize the tree-sitter library are named <code class=\"code\"><var "
"class=\"var\">foo</var>-ts-mode</code>, with the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-ts-</samp>&rsquo; part indicating the use of the library.  "
"This subsection documents the Font Lock support based on the tree-sitter "
"library."
msgstr ""
"Emacsがtree-sitterライブラリを用いてビルドされている場合、フォント化のために"
"同ライブラリによるバッファテキストの解析結果を利用できます。tree-sitterライブ"
"ラリは、サポートしているプログラミング言語やその他の形式付きテキスト向けに本"
"格的なパーサーを提供しているため、これは通常、前節で説明した「従来の」手法よ"
"りも高速で高精度です。tree-sitterライブラリを利用するメジャーモードは<code "
"class=\"code\"><var class=\"var\">foo</var>-ts-mode</code>という名称になって"
"おり、「<samp class=\"samp\">-ts-</samp>」の部分がライブラリの使用を示してい"
"ます。本節では、tree-sitterライブラリに基づくFont Lockのサポートについて解説"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"treesit_002dfont_002dlock_002dlevel\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"treesit_002dfont_002dlock_002dlevel\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"You can control the amount of fontification applied by Font Lock mode of "
"major modes based on tree-sitter by customizing the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-level</code>.  Its value is a number "
"between 1 and 4:"
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-level</code> をカスタマイズするこ"
"とで、Tree-sitter ベースのメジャーモードの Font Lock モードによるフォント化の"
"度合いを調整できます。その値は 1 から 4 までの数値です："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid "Level 1"
msgstr "レベル1"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"This level usually fontifies only comments and function names in function "
"definitions."
msgstr ""
"このレベルでは通常、コメントと関数定義内の関数名のみがフォント表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid "Level 2"
msgstr "レベル2"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid "This level adds fontification of keywords, strings, and data types."
msgstr ""
"このレベルでは、キーワード、文字列、データ型のフォント化が追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid "Level 3"
msgstr "レベル3"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"This is the default level; it adds fontification of assignments, numbers, "
"etc."
msgstr "これはデフォルトのレベルで、代入や数値などのフォント装飾を追加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid "Level 4"
msgstr "レベル4"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"This level adds everything else that can be fontified: operators, "
"delimiters, brackets, other punctuation, function names in function calls, "
"property look ups, variables, etc."
msgstr ""
"このレベルでは、演算子、区切り文字、括弧、その他の句読点、関数呼び出し時の関"
"数名、プロパティ参照、変数など、フォント化可能なあらゆる要素が追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"treesit_002dfont_002dlock_002dfeature_002dlist\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"treesit_002dfont_002dlock_002dfeature_002dlist\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"What exactly constitutes each of the syntactical categories mentioned above "
"depends on the major mode and the parser grammar used by tree-sitter for the "
"major-mode&rsquo;s language.  However, in general the categories follow the "
"conventions of the programming language or the file format supported by the "
"major mode.  The buffer-local value of the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-feature-list</code> holds the fontification "
"features supported by a tree-sitter based major mode, where each sub-list "
"shows the features provided by the corresponding fontification level."
msgstr ""
"上述の各構文カテゴリが具体的に何を指すかは、メジャーモード、およびその言語に"
"対してTree-sitterが使用するパーサー文法によって決まります。ただし一般的に、こ"
"れらのカテゴリはプログラミング言語やメジャーモードがサポートするファイル形式"
"の慣習に従っています。変数 <code class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-feature-"
"list</code> のバッファローカル値には、Tree-sitterベースのメジャーモードがサ"
"ポートするフォント化機能が格納されており、各サブリストは対応するフォント化レ"
"ベルによって提供される機能を示しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Parser_002dbased-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"Once you change the value of <code class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-level</"
"code> via <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;customize-variable</kbd> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Specific-Customization.html\">Customizing Specific "
"Items</a>), it takes effect immediately in all the existing buffers and for "
"files you visit in the future in the same session."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;customize-variable</kbd> 経由で <code "
"class=\"code\">treesit-font-lock-level</code> の値を変更すると（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Specific-Customization.html\">特定項目のカスタマイズ</"
"a> を参照）、その変更は既存のすべてのバッファ、および同じセッション内で今後ア"
"クセスするファイルに即座に反映されます。"

