#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Point.html
msgid ""
"The term &ldquo;point&rdquo; comes from the character &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.</samp>&rsquo;, which was the command in TECO (the language "
"in which the original Emacs was written)  for accessing the editing position."
msgstr ""
