"windows\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-4\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-selecting-buffers-in-other-"
"windows\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-4\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pop-Up-Window.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4</kbd> is a prefix key for a variety of commands "
"that switch to a buffer in a different window&mdash;either another existing "
"window, or a new window created by splitting the selected window.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-Choice.html\">How <code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code> works</a>, for how Emacs picks or creates the window to use."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4</kbd> は、別のウィンドウ&mdash;既存の別のウィンド"
"ウ、あるいは選択中のウィンドウを分割して作成した新しいウィンドウ&mdash;のバッ"
"ファに切り替えるための、さまざまなコマンドのプレフィックスキーです。Emacs が"
"使用するウィンドウをどのように選択または作成するかについては、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Window-Choice.html\"><code class=\"code\">display-"
"buffer</code> の仕組み</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Pop-Up-Window.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 b <var class=\"var\">bufname</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 b <var class=\"var\">bufname</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pop-Up-Window.html
msgid ""
"Select buffer <var class=\"var\">bufname</var> in another window (<code "
"class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer-other-window</code>).  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Select-Buffer.html\">Creating and Selecting Buffers</a>."
msgstr ""
"別のウィンドウ (<code class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer-other-window</code>) で"
"バッファ <var class=\"var\">bufname</var> を選択します。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Select-Buffer.html\">バッファの作成と選択</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Pop-Up-Window.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-4-C_002do\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-display_002dbuffer-_0028command_0029\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 C-o <var class=\"var\">bufname</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"display_002dbuffer-_0028command_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-4-C_002do\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-display_002dbuffer-_0028command_0029\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 C-o <var class=\"var\">bufname</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"display_002dbuffer-_0028command_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pop-Up-Window.html
msgid ""
"Display buffer <var class=\"var\">bufname</var> in some window, without "
"trying to select it (<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>).  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Displaying-Buffers.html\">Displaying a Buffer in a "
"Window</a>, for details about how the window is chosen."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウを選択しようとせずに（<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</"
"code>）、あるウィンドウにバッファ <var class=\"var\">bufname</var> を表示しま"
"す。ウィンドウの選択方法の詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Displaying-Buffers.html\">ウィンドウへのバッファ表示</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Pop-Up-Window.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 f <var class=\"var\">filename</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 f <var class=\"var\">filename</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pop-Up-Window.html
msgid ""
"Visit file <var class=\"var\">filename</var> and select its buffer in "
"another window (<code class=\"code\">find-file-other-window</code>).  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Visiting.html\">Visiting Files</a>."
msgstr ""
"ファイル <var class=\"var\">filename</var> に移動し、別のウィンドウ (<code "
"class=\"code\">find-file-other-window</code>) でそのバッファを選択します。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Visiting.html\">ファイルの移動</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pop-Up-Window.html
msgid ""
"Select a Dired buffer for directory <var class=\"var\">directory</var> in "
"another window (<code class=\"code\">dired-other-window</code>).  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Dired.html\">Dired, the Directory Editor</a>."
msgstr ""
"別のウィンドウ (<code class=\"code\">dired-other-window</code>) で、ディレク"
"トリ <var class=\"var\">directory</var> 用の Dired バッファを選択します。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Dired.html\">Dired, the Directory Editor</a> を参照して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Pop-Up-Window.html build/html/emacs/Sending-Mail.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 m</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 4 m</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pop-Up-Window.html
msgid ""
"Start composing a mail message, similar to <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x m</kbd> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Sending-Mail.html\">Sending Mail</a>), but in "
"another window (<code class=\"code\">compose-mail-other-window</code>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x m</kbd>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Sending-"
