# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Pop-Up-Window.html
msgid ""
"Find the definition of an identifier, similar to <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-.</"
"kbd> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Xref.html\">Find Identifier References</"
