# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Position-Registers.html
msgid ""
"Record the position of point and the current buffer in register <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var> (<code class=\"code\">point-to-register</code>)."
