"entry-id\" id=\"index-point_002dto_002dregister\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Position-Registers.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">point-to-register</code>), followed by a character <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>, saves both the position of "
"point and the current buffer in register <var class=\"var\">r</var>.  The "
"register retains this information until you store something else in it."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">point-to-register</code>) と入力し、続けて文字 <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd> を入力すると、ポイントの位置と"
"現在のバッファの両方がレジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</var> に保存されます。こ"
"のレジスタには、他に何かを格納するまでこの情報が保持されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Position-Registers.html
msgid ""
