# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dlpr_002dcommand\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dlpr_002dswitches\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dprinter_002dname\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dlpr_002dcommand\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dlpr_002dswitches\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dprinter_002dname\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"All the PostScript hardcopy commands use the variables <code "
"class=\"code\">ps-lpr-command</code> and <code class=\"code\">ps-lpr-"
"switches</code> to specify how to print the output.  <code class=\"code\">ps-"
"lpr-command</code> specifies the command name to run, <code "
"class=\"code\">ps-lpr-switches</code> specifies command line options to use, "
"and <code class=\"code\">ps-printer-name</code> specifies the printer.  If "
"you don&rsquo;t set the first two variables yourself, they take their "
"initial values from <code class=\"code\">lpr-command</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">lpr-switches</code>.  If <code class=\"code\">ps-printer-"
"name</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <code class=\"code\">printer-"
"name</code> is used."
msgstr ""
"すべてのPostScriptハードコピーコマンドでは、出力の印刷方法を指定するために変"
"数 <code class=\"code\">ps-lpr-command</code> と <code class=\"code\">ps-lpr-"
"switches</code> を使用します。<code class=\"code\">ps-lpr-command</code> は実"
"行するコマンド名を、<code class=\"code\">ps-lpr-switches</code> は使用するコ"
"マンドラインオプションを、<code class=\"code\">ps-printer-name</code> はプリ"
"ンターを指定します。最初の2つの変数を自身で設定しない場合、それらは <code "
"class=\"code\">lpr-command</code> と <code class=\"code\">lpr-switches</"
"code> の初期値が適用されます。<code class=\"code\">ps-printer-name</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合は、<code class=\"code\">printer-"
"name</code> が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dprint_002dheader\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dprint_002dheader\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">ps-print-header</code> controls whether "
"these commands add header lines to each page&mdash;set it to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> to turn headers off."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">ps-print-header</code> は、これらのコマンドが各ペー"
"ジにヘッダー行を追加するかどうかを制御します。ヘッダーを無効にするには、"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-color-emulation-on-"
"black_002dand_002dwhite-printers\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-ps_002dprint_002dcolor_002dp\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-color-emulation-on-"
"black_002dand_002dwhite-printers\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-ps_002dprint_002dcolor_002dp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"If your printer doesn&rsquo;t support colors, you should turn off color "
"processing by setting <code class=\"code\">ps-print-color-p</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  By default, if the display supports colors, "
"Emacs produces hardcopy output with color information; on black-and-white "
"printers, colors are emulated with shades of gray.  This might produce "
"barely-readable or even illegible output, even if your screen colors only "
"use shades of gray."
msgstr ""
"プリンターがカラーに対応していない場合は、<code class=\"code\">ps-print-"
"color-p</code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定してカラー処理を無効"
"にしてください。デフォルトでは、ディスプレイがカラーに対応している場合、"
"Emacs はカラー情報を含むハードコピー出力を生成します。白黒プリンターでは、色"
"はグレーの濃淡でエミュレートされます。これにより、画面上の色がグレーの濃淡の"
"みであっても、出力がほとんど読めない、あるいは全く判読できない状態になる可能"
"性があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dblack_002dwhite_002dfaces\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dblack_002dwhite_002dfaces\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can set <code class=\"code\">ps-print-color-p</code> to "
"<code class=\"code\">black-white</code> to have colors display better on "
"black/white printers.  This works by using information in <code "
"class=\"code\">ps-black-white-faces</code> to express colors by customizable "
"list of shades of gray, augmented by bold and italic face attributes."
msgstr ""
"あるいは、白黒プリンターで色をより適切に表示させるために、<code "
"class=\"code\">ps-print-color-p</code> を <code class=\"code\">black-white</"
"code> に設定することもできます。これは、<code class=\"code\">ps-black-white-"
"faces</code> の情報を利用して、太字や斜体のフォント属性で補完した、カスタマイ"
"ズ可能なグレーの階調リストで色を表現する仕組みです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ps_002duse_002dface_002dbackground\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ps_002duse_002dface_002dbackground\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"By default, PostScript printing ignores the background colors of the faces, "
"unless the variable <code class=\"code\">ps-use-face-background</code> is "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  This is to avoid unwanted interference "
"with the zebra stripes and background image/text."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、変数 <code class=\"code\">ps-use-face-background</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> でない限り、PostScript 印刷では面の背景色が無"
"視されます。これは、ゼブラストライプや背景画像・テキストへの不要な干渉を防ぐ"
"ためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dpaper_002dtype\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ps_002dpage_002ddimensions_002ddatabase\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dpaper_002dtype\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ps_002dpage_002ddimensions_002ddatabase\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">ps-paper-type</code> specifies which size "
"of paper to format for; legitimate values include <code class=\"code\">a4</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">a3</code>, <code class=\"code\">a4small</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">b4</code>, <code class=\"code\">b5</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">executive</code>, <code class=\"code\">ledger</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">legal</code>, <code class=\"code\">letter</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">letter-small</code>, <code class=\"code\">statement</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">tabloid</code>.  The default is <code "
"class=\"code\">letter</code>.  You can define additional paper sizes by "
"changing the variable <code class=\"code\">ps-page-dimensions-database</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">ps-paper-type</code> は、どのサイズの用紙向けに"
"フォーマットするかを指定します。有効な値には、<code class=\"code\">a4</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">a3</code>、<code class=\"code\">a4small</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">b4</code>、<code class=\"code\">b5</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">executive</code>、<code class=\"code\">ledger</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">legal</code>、<code class=\"code\">letter</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">letter-small</code>、<code class=\"code\">statement</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">tabloid</code> があります。デフォルトは <code "
"class=\"code\">letter</code> です。変数 <code class=\"code\">ps-page-"
"dimensions-database</code> を変更することで、追加の用紙サイズを定義できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dlandscape_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dlandscape_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">ps-landscape-mode</code> specifies the "
"orientation of printing on the page.  The default is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, which stands for portrait mode.  Any non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value specifies landscape mode."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">ps-landscape-mode</code> は、ページ上の印刷方向を指"
"定します。デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で、これは縦向きを意味"
"します。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値はすべて横向きを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dnumber_002dof_002dcolumns\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dnumber_002dof_002dcolumns\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">ps-number-of-columns</code> specifies the "
"number of columns; it takes effect in both landscape and portrait mode.  The "
"default is 1."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">ps-number-of-columns</code> は列数を指定し、横向"
"き・縦向きのどちらのモードでも有効です。デフォルトは 1 です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dfont_002dfamily\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dfont_002dsize\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dfont_002dinfo_002ddatabase\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dfont_002dfamily\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dfont_002dsize\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dfont_002dinfo_002ddatabase\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">ps-font-family</code> specifies which font "
"family to use for printing ordinary text.  Legitimate values include <code "
"class=\"code\">Courier</code>, <code class=\"code\">Helvetica</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">NewCenturySchlbk</code>, <code class=\"code\">Palatino</code> "
"and <code class=\"code\">Times</code>.  The variable <code class=\"code\">ps-"
"font-size</code> specifies the size of the font for ordinary text and "
"defaults to 8.5 points.  The value of <code class=\"code\">ps-font-size</"
"code> can also be a cons of 2 floats: one for landscape mode, the other for "
"portrait mode."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">ps-font-family</code> は、通常のテキストの印刷に使"
"用するフォントファミリーを指定します。有効な値には <code "
"class=\"code\">Courier</code>、<code class=\"code\">Helvetica</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">NewCenturySchlbk</code>、<code class=\"code\">Palatino</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">Times</code> があります。変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">ps-font-size</code> は通常テキストのフォントサイズを指定し、デ"
"フォルトは 8.5 ポイントです。<code class=\"code\">ps-font-size</code> の値に"
"は、横向きモード用と縦向きモード用の 2 つの浮動小数点数からなるコンスを指定す"
"ることもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dmultibyte_002dbuffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Intlfonts-for-PostScript-printing\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fonts-for-PostScript-printing\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ps_002dmultibyte_002dbuffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Intlfonts-for-PostScript-printing\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-fonts-for-PostScript-printing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"Emacs supports more scripts and characters than a typical PostScript "
"printer.  Thus, some of the characters in your buffer might not be printable "
"using the fonts built into your printer.  You can augment the fonts supplied "
"with the printer with those from the GNU Intlfonts package, or you can "
"instruct Emacs to use Intlfonts exclusively.  The variable <code "
"class=\"code\">ps-multibyte-buffer</code> controls this: the default value, "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, is appropriate for printing <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> and Latin-1 characters; a value of <code "
"class=\"code\">non-latin-printer</code> is for printers which have the fonts "
"for <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>, Latin-1, Japanese, and Korean "
"characters built into them.  A value of <code class=\"code\">bdf-font</code> "
"arranges for the BDF fonts from the Intlfonts package to be used for <em "
"class=\"emph\">all</em> characters.  Finally, a value of <code "
"class=\"code\">bdf-font-except-latin</code> instructs the printer to use "
"built-in fonts for <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> and Latin-1 "
"characters, and Intlfonts BDF fonts for the rest."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、一般的なPostScriptプリンターよりも多くのスクリプトや文字をサポートし"
"ています。そのため、バッファ内の一部の文字は、プリンターに内蔵されているフォ"
"ントでは印刷できない場合があります。プリンターに付属しているフォントをGNU "
"Intlfontsパッケージのフォントで補完するか、あるいはEmacsにIntlfontsのみを使用"
"するように指定することができます。これを制御するのが変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">ps-multibyte-buffer</code> です。デフォルト値の <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> は、<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> および "
"Latin-1 文字の印刷に適しています。<code class=\"code\">non-latin-printer</"
"code> は、<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>、Latin-1、日本語、および韓国語"
"のフォントを内蔵しているプリンター向けです。<code class=\"code\">bdf-font</"
"code> を指定すると、IntlfontsパッケージのBDFフォントが<em class=\"emph\">すべ"
"ての</em>文字に使用されるようになります。最後に、<code class=\"code\">bdf-"
"font-except-latin</code> を指定すると、<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> "
"および Latin-1 文字には内蔵フォントを、それ以外の文字にはIntlfontsのBDFフォン"
"トを使用するようにプリンターに指示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bdf_002ddirectory_002dlist\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-bdf_002ddirectory_002dlist\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/PostScript-Variables.html
msgid ""
"To be able to use the BDF fonts, Emacs needs to know where to find them.  "
"The variable <code class=\"code\">bdf-directory-list</code> holds the list "
"of directories where Emacs should look for the fonts; the default value "
"includes a single directory <samp class=\"file\">/usr/local/share/emacs/"
"fonts/bdf</samp>."
msgstr ""
"BDFフォントを使用するには、Emacsがそれらの所在を把握している必要があります。"
"変数 <code class=\"code\">bdf-directory-list</code> には、Emacsがフォントを探"
"すべきディレクトリの一覧が格納されており、デフォルト値には単一のディレクトリ "
"<samp class=\"file\">/usr/local/share/emacs/fonts/bdf</samp> が含まれていま"
"す。"

