"code> package, which reformats Lisp objects with nice-looking indentation.  "
"See <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/elisp/Output-Functions.html#Output-Functions\">pp</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
