# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Program-Modes.html
msgid ""
"Major modes for programming languages can use services of <em "
"class=\"dfn\">language servers</em> via the facilities provided by the Eglot "
"package.  Eglot implements LSP, the <em class=\"dfn\">language server "
"protocol</em>, which allows Emacs to receive language-specific information "
"and services that enrich and extend source code editing capabilities.  See "
"<a data-manual=\"eglot\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/eglot/Eglot-Features.html#Eglot-Features\">Eglot Features</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">Eglot: The Emacs LSP Client</cite>."
msgstr ""
"プログラミング言語の主要なモードでは、Eglotパッケージが提供する機能を通じて"
"<em class=\"dfn\">言語サーバー</em>のサービスを利用できます。EglotはLSP（<em "
"class=\"dfn\">言語サーバープロトコル</em>）を実装しており、これによりEmacs"
"は、ソースコード編集機能を拡充・拡張する言語固有の情報やサービスを受け取るこ"
"とができます。<cite class=\"cite\">Eglot: The Emacs LSP Client</cite>の<a "
"data-manual=\"eglot\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/eglot/Eglot-Features.html#Eglot-Features\">Eglot Features</a>を参照"
"してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Program-Modes.html
msgid ""
