# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Programming-Language-Doc.html
msgid ""
"The value of this user option controls the amount of idle time before the at-"
"point documentation is displayed.  It should be set to the number of seconds "
"to wait; the value of zero means to display without any delay.  The default "
"is 0.5 sec."
msgstr ""
"このユーザーオプションの値は、at-point ドキュメントが表示されるまでの待機時間"
"を制御します。待機する秒数を指定してください。値が 0 の場合は、遅延なく表示さ"
"れます。デフォルトは 0.5 秒です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Programming-Language-Doc.html
msgid ""
