# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Project-Buffer-Commands.html
msgid ""
"Like the command <code class=\"code\">list-buffers</code> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"List-Buffers.html\">Listing Existing Buffers</a>), "
"the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x p C-b</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">project-"
"list-buffers</code>) displays a list of existing buffers, but only belonging "
"to the current project."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <code class=\"code\">list-buffers</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"List-Buffers.html\">既存バッファの一覧表示</a>を参照）と同様に、コマン"
"ド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x p C-b</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">project-list-"
"buffers</code>) は、現在のプロジェクトに属する既存バッファの一覧を表示しま"
"す。"

