# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Query-Replace.html
msgid ""
"If you want to change only some of the occurrences of &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">bar</"
"samp>&rsquo;, not all of them, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-%</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">query-replace</code>).  This command finds occurrences of "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; one by one, displays each "
"occurrence and asks you whether to replace it.  Aside from querying, <code "
"class=\"code\">query-replace</code> works just like <code "
"class=\"code\">replace-string</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Unconditional-Replace.html\">Unconditional Replacement</a>).  In "
"particular, it preserves case provided that <code class=\"code\">case-"
"replace</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, as it normally is "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html\">Replace "
"Commands and Lax Matches</a>).  A numeric argument means to consider only "
"occurrences that are bounded by word-delimiter characters.  A negative "
"prefix argument replaces backward."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; の出現箇所をすべてではなく、一"
"部だけ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">bar</samp>&rsquo; に変更したい場合は、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-%</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">query-replace</code>) を使"
"用します。このコマンドは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; の出現"
"箇所を一つずつ探し、各箇所を表示して置換するかどうかを尋ねます。クエリ機能を"
"除けば、<code class=\"code\">query-replace</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">replace-string</code> と同様に動作します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Unconditional-Replace.html\">無条件置換</a> を参照）。特に、通常と同様"
"に <code class=\"code\">case-replace</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> でない限り、大文字と小文字は区別されません（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html\">置換コマンドと緩いマッチング</a> を"
"参照）。数値引数を指定すると、単語区切り文字で囲まれた出現箇所のみを考慮しま"
"す。負の接頭辞引数を指定すると、逆方向から置換します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Query-Replace.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dM_002d_0025\"></a> <a "
