# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Query-Replace.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-%</kbd> performs regexp search and replace (<code "
"class=\"code\">query-replace-regexp</code>).  It works like <code "
"class=\"code\">replace-regexp</code> except that it queries like <code "
"class=\"code\">query-replace</code>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-%</kbd> は正規表現による検索・置換（<code "
"class=\"code\">query-replace-regexp</code>）を行います。動作は <code "
"class=\"code\">replace-regexp</code> と同様ですが、クエリの形式は <code "
"class=\"code\">query-replace</code> のようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Query-Replace.html
