#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Recover.html
msgid ""
"<span>20.6.3 Recovering Data from Auto-Saves<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Recovering-Data-from-Auto_002dSaves\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>20.6.3 自動保存からのデータの復元<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Recovering-Data-from-Auto_002dSaves\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Recover.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recover_002dfile\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recover_002dfile\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Recover.html
msgid ""
"You can use the contents of an auto-save file to recover from a loss of data "
"with the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x recover-file <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd> <var class=\"var\">file</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>.  This "
"visits <var class=\"var\">file</var> and then (after your confirmation)  "
"restores the contents from its auto-save file <samp class=\"file\">#<var "
"class=\"var\">file</var>#</samp>.  You can then save with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-s</kbd> to put the recovered text into <var "
"class=\"var\">file</var> itself.  For example, to recover file <samp "
"class=\"file\">foo.c</samp> from its auto-save file <samp "
"class=\"file\">#foo.c#</samp>, do:"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x recover-file <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">file</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> コマンドを使用す"
"ると、自動保存ファイルの内容を利用してデータの消失から復旧できます。このコマ"
"ンドは <var class=\"var\">file</var> を参照し、（確認操作の後）その自動保存"
"ファイル <samp class=\"file\">#<var class=\"var\">file</var>#</samp> から内容"
"を復元します。その後、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-s</kbd> で保存することで、復元"
"したテキストを <var class=\"var\">file</var> 自体に格納できます。例えば、自動"
"保存ファイル <samp class=\"file\">#foo.c#</samp> からファイル <samp "
"class=\"file\">foo.c</samp> を復元するには、次のように操作します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Recover.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"M-x recover-file <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> foo.c <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
"yes <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
"C-x C-s\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Recover.html
msgid ""
"Before asking for confirmation, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x recover-file</kbd> "
"displays a directory listing describing the specified file and the auto-save "
"file, so you can compare their sizes and dates.  If the auto-save file is "
"older, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x recover-file</kbd> does not offer to read it."
msgstr ""
"確認を求める前に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x recover-file</kbd> は指定したファイ"
"ルと自動保存ファイルの詳細を示すディレクトリ一覧を表示するため、それぞれのサ"
"イズや日付を比較できます。自動保存ファイルの方が古い場合、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x recover-file</kbd> はその読み込みを提案しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Recover.html
msgid ""
"When <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x recover-file</kbd> asks for confirmation, if you "
"answer with <kbd class=\"kbd\">diff</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">=</kbd>, it "
"shows the diffs between <var class=\"var\">file</var> and its auto-save file "
"<samp class=\"file\">#<var class=\"var\">file</var>#</samp> and reprompts "
"you for confirmation."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x recover-file</kbd> が確認を求めた際に <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">diff</kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">=</kbd> と答えると、<var "
"class=\"var\">file</var> と自動保存ファイル <samp class=\"file\">#<var "
"class=\"var\">file</var>#</samp> の差分が表示され、再度確認を求められます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Recover.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recover_002dsession\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-recover_002dsession\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Recover.html
msgid ""
"If Emacs or the computer crashes, you can recover all the files you were "
"editing from their auto save files with the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"recover-session</kbd>.  This first shows you a list of recorded interrupted "
"sessions.  Move point to the one you choose, and type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c "
"C-c</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsやコンピュータがクラッシュした場合、コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"recover-session</kbd> を使えば、自動保存ファイルから編集していたすべてのファ"
"イルを復元できます。まず、中断されたセッションの一覧が表示されます。目的の"
"セッションにポイントを移動し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c</kbd> と入力してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Recover.html
msgid ""
"Then <code class=\"code\">recover-session</code> asks about each of the "
"files that were being edited during that session, asking whether to recover "
"that file.  If you answer <kbd class=\"kbd\">y</kbd>, it calls <code "
"class=\"code\">recover-file</code>, which works in its normal fashion.  It "
"shows the dates of the original file and its auto-save file, and asks once "
"again whether to recover that file."
msgstr ""
"次に <code class=\"code\">recover-session</code> が、そのセッション中に編集さ"
"れていた各ファイルについて、そのファイルを復元するかどうかを尋ねます。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">y</kbd> と答えると <code class=\"code\">recover-file</code> が"
"呼び出され、通常通りに動作します。そこでは、元のファイルと自動保存ファイルの"
"日付が表示され、改めてそのファイルを復元するかどうかが尋ねられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Recover.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"auto_002dsave_002dlist_002dfile_002dprefix\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"auto_002dsave_002dlist_002dfile_002dprefix\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Recover.html
msgid ""
"Emacs records information about interrupted sessions in files named <samp "
"class=\"file\">.saves-<var class=\"var\">pid</var>-<var "
"class=\"var\">hostname</var>~</samp> in the directory <samp "
"class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/auto-save-list/</samp>.  This directory is "
"determined by the variable <code class=\"code\">auto-save-list-file-prefix</"
"code>.  If you set <code class=\"code\">auto-save-list-file-prefix</code> to "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, sessions are not recorded for recovery."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、中断されたセッションに関する情報を、ディレクトリ <samp "
"class=\"file\">~/.emacs.d/auto-save-list/</samp> 内の <samp "
"class=\"file\">.saves-<var class=\"var\">pid</var>-<var "
"class=\"var\">hostname</var>~</samp> という名前のファイルに記録します。この"
"ディレクトリは変数 <code class=\"code\">auto-save-list-file-prefix</code> に"
"よって決定されます。<code class=\"code\">auto-save-list-file-prefix</code> "
"を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定すると、復旧用のセッションは記録され"
"ません。"

