# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles-in-Picture.html
msgid ""
"Picture mode defines commands for working on rectangular pieces of the text "
"in ways that fit with the quarter-plane model.  The standard rectangle "
"commands may also be useful.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Rectangles.html\">Rectangles</a>."
msgstr ""
"ピクチャーモードでは、四分平面モデルに適合する形で、テキストの矩形領域を操作"
"するためのコマンドが定義されています。標準的な矩形コマンドも役立つ場合があり"
"ます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Rectangles.html\">矩形</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles-in-Picture.html
msgid ""
"Clear out the region-rectangle with spaces (<code class=\"code\">picture-"
"clear-rectangle</code>).  With a prefix argument, delete the text."
msgstr ""
"領域矩形をスペース (<code class=\"code\">picture-clear-rectangle</code>) でク"
"リアします。接頭辞引数を指定すると、テキストを削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles-in-Picture.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-w <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-w <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles-in-Picture.html
msgid ""
"Similar, but save rectangle contents in register <var class=\"var\">r</var> "
"first (<code class=\"code\">picture-clear-rectangle-to-register</code>).  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Registers.html\">Registers</a>."
msgstr ""
"同様ですが、まず矩形の内容をレジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</var> (<code "
"class=\"code\">picture-clear-rectangle-to-register</code>) に保存します。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Registers.html\">レジスタ</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles-in-Picture.html
msgid ""
"Copy last killed rectangle into the buffer by overwriting, with upper left "
"corner at point (<code class=\"code\">picture-yank-rectangle</code>).  With "
"argument, insert instead."
msgstr ""
"最後に消した矩形を、左上隅を点 (<code class=\"code\">picture-yank-rectangle</"
"code>) として上書きすることでバッファにコピーします。引数を指定すると、代わり"
"に挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles-in-Picture.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-x <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-x <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles-in-Picture.html
msgid ""
"Similar, but use the rectangle in register <var class=\"var\">r</var> (<code "
"class=\"code\">picture-yank-rectangle-from-register</code>)."
msgstr ""
"同様ですが、レジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</var> (<code "
"class=\"code\">picture-yank-rectangle-from-register</code>) の矩形を使用して"
"ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles-in-Picture.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dk-_0028Picture-"
"mode_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dw-"
"_0028Picture-mode_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"picture_002dclear_002drectangle\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-picture_002dclear_002drectangle_002dto_002dregister\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dk-_0028Picture-"
"mode_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dw-"
"_0028Picture-mode_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
