# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Rectangle</em> commands operate on rectangular areas of "
"the text: all the characters between a certain pair of columns, in a certain "
"range of lines.  Emacs has commands to kill rectangles, yank killed "
"rectangles, clear them out, fill them with blanks or text, or delete them.  "
