# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles.html
msgid ""
"To yank the last killed rectangle, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r y</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">yank-rectangle</code>).  The rectangle&rsquo;s first "
"line is inserted at point, the rectangle&rsquo;s second line is inserted at "
"the same horizontal position one line vertically below, and so on.  The "
"number of lines affected is determined by the height of the saved rectangle."
msgstr ""
"最後に削除した矩形をヤンクするには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r y</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">yank-rectangle</code>) と入力します。矩形の1行目はポイントに挿"
"入され、2行目はそれより1行下の同じ水平位置に挿入され、以降も同様に続きます。"
"影響を受ける行数は、保存された矩形の高さによって決まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles.html
msgid ""
"For example, you can convert two single-column lists into a double-column "
"list by killing one of the single-column lists as a rectangle, and then "
"yanking it beside the other list."
msgstr ""
