"class=\"kbd\">C-x r r <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x r i <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Rectangle-Registers.html\">Saving Rectangles in "
"Registers</a>."
msgstr ""
