msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r N</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">rectangle-"
"number-lines</code>) inserts line numbers along the left edge of the region-"
"rectangle.  Normally, the numbering begins from 1 (for the first line of the "
"rectangle).  With a prefix argument, the command prompts for a number to "
"begin from, and for a format string with which to print the numbers (see <a "
"data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html#Formatting-Strings\">Formatting "
"Strings</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r N</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">rectangle-"
"number-lines</code>) は、領域矩形の左端に沿って行番号を挿入します。通常、番号"
"は 1（矩形の1行目）から始まります。接頭辞引数を指定すると、このコマンドは開始"
"番号と、番号を出力するためのフォーマット文字列の入力を求めます（<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Formatting-Strings.html#Formatting-Strings\">Formatting Strings</a> を"
"参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-r-t\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-string_002drectangle\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-r-t\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-string_002drectangle\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r t</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">string-"
"rectangle</code>) replaces the contents of a region-rectangle with a string "
"on each line.  The string&rsquo;s width need not be the same as the width of "
"the rectangle.  If the string&rsquo;s width is less, the text after the "
"rectangle shifts left; if the string is wider than the rectangle, the text "
"after the rectangle shifts right."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r t</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">string-"
"rectangle</code>) は、領域矩形の内容を各行の文字列で置き換えます。文字列の幅"
"は、矩形の幅と同じである必要はありません。文字列の幅が狭い場合は、矩形以降の"
"テキストが左にずれ、文字列が矩形より広い場合は、矩形以降のテキストが右にずれ"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-string_002dinsert_002drectangle\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-string_002dinsert_002drectangle\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x string-insert-rectangle</kbd> is similar "
"to <code class=\"code\">string-rectangle</code>, but inserts the string on "
"each line, shifting the original text to the right."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x string-insert-rectangle</kbd> は <code "
"class=\"code\">string-rectangle</code> と同様ですが、各行に文字列を挿入し、元"
"のテキストを右にずらします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rectangle_002dmark_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rectangle_002dmark_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">rectangle-mark-mode</code>) toggles whether the region-"
"rectangle or the standard region is highlighted (first activating the region "
"if necessary).  When this mode is enabled, commands that resize the region "
"(<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> etc.) do so in a "
"rectangular fashion, and killing and yanking operate on the rectangle.  See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Killing.html\">Killing and Moving Text</a>.  The "
"mode persists only as long as the region is active."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">rectangle-mark-mode</code>) は、リージョン矩形と標準リージョン"
"のどちらをハイライトするかを切り替えます（必要に応じて、まずリージョンを有効"
"にします）。このモードが有効な場合、リージョンのサイズを変更するコマンド"
"（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-n</kbd> など）は矩形単位"
"で処理され、キルやヤンクもこの矩形に対して行われます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Killing.html\">テキストのキルと移動</a> を参照してください。このモード"
"は、リージョンが有効な間のみ持続します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles.html
msgid ""
"The region-rectangle works only when the mark is active.  In particular, "
"when Transient Mark mode is off (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Disabled-"
"Transient-Mark.html\">Disabling Transient Mark Mode</a>), in addition to "
"typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> you will "
"need to activate the mark."
msgstr ""
"リージョン矩形は、マークが有効な場合にのみ機能します。特に、一時マークモード"
"がオフの場合（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Disabled-Transient-Mark.html\">一時"
"マークモードの無効化</a>を参照）、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> を入力するだけでなく、マークを有効にする必要が"
"あります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles.html
msgid ""
"Unlike the standard region, the region-rectangle can have its corners "
"extended past the end of buffer, or inside stretches of white space that "
"point normally cannot enter, like in the middle of a TAB character."
msgstr ""
"標準領域とは異なり、領域矩形の角はバッファの終端を超えて延びたり、通常はポイ"
"ンタが進入できない空白領域（TAB文字の途中など）にまで入り込んだりすることがあ"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"rectangle_002dexchange_002dpoint_002dand_002dmark\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-exchange_002dpoint_002dand_002dmark_002c-in-"
"rectangle_002dmark_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"C_002dx-C_002dx_002c-in-rectangle_002dmark_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"rectangle_002dexchange_002dpoint_002dand_002dmark\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-exchange_002dpoint_002dand_002dmark_002c-in-"
"rectangle_002dmark_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"C_002dx-C_002dx_002c-in-rectangle_002dmark_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rectangles.html
msgid ""
"When the region is active (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mark.html\">The "
"Mark and the Region</a>) and in rectangle-mark-mode, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"C-x</kbd> runs the command <code class=\"code\">rectangle-exchange-point-and-"
"mark</code>, which cycles between the four corners of the region-rectangle.  "
"This comes in handy if you want to modify the dimensions of the region-"
"rectangle before invoking an operation on the marked text."
msgstr ""
"リージョンがアクティブな状態（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mark.html\">マークと"
"リージョン</a>を参照）で、かつ矩形マークモードの場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"C-x</kbd> はリージョン矩形の4つの頂点を順に移動するコマンド <code "
"class=\"code\">rectangle-exchange-point-and-mark</code> を実行します。これ"
"は、マークされたテキストに対して操作を行う前に、リージョン矩形の寸法を変更し"
"たい場合に便利です。"

