"要素には &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">w</samp>&rsquo;、空白には &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"> </"
"samp>&rsquo;、通常の句読点には &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.</samp>&rsquo; な"
"どが該当します。<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> "
"の <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Syntax-Class-Table.html#Syntax-Class-Table\">構文クラス表</"
"a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">\\S<var class=\"var\">c</var></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">\\S<var class=\"var\">c</var></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
