"describe_002dcategories\"></a> <a id=\"index-categories-of-characters\"></"
"a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">\\c<var class=\"var\">c</var></kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-categories-of-characters\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Backslash.html
msgid ""
"matches any character that belongs to the category <var class=\"var\">c</"
"var>.  For example, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\cc</samp>&rsquo; matches "
"Chinese characters, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\cg</samp>&rsquo; matches "
