# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Example.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of a regexp&mdash;similar to the regexp that Emacs uses, "
"by default, to recognize the end of a sentence, not including the following "
"space (i.e., the variable <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-base</code>):"
msgstr ""
"以下に正規表現の例を示します。これは、Emacsがデフォルトで文末を判定する際に使"
"用する正規表現（後続のスペースは含まない。すなわち、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end-base</code>）と同様のものです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Example.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "[.?!][]\\&quot;')}]*\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Example.html
msgid ""
"This contains two parts in succession: a character set matching period, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?</samp>&rsquo;, or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">!"
"</samp>&rsquo;, and a character set matching close-brackets, quotes, or "
"parentheses, repeated zero or more times."
msgstr ""
"これには、文字セットに一致する期間（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?</"
"samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">!</samp>&rsquo;）と、閉じ括"
"弧、引用符、または丸括弧に一致する文字セットが0回以上繰り返される、という2つ"
"の部分が連続して含まれています。"

