#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"<span>17.10.2 Regexp Replacement<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Regexp-"
"Replacement\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>17.10.2 正規表現による置換<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Regexp-"
"Replacement\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-replace_002dregexp\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-replace_002dregexp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"The <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x replace-string</kbd> command replaces exact "
"matches for a single string.  The similar command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"replace-regexp</kbd> replaces any match for a specified regular expression "
"pattern (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regexps.html\">Syntax of Regular "
"Expressions</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x replace-string</kbd> コマンドは、単一の文字列に対する"
"完全一致を置換します。類似のコマンドである <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x replace-"
"regexp</kbd> は、指定した正規表現パターンに一致するあらゆる箇所を置換します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regexps.html\">正規表現の構文</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x replace-regexp <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">regexp</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">newstring</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x replace-regexp <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">regexp</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">newstring</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"Replace every match for <var class=\"var\">regexp</var> with <var "
"class=\"var\">newstring</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> のすべての出現箇所を <var "
"class=\"var\">newstring</var> に置換してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-back-reference_002c-in-regexp-"
"replacement\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-back-reference_002c-in-regexp-"
"replacement\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"In <code class=\"code\">replace-regexp</code>, the <var "
"class=\"var\">newstring</var> need not be constant: it can refer to all or "
"part of what is matched by the <var class=\"var\">regexp</var>.  &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\&amp;</samp>&rsquo; in <var class=\"var\">newstring</"
"var> stands for the entire match being replaced.  &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\<var class=\"var\">d</var></samp>&rsquo; in <var "
"class=\"var\">newstring</var>, where <var class=\"var\">d</var> is a digit "
"starting from 1, stands for whatever matched the <var class=\"var\">d</"
"var>th parenthesized grouping in <var class=\"var\">regexp</var>.  (This is "
"called a &ldquo;back reference&rdquo;.)  &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\#</"
"samp>&rsquo; refers to the count of replacements already made in this "
"command, as a decimal number.  In the first replacement, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\#</samp>&rsquo; stands for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</"
"samp>&rsquo;; in the second, for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">1</"
"samp>&rsquo;; and so on.  For example,"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">replace-regexp</code> において、<var "
"class=\"var\">newstring</var> は定数である必要はありません。<var "
"class=\"var\">regexp</var> でマッチした部分の全部または一部を参照できます。"
"<var class=\"var\">newstring</var> 内の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\&amp;</"
"samp>&rsquo; は、置換対象となるマッチ全体を表します。<var "
"class=\"var\">newstring</var> 内の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\<var "
"class=\"var\">d</var></samp>&rsquo;（ここで <var class=\"var\">d</var> は 1 "
"から始まる数字）は、<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> の <var class=\"var\">d</"
"var> 番目の括弧で囲まれたグループにマッチしたものを表します。（これは「後方参"
"照」と呼ばれます。）&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\#</samp>&rsquo; は、このコ"
"マンドで既に行われた置換回数を10進数で表します。1回目の置換では &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\#</samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</"
"samp>&rsquo; を、2回目では &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">1</samp>&rsquo; を、と"
"いうように表します。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "M-x replace-regexp <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> c[ad]+r <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> \\&amp;-safe <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"replaces (for example) &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cadr</samp>&rsquo; with "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cadr-safe</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">cddr</samp>&rsquo; with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cddr-"
"safe</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"（例えば）&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cadr</samp>&rsquo;を&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">cadr-safe</samp>&rsquo;に、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cddr</"
"samp>&rsquo;を&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">cddr-safe</samp>&rsquo;に置き換えま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "M-x replace-regexp <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> \\(c[ad]+r\\)-safe <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> \\1 <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"performs the inverse transformation.  To include a &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; in the text to replace with, you must enter "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"逆変換を行います。テキスト内で置換対象として「<samp class=\"samp\">\\</"
"samp>」を含めるには、「<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\</samp>」と入力する必要があり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"If you want to enter part of the replacement string by hand each time, use "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\?</samp>&rsquo; in the replacement string.  "
"Each replacement will ask you to edit the replacement string in the "
"minibuffer, putting point where the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\?</"
"samp>&rsquo; was."
msgstr ""
"置換文字列の一部を毎回手動で入力したい場合は、置換文字列に &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\?</samp>&rsquo; を使用してください。置換を行うたびに、ミニ"
"バッファ内で置換文字列を編集するよう求められ、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\?"
"</samp>&rsquo; があった位置にポイントが置かれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"The remainder of this subsection is intended for specialized tasks and "
"requires knowledge of Lisp.  Most readers can skip it."
msgstr ""
"本節の残りの部分は専門的なタスクを対象としており、Lispの知識が必要です。ほと"
"んどの読者は読み飛ばして構いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"You can use Lisp expressions to calculate parts of the replacement string.  "
"To do this, write &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\,</samp>&rsquo; followed by "
"the expression in the replacement string.  Each replacement calculates the "
"value of the expression and converts it to text without quoting (if "
"it&rsquo;s a string, this means using the string&rsquo;s contents), and uses "
"it in the replacement string in place of the expression itself.  If the "
"expression is a symbol, one space in the replacement string after the symbol "
"name goes with the symbol name, so the value replaces them both."
msgstr ""
"Lisp式を使用して、置換文字列の一部を計算できます。これを行うには、置換文字列"
"内で &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\,</samp>&rsquo; と記述し、その後に式を続け"
"ます。各置換処理では、式の値を計算してクォートなしでテキストに変換し（文字列"
"の場合はその内容を使用します）、式そのものの代わりに置換文字列内でその値を使"
"用します。式がシンボルの場合、置換文字列内のシンボル名の後のスペース1つがシン"
"ボル名に付随するため、その値が両方を置き換えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"Inside such an expression, you can use some special sequences.  &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\&amp;</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\<var "
"class=\"var\">d</var></samp>&rsquo; refer here, as usual, to the entire "
"match as a string, and to a submatch as a string.  <var class=\"var\">d</"
"var> may be multiple digits, and the value of &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\<var class=\"var\">d</var></samp>&rsquo; is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> if the <var class=\"var\">d</var>&rsquo;th "
"parenthesized grouping did not match.  You can also use &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\#&amp;</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\#<var class=\"var\">d</var></samp>&rsquo; to refer to those "
"matches as numbers (this is valid when the match or submatch has the form of "
"a numeral).  &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\#</samp>&rsquo; here too stands "
"for the number of already-completed replacements."
msgstr ""
"このような式の中では、いくつかの特殊なシーケンスを使用できます。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\&amp;</samp>&rsquo;および&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\<var "
"class=\"var\">d</var></samp>&rsquo;は、ここでも通常通り、マッチ全体を文字列と"
"して、またサブマッチを文字列として参照します。&lsquo;<var class=\"var\">d</"
"var>&rsquo;は複数の桁数になる場合があり、&lsquo;<var class=\"var\">d</"
"var>&rsquo;番目の括弧で囲まれたグループがマッチしなかった場合、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\<var class=\"var\">d</var></samp>&rsquo;の値は<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>となります。また、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\#&amp;</samp>&rsquo;および&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\#<var class=\"var\">d</var></samp>&rsquo;を使用して、それら"
"のマッチを数値として参照することもできます（これは、マッチまたはサブマッチが"
"数値の形式である場合に有効です）。ここでの&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\#</"
"samp>&rsquo;も、すでに完了した置換の回数を表します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"For example, we can exchange &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">x</samp>&rsquo; and "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">y</samp>&rsquo; this way:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">x</samp>&rsquo;と&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">y</samp>&rsquo;を次のように入れ替えることができます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"M-x replace-regexp <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> \\(x\\)\\|y <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
"\\,(if \\1 &quot;y&quot; &quot;x&quot;) <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
msgid ""
"For computing replacement strings for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\,</"
"samp>&rsquo;, the <code class=\"code\">format</code> function is often "
"useful (see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Formatting-Strings.html#Formatting-"
"Strings\">Formatting Strings</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp "
"Reference Manual</cite>).  For example, to add consecutively numbered "
"strings like &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ABC00042</samp>&rsquo; to columns "
"73 to&nbsp;80 (unless they are already occupied), you can use"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\,</samp>&rsquo; の置換文字列を計算する場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">format</code> 関数が有用なことが多いです（<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Formatting-Strings.html#Formatting-Strings\">Formatting Strings</a> を"
"参照してください）。例えば、73列目から80列目まで（すでに使用されている場合を"
"除く）に、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ABC00042</samp>&rsquo; のように連番の文"
"字列を追加するには、以下を使用できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Regexp-Replace.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"M-x replace-regexp <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> ^.\\{0,72\\}$ <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
"\\,(format &quot;%-72sABC%05d&quot; \\&amp; \\#) <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

