"x&nbsp;8&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>&nbsp;3fffff&nbsp;<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd>&nbsp;]</kbd>.  Emacs will show the equivalent"
msgstr ""
"正規表現を用いて生バイト（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"International-"
"Chars.html\">国際文字セット入門</a>を参照）を検索するには、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-s&nbsp;[&nbsp;C-x&nbsp;8&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
