# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Registers.html
msgid ""
"Emacs <em class=\"dfn\">registers</em> are compartments where you can save "
"text, rectangles, positions, and other things for later use.  Once you save "
"text or a rectangle in a register, you can copy it into the buffer once or "
"many times; once you save a position in a register, you can jump back to "
"that position once or many times."
msgstr ""
"Emacsの<em class=\"dfn\">レジスタ</em>とは、テキストや矩形、位置などを保存し"
"て後で利用するための領域のことです。レジスタにテキストや矩形を保存すれば、そ"
"れをバッファに1回または複数回コピーできます。また、レジスタに位置を保存すれ"
"ば、その位置へ1回または複数回ジャンプできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Registers.html
msgid ""
"Each register has a name that consists of a single character, which we will "
"denote by <var class=\"var\">r</var>; <var class=\"var\">r</var> can be a "
"letter (such as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo;)  or a number "
"(such as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">1</samp>&rsquo;); case matters, so "
"register &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo; is not the same as "
"register &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo;.  You can also set a "
"register in non-alphanumeric characters, for instance &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">C-d</samp>&rsquo; by using for example <kbd class=\"key\">C-"
"q</kbd> &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C-d</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"各レジスタには1文字からなる名前があり、これを <var class=\"var\">r</var> と表"
"記します。<var class=\"var\">r</var> は英字（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</"
"samp>&rsquo; など）または数字（&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">1</samp>&rsquo; な"
"ど）であり得ます。大文字と小文字は区別されるため、レジスタ &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo; はレジスタ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A</"
"samp>&rsquo; とは異なります。また、例えば <kbd class=\"key\">C-q</kbd> や "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">C-d</samp>&rsquo; を用いることで、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">C-d</samp>&rsquo; のように英数字以外の文字でレジスタを指定する"
"ことも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Registers.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-view_002dregister\"></a>"
