"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> を押す代わりに、レジスタ名と同じキーをもう一度押すこ"
"とでミニバッファを終了できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Registers.html
msgid ""
"This value requests behavior similar to <code class=\"code\">traditional</"
