#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Files.html
msgid ""
"You can entirely turn off the remote file name feature by running <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x inhibit-remote-files</kbd>.  You can turn off the feature "
"in individual cases by quoting the file name with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">/:</samp>&rsquo; (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Quoted-File-"
