# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"<span>35.19 Retrieving Mail from Remote Mailboxes<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Retrieving-Mail-from-Remote-Mailboxes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>35.19 リモートメールボックスからのメールの取得<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Retrieving-Mail-from-Remote-Mailboxes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-movemail\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-remote-mailboxes_002c-accessing-by-movemail\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-movemail\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-remote-mailboxes_002c-accessing-by-movemail\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"Some sites use a method called POP3 for accessing users&rsquo; inbox data "
"instead of storing the data in inbox files.  The Mailutils <code "
"class=\"command\">movemail</code> by default supports POP3 with TLS "
"encryption.  <strong class=\"strong\">Warning:</strong> Although the <code "
"class=\"command\">Emacs movemail</code> supports POP3, its use for this is "
"not recommended since it does not support encrypted connections&mdash;the "
"Mailutils version does.  Both versions of <code class=\"command\">movemail</"
"code> work only with POP3, not with older versions of POP."
msgstr ""
"一部のサイトでは、受信トレイのファイルにデータを保存する代わりに、POP3と呼ば"
"れる方式を用いてユーザーの受信トレイデータにアクセスしています。Mailutils "
"<code class=\"command\">movemail</code> は、デフォルトでTLS暗号化を用いたPOP3"
"をサポートしています。<strong class=\"strong\">警告：</strong> <code "
"class=\"command\">Emacs movemail</code> はPOP3をサポートしていますが、暗号化"
"接続に対応していないため、この目的での使用は推奨されません（Mailutils版は対応"
"しています）。<code class=\"command\">movemail</code> の両バージョンともPOP3"
"でのみ動作し、旧バージョンのPOPには対応していません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-MAILHOST-environment-variable\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-POP3-mailboxes\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-MAILHOST-environment-variable\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-POP3-mailboxes\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"You can specify a POP3 inbox by using a POP3 <em class=\"dfn\">URL</em> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Movemail.html\"><code class=\"command\">movemail</"
"code> program</a>).  A POP3 <abbr class=\"acronym\">URL</abbr> is of the "
"form &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">pop://<var class=\"var\">username</"
"var>@<var class=\"var\">hostname</var>:<var class=\"var\">port</var></"
"samp>&rsquo;, where <var class=\"var\">hostname</var> and <var "
"class=\"var\">port</var> are the host name (or IP address)  and port number "
"of the remote mail server and <var class=\"var\">username</var> is the user "
"name on that server.  Additionally, you may specify the password in the "
"mailbox <abbr class=\"acronym\">URL</abbr>: &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">pop://<var class=\"var\">username</var>:<var "
"class=\"var\">password</var>@<var class=\"var\">hostname</var>:<var "
"class=\"var\">port</var></samp>&rsquo;.  In this case, <var "
"class=\"var\">password</var> takes preference over the one set by <code "
"class=\"code\">rmail-remote-password</code> (see below).  This is especially "
"useful if you have several remote mailboxes with different passwords.  If "
"using Mailutils <code class=\"command\">movemail</code> and the server "
"supports encrypted connections, <code class=\"command\">movemail</code> "
"tries to use it; specify &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">pops:</samp>&rsquo; "
"instead of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">pop:</samp>&rsquo; to require such a "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"POP3 <em class=\"dfn\">URL</em>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Movemail.html\"><code class=\"command\">movemail</code> プログラム</a>"
"を参照）を使用して、POP3受信トレイを指定できます。POP3 <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">URL</abbr>は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">pop://<var "
"class=\"var\">username</var>@<var class=\"var\">hostname</var>:<var "
"class=\"var\">port</var></samp>&rsquo; という形式であり、ここで <var "
"class=\"var\">hostname</var> と <var class=\"var\">port</var> はリモートメー"
"ルサーバーのホスト名（またはIPアドレス）とポート番号、<var "
"class=\"var\">username</var> はそのサーバー上のユーザー名です。さらに、メール"
"ボックスの <abbr class=\"acronym\">URL</abbr> &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">pop://<var class=\"var\">username</var>:<var "
"class=\"var\">password</var>@<var class=\"var\">hostname</var>:<var "
"class=\"var\">port</var></samp>&rsquo; でパスワードを指定することも可能です。"
"この場合、<var class=\"var\">password</var> が <code class=\"code\">rmail-"
"remote-password</code> で設定されたものより優先されます（後述）。これは、異な"
"るパスワードを持つ複数のリモートメールボックスがある場合に特に有用です。"
"Mailutils <code class=\"command\">movemail</code> を使用し、サーバーが暗号化"
"接続をサポートしている場合、<code class=\"command\">movemail</code> はその接"
"続を試みます。このような接続を必須にするには、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">pop:</samp>&rsquo; の代わりに &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">pops:</samp>&rsquo; を指定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"For backward compatibility, Rmail also supports an alternative way of "
"specifying remote POP3 mailboxes.  Specifying an inbox name in the form "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">po:<var class=\"var\">username</var>:<var "
"class=\"var\">hostname</var>:<var class=\"var\">port</var></samp>&rsquo; is "
"equivalent to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">pop://<var class=\"var\">username</"
"var>@<var class=\"var\">hostname</var>:<var class=\"var\">port</var></"
"samp>&rsquo;.  If you omit the <var class=\"var\">:hostname</var> part, the "
"<code class=\"env\">MAILHOST</code> environment variable specifies the "
"machine on which to look for the POP3 server."
msgstr ""
"後方互換性のため、RmailではリモートPOP3メールボックスを指定する別の方法もサ"
"ポートしています。受信トレイ名を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">po:<var "
"class=\"var\">username</var>:<var class=\"var\">hostname</var>:<var "
"class=\"var\">port</var></samp>&rsquo; の形式で指定すると、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">pop://<var class=\"var\">username</var>@<var "
"class=\"var\">hostname</var>:<var class=\"var\">port</var></samp>&rsquo; と同"
"等になります。<var class=\"var\">:hostname</var> の部分を省略した場合、環境変"
"数 <code class=\"env\">MAILHOST</code> でPOP3サーバーを検索する対象マシンを指"
"定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-IMAP-mailboxes\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-IMAP-mailboxes\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"Another method for accessing remote mailboxes is IMAP.  This method is "
"supported only by the Mailutils <code class=\"command\">movemail</code>, and "
"uses the IMAP4 protocol.  To specify an IMAP mailbox in the inbox list, use "
"the following mailbox <abbr class=\"acronym\">URL</abbr>: &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">imap://<var class=\"var\">username</var>[:<var "
"class=\"var\">password</var>]@<var class=\"var\">hostname</var>:<var "
"class=\"var\">port</var></samp>&rsquo;.  The <var class=\"var\">password</"
"var> part is optional, as described above.  If the server supports it, <code "
"class=\"command\">movemail</code> tries to use an encrypted "
"connection&mdash;use the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">imaps:</samp>&rsquo; "
"form to require one."
msgstr ""
"リモートメールボックスにアクセスするもう一つの方法にIMAPがあります。この方法"
"はMailutils <code class=\"command\">movemail</code>でのみサポートされており、"
"IMAP4プロトコルを使用します。受信トレイリストでIMAPメールボックスを指定するに"
"は、以下のメールボックス <abbr class=\"acronym\">URL</abbr> を使用してくださ"
"い：&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">imap://<var class=\"var\">username</var>[:"
"<var class=\"var\">password</var>]@<var class=\"var\">hostname</var>:<var "
"class=\"var\">port</var></samp>&rsquo;。前述の通り、<var "
"class=\"var\">password</var> の部分は省略可能です。サーバーが対応している場"
"合、<code class=\"command\">movemail</code> は暗号化接続の使用を試みます。暗"
"号化接続を必須にするには、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">imaps:</samp>&rsquo; の"
"形式を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rmail_002dremote_002dpassword\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"rmail_002dremote_002dpassword_002drequired\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rmail_002dremote_002dpassword\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"rmail_002dremote_002dpassword_002drequired\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"Accessing a remote mailbox may require a password.  Rmail uses the following "
"algorithm to retrieve it:"
msgstr ""
"リモートメールボックスへのアクセスにはパスワードが必要な場合があります。Rmail"
"では、以下のアルゴリズムを用いてパスワードを取得します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"If a <var class=\"var\">password</var> is present in the mailbox URL (see "
"above), it is used."
msgstr ""
"メールボックスURL（上記参照）に <var class=\"var\">password</var> が含まれて"
"いる場合は、それが使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"If the variable <code class=\"code\">rmail-remote-password-required</code> "
"is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Rmail assumes no password is required."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">rmail-remote-password-required</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合、Rmail はパスワードが不要であると判断しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"If the variable <code class=\"code\">rmail-remote-password</code> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, its value is used."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">rmail-remote-password</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、その値が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ol><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid "Otherwise, Rmail will ask you for the password to use."
msgstr "そうでない場合は、Rmail が使用するためのパスワードを求めてきます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"On some mail servers the usernames include domain information, which can "
"mean they contain the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@</samp>&rsquo; "
"character.  The inbox specifier string uses &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@</"
"samp>&rsquo; to signal the start of the mailserver name.  This creates "
"confusion for movemail.  If your username contains &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">@</samp>&rsquo; and you&rsquo;re using Mailutils <code "
"class=\"command\">movemail</code> then you can fix this: Replace <code "
"class=\"code\">@</code> in the user name with its <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">URL</abbr> encoding &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%40</"
"samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"一部のメールサーバーでは、ユーザー名にドメイン情報が含まれており、その結果"
"「<samp class=\"samp\">@</samp>」という文字が含まれる場合があります。受信トレ"
"イ指定文字列では、メールサーバー名の開始を示すために「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">@</samp>」が使用されています。これがmovemailで混乱を招きます。"
"ユーザー名に「<samp class=\"samp\">@</samp>」が含まれており、Mailutils <code "
"class=\"command\">movemail</code>を使用している場合は、次のように対処できま"
"す。ユーザー名内の<code class=\"code\">@</code>を、その<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">URL</abbr>エンコーディングである「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%40</samp>」に置き換えてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rmail_002dmovemail_002dflags\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rmail_002dmovemail_002dflags\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"If you need to pass additional command-line flags to <code "
"class=\"command\">movemail</code>, set the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">rmail-movemail-flags</code> a list of the flags you wish to "
"use.  Do not use this variable to pass the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-p</"
"samp>&rsquo; flag to preserve your inbox contents; use <code "
"class=\"code\">rmail-preserve-inbox</code> instead."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"command\">movemail</code> に追加のコマンドラインフラグを渡す必"
"要がある場合は、変数 <code class=\"code\">rmail-movemail-flags</code> に使用"
"したいフラグのリストを設定してください。受信トレイの内容を保持するために "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-p</samp>&rsquo; フラグを渡す際にこの変数を使用し"
"ないでください。代わりに <code class=\"code\">rmail-preserve-inbox</code> を"
"使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Kerberos-POP3-authentication\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Kerberos-POP3-authentication\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"command\">movemail</code> program installed at your site "
"may support Kerberos authentication.  If it is supported, it is used by "
"default whenever you attempt to retrieve POP3 mail when <code "
"class=\"code\">rmail-remote-password</code> and <code class=\"code\">rmail-"
"remote-password-required</code> are unset."
msgstr ""
"サイトにインストールされている <code class=\"command\">movemail</code> プログ"
"ラムは、Kerberos 認証に対応している場合があります。対応している場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">rmail-remote-password</code> および <code "
"class=\"code\">rmail-remote-password-required</code> が未設定の状態で POP3 "
"メールの取得を試みる際は、デフォルトでこの認証が使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-reverse-order-in-POP3-inboxes\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-reverse-order-in-POP3-inboxes\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
"Some POP3 servers store messages in reverse order.  If your server does "
"this, and you would rather read your mail in the order in which it was "
"received, you can tell <code class=\"command\">movemail</code> to reverse "
"the order of downloaded messages by adding the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-"
"r</samp>&rsquo; flag to <code class=\"code\">rmail-movemail-flags</code>."
msgstr ""
"一部のPOP3サーバーでは、メッセージが逆順で保存されます。お使いのサーバーがこ"
"のような仕様で、受信順にメールを読みたい場合は、<code class=\"code\">rmail-"
"movemail-flags</code>に&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-r</samp>&rsquo;フラグを追"
"加することで、<code class=\"command\">movemail</code>にダウンロードしたメッ"
"セージの順序を反転させるよう指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Remote-Mailboxes.html
msgid ""
