# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Repeat-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"Suppose you search forward for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>&rsquo; "
"and find a match, but not the one you expected to find: the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>&rsquo; you were aiming for occurs later in the "
"buffer.  In this event, type another <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-repeat-forward</code>) to move to the next occurrence "
"of the search string, or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-repeat-backward</code>) to move to the previous "
"occurrence.  You can repeat these commands any number of times.  "
"Alternatively, you can supply a numeric prefix argument of <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> to <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd> to find the <var class=\"var\">n</var>th next or "
"previous occurrence.  If you overshoot, you can cancel some <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> commands with <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>.  "
"Similarly, each <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-"
"repeat-backward</code>) in a backward incremental search repeats the "
"backward search."
msgstr ""
"「<samp class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>」を前方検索して一致箇所が見つかったものの、"
"それが期待していた箇所ではなかったとします。つまり、目的としていた「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>」がバッファのより後方に存在していた場合です。このと"
"き、別の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-repeat-"
"forward</code>) を入力して検索文字列の次の出現箇所へ移動するか、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-repeat-backward</"
"code>) を入力して前の出現箇所へ移動できます。これらのコマンドは何度でも繰り返"
"し実行可能です。あるいは、数値のプレフィックス引数として <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> から <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> および <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd> を指定することで、<var class=\"var\">n</var> 番目の次"
"または前の出現箇所を探すこともできます。範囲を超えてしまった場合は、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> で一部の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> コマンドをキャ"
"ンセルできます。同様に、後方インクリメンタル検索における各 <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-repeat-backward</"
"code>) は、後方検索を繰り返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Repeat-Isearch.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lazy-search-highlighting\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lazy-search-highlighting\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Repeat-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"If you pause for a little while during incremental search, Emacs highlights "
"all the other possible matches for the search string that are present on the "
"screen.  This helps you anticipate where you can get to by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd> to repeat the "
"search.  The other matches are highlighted differently from the current "
"match, using the customizable face <code class=\"code\">lazy-highlight</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Faces.html\">Text Faces</a>).  If you "
"don&rsquo;t like this feature, you can disable it by setting <code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-lazy-highlight</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>.  For other customizations related to highlighting matches, see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Search-Customizations.html\">Tailoring Search to Your "
"Needs</a>."
msgstr ""
"インクリメンタル検索中にしばらく操作を中断すると、Emacsは画面上に存在する検索"
"文字列の他のすべての候補をハイライト表示します。これにより、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd> と入力して検索を繰り"
"返すことで、どこまで辿り着けるかを予測しやすくなります。他の候補は、カスタマ"
"イズ可能なフェイス <code class=\"code\">lazy-highlight</code>（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Faces.html\">テキストフェイス</a>を参照）を用いて、現"
"在の候補とは異なる方法でハイライトされます。この機能が不要な場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-lazy-highlight</code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> に設定することで無効にできます。候補のハイライトに関するその他のカスタ"
"マイズについては、<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Search-Customizations.html\">ニーズ"
"に合わせた検索の調整</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Repeat-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"After exiting a search, you can search for the same string again by typing "
"just <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s C-s</kbd>.  The first <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</"
"kbd> is the key that invokes incremental search, and the second <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> means to search again for the last search string.  "
"Similarly, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-r C-r</kbd> searches backward for the last "
"search string.  In determining the last search string, it doesn&rsquo;t "
"matter whether that string was searched for with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</"
"kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"検索を終了した後、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s C-s</kbd> と入力するだけで、同じ文字"
"列を再度検索できます。最初の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> はインクリメンタル"
"検索を呼び出すキーであり、2番目の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> は最後に検索し"
"た文字列を再度検索することを意味します。同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-r C-r</"
"kbd> は最後に検索した文字列を逆方向に検索します。最後に検索した文字列を判定す"
"る際、その文字列が <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> で検索されたものか <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd> で検索されたものかは問いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Repeat-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"If you are searching forward but you realize you were looking for something "
"before the starting point, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd> to switch to a "
"backward search, leaving the search string unchanged.  Similarly, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-s</kbd> in a backward search switches to a forward search."
msgstr ""
"前方検索を行っている際に、開始点より前の何かを探していたことに気づいた場合"
"は、検索文字列をそのままにしたまま <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-r</kbd> と入力して後"
"方検索に切り替えてください。同様に、後方検索中の <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-s</"
"kbd> は前方検索に切り替えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Repeat-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-search_002c-changing-direction\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002drepeat_002don_002ddirection_002dchange\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-search_002c-changing-direction\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002drepeat_002don_002ddirection_002dchange\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Repeat-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"When you change the direction of a search, the first command you type will, "
"by default, remain on the same match, and the cursor will move to the other "
"end of the match.  To move to another match immediately, customize the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">isearch-repeat-on-direction-change</code> to "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"検索方向を変更すると、最初に入力したコマンドはデフォルトで同一のマッチ箇所に"
"留まり、カーソルはマッチ箇所のもう一方の端に移動します。すぐに別のマッチ箇所"
"へ移動するには、変数 <code class=\"code\">isearch-repeat-on-direction-"
"change</code> を <code class=\"code\">t</code> に設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Repeat-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-search_002c-wrapping-around\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-search_002c-overwrapped\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-wrapped-search\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-overwrapped-search\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-search_002c-wrapping-around\"></a> <a "
