"kbd> <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd></kbd>が繰り返し実行可能なすべてのコマンド"
"を、新しい順に表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Repetition.html
msgid ""
