# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Repetition.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</"
"kbd></kbd> re-executes a recent command that used the minibuffer.  With no "
"argument, it repeats the last such command.  A numeric argument specifies "
"which command to repeat; 1 means the last one, 2 the previous, and so on."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</"
"kbd></kbd> は、ミニバッファを使用した直近のコマンドを再実行します。引数を指定"
"しない場合は、最後に実行した同様のコマンドを繰り返します。数値引数で繰り返す"
"コマンドを指定でき、1は直前のコマンド、2はその前のコマンド、といった具合にな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Repetition.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</"
"kbd></kbd> works by turning the previous command into a Lisp expression and "
"then entering a minibuffer initialized with the text for that expression.  "
"Even if you don&rsquo;t know Lisp, it will probably be obvious which command "
"is displayed for repetition.  If you type just <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>, "
"that repeats the command unchanged.  You can also change the command by "
"editing the Lisp expression before you execute it.  The executed command is "
"added to the front of the command history unless it is identical to the most "
"recent item."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</"
"kbd></kbd> は、直前のコマンドを Lisp 式に変換し、その式のテキストで初期化され"
"たミニバッファに入ることで動作します。Lisp の知識がなくても、どのコマンドが繰"
"り返し表示されるかはおそらく一目瞭然でしょう。単に <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd> と入力すれば、そのコマンドがそのまま繰り返されます。また、実行前に Lisp "
"式を編集することで、コマンドを変更することもできます。実行されたコマンドは、"
"直近の項目と同一でない限り、コマンド履歴の先頭に追加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Repetition.html
msgid ""
"Once inside the minibuffer for <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd></kbd>, you can use the "
"usual minibuffer history commands (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer-"
"History.html\">Minibuffer History</a>) to move through the history list.  "
"After finding the desired previous command, you can edit its expression as "
"usual and then execute it by typing <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</"
"kbd></kbd> のミニバッファに入ると、通常のミニバッファ履歴コマンド（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer-History.html\">ミニバッファ履歴</a>を参照）"
"を使用して履歴リストを移動できます。目的の直前のコマンドが見つかったら、通常"
"通りにその式を編集し、<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力して実行できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Repetition.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dresume_002din_002dcommand_002dhistory\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dresume_002din_002dcommand_002dhistory\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Repetition.html
msgid ""
"Incremental search does not, strictly speaking, use the minibuffer.  "
"Therefore, although it behaves like a complex command, it normally does not "
"appear in the history list for <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;<kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd></kbd>.  You can "
"make incremental search commands appear in the history by setting <code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-resume-in-command-history</code> to a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Incremental-"
"Search.html\">Incremental Search</a>."
msgstr ""
"インクリメンタル検索は、厳密に言えばミニバッファを使用しません。そのため、複"
"雑なコマンドのように動作しますが、通常 <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;<kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd></kbd> の履歴リスト"
"には表示されません。<code class=\"code\">isearch-resume-in-command-history</"
"code> に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を設定することで、インクリメ"
"ンタル検索コマンドを履歴に表示させることができます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Incremental-Search.html\">インクリメンタル検索</a> を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
