"<span>17.10.3 Replace Commands and Lax Matches<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Replace-Commands-and-Lax-Matches\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>17.10.3 コマンドと緩いマッチの置換<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Replace-Commands-and-Lax-Matches\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"This subsection describes the behavior of replace commands with respect to "
"lax matches (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">Lax Matching "
"During Searching</a>) and how to customize it.  In general, replace commands "
"mostly default to stricter matching than their search counterparts."
msgstr ""
"本サブセクションでは、laxマッチ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">"
"検索時のlaxマッチ</a>を参照）に対する置換コマンドの動作と、そのカスタマイズ方"
"法について説明します。一般的に、置換コマンドは検索コマンドよりも厳格なマッチ"
"ングをデフォルトとする傾向があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lax-space-matching-in-replace-"
"commands\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"replace_002dlax_002dwhitespace\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lax-space-matching-in-replace-"
"commands\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"replace_002dlax_002dwhitespace\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"Unlike incremental search, the replacement commands do not use lax space "
"matching (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">lax space "
"matching</a>) by default.  To enable lax space matching for replacement, "
"change the variable <code class=\"code\">replace-lax-whitespace</code> to "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  (This only affects how Emacs finds the "
"text to replace, not the replacement text.)"
msgstr ""
"インクリメンタル検索とは異なり、置換コマンドではデフォルトでlax space "
"matching（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">lax space matching</a>"
"を参照）は使用されません。置換時にlax space matchingを有効にするには、変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">replace-lax-whitespace</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外に変更してください。（これはEmacsが置換対象のテ"
"キストを検出する方法にのみ影響し、置換後のテキストには影響しません。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"replace_002dregexp_002dlax_002dwhitespace\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"replace_002dregexp_002dlax_002dwhitespace\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"A companion variable <code class=\"code\">replace-regexp-lax-whitespace</"
"code> controls whether <code class=\"code\">query-replace-regexp</code> uses "
"lax whitespace matching when searching for patterns."
msgstr ""
"コンパニオン変数 <code class=\"code\">replace-regexp-lax-whitespace</code> "
"は、<code class=\"code\">query-replace-regexp</code> がパターン検索時に緩い空"
"白文字マッチングを使用するかどうかを制御します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case-folding-in-replace-commands\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case-folding-in-replace-commands\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"If the first argument of a replace command is all lower case, the command "
"ignores case while searching for occurrences to replace&mdash;provided <code "
"class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">search-upper-case</code> is also non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  If <code class=\"code\">search-upper-case</code> "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">search-upper-case</a>) is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, whether searching ignores case is "
"determined by <code class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code> alone, regardless "
"of letter-case of the command&rsquo;s first argument.  If <code "
"class=\"code\">case-fold-search</code> is set to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, case is always significant in all searches."
msgstr ""
"置換コマンドの第1引数がすべて小文字の場合、<code class=\"code\">case-fold-"
"search</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> ではなく、かつ <code "
"class=\"code\">search-upper-case</code> も <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"ない限り、コマンドは置換対象の出現箇所を検索する際に大文字・小文字を区別しま"
"せん。<code class=\"code\">search-upper-case</code>（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Lax-Search.html\">search-upper-case</a> を参照）が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、大文字・小文字を区別するかどうかは、コ"
"マンドの第1引数の大文字・小文字に関わらず、<code class=\"code\">case-fold-"
"search</code> のみによって決定されます。<code class=\"code\">case-fold-"
"search</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定されている場合、すべて"
"の検索において常に大文字・小文字が区別されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case_002dreplace\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case-preservation-in-replace-"
"commands\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case_002dreplace\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-case-preservation-in-replace-"
"commands\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"In addition, when the second argument of a replace command is all or partly "
"lower case, replacement commands try to preserve the case pattern of each "
"occurrence.  Thus, the command"
msgstr ""
"さらに、置換コマンドの第2引数が全部または一部小文字である場合、置換コマンドは"
"各出現箇所の大文字・小文字のパターンを保持しようとします。したがって、このコ"
"マンドは"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "M-x replace-string <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> foo <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> bar <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"replaces a lower case &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; with a "
"lower case &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">bar</samp>&rsquo;, an all-caps &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>&rsquo; with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">BAR</"
"samp>&rsquo;, and a capitalized &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Foo</"
"samp>&rsquo; with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Bar</samp>&rsquo;.  (These "
"three alternatives&mdash;lower case, all caps, and capitalized, are the only "
"ones that <code class=\"code\">replace-string</code> can distinguish.)  Note "
"that Emacs decides whether to up-case or capitalize the replacement text by "
"analyzing each word in the text being replaced, and will preserve the letter-"
"case of the replaced text only if <em class=\"emph\">all</em> of its words "
"use the same letter-case.  Thus, the command"
msgstr ""
"小文字の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; を小文字の &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">bar</samp>&rsquo; に、すべて大文字の &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>&rsquo; を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">BAR</"
"samp>&rsquo; に、そして大文字混じりの &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Foo</"
"samp>&rsquo; を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Bar</samp>&rsquo; に置換します。"
"（小文字、すべて大文字、大文字混じりというこれら3つのパターンこそが、<code "
"class=\"code\">replace-string</code> で区別可能な唯一のものです。）なお、"
"Emacs は置換対象のテキスト内の各単語を解析して、置換後のテキストを大文字にす"
"るか小文字にするかを決定し、置換されるテキストの文字ケースが保持されるのは、"
"その<em class=\"emph\">すべて</em>の単語が同じ文字ケースである場合に限られま"
"す。したがって、このコマンドは"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "M-x replace-string <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> foo bar <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> baz quux <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"replaces &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Foo Bar</samp>&rsquo; with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Baz Quux</samp>&rsquo; because both words in &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Foo Bar</samp>&rsquo; are capitalized.  By contrast, the same "
"command replaces &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Foo bar</samp>&rsquo; with "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">baz quux</samp>&rsquo;, i.e. it leaves the "
"letter-case of the replacement text unchanged, since the two words in &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Foo bar</samp>&rsquo; use different capitalization.  "
"What exactly is considered a &ldquo;word&rdquo; depends on the syntax tables "
"that are in effect in the current buffer (see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Syntax-"
"Tables.html#Syntax-Tables\">Syntax Tables</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The "
"Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>); thus, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Foo_Bar</samp>&rsquo; is two words in Text mode, but could be "
"a single word in some major mode that supports a programming language."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Foo Bar</samp>&rsquo; 内の2つの単語がともに大文字"
"であるため、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Foo Bar</samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Baz Quux</samp>&rsquo; に置換されます。対照的に、同じコ"
"マンドでも &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Foo bar</samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">baz quux</samp>&rsquo; に置換されます。つまり、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Foo bar</samp>&rsquo; 内の2つの単語で大文字・小文字の使い分け"
"が異なるため、置換後のテキストの大文字・小文字は変更されません。何をもって"
"「単語」とするかは、現在のバッファで有効な構文テーブルによって決まります"
"（<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Syntax-Tables.html#Syntax-Tables\">Syntax Tables</a> を参照）。したがっ"
"て、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Foo_Bar</samp>&rsquo; はテキストモードでは2つ"
"の単語ですが、プログラミング言語をサポートする一部のメジャーモードでは単一の"
"単語となる場合があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"If upper-case letters are used in the replacement string, they remain upper "
"case every time that text is inserted.  If upper-case letters are used in "
"the first argument, the second argument is always substituted exactly as "
"given, with no case conversion.  Likewise, if either <code "
"class=\"code\">case-replace</code> or <code class=\"code\">case-fold-search</"
"code> is set to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, replacement is done without "
"case conversion."
msgstr ""
"置換文字列に大文字が含まれている場合、そのテキストが挿入されるたびに大文字の"
"ままとなります。第1引数に大文字が含まれている場合、第2引数は常に大文字・小文"
"字の変換なしに、指定された通りに置換されます。同様に、<code "
"class=\"code\">case-replace</code> または <code class=\"code\">case-fold-"
"search</code> のいずれかが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定されている場"
"合、置換は大文字・小文字の変換なしに行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-folding-in-replace-"
"commands\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-character-folding-in-replace-"
"commands\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html
msgid ""
"The replacement commands by default do not use character folding (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">character folding</a>) when looking "
"for the text to replace.  To enable character folding for matching in <code "
"class=\"code\">query-replace</code> and <code class=\"code\">replace-string</"
"code>, set the variable <code class=\"code\">replace-char-fold</code> to a "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value.  (This setting does not affect "
"the replacement text, only how Emacs finds the text to replace.  It also "
"doesn&rsquo;t affect <code class=\"code\">replace-regexp</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"置換コマンドは、デフォルトでは置換対象のテキストを検索する際に文字フォール"
"ディング（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">文字フォールディング</"
"a>を参照）を使用しません。<code class=\"code\">query-replace</code> および "
"<code class=\"code\">replace-string</code> でのマッチングに文字フォールディン"
"グを有効にするには、変数 <code class=\"code\">replace-char-fold</code> に "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を設定してください。（この設定は置換"
"テキストには影響せず、Emacs が置換対象のテキストを検索する方法にのみ影響しま"
"す。また、<code class=\"code\">replace-regexp</code> にも影響しません。）"

