# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"Some labels such as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">deleted</samp>&rsquo; and "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">filed</samp>&rsquo; have built-in meanings, and "
"Rmail assigns them to messages automatically at appropriate times; these "
"labels are called <em class=\"dfn\">attributes</em>.  Here is a list of "
"Rmail attributes:"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">deleted</samp>&rsquo;や&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">filed</samp>&rsquo;といった一部のラベルにはあらかじめ意味が定"
"義されており、Rmailは適切なタイミングでこれらをメッセージに自動的に割り当てま"
"す。こうしたラベルは<em class=\"dfn\">属性</em>と呼ばれます。以下にRmailの属"
"性一覧を示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Attributes.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">unseen</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">unseen</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"Means the message has never been current.  Assigned to messages when they "
"come from an inbox file, and removed when a message is made current.  When "
"you start Rmail, it initially shows the first message that has this "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
"このメッセージが一度も最新状態にならなかったことを意味します。受信トレイファ"
"イルからメッセージが届いた際に付与され、メッセージが最新状態になると解除され"
"ます。Rmailを起動すると、まずこの属性を持つ最初のメッセージが表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Attributes.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">deleted</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">deleted</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"Means the message is deleted.  Assigned by deletion commands and removed by "
"undeletion commands (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Rmail-"
"Deletion.html\">Deleting Messages</a>)."
msgstr ""
"メッセージが削除されることを意味します。削除コマンドによって割り当てられ、未"
"削除コマンドによって解除されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Rmail-"
"Deletion.html\">メッセージの削除</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Attributes.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">filed</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">filed</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"Means the message has been copied to some other file.  Assigned by the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">o</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-o</kbd> file output commands "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Rmail-Output.html\">Copying Messages Out to "
"Files</a>)."
msgstr ""
"メッセージが別のファイルにコピーされたことを意味します。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">o</kbd> および <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-o</kbd> ファイル出力コマン"
"ドによって指定されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Rmail-Output.html\">メッ"
"セージのファイルへの出力</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Attributes.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">answered</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">answered</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Attributes.html
msgid ""
"Means you have mailed an answer to the message.  Assigned by the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">r</kbd> command (<code class=\"code\">rmail-reply</code>).  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Rmail-Reply.html\">Sending Replies</a>."
msgstr ""
"メッセージへの返信を送信したことを意味します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">r</kbd>コマ"
"ンド（<code class=\"code\">rmail-reply</code>）によって割り当てられます。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Rmail-Reply.html\">返信の送信</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
