msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Display.html
msgid ""
"Then you can browse these URLs by clicking on them with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> (or <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd> quickly) or "
"by moving to one and typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd></kbd>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Goto-Address-"
"mode.html\">Activating URLs</a>."
msgstr ""
"次に、これらのURLを <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd>（または素早く <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-1</kbd>）でクリックするか、いずれかに移動して <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> と入力することで閲覧でき"
"ます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Goto-Address-mode.html\">URLの有効化</a>を参照"
"してください。"

