#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Editing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-e-_0028Rmail_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"rmail_002dedit_002dcurrent_002dmessage\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-e-_0028Rmail_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"rmail_002dedit_002dcurrent_002dmessage\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Editing.html
msgid ""
"The <kbd class=\"kbd\">e</kbd> command (<code class=\"code\">rmail-edit-"
"current-message</code>) switches from Rmail mode into Rmail Edit mode, "
"another major mode which is nearly the same as Text mode.  The mode line "
"indicates this change."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">e</kbd>コマンド（<code class=\"code\">rmail-edit-current-"
"message</code>）は、RmailモードからRmail Editモードへと切り替えます。Editモー"
"ドは、Textモードとほぼ同様のもう一つの主要なモードです。モード行にこの切り替"
"えが表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Editing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rmail_002dcease_002dedit\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rmail_002dabort_002dedit\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rmail_002dcease_002dedit\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rmail_002dabort_002dedit\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Editing.html
msgid ""
"In Rmail Edit mode, letters insert themselves as usual and the Rmail "
"commands are not available.  You can edit the message body and header "
"fields.  When you are finished editing the message, type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">rmail-cease-edit</code>) "
"to switch back to Rmail mode.  Alternatively, you can return to Rmail mode "
"but cancel any editing that you have done, by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c "
"C-]</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">rmail-abort-edit</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Rmailの編集モードでは、文字は通常通り挿入され、Rmailコマンドは利用できませ"
"ん。メッセージ本文とヘッダーフィールドを編集できます。メッセージの編集が完了"
"したら、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">rmail-cease-"
"edit</code>) と入力してRmailモードに戻ります。あるいは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"c C-]</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">rmail-abort-edit</code>) と入力することで、"
"Rmailモードに戻りつつ、それまでの編集内容をキャンセルすることもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Editing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rmail_002dedit_002dmode_002dhook\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rmail_002dedit_002dmode_002dhook\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Editing.html
msgid ""
"Entering Rmail Edit mode runs the hook <code class=\"code\">text-mode-hook</"
"code>; then it runs the hook <code class=\"code\">rmail-edit-mode-hook</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Hooks.html\">Hooks</a>).  Returning to "
"ordinary Rmail mode adds the attribute &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">edited</"
"samp>&rsquo; to the message, if you have made any changes in it (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Rmail-Attributes.html\">Rmail Attributes</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Rmailの編集モードに入るとフック <code class=\"code\">text-mode-hook</code> が"
"実行され、続いてフック <code class=\"code\">rmail-edit-mode-hook</code> が実"
"行されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Hooks.html\">フック</a> を参照）。通常"
"のRmailモードに戻ると、メッセージに変更を加えていた場合、属性 &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">edited</samp>&rsquo; が追加されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Rmail-Attributes.html\">Rmail属性</a> を参照）。"

