#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Labels.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-n <var class=\"var\">labels</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">rmail-next-labeled-"
"message</code>) moves to the next message that has one of the labels <var "
"class=\"var\">labels</var>.  The argument <var class=\"var\">labels</var> "
"specifies one or more label names, separated by commas.  <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-p</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">rmail-previous-labeled-"
"message</code>) is similar, but moves backwards to previous messages.  A "
"numeric argument to either command serves as a repeat count."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-n <var class=\"var\">labels</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">rmail-next-labeled-"
"message</code>) は、ラベル <var class=\"var\">labels</var> のいずれかを持つ次"
"のメッセージに移動します。引数 <var class=\"var\">labels</var> では、1つ以上"
"のラベル名をカンマ区切りで指定します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-p</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">rmail-previous-labeled-message</code>) も同様ですが、前のメッ"
"セージへと戻ります。いずれのコマンドにおいても、数値引数は繰り返し回数として"
"機能します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Labels.html
msgid ""
