# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Motion.html
msgid ""
"<span>35.3 Moving Among Messages<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Moving-"
"Among-Messages\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>35.3 メッセージ間の移動<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Moving-Among-"
"Messages\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Motion.html
msgid ""
"The most basic thing to do with a message is to read it.  The way to do this "
"in Rmail is to make the message current.  The usual practice is to move "
"sequentially through the file, since this is the order of receipt of "
"messages.  When you enter Rmail, you are positioned at the first message "
"that you have not yet made current (that is, the first one that has the "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">unseen</samp>&rsquo; attribute; see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Rmail-Attributes.html\">Rmail Attributes</a>).  Move "
"forward to see the other new messages; move backward to re-examine old "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"メッセージに対して行える最も基本的な操作は、それを読むことです。Rmailでこれを"
"行うには、メッセージをカレントにします。通常は、メッセージの受信順に従って、"
"ファイルを順に辿っていきます。Rmailを起動すると、まだカレントにしていない最初"
"のメッセージ（つまり、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">unseen</samp>&rsquo;属性を"
"持つ最初のメッセージ。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Rmail-Attributes.html\">Rmail"
"の属性</a>を参照）が位置することになります。前方に移動して他の新しいメッセー"
"ジを確認し、後方に移動して古いメッセージを再確認してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Motion.html
msgid ""
"Move to the next nondeleted message, skipping any intervening deleted "
"messages (<code class=\"code\">rmail-next-undeleted-message</code>)."
msgstr ""
"途中の削除済みメッセージ（<code class=\"code\">rmail-next-undeleted-message</"
"code>）をスキップして、次の未削除メッセージへ移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Motion.html
