# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Scrolling.html
msgid ""
"Since the most common thing to do while reading a message is to scroll "
"through it by screenfuls, Rmail makes <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> (or <kbd class=\"kbd\">S-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</"
"kbd></kbd>) do the same as <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-v</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">scroll-up-command</code>)  and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-v</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">scroll-down-command</code>) respectively."
msgstr ""
"メッセージを読んでいる際に最もよく行われる操作は画面単位でスクロールすること"
"であるため、Rmailでは<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>と<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</"
"kbd>（または<kbd class=\"kbd\">S-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>）に、それ"
"ぞれ<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-v</kbd>（<code class=\"code\">scroll-up-command</"
"code>）および<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-v</kbd>（<code class=\"code\">scroll-down-"
"command</code>）と同じ動作をさせています。"

