# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"<span>35.11.2 Editing in Summaries<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Editing-"
"in-Summaries\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>35.11.2 サマリーでの編集<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Editing-in-"
"Summaries\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"You can use the Rmail summary buffer to do almost anything you can do in the "
"Rmail buffer itself.  In fact, once you have a summary buffer, there&rsquo;s "
"no need to switch back to the Rmail buffer."
msgstr ""
"Rmailサマリーバッファを使えば、Rmailバッファ自体でできることはほぼすべて行え"
"ます。実際、一度サマリーバッファがあれば、わざわざRmailバッファに戻る必要はあ"
"りません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"You can select and display various messages in the Rmail buffer, from the "
"summary buffer, just by moving point in the summary buffer to different "
"lines.  It doesn&rsquo;t matter what Emacs command you use to move point; "
"whichever line point is on at the end of the command, that message is "
"selected in the Rmail buffer."
msgstr ""
"サマリーバッファ内でポイントを別の行に移動させるだけで、Rmailバッファ内のさま"
"ざまなメッセージを選択して表示できます。ポイントの移動にどのEmacsコマンドを使"
"用しても構いません。コマンド実行終了時にポイントがある行のメッセージが、Rmail"
"バッファ内で選択されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"rmail_002dsummary_002dscroll_002dbetween_002dmessages\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"rmail_002dsummary_002dscroll_002dbetween_002dmessages\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Almost all Rmail commands work in the summary buffer as well as in the Rmail "
"buffer.  Thus, <kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd> in the summary buffer deletes the "
"current message, <kbd class=\"kbd\">u</kbd> undeletes, and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">x</kbd> expunges.  (However, in the summary buffer, if there "
"are no more undeleted messages in the relevant direction, the delete "
"commands go to the first or last message, rather than staying on the current "
"message.)  <kbd class=\"kbd\">o</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-o</kbd> "
"output the current message to a FILE; <kbd class=\"kbd\">r</kbd> starts a "
"reply to it; etc.  You can scroll the current message while remaining in the "
"summary buffer using <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>.  However, in the summary buffer scrolling past the "
"end or the beginning of a message with <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> or <kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> goes, respectively, to the next or previous "
"undeleted message.  Customize the <code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-scroll-"
"between-messages</code> option to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> to disable "
"scrolling to next/previous messages."
msgstr ""
"ほぼすべてのRmailコマンドは、Rmailバッファだけでなくサマリーバッファでも動作"
"します。したがって、サマリーバッファにおける<kbd class=\"kbd\">d</kbd>は現在"
"のメッセージを削除し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">u</kbd>は未削除状態に戻し、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">x</kbd>は消去します。（ただし、サマリーバッファにおいて、該当す"
"る方向に未削除のメッセージがもう存在しない場合、削除コマンドは現在のメッセー"
"ジに留まらず、最初または最後のメッセージに対して実行されます。）<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">o</kbd>および<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-o</kbd>は現在のメッセージを"
"FILEに出力し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">r</kbd>はそのメッセージへの返信を開始しま"
"す。など。<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>および<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>を使"
"用すると、サマリーバッファに留まったまま現在のメッセージをスクロールできま"
"す。ただし、サマリーバッファで<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>または<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>を用いてメッセージの末尾または先頭を越えてスクロールす"
"ると、それぞれ次の未削除メッセージまたは前の未削除メッセージへ移動します。次"
"の/前のメッセージへのスクロールを無効にするには、<code class=\"code\">rmail-"
"summary-scroll-between-messages</code>から<code class=\"code\">nil</code>のオ"
"プションを設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"rmail_002dsummary_002dundelete_002dmany\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"rmail_002dsummary_002dundelete_002dmany\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-u</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-undelete-"
"many</code>) undeletes all deleted messages in the summary.  A prefix "
"argument means to undelete that many of the previous deleted messages."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-u</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-undelete-"
"many</code>) は、サマリー内の削除済みメッセージをすべて復元します。接頭辞引数"
"を指定すると、過去に削除されたメッセージのうち、その数だけ復元します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"The Rmail commands to move between messages also work in the summary buffer, "
"but with a twist: they move through the set of messages included in the "
"summary.  They also ensure the Rmail buffer appears on the screen (unlike "
"cursor motion commands, which update the contents of the Rmail buffer but "
"don&rsquo;t display it in a window unless it already appears).  Here is a "
"list of these commands:"
msgstr ""
"メッセージ間を移動するためのRmailコマンドは、サマリーバッファでも動作します"
"が、一点だけ異なります。それは、サマリーに含まれるメッセージ群の中を移動する"
"という点です。また、これらのコマンドはRmailバッファが画面に表示されることを確"
"実にします（カーソル移動コマンドとは異なり、カーソル移動コマンドはRmailバッ"
"ファの内容を更新しますが、すでに表示されていない限りウィンドウに表示しませ"
"ん）。以下にこれらのコマンドを列挙します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Move to next line, skipping lines saying &ldquo;deleted&rdquo;, and select "
"its message (<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-next-msg</code>)."
msgstr ""
"次の行に移動し、「deleted」と記載された行をスキップして、そのメッセージ"
"（<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-next-msg</code>）を選択する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Move to previous line, skipping lines saying &ldquo;deleted&rdquo;, and "
"select its message (<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-previous-msg</code>)."
msgstr ""
"前の行に移動し、「deleted」と記載された行をスキップして、そのメッセージ"
"（<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-previous-msg</code>）を選択する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Move to next line and select its message (<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-"
"next-all</code>)."
msgstr ""
"次の行に移動し、そのメッセージ (<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-next-all</"
"code>) を選択します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Move to previous line and select its message (<code class=\"code\">rmail-"
"summary-previous-all</code>)."
msgstr ""
"前の行に移動し、そのメッセージ (<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-previous-"
"all</code>) を選択します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Move to the last line, and select its message (<code class=\"code\">rmail-"
"summary-last-message</code>)."
msgstr ""
"最後の行に移動し、そのメッセージ (<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-last-"
"message</code>) を選択します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Move to the first line, and select its message (<code class=\"code\">rmail-"
"summary-first-message</code>)."
msgstr ""
"1行目に移動し、そのメッセージ (<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-first-"
"message</code>) を選択します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Select the message on the current line (ensuring that the Rmail buffer "
"appears on the screen; <code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-goto-msg</code>).  "
"With argument <var class=\"var\">n</var>, select message number <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> and move to its line in the summary buffer; this "
"signals an error if the message is not listed in the summary buffer."
msgstr ""
"現在の行にあるメッセージを選択します（Rmailバッファが画面に表示されていること"
"を確認してください。<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-goto-msg</code>）。引"
"数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> を指定すると、メッセージ番号 <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> を選択し、サマリーバッファのその行に移動します。メッ"
"セージがサマリーバッファに登録されていない場合は、エラーとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s <var class=\"var\">pattern</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s <var class=\"var\">pattern</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Search through messages for <var class=\"var\">pattern</var> starting with "
"the current message; select the message found, and move point in the summary "
"buffer to that message&rsquo;s line (<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-"
"search</code>).  A prefix argument acts as a repeat count; a negative "
"argument means search backward (equivalent to <code class=\"code\">rmail-"
"summary-search-backward</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"現在のメッセージから始まる <var class=\"var\">pattern</var> をメッセージの中"
"から検索し、見つかったメッセージを選択して、サマリーバッファのポイントをその"
"メッセージの行 (<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-search</code>) に移動しま"
"す。接頭辞引数は繰り返し回数として機能し、負の引数は逆方向に検索することを意"
"味します（<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-search-backward</code> と同等で"
"す）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Move to the next message with at least one of the specified labels (<code "
"class=\"code\">rmail-summary-next-labeled-message</code>).  <var "
"class=\"var\">labels</var> is a comma-separated list of labels.  A prefix "
"argument acts as a repeat count."
msgstr ""
"指定されたラベル（<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-next-labeled-message</"
"code>）のうち少なくとも1つを含む次のメッセージに移動します。<var "
"class=\"var\">labels</var>はカンマ区切りのラベルリストです。接頭辞引数は繰り"
"返し回数として機能します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Move to the previous message with at least one of the specified labels "
"(<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-previous-labeled-message</code>)."
msgstr ""
"指定されたラベル（<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-previous-labeled-"
"message</code>）のいずれか少なくとも1つを持つ直前のメッセージに移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-n <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-n <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Move to the next message with the same subject as the current message (<code "
"class=\"code\">rmail-summary-next-same-subject</code>).  A prefix argument "
"acts as a repeat count."
msgstr ""
"現在のメッセージと同じ件名（<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-next-same-"
"subject</code>）を持つ次のメッセージに移動します。接頭辞引数は繰り返し回数と"
"して機能します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-p <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-p <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Move to the previous message with the same subject as the current message "
"(<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-previous-same-subject</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在のメッセージと同じ件名（<code class=\"code\">rmail-summary-previous-same-"
"subject</code>）の直前のメッセージに移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rmail_002dredisplay_002dsummary\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-rmail_002dredisplay_002dsummary\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
"Deletion, undeletion, and getting new mail, and even selection of a "
"different message all update the summary buffer when you do them in the "
"Rmail buffer.  If the variable <code class=\"code\">rmail-redisplay-summary</"
"code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, these actions also bring the "
"summary buffer back onto the screen."
msgstr ""
"削除、元に戻す、新規メールの受信、さらには別のメッセージの選択といった操作"
"は、いずれもRmailバッファ上で行うとサマリーバッファを更新します。変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">rmail-redisplay-summary</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> 以外の場合、これらの操作によってサマリーバッファが画面に再表示されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Rmail-Summary-Edit.html
msgid ""
