# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Save-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k n</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-k n</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Save-Keyboard-Macro.html
msgid ""
"Give a command name (for the duration of the Emacs session) to the most "
"recently defined keyboard macro (<code class=\"code\">kmacro-name-last-"
"macro</code>)."
msgstr ""
"直近で定義されたキーボードマクロ（<code class=\"code\">kmacro-name-last-"
"macro</code>）に、（Emacsセッションの間有効な）コマンド名を付与します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Save-Keyboard-Macro.html
