# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"Emacs will offer to save abbrevs automatically if you have changed any of "
"them, whenever it offers to save all files (for <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x s</"
"kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-c</kbd>).  It saves them in the file "
"specified by <code class=\"code\">abbrev-file-name</code>.  This feature can "
"be inhibited by setting the variable <code class=\"code\">save-abbrevs</"
"code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>; setting it to <code "
"class=\"code\">silently</code> will save the abbrevs automatically without "
"asking."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、すべてのファイルの保存を促す際（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x s</kbd> また"
"は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-c</kbd> の場合）、略語を変更していれば自動的に保"
"存することを提案します。略語は <code class=\"code\">abbrev-file-name</code> "
"で指定されたファイルに保存されます。この機能は、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">save-abbrevs</code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定"
"することで無効にできます。また、<code class=\"code\">silently</code> に設定す"
"ると、確認なしに自動的に略語が保存されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-insert_002dabbrevs\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-define_002dabbrevs\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-insert_002dabbrevs\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-define_002dabbrevs\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Abbrevs.html
msgid ""
"The commands <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x insert-abbrevs</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x define-abbrevs</kbd> are similar to the previous commands "
"but work on text in an Emacs buffer.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x insert-abbrevs</"
"kbd> inserts text into the current buffer after point, describing all "
"current abbrev definitions; <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x define-abbrevs</kbd> "
"parses the entire current buffer and defines abbrevs accordingly."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x insert-abbrevs</kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x define-abbrevs</kbd> は前述のコマンドと同様ですが、Emacsバッファ内のテキス"
"トに対して動作します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x insert-abbrevs</kbd> は現在の"
"バッファのポイント以降にテキストを挿入し、現在のすべての略語定義を記述しま"
"す。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x define-abbrevs</kbd> は現在のバッファ全体を解析"
"し、それに応じて略語を定義します。"

