#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"<span>51.1.4 Saving Customizations<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Saving-"
"Customizations-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>51.1.4 カスタマイズの保存<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Saving-"
"Customizations-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"In the customization buffer, you can <em class=\"dfn\">save</em> a "
"customization setting by choosing the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Save for "
"Future Sessions</samp>&rsquo; choice from its &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>&rsquo; button.  The <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-"
"s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">Custom-save</code>)  command, or the &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">[Apply and Save]</samp>&rsquo; button at the top of the "
"customization buffer, saves all applicable settings in the buffer."
msgstr ""
"カスタマイズバッファでは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[State]</samp>&rsquo;ボ"
"タンから&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Save for Future Sessions</samp>&rsquo;を"
"選択することで、カスタマイズ設定を<em class=\"dfn\">保存</em>できます。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-s</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">Custom-save</code>) コマン"
"ド、またはカスタマイズバッファ上部の&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[Apply and "
"Save]</samp>&rsquo;ボタンを使用すると、バッファ内の該当するすべての設定が保存"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"Saving works by writing code to a file, usually your initialization file "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The Emacs Initialization "
"File</a>).  Future Emacs sessions automatically read this file at startup, "
"which sets up the customizations again."
msgstr ""
"ファイルを（通常は初期化ファイル。<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-"
"File.html\">Emacs初期化ファイル</a>を参照）にコードを書き込むことで、設定を保"
"存できます。次回以降のEmacsセッションでは、起動時にこのファイルが自動的に読み"
"込まれ、カスタマイズ設定が再度適用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Customizations.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-custom_002dfile\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-custom_002dfile\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"You can choose to save customizations somewhere other than your "
"initialization file.  To make this work, you must add a couple of lines of "
"code to your initialization file, to set the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">custom-file</code> to the name of the desired file, and to "
"load that file.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"カスタマイズ内容を初期化ファイル以外の場所に保存することも可能です。これを実"
"現するには、初期化ファイルに数行のコードを追加し、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">custom-file</code> に目的のファイル名を設定して、そのファイル"
"を読み込む必要があります。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Customizations.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq custom-file &quot;~/.config/emacs-custom.el&quot;)\n"
"(load custom-file)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"You can even specify different customization files for different Emacs "
"versions, like this:"
msgstr ""
"次のように、Emacsのバージョンごとに異なるカスタマイズファイルを指定することも"
"可能です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Customizations.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(cond ((&lt; emacs-major-version 28)\n"
"       ;; <span class=\"r\">Emacs 27 customization.</span>\n"
"       (setq custom-file &quot;~/.config/custom-27.el&quot;))\n"
"      ((and (= emacs-major-version 26)\n"
"            (&lt; emacs-minor-version 3))\n"
"       ;; <span class=\"r\">Emacs 26 customization, before version 26.3.</span>\n"
"       (setq custom-file &quot;~/.config/custom-26.el&quot;))\n"
"      (t\n"
"       ;; <span class=\"r\">Emacs version 28.1 or later.</span>\n"
"       (setq custom-file &quot;~/.config/emacs-custom.el&quot;)))\n"
"\n"
"(load custom-file)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"If Emacs was invoked with the <samp class=\"option\">-q</samp> or <samp "
"class=\"option\">--no-init-file</samp> options (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Initial-Options.html\">Initial Options</a>), it will not let you save "
"your customizations in your initialization file.  This is because saving "
"customizations from such a session would wipe out all the other "
"customizations you might have on your initialization file."
msgstr ""
"Emacsを<samp class=\"option\">-q</samp>または<samp class=\"option\">--no-"
"init-file</samp>オプション（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Initial-Options.html\">"
"初期オプション</a>を参照）付きで起動した場合、初期化ファイルにカスタマイズ内"
"容を保存することはできません。これは、このようなセッションでカスタマイズ内容"
"を保存すると、初期化ファイルにある他のすべてのカスタマイズ内容が消去されてし"
"まうためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unsaved-customizations_002c-reminder-"
"to-save\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"custom_002dprompt_002dcustomize_002dunsaved_002doptions\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unsaved-customizations_002c-reminder-"
"to-save\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"custom_002dprompt_002dcustomize_002dunsaved_002doptions\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"Please note that any customizations you have not chosen to save for future "
"sessions will be lost when you terminate Emacs.  If you&rsquo;d like to be "
"prompted about unsaved customizations at termination time, add the following "
"to your initialization file:"
msgstr ""
"次回以降のセッションのために保存することを選択しなかったカスタマイズは、Emacs"
"を終了する際に失われますのでご注意ください。終了時に未保存のカスタマイズにつ"
"いて通知を受け取りたい場合は、初期化ファイルに以下を追加してください："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Saving-Customizations.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(add-hook 'kill-emacs-query-functions\n"
"          'custom-prompt-customize-unsaved-options)\n"
msgstr ""

