#: build/html/emacs/Search-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"Like <code class=\"code\">lazy-highlight-max-at-a-time</code>, but used for "
"highlighting matches not currently visible in the window when <code "
"class=\"code\">lazy-highlight-buffer</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
