# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Search-Customizations.html
msgid ""
"Normally, entering <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> within incremental search "
"when the search string is empty launches a nonincremental search.  "
"(Actually, it lets you edit the search string, and the next <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> does the search.)  However, if you customize the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">search-nonincremental-instead</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, typing <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> will always "
"exit the incremental search, even if the search string is empty."
msgstr ""
"通常、検索文字列が空の状態でインクリメンタル検索中に <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd> を入力すると、非インクリメンタル検索が開始されます。（実際には、検索文字"
"列を編集でき、次の <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> で検索が行われます。）ただ"
"し、変数 <code class=\"code\">search-nonincremental-instead</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> にカスタマイズすると、検索文字列が空であっても、"
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力すれば常にインクリメンタル検索を終了しま"
"す。"

