# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Secondary-Selection.html
msgid ""
"In addition to the primary selection, the X Window System provides a second "
"similar facility known as the <em class=\"dfn\">secondary selection</em>.  "
"Nowadays, few X applications make use of the secondary selection, but you "
"can access it using the following Emacs commands:"
msgstr ""
"プライマリ選択に加えて、X Window Systemには<em class=\"dfn\">セカンダリ選択</"
"em>と呼ばれる同様の機能が用意されています。現在ではセカンダリ選択を利用するX"
"アプリケーションはほとんどありませんが、以下のEmacsコマンドでアクセスできま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Secondary-Selection.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dDrag_002dmouse_002d1\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-secondary_002dselection-face\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-mouse_002dset_002dsecondary\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-Drag-"
"mouse-1</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002dset_002dsecondary\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dDrag_002dmouse_002d1\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-secondary_002dselection-face\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-mouse_002dset_002dsecondary\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-Drag-"
"mouse-1</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002dset_002dsecondary\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Secondary-Selection.html
msgid ""
"Set the secondary selection, with one end at the place where you press down "
"the button, and the other end at the place where you release it (<code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-set-secondary</code>).  The selected text is "
"highlighted, using the <code class=\"code\">secondary-selection</code> face, "
"as you drag.  The window scrolls automatically if you drag the mouse off the "
"top or bottom of the window, just like <code class=\"code\">mouse-set-"
"region</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mouse-Commands.html\">Mouse "
"Commands for Editing</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ボタンを押し込んだ位置を始点とし、離した位置を終点として、二次選択を行います"
"（<code class=\"code\">mouse-set-secondary</code>）。ドラッグすると、選択した"
"テキストが<code class=\"code\">secondary-selection</code>フェイスでハイライト"
"されます。<code class=\"code\">mouse-set-region</code>と同様に、マウスをウィ"
"ンドウの上端または下端から外に移動させると、ウィンドウが自動的にスクロールし"
"ます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mouse-Commands.html\">編集用マウスコマンド</"
"a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Secondary-Selection.html
msgid "This command does not alter the kill ring."
msgstr "このコマンドはキルリングを変更しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Secondary-Selection.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dmouse_002d1\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-mouse_002dstart_002dsecondary\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"mouse-1</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002dstart_002dsecondary\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dmouse_002d1\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-mouse_002dstart_002dsecondary\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"mouse-1</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002dstart_002dsecondary\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Secondary-Selection.html
msgid ""
"Set one endpoint for the <em class=\"dfn\">secondary selection</em> (<code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-start-secondary</code>); use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"mouse-3</kbd> to set the other end and complete the selection.  This command "
"cancels any existing secondary selection, when it starts a new one."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">二次選択</em>の一方の端点を設定します（<code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-start-secondary</code>）。もう一方の端点を設定するには"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-mouse-3</kbd>を使用し、選択を完了させます。このコマンド"
"は、新しい選択を開始する際に、既存の二次選択をすべて解除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Secondary-Selection.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dmouse_002d3\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-mouse_002dsecondary_002dsave_002dthen_002dkill\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-mouse-3</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002dsecondary_002dsave_002dthen_002dkill\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dmouse_002d3\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-mouse_002dsecondary_002dsave_002dthen_002dkill\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-mouse-3</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"mouse_002dsecondary_002dsave_002dthen_002dkill\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Secondary-Selection.html
msgid ""
"Set the secondary selection (<code class=\"code\">mouse-secondary-save-then-"
"kill</code>), with one end at the position you click <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"mouse-3</kbd>, and the other at the position specified previously with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-mouse-1</kbd>.  This also puts the selected text in the kill "
"ring.  A second <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-mouse-3</kbd> at the same place kills "
"the text selected by the secondary selection just made."
msgstr ""
"セカンダリ選択（<code class=\"code\">mouse-secondary-save-then-kill</code>）"
"を設定します。一方の端をクリックした位置<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-mouse-3</kbd>"
"に、もう一方の端を先ほど<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-mouse-1</kbd>で指定した位置に設"
"定します。これにより、選択したテキストがキルリングに入ります。同じ位置に2つ目"
"の<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-mouse-3</kbd>を設定すると、先ほど行ったセカンダリ選択"
"で指定したテキストが削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Secondary-Selection.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dmouse_002d2\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-mouse_002dyank_002dsecondary\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"mouse-2</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
