msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x list-input-methods</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid "Display a list of all the supported input methods."
msgstr "サポートされているすべての入力方法の一覧を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-set_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-current_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-RET-C_002d_005c\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-set_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-current_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-RET-C_002d_005c\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"To choose an input method for the current buffer, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> C-\\</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">set-input-"
"method</code>).  This command reads the input method name from the "
"minibuffer; the name normally starts with the language environment that it "
"is meant to be used with.  The variable <code class=\"code\">current-input-"
"method</code> records which input method is selected."
msgstr ""
"現在のバッファの入力メソッドを選択するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> C-\\</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">set-input-method</"
"code>) を使用します。このコマンドはミニバッファから入力メソッド名を読み取りま"
"す。通常、その名称は使用対象となる言語環境から始まります。変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">current-input-method</code> には、どの入力メソッドが選択されて"
"いるかが記録されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-toggle_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002d_005c\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-toggle_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002d_005c\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"Input methods use various sequences of <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> "
"characters to stand for non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> "
"characters.  Sometimes it is useful to turn off the input method "
"temporarily.  To do this, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-\\</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">toggle-input-method</code>).  To reenable the input method, "
"type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-\\</kbd> again."
msgstr ""
"入力メソッドでは、<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>以外の文字を表すため"
"に、さまざまな<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字の組み合わせを使用しま"
"す。場合によっては、一時的に入力メソッドを無効にすると便利なことがあります。"
"その場合は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-\\</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">toggle-input-"
"method</code>) と入力してください。入力メソッドを再度有効にするには、もう一"
"度 <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-\\</kbd> と入力してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"If you type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-\\</kbd> and you have not yet selected an "
"input method, it prompts you to specify one.  This has the same effect as "
"using <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> C-\\</kbd> to "
"specify an input method."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-\\</kbd> と入力し、まだ入力メソッドを選択していない場合"
"は、入力メソッドを指定するよう求められます。これは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> C-\\</kbd> を使用して入力メソッドを指定するのと"
"同じ効果があります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"When invoked with a numeric argument, as in <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-\\</"
"kbd>, <code class=\"code\">toggle-input-method</code> always prompts you for "
"an input method, suggesting the most recently selected one as the default."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-default_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-default_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"Selecting a language environment specifies a default input method for use in "
"various buffers.  When you have a default input method, you can select it in "
"the current buffer by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-\\</kbd>.  The variable "
"<code class=\"code\">default-input-method</code> specifies the default input "
"method (<code class=\"code\">nil</code> means there is none)."
msgstr ""
"言語環境を選択すると、さまざまなバッファで使用するデフォルトの入力メソッドが"
"指定されます。デフォルトの入力メソッドが設定されている場合、現在のバッファで "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-\\</kbd> と入力することでそれを選択できます。変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">default-input-method</code> はデフォルトの入力メソッドを指定し"
"ます（<code class=\"code\">nil</code> は設定がないことを意味します）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"In some language environments, which support several different input "
"methods, you might want to use an input method different from the default "
"chosen by <code class=\"code\">set-language-environment</code>.  You can "
"instruct Emacs to select a different default input method for a certain "
"language environment, if you wish, by using <code class=\"code\">set-"
"language-environment-hook</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Language-"
"Environments.html\">set-language-environment-hook</a>).  For example:"
msgstr ""
"複数の異なる入力メソッドをサポートする一部の言語環境では、<code "
"class=\"code\">set-language-environment</code> で選択されたデフォルトとは異な"
"る入力メソッドを使用したい場合があります。必要に応じて、<code "
"class=\"code\">set-language-environment-hook</code> を使用することで、特定の"
"言語環境に対して別のデフォルト入力メソッドを選択するよう Emacs に指示できます"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Language-Environments.html\">set-language-"
"environment-hook</a> を参照）。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun my-chinese-setup ()\n"
"  &quot;Set up my private Chinese environment.&quot;\n"
"  (if (equal current-language-environment &quot;Chinese-GB&quot;)\n"
"      (setq default-input-method &quot;chinese-tonepy&quot;)))\n"
"(add-hook 'set-language-environment-hook 'my-chinese-setup)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"This sets the default input method to be <code class=\"code\">chinese-"
"tonepy</code> whenever you choose a Chinese-GB language environment."
msgstr ""
"これにより、中国語-GB言語環境を選択するたびに、デフォルトの入力方式が<code "
"class=\"code\">chinese-tonepy</code>に設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"You can instruct Emacs to activate a certain input method automatically.  "
"For example:"
msgstr ""
"Emacsに特定の入力メソッドを自動的に有効にするよう指示できます。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(add-hook 'text-mode-hook\n"
"  (lambda () (set-input-method &quot;german-prefix&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"This automatically activates the input method <code class=\"code\">german-"
"prefix</code> in Text mode."
msgstr ""
"これにより、テキストモードで入力メソッド <code class=\"code\">german-prefix</"
"code> が自動的に有効になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"quail_002dset_002dkeyboard_002dlayout\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"quail_002dset_002dkeyboard_002dlayout\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"Some input methods for alphabetic scripts work by (in effect)  remapping the "
"keyboard to emulate various keyboard layouts commonly used for those "
"scripts.  How to do this remapping properly depends on your actual keyboard "
"layout.  To specify which layout your keyboard has, use the command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x quail-set-keyboard-layout</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"アルファベット表記の文字体系向けの入力方式の中には、（実質的に）キーボードを"
"再マッピングすることで、それらの文字体系で一般的に用いられるさまざまなキー"
"ボードレイアウトをエミュレートするものがあります。この再マッピングを適切に行"
"う方法は、実際のキーボードレイアウトによって異なります。お使いのキーボードが"
"どのレイアウトを採用しているかを確認するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x quail-"
"set-keyboard-layout</kbd> コマンドを使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quail_002dshow_002dkey\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-quail_002dshow_002dkey\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"You can use the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x quail-show-key</kbd> to show "
"what key (or key sequence) to type in order to input the character following "
"point, using the selected keyboard layout.  The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"u C-x =</kbd> also shows that information, in addition to other information "
"about the character."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x quail-show-key</kbd> を使用すると、選択した"
"キーボードレイアウトで、ポイントの次の文字を入力するためにどのキー（または"
"キーシーケンス）を押せばよいかを確認できます。コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"u C-x =</kbd> でも、その文字に関するその他の情報に加えて、同様の情報が表示さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-list_002dinput_002dmethods\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-list_002dinput_002dmethods\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Select-Input-Method.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x list-input-methods</kbd> displays a list of all the "
"supported input methods.  The list gives information about each input "
"method, including the string that stands for it in the mode line."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x list-input-methods</kbd> は、サポートされているすべて"
"の入力メソッドの一覧を表示します。この一覧には、モードラインで各メソッドを表"
"す文字列など、各入力メソッドに関する情報が記載されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
