# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"Semantic is a package that provides language-aware editing commands based on "
"<code class=\"code\">source code parsers</code>.  This section provides a "
"brief description of Semantic; for full details, see <a data-"
"manual=\"semantic\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/semantic/index.html#Top\">Semantic</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">Semantic</cite>."
msgstr ""
"Semanticは、<code class=\"code\">source code parsers</code>に基づいた言語認識"
"型の編集コマンドを提供するパッケージです。本節ではSemanticについて簡潔に説明"
"します。詳細については、<cite class=\"cite\">Semantic</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"semantic\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/semantic/index.html#Top\">Semantic</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"Most of the language-aware features in Emacs, such as Font Lock mode (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Font-Lock.html\">Font Lock mode</a>), rely on rules "
"of thumb<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF19\" href=\"#FOOT19\"><sup>19</sup></"
"a> that usually give good results but are never completely exact.  In "
"contrast, the parsers used by Semantic have an exact understanding of "
"programming language syntax.  This allows Semantic to provide search, "
"navigation, and completion commands that are powerful and precise."
msgstr ""
"Font Lockモード（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Font-Lock.html\">Font Lockモード</"
"a>を参照）など、Emacsの言語認識機能の多くは、通常は良好な結果をもたらすもの"
"の、完全に正確とは言えない経験則<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF19\" "
"href=\"#FOOT19\"><sup>19</sup></a>に基づいています。これに対し、Semanticが使"
"用するパーサーは、プログラミング言語の構文を正確に理解しています。これによ"
"り、Semanticは強力かつ精密な検索、ナビゲーション、および補完コマンドを提供す"
"ることが可能になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Semantic-mode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-mode_002c-Semantic\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Semantic-mode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-mode_002c-Semantic\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"To begin using Semantic, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x semantic-mode</kbd> or "
"click on the menu item named &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Source Code Parsers "
"(Semantic)</samp>&rsquo; in the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Tools</"
"samp>&rsquo; menu.  This enables Semantic mode, a global minor mode."
msgstr ""
"Semanticを使い始めるには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x semantic-mode</kbd>と入力す"
"るか、<samp class=\"samp\">Tools</samp>メニューにある&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Source Code Parsers (Semantic)</samp>&rsquo;というメニュー項目"
"をクリックしてください。これにより、グローバルマイナーモードであるSemantic"
"モードが有効になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"When Semantic mode is enabled, Emacs automatically attempts to parse each "
"file you visit.  Currently, Semantic understands C, C++, HTML, Java, "
"Javascript, Make, Python, Scheme, SRecode, and Texinfo.  Within each parsed "
"buffer, the following commands are available:"
msgstr ""
"Semanticモードが有効な場合、Emacsはアクセスする各ファイルを自動的に解析しよう"
"とします。現在、SemanticはC、C++、HTML、Java、Javascript、Make、Python、"
"Scheme、SRecode、およびTexinfoに対応しています。解析された各バッファ内では、"
"以下のコマンドが利用可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-C_002dc-_002c-j\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c , j</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dc-_002c-j\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-C_002dc-_002c-j\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c , j</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dc-_002c-j\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"Prompt for the name of a function defined in the current file, and move "
"point there (<code class=\"code\">semantic-complete-jump-local</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在のファイルで定義されている関数名のプロンプトを表示し、ポイントをそこに移"
"動します (<code class=\"code\">semantic-complete-jump-local</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-C_002dc-_002c-J\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c , J</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dc-_002c-J\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-C_002dc-_002c-J\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c , J</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dc-_002c-J\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"Prompt for the name of a function defined in any file Emacs has parsed, and "
"move point there (<code class=\"code\">semantic-complete-jump</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Emacsが解析した任意のファイルで定義されている関数名のプロンプトを表示し、ポイ"
"ントをそこへ移動します (<code class=\"code\">semantic-complete-jump</code>)。"

