#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-C_002dc-_002c-SPC\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c , <kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"C_002dc-_002c-SPC\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-C_002dc-_002c-SPC\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c , <kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"C_002dc-_002c-SPC\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"Display a list of possible completions for the symbol at point (<code "
"class=\"code\">semantic-complete-analyze-inline</code>).  This also "
"activates a set of special key bindings for choosing a completion: <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> accepts the current "
"completion, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-p</kbd> "
"cycle through possible completions, <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> completes as far as possible and then cycles, "
"and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> or any other key aborts completion."
msgstr ""
"ポイント (<code class=\"code\">semantic-complete-analyze-inline</code>) にあ"
"るシンボルの補完候補一覧を表示します。これにより、補完を選択するための一連の"
"特殊キーバインドも有効になります。<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd></kbd> は現在の補完を確定し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-p</kbd> は補完候補を順に切り替え、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> は可能な限り補完を行った後に順に切り替え、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> またはその他のキーを押すと補完を中断します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-C_002dc-_002c-l\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c , l</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dc-_002c-l\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-C_002dc-_002c-l\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c , l</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dc-_002c-l\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"Display a list of the possible completions of the symbol at point, in "
"another window (<code class=\"code\">semantic-analyze-possible-completions</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"ポイントにあるシンボルの補完候補一覧を、別のウィンドウに表示します (<code "
"class=\"code\">semantic-analyze-possible-completions</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Semantic.html
msgid ""
"In addition to the above commands, the Semantic package provides a variety "
"of other ways to make use of parser information.  For instance, you can use "
"it to display a list of completions when Emacs is idle.  See <a data-"
"manual=\"semantic\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/semantic/index.html#Top\">Semantic</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">Semantic</cite>, for details."
msgstr ""
"上記のコマンドに加え、Semanticパッケージではパーサー情報を活用するためのさま"
"ざまな方法が提供されています。例えば、Emacsがアイドル状態のときに、補完候補の"
"一覧を表示させることができます。詳細については、<cite "
"class=\"cite\">Semantic</cite>の<a data-manual=\"semantic\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/semantic/"
"index.html#Top\">Semantic</a>を参照してください。"

