msgstr "メールの作成を開始 (<code class=\"code\">compose-mail</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sending-Mail.html
