"sentence</code>)."
msgstr "文末 (<code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code>) まで移動する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid ""
"Kill forward to the end of the sentence (<code class=\"code\">kill-sentence</"
"code>)."
msgstr "文末まで前方一致で検索 (<code class=\"code\">kill-sentence</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
