# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid ""
"The commands <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">backward-"
"sentence</code>) and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-e</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code>) move to the beginning and end of the "
"current sentence, respectively.  Their bindings were chosen to resemble <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-e</kbd>, which move to the "
"beginning and end of a line.  Unlike them, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> and "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-e</kbd> move over successive sentences if repeated."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">backward-"
"sentence</code>) および <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-e</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code>) は、それぞれ現在の文の先頭と末尾に移"
"動します。これらのバインドは、行の先頭と末尾に移動する <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"a</kbd> および <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-e</kbd> に似せて設定されました。これらと"
"は異なり、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-e</kbd> は繰り"
"返し使用された場合、連続する文をまたいで移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid ""
"Moving backward over a sentence places point just before the first character "
"of the sentence; moving forward places point right after the punctuation "
"that ends the sentence.  Neither one moves over the whitespace at the "
"sentence boundary."
msgstr ""
"文の後方に移動するとポインタは文の先頭文字の直前に配置され、前方に移動すると"
"文を終わらせる句読点の直後に配置されます。いずれの場合も、文境界の空白部分は"
"スキップされません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dk\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-kill_002dsentence\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dk\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-kill_002dsentence\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid ""
"Just as <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-e</kbd> have a "
"kill command, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd>, to go with them, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-e</kbd> have a "
"corresponding kill command: <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-k</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-sentence</code>) kills from point to the end of the "
"sentence.  With a positive numeric argument <var class=\"var\">n</var>, it "
"kills the next <var class=\"var\">n</var> sentences; with a negative "
"argument &minus;<var class=\"var\">n</var>, it kills back to the beginning "
"of the <var class=\"var\">n</var>th preceding sentence."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-e</kbd> に対応するキルコ"
"マンドがあるのと同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> にも対応するキルコマンド"
"があり、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-e</kbd> にも同様"
"のキルコマンドが存在します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-k</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-sentence</code>) は、指定した箇所から文末までをキルしま"
"す。正の数値引数を指定すると <var class=\"var\">n</var> は次の <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> 文をキルし、負の引数 &minus;<var class=\"var\">n</var> "
"を指定すると、直前の <var class=\"var\">n</var> 文の先頭まで遡ってキルしま"
"す。"

