# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid ""
"The <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">backward-kill-sentence</code>) kills back to the beginning of "
"a sentence."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">backward-kill-sentence</code>) は文頭まで遡ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid ""
"The sentence commands assume that you follow the American typist&rsquo;s "
"convention of putting two spaces at the end of a sentence.  That is, a "
"sentence ends wherever there is a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">!</samp>&rsquo; followed by the end of a line or two spaces, "
"with any number of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">)</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">]</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">'</samp>&rsquo;, "
"or &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;</samp>&rsquo; characters allowed in "
"between.  A sentence also begins or ends wherever a paragraph begins or "
"ends.  It is useful to follow this convention, because it allows the Emacs "
"sentence commands to distinguish between periods that end a sentence and "
"periods that indicate abbreviations."
msgstr ""
"文コマンドは、文末に2つのスペースを置くというアメリカのタイピストの慣習に従う"
"ことを前提としています。つまり、文は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">?</samp>&rsquo;、または &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">!</samp>&rsquo; の後に改行または2つのスペースが続く箇所"
"で終わり、その間には任意の数の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">)</samp>&rsquo;、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">]</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">'</"
"samp>&rsquo;、または &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;</samp>&rsquo; という"
"文字を置くことができます。また、文は段落の開始または終了箇所で始まり、あるい"
"は終わります。Emacsの文コマンドが、文を終わらせるピリオドと略語を示すピリオド"
"を区別できるため、この慣習に従うことが有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"sentence_002dend_002ddouble_002dspace\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"sentence_002dend_002ddouble_002dspace\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid ""
"If you want to use just one space between sentences, you can set the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-double-space</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> to make the sentence commands stop for single "
"spaces.  However, this has a drawback: there is no way to distinguish "
"between periods that end sentences and those that indicate abbreviations.  "
"For convenient and reliable editing, we therefore recommend you follow the "
"two-space convention.  The variable <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-double-"
"space</code> also affects filling (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Fill-"
"Commands.html\">Explicit Fill Commands</a>)."
msgstr ""
"文間のスペースを1つだけにしたい場合は、変数 <code class=\"code\">sentence-"
"end-double-space</code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定することで、"
"文コマンドが単一スペースで停止するようにできます。ただし、これには欠点があり"
"ます。文を終わらせるピリオドと、略語を示すピリオドを区別する方法がないことで"
"す。そのため、便利で確実な編集を行うには、2スペースの慣習に従うことをおすすめ"
"します。変数 <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-double-space</code> はフィル処"
"理にも影響します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Fill-Commands.html\">明示的なフィ"
"ルコマンド</a>を参照してください）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sentence_002dend\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sentence_002dend\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> controls how to "
"recognize the end of a sentence.  If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"its value should be a regular expression, which is used to match the last "
"few characters of a sentence, together with the whitespace following the "
"sentence (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regexps.html\">Syntax of Regular "
"Expressions</a>).  If the value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"default, then Emacs computes sentence ends according to various criteria "
"such as the value of <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-double-space</code>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> は、文末の判定方法を制御しま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、その値は正規表現である必要が"
"あり、これを用いて文の末尾数文字と、文に続く空白文字を照合します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Regexps.html\">正規表現の構文</a>を参照）。値がデフォ"
"ルトの <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合、Emacs は <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end-double-space</code> の値などのさまざまな基準に基"
"づいて文末を判定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"sentence_002dend_002dwithout_002dperiod\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"sentence_002dend_002dwithout_002dperiod\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid ""
"Some languages, such as Thai, do not use periods to indicate the end of a "
"sentence.  Set the variable <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-without-"
"period</code> to <code class=\"code\">t</code> in such cases."
msgstr ""
"タイ語など、文末を示すのにピリオドを用いない言語があります。そのような場合"
"は、変数 <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-without-period</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> に設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sentences.html
msgid ""
"Even though the above mentioned sentence movement commands are based on "
"human languages, other Emacs modes can set these command to get similar "
"functionality (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Moving-by-"
"Sentences.html\">Moving by Sentences</a>)."
msgstr ""
"前述の文単位の移動コマンドは人間の言語に基づいていますが、他のEmacsモードでも"
"同様の機能を実現するためにこれらのコマンドを設定できます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Moving-by-Sentences.html\">文単位の移動</a>を参照）。"

