#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"<span>13.1 Setting the Mark<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Setting-the-"
"Mark\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>13.1 マークの設定<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Setting-the-"
"Mark\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid "Here are some commands for setting the mark:"
msgstr "マークを設定するためのコマンドをいくつか紹介します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"Set the mark at point, and activate it (<code class=\"code\">set-mark-"
"command</code>)."
msgstr ""
"ポイントにマークを設定し、有効化します (<code class=\"code\">set-mark-"
"command</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-@</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-@</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid "The same."
msgstr "同じ。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-x</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-x</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"Set the mark at point, and activate it; then move point where the mark used "
"to be (<code class=\"code\">exchange-point-and-mark</code>)."
msgstr ""
"ポイントにマークを設定して有効化し、その後、マークがあった場所（<code "
"class=\"code\">exchange-point-and-mark</code>）にポイントを移動させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid "Set point and the mark around the text you drag across."
msgstr "セットポイントと、ドラッグしたテキスト周辺のマーク。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"Set the mark at point, then move point to where you click (<code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-save-then-kill</code>)."
msgstr ""
"マークをポイントに設定し、次にポイントをクリックした位置（<code "
"class=\"code\">mouse-save-then-kill</code>）に移動させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><span class=\"r\">Shifted cursor motion keys</span></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><span class=\"r\">Shifted cursor motion keys</span></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"Set the mark at point if the mark is inactive, then move point.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Shift-Selection.html\">Shift Selection</a>."
msgstr ""
"マークが非アクティブな場合は、マークをポイントに設定し、その後ポイントを移動"
"します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Shift-Selection.html\">Shift Selection</a>を"
"参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dSPC\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002d_0040\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-set_002dmark_002dcommand\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dSPC\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002d_0040\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-set_002dmark_002dcommand\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"The most common way to set the mark is with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">set-mark-command</"
"code>)<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF7\" href=\"#FOOT7\"><sup>7</sup></a>.  "
"This sets the mark where point is, and activates it.  You can then move "
"point away, leaving the mark behind.  If the mark is already set where point "
"is, this command doesn&rsquo;t set another mark, but only activates the "
"existing mark."
msgstr ""
"マークを設定する最も一般的な方法は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">set-mark-command</"
"code>)<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF7\" href=\"#FOOT7\"><sup>7</sup></a> を"
"用いることです。これにより、ポイントの位置にマークが設定され、有効化されま"
"す。その後、ポイントを移動させると、マークが残ります。すでにポイントの位置に"
"マークが設定されている場合、このコマンドは別のマークを設定するのではなく、既"
"存のマークを有効化するだけです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"For example, suppose you wish to convert part of the buffer to upper case.  "
"To accomplish this, go to one end of the desired text, type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>, and move point until the "
"desired portion of text is highlighted.  Now type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-"
"u</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">upcase-region</code>).  This converts the text "
"in the region to upper case, and then deactivates the mark."
msgstr ""
"例えば、バッファの一部を大文字に変換したいとします。これを行うには、目的のテ"
"キストの一端に移動して <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></"
"kbd> と入力し、目的のテキスト部分がハイライトされるまでポイントを移動させま"
"す。次に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-u</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">upcase-"
"region</code>) と入力します。これにより、その領域のテキストが大文字に変換さ"
"れ、マークが解除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"Whenever the mark is active, you can deactivate it by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Quitting.html\">Quitting and Aborting</a>).  Most commands that "
"operate on the region also automatically deactivate the mark, like <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-u</kbd> in the above example."
msgstr ""
"マークが有効な状態であれば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> と入力することで無効"
"にできます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Quitting.html\">終了と中断</a>を参"
"照）。上記の例における <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-u</kbd> のように、リージョン"
"を操作するほとんどのコマンドも、自動的にマークを無効にします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"Instead of setting the mark in order to operate on a region, you can also "
"use it to remember a position in the buffer (by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>), and "
"later jump back there (by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>).  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Mark-"
"Ring.html\">The Mark Ring</a>, for details."
msgstr ""
"領域を操作するためにマークを設定する代わりに、バッファ内の位置を記憶しておく"
"（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> と入力）ために利用し、後でそこへジャンプする"
"（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> と入力）ことも"
"できます。詳細は <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Mark-Ring.html\">マークリング</a> "
"を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dx\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-exchange_002dpoint_002dand_002dmark\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-C_002dx\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-exchange_002dpoint_002dand_002dmark\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-x</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">exchange-"
"point-and-mark</code>) exchanges the positions of point and the mark.  <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-x</kbd> is useful when you are satisfied with the "
"position of point but want to move the other end of the region (where the "
"mark is).  Using <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-x</kbd> a second time, if "
"necessary, puts the mark at the new position with point back at its original "
"position.  Normally, if the mark is inactive, this command first reactivates "
"the mark wherever it was last set, to ensure that the region is left "
"highlighted.  However, if you call it with a prefix argument, it leaves the "
"mark inactive and the region unhighlighted; you can use this to jump to the "
"mark in a manner similar to <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</"
"kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-x</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">exchange-"
"point-and-mark</code>) は、ポイントとマークの位置を入れ替えます。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-x</kbd> は、ポイントの位置には満足しているが、領域のもう"
"一方の端（マークがある位置）を移動させたい場合に便利です。必要に応じて <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-x</kbd> を再度使用すると、マークが新しい位置に移動し、ポ"
"イントが元の位置に戻ります。通常、マークが非アクティブな場合、このコマンドは"
"まずマークが最後に設定された位置でマークを再アクティブにし、領域がハイライト"
"されたままになるようにします。ただし、接頭辞引数を付けて呼び出すと、マークは"
"非アクティブなままとなり、領域もハイライトされません。これを利用して、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> と同様の方法でマークへ"
"ジャンプできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"You can also set the mark with the mouse.  If you press the left mouse "
"button (<kbd class=\"kbd\">down-mouse-1</kbd>) and drag the mouse across a "
"range of text, this sets the mark where you first pressed the mouse button "
"and puts point where you release it.  Alternatively, clicking the right "
"mouse button (<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd>) sets the mark at point and "
"then moves point to where you clicked.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Mouse-"
"Commands.html\">Mouse Commands for Editing</a>, for a more detailed "
"description of these mouse commands."
msgstr ""
"マウスでマークを設定することもできます。マウスの左ボタン（<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">down-mouse-1</kbd>）を押しながらテキストの範囲をドラッグする"
"と、最初にマウスボタンを押した位置にマークが設定され、ボタンを離した位置にポ"
"イントが移動します。あるいは、マウスの右ボタン（<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</"
"kbd>）をクリックすると、ポイントにマークが設定され、その後ポイントがクリック"
"した位置に移動します。これらのマウスコマンドの詳細な説明については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Mouse-Commands.html\">編集用マウスコマンド</a>を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"Finally, you can set the mark by holding down the shift key while typing "
"certain cursor motion commands (such as <kbd class=\"kbd\">S-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">S-C-f</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">S-C-n</kbd>, etc.).  This is called <em class=\"dfn\">shift-"
"selection</em>.  It sets the mark at point before moving point, but only if "
"there is no active mark set via a previous shift-selection or mouse "
"commands.  The mark set by mouse commands and by shift-selection behaves "
"slightly differently from the usual mark: any subsequent unshifted cursor "
"motion command deactivates it automatically.  For details, see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"Shift-Selection.html\">Shift Selection</a>."
msgstr ""
"最後に、特定のカーソル移動コマンド（<kbd class=\"kbd\">S-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RIGHT</kbd></kbd>、<kbd class=\"kbd\">S-C-f</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">S-C-n</kbd>など）を入力する際にShiftキーを押し続けることで、"
"マークを設定できます。これは<em class=\"dfn\">シフト選択</em>と呼ばれます。こ"
"れにより、ポイントを移動させる前にポイントにマークが設定されますが、これは直"
"前のシフト選択やマウスコマンドによって有効なマークが設定されていない場合に限"
"られます。マウスコマンドやシフト選択によって設定されたマークは、通常のマーク"
"とは動作が若干異なります。その後にShiftキーを押さずにカーソル移動コマンドを実"
"行すると、自動的に解除されます。詳細については、<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Shift-Selection.html\">シフト選択</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"Many commands that insert text, such as <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">yank</code>), set the mark at the other end of the inserted "
"text, without activating it.  This lets you easily return to that position "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mark-Ring.html\">The Mark Ring</a>).  You can "
"tell that a command does this when it shows &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Mark "
"set</samp>&rsquo; in the echo area."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">yank</code>) のようにテキ"
"ストを挿入する多くのコマンドは、マークを有効化することなく、挿入されたテキス"
