# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Setting-Mark.html
msgid ""
"There is no <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> "
"character in <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>; usually, typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> on a text terminal gives "
"the character <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-@</kbd>.  This key is also bound to <code "
"class=\"code\">set-mark-command</code>, so unless you are unlucky enough to "
"have a text terminal that behaves differently, you might as well think of "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-@</kbd> as <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</"
"kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>に<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>という文字は存在しません。通常、テキスト端末で"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>と入力すると<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-@</kbd>という文字が出力されます。このキーは<code "
"class=\"code\">set-mark-command</code>にも割り当てられているため、挙動の異な"
"るテキスト端末に当たるという不運に見舞われない限り、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-@</"
"kbd>は<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>と考えて差し支え"
"ないでしょう。"

