# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Several-Buffers.html
msgid ""
"To use the Buffer Menu, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-b</kbd> and switch to "
"the window displaying the <samp class=\"file\">*Buffer List*</samp> buffer.  "
"You can also type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x buffer-menu</kbd> to open the "
"Buffer Menu in the selected window.  Alternatively, the command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x buffer-menu-other-window</kbd> opens the Buffer Menu in "
"another window, and selects that window."
msgstr ""
"バッファメニューを使用するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-b</kbd> と入力して "
"<samp class=\"file\">*Buffer List*</samp> バッファが表示されているウィンドウ"
