# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sexp-Diary-Entries.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">diary-date</code> applies to dates "
"described by a month, day, year combination, each of which can be an "
"integer, a list of integers, or <code class=\"code\">t</code> (meaning all "
"values).  For example,"
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">diary-date</code> は、月・日・年の組み合わせで表さ"
"れる日付に適用されます。各要素は、整数、整数のリスト、または <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>（すべての値を意味する）のいずれかとなります。例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Sexp-Diary-Entries.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "%%(diary-date '(10 11 12) 22 t) Rake leaves\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sexp-Diary-Entries.html
msgid "causes the fancy diary to show"
msgstr "凝った日記を表示させる"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Sexp-Diary-Entries.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rake leaves\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sexp-Diary-Entries.html
msgid "on October 22, November 22, and December 22 of every year."
msgstr "毎年10月22日、11月22日、12月22日。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Sexp-Diary-Entries.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dfloat_002c-and-sexp-diary-"
"entries\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-diary_002dfloat_002c-and-sexp-diary-"
"entries\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sexp-Diary-Entries.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">diary-float</code> allows you to describe "
"diary entries that apply to dates like the third Friday of November, or the "
"last Tuesday in April.  The parameters are the <var class=\"var\">month</"
"var>, <var class=\"var\">dayname</var>, and an index <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var>.  The entry appears on the <var class=\"var\">n</var>th <var "
"class=\"var\">dayname</var> after the first day of <var class=\"var\">month</"
"var>, where <var class=\"var\">dayname</var>=0 means Sunday, 1 means Monday, "
"and so on.  If <var class=\"var\">n</var> is negative it counts backward "
"from the end of <var class=\"var\">month</var>.  The value of <var "
"class=\"var\">month</var> can be a list of months, a single month, or <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> to specify all months.  You can also use an optional "
"parameter <var class=\"var\">day</var> to specify the <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var>th <var class=\"var\">dayname</var> on or after/before <var "
"class=\"var\">day</var> of <var class=\"var\">month</var>; the value of <var "
"class=\"var\">day</var> defaults to 1 if <var class=\"var\">n</var> is "
"positive and to the last day of <var class=\"var\">month</var> if <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> is negative.  For example,"
msgstr ""
"関数 <code class=\"code\">diary-float</code> を使用すると、11月の第3金曜日や4"
"月の最終火曜日といった日付に該当する日記エントリを記述できます。パラメータは "
"<var class=\"var\">month</var>、<var class=\"var\">dayname</var>、およびイン"
"デックス <var class=\"var\">n</var> です。エントリは、<var "
"class=\"var\">month</var> の初日から <var class=\"var\">n</var> 番目の <var "
"class=\"var\">dayname</var> に表示されます。ここで <var "
"class=\"var\">dayname</var>=0 は日曜日、1 は月曜日を意味し、以降も同様です。"
"<var class=\"var\">n</var> が負の値の場合、<var class=\"var\">month</var> の"
"末尾から逆順にカウントされます。<var class=\"var\">month</var> の値には、月の"
"リスト、単一の月、またはすべての月を指定する <code class=\"code\">t</code> を"
"指定できます。また、オプションパラメータ <var class=\"var\">day</var> を使用"
"して、<var class=\"var\">month</var> の <var class=\"var\">day</var> 以降また"
"は以前の <var class=\"var\">n</var> 番目の <var class=\"var\">dayname</var> "
"を指定することも可能です。<var class=\"var\">day</var> の値は、<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> が正の場合はデフォルトで 1 となり、<var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> が負の場合は <var class=\"var\">month</var> の最終日と"
"なります。例えば、"

