# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"<span>32.9 Shell Command Guessing<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Shell-"
"Command-Guessing-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>32.9 シェルコマンドの推測<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Shell-"
"Command-Guessing-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-guessing-shell-commands-for-files-"
"_0028in-Dired_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-guessing-shell-commands-for-files-"
"_0028in-Dired_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"Based upon the name of a file, Dired tries to guess what shell command you "
"might want to apply to it.  For example, if you have point on a file named "
"<samp class=\"file\">foo.tar</samp> and you press <kbd class=\"kbd\">!</"
"kbd>, Dired will guess that you want to run &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">tar "
"xvf</samp>&rsquo;, and suggest that as the default shell command."
msgstr ""
"ファイルの名前に基づき、Diredはそのファイルにどのようなシェルコマンドを適用し"
"たいかを推測しようとします。例えば、<samp class=\"file\">foo.tar</samp>という"
"名前のファイルにポイントを置いて<kbd class=\"kbd\">!</kbd>を押すと、Diredは"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">tar xvf</samp>&rsquo;を実行したいのだと推測し、そ"
"れをデフォルトのシェルコマンドとして提案します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"You can type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> to get the default into the "
"minibuffer for editing.  If there are several commands for a given file, "
"type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> several times to see each matching command "
"in order."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> と入力すると、デフォルトのコマンドが編集用のミニ"
"バッファに表示されます。特定のファイルに対して複数のコマンドがある場合は、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd> を数回入力することで、一致する各コマンドを順に表"
"示できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"Dired only tries to guess a command for a single file, never for a list of "
"marked files."
msgstr ""
"Diredは単一のファイルに対するコマンドを推測しようとするのみで、マークされた"
"ファイルの一覧に対しては決して行いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">dired-guess-shell-alist-default</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-dired_002dguess_002dshell_002dalist_002ddefault\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">dired-guess-shell-alist-default</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-dired_002dguess_002dshell_002dalist_002ddefault\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"This variable specifies the predefined rules for guessing shell commands "
"suitable for certain files.  Set this to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> to "
"turn guessing off.  The elements of <code class=\"code\">dired-guess-shell-"
"alist-user</code> (defined by the user) will override these rules."
msgstr ""
"この変数は、特定のファイルに適したシェルコマンドを推測するための事前定義済み"
"ルールを指定します。推測機能を無効にするには、これを <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定してください。<code class=\"code\">dired-"
"guess-shell-alist-user</code> の要素（ユーザー定義）は、これらのルールよりも"
"優先されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">dired-guess-shell-alist-optional</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-dired_002dguess_002dshell_002dalist_002doptional\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">dired-guess-shell-alist-optional</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-dired_002dguess_002dshell_002dalist_002doptional\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"This variable is like <code class=\"code\">dired-guess-shell-alist-default</"
"code> but contains external viewers and players for various media formats.  "
"Setting this to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> turns guessing off.  The "
"variables <code class=\"code\">dired-guess-shell-alist-user</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-guess-shell-alist-default</code> will override these "
"rules."
msgstr ""
"この変数は <code class=\"code\">dired-guess-shell-alist-default</code> と同様"
"ですが、さまざまなメディア形式向けの外部ビューアやプレーヤーが含まれていま"
"す。これを <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定すると、推測機能が無効になり"
"ます。変数 <code class=\"code\">dired-guess-shell-alist-user</code> および "
"<code class=\"code\">dired-guess-shell-alist-default</code> は、これらのルー"
"ルを上書きします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">Variable: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">dired-guess-shell-alist-user</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-dired_002dguess_002dshell_002dalist_002duser\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"category-def\">変数: </span><span><strong class=\"def-"
"name\">dired-guess-shell-alist-user</strong><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-dired_002dguess_002dshell_002dalist_002duser\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"If non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, this variable specifies the user-"
"defined alist of file regexps and their suggested commands.  These rules "
"take precedence over the predefined rules in the variables <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-guess-shell-alist-default</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-guess-shell-alist-optional</code> when <code "
"class=\"code\">dired-do-shell-command</code> is run).  The default is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、この変数はファイル正規表現とその"
"推奨コマンドからなるユーザー定義のalistを指定します。<code "
"class=\"code\">dired-do-shell-command</code> が実行される際、これらのルールは"
"変数 <code class=\"code\">dired-guess-shell-alist-default</code> および "
"<code class=\"code\">dired-guess-shell-alist-optional</code> に定義済みのルー"
"ルよりも優先されます。デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid "Each element of the alist looks like"
msgstr "alistの各要素は次のようになっています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(<var class=\"var\">regexp</var> <var class=\"var\">command</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"where each <var class=\"var\">command</var> can either be a string or a Lisp "
"expression that evaluates to a string.  If several commands are given, all "
"of them will temporarily be pushed onto the history."
msgstr ""
"ここで、各 <var class=\"var\">command</var> は文字列、または文字列として評価"
"される Lisp 式のいずれかとなります。複数のコマンドが指定された場合、それらは"
"すべて一時的に履歴にプッシュされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"A &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; in the shell command stands "
"for the file name that matched <var class=\"var\">regexp</var>.  When Emacs "
"invokes the <var class=\"var\">command</var>, it replaces each instance of "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; with the matched file name."
msgstr ""
"シェルコマンド内の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</samp>&rsquo; は、<var "
"class=\"var\">regexp</var> に一致したファイル名を表します。Emacs が <var "
"class=\"var\">command</var> を呼び出す際、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">*</"
"samp>&rsquo; の各出現箇所を、一致したファイル名に置き換えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"To add rules for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.foo</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">.bar</samp>&rsquo; file extensions, add this to your "
"Init file:"
msgstr ""
"ファイル拡張子「<samp class=\"samp\">.foo</samp>」および「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.bar</samp>」のルールを追加するには、Initファイルに以下を追記"
"してください："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq dired-guess-shell-alist-user\n"
"      (list\n"
"       (list &quot;\\\\.foo$&quot; &quot;<var class=\"var\">foo-command</var>&quot;)  ; fixed rule\n"
"       ;; possibly more rules...\n"
"       (list &quot;\\\\.bar$&quot;  ; rule with condition test\n"
"             '(if <var class=\"var\">condition</var>\n"
"                  &quot;<var class=\"var\">bar-command-1</var>&quot;\n"
"                &quot;<var class=\"var\">bar-command-2</var>&quot;))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid "This will override any predefined rules for the same extensions."
msgstr "これにより、同一の拡張子に対する既定のルールはすべて上書きされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Command-Guessing.html
msgid ""
"You can find more user options with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-group "
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> dired-guess <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-group <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> dired-"
"guess <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> を使用すると、さらに多くのユーザーオ"
"プションを利用できます。"

