"<span>40.5 Shell Command History<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Shell-"
"Command-History\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>40.5 シェルコマンド履歴<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Shell-"
