# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Complete the command name or file name before point in the shell buffer "
"(<code class=\"code\">completion-at-point</code>).  This uses the usual "
"Emacs completion rules (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Completion.html\">Completion</a>), with the completion alternatives "
"being file names, environment variable names, the shell command history, and "
"history references (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"History-"
"References.html\">Shell History References</a>).  For options controlling "
"the completion, see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Shell-Options.html\">Shell "
"Mode Options</a>."
msgstr ""
"シェルバッファ (<code class=\"code\">completion-at-point</code>) 内で、ポイン"
"トより前のコマンド名またはファイル名を補完します。これには通常の Emacs 補完"
"ルール（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion.html\">Completion</a> を参照）が"
"適用され、補完候補にはファイル名、環境変数名、シェルのコマンド履歴、および履"
"歴参照（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"History-References.html\">Shell History "
"References</a> を参照）が含まれます。補完を制御するオプションについては、<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Shell-Options.html\">Shell Mode Options</a> を参照して"
"ください。"

