# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Either delete a character or send <abbr class=\"acronym\">EOF</abbr> (<code "
"class=\"code\">comint-delchar-or-maybe-eof</code>).  Typed at the end of the "
"shell buffer, this sends <abbr class=\"acronym\">EOF</abbr> to the "
"subshell.  Typed at any other position in the buffer, this deletes a "
"character as usual."
msgstr ""
"文字を削除するか、<abbr class=\"acronym\">EOF</abbr> (<code "
"class=\"code\">comint-delchar-or-maybe-eof</code>) を送信します。シェルバッ"
"ファの末尾で入力すると、サブシェルに <abbr class=\"acronym\">EOF</abbr> が送"
"信されます。バッファ内のそれ以外の位置で入力すると、通常通り文字が削除されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"comint_002dbol_002dor_002dprocess_002dmark\"></a> <a id=\"index-C_002dc-"
"C_002da-_0028Shell-mode_0029\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-a</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dc-C_002da-_0028Shell-"
"mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"comint_002dbol_002dor_002dprocess_002dmark\"></a> <a id=\"index-C_002dc-"
"C_002da-_0028Shell-mode_0029\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-a</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dc-C_002da-_0028Shell-"
"mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Move to the beginning of the line, but after the prompt if any (<code "
"class=\"code\">comint-bol-or-process-mark</code>).  If you repeat this "
"command twice in a row, the second time it moves back to the process mark, "
"which is the beginning of the input that you have not yet sent to the "
"subshell.  (Normally that is the same place&mdash;the end of the prompt on "
"this line&mdash;but after <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</"
"kbd></kbd> the process mark may be in a previous line.)"
msgstr ""
"行の先頭に移動しますが、プロンプトがある場合はその後ろに移動します（<code "
"class=\"code\">comint-bol-or-process-mark</code>）。このコマンドを2回連続して"
"実行すると、2回目はプロセスマーク（まだサブシェルに送信していない入力の先頭）"
"に戻ります。（通常、そこは同じ場所――この行のプロンプトの末尾――ですが、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> の後ではプロセスマークが"
"前の行にある場合があります。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Mode.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Accumulate multiple lines of input, then send them together (<code "
"class=\"code\">comint-accumulate</code>).  This command inserts a newline "
"before point, but does not send the preceding text as input to the "
"subshell&mdash;at least, not yet.  Both lines, the one before this newline "
"and the one after, will be sent together (along with the newline that "
"separates them), when you type <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"複数行の入力を蓄積し、まとめて送信します (<code class=\"code\">comint-"
"accumulate</code>)。このコマンドはポイントの前に改行を挿入しますが、直前のテ"
"キストをサブシェルへの入力として送信することはありません&mdash;少なくとも、現"
"時点では。<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力すると、この改行の前の行と後の行"
"の両方が（それらを区切る改行とともに）まとめて送信されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-comint_002dkill_002dinput\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002du-_0028Shell-mode_0029\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-u</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dc-"
"C_002du-_0028Shell-mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
