# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Shell mode is a derivative of Comint mode, a general-purpose mode for "
"communicating with interactive subprocesses.  Most of the features of Shell "
"mode actually come from Comint mode, as you can see from the command names "
"listed above.  The special features of Shell mode include the directory "
"tracking feature, and a few user commands."
msgstr ""
"シェルモードは、対話型サブプロセスとの通信を行う汎用モードであるComintモード"
"から派生したものです。上述のコマンド名からもわかるように、シェルモードの機能"
"の大部分は実際にはComintモードに由来しています。シェルモードの特徴的な機能と"
"しては、ディレクトリ追跡機能や、いくつかのユーザーコマンドが挙げられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Other Emacs features that use variants of Comint mode include GUD (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Debuggers.html\">Running Debuggers Under Emacs</a>) "
"and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x run-lisp</kbd> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"External-Lisp.html\">Running an External Lisp</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Comintモードの派生形を利用したその他のEmacs機能には、GUD（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Debuggers.html\">Emacsでのデバッガの実行</a>を参照）や<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x run-lisp</kbd>（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"External-"
"Lisp.html\">外部Lispの実行</a>を参照）があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Mode.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-comint_002drun\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-comint_002drun\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Mode.html
msgid ""
"You can use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x comint-run</kbd> to execute any program "
"of your choice in a subprocess using unmodified Comint mode&mdash;without "
"the specializations of Shell mode.  To pass arguments to the program, use "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-x comint-run</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x comint-run</kbd> を使用すると、シェルモードの特殊機能"
"を使わず、変更のない Comint モードを用いて、任意のプログラムをサブプロセスで"
"実行できます。プログラムに引数を渡すには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-x comint-"
"run</kbd> を使用してください。"

