"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"comint_002dscroll_002dto_002dbottom_002don_002dinput\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"If the variable <code class=\"code\">comint-scroll-to-bottom-on-input</code> "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, insertion and yank commands scroll "
"the selected window to the bottom before inserting.  The default is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">comint-scroll-to-bottom-on-input</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、挿入およびヤンクコマンドは、挿入前に選"
"択ウィンドウを最下部までスクロールします。デフォルトは <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"comint_002dscroll_002dshow_002dmaximum_002doutput\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"comint_002dscroll_002dshow_002dmaximum_002doutput\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">comint-scroll-show-maximum-output</code> is non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then arrival of output when point is at the "
"end tries to scroll the last line of text to the bottom line of the window, "
"showing as much useful text as possible.  (This mimics the scrolling "
"behavior of most terminals.)  The default is <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">comint-scroll-show-maximum-output</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、ポイントが末尾に達した際に出力が届く"
"と、テキストの最終行をウィンドウの最下行までスクロールさせ、可能な限り多くの"
"有用なテキストを表示しようとします。（これはほとんどのターミナルのスクロール"
"動作を再現したものです。）デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">t</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"comint_002dmove_002dpoint_002dfor_002doutput\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"comint_002dmove_002dpoint_002dfor_002doutput\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"By setting <code class=\"code\">comint-move-point-for-output</code>, you can "
"opt for having point jump to the end of the buffer whenever output "
"arrives&mdash;no matter where in the buffer point was before.  If the value "
"is <code class=\"code\">this</code>, point jumps in the selected window.  If "
"the value is <code class=\"code\">all</code>, point jumps in each window "
"that shows the Comint buffer.  If the value is <code class=\"code\">other</"
"code>, point jumps in all nonselected windows that show the current buffer.  "
"The default value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, which means point does "
"not jump to the end."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">comint-move-point-for-output</code> を設定すると、出力が"
"届くたびにポイントをバッファの末尾へジャンプさせるよう指定できます&mdash;バッ"
"ファ内のどこにポイントがあったかは問いません。値が <code "
"class=\"code\">this</code> の場合、ポイントは選択中のウィンドウ内でジャンプし"
"ます。値が <code class=\"code\">all</code> の場合、ポイントは Comint バッファ"
"を表示している各ウィンドウ内でジャンプします。値が <code "
"class=\"code\">other</code> の場合、ポイントは現在のバッファを表示している選"
"択外のすべてのウィンドウ内でジャンプします。デフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> で、これはポイントが末尾へジャンプしないことを意味"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"comint_002dprompt_002dread_002donly\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"comint_002dprompt_002dread_002donly\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"If you set <code class=\"code\">comint-prompt-read-only</code>, the prompts "
"in the Comint buffer are read-only."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">comint-prompt-read-only</code> を設定すると、Comint バッ"
"ファ内のプロンプトは読み取り専用になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-comint_002dinput_002dignoredups\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-comint_002dinput_002dignoredups\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">comint-input-ignoredups</code> controls "
"whether successive identical inputs are stored in the input history.  A non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value means to omit an input that is the "
"same as the previous input.  The default is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"which means to store each input even if it is equal to the previous input."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">comint-input-ignoredups</code> は、連続して入力され"
"た同一の入力を入力履歴に保存するかどうかを制御します。<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を指定すると、直前の入力と同じ入力を省略し"
"ます。デフォルトは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で、直前の入力と同一であっ"
"ても各入力を保存します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"comint_002dcompletion_002daddsuffix\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-comint_002dcompletion_002drecexact\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-comint_002dcompletion_002dautolist\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"comint_002dcompletion_002daddsuffix\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-comint_002dcompletion_002drecexact\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-comint_002dcompletion_002dautolist\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"Three variables customize file name completion.  The variable <code "
"class=\"code\">comint-completion-addsuffix</code> controls whether "
"completion inserts a space or a slash to indicate a fully completed file or "
"directory name (non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> means do insert a space "
"or slash).  <code class=\"code\">comint-completion-recexact</code>, if non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, directs <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> to "
"choose the shortest possible completion if the usual Emacs completion "
"algorithm cannot add even a single character.  <code class=\"code\">comint-"
"completion-autolist</code>, if non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, says to "
"list all the possible completions whenever completion is not exact."
msgstr ""
"3つの変数でファイル名の補完動作をカスタマイズできます。変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">comint-completion-addsuffix</code> は、完全に補完されたファイ"
"ル名やディレクトリ名であることを示すために、補完時にスペースまたはスラッシュ"
"を挿入するかどうかを制御します（<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合は"
"スペースまたはスラッシュを挿入します）。<code class=\"code\">comint-"
"completion-recexact</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、通"
"常の Emacs 補完アルゴリズムで1文字すら追加できないときに、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> に可能な限り短い補完候補を選択させるよう指示します。"
"<code class=\"code\">comint-completion-autolist</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、補完結果が完全ではないときに考えられる"
"すべての補完候補を一覧表示するよう指示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-shell_002dcompletion_002dexeconly\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-shell_002dcompletion_002dexeconly\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"Command completion normally considers only executable files.  If you set "
"<code class=\"code\">shell-completion-execonly</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it considers nonexecutable files as well."
msgstr ""
"コマンド補完では通常、実行ファイルのみが対象となります。<code "
"class=\"code\">shell-completion-execonly</code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> に設定すると、実行ファイル以外のファイルも対象になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-shell_002dcompletion_002dfignore\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"comint_002dcompletion_002dfignore\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-shell_002dcompletion_002dfignore\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"comint_002dcompletion_002dfignore\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Shell-Options.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">shell-completion-fignore</code> specifies "
"a list of file name extensions to ignore in Shell mode completion.  The "
"default setting is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, but some users prefer "
"<code class=\"code\">(&quot;~&quot; &quot;#&quot; &quot;%&quot;)</code> to "
"ignore file names ending in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~</samp>&rsquo;, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;.  Other related Comint modes use the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">comint-completion-fignore</code> instead."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">shell-completion-fignore</code> は、シェルモードの"
"補完において無視するファイル名拡張子のリストを指定します。デフォルト設定は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> ですが、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">~</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">#</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;"
