# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-!</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">shell-command</code>) "
"reads a line of text using the minibuffer and executes it as a shell "
"command, in a subshell made just for that command.  Standard input for the "
"command comes from the null device.  If the shell command produces any "
"output, the output appears either in the echo area (if it is short), or in "
"the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;*Shell Command Output*&quot;</"
"samp>&rsquo; (<code class=\"code\">shell-command-buffer-name</code>) buffer "
"(if the output is long).  The variables <code class=\"code\">resize-mini-"
"windows</code> and <code class=\"code\">max-mini-window-height</code> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer-Edit.html\">Editing in the Minibuffer</"
"a>) control when Emacs should consider the output to be too long for the "
"echo area.  Note that customizing <code class=\"code\">shell-command-dont-"
"erase-buffer</code>, described below, can affect what is displayed in the "
"echo area."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-!</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">shell-command</code>) は、"
"ミニバッファを使用してテキストの1行を読み込み、そのコマンド専用に作成されたサ"
"ブシェル内でシェルコマンドとして実行します。コマンドへの標準入力はヌルデバイ"
"スから供給されます。シェルコマンドが出力を生成した場合、その出力は（短い場合"
"は）エコー領域に、（長い場合は）&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;*Shell "
"Command Output*&quot;</samp>&rsquo; (<code class=\"code\">shell-command-"
"buffer-name</code>) バッファに表示されます。変数 <code class=\"code\">resize-"
"mini-windows</code> と <code class=\"code\">max-mini-window-height</code>"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minibuffer-Edit.html\">ミニバッファでの編集</a> "
"を参照）は、Emacs が出力をエコー領域に対して長すぎると判断するタイミングを制"
"御します。なお、後述する <code class=\"code\">shell-command-dont-erase-"
"buffer</code> のカスタマイズによって、エコー領域に表示される内容が影響を受け"
"る可能性があることに注意してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"For instance, one way to decompress a file named <samp "
"class=\"file\">foo.gz</samp> is to type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-! gunzip foo.gz "
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>.  That shell command normally creates the "
"file <samp class=\"file\">foo</samp> and produces no terminal output."
msgstr ""
"例えば、<samp class=\"file\">foo.gz</samp> という名前のファイルを展開する方法"
"の一つに、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-! gunzip foo.gz <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd> と入力することがあります。このシェルコマンドは通常、<samp "
"class=\"file\">foo</samp> というファイルを作成し、ターミナルへの出力は行いま"
"せん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"A numeric argument to <code class=\"code\">shell-command</code>, e.g., <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-1 M-!</kbd>, causes it to insert terminal output into the "
"current buffer instead of a separate buffer.  By default, it puts point "
"before the output, and sets the mark after the output (but a non-default "
"value of <code class=\"code\">shell-command-dont-erase-buffer</code> can "
"change that, see below).  For instance, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-1 M-! gunzip "
"&lt; foo.gz <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> would insert the uncompressed "
"form of the file <samp class=\"file\">foo.gz</samp> into the current buffer."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">shell-command</code> に数値引数（例：<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-1 M-!</kbd>）を指定すると、ターミナル出力を別バッファではなく"
"現在のバッファに挿入します。デフォルトでは、出力の前にポイントを置き、出力の"
"後にマークを設定します（ただし、デフォルト以外の値である <code "
"class=\"code\">shell-command-dont-erase-buffer</code> を指定するとこの動作を"
"変更できます。詳細は後述）。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-1 M-! gunzip &lt; "
"foo.gz <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> を指定すると、ファイル <samp "
"class=\"file\">foo.gz</samp> の非圧縮形式が現在のバッファに挿入されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"Provided the specified shell command does not end with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&amp;</samp>&rsquo;, it runs <em class=\"dfn\">synchronously</"
"em>, and you must wait for it to exit before continuing to use Emacs.  To "
"stop waiting, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> to quit; this sends a <code "
"class=\"code\">SIGINT</code> signal to terminate the shell command (this is "
"the same signal that <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> normally generates in the "
"shell).  Emacs then waits until the command actually terminates.  If the "
"shell command doesn&rsquo;t stop (because it ignores the <code "
"class=\"code\">SIGINT</code> signal), type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> "
"again; this sends the command a <code class=\"code\">SIGKILL</code> signal, "
"which is impossible to ignore."
msgstr ""
"指定したシェルコマンドが &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&amp;</samp>&rsquo; で終"
"わっていない限り、そのコマンドは<em class=\"dfn\">同期的に</em>実行され、"
"Emacsを使い続ける前にその終了を待つ必要があります。待機を停止するには、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> と入力して終了してください。これによりシェルコマンド"
"を終了させる <code class=\"code\">SIGINT</code> シグナルが送信されます（これ"
"は通常、シェル内で <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> が生成するのと同じシグナルで"
"す）。その後、Emacsはコマンドが実際に終了するまで待機します。シェルコマンドが"
"（<code class=\"code\">SIGINT</code> シグナルを無視して）停止しない場合は、再"
"度 <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> と入力してください。これによりコマンドに "
"<code class=\"code\">SIGKILL</code> シグナルが送信され、このシグナルを無視す"
"ることは不可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002d_0026\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-async_002dshell_002dcommand\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-shell_002dcommand_002dbuffer_002dname_002dasync\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002d_0026\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-async_002dshell_002dcommand\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-shell_002dcommand_002dbuffer_002dname_002dasync\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"A shell command that ends in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&amp;</samp>&rsquo; "
"is executed <em class=\"dfn\">asynchronously</em>, and you can continue to "
"use Emacs as it runs.  You can also type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&amp;</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">async-shell-command</code>) to execute a shell command "
"asynchronously; this is exactly like calling <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-!</kbd> "
"with a trailing &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&amp;</samp>&rsquo;, except that "
"you do not need the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&amp;</samp>&rsquo;.  The "
"output from asynchronous shell commands, by default, goes into the &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;*Async Shell Command*&quot;</samp>&rsquo; buffer "
"(<code class=\"code\">shell-command-buffer-name-async</code>).  Emacs "
"inserts the output into this buffer as it comes in, whether or not the "
"buffer is visible in a window."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&amp;</samp>&rsquo; で終わるシェルコマンドは<em "
"class=\"dfn\">非同期に</em>実行され、実行中もEmacsを使い続けることができま"
"す。また、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&amp;</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">async-shell-"
"command</code>) と入力してシェルコマンドを非同期に実行することも可能です。こ"
"れは、末尾に&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&amp;</samp>&rsquo;を付けて<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-!</kbd>を呼び出すのと全く同じですが、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&amp;</samp>&rsquo;は不要です。非同期シェルコマンドの出力は、"
"デフォルトでは&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;*Async Shell Command*&quot;</"
"samp>&rsquo;バッファ (<code class=\"code\">shell-command-buffer-name-async</"
"code>) に送られます。Emacsは、バッファがウィンドウに表示されているかどうかに"
"かかわらず、出力が届くたびにこのバッファに挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"async_002dshell_002dcommand_002dbuffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"async_002dshell_002dcommand_002dbuffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"If you want to run more than one asynchronous shell command at the same "
"time, they could end up competing for the output buffer.  The option <code "
"class=\"code\">async-shell-command-buffer</code> specifies what to do about "
"this; e.g., whether to rename the pre-existing output buffer, or to use a "
"different buffer for the new command.  Consult the variable&rsquo;s "
"documentation for more possibilities."
msgstr ""
"複数の非同期シェルコマンドを同時に実行する場合、出力バッファを巡って競合が発"
"生する可能性があります。オプション <code class=\"code\">async-shell-command-"
"buffer</code> では、これにどう対処するか（例えば、既存の出力バッファの名前を"
"変更するか、あるいは新しいコマンドに別のバッファを使用するかなど）を指定しま"
"す。その他の選択肢については、変数のドキュメントを参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"async_002dshell_002dcommand_002ddisplay_002dbuffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"async_002dshell_002dcommand_002ddisplay_002dbuffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"If you want the output buffer for asynchronous shell commands to be "
"displayed only when the command generates output, set <code "
"class=\"code\">async-shell-command-display-buffer</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"非同期シェルコマンドの出力バッファを、コマンドが出力を生成した場合にのみ表示"
"するようにするには、<code class=\"code\">async-shell-command-display-buffer</"
"code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"async_002dshell_002dcommand_002dwidth\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"async_002dshell_002dcommand_002dwidth\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"The option <code class=\"code\">async-shell-command-width</code> defines the "
"number of display columns available for output of asynchronous shell "
"commands.  A positive integer tells the shell to use that number of columns "
"for command output.  The default value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"that means to use the same number of columns as provided by the shell."
msgstr ""
"オプション <code class=\"code\">async-shell-command-width</code> は、非同期"
"シェルコマンドの出力に使用可能な表示列数を指定します。正の整数を指定すると、"
"シェルはその列数をコマンド出力に使用します。デフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> で、これはシェルが提供する列数と同じ数を使用するこ"
"とを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"shell_002dcommand_002dprompt_002dshow_002dcwd\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"shell_002dcommand_002dprompt_002dshow_002dcwd\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"To make the above commands show the current directory in their prompts, "
"customize the variable <code class=\"code\">shell-command-prompt-show-cwd</"
"code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"上記のコマンドのプロンプトにカレントディレクトリを表示させるには、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">shell-command-prompt-show-cwd</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002d_007c\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-shell_002dcommand_002don_002dregion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002d_007c\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-shell_002dcommand_002don_002dregion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-|</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">shell-command-on-region</"
"code>) is like <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-!</kbd>, but passes the contents of the "
"region as the standard input to the shell command, instead of no input.  "
"With a numeric argument, it deletes the old region and replaces it with the "
"output from the shell command."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-|</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">shell-command-on-region</"
"code>) は <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-!</kbd> と同様ですが、入力なしではなく、リー"
"ジョンの内容をシェルコマンドの標準入力として渡します。数値引数を指定すると、"
"古いリージョンを削除し、シェルコマンドの出力で置き換えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"For example, you can use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-|</kbd> with the <code "
"class=\"command\">gpg</code> program to see what keys are in the buffer.  If "
"the buffer contains a GnuPG key, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x h M-| gpg <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> to feed the entire buffer contents to <code "
"class=\"command\">gpg</code>.  This will output the list of keys to the "
"buffer whose name is the value of <code class=\"code\">shell-command-buffer-"
"name</code>."
msgstr ""
"例えば、<code class=\"command\">gpg</code> プログラムで <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-|</kbd> を使用すると、バッファにどのような鍵が含まれているか"
"を確認できます。バッファに GnuPG 鍵が含まれている場合は、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x h M-| gpg <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> と入力してバッ"
"ファの内容全体を <code class=\"command\">gpg</code> に渡します。これにより、"
"<code class=\"code\">shell-command-buffer-name</code> の値を名前とするバッ"
"ファ内の鍵の一覧が出力されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-shell_002dfile_002dname\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SHELL-environment-variable\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-shell_002dfile_002dname\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-SHELL-environment-variable\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"The above commands use the shell specified by the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">shell-file-name</code>.  Its default value is determined by "
"the <code class=\"env\">SHELL</code> environment variable when Emacs is "
"started.  If the file name is relative, Emacs searches the directories "
"listed in <code class=\"code\">exec-path</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Shell.html\">Running Shell Commands from Emacs</a>)."
msgstr ""
"上記のコマンドは、変数 <code class=\"code\">shell-file-name</code> で指定され"
"たシェルを使用します。そのデフォルト値は、Emacs 起動時に環境変数 <code "
"class=\"env\">SHELL</code> によって決定されます。ファイル名が相対パスの場合、"
"Emacs は <code class=\"code\">exec-path</code> に列挙されたディレクトリを検索"
"します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Shell.html\">Emacs からシェルコマンドを実行"
"する</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"If the default directory is remote (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Remote-"
"Files.html\">Remote Files</a>), the default value is <samp class=\"file\">/"
"bin/sh</samp>.  This can be changed by declaring <code class=\"code\">shell-"
"file-name</code> connection-local (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Connection-"
"Variables.html\">Per-Connection Local Variables</a>)."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトディレクトリがリモートの場合（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Remote-"
"Files.html\">リモートファイル</a>を参照）、デフォルト値は <samp "
"class=\"file\">/bin/sh</samp> となります。これは、<code class=\"code\">shell-"
"file-name</code> を接続ローカルとして宣言することで変更可能です（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Connection-Variables.html\">接続ごとのローカル変数</a>"
"を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"To specify a coding system for <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-!</kbd> or <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-|</kbd>, use the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> c</kbd> immediately beforehand.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Communication-Coding.html\">Coding Systems for "
"Interprocess Communication</a>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-!</kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-|</kbd> の符号化方式"
"を指定するには、その直前に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd> c</kbd> コマンドを使用します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Communication-"
"Coding.html\">プロセス間通信の符号化方式</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"shell_002dcommand_002ddefault_002derror_002dbuffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"shell_002dcommand_002ddefault_002derror_002dbuffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"By default, error output is intermixed with the regular output in the output "
"buffer.  But if you change the value of the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">shell-command-default-error-buffer</code> to a string, error "
"output is inserted into a buffer of that name."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、エラー出力は出力バッファ内で通常の出力と混在します。ただし、"
"変数 <code class=\"code\">shell-command-default-error-buffer</code> の値を文"
"字列に変更すると、エラー出力はその名前のバッファに挿入されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"shell_002dcommand_002ddont_002derase_002dbuffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"shell_002dcommand_002ddont_002derase_002dbuffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"By default, the output buffer is erased between shell commands, except when "
"the output goes to the current buffer.  If you change the value of the "
"option <code class=\"code\">shell-command-dont-erase-buffer</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">erase</code>, then the output buffer is always erased.  Other "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> values prevent erasing of the output "
"buffer, and&mdash;if the output buffer is not the current buffer&mdash;also "
"control where to put point after inserting the output of the shell command:"
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、出力が現在のバッファに送られる場合を除き、シェルコマンド間で"
"出力バッファは消去されます。オプション <code class=\"code\">shell-command-"
"dont-erase-buffer</code> の値を <code class=\"code\">erase</code> に変更する"
"と、出力バッファは常に消去されます。<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値"
"を指定すると出力バッファの消去が防止され、さらに&mdash;出力バッファが現在の"
"バッファでない場合&mdash;シェルコマンドの出力を挿入した後のポイントの位置も制"
"御されます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">beg-last-out</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">beg-last-out</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid "Puts point at the beginning of the last shell-command output."
msgstr "直前のシェルコマンド出力の先頭にポイントを置きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">end-last-out</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">end-last-out</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"Puts point at the end of the last shell-command output, i.e. at the end of "
"the output buffer."
msgstr ""
"直前のシェルコマンド出力の末尾、すなわち出力バッファの末尾にポイントを置きま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">save-point</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">save-point</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"Restores the position of point as it was before inserting the shell-command "
"output."
msgstr "shell-commandの出力を挿入する前のポイントの位置を復元します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"Note that if this option is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the output "
"shown in the echo area could be from more than just the last command, since "
"the echo area just displays a portion of the output buffer."
msgstr ""
"なお、このオプションが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、エコー領域"
"には出力バッファの一部のみが表示されるため、表示される内容は直前のコマンドに"
"よるものとは限らない点にご注意ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Single-Shell.html
msgid ""
"In case the output buffer is not the current buffer, shell command output is "
"appended at the end of this buffer."
msgstr ""
"出力バッファが現在のバッファでない場合、シェルコマンドの出力がこのバッファの"
"末尾に追加されます。"

