msgid ""
"<span>43 Sorting Text<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Sorting-Text\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>43 テキストの並べ替え<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Sorting-"
"Text\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sorting\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sorting\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"Emacs provides several commands for sorting text in the buffer.  All operate "
"on the contents of the region.  They divide the text of the region into many "
"<em class=\"dfn\">sort records</em>, identify a <em class=\"dfn\">sort key</"
"em> for each record, and then reorder the records into the order determined "
"by the sort keys.  The records are ordered so that their keys are in "
"alphabetical order, or, for numeric sorting, in numeric order.  In "
"alphabetic sorting, all upper-case letters &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A</"
"samp>&rsquo; through &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Z</samp>&rsquo; come before "
"lower-case &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo;, in accordance with "
"the <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> character sequence (but <code "
"class=\"code\">sort-fold-case</code>, described below, can change that)."
msgstr ""
"Emacsには、バッファ内のテキストをソートするためのコマンドがいくつか用意されて"
"います。これらはすべてリージョンの内容に対して動作します。リージョンのテキス"
"トを多数の<em class=\"dfn\">ソートレコード</em>に分割し、各レコードの<em "
"class=\"dfn\">ソートキー</em>を特定した上で、ソートキーによって決定される順序"
"にレコードを並べ替えます。レコードは、キーがアルファベット順、あるいは数値"
"ソートの場合は数値順になるように並べられます。アルファベット順のソートでは、"
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>文字シーケンスに従い、大文字の&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo;から&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Z</"
"samp>&rsquo;までがすべて小文字の&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo;よ"
"り前に配置されます（ただし、後述する<code class=\"code\">sort-fold-case</"
"code>によってこの順序が変わる場合があります）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"The various sort commands differ in how they divide the text into sort "
"records and in which part of each record is used as the sort key.  Most of "
"the commands make each line a separate sort record, but some commands use "
"paragraphs or pages as sort records.  Most of the sort commands use each "
"entire sort record as its own sort key, but some use only a portion of the "
"record as the sort key."
msgstr ""
"各種ソートコマンドは、テキストをソートレコードにどのように分割するか、また各"
"レコードのどの部分をソートキーとして使用するかという点で異なります。ほとんど"
"のコマンドは各行を個別のソートレコードとしますが、一部のコマンドでは段落や"
"ページをソートレコードとして使用します。ほとんどのソートコマンドは、ソートレ"
"コード全体をソートキーとして使用しますが、一部のコマンドではレコードの一部の"
"みをソートキーとして使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sort_002dlines\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sort_002dparagraphs\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sort_002dpages\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-sort_002dfields\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-sort_002dnumeric_002dfields\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-sort_002dnumeric_002dbase\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sort_002dlines\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sort_002dparagraphs\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sort_002dpages\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-sort_002dfields\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-sort_002dnumeric_002dfields\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-sort_002dnumeric_002dbase\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-lines</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-lines</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"Divide the region into lines, and sort by comparing the entire text of a "
"line.  A numeric argument means sort into descending order."
msgstr ""
"領域を行に分割し、各行の全文を比較してソートします。数値引数を指定すると、降"
"順にソートされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-paragraphs</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-paragraphs</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"Divide the region into paragraphs, and sort by comparing the entire text of "
"a paragraph (except for leading blank lines).  A numeric argument means sort "
"into descending order."
msgstr ""
"領域を段落ごとに分割し、各段落の全文（先頭の空行を除く）を比較してソートしま"
"す。数値引数を指定すると、降順にソートされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-pages</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-pages</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"Divide the region into pages, and sort by comparing the entire text of a "
"page (except for leading blank lines).  A numeric argument means sort into "
"descending order."
msgstr ""
"領域をページごとに分割し、各ページの全文（先頭の空行を除く）を比較してソート"
"します。数値引数を指定すると、降順にソートされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-fields</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-fields</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"Divide the region into lines, and sort by comparing the contents of one "
"field in each line.  Fields are defined as separated by whitespace, so the "
"first run of consecutive non-whitespace characters in a line constitutes "
"field 1, the second such run constitutes field 2, etc."
msgstr ""
"領域を行に分割し、各行の1つのフィールドの内容を比較してソートします。フィール"
"ドは空白文字で区切られたものと定義されるため、行内で連続する非空白文字の最初"
"のまとまりがフィールド1、2番目のまとまりがフィールド2となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"Specify which field to sort by with a numeric argument: 1 to sort by field "
"1, etc.; the default is 1.  A negative argument means count fields from the "
"right instead of from the left; thus, minus 1 means sort by the last field.  "
"If several lines have identical contents in the field being sorted, they "
"keep the same relative order that they had in the original buffer."
msgstr ""
"数値引数を指定して、ソート対象のフィールドを指定します。1 を指定するとフィー"
"ルド 1 でソートされ、以下同様です。デフォルトは 1 です。負の引数を指定する"
"と、左からではなく右からフィールドをカウントします。したがって、-1 は最後の"
"フィールドでソートすることを意味します。ソート対象のフィールドの内容が同一で"
"ある行が複数ある場合、元のバッファにおける相対的な順序が維持されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-numeric-fields</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-numeric-fields</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"Like <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-fields</kbd> except the specified field is "
"converted to an integer for each line, and the numbers are compared.  &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">10</samp>&rsquo; comes before &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">2</samp>&rsquo; when considered as text, but after it when "
"considered as a number.  By default, numbers are interpreted according to "
"<code class=\"code\">sort-numeric-base</code>, but numbers beginning with "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0x</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo; are interpreted as hexadecimal and octal, "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-fields</kbd>と同様ですが、各行で指定されたフィー"
"ルドが整数に変換され、その数値が比較されます。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">10</samp>&rsquo;は、テキストとして扱う場合は&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">2</samp>&rsquo;より前になりますが、数値として扱う場合はその後"
"になります。デフォルトでは、数値は<code class=\"code\">sort-numeric-base</"
"code>に従って解釈されますが、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0x</samp>&rsquo;また"
"は&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo;で始まる数値は、それぞれ16進数お"
"よび8進数として解釈されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-columns</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-columns</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"Like <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-fields</kbd> except that the text within "
"each line used for comparison comes from a fixed range of columns.  With a "
"prefix argument, sort in reverse order.  See below for more details on this "
"command."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sort-fields</kbd>と同様ですが、比較に使用される各行内"
"のテキストは、固定の列範囲から取得されます。接頭辞引数を指定すると、逆順で"
"ソートされます。このコマンドの詳細については、以下を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-reverse_002dregion\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x reverse-"
"region</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-reverse_002dregion\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-reverse_002dregion\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x reverse-"
"region</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-reverse_002dregion\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"Reverse the order of the lines in the region.  This is useful for sorting "
"into descending order by fields, since those sort commands do not have a "
"feature for doing that."
msgstr ""
"リージョン内の行の順序を反転させます。これらのソートコマンドには降順でソート"
"する機能がないため、フィールド単位で降順にソートする際に便利です。"

