#: build/html/emacs/Special-Diary-Entries.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Cyclic</em> diary entries repeat after a fixed interval of "
"days.  To create one, select the starting date and use the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">i c</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">diary-insert-cyclic-entry</"
"code>) command.  The command prompts for the length of interval, then "
"inserts the entry, which looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">周期的</em>な日記エントリは、一定の日数間隔で繰り返されま"
"す。作成するには、開始日を選択し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">i c</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">diary-insert-cyclic-entry</code>) コマンドを使用します。このコ"
"マンドは間隔の長さの入力を求め、その後、次のような形式でエントリを挿入しま"
"す："

