#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"<span>17.1.5 Special Input for Incremental Search<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Special-Input-for-Incremental-Search\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>17.1.5 インクリメンタル検索用の特殊入力<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Special-Input-for-Incremental-Search\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"In addition to characters described in the previous subsections, some of the "
"other characters you type during incremental search have special effects.  "
"They are described here."
msgstr ""
"前述のサブセクションで説明した文字に加え、インクリメンタルサーチ中に入力する"
"その他の文字の中には、特殊な効果を持つものがあります。それらについてここで説"
"明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"To toggle lax space matching (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-"
"Search.html\">lax space matching</a>), type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s <kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"緩いスペースマッチング（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">緩いス"
"ペースマッチング</a>を参照）を切り替えるには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s <kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> と入力します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"To toggle case sensitivity of the search, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-c</kbd> "
"or <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s c</kbd>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Lax-"
"Search.html\">case folding</a>.  If the search string includes upper-case "
"letters, the search is case-sensitive by default."
msgstr ""
"検索の大文字・小文字の区別を切り替えるには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-c</kbd> また"
"は <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s c</kbd> と入力してください。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Lax-Search.html\">ケースフォールディング</a>を参照してください。検索文"
"字列に大文字が含まれている場合、デフォルトでは大文字・小文字を区別して検索さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"To toggle whether or not the search will consider similar and equivalent "
"characters as a match, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s '</kbd>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Lax-Search.html\">character folding</a>.  If the "
"search string includes accented characters, that disables character folding "
"during that search."
msgstr ""
"類似文字や等価文字を一致とみなすかどうかを切り替えるには、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-s '</kbd> と入力してください。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Lax-"
"Search.html\">文字フォールディング</a>を参照してください。検索文字列にアクセ"
"ント付き文字が含まれている場合、その検索中は文字フォールディングが無効になり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-invisible-text_002c-searching-for\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002ds-i-_0028Incremental-"
"search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dtoggle_002dinvisible\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-invisible-text_002c-searching-for\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002ds-i-_0028Incremental-"
"search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dtoggle_002dinvisible\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"To toggle whether or not the search will find text made invisible by "
"overlays, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s i</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-"
"toggle-invisible</code>).  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Outline-"
"Visibility.html#Outline-Search\">Outline Search</a>.  To make all "
"incremental searches find matches inside invisible text, whether due to text "
"properties or overlay properties, customize <code class=\"code\">search-"
"invisible</code> to the value <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"オーバーレイによって非表示になったテキストを検索対象にするかどうかを切り替え"
"るには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s i</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-toggle-"
"invisible</code>) と入力してください。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Outline-"
"Visibility.html#Outline-Search\">アウトライン検索</a>を参照してください。テキ"
"ストプロパティやオーバーレイプロパティに関わらず、すべてのインクリメンタル検"
"索で非表示テキスト内の一致箇所を検索するようにするには、<code "
"class=\"code\">search-invisible</code> を <code class=\"code\">t</code> の値"
"にカスタマイズしてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dr-_0028Incremental-"
"Search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002ds-r-"
"_0028Incremental-Search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dtoggle_002dregexp\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dr-_0028Incremental-"
"Search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002ds-r-"
"_0028Incremental-Search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dtoggle_002dregexp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"To toggle between non-regexp and regexp incremental search, type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-r</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s r</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-toggle-regexp</code>).  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Regexp-Search.html\">Regular Expression Search</a>."
msgstr ""
"正規表現不使用の検索と正規表現を用いたインクリメンタル検索を切り替えるには、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-r</kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s r</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-toggle-regexp</code>) と入力してください。<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Regexp-Search.html\">正規表現検索</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"To toggle symbol mode, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s _</kbd>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Symbol-Search.html\">Symbol Search</a>."
msgstr ""
"シンボルモードを切り替えるには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s _</kbd> と入力してくだ"
"さい。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Symbol-Search.html\">シンボル検索</a>を参照し"
"てください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"To search for a newline character, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> as part "
"of the search string."
msgstr ""
"改行文字を検索するには、検索文字列の一部として <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-j</kbd> "
"と入力してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"To search for non-<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> characters, use one "
"of the following methods during incremental search:"
msgstr ""
"<abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>以外の文字を検索するには、インクリメンタ"
"ル検索中に以下のいずれかの方法を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-isearch_002dquote_002dchar\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dq-_0028Incremental-Search_0029\"></"
"a> Type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-q</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-quote-"
"char</code>), followed by a non-graphic character or a sequence of octal "
"digits.  This adds a character to the search string, similar to inserting "
"into a buffer using <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-q</kbd> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Inserting-Text.html\">Inserting Text</a>).  For example, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-q C-s</kbd> during incremental search adds the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">control-S</samp>&rsquo; character to the search string."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-isearch_002dquote_002dchar\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dq-_0028Incremental-Search_0029\"></"
"a> 型 <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-q</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-quote-char</"
"code>) に続き、非グラフィック文字または8進数の数字列が指定されます。これによ"
"り、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-q</kbd> を用いてバッファに挿入する場合と同様に、検索"
"文字列に文字が追加されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Inserting-Text.html\">"
"テキストの挿入</a> を参照）。例えば、インクリメンタル検索中の <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-q C-s</kbd> は、検索文字列に &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">control-S</samp>&rsquo; という文字を追加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002d_005e-_0028Incremental-"
"Search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dtoggle_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-isearch_002dtoggle_002dspecified_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dtransient_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a> Use an input method (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Methods.html\">Input Methods</a>).  If an "
"input method is enabled in the current buffer when you start the search, the "
"same method will be active in the minibuffer when you type the search "
"string.  While typing the search string, you can toggle the input method "
"with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-\\</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-toggle-"
"input-method</code>).  You can also turn on a non-default input method with "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-^</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-toggle-specified-"
"input-method</code>), which prompts for the name of the input method.  When "
"an input method is active during incremental search, the search prompt "
"includes the input method mnemonic, like this:"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002d_005e-_0028Incremental-"
"Search_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dtoggle_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-isearch_002dtoggle_002dspecified_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"isearch_002dtransient_002dinput_002dmethod\"></a> 入力メソッドを使用してくだ"
"さい（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Methods.html\">入力メソッド</a>を参"
"照）。検索を開始する際に現在のバッファで入力メソッドが有効になっている場合、"
"検索文字列を入力する際にもミニバッファで同じメソッドが有効になります。検索文"
"字列の入力中は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-\\</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-"
"toggle-input-method</code>) で入力メソッドを切り替えることができます。また、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-^</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-toggle-specified-"
"input-method</code>) でデフォルト以外の入力メソッドを有効にすることもでき、そ"
"の際、入力メソッド名の入力が求められます。インクリメンタル検索中に入力メソッ"
"ドが有効な場合、検索プロンプトには次のように入力メソッドのニーモニックが含ま"
"れます："

