# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"where <var class=\"var\">im</var> is the mnemonic of the active input "
"method.  Any input method you enable during incremental search remains "
"enabled in the current buffer afterwards.  Finally, you can temporarily "
"enable a transient input method (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Select-Input-"
"Method.html#transient-input-method\">transient input method</a>) with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x \\</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">isearch-transient-input-"
"method</code>) to insert a single character to the search string using an "
"input method, and automatically disable the input method afterwards."
msgstr ""
"ここで <var class=\"var\">im</var> はアクティブな入力メソッドのニーモニックで"
"す。インクリメンタル検索中に有効にした入力メソッドは、その後も現在のバッファ"
"で有効なままとなります。最後に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x \\</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-transient-input-method</code>) で一過性の入力メソッド"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Select-Input-Method.html#transient-input-"
"method\">一過性入力メソッド</a> を参照）を一時的に有効にすると、入力メソッド"
"を用いて検索文字列に1文字を挿入でき、その後自動的にその入力メソッドが無効にな"
"ります。"

