#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"You can also include Emoji sequences in the search string.  Type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;8&nbsp;e&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">isearch-emoji-by-name</code>), followed by the Unicode "
"name of an Emoji (for example, <kbd class=\"kbd\">smiling face</kbd> or <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">heart with arrow</kbd>).  This adds the specified Emoji to the "
"search string.  If you don&rsquo;t know the name of the Emoji you want to "
"search for, you can use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 8 e l</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">emoji-list</code>) and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 8 e d</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">emoji-describe</code>) (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Input-Methods.html\">Input Methods</a>)."
msgstr ""
"検索文字列に絵文字シーケンスを含めることもできます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x&nbsp;8&nbsp;e&nbsp;<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-emoji-by-name</code>) と入力し、続けて絵文字のUnicode"
"名（例：<kbd class=\"kbd\">smiling face</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">heart "
"with arrow</kbd>）を入力してください。これにより、指定した絵文字が検索文字列"
"に追加されます。検索したい絵文字の名前がわからない場合は、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x 8 e l</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">emoji-list</code>) や "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 8 e d</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">emoji-describe</"
"code>) を使用できます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Input-Methods.html\">入力方"
"法</a>を参照してください）。"

