# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s o</kbd> in incremental search invokes <code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-occur</code>, which runs <code class=\"code\">occur</"
"code> with the current search string.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Other-"
"Repeating-Search.html\">occur</a>."
msgstr ""
"インクリメンタル検索で <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s o</kbd> と入力すると <code "
"class=\"code\">isearch-occur</code> が呼び出され、現在の検索文字列を用いて "
"<code class=\"code\">occur</code> が実行されます。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Other-Repeating-Search.html\">occur</a> を参照してください。"

