# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Special-Isearch.html
msgid ""
"When incremental search is active, typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s M-&gt;</"
"kbd> will go to the last occurrence of the search string, and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-s M-&lt;</kbd> will go to the first occurrence.  With a "
"prefix numeric argument of <var class=\"var\">n</var>, these commands will "
"go to the <var class=\"var\">n</var>th occurrence of the search string "
"counting from the beginning or end of the buffer, respectively."
msgstr ""
"インクリメンタル検索が有効な状態では、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s M-&gt;</kbd> と"
"入力すると検索文字列の最後の出現箇所へ、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-s M-&lt;</kbd> "
"と入力すると最初の出現箇所へ移動します。接頭辞に数値引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> を付けると、これらのコマンドは、バッファの先頭または末"
"尾からそれぞれ数えて <var class=\"var\">n</var> 番目の検索文字列の出現箇所へ"
"移動します。"

