#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Specific-Customization.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002doption\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002doption\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Specific-Customization.html
msgid ""
"If you want to customize a particular user option, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"x customize-option</kbd>.  This reads the variable name, and sets up the "
"customization buffer with just that one user option.  When entering the "
"variable name into the minibuffer, completion is available, but only for the "
"names of variables that have been loaded into Emacs."
msgstr ""
"特定のユーザーオプションをカスタマイズしたい場合は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"customize-option</kbd> と入力してください。これにより変数名が読み込まれ、その"
"ユーザーオプションのみを含むカスタマイズバッファが設定されます。ミニバッファ"
"に変数名を入力する際、補完が利用可能ですが、これは Emacs にロード済みの変数名"
"に限られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Specific-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002dface\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002dgroup\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002dface\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002dgroup\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Specific-Customization.html
msgid ""
"Likewise, you can customize a specific face using <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"customize-face</kbd>.  You can set up a customization buffer for a specific "
"customization group using <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-group</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-face</kbd> を使用して特定のフェイス"
"をカスタマイズできます。また、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-group</kbd> を"
"使用して、特定のカスタマイズグループ用のカスタマイズバッファを設定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Specific-Customization.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002dapropos\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002dapropos\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Specific-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-apropos</kbd> prompts for a search "
"term&mdash;either one or more words separated by spaces, or a regular "
"expression&mdash;and sets up a customization buffer for all <em "
"class=\"emph\">loaded</em> settings and groups with matching names.  This is "
"like using the search field at the top of the customization buffer (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Customization-Groups.html\">Customization Groups</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-apropos</kbd> は、検索キーワード（スペースで"
"区切られた1つ以上の単語、または正規表現）の入力を促し、一致する名前を持つすべ"
"ての<em class=\"emph\">ロード済み</em>設定およびグループ用のカスタマイズバッ"
"ファを準備します。これは、カスタマイズバッファ上部の検索フィールドを使用する"
"のと同様です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Customization-Groups.html\">カスタマ"
"イズグループ</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Specific-Customization.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002dchanged\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002dchanged\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Specific-Customization.html
msgid ""
"When you upgrade to a new Emacs version, you might want to consider "
"customizing new settings, and settings whose meanings or default values have "
"changed.  To do this, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-changed</kbd> and "
"specify a previous Emacs version number using the minibuffer.  It creates a "
"customization buffer which shows all the settings and groups whose "
"definitions have been changed since the specified version, loading them if "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
"新しいバージョンのEmacsにアップグレードする際は、新しい設定や、意味やデフォル"
"ト値が変更された設定のカスタマイズを検討するとよいでしょう。そのためには、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-changed</kbd> を使用し、ミニバッファで以前の"
"Emacsバージョン番号を指定してください。これにより、指定したバージョン以降に定"
"義が変更されたすべての設定とグループが表示されるカスタマイズバッファが作成さ"
"れ、必要に応じてそれらが読み込まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Specific-Customization.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002dsaved\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002dunsaved\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002dsaved\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-customize_002dunsaved\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Specific-Customization.html
msgid ""
"If you change settings and then decide the change was a mistake, you can use "
"two commands to revisit your changes.  Use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-"
"saved</kbd> to customize settings that you have saved.  Use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-unsaved</kbd> to customize settings that you "
"have set but not saved."
msgstr ""
"設定を変更した後、その変更が間違いだったと判断した場合は、2つのコマンドを使っ"
"て変更内容を元に戻せます。保存済みの設定をカスタマイズするには <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-saved</kbd> を、設定はしたが保存していない設定を"
"カスタマイズするには <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x customize-unsaved</kbd> を使用し"
"てください。"

