"id=\"index-ispell_002dchange_002ddictionary\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Spelling.html
msgid ""
"Spell-checkers look up spelling in two dictionaries: the standard dictionary "
"and your personal dictionary.  The standard dictionary is specified by the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">ispell-local-dictionary</code> or, if that is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, by the variable <code class=\"code\">ispell-"
"dictionary</code>.  If both are <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"spelling program&rsquo;s default dictionary is used.  The command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;ispell-change-dictionary</kbd> sets the standard "
"dictionary for the buffer and then restarts the subprocess, so that it will "
"use a different standard dictionary.  Your personal dictionary is specified "
"by the variable <code class=\"code\">ispell-personal-dictionary</code>.  If "
"that is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the spelling program looks for a "
"personal dictionary in a default location, which is specific to each spell-"
"checker."
msgstr ""
"スペルチェッカーは、標準辞書と個人用辞書という2つの辞書で綴りを確認します。標"
"準辞書は、変数 <code class=\"code\">ispell-local-dictionary</code>、またはそ"
"れが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">ispell-dictionary</code> で指定されます。両方が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は、スペルプログラムのデフォルト辞書が使用さ"
"れます。コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;ispell-change-dictionary</kbd> "
"は、バッファの標準辞書を設定した上でサブプロセスを再起動し、別の標準辞書を使"
"用するようにします。個人用辞書は、変数 <code class=\"code\">ispell-personal-"
"dictionary</code> で指定されます。それが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場"
"合、スペルプログラムは各スペルチェッカー固有のデフォルト場所にある個人用辞書"
"を探します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Spelling.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-spell_002dchecking-different-"
"languages\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-language-for-"
"spell_002dchecking\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-spell_002dchecking-different-"
