# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 2</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 2</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid ""
"Split the selected window into two windows, one above the other (<code "
"class=\"code\">split-window-below</code>)."
msgstr ""
"選択したウィンドウを上下2つのウィンドウに分割します (<code "
"class=\"code\">split-window-below</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 3</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 3</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid ""
"Split the selected window into two windows, positioned side by side (<code "
"class=\"code\">split-window-right</code>)."
msgstr ""
"選択したウィンドウを2つのウィンドウに分割し、左右に並べて配置します (<code "
"class=\"code\">split-window-right</code>)。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid "In the mode line of a window, split that window."
msgstr "ウィンドウのモードラインで、そのウィンドウを分割する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-2\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-split_002dwindow_002dbelow\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-2\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-split_002dwindow_002dbelow\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 2</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">split-window-below</"
"code>) splits the selected window into two windows, one above the other.  "
"After splitting, the selected window is the upper one, and the newly split-"
"off window is below.  Both windows have the same value of point as before, "
"and display the same portion of the buffer (or as close to it as possible).  "
"If necessary, the windows are scrolled to keep point on-screen.  By default, "
"the two windows each get half the height of the original window.  A positive "
"numeric argument specifies how many lines to give to the top window; a "
"negative numeric argument specifies how many lines to give to the bottom "
"window."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 2</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">split-window-below</"
"code>) は、選択中のウィンドウを上下2つのウィンドウに分割します。分割後、選択"
"中のウィンドウが上側に、新たに分割されたウィンドウが下側に配置されます。どち"
"らのウィンドウも point の値は以前と同じであり、バッファの同一部分（またはそれ"
"に可能な限り近い部分）を表示します。必要に応じて、point が画面内に留まるよう"
"にウィンドウがスクロールされます。デフォルトでは、2つのウィンドウはそれぞれ元"
"のウィンドウの高さの半分になります。正の数値引数を指定すると上側のウィンドウ"
"に割り当てる行数が、負の数値引数を指定すると下側のウィンドウに割り当てる行数"
"が指定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"split_002dwindow_002dkeep_002dpoint\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"split_002dwindow_002dkeep_002dpoint\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid ""
"If you change the variable <code class=\"code\">split-window-keep-point</"
"code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 2</kbd> "
"instead adjusts the portion of the buffer displayed by the two windows, as "
"well as the value of point in each window, in order to keep the text on the "
"screen as close as possible to what it was before; furthermore, if point was "
"in the lower half of the original window, the bottom window is selected "
"instead of the upper one."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">split-window-keep-point</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に変更すると、代わりに <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 2</"
"kbd> が、画面上のテキストを可能な限り元の状態に近づけるため、2つのウィンドウ"
"に表示されるバッファの範囲と、各ウィンドウにおけるポイントの値を調整します。"
"さらに、ポイントが元のウィンドウの下半分にあった場合は、上のウィンドウではな"
"く下のウィンドウが選択されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-3\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-split_002dwindow_002dright\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-3\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-split_002dwindow_002dright\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 3</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">split-window-right</"
"code>) splits the selected window into two side-by-side windows.  The left "
"window is the selected one; the right window displays the same portion of "
"the same buffer, and has the same value of point.  A positive numeric "
"argument specifies how many columns to give the left window; a negative "
"numeric argument specifies how many columns to give the right window."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 3</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">split-window-right</"
"code>) は、選択中のウィンドウを左右に並んだ2つのウィンドウに分割します。左側"
"のウィンドウが選択中のウィンドウとなり、右側のウィンドウには同じバッファの同"
"じ部分が表示され、point の値も同一になります。正の数値引数は左側のウィンドウ"
"に割り当てる列数を、負の数値引数は右側のウィンドウに割り当てる列数を指定しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"truncate_002dpartial_002dwidth_002dwindows\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"truncate_002dpartial_002dwidth_002dwindows\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid ""
"When you split a window with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 3</kbd>, each resulting "
"window occupies less than the full width of the frame.  If it becomes too "
"narrow, the buffer may be difficult to read if continuation lines are in use "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Continuation-Lines.html\">Continuation Lines</"
"a>).  Therefore, Emacs automatically switches to line truncation if the "
"window width becomes narrower than 50 columns.  This truncation occurs "
"regardless of the value of the variable <code class=\"code\">truncate-lines</"
"code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Line-Truncation.html\">Line Truncation</"
"a>); it is instead controlled by the variable <code class=\"code\">truncate-"
"partial-width-windows</code>.  If the value of this variable is a positive "
"integer (the default is 50), that specifies the minimum total width for a "
"partial-width window before automatic line truncation occurs; if the value "
"is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, automatic line truncation is disabled; "
"and for any other non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, Emacs truncates "
"lines in every partial-width window regardless of its width.  The total "
"width of a window is in column units as reported by <code "
"class=\"code\">window-total-width</code> (see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Window-"
"Sizes.html#Window-Sizes\">Window Sizes</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs "
"Lisp Reference Manual</cite>), it includes the fringes, the continuation and "
"truncation glyphs, the margins, and the scroll bar."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 3</kbd> でウィンドウを分割すると、結果として生じる各"
"ウィンドウがフレームの全幅に満たない幅になります。幅が狭すぎると、継続行が使"
"用されている場合にバッファの読み取りが困難になることがあります（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Continuation-Lines.html\">継続行</a>を参照）。そのた"
"め、ウィンドウ幅が50列未満になると、Emacsは自動的に行の切り捨てに切り替わりま"
"す。この切り捨ては変数 <code class=\"code\">truncate-lines</code> の値に関わ"
"らず行われ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Line-Truncation.html\">行の切り捨て</a>"
"を参照）、代わりに変数 <code class=\"code\">truncate-partial-width-windows</"
"code> によって制御されます。この変数の値が正の整数（デフォルトは50）である場"
"合、自動的な行の切り捨てが行われる前の部分幅ウィンドウの最小合計幅が指定され"
"ます。値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の場合は自動的な行の切り捨てが無効"
"になり、それ以外の <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値の場合は、ウィンド"
"ウ幅に関わらず Emacs はすべての部分幅ウィンドウで行を切り捨てます。ウィンドウ"
"の合計幅は、<code class=\"code\">window-total-width</code> で報告される列単位"
"の値であり（<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の "
"<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Window-Sizes.html#Window-Sizes\">ウィンドウサイズ</a>を参"
"照）、これにはフリンジ、継続および切り捨てグリフ、マージン、およびスクロール"
"バーが含まれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid ""
"On text terminals, side-by-side windows are separated by a vertical divider "
"which is drawn using the <code class=\"code\">vertical-border</code> face."
msgstr ""
"テキスト端末では、横並びのウィンドウは<code class=\"code\">vertical-border</"
"code>フェイスを用いて描画される垂直方向の区切り線で区切られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Split-Window.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dmouse_002d2-_0028mode-"
"line_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dmouse_002d2-"
"_0028scroll-bar_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dmouse_002d2-_0028mode-"
