#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Stack-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<span>29.6.5.5 Stack Buffer<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Stack-"
"Buffer-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>29.6.5.5 スタックバッファ<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Stack-"
"Buffer-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Stack-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"The GDB Stack buffer displays a <em class=\"dfn\">call stack</em>, with one "
"line for each of the nested subroutine calls (<em class=\"dfn\">stack "
"frames</em>) in the debugger session.  See <a data-manual=\"gdb\" "
"href=\"https://sourceware.org/gdb/current/onlinedocs/gdb.html/"
"Backtrace.html#Backtrace\">Backtraces</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"debugger</cite>."
msgstr ""
"GDBのスタックバッファには、デバッガセッションにおけるネストされたサブルーチン"
"呼び出し（<em class=\"dfn\">スタックフレーム</em>）ごとに1行ずつ、<em "
"class=\"dfn\">コールスタック</em>が表示されます。<cite class=\"cite\">The "
"GNU debugger</cite>の<a data-manual=\"gdb\" href=\"https://sourceware.org/"
"gdb/current/onlinedocs/gdb.html/Backtrace.html#Backtrace\">Backtraces</a>を参"
"照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Stack-Buffer.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-gdb_002dframes_002dselect\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-gdb_002dframes_002dselect\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Stack-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"On graphical displays, the selected stack frame is indicated by an arrow in "
"the fringe.  On text terminals, or when fringes are disabled, the selected "
"stack frame is displayed in reverse contrast.  To select a stack frame, move "
"point in its line and type <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">gdb-frames-select</code>), or click <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> on it.  Doing so also updates the Locals buffer "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Other-GDB-Buffers.html\">Other GDB Buffers</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"グラフィカルディスプレイでは、選択中のスタックフレームがフリンジ内の矢印で示"
"されます。テキスト端末やフリンジが無効な場合は、選択中のスタックフレームが反"
"転表示されます。スタックフレームを選択するには、その行のポイントを移動して "
"<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">gdb-frames-select</code>) "
"と入力するか、<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> をクリックします。これにより、"
"Locals バッファも更新されます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Other-GDB-"
"Buffers.html\">その他の GDB バッファ</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Stack-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"gdb_002dstack_002dbuffer_002daddresses\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"gdb_002dstack_002dbuffer_002daddresses\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Stack-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"If you want the frame address to be shown each stack frame, customize the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">gdb-stack-buffer-addresses</code> to a non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"スタックフレームごとにフレームアドレスを表示したい場合は、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">gdb-stack-buffer-addresses</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に設定してください。"

