# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-standard-faces\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-standard-faces\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"Here are the standard faces for specifying text appearance.  You can apply "
"them to specific text when you want the effects they produce."
msgstr ""
"以下は、テキストの外観を指定するための標準的なフェイスです。これらが生み出す"
"効果を利用したい場合に、特定のテキストに適用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">default</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">default</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This face is used for ordinary text that doesn&rsquo;t specify any face.  "
"Its background color is used as the frame&rsquo;s background color."
msgstr ""
"このフォントは、フォントを指定しない通常のテキストに使用されます。その背景色"
"は、フレームの背景色として使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">bold</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">bold</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "This face uses a bold variant of the default font."
msgstr "この顔には、デフォルトフォントの太字バリエーションが使用されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">italic</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">italic</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "This face uses an italic variant of the default font."
msgstr "この顔には、デフォルトフォントのイタリック体が使われています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">bold-italic</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">bold-italic</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "This face uses a bold italic variant of the default font."
msgstr ""
"このフェイスでは、デフォルトフォントの太いイタリック体を使用しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">underline</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">underline</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "This face underlines text."
msgstr "この顔はテキストを強調します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">fixed-pitch</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">fixed-pitch</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This face forces use of a fixed-width font.  It&rsquo;s reasonable to "
"customize this face to use a different fixed-width font, if you like, but "
"you should not make it a variable-width font."
msgstr ""
"このフェイスでは、固定幅フォントの使用が必須となっています。お好みで別の固定"
"幅フォントを使用するようにカスタマイズしても構いませんが、可変幅フォントにし"
"てはいけません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">fixed-pitch-serif</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">fixed-pitch-serif</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This face is like <code class=\"code\">fixed-pitch</code>, except the font "
"has serifs and looks more like traditional typewriting."
msgstr ""
"この顔は<code class=\"code\">fixed-pitch</code>に似ているが、フォントにセリフ"
"があり、より伝統的なタイプライター風に見える。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-variable_002dpitch-face\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">variable-pitch</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"variable_002dpitch-face\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-variable_002dpitch-face\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">variable-pitch</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"variable_002dpitch-face\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This face forces use of a variable-width (i.e., proportional) font.  The "
"font size picked for this face matches the font picked for the default "
"(usually fixed-width) font."
msgstr ""
"このフェイスでは、可変幅（すなわちプロポーショナル）フォントの使用が必須とな"
"ります。このフェイスに採用されるフォントサイズは、デフォルト（通常は等幅）"
"フォントに採用されるものと一致します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">variable-pitch-text</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">variable-pitch-text</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This is like the <code class=\"code\">variable-pitch</code> face (from which "
"it inherits), but is slightly larger.  A proportional font of the same "
"height as a monospace font usually appears visually smaller, and can "
"therefore be harder to read.  When displaying longer texts, this face can be "
"a good choice over the (slightly smaller) <code class=\"code\">variable-"
"pitch</code> face."
msgstr ""
"これは<code class=\"code\">variable-pitch</code>フェイス（継承元）に似ていま"
"すが、わずかに大きくなっています。等幅フォントと同じ高さのプロポーショナル"
"フォントは、通常、視覚的に小さく見えるため、読みにくくなることがあります。長"
"いテキストを表示する場合、このフェイスは（わずかに小さい）<code "
"class=\"code\">variable-pitch</code>フェイスよりも良い選択肢となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-shadow-face\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">shadow</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-shadow-face\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-shadow-face\"></a><span><code class=\"code\">shadow</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-shadow-face\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This face is used for making the text less noticeable than the surrounding "
"ordinary text.  Usually this can be achieved by using shades of gray in "
"contrast with either black or white default foreground color."
msgstr ""
"このフェイスは、テキストを周囲の通常のテキストよりも目立たなくさせるために使"
"用されます。通常、黒または白のデフォルトの前景色と対比させる形で、グレーの濃"
"淡を用いることでこれを実現できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"Here&rsquo;s an incomplete list of faces used to highlight parts of the text "
"temporarily for specific purposes.  (Many other modes define their own faces "
"for this purpose.)"
msgstr ""
"以下は、特定の目的でテキストの一部を一時的に強調するために使用されるグリフの"
"不完全な一覧です。（他の多くのモードでも、この目的のために独自のグリフが定義"
"されています。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">highlight</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">highlight</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This face is used for text highlighting in various contexts, such as when "
"the mouse cursor is moved over a hyperlink."
msgstr ""
"この顔は、ハイパーリンクの上にマウスカーソルを移動させた際など、さまざまな場"
"面でテキストのハイライトに使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">isearch</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">isearch</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This face is used to highlight the current Isearch match (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Incremental-Search.html\">Incremental Search</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この面は、現在のIsearchマッチを強調するために使用されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Incremental-Search.html\">インクリメンタル検索</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">query-replace</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">query-replace</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This face is used to highlight the current Query Replace match (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Replace.html\">Replacement Commands</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この面は、現在のクエリ置換マッチを強調表示するために使用されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Replace.html\">置換コマンド</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">lazy-highlight</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">lazy-highlight</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This face is used to highlight lazy matches for Isearch and Query Replace "
"(matches other than the current one)."
msgstr ""
"この顔は、Isearch や Query Replace におけるレイジーマッチ（現在のマッチ以外の"
"マッチ）を強調するために使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">region</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">region</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This face is used for displaying an active region (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Mark.html\">The Mark and the Region</a>).  When Emacs is built with "
"GTK+ support, its colors are taken from the current GTK+ theme."
msgstr ""
"この面は、アクティブ領域の表示に使用されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Mark.html\">マークと領域</a>を参照）。EmacsをGTK+サポート付きでビルド"
"した場合、その色は現在のGTK+テーマから取得されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">secondary-selection</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">secondary-selection</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Standard-Faces.html
msgid ""
"This face is used for displaying a secondary X selection (see <a "
