# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Starting-GUD.html
msgid ""
"There are several commands for starting a debugger subprocess, each "
"corresponding to a particular debugger program."
msgstr ""
"デバッガのサブプロセスを起動するためのコマンドがいくつかあり、それぞれ特定の"
"デバッガプログラムに対応しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Starting-GUD.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-gdb\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x gdb</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-gdb\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-gdb\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x gdb</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-gdb\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Starting-GUD.html
msgid ""
"Run GDB as a subprocess, and interact with it via an IDE-like Emacs "
"interface.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"GDB-Graphical-Interface.html\">GDB "
"Graphical Interface</a>, for more information about this command."
msgstr ""
"GDBをサブプロセスとして実行し、IDEのようなEmacsインターフェースを介して操作し"
"ます。このコマンドの詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"GDB-Graphical-"
"Interface.html\">GDBグラフィカルインターフェース</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Starting-GUD.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-gud_002dgdb\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x gud-gdb</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-gud_002dgdb\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-gud_002dgdb\"></a><span><kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x gud-gdb</kbd><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-gud_002dgdb\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Starting-GUD.html
msgid ""
"Run GDB, using a GUD interaction buffer for input and output to the GDB "
"subprocess (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Debugger-Operation.html\">Debugger "
"Operation</a>).  If such a buffer already exists, switch to it; otherwise, "
"create the buffer and switch to it."
msgstr ""
"GDBを起動し、GDBサブプロセスへの入出力にGUDインタラクションバッファを使用しま"
"す（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Debugger-Operation.html\">デバッガの動作</a>を"
"参照）。そのようなバッファが既に存在する場合はそれに切り替え、存在しない場合"
"はバッファを作成して切り替えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Starting-GUD.html
msgid ""
