# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid ""
"<span>30.6.3 State of a Difference<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#State-"
"of-a-Difference\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>30.6.3 差の状態<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#State-of-a-"
"Difference\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid ""
"In the merge buffer, a difference is marked with lines of &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">v</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</"
"samp>&rsquo; characters.  Each difference has one of these seven states:"
msgstr ""
"マージバッファでは、差分が&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">v</samp>&rsquo;および"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo;文字の行で示されます。各差分は、以"
"下の7つの状態のいずれかの状態にあります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid ""
"The difference is showing the A version.  The <kbd class=\"kbd\">a</kbd> "
"command always produces this state; the mode line indicates it with &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">A</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"違いはAバージョンが表示されている点です。<kbd class=\"kbd\">a</kbd>コマンドは"
"常にこの状態を生成し、モードラインでは&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A</"
"samp>&rsquo;と表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid ""
"The difference is showing the B version.  The <kbd class=\"kbd\">b</kbd> "
"command always produces this state; the mode line indicates it with &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">B</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"違いはBバージョンが表示されている点です。<kbd class=\"kbd\">b</kbd>コマンドは"
"常にこの状態を生成し、モードラインでは&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">B</"
"samp>&rsquo;と表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid "default-A"
msgstr "default-A"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid "default-B"
msgstr "default-B"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid ""
"The difference is showing the A or the B state by default, because you "
"haven&rsquo;t made a choice.  All differences start in the default-A state "
"(and thus the merge buffer is a copy of the A buffer), except those for "
"which one alternative is preferred (see below)."
msgstr ""
"差異がデフォルトでAまたはBの状態として表示されるのは、選択が行われていないた"
"めです。一方の選択肢が優先される場合（後述）を除き、すべての差異はデフォルト"
"のA状態から始まります（したがって、マージバッファはAバッファのコピーとなりま"
"す）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid ""
"When you select a difference, its state changes from default-A or default-B "
"to plain A or B.  Thus, the selected difference never has state default-A or "
"default-B, and these states are never displayed in the mode line."
msgstr ""
"差分を選択すると、その状態は default-A または default-B から、通常の A また"
"は B へと切り替わります。したがって、選択された差分が default-A または "
"default-B の状態になることはなく、これらの状態がモードラインに表示されること"
"もありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">d a</kbd> chooses default-A as the default "
"state, and <kbd class=\"kbd\">d b</kbd> chooses default-B.  This chosen "
"default applies to all differences that you have never selected and for "
"which no alternative is preferred.  If you are moving through the merge "
"sequentially, the differences you haven&rsquo;t selected are those following "
"the selected one.  Thus, while moving sequentially, you can effectively make "
"the A version the default for some sections of the merge buffer and the B "
"version the default for others by using <kbd class=\"kbd\">d a</kbd> and "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">d b</kbd> between sections."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">d a</kbd> は default-A を、<kbd class=\"kbd\">d "
"b</kbd> は default-B をデフォルト状態として選択します。この選択されたデフォル"
"トは、一度も選択したことがなく、かつ代替案が優先されないすべての差分に適用さ"
"れます。マージを順次進めている場合、未選択の差分とは、選択済みの差分に続くも"
"のを指します。したがって、順次進めながら、セクション間で <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">d a</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">d b</kbd> を使用することで、"
"マージバッファの一部のセクションでは A バージョンを、他のセクションでは B "
"バージョンを実質的にデフォルトとして設定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid "prefer-A"
msgstr "prefer-A"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid "prefer-B"
msgstr "prefer-B"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid ""
"The difference is showing the A or B state because it is <em "
"class=\"dfn\">preferred</em>.  This means that you haven&rsquo;t made an "
"explicit choice, but one alternative seems likely to be right because the "
"other alternative agrees with the common ancestor.  Thus, where the A buffer "
"agrees with the common ancestor, the B version is preferred, because chances "
"are it is the one that was actually changed."
msgstr ""
"この差異は、AまたはBの状態が<em class=\"dfn\">優先</em>されていることを示して"
"います。つまり、明示的な選択を行ったわけではないものの、一方の選択肢が共通祖"
"先と一致しているため、それが正しい可能性が高いということです。したがって、A"
"バッファが共通祖先と一致する場合、実際に変更されたのはそちらである可能性が高"
"いため、Bバージョンが優先されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid ""
"These two states are displayed in the mode line as &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">A*</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">B*</"
"samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"これら2つの状態は、モードラインに&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">A*</samp>&rsquo;"
"および&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">B*</samp>&rsquo;として表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid "combined"
msgstr "統合済み"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid ""
"The difference is showing a combination of the A and B states, as a result "
"of the <kbd class=\"kbd\">x c</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">x C</kbd> commands."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">x c</kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">x C</kbd> コマンドの結"
"果、A状態とB状態が組み合わさった状態が表示されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid ""
"Once a difference is in this state, the <kbd class=\"kbd\">a</kbd> and <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">b</kbd> commands don&rsquo;t do anything to it unless you give "
"them a numeric argument."
msgstr ""
"一度差分がこの状態になると、数値引数を指定しない限り、<kbd class=\"kbd\">a</"
"kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">b</kbd> コマンドは何も行いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/State-of-Difference.html
msgid ""
"The mode line displays this state as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">comb</"
"samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"モードラインはこの状態を&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">comb</samp>&rsquo;と表示"
"します。"

