# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Subdirectories-in-Dired.html
msgid "Insert the contents of a subdirectory later in the buffer."
msgstr "サブディレクトリの内容を、後でバッファに挿入する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Subdirectories-in-Dired.html
msgid ""
"If you use this command on a line that describes a file which is a "
"directory, it inserts the contents of that directory into the same Dired "
"buffer, and moves there.  Inserted subdirectory contents follow the top-"
"level directory of the Dired buffer, just as they do in &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">ls -lR</samp>&rsquo; output."
msgstr ""
"ディレクトリであるファイルを記述している行に対してこのコマンドを実行すると、"
"そのディレクトリの内容が同じDiredバッファに挿入され、そこへ移動します。挿入さ"
"れたサブディレクトリの内容は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">ls -lR</"
"samp>&rsquo; 出力時と同様に、Diredバッファの最上位ディレクトリの後に続きま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Subdirectories-in-Dired.html
msgid ""
"If the subdirectory&rsquo;s contents are already present in the buffer, the "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">i</kbd> command just moves to it."
msgstr ""
"サブディレクトリの内容が既にバッファに含まれている場合、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">i</kbd>コマンドは単にそこへ移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Subdirectories-in-Dired.html
msgid ""
"In either case, <kbd class=\"kbd\">i</kbd> sets the Emacs mark before "
"moving, so <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> "
"returns to your previous position in the Dired buffer (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Setting-Mark.html\">Setting the Mark</a>).  You can "
"also use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo; to return to the parent "
"directory in the same Dired buffer (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Dired-"
"Visiting.html\">Visiting Files in Dired</a>)."
msgstr ""
"いずれの場合も、<kbd class=\"kbd\">i</kbd> は移動前に Emacs マークを設定する"
"ため、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> で Dired "
"バッファ内の直前の位置に戻ります（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Setting-"
"Mark.html\">マークの設定</a>を参照）。また、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</"
"samp>&rsquo; を使用して、同じ Dired バッファ内の親ディレクトリに戻ることもで"
"きます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Dired-Visiting.html\">Dired でのファイル訪"
"問</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Subdirectories-in-Dired.html
msgid ""
"Use the <kbd class=\"kbd\">l</kbd> command (<code class=\"code\">dired-do-"
"redisplay</code>) to update the subdirectory&rsquo;s contents, and use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u k</kbd> on the subdirectory header line to remove the "
"subdirectory listing (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Dired-"
"Updating.html\">Updating the Dired Buffer</a>).  You can also hide and show "
"inserted subdirectories (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Hiding-"
"Subdirectories.html\">Hiding Subdirectories</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">l</kbd> コマンド (<code class=\"code\">dired-do-"
"redisplay</code>) を使用してサブディレクトリの内容を更新し、サブディレクトリ"
"のヘッダー行に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u k</kbd> を使用してサブディレクトリの一"
"覧を削除します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Dired-Updating.html\">Dired バッ"
"ファの更新</a> を参照）。また、挿入したサブディレクトリを非表示にしたり表示し"
"たりすることも可能です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Hiding-"
"Subdirectories.html\">サブディレクトリの非表示</a> を参照）。"

