msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-S-_0028Calendar-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dsunrise_002dsunset\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sunrise_002dsunset\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sunrise_002fSunset.html
msgid ""
"Within the calendar, to display the <em class=\"emph\">local times</em> of "
"sunrise and sunset in the echo area, move point to the date you want, and "
"type <kbd class=\"kbd\">S</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">calendar-sunrise-"
"sunset</code>).  Alternatively, click <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> on "
"the date, then choose &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Sunrise/sunset</"
"samp>&rsquo; from the menu that appears.  The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"sunrise-sunset</kbd> is available outside the calendar to display this "
"information for today&rsquo;s date or a specified date.  To specify a date "
"other than today, use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-x sunrise-sunset</kbd>, which "
"prompts for the year, month, and day."
msgstr ""
"カレンダー内で、エコー領域に日の出・日の入りの<em class=\"emph\">現地時刻</"
"em>を表示するには、目的の日付にポイントを移動し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">S</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">calendar-sunrise-sunset</code>) と入力します。または、"
"日付上の <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> をクリックし、表示されるメニューか"
"ら &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Sunrise/sunset</samp>&rsquo; を選択します。コ"
"マンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x sunrise-sunset</kbd> はカレンダー外でも利用で"
"き、本日または指定した日付のこの情報を表示します。本日以外の日付を指定する場"
"合は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-x sunrise-sunset</kbd> を使用し、年・月・日の入"
"力が求められます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sunrise_002fSunset.html
msgid ""
"You can display the times of sunrise and sunset for any location and any "
"date with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-u M-x sunrise-sunset</kbd>.  This asks "
"you for a longitude, latitude, number of minutes difference from Coordinated "
"Universal Time, and date, and then tells you the times of sunrise and sunset "
"for that location on that date."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-u M-x sunrise-sunset</kbd> を使えば、任意の場所と日"
"付における日の出・日の入り時刻を表示できます。このコマンドでは、経度、緯度、"
"協定世界時との分単位の時差、および日付の入力を求められ、その後、その場所にお"
"ける該当日の日の出・日の入り時刻を教えてくれます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Sunrise_002fSunset.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dlocation_002dname\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dlongitude\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dlatitude\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dlocation_002dname\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dlongitude\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dlatitude\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sunrise_002fSunset.html
msgid ""
"Because the times of sunrise and sunset depend on the location on earth, you "
"need to tell Emacs your latitude, longitude, and location name before using "
"these commands.  Here is an example of what to set:"
msgstr ""
"日の出・日の入りの時刻は地球上の場所によって異なるため、これらのコマンドを使"
"用する前に、Emacsに緯度、経度、および地名を指定する必要があります。設定例を以"
"下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Sunrise_002fSunset.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq calendar-latitude 40.1)\n"
"(setq calendar-longitude -88.2)\n"
"(setq calendar-location-name &quot;Urbana, IL&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sunrise_002fSunset.html
msgid ""
"Use one decimal place in the values of <code class=\"code\">calendar-"
"latitude</code> and <code class=\"code\">calendar-longitude</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">calendar-latitude</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-longitude</code> の値は、小数第1位まで求めてくださ"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Sunrise_002fSunset.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dtime_002dzone\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dstandard_002dtime_002dzone_002dname\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002ddaylight_002dtime_002dzone_002dname\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002dtime_002dzone\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"calendar_002dstandard_002dtime_002dzone_002dname\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-calendar_002ddaylight_002dtime_002dzone_002dname\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sunrise_002fSunset.html
msgid ""
"Your time zone also affects the local time of sunrise and sunset.  Emacs "
"usually gets time zone information from the operating system, but if these "
"values are not what you want (or if the operating system does not supply "
"them), you must set them yourself.  Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"タイムゾーンは、日の出・日の入りの現地時刻にも影響します。Emacsは通常、オペ"
"レーティングシステムからタイムゾーン情報を取得しますが、これらの値が希望通り"
"でない場合（あるいはオペレーティングシステムが情報を提供していない場合）は、"
"自身で設定する必要があります。以下に例を示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Sunrise_002fSunset.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq calendar-time-zone (* 12 60))\n"
"(setq calendar-standard-time-zone-name &quot;NZST&quot;)\n"
"(setq calendar-daylight-time-zone-name &quot;NZDT&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sunrise_002fSunset.html
msgid ""
"The value of <code class=\"code\">calendar-time-zone</code> is the number of "
"minutes of difference between your local standard time and Coordinated "
"Universal Time (a.k.a. &ldquo;Greenwich time&rdquo;).  The values of <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-standard-time-zone-name</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-time-zone-name</code> are the abbreviations "
"used in your time zone.  Emacs displays the times of sunrise and sunset <em "
"class=\"emph\">corrected for daylight saving time</em>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Daylight-Saving.html\">Daylight Saving Time</a>, for "
"how daylight saving time is determined."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">calendar-time-zone</code> の値は、ローカル標準時と協定世"
"界時（通称「グリニッジ時」）との分単位の差です。<code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-standard-time-zone-name</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">calendar-daylight-time-zone-name</code> の値は、お使いのタイム"
"ゾーンで使用される略称です。Emacs は、日の出・日の入り時刻を<em "
"class=\"emph\">夏時間補正済み</em>で表示します。夏時間の決定方法については、"
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Daylight-Saving.html\">夏時間</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。"

