# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Sunrise_002fSunset.html
msgid ""
"If you want to display numerical time zones (like &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;+0100&quot;</samp>&rsquo;)  instead of symbolic ones "
"(like &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;CET&quot;</samp>&rsquo;), set the "
