#: build/html/emacs/Tab-Bars.html
msgid ""
"Switch to the tab by its number <var class=\"var\">tab-number</var> (<code "
"class=\"code\">tab-select</code>).  After customizing the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">tab-bar-select-tab-modifiers</code> to specify one or more "
