"select any modifiers supported by Emacs, see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Modifier-Keys.html\">Modifier Keys</a>.  To display the tab number "
"alongside the tab name, you can customize another variable <code "
"class=\"code\">tab-bar-tab-hints</code>.  This will help you decide which "
"numerical key to press to select the tab by its number."
