"|                                                          |\n"
"|Parse Cell Items   Using row and column delimiter regexps,|\n"
"|                   it parses the specified text area and  |\n"
"|                   extracts cell items into a table.      |\n"
"+----------------------------------------------------------+\n"
msgstr ""

