#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Table-Conversion.html
msgid ""
"We can then use the cell splitting commands (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Cell-Commands.html\">Commands for Table Cells</a>) to subdivide the "
"table so that each paragraph occupies a cell:"
msgstr ""
"次に、セル分割コマンド（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Cell-Commands.html\">テーブ"
"ルセル用コマンド</a>を参照）を使用してテーブルを細分化し、各段落が1つのセルを"
"占めるようにできます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Table-Conversion.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"+----------------------------------------------------------+\n"
"|table-capture is a powerful command.                      |\n"
"|Here are some things it can do:                           |\n"
"+-----------------+----------------------------------------+\n"
