#: build/html/emacs/Table-Definition.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">table</em> consists of a rectangular text area which is "
"divided into <em class=\"dfn\">cells</em>.  Each cell must be at least one "
"character wide and one character high, not counting its border lines.  A "
"cell can be subdivided into more cells, but they cannot overlap."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">テーブル</em>は、<em class=\"dfn\">セル</em>に分割された矩"
"形のテキスト領域で構成されます。各セルは、枠線を除いて、幅と高さがそれぞれ少"
"なくとも1文字分である必要があります。セルはさらに小さなセルに分割できますが、"
"互いに重なることはできません。"

