# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Table-Misc.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dinsert_002dsequence\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dinsert_002dsequence\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Table-Misc.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-insert-sequence</kbd> traverses the cells of a "
"table inserting a sequence of text strings into each cell as it goes.  It "
"asks for the base string of the sequence, and then produces the sequence by "
"&ldquo;incrementing&rdquo; the base string, either numerically (if the base "
"string ends in numerical characters) or in the <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> order.  In addition to the base string, the "
"command prompts for the number of elements in the sequence, the increment, "
"the cell interval, and the justification of the text in each cell."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-insert-sequence</kbd> はテーブルのセルを走査し、"
"各セルにテキスト文字列のシーケンスを挿入していきます。まずシーケンスの基底文"
"字列を要求し、次にその基底文字列を、数値的に（基底文字列が数値文字で終わる場"
"合）、あるいは <abbr class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr> 順で「インクリメント」す"
"ることでシーケンスを生成します。基底文字列に加えて、このコマンドはシーケンス"
"の要素数、インクリメント値、セル間隔、および各セル内のテキストの配置を要求し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Table-Misc.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table-for-HTML-and-LaTeX\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dgenerate_002dsource\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table-for-HTML-and-LaTeX\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dgenerate_002dsource\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Table-Misc.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-generate-source</kbd> generates a table "
"formatted for a specific markup language.  It asks for a language (which "
"must be one of <code class=\"code\">html</code>, <code class=\"code\">latex</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">cals</code>, <code class=\"code\">wiki</code> or "
"<code class=\"code\">mediawiki</code>), a destination buffer in which to put "
"the result, and a table caption, and then inserts the generated table into "
"the specified buffer.  The default destination buffer is <code "
"class=\"code\">table.<var class=\"var\">lang</var></code>, where <var "
"class=\"var\">lang</var> is the language you specified."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-generate-source</kbd> は、特定のマークアップ言語"
"向けにフォーマットされたテーブルを生成します。言語（<code "
"class=\"code\">html</code>、<code class=\"code\">latex</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">cals</code>、<code class=\"code\">wiki</code>、または <code "
"class=\"code\">mediawiki</code> のいずれかである必要があります）、結果を格納"
"する出力バッファ、およびテーブルのキャプションを要求し、生成したテーブルを指"
"定されたバッファに挿入します。デフォルトの出力バッファは <code "
"class=\"code\">table.<var class=\"var\">lang</var></code> であり、<var "
"class=\"var\">lang</var> は指定した言語となります。"

