# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Table-Rows-and-Columns.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inserting-rows-and-columns-in-"
"text_002dbased-tables\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"table_002dinsert_002drow\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-inserting-rows-and-columns-in-"
"text_002dbased-tables\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"table_002dinsert_002drow\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Table-Rows-and-Columns.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-insert-row</kbd> inserts a row of cells before "
"the current table row.  The current row, together with point, is pushed down "
"past the new row.  To insert a row after the last row at the bottom of a "
"table, invoke this command with point below the table, just below the bottom "
"edge.  You can insert more than one row at a time by using a numeric prefix "
"argument."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-insert-row</kbd> は、現在のテーブル行の前にセル"
"の行を挿入します。現在の行は、ポイントとともに新しい行を越えて下に押し下げら"
"れます。テーブル最下部の最後の行の後に行を挿入するには、ポイントをテーブルの"
"下、下端のすぐ下に配置した状態でこのコマンドを実行してください。数値の接頭辞"
"引数を使用することで、一度に複数の行を挿入できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Table-Rows-and-Columns.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dinsert_002dcolumn\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-table_002dinsert_002dcolumn\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Table-Rows-and-Columns.html
msgid ""
"Similarly, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-insert-column</kbd> inserts a column "
"of cells to the left of the current table column.  To insert a column to the "
"right side of the rightmost column, invoke this command with point to the "
"right of the rightmost column, outside the table.  A numeric prefix argument "
"specifies the number of columns to insert."
msgstr ""
"同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-insert-column</kbd> は現在のテーブル列の"
"左側にセル列を挿入します。最右列の右側に列を挿入するには、ポイントを最右列の"
"右側、テーブルの外側に置いた状態でこのコマンドを実行します。数値の接頭辞引数"
"で、挿入する列数を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Table-Rows-and-Columns.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-deleting-rows-and-column-in-"
"text_002dbased-tables\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-deleting-rows-and-column-in-"
"text_002dbased-tables\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Table-Rows-and-Columns.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-delete-column</kbd> deletes the column of cells "
"at point.  Similarly, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-delete-row</kbd> deletes "
"the row of cells at point.  A numeric prefix argument to either command "
"specifies the number of columns or rows to delete."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-delete-column</kbd> はポイントにあるセル列を削除"
"します。同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x table-delete-row</kbd> はポイントにあ"
"るセル行を削除します。いずれのコマンドにおいても、数値の接頭辞引数を指定する"
"ことで、削除する列数または行数を指定できます。"

