# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h3>
#: build/html/emacs/Tabs-in-Picture.html
msgid ""
"<span>44.3 Picture Mode Tabs<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Picture-Mode-"
"Tabs\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>44.3 画像モードタブ<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Picture-Mode-"
"Tabs\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Tabs-in-Picture.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dTAB-_0028Picture-mode_0029\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-picture_002dtab_002dsearch\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-picture_002dtab_002dchars\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dTAB-_0028Picture-mode_0029\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-picture_002dtab_002dsearch\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-picture_002dtab_002dchars\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Tabs-in-Picture.html
msgid ""
"Two kinds of tab-like action are provided in Picture mode.  Use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">picture-tab-search</code>) for context-based tabbing.  With "
"no argument, it moves to a point underneath the next "
"&ldquo;interesting&rdquo; character that follows whitespace in the previous "
"nonblank line.  &ldquo;Next&rdquo; here means &ldquo;appearing at a "
"horizontal position greater than the one point starts out at&rdquo;.  With "
"prefix argument, as in <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</"
"kbd></kbd>, this command moves to the next such interesting character in the "
"current line.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> does "
"not change the text; it only moves point.  &ldquo;Interesting&rdquo; "
"characters are defined by the variable <code class=\"code\">picture-tab-"
"chars</code>, which should define a set of characters.  The syntax for this "
"variable is like the syntax used inside of &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">[&hellip;]</samp>&rsquo; in a regular expression&mdash;but "
"without the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[</samp>&rsquo; and the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">]</samp>&rsquo;.  Its default value is <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;!-~&quot;</code>."
msgstr ""
"Pictureモードでは、2種類のタブのような操作が提供されています。コンテキスト"
"ベースのタブ移動には <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">picture-tab-search</code>) を使用します。引数を指定しな"
"い場合、直前の非空白行の空白文字の後に続く、次の「興味深い」文字の直下のポイ"
"ントに移動します。ここでの「次」とは、「ポイントが開始した位置よりも水平方向"
"の位置が大きい」ことを意味します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> のように接頭辞引数を指定すると、このコマンドは"
"現在の行にある次のそのような興味深い文字に移動します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> はテキストを変更せず、ポイントのみを移動さ"
"せます。「興味深い」文字は変数 <code class=\"code\">picture-tab-chars</code> "
"によって定義され、この変数には文字セットが定義されている必要があります。この"
"変数の構文は、正規表現内の「<samp class=\"samp\">[&hellip;]</samp>」で使用さ"
"れる構文と同様ですが、「<samp class=\"samp\">[</samp>」および「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">]</samp>」は含まれません。デフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;!-~&quot;</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Tabs-in-Picture.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-picture_002dtab\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-picture_002dtab\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Tabs-in-Picture.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> itself runs <code class=\"code\">picture-tab</"
"code>, which operates based on the current tab stop settings; it is the "
"Picture mode equivalent of <code class=\"code\">tab-to-tab-stop</code>.  "
"Normally it just moves point, but with a numeric argument it clears the text "
"that it moves over."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> 自体は <code class=\"code\">picture-tab</code> "
"を実行し、これは現在のタブストップ設定に基づいて動作します。いわば <code "
"class=\"code\">tab-to-tab-stop</code> のピクチャーモード版です。通常は単にポ"
"イントを移動させますが、数値引数を指定すると、移動先のテキストをクリアしま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Tabs-in-Picture.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dc-TAB-_0028Picture-"
"mode_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"picture_002dset_002dtab_002dstops\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dc-TAB-_0028Picture-"
"mode_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"picture_002dset_002dtab_002dstops\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Tabs-in-Picture.html
msgid ""
"The context-based and tab-stop-based forms of tabbing are brought together "
"by the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">picture-set-tab-stops</code>).  This command sets the "
"tab stops to the positions which <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> would consider significant in the current "
"line.  The use of this command, together with <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd>, "
"can get the effect of context-based tabbing.  But <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> is more convenient in the cases where it is "
"sufficient."
msgstr ""
"コンテキストベースのタブ移動とタブストップベースのタブ移動は、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">picture-set-tab-stops</code>) コマンドによって統合されます。こ"
"のコマンドは、現在の行において <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</"
"kbd></kbd> が重要とみなす位置にタブストップを設定します。このコマンドを <kbd "
"class=\"key\">TAB</kbd> と併用することで、コンテキストベースのタブ移動と同様"
"の効果を得ることができます。ただし、それで十分な場合には、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> の方が便利です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Tabs-in-Picture.html
msgid ""
"It may be convenient to prevent use of actual tab characters in pictures.  "
"For example, this prevents <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</"
"kbd></kbd> from messing up the picture.  You can do this by setting the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">indent-tabs-mode</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"画像内で実際のタブ文字の使用を防ぐと便利な場合があります。例えば、これにより "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> が画像を乱すのを防"
"げます。変数 <code class=\"code\">indent-tabs-mode</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を設定することで実現できます。"

