# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Tag-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"<span>30.4.2.1 Source File Tag Syntax<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Source-File-Tag-Syntax\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>30.4.2.1 ソースファイルタグの構文<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Source-File-Tag-Syntax\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Tag-Syntax.html
msgid "Here is how tag syntax is defined for the most popular languages:"
msgstr "主要な言語におけるタグ構文の定義は以下の通りです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Tag-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"In C code, any C function or typedef is a tag, and so are definitions of "
"<code class=\"code\">struct</code>, <code class=\"code\">union</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">enum</code>.  <code class=\"code\">#define</code> macro "
"definitions, <code class=\"code\">#undef</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">enum</code> constants are also tags, unless you specify "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--no-defines</samp>&rsquo; when making the tags "
"table.  Similarly, global variables are tags, unless you specify &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">--no-globals</samp>&rsquo;, and so are struct members, "
"unless you specify &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--no-members</samp>&rsquo;.  "
"Use of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--no-globals</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">--no-defines</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--"
"no-members</samp>&rsquo; can make the tags table file much smaller."
msgstr ""
"C言語のコードでは、あらゆるC関数やtypedefがタグとなり、<code "
"class=\"code\">struct</code>、<code class=\"code\">union</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">enum</code>の定義も同様です。<code class=\"code\">#define</"
"code>のマクロ定義、<code class=\"code\">#undef</code>および<code "
"class=\"code\">enum</code>の定数もタグとなりますが、タグテーブルを作成する際"
"に&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--no-defines</samp>&rsquo;を指定した場合は除き"
"ます。同様に、グローバル変数も&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--no-globals</"
"samp>&rsquo;を指定しない限りタグとなり、構造体メンバも&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">--no-members</samp>&rsquo;を指定しない限りタグとなります。"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--no-globals</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">--no-defines</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--no-"
"members</samp>&rsquo;を使用することで、タグテーブルファイルを大幅に小さくでき"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Tag-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"You can tag function declarations and external variables in addition to "
"function definitions by giving the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--"
"declarations</samp>&rsquo; option to <code class=\"command\">etags</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"command\">etags</code> に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--"
"declarations</samp>&rsquo; オプションを指定することで、関数定義に加えて関数宣"
"言や外部変数にもタグを付けることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Tag-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"In C++ code, in addition to all the tag constructs of C code, member "
"functions are also recognized; member variables are also recognized, unless "
"you use the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--no-members</samp>&rsquo; option.  "
"<code class=\"code\">operator</code> definitions have tag names like &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">operator+</samp>&rsquo;.  If you specify the &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">--class-qualify</samp>&rsquo; option, tags for "
"variables and functions in classes are named &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">class</var>::<var class=\"var\">variable</"
"var></samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">class</"
"var>::<var class=\"var\">function</var></samp>&rsquo;.  By default, class "
"methods and members are not class-qualified, which facilitates identifying "
"their names in the sources more accurately."
msgstr ""
"C++コードでは、Cコードのすべてのタグ構文に加え、メンバ関数も認識されます。ま"
"た、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--no-members</samp>&rsquo;オプションを使用し"
"ない限り、メンバ変数も認識されます。  <code class=\"code\">operator</code> の"
"定義には、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">operator+</samp>&rsquo;のようなタグ名が"
"付与されます。  &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--class-qualify</samp>&rsquo;オプ"
"ションを指定すると、クラス内の変数および関数のタグは&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">class</var>::<var class=\"var\">variable</"
"var></samp>&rsquo;および&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var "
"class=\"var\">class</var>::<var class=\"var\">function</var></samp>&rsquo;と"
"いう名前になります。  デフォルトでは、クラスのメソッドやメンバはクラス修飾さ"
"れないため、ソース内でそれらの名前をより正確に特定しやすくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Tag-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"In Java code, tags include all the constructs recognized in C++, plus the "
"<code class=\"code\">interface</code>, <code class=\"code\">extends</code> "
"and <code class=\"code\">implements</code> constructs.  Tags for variables "
"and functions in classes are named &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var "
"class=\"var\">class</var>.<var class=\"var\">variable</var></samp>&rsquo; "
"and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">class</var>.<var "
"class=\"var\">function</var></samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"Javaコードにおけるタグには、C++で認識されるすべての構文に加え、<code "
"class=\"code\">interface</code>、<code class=\"code\">extends</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">implements</code>という構文が含まれます。クラス内の変数や関数"
"用のタグは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">class</var>.<var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var></samp>&rsquo;および&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">class</var>.<var class=\"var\">function</"
"var></samp>&rsquo;と名付けられています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Tag-Syntax.html
msgid ""
"In LaTeX documents, the arguments for <code class=\"code\">\\chapter</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">\\section</code>, <code class=\"code\">\\subsection</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">\\subsubsection</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">\\eqno</code>, <code class=\"code\">\\label</code>, <code "
