# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/TeX-Print.html
msgid ""
"You can invoke TeX as a subprocess of Emacs, supplying either the entire "
"contents of the buffer or just part of it (e.g., one chapter of a larger "
"document)."
msgstr ""
"TeXをEmacsのサブプロセスとして起動し、バッファの全内容、あるいはその一部"
"（例：大規模な文書の1章分）を渡すことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/TeX-Print.html
msgid ""
"Invoke TeX on the entire current buffer (<code class=\"code\">tex-buffer</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在のバッファ全体 (<code class=\"code\">tex-buffer</code>) に対して TeX を実"
"行します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/TeX-Print.html
msgid ""
