# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-temporary-windows\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-temporary-windows\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
"Some buffers are shown in windows for perusal rather than for editing.  Help "
"commands (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Help.html\">Help</a>) typically use "
"a buffer called <samp class=\"file\">*Help*</samp> for that purpose, "
"minibuffer completion (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Completion.html\">Completion</a>) uses a buffer called <samp "
"class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp>, etc.  Such buffers are usually "
"displayed only for a short period of time."
msgstr ""
"一部のバッファは、編集用ではなく閲覧用にウィンドウに表示されます。ヘルプコマ"
"ンド（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Help.html\">ヘルプ</a>を参照）では通常、その"
"目的で<samp class=\"file\">*Help*</samp>というバッファが使用され、ミニバッ"
"ファ補完（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Completion.html\">補完</a>を参照）では"
"<samp class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp>というバッファが使用される、といった"
"具合です。こうしたバッファは通常、短時間のみ表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
"Normally, Emacs chooses the window for such temporary displays via <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code>, as described in the previous "
"subsection.  The <samp class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> buffer, on the "
"other hand, is normally displayed in a window at the bottom of the selected "
"frame, regardless of the number of windows already shown on that frame."
msgstr ""
"通常、Emacsは前節で説明した通り、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> "
"を用いてこうした一時的な表示用のウィンドウを選択します。一方、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> バッファは、当該フレームに既に表示されて"
"いるウィンドウの数にかかわらず、通常は選択中のフレーム下部のウィンドウに表示"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
"If you prefer Emacs to display a temporary buffer in a different fashion, "
"customize the variable <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> (see "
"<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Choosing-Window.html#Choosing-Window\">Choosing a Window for "
"Displaying a Buffer</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference "
"Manual</cite>) appropriately.  For example, to display <samp "
"class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> always below the selected window, use "
"the following form in your initialization file (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Init-File.html\">The Emacs Initialization File</a>):"
msgstr ""
"Emacsで一時バッファを別の形式で表示したい場合は、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code>（<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs "
"Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Choosing-"
"Window.html#Choosing-Window\">Choosing a Window for Displaying a Buffer</a> "
"を参照）を適切にカスタマイズしてください。例えば、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> を常に選択中のウィンドウの下に表示するに"
"は、初期化ファイル（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Init-File.html\">The Emacs "
"Initialization File</a> を参照）で以下の形式を使用してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Temporary-Displays.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setopt\n"
" display-buffer-alist\n"
" '((&quot;\\\\*Completions\\\\*&quot; display-buffer-below-selected)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"temp_002dbuffer_002dresize_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"temp_002dbuffer_002dresize_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
"The <samp class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> buffer is also special in the "
"sense that Emacs usually tries to make its window just as large as necessary "
"to display all of its contents.  To resize windows showing other temporary "
"displays, like, for example, the <samp class=\"file\">*Help*</samp> buffer, "
"turn on the minor mode (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minor-"
"Modes.html\">Minor Modes</a>) <code class=\"code\">temp-buffer-resize-mode</"
"code> (see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Temporary-Displays.html#Temporary-"
"Displays\">Temporary Displays</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp "
"Reference Manual</cite>)."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*Completions*</samp> バッファが特殊なのは、Emacs が通"
"常、ウィンドウの内容をすべて表示するために必要な最小限の大きさに調整しようと"
"する点にあります。例えば、<samp class=\"file\">*Help*</samp> バッファのような"
"他の一時的表示を行っているウィンドウのサイズを変更するには、マイナーモード"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Minor-Modes.html\">マイナーモード</a> を参照）"
"<code class=\"code\">temp-buffer-resize-mode</code>（<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Temporary-Displays.html#Temporary-Displays\">一時的表示</a> を参照）を"
"有効にしてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
