# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
"The maximum size of windows resized by <code class=\"code\">temp-buffer-"
"resize-mode</code> can be controlled by customizing the options <code "
"class=\"code\">temp-buffer-max-height</code> and <code class=\"code\">temp-"
"buffer-max-width</code> (see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Temporary-"
"Displays.html#Temporary-Displays\">Temporary Displays</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>), and cannot exceed "
"the size of the containing frame."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">temp-buffer-resize-mode</code> でリサイズされるウィンド"
"ウの最大サイズは、オプション <code class=\"code\">temp-buffer-max-height</"
"code> および <code class=\"code\">temp-buffer-max-width</code> をカスタマイズ"
"することで制御でき（<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</"
"cite> の <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/elisp/Temporary-Displays.html#Temporary-"
"Displays\">Temporary Displays</a> を参照）、包含するフレームのサイズを超える"
"ことはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-warning-buffer_002c-display\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"warning_002ddisplay_002dat_002dbottom\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-warning-buffer_002c-display\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"warning_002ddisplay_002dat_002dbottom\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Temporary-Displays.html
msgid ""
"Buffers showing warnings (such as byte-compilation warnings, see <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Compilation-Functions.html#Compilation-Functions\">Byte Compilation "
"Functions</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</"
"cite>) are also by default shown in a window at the bottom of the selected "
"frame.  You can control this using the variable <code class=\"code\">warning-"
"display-at-bottom</code>: if set to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs "
"will use the normal logic of <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Window-Choice.html\">How <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> works</a>) instead, and you can "
"customize that via <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code>."
