#: build/html/emacs/Term-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Term mode has a page-at-a-time feature.  When enabled, it makes output pause "
"at the end of each screenful:"
msgstr ""
"Term modeには1ページずつ表示する機能があります。この機能を有効にすると、各画"
"面の末尾で出力が一時停止します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Term-Mode.html
