"id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dq-_0028Term-mode_0029\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-q</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dc-"
"C_002dq-_0028Term-mode_0029\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-term_002dpager_002dtoggle\"></a> <a "
"id=\"index-C_002dc-C_002dq-_0028Term-mode_0029\"></a><span><kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-q</kbd><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-C_002dc-"
