# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid ""
"When you want to insert a copy of the same piece of text several times, it "
"may be inconvenient to yank it from the kill ring, since each subsequent "
"kill moves that entry further down the ring.  An alternative is to store the "
"text in a register and later retrieve it."
msgstr ""
"同じテキストのコピーを複数回挿入したい場合、キルリングからそれを取り出すのは"
"不便なことがあります。後続のキルが行われるたびに、そのエントリがリングの下方"
"へと押し下げられてしまうためです。別の方法としては、テキストをレジスタに格納"
"し、後で取り出すという方法があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r s <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r s <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid ""
"Copy region into register <var class=\"var\">r</var> (<code "
"class=\"code\">copy-to-register</code>)."
msgstr ""
"領域をレジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</var> (<code class=\"code\">copy-to-"
"register</code>) にコピーする。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid ""
"Insert text from register <var class=\"var\">r</var> (<code "
"class=\"code\">insert-register</code>)."
msgstr ""
"レジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</var> (<code class=\"code\">insert-register</"
"code>) からテキストを挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x append-to-register <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x append-to-register <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid "Append region to text in register <var class=\"var\">r</var>."
msgstr "レジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</var> のテキストにリージョンを追加。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid ""
"When register <var class=\"var\">r</var> contains text, you can use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x r +</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">increment-register</code>) "
"to append to that register.  Note that command <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r +</"
"kbd> behaves differently if <var class=\"var\">r</var> contains a number.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Number-Registers.html\">Keeping Numbers in "
"Registers</a>."
msgstr ""
"レジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</var> にテキストが含まれている場合、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x r +</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">increment-register</code>) "
"を使用してそのレジスタに追記できます。なお、<var class=\"var\">r</var> に数値"
"が含まれている場合、コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r +</kbd> の動作は異なり"
"ます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Number-Registers.html\">レジスタへの数値の保持"
"</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x prepend-to-register <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x prepend-to-register <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid "Prepend region to text in register <var class=\"var\">r</var>."
msgstr ""
"レジスタ <var class=\"var\">r</var> のテキストの先頭にリージョンを追加しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-r-s\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-copy_002dto_002dregister\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-r-s\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-copy_002dto_002dregister\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r s <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd> stores a copy of "
"the text of the region into the register named <var class=\"var\">r</var>.  "
"If the mark is inactive, Emacs first reactivates the mark where it was last "
"set.  The mark is deactivated at the end of this command.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Mark.html\">The Mark and the Region</a>.  <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x r s <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd>, the same command "
"with a prefix argument, copies the text into register <var class=\"var\">r</"
"var> and deletes the text from the buffer as well; you can think of this as "
"moving the region text into the register."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r s <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd> は、リージョンの"
"テキストのコピーを <var class=\"var\">r</var> という名前のレジスタに格納しま"
"す。マークが非アクティブな場合、Emacs はまず最後にマークが設定された位置で"
"マークを再有効化します。このコマンドの終了時にマークは非アクティブになりま"
"す。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Mark.html\">マークとリージョン</a> を参照してく"
"ださい。接頭辞引数を指定した同一のコマンドである <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x "
"r s <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd> は、テキストをレジスタ <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var> にコピーし、バッファからもテキストを削除します。これ"
"は、リージョンのテキストをレジスタに移動させる操作と考えることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-append_002dto_002dregister\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-prepend_002dto_002dregister\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-append_002dto_002dregister\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-prepend_002dto_002dregister\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x append-to-register <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var></kbd> appends the copy of the text in the region to "
"the text already stored in the register named <var class=\"var\">r</var>.  "
"If invoked with a prefix argument, it deletes the region after appending it "
"to the register.  The command <code class=\"code\">prepend-to-register</"
"code> is similar, except that it <em class=\"emph\">prepends</em> the region "
"text to the text in the register instead of <em class=\"emph\">appending</"
"em> it."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x append-to-register <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">r</var></kbd> は、リージョン内のテキストのコピーを、<var "
"class=\"var\">r</var> という名前のレジスタに既に格納されているテキストに追記"
"します。接頭辞引数を指定して呼び出した場合は、リージョンをレジスタに追記した"
"後、そのリージョンを削除します。コマンド <code class=\"code\">prepend-to-"
"register</code> も同様ですが、レジスタ内のテキストにリージョンのテキストを"
"<em class=\"emph\">追記</em>するのではなく、<em class=\"emph\">先頭に挿入</"
"em>します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-register_002dseparator\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-register_002dseparator\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid ""
"When you are collecting text using <code class=\"code\">append-to-register</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">prepend-to-register</code>, you may want to "
"separate individual collected pieces using a separator.  In that case, "
"configure a <code class=\"code\">register-separator</code> and store the "
"separator text in to that register.  For example, to get double newlines as "
"text separator during the collection process, you can use the following "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append-to-register</code> や <code "
"class=\"code\">prepend-to-register</code> を使用してテキストを収集する際、収"
"集した個々の断片を区切り文字で区切りたい場合があります。その場合は、<code "
"class=\"code\">register-separator</code> を設定し、そのレジスタに区切り文字を"
"格納してください。例えば、収集処理中に2つの改行をテキスト区切り文字として取得"
"するには、以下の設定を使用できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq register-separator ?+)\n"
"(set-register register-separator &quot;\\n\\n&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-r-i\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-insert_002dregister\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-r-i\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-insert_002dregister\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Registers.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r i <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd> inserts in the "
"buffer the text from register <var class=\"var\">r</var>.  Normally it "
"leaves point after the text and sets the mark before, without activating "
"it.  With a prefix argument, it instead puts point before the text and the "
"mark after."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r i <var class=\"var\">r</var></kbd> は、レジスタ "
"<var class=\"var\">r</var> のテキストをバッファに挿入します。通常は、テキスト"
"の後にポイントを置き、その手前にマークを設定しますが、マークは有効にしませ"
"ん。接頭辞引数を指定すると、代わりにテキストの手前にポイントを置き、その後に"
"マークを設定します。"

