# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Scale.html
msgid ""
"The commands <code class=\"code\">text-scale-increase</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">text-scale-decrease</code> increase or decrease the size of "
"the font in the current buffer, just like <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-+</kbd> "
"and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C--</kbd> respectively.  You may find it "
"convenient to bind to these commands, rather than <code class=\"code\">text-"
"scale-adjust</code>."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <code class=\"code\">text-scale-increase</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">text-scale-decrease</code> は、それぞれ <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x C-+</kbd> や <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C--</kbd> と同様に、現在のバッファ内の"
"フォントサイズを大きくしたり小さくしたりします。<code class=\"code\">text-"
"scale-adjust</code> ではなく、これらのコマンドにバインドしておくと便利かもし"
"れません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Scale.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-set-buffer-font-size\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text_002dscale_002dset\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-set-buffer-font-size\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text_002dscale_002dset\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Scale.html
msgid ""
"The command <code class=\"code\">text-scale-set</code> scales the size of "
"the font in the current buffer to an absolute level specified by its prefix "
"argument."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <code class=\"code\">text-scale-set</code> は、現在のバッファ内の"
"フォントサイズを、その接頭辞引数で指定された絶対値まで拡大します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Scale.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text_002dscale_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text_002dscale_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Scale.html
msgid ""
"The above commands automatically enable the minor mode <code "
"class=\"code\">text-scale-mode</code> if the current font scaling is other "
"than 1, and disable it otherwise."
msgstr ""
"上記のコマンドは、現在のフォントスケーリングが1以外の場合はマイナーモード "
"<code class=\"code\">text-scale-mode</code> を自動的に有効にし、それ以外の場"
"合は無効にします。"

