# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Scale.html
msgid ""
"The command <code class=\"code\">mouse-wheel-text-scale</code> also changes "
"the text scale.  Normally, it is run when you press <kbd class=\"key\">Ctrl</"
"kbd> while moving the mouse wheel.  The text scale is increased when the "
"wheel is moved downwards, and it is decreased when the wheel is moved "
"upwards."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <code class=\"code\">mouse-wheel-text-scale</code> はテキストスケー"
"ルも変更します。通常、マウスホイールを操作しながら <kbd class=\"key\">Ctrl</"
"kbd> を押したときに実行されます。ホイールを下に動かすとテキストスケールが上が"
"り、上に動かすと下がります。"

