#: build/html/emacs/Text-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"<span>23.22 Text Terminals<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Text-"
"Terminals-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>23.22 テキスト端末<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Text-"
"Terminals-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Terminals.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text-terminal\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-text-terminal\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"On a text terminal, Emacs can display only one Emacs frame at a time.  "
"However, you can still create multiple Emacs frames, and switch between "
"them.  Switching frames on these terminals is much like switching between "
"different window configurations."
msgstr ""
"テキスト端末では、Emacsは一度に1つのEmacsフレームしか表示できません。ただし、"
"複数のEmacsフレームを作成し、それらを切り替えることは可能です。これらの端末で"
"フレームを切り替える操作は、異なるウィンドウ構成を切り替える操作とよく似てい"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"Use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 2</kbd> to create a new frame and switch to it; "
"use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 o</kbd> to cycle through the existing frames; "
"use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 0</kbd> to delete the current frame."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 2</kbd> で新しいフレームを作成して切り替え、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 o</kbd> で既存のフレームを順に切り替え、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x 5 0</kbd> で現在のフレームを削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"Each frame has a number to distinguish it.  If your terminal can display "
"only one frame at a time, the selected frame&rsquo;s number <var "
"class=\"var\">n</var> appears near the beginning of the mode line, in the "
"form &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">F<var class=\"var\">n</var></samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"各フレームには、識別用の番号が付与されています。端末で一度に1つのフレームしか"
"表示できない場合、選択中のフレームの番号 <var class=\"var\">n</var> がモード"
"ラインの先頭付近に「<samp class=\"samp\">F<var class=\"var\">n</var></samp>」"
"の形式で表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-set_002dframe_002dname\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-select_002dframe_002dby_002dname\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-set_002dframe_002dname\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-select_002dframe_002dby_002dname\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Text-Terminals.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">F<var class=\"var\">n</var></samp>&rsquo; is in "
"fact the frame&rsquo;s initial name.  You can give frames more meaningful "
"names if you wish, and you can select a frame by its name.  Use the command "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x set-frame-name <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> to specify a new "
"name for the selected frame, and use <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x select-frame-by-"
"name <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var class=\"var\">name</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> to select a frame according to its name.  The "
"name you specify appears in the mode line when the frame is selected."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">F<var class=\"var\">n</var></samp>&rsquo;は、実際"
"にはフレームの初期名です。必要に応じてフレームにより意味のある名前を付けるこ"
"とができ、名前でフレームを選択することも可能です。選択したフレームに新しい名"
"前を指定するにはコマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x set-frame-name <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var class=\"var\">name</var> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> を、名前に基づいてフレームを選択するには <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x select-frame-by-name <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> <var "
"class=\"var\">name</var> <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> を使用してくださ"
"い。指定した名前は、フレームが選択されているときにモードラインに表示されま"
"す。"

