# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Threads-Buffer.html
msgid ""
"The GDB Threads buffer displays a summary of the threads in the debugged "
"program.  See <a data-manual=\"gdb\" href=\"https://sourceware.org/gdb/"
"current/onlinedocs/gdb.html/Threads.html#Threads\">Debugging programs with "
"multiple threads</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU debugger</cite>.  To "
"select a thread, move point there and press <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">gdb-select-thread</code>), or click on it with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd>.  This also displays the associated source "
"buffer, and updates the contents of the other GDB buffers."
msgstr ""
"GDBのThreadsバッファには、デバッグ対象プログラム内のスレッドの概要が表示され"
"ます。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU debugger</cite>の<a data-manual=\"gdb\" "
"href=\"https://sourceware.org/gdb/current/onlinedocs/gdb.html/"
"Threads.html#Threads\">Debugging programs with multiple threads</a>を参照して"
"ください。スレッドを選択するには、ポイントをそのスレッドに移動して<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">gdb-select-thread</code>)を押す"
"か、<kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd>でクリックします。これにより、関連する"
"ソースバッファも表示され、他のGDBバッファの内容も更新されます。"

