#: build/html/emacs/Time-Stamps.html
msgid ""
"<span>20.3.6 Updating Time Stamps Automatically<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Updating-Time-Stamps-Automatically\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>20.3.6 タイムスタンプの自動更新<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Updating-Time-Stamps-Automatically\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Time-Stamps.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-time-stamps_002c-automatic-file-"
"timestamps\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-modification-"
"dates\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-last-modified-time\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-time-stamps_002c-automatic-file-"
"timestamps\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-modification-"
"dates\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-last-modified-time\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Time-Stamps.html
msgid ""
"Having a time stamp in the text of a file ensures that the time the file was "
"written will be preserved even if the file is copied or transformed in a way "
"that loses the file system&rsquo;s modification time.  A time stamp may also "
"be called a date stamp or a last modified time.  You can arrange to have a "
"time stamp in a file update automatically each time you save the file."
msgstr ""
"ファイルの本文にタイムスタンプを付与しておけば、ファイルがコピーされたり、"
"ファイルシステムの更新日時が失われるような処理が行われたりしても、ファイルが"
"作成された時刻が保持されます。タイムスタンプは、日付スタンプや最終更新日時と"
"呼ばれることもあります。また、ファイルを保存するたびにタイムスタンプが自動的"
"に更新されるように設定することも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Time-Stamps.html
msgid ""
"There are two steps to setting up automatic time stamping.  First, the file "
"needs a time stamp template.  By default, the template occurs somewhere in "
"the first eight lines and looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"自動タイムスタンプを設定するには、2つの手順があります。まず、ファイルにタイム"
"スタンプテンプレートが必要です。デフォルトでは、テンプレートは最初の8行のどこ"
"かに配置されており、次のような形式になっています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Time-Stamps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Time-stamp: &lt;&gt;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Time-Stamps.html
msgid "or (your choice) like this:"
msgstr "または（お好みで）次のように："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Time-Stamps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Time-stamp: &quot; &quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Time-Stamps.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-time_002dstamp\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-time_002dstamp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Time-Stamps.html
msgid ""
"With that template in place, you can update the current buffer&rsquo;s time "
"stamp once immediately with the command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x time-stamp</"
"kbd>.  The Emacs editor will check for a template; if a template is found, "
"Emacs will write the current date, time, author, and/or other info between "
"the angle brackets or quotes.  After the first time stamp, the line might "
"look like this:"
msgstr ""
"このテンプレートを用意しておけば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x time-stamp</kbd> コ"
"マンドを使って現在のバッファのタイムスタンプを即座に1回だけ更新できます。"
"Emacsエディタはテンプレートの有無を確認し、テンプレートが見つかった場合は、現"
"在の日付、時刻、作成者、および／またはその他の情報を山括弧や引用符の間に書き"
"込みます。最初のタイムスタンプが設定された後、行は次のようになる場合がありま"
"す："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Time-Stamps.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Time-stamp: &lt;1993-07-06 11:05:14 terryg&gt;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Time-Stamps.html
msgid ""
"Second, configure your Emacs to run <code class=\"code\">time-stamp</code> "
"whenever it saves a file, by adding <code class=\"code\">time-stamp</code> "
"to <code class=\"code\">before-save-hook</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
