"class=\"code\">tooltip-x-offset</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-tooltip_002dx_002doffset\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Tooltips.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-tooltip_002dy_002doffset\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">tooltip-y-offset</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-tooltip_002dy_002doffset\"> &para;</a></span>"
