#: build/html/emacs/Touchscreens.html
msgid ""
"Difficulties in making accurate adjustments to the region from the cursor "
"being physically obscured by the tool can be mitigated by indicating the "
"position of the point within the echo area.  If <code class=\"code\">touch-"
"screen-preview-select</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"line surrounding point is displayed in the echo area (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Echo-Area.html\">The Echo Area</a>)  during the motion of the tool, "
"below which is another line indicating the position of point relative to the "
"first."
msgstr ""
"工具によってカーソルが物理的に遮られることで、領域の正確な調整が困難になる問"
"題は、エコー領域内における点の位置を示すことで軽減できます。<code "
"class=\"code\">touch-screen-preview-select</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> でない場合、工具の移動中、点を囲む線がエコー領域"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Echo-Area.html\">エコー領域</a> を参照）に表示さ"
"れ、その下には最初の線に対する点の相対位置を示す別の線が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
