"class=\"dfn\">Pinching</em>, the placement of two tools apart on the screen "
"followed by adjustments to their position such as to increase or decrease "
"the distance between them will modify the text scale (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Text-Scale.html\">Text Scale</a>) in proportion to the change in that "
"distance."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-pinching_002c-touchscreens\"></a> <em "
