# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Traditional-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"&ldquo;Traditional&rdquo; methods of providing font-lock information are "
"based on regular-expression search and on syntactic analysis using syntax "
"tables built into Emacs.  This subsection describes the use and "
"customization of font-lock for major modes which use these traditional "
"methods."
msgstr ""
"「従来型」のfont-lock情報提供手法は、正規表現による検索と、Emacsに内蔵された"
"構文テーブルを用いた構文解析に基づいています。本節では、これらの従来型手法を"
"採用しているメジャーモードにおけるfont-lockの使用法とカスタマイズについて解説"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Traditional-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"font_002dlock_002dmaximum_002ddecoration\"></a>"
