#: build/html/emacs/Traditional-Font-Lock.html
msgid ""
"Font Lock highlighting patterns already exist for most modes, but you may "
"want to fontify additional patterns.  You can use the function <code "
"class=\"code\">font-lock-add-keywords</code>, to add your own highlighting "
"patterns for a particular mode.  For example, to highlight &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FIXME:</samp>&rsquo; words in C comments, use this:"
msgstr ""
