# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Transpose.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-t</kbd> transposes the word before point with the word "
"after point (<code class=\"code\">transpose-words</code>).  It moves point "
"forward over a word, dragging the word preceding or containing point forward "
"as well.  The punctuation characters between the words do not move.  For "
"example, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FOO,&nbsp;BAR</samp>&rsquo; transposes "
"into &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">BAR,&nbsp;FOO</samp>&rsquo; rather than "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">BAR&nbsp;FOO,</samp>&rsquo;.  When point is at "
"the end of the line, it will transpose the word before point with the first "
"word on the next line."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-t</kbd> は、ポイント前の単語とポイント後の単語（<code "
"class=\"code\">transpose-words</code>）を入れ替えます。ポイントを単語の前方へ"
"移動させ、ポイントに先行する、あるいはポイントを含む単語も併せて前方へドラッ"
"グします。単語間の句読点は移動しません。例えば、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOO,&nbsp;BAR</samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">BAR&nbsp;FOO,</samp>&rsquo; ではなく、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">BAR,&nbsp;FOO</samp>&rsquo; へと入れ替わります。ポイントが行末"
"にある場合、ポイント前の単語と次行の最初の単語が入れ替わります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Transpose.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-transpose_002dsentences\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-transpose_002dparagraphs\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-transpose_002dsentences\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-transpose_002dparagraphs\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Transpose.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-t</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">transpose-sexps</code>) "
"is a similar command for transposing two expressions (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Expressions.html\">Expressions with Balanced Parentheses</a>), and "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-t</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">transpose-lines</"
"code>) exchanges lines.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x transpose-sentences</kbd> "
"and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x transpose-paragraphs</kbd> transpose sentences "
"and paragraphs, respectively.  These commands work like <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"t</kbd> except as regards the units of text they transpose."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-t</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">transpose-sexps</code>) "
"は2つの式を転置するための同様のコマンドであり（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Expressions.html\">バランスの取れた括弧を持つ式</a>を参照）、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-t</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">transpose-lines</code>) は"
"行を入れ替えます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x transpose-sentences</kbd> と <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x transpose-paragraphs</kbd> は、それぞれ文と段落を転置しま"
"す。これらのコマンドは、転置するテキスト単位を除けば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"t</kbd> と同様に動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Transpose.html
msgid ""
"A numeric argument to a transpose command serves as a repeat count: it tells "
"the transpose command to move the character (or word or expression or line) "
"before or containing point across several other characters (or words or "
"expressions or lines).  For example, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u&nbsp;3&nbsp;C-t</"
"kbd> moves the character before point forward across three other "
"characters.  It would change &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">f&lowast;oobar</"
"samp>&rsquo; into &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">oobf&lowast;ar</samp>&rsquo;.  "
"This is equivalent to repeating <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-t</kbd> three times.  "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u - 4 M-t</kbd> moves the word before point backward "
"across four words.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u - C-M-t</kbd> would cancel the "
"effect of plain <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-t</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"転置コマンドの数値引数は繰り返し回数として機能します。これにより、転置コマン"
"ドはポイントの前にある文字（または単語、式、行）を、他の複数の文字（または単"
"語、式、行）にわたって移動させます。例えば、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"u&nbsp;3&nbsp;C-t</kbd> はポイントの前にある文字を、他の3つの文字にわたって前"
"方に移動させます。これにより、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">f&lowast;oobar</"
"samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">oobf&lowast;ar</samp>&rsquo; に変"
"わります。これは <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-t</kbd> を3回繰り返すのと同等です。"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u - 4 M-t</kbd> はポイントの前にある単語を、4つの単語に"
"わたって後方に移動させます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u - C-M-t</kbd> は、単純な "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-t</kbd> の効果を打ち消します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Transpose.html
msgid ""
"A numeric argument of zero is assigned a special meaning (because otherwise "
"a command with a repeat count of zero would do nothing): to transpose the "
"character (or word or expression or line) ending after point with the one "
"ending after the mark.  So to convert, say, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Bob "
"and Mary</samp>&rsquo; into &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Mary and Bob</"
"samp>&rsquo;, set the mark on &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Bob</samp>&rsquo; "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Setting-Mark.html\">Setting the Mark</a>), "
"then move point to &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Mary</samp>&rsquo;, and then "
"type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u 0 M-t</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"数値引数に 0 を指定すると、特別な意味を持ちます（そうしないと、繰り返し回数"
"が 0 のコマンドは何も行わないためです）。これは、ポイントの後で終わる文字（ま"
"たは単語、式、行）を、マークの後で終わる文字と転置させるというものです。した"
"がって、例えば &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Bob and Mary</samp>&rsquo; を "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Mary and Bob</samp>&rsquo; に変換するには、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Bob</samp>&rsquo; にマークを設定し（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Setting-Mark.html\">マークの設定</a>を参照）、次にポイ"
"ントを &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Mary</samp>&rsquo; に移動させ、最後に "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u 0 M-t</kbd> と入力します。"

