# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Two_002dColumn.html
msgid ""
"Split the current buffer, which contains two-column text, into two buffers, "
"and display them side by side (<code class=\"code\">2C-split</code>).  The "
"current buffer becomes the left-hand buffer, but the text in the right-hand "
"column is moved into the right-hand buffer.  The current column specifies "
"the split point.  Splitting starts with the current line and continues to "
"the end of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"2列のテキストを含む現在のバッファを2つのバッファに分割し、左右に並べて表示し"
"ます (<code class=\"code\">2C-split</code>)。現在のバッファは左側のバッファに"
"なりますが、右側の列のテキストは右側のバッファに移動します。現在の列が分割位"
"置を指定します。分割は現在の行から始まり、バッファの末尾まで続きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Two_002dColumn.html
msgid ""
"This command is appropriate when you have a buffer that already contains two-"
"column text, and you wish to separate the columns temporarily."
msgstr ""
"このコマンドは、すでに2段組のテキストが含まれているバッファがあり、一時的に段"
"を分けたい場合に適しています。"

