#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Two_002dColumn.html
msgid ""
"Enter two-column mode using the current buffer as the left-hand buffer, and "
"using buffer <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> as the right-hand buffer (<code "
"class=\"code\">2C-associate-buffer</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在のバッファを左バッファ、バッファ <var class=\"var\">buffer</var> を右バッ"
"ファ (<code class=\"code\">2C-associate-buffer</code>) として2列モードに入り"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Two_002dColumn.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">F2</kbd> s</kbd> or <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x 6 s</kbd> looks for a column separator, which is a string "
"that appears on each line between the two columns.  You can specify the "
"width of the separator with a numeric argument to <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">F2</kbd> s</kbd>; that many characters, before point, "
"constitute the separator string.  By default, the width is 1, so the column "
"separator is the character before point."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">F2</kbd> s</kbd> または <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x 6 s</kbd> は列区切り文字を探します。これは、2つの列の間の各"
"行に現れる文字列です。<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">F2</kbd> s</kbd> "
"に数値引数を指定することで区切り文字の幅を指定でき、ポイント前のその文字数分"
"が区切り文字文字列となります。デフォルトでは幅は 1 であるため、列区切り文字は"
"ポイント前の文字になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Two_002dColumn.html
msgid ""
"When a line has the separator at the proper place, <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">F2</kbd> s</kbd> puts the text after the separator into the "
"right-hand buffer, and deletes the separator.  Lines that don&rsquo;t have "
"the column separator at the proper place remain unsplit; they stay in the "
"left-hand buffer, and the right-hand buffer gets an empty line to "
"correspond.  (This is the way to write a line that spans both columns while "
"in two-column mode: write it in the left-hand buffer, and put an empty line "
"in the right-hand buffer.)"
msgstr ""
"行の適切な位置に区切り文字がある場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">F2</kbd> s</kbd> は区切り文字以降のテキストを右バッファに格納"
"し、区切り文字を削除します。適切な位置に列区切り文字がない行は分割されず、左"
"バッファに残り、右バッファにはそれに対応する空行が格納されます。（これは、2段"
"組モードで両列にまたがる行を記述する方法です。左バッファに記述し、右バッファ"
"に空行を挿入します。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Two_002dColumn.html
msgid ""
