# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Two_002dColumn.html
msgid ""
"The command <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">F2</kbd> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 6 <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">2C-newline</code>) "
"inserts a newline in each of the two buffers at corresponding positions.  "
"This is the easiest way to add a new line to the two-column text while "
"editing it in split buffers."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">F2</kbd> <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 6 <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> (<code class=\"code\">2C-newline</code>) は、2"
"つのバッファの対応する位置にそれぞれ改行を挿入します。これは、分割バッファで"
"編集しながら2段組のテキストに改行を追加する最も簡単な方法です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Two_002dColumn.html
