# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Two_002dColumn.html
msgid ""
"When you have edited both buffers as you wish, merge them with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">F2</kbd> 1</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"6 1</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">2C-merge</code>).  This copies the text from "
"the right-hand buffer as a second column in the other buffer.  To go back to "
"two-column editing, use <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">F2</kbd> s</"
"kbd>."
msgstr ""
"両方のバッファを任意に編集したら、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">F2</"
"kbd> 1</kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x 6 1</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">2C-merge</code>) でマージします。これにより、右側のバッファの"
"テキストが、もう一方のバッファの2列目にコピーされます。2列編集に戻るには、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">F2</kbd> s</kbd> を使用してください。"

