# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Unconditional-Replace.html
msgid ""
"Replace every occurrence of <var class=\"var\">string</var> with <var "
"class=\"var\">newstring</var>."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">string</var> をすべて <var class=\"var\">newstring</var> "
"に置換してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Unconditional-Replace.html
msgid ""
"To replace every instance of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; "
"after point with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">bar</samp>&rsquo;, use the "
"command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x replace-string</kbd> with the two arguments "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">bar</samp>&rsquo;.  Replacement happens only in the text "
"after point, so if you want to cover the whole buffer you must go to the "
"beginning first.  All occurrences up to the end of the buffer are replaced; "
"to limit replacement to part of the buffer, activate the region around that "
"part.  When the region is active, replacement is limited to the region (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Mark.html\">The Mark and the Region</a>)."
msgstr ""
"ポイント以降の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; をすべて &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">bar</samp>&rsquo; に置換するには、2つの引数 &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">foo</samp>&rsquo; と &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">bar</"
"samp>&rsquo; を指定してコマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x replace-string</kbd> "
"を実行します。置換はポイント以降のテキストに対してのみ行われるため、バッファ"
"全体を対象とする場合は、まず先頭まで移動する必要があります。バッファの末尾ま"
"でのすべての出現箇所が置換されます。置換範囲をバッファの一部に限定するには、"
"その部分の周辺をリージョンとしてアクティブにします。リージョンがアクティブな"
"状態では、置換はそのリージョン内に限定されます（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Mark.html\">マークとリージョン</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Unconditional-Replace.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">replace-string</code> exits, it leaves point at "
"the last occurrence replaced.  It adds the prior position of point (where "
"the <code class=\"code\">replace-string</code> command was issued) to the "
"mark ring, without activating the mark; use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> to move back there.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Mark-Ring.html\">The Mark Ring</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">replace-string</code> が終了すると、最後に置換が行われた"
"時点の point の位置を離れます。mark を有効にすることなく、point の直前の位置"
"（<code class=\"code\">replace-string</code> コマンドが発行された位置）を "
"mark ring に追加します。そこへ戻るには <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> を使用してください。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Mark-Ring.html\">マークリング</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Unconditional-Replace.html
msgid ""
"A prefix argument restricts replacement to matches that are surrounded by "
"word boundaries."
msgstr ""
"接頭辞引数を指定すると、置換対象が単語境界に囲まれた一致箇所に限定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Unconditional-Replace.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Replacement-and-Lax-Matches.html\">Replace "
"Commands and Lax Matches</a>, for details about case-sensitivity and "
"character folding in replace commands."
msgstr ""
