# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Unintegrated-Changes.html
msgid ""
"Type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v T D</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">vc-root-diff-"
"unintegrated</code>) to display a summary of all these changes, committed "
"and uncommitted.  This summary is in the form of a diff of what committing "
"and pushing (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Pulling-_002f-"
"Pushing.html\">Pulling/Pushing Changes into/from a Branch</a>) all these "
"changes would do to the upstream repository.  You can use <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x v T =</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">vc-diff-unintegrated</"
"code>) instead to limit the display of changes to the current VC fileset.  "
"(The difference between <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;v&nbsp;T&nbsp;D</kbd> "
"and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;v&nbsp;T&nbsp;=</kbd> is like the difference "
"between <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v D</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v =</"
"kbd> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Old-Revisions.html\">Examining And "
"Comparing Old Revisions</a>).)<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF21\" "
"href=\"#FOOT21\"><sup>21</sup></a>"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v T D</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">vc-root-diff-"
"unintegrated</code>) を指定すると、コミット済みおよび未コミットのこれらすべて"
"の変更の概要が表示されます。この概要は、これらすべての変更をコミットおよび"
"プッシュ（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Pulling-_002f-Pushing.html\">ブランチへの"
"変更のプル/プッシュ</a>を参照）した場合に、アップストリームリポジトリにどのよ"
"うな影響が出るかを差分形式で示したものです。代わりに <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"v T =</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">vc-diff-unintegrated</code>) を使用すると、"
"表示する変更を現在のVCファイルセットに限定できます。（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x&nbsp;v&nbsp;T&nbsp;D</kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;v&nbsp;T&nbsp;=</"
"kbd> の違いは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v D</kbd> と <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v "
"=</kbd> の違いと同様です（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Old-Revisions.html\">古い"
"リビジョンの確認と比較</a>を参照）。）<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF21\" "
"href=\"#FOOT21\"><sup>21</sup></a>"

