# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Unintegrated-Changes.html
msgid ""
"Another point of comparison is that these commands are like <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x&nbsp;v&nbsp;O&nbsp;=</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">vc-"
"fileset-diff-outgoing</code>)  and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v O D</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">vc-root-diff-outgoing</code>) except that they include "
"uncommitted changes in the reported diffs.  Like those other commands, you "
"can use a prefix argument to specify a particular upstream location."
msgstr ""
"もう一つの比較点は、これらのコマンドが <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x&nbsp;v&nbsp;O&nbsp;=</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">vc-fileset-diff-outgoing</"
"code>) や <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v O D</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">vc-root-"
"diff-outgoing</code>) と同様であるものの、報告される差分に未コミットの変更が"
"含まれている点です。他のコマンドと同様に、プレフィックス引数を使用して特定の"
"アップストリームの場所を指定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h5>
