#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Uniquify.html
msgid ""
"<span>21.7.1 Making Buffer Names Unique<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Making-Buffer-Names-Unique\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>21.7.1 バッファ名を一意にする<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Making-"
"Buffer-Names-Unique\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Uniquify.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unique-buffer-names\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-directories-in-buffer-names\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-unique-buffer-names\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-directories-in-buffer-names\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Uniquify.html
msgid ""
"When several buffers visit identically-named files, Emacs must give the "
"buffers distinct names.  The default method adds a suffix based on the names "
"of the directories that contain the files.  For example, if you visit files "
"<samp class=\"file\">/foo/bar/mumble/name</samp> and <samp class=\"file\">/"
"baz/quux/mumble/name</samp> at the same time, their buffers will be named "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">name&lt;bar/mumble&gt;</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">name&lt;quux/mumble&gt;</samp>&rsquo;, respectively.  "
"Emacs adds as many directory parts as are needed to make a unique name."
msgstr ""
"複数のバッファが同一名称のファイルを参照する場合、Emacsは各バッファに異なる名"
"称を付与する必要があります。デフォルトの手法では、ファイルが格納されている"
"ディレクトリ名に基づいた接尾辞が付加されます。例えば、ファイル <samp "
"class=\"file\">/foo/bar/mumble/name</samp> と <samp class=\"file\">/baz/quux/"
"mumble/name</samp> を同時に参照した場合、それぞれのバッファ名は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">name&lt;bar/mumble&gt;</samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">name&lt;quux/mumble&gt;</samp>&rsquo; となります。Emacsは、一"
"意の名称にするために必要な数だけディレクトリ名の部分を付加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Uniquify.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"uniquify_002dbuffer_002dname_002dstyle\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"uniquify_002dbuffer_002dname_002dstyle\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Uniquify.html
msgid ""
"You can choose from several different styles for constructing unique buffer "
"names, by customizing the option <code class=\"code\">uniquify-buffer-name-"
"style</code>."
msgstr ""
"オプション <code class=\"code\">uniquify-buffer-name-style</code> をカスタマ"
"イズすることで、一意のバッファ名を生成するためのさまざまなスタイルから選択で"
"きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Uniquify.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">forward</code> naming method includes part of the "
"file&rsquo;s directory name at the beginning of the buffer name; using this "
"method, buffers visiting the files <samp class=\"file\">/u/rms/tmp/Makefile</"
"samp> and <samp class=\"file\">/usr/projects/zaphod/Makefile</samp> would be "
"named &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">tmp/Makefile</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">zaphod/Makefile</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">forward</code> という命名方式では、バッファ名の先頭に"
"ファイルのディレクトリ名の一部が含まれます。この方式を用いると、ファイル "
"<samp class=\"file\">/u/rms/tmp/Makefile</samp> と <samp class=\"file\">/usr/"
"projects/zaphod/Makefile</samp> を参照するバッファは、それぞれ &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">tmp/Makefile</samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">zaphod/Makefile</samp>&rsquo; と名付けられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Uniquify.html
msgid ""
"In contrast, the <code class=\"code\">post-forward</code> naming method "
"would call the buffers &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Makefile|tmp</"
"samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Makefile|zaphod</samp>&rsquo;.  "
"The default method <code class=\"code\">post-forward-angle-brackets</code> "
"is like <code class=\"code\">post-forward</code>, except that it encloses "
"the unique path in angle brackets.  The <code class=\"code\">reverse</code> "
"naming method would call them &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Makefile\\tmp</"
"samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Makefile\\zaphod</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  The nontrivial difference between <code class=\"code\">post-"
"forward</code> and <code class=\"code\">reverse</code> occurs when just one "
"directory name is not enough to distinguish two files; then <code "
"class=\"code\">reverse</code> puts the directory names in reverse order, so "
"that <samp class=\"file\">/top/middle/file</samp> becomes &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">file\\middle\\top</samp>&rsquo;, while <code "
"class=\"code\">post-forward</code> puts them in forward order after the file "
"name, as in &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">file|top/middle</samp>&rsquo;.  If "
"<code class=\"code\">uniquify-buffer-name-style</code> is set to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the buffer names simply get &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&lt;2&gt;</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;3&gt;"
"</samp>&rsquo;, etc. appended."
msgstr ""
"これに対し、<code class=\"code\">post-forward</code> という命名方式では、バッ"
"ファを &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Makefile|tmp</samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Makefile|zaphod</samp>&rsquo; と呼びます。デフォルト方式"
"の <code class=\"code\">post-forward-angle-brackets</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">post-forward</code> と同様ですが、一意のパスを山括弧で囲む点が"
"異なります。<code class=\"code\">reverse</code> という命名方式では、これらを "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Makefile\\tmp</samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Makefile\\zaphod</samp>&rsquo; と呼びます。<code "
"class=\"code\">post-forward</code> と <code class=\"code\">reverse</code> の"
"本質的な違いは、ディレクトリ名1つだけでは2つのファイルを区別できない場合に生"
"じます。このとき、<code class=\"code\">reverse</code> はディレクトリ名を逆順"
"に並べるため、<samp class=\"file\">/top/middle/file</samp> は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">file\\middle\\top</samp>&rsquo; となります。一方、<code "
"class=\"code\">post-forward</code> はファイル名の後に順に並べるため、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">file|top/middle</samp>&rsquo; のようになります。もし "
"<code class=\"code\">uniquify-buffer-name-style</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定されている場合、バッファ名には単に &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">&lt;2&gt;</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&lt;3&gt;</samp>&rsquo; などが付加されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Uniquify.html
msgid ""
"The value of <code class=\"code\">uniquify-buffer-name-style</code> can be "
"set to a customized function with two arguments <var class=\"var\">base</"
"var> and <var class=\"var\">extra-strings</var> where <var "
"class=\"var\">base</var> is a string and <var class=\"var\">extra-strings</"
"var> is a list of strings.  For example the current implementation for <code "
"class=\"code\">post-forward-angle-brackets</code> could be:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">uniquify-buffer-name-style</code> の値には、2つの引数 "
"<var class=\"var\">base</var> と <var class=\"var\">extra-strings</var> を持"
"つカスタム関数を指定できます。ここで <var class=\"var\">base</var> は文字列、"
"<var class=\"var\">extra-strings</var> は文字列のリストです。例えば、<code "
"class=\"code\">post-forward-angle-brackets</code> の現在の実装は以下のように"
"なります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Uniquify.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun my-post-forward-angle-brackets (base extra-string)\n"
"  (concat base \\&quot;&lt;\\&quot; (mapconcat #'identity extra-string \\&quot;/\\&quot;) \\&quot;&gt;\\&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Uniquify.html
msgid ""
"Which rule to follow for putting the directory names in the buffer name is "
"not very important if you are going to <em class=\"emph\">look</em> at the "
"buffer names before you type one.  But as an experienced user, if you know "
"the rule, you won&rsquo;t have to look.  And then you may find that one rule "
"or another is easier for you to remember and apply quickly."
msgstr ""
"バッファ名を入力する前にその名前を<em class=\"emph\">確認</em>するのであれ"
"ば、バッファ名をバッファ名に格納する際のルールをどれにすべきかは、それほど重"
"要ではありません。しかし、経験豊富なユーザーであれば、そのルールを知っていれ"
"ば確認する必要はありません。そして、あるルールの方が覚えやすく、素早く適用で"
"きることに気づくかもしれません。"

