# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Useless-Whitespace.html
msgid ""
"It is easy to leave unnecessary spaces at the end of a line, or empty lines "
"at the end of a buffer, without realizing it.  In most cases, this <em "
"class=\"dfn\">trailing whitespace</em> has no effect, but sometimes it can "
"be a nuisance."
msgstr ""
"行末に不要なスペースを残したり、バッファの末尾に空行を残したりすることは、気"
"づかないうちに起こりがちです。ほとんどの場合、この<em class=\"dfn\">末尾の空"
"白</em>は影響を及ぼしませんが、時には厄介なこともあります。"

