"kinds of whitespace visualized are determined by the list variable <code "
"class=\"code\">whitespace-style</code>.  Individual elements in that list "
"can be toggled on or off in the current buffer by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x&nbsp;whitespace-toggle-options</kbd>.  Here is a partial "
"list of possible elements (see the variable&rsquo;s documentation for the "
"full list):"
