# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/User-Input.html
msgid ""
"Keyboard input into Emacs is based on a heavily-extended version of <abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>.  Simple characters, like &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">B</samp>&rsquo;, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">3</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">=</"
"samp>&rsquo;, and the space character (denoted as <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</"
"kbd>), are entered by typing the corresponding key.  <em "
"class=\"dfn\">Control characters</em>, such as <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>, "
"<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd>, <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>, <kbd class=\"key\">F1</kbd>, <kbd "
"class=\"key\">Home</kbd>, and <kbd class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd>, are also "
"entered this way, as are certain characters found on non-English keyboards "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"International.html\">International Character "
"Set Support</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Emacsにおけるキーボード入力は、大幅に拡張された<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">ASCII</abbr>に基づいています。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">B</samp>&rsquo;、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">3</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">=</"
"samp>&rsquo;、およびスペース文字（<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>と表記）などの"
"単純な文字は、対応するキーを押すことで入力できます。<kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd>、<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd>、<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>、<kbd class=\"key\">F1</kbd>、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">Home</kbd>、<kbd class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd>といった<em "
"class=\"dfn\">制御文字</em>や、非英語圏のキーボードにある特定の文字（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"International.html\">国際文字セットのサポート</a>を参"
"照）も、同様に入力されます。"

