# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/User-Input.html
msgid ""
"Emacs also recognizes control characters that are entered using <em "
"class=\"dfn\">modifier keys</em>.  Two commonly-used modifier keys are <kbd "
"class=\"key\">Control</kbd> (usually labeled <kbd class=\"key\">Ctrl</kbd>), "
"and <kbd class=\"key\">Meta</kbd> (usually labeled <kbd class=\"key\">Alt</"
"kbd>)<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF3\" href=\"#FOOT3\"><sup>3</sup></a>.  "
"For example, <kbd class=\"kbd\">Control-a</kbd> is entered by holding down "
"the <kbd class=\"key\">Ctrl</kbd> key while pressing <kbd class=\"kbd\">a</"
"kbd>; we will refer to this as <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> for short.  "
"Similarly, <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">Meta</kbd>-a</kbd>, or <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd> for short, is entered by holding down the <kbd "
"class=\"key\">Alt</kbd> key and pressing <kbd class=\"kbd\">a</kbd>.  "
"Modifier keys can also be applied to non-alphanumerical characters, e.g., "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">F1</kbd></kbd> or <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、<em class=\"dfn\">修飾キー</em>を用いて入力される制御文字も認識しま"
"す。よく使われる修飾キーには、<kbd class=\"key\">Control</kbd>（通常は<kbd "
"class=\"key\">Ctrl</kbd>と表記）と<kbd class=\"key\">Meta</kbd>（通常は<kbd "
"class=\"key\">Alt</kbd>と表記）の2つがあります<a class=\"footnote\" "
"id=\"DOCF3\" href=\"#FOOT3\"><sup>3</sup></a>。例えば、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">Control-a</kbd>は<kbd class=\"key\">Ctrl</kbd>キーを押しながら"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">a</kbd>を押すことで入力でき、これを略して<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd>と呼びます。同様に、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">Meta</kbd>-a</kbd>（略して<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</kbd>）は、"
"<kbd class=\"key\">Alt</kbd>キーを押しながら<kbd class=\"kbd\">a</kbd>を押す"
"ことで入力できます。修飾キーは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">F1</"
"kbd></kbd>や<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">LEFT</kbd></kbd>のよう"
"に、英数字以外の文字にも適用可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/User-Input.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ESC-replacing-Meta-key\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ESC-replacing-Meta-key\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/User-Input.html
msgid ""
"You can also type Meta characters using two-character sequences starting "
"with <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd>.  Thus, you can enter <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-"
"a</kbd> by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> a</kbd>.  "
"You can enter <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-a</kbd> (holding down both <kbd "
"class=\"key\">Ctrl</kbd> and <kbd class=\"key\">Alt</kbd>, then pressing "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">a</kbd>) by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> C-a</kbd>.  Unlike <kbd class=\"key\">Meta</kbd>, "
"<kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> is entered as a separate character.  You "
"don&rsquo;t hold down <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> while typing the next "
"character; instead, press <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> and release it, then "
"enter the next character.  This feature is useful on certain text terminals "
"where the <kbd class=\"key\">Meta</kbd> key does not function reliably."
msgstr ""
"また、<kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> で始まる2文字のシーケンスを使用して、Meta"
"文字を入力することもできます。したがって、<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd "
"class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> a</kbd> と入力することで <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-a</"
"kbd> を入力できます。<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> C-a</"
"kbd> と入力することで、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-a</kbd>（<kbd "
"class=\"key\">Ctrl</kbd> と <kbd class=\"key\">Alt</kbd> を同時に押したまま "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">a</kbd> を押す）を入力できます。<kbd class=\"key\">Meta</"
"kbd> とは異なり、<kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> は独立した文字として入力されま"
"す。次の文字を入力する際に <kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> を押し続けるのではな"
"く、<kbd class=\"key\">ESC</kbd> を押してから離し、次に文字を入力します。この"
"機能は、<kbd class=\"key\">Meta</kbd> キーが確実に動作しない一部のテキスト端"
"末で有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
