#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"<span>13.3 Operating on the Region<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Operating-on-the-Region\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>13.3 リージョンでの運用<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Operating-on-"
"the-Region\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-operations-on-a-marked-region\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-operations-on-a-marked-region\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"Once you have a region, here are some of the ways you can operate on it:"
msgstr "リージョンを用意したら、以下のような操作が可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"Kill it with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-w</kbd> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Killing.html\">Killing and Moving Text</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-w</kbd> で打ち消します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Killing.html\">テキストの打ち消しと移動</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"Copy it to the kill ring with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-w</kbd> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Yanking.html\">Yanking</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-w</kbd> でキルリングにコピーします（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Yanking.html\">Yanking</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"Convert case with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-l</kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"C-u</kbd> (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Case.html\">Case Conversion "
"Commands</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-l</kbd> または <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-u</kbd> で大"
"文字・小文字を変換します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Case.html\">大文字・小文"
"字変換コマンド</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"Undo changes within it using <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-/</kbd> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Undo.html\">Undo</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-/</kbd> を使用して、その中の変更を取り消します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Undo.html\">Undo</a> を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"Replace text within it using <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-%</kbd> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Query-Replace.html\">Query Replace</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-%</kbd> を使用して、その中のテキストを置換します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Query-Replace.html\">クエリ置換</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"Indent it with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> or "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-\\</kbd> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Indentation.html\">Indentation</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd></kbd> または <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-M-\\</kbd> でインデントします（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Indentation.html\">インデント</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"Fill it as text with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x fill-region</kbd> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Filling.html\">Filling Text</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x fill-region</kbd> でテキストとして埋めます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Filling.html\">テキストの埋め込み</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"Check the spelling of words within it with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-$</kbd> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Spelling.html\">Checking and Correcting Spelling</"
"a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-$</kbd> を使用して、その中の単語のスペルを確認してくださ"
"い（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Spelling.html\">スペルの確認と修正</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"Evaluate it as Lisp code with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x eval-region</kbd> (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lisp-Eval.html\">Evaluating Emacs Lisp "
"Expressions</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x eval-region</kbd> を用いて Lisp コードとして評価します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Lisp-Eval.html\">Emacs Lisp 式の評価</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"Save it in a register with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r s</kbd> (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Registers.html\">Registers</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x r s</kbd> を持つレジスタに保存します（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Registers.html\">レジスタ</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"Save it in a buffer or a file (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Accumulating-"
"Text.html\">Accumulating Text</a>)."
msgstr ""
"バッファまたはファイルに保存します（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Accumulating-"
"Text.html\">テキストの蓄積</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"Some commands have a default behavior when the mark is inactive, but operate "
"on the region if the mark is active.  For example, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-$</"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">ispell-word</code>) normally checks the spelling "
"of the word at point, but it checks the text in the region if the mark is "
"active (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Spelling.html\">Checking and "
"Correcting Spelling</a>).  Normally, such commands use their default "
"behavior if the region is empty (i.e., if mark and point are at the same "
"position).  If you want them to operate on the empty region, change the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">use-empty-active-region</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"マークが非アクティブなときはデフォルトの動作をするが、マークがアクティブなと"
"きはリージョンに対して動作するコマンドがあります。例えば、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-$</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">ispell-word</code>) は通常、ポ"
"イントにある単語のスペルをチェックしますが、マークがアクティブな場合はリー"
"ジョン内のテキストをチェックします（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Spelling.html\">スペルのチェックと修正</a>を参照）。通常、このようなコ"
"マンドは、リージョンが空の場合（つまり、マークとポイントが同じ位置にある場"
"合）にはデフォルトの動作を行います。空のリージョンに対して動作させたい場合"
"は、変数 <code class=\"code\">use-empty-active-region</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> に変更してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-delete_002dactive_002dregion\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-delete_002dactive_002dregion\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Using-Region.html
msgid ""
"As described in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Erasing.html\">Erasing Text</a>, the "
"<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">backward-delete-char</"
"code>) and <kbd class=\"key\">Delete</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">delete-"
"forward-char</code>) commands also act this way.  If the mark is active, "
"they delete the text in the region.  (As an exception, if you supply a "
"numeric argument <var class=\"var\">n</var>, where <var class=\"var\">n</"
"var> is not one, these commands delete <var class=\"var\">n</var> characters "
"regardless of whether the mark is active).  If you change the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-active-region</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, then these commands don&rsquo;t act differently when the mark is "
"active.  If you change the value to <code class=\"code\">kill</code>, these "
"commands <em class=\"dfn\">kill</em> the region instead of deleting it (see "
"<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Killing.html\">Killing and Moving Text</a>)."
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"ref\" href=\"Erasing.html\">テキストの消去</a>で説明されている通"
"り、<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">backward-delete-char</"
"code>) および <kbd class=\"key\">Delete</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">delete-"
"forward-char</code>) コマンドも同様に動作します。マークが有効な場合、これらは"
"リージョン内のテキストを削除します。（例外として、<var class=\"var\">n</var> "
"が 1 ではない数値引数 <var class=\"var\">n</var> を指定した場合、これらのコマ"
"ンドはマークの有効・無効にかかわらず <var class=\"var\">n</var> 文字を削除し"
"ます）。変数 <code class=\"code\">delete-active-region</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に変更すると、これらのコマンドはマークが有効な場合"
"でも動作が変わりません。値を <code class=\"code\">kill</code> に変更すると、"
"これらのコマンドはリージョンを削除する代わりに <em class=\"dfn\">キル</em> し"
"ます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Killing.html\">テキストのキルと移動</a> を参"
"照）。"

