"vc_002droot_002ddiff_002doutgoing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"The closely related commands <code class=\"code\">vc-root-diff-incoming</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">vc-root-diff-outgoing</code> are the diff "
"analogues of <code class=\"code\">vc-root-log-incoming</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">vc-root-log-outgoing</code>.  These display diff buffers "
"reporting the changes that would be pulled or pushed.  You can use a prefix "
"argument here too to specify a particular remote location.  <code "
"class=\"code\">vc-root-diff-outgoing</code> is useful as a way to preview "
"your push and quickly check that all and only the changes you intended to "
"include were committed and will be pushed."
msgstr ""
"密接に関連するコマンド <code class=\"code\">vc-root-diff-incoming</code> と "
"<code class=\"code\">vc-root-diff-outgoing</code> は、<code "
"class=\"code\">vc-root-log-incoming</code> と <code class=\"code\">vc-root-"
"log-outgoing</code> の diff 版にあたります。これらは、プルまたはプッシュされ"
"る変更内容を報告する diff バッファを表示します。ここでもプレフィックス引数を"
"使用して、特定のリモートロケーションを指定できます。<code class=\"code\">vc-"
"root-diff-outgoing</code> は、プッシュ内容をプレビューし、含めるつもりだった"
"変更がすべて、かつそれ以外に何も含まれずにコミットされ、プッシュされることを"
"素早く確認するのに便利です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-vc_002ddiff_002dincoming\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-vc_002ddiff_002doutgoing\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-vc_002ddiff_002dincoming\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-vc_002ddiff_002doutgoing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"The commands <code class=\"code\">vc-diff-incoming</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">vc-diff-outgoing</code> are very similar.  They also display "
"changes that would be pulled or pushed.  The difference is that the diffs "
"reported are limited to the current fileset.  Don&rsquo;t forget that actual "
"pull and push operations always affect the whole working tree, not just the "
"current fileset."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <code class=\"code\">vc-diff-incoming</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">vc-diff-outgoing</code> は非常によく似ています。また、プルまた"
"はプッシュされる変更内容も表示されます。違いは、報告される差分が現在のファイ"
"ルセットに限定されている点です。実際のプルおよびプッシュ操作は、現在のファイ"
"ルセットだけでなく、常にワーキングツリー全体に影響を与えることを忘れないでく"
"ださい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-v-E-_003d\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-v-E-D\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-vc_002ddiff_002doutgoing_002dand_002dedited\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"vc_002droot_002ddiff_002doutgoing_002dand_002dedited\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-v-E-_003d\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-C_002dx-v-E-D\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-vc_002ddiff_002doutgoing_002dand_002dedited\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"vc_002droot_002ddiff_002doutgoing_002dand_002dedited\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Finally, there is also <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v E D</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">vc-root-diff-outgoing-and-edited</code>) which shows a "
"combined diff of all changes that would be pushed plus any uncommitted "
"changes.  It is useful to show all work that&rsquo;s present only locally.  "
"There is also <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v E =</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">vc-"
"diff-outgoing-and-edited</code>) which is the same but limited to the "
"current fileset."
msgstr ""
"最後に、プッシュ予定のすべての変更と未コミットの変更を合わせた差分を表示する "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v E D</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">vc-root-diff-"
"outgoing-and-edited</code>) もあります。これは、ローカルにのみ存在するすべて"
"の作業内容を表示する際に便利です。また、同様の機能で現在のファイルセットに限"
"定した <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v E =</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">vc-diff-"
"outgoing-and-edited</code>) もあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-VC-log-buffer_002c-commands-in\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-vc_002dlog-buffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-VC-log-buffer_002c-commands-in\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-vc_002dlog-buffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"In the <samp class=\"file\">*vc-change-log*</samp> buffer, you can use the "
"following keys to move between the logs of revisions and of files, and to "
"examine and compare past revisions (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Old-"
"Revisions.html\">Examining And Comparing Old Revisions</a>):"
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*vc-change-log*</samp> バッファでは、以下のキーを使用し"
"てリビジョンとファイルのログ間を移動したり、過去のリビジョンを確認・比較した"
"りできます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Old-Revisions.html\">過去のリビジョンの"
"確認と比較</a>を参照）："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Move to the previous revision entry (<code class=\"code\">log-view-msg-prev</"
"code>).  (Revision entries in the log buffer are usually in reverse-"
"chronological order, so the previous revision-item usually corresponds to a "
"newer revision.)  A numeric prefix argument is a repeat count."
msgstr ""
"直前のリビジョンエントリ (<code class=\"code\">log-view-msg-prev</code>) に移"
"動します。（ログバッファ内のリビジョンエントリは通常、逆時系列順に並んでいる"
"ため、直前のリビジョン項目は通常、より新しいリビジョンに対応します。）数値の"
"プレフィックス引数は繰り返し回数です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Move to the next revision entry (<code class=\"code\">log-view-msg-next</"
"code>).  A numeric prefix argument is a repeat count."
msgstr ""
"次のリビジョンエントリ (<code class=\"code\">log-view-msg-next</code>) に移動"
"します。数値のプレフィックス引数は繰り返し回数です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Annotate the revision on the current line (<code class=\"code\">log-view-"
"annotate-version</code>; see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Old-"
"Revisions.html\">Examining And Comparing Old Revisions</a>)."
msgstr ""
"現在の行のリビジョンに注釈を付けます（<code class=\"code\">log-view-annotate-"
"version</code>; <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Old-Revisions.html\">古いリビジョン"
"の確認と比較</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Modify the change comment displayed at point (<code class=\"code\">log-view-"
"modify-change-comment</code>).  Note that not all VC systems support "
"modifying change comments."
msgstr ""
"(<code class=\"code\">log-view-modify-change-comment</code>) の箇所に表示され"
"る変更コメントを変更します。なお、すべての VC システムが変更コメントの変更に"
"対応しているわけではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Visit the revision indicated at the current line (<code class=\"code\">log-"
"view-find-revision</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在の行に示されているリビジョン（<code class=\"code\">log-view-find-"
"revision</code>）を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Display a diff between the revision at point and the next earlier revision, "
"for the specific file (<code class=\"code\">log-view-diff</code>)."
msgstr ""
"特定のファイル（<code class=\"code\">log-view-diff</code>）について、時点のリ"
"ビジョンとそれより前の次のリビジョンとの差分を表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Display the changeset diff between the revision at point and the next "
"earlier revision (<code class=\"code\">log-view-diff-changeset</code>).  "
"This shows the changes to all files made in that revision."
msgstr ""
"時点のリビジョンと、その一つ前のリビジョン（<code class=\"code\">log-view-"
"diff-changeset</code>）とのチェンジセット差分を表示します。これにより、そのリ"
"ビジョンで行われたすべてのファイルへの変更内容が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Copy to the kill ring (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Kill-Ring.html\">The "
"Kill Ring</a>) the revision ID of the log entry at point, as if you had used "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-w</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">log-view-copy-revision-as-"
"kill</code>).  If several revisions are marked, the command copies to the "
"kill ring the IDs of all of them, separated by spaces."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-w</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">log-view-copy-revision-as-"
"kill</code>) を使用した場合と同様に、point にあるログエントリのリビジョンIDを"
"キルリング（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Kill-Ring.html\">キルリング</a> を参"
"照）にコピーします。複数のリビジョンがマークされている場合、このコマンドはそ"
"れらすべてのIDをスペース区切りでキルリングにコピーします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"In a compact-style log buffer (e.g., the one created by <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x v L</kbd>), toggle between showing and hiding the full log entry for the "
"revision at point (<code class=\"code\">log-view-toggle-entry-display</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"コンパクト形式のログバッファ（例：<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x v L</kbd> で作成され"
"たもの）において、位置 (<code class=\"code\">log-view-toggle-entry-display</"
"code>) にあるリビジョンのログエントリ全文の表示と非表示を切り替えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Show the full log entry like <kbd class=\"kbd\">RET</kbd> does, if relevant, "
"and also display the diff like <kbd class=\"kbd\">D</kbd> does, but without "
"selecting the window showing the diff (<code class=\"code\">log-view-display-"
"entry-and-diff</code>).  Never hides the full log entry text if it is "
"already shown."
msgstr ""
"該当する場合は、<kbd class=\"kbd\">RET</kbd> のようにログエントリ全文を表示"
"し、あわせて <kbd class=\"kbd\">D</kbd> のように差分も表示しますが、差分を表"
"示しているウィンドウは選択しません（<code class=\"code\">log-view-display-"
"entry-and-diff</code>）。ログエントリ全文が既に表示されている場合は、決して非"
"表示にしません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Like <kbd class=\"kbd\">p</kbd> followed by <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>: move to the previous entry, display it in "
"full if relevant, and display its diff (<code class=\"code\">log-view-msg-"
"and-diff-prev</code>).  A numeric prefix argument is a repeat count for the "
"movement part; at most one entry is displayed in full."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">p</kbd> の後に <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> が続く場合：前のエントリに移動し、該当すれば全"
"文を表示し、その差分 (<code class=\"code\">log-view-msg-and-diff-prev</"
"code>) を表示します。数値の接頭辞引数は移動部分の繰り返し回数であり、全文表示"
"されるエントリは最大で1件です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Like <kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> followed by <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>: move to the previous entry, display it in "
"full if relevant, and display its diff (<code class=\"code\">log-view-msg-"
"and-diff-next</code>).  A numeric prefix argument is a repeat count for the "
"movement part; at most one entry is displayed in full."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">n</kbd> の後に <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> が続く場合：前のエントリに移動し、該当すれば全"
"文を表示し、その差分 (<code class=\"code\">log-view-msg-and-diff-next</"
"code>) を表示します。数値の接頭辞引数は移動部分の繰り返し回数であり、全文表示"
"されるエントリは最大で1件です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Mark the entry at point (<code class=\"code\">log-view-mark-entry</code>)."
msgstr ""
"点 (<code class=\"code\">log-view-mark-entry</code>) にエントリをマークする。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Unmark the entry at point (<code class=\"code\">log-view-unmark-entry</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"点 (<code class=\"code\">log-view-unmark-entry</code>) のエントリのマークを解"
"除する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Unmark all marked entries (<code class=\"code\">log-view-unmark-all-entries</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"マーク済みのエントリ（<code class=\"code\">log-view-unmark-all-entries</"
"code>）のマークをすべて解除する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid ""
"Copy changes to a currently checked out branch; either the changes from the "
"revision at point, or the changes from all marked revisions (<code "
"class=\"code\">log-view-cherry-pick</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在チェックアウト中のブランチへの変更内容をコピーします。ポイントにあるリビ"
"ジョンの変更内容、またはマークされたすべてのリビジョンの変更内容（<code "
"class=\"code\">log-view-cherry-pick</code>）のいずれかとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Change-Log.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">R</kbd>"
