# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Ignore.html
msgid ""
"Ignore a file under current version control system.  (<code "
"class=\"code\">vc-ignore</code>)."
msgstr ""
"現在のバージョン管理システム下のファイルを無視する。  (<code "
"class=\"code\">vc-ignore</code>)."

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/VC-Ignore.html
msgid ""
