# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/View-Mode.html
msgid ""
"View mode is a minor mode that lets you scan a buffer by sequential "
"screenfuls.  It provides commands for scrolling through the buffer "
"conveniently but not for changing it.  Apart from the usual Emacs cursor "
"motion commands, you can type <kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> to scroll forward "
"one windowful, <kbd class=\"kbd\">S-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> or "
"<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> to scroll backward, and <kbd class=\"kbd\">s</"
"kbd> to start an incremental search."
msgstr ""
"ビューモードは、バッファを画面単位で順次スキャンできるマイナーモードです。"
"バッファ内を便利にスクロールするためのコマンドを提供しますが、バッファ自体を"
"変更する機能はありません。通常のEmacsのカーソル移動コマンドに加え、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> で1ウィンドウ分前方へ、<kbd class=\"kbd\">S-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> または <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> で後方へス"
"クロールし、<kbd class=\"kbd\">s</kbd> でインクリメンタル検索を開始できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/View-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-q-_0028View-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-e-_0028View-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-View_002dquit\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-View_002dexit\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-q-_0028View-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-e-_0028View-mode_0029\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-View_002dquit\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-View_002dexit\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/View-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">q</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">View-quit</code>) "
"disables View mode, and switches back to the buffer and position before View "
"mode was enabled.  Typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">e</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">View-exit</code>) disables View mode, keeping the current "
"buffer and position."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">q</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">View-quit</code>) と入力する"
"とビューモードが無効になり、ビューモードが有効になる前のバッファと位置に切り"
"替わります。<kbd class=\"kbd\">e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">View-exit</"
"code>) と入力すると、現在のバッファと位置を維持したままビューモードが無効にな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/View-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-view_002dbuffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-view_002dfile\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-view_002dbuffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-view_002dfile\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/View-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x view-buffer</kbd> prompts for an existing Emacs "
"buffer, switches to it, and enables View mode.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x view-"
"file</kbd> prompts for a file and visits it with View mode enabled."
msgstr ""
