# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Visual-Line-Mode.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-word-wrap\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-word-wrap\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Visual-Line-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Another alternative to ordinary line continuation (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Continuation-Lines.html\">Continuation Lines</a>) is to use <em "
"class=\"dfn\">word wrap</em>.  Here, each long logical line is divided into "
"two or more screen lines, or &ldquo;visual lines&rdquo;, like in ordinary "
"line continuation.  However, Emacs attempts to wrap the line at word "
"boundaries near the right window edge.  (If the line&rsquo;s direction is "
"right-to-left, it is wrapped at the left window edge instead.)  This makes "
"the text easier to read, as wrapping does not occur in the middle of words."
msgstr ""
"通常の行継続（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Continuation-Lines.html\">継続行</a>"
"を参照）に代わるもう一つの方法は、<em class=\"dfn\">ワードラップ</em>を使用す"
"ることです。ここでは、通常の行継続と同様に、各長い論理行が2つ以上の画面行、す"
"なわち「ビジュアル行」に分割されます。ただし、Emacsはウィンドウの右端付近で、"
"単語の境界に合わせて行を折り返そうとします。（行の方向が右から左の場合は、代"
"わりにウィンドウの左端で折り返されます。）これにより、単語の途中で折り返しが"
"発生しないため、テキストが読みやすくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Visual-Line-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mode_002c-Visual-Line\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Visual-Line-mode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-visual_002dline_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-global_002dvisual_002dline_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mode_002c-Visual-Line\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Visual-Line-mode\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-visual_002dline_002dmode\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-global_002dvisual_002dline_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Visual-Line-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Word wrap is enabled by Visual Line mode, an optional minor mode.  To turn "
"on Visual Line mode in the current buffer, type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"visual-line-mode</kbd>; repeating this command turns it off.  You can also "
"turn on Visual Line mode using the menu bar: in the Options menu, select the "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Line Wrapping in this Buffer</samp>&rsquo; "
"submenu, followed by the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Word Wrap (Visual Line "
"mode)</samp>&rsquo; menu item.  While Visual Line mode is enabled, the mode "
"line shows the string &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">wrap</samp>&rsquo; in the "
"mode display.  The command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x global-visual-line-mode</"
"kbd> toggles Visual Line mode in all buffers."
msgstr ""
"ワードラップは、オプションのマイナーモードであるVisual Lineモードによって有効"
"になります。現在のバッファでVisual Lineモードを有効にするには <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x visual-line-mode</kbd> と入力し、このコマンドを繰り返すと無"
"効になります。また、メニューバーからVisual Lineモードを有効にすることもできま"
"す。Optionsメニューで &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Line Wrapping in this "
"Buffer</samp>&rsquo; サブメニューを選択し、続いて &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Word Wrap (Visual Line mode)</samp>&rsquo; メニュー項目を選択"
"します。Visual Lineモードが有効な間、モードラインのモード表示には &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">wrap</samp>&rsquo; という文字列が表示されます。コマンド "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x global-visual-line-mode</kbd> は、すべてのバッファで"
"Visual Lineモードを切り替えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Visual-Line-Mode.html
msgid ""
"Since word wrap and line truncation (described in the previous section) are "
"contradictory, turning on <code class=\"code\">visual-line-mode</code> "
"disables line truncation."
msgstr ""
"ワードラップと行の切り捨て（前節で説明）は相反するため、<code "
"class=\"code\">visual-line-mode</code> をオンにすると行の切り捨てが無効になり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Visual-Line-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"beginning_002dof_002dvisual_002dline\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-end_002dof_002dvisual_002dline\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-next_002dlogical_002dline\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-previous_002dlogical_002dline\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"beginning_002dof_002dvisual_002dline\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-end_002dof_002dvisual_002dline\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-next_002dlogical_002dline\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-previous_002dlogical_002dline\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Visual-Line-Mode.html
msgid ""
"In Visual Line mode, some editing commands work on screen lines instead of "
"logical lines: <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">beginning-"
"of-visual-line</code>)  moves to the beginning of the screen line, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">end-of-visual-line</code>) "
"moves to the end of the screen line, and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-visual-line</code>) kills text to the end of the screen "
"line."
msgstr ""
"ビジュアルラインモードでは、一部の編集コマンドが論理行ではなくスクリーン行単"
"位で動作します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-a</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">beginning-"
"of-visual-line</code>) はスクリーン行の先頭に移動し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-e</"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">end-of-visual-line</code>) はスクリーン行の末尾に"
"移動し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kill-visual-line</"
"code>) はスクリーン行の末尾までのテキストを消去します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Visual-Line-Mode.html
msgid ""
"To move by logical lines, use the commands <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x next-"
"logical-line</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x previous-logical-line</kbd>.  "
"These move point to the next logical line and the previous logical line "
"respectively, regardless of whether Visual Line mode is enabled.  If you use "
"these commands frequently, it may be convenient to assign key bindings to "
"them.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Init-Rebinding.html\">Rebinding Keys in "
"Your Init File</a>."
msgstr ""
"論理行を移動するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x next-logical-line</kbd> および "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x previous-logical-line</kbd> コマンドを使用します。これ"
"らのコマンドは、ビジュアルラインモードの有効・無効にかかわらず、それぞれ次の"
"論理行と前の論理行にポイントを移動します。これらのコマンドを頻繁に使用する場"
"合は、キーバインドを割り当てると便利です。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Init-"
"Rebinding.html\">初期化ファイルでのキー再割り当て</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Visual-Line-Mode.html
msgid ""
"By default, word-wrapped lines do not display fringe indicators.  Visual "
"Line mode is often used to edit files that contain many long logical lines, "
"so having a fringe indicator for each wrapped line would be visually "
"distracting.  You can change this by customizing the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">visual-line-fringe-indicators</code>."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、折り返した行にフリンジインジケーターは表示されません。ビジュ"
"アルラインモードは、長い論理行を多く含むファイルの編集によく使用されるため、"
"折り返した各行にフリンジインジケーターが表示されると、視覚的な妨げになりま"
"す。変数 <code class=\"code\">visual-line-fringe-indicators</code> をカスタマ"
"イズすることで、この設定を変更できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Visual-Line-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"word_002dwrap_002dwhitespace_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"word_002dwrap_002dwhitespace_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Visual-Line-Mode.html
msgid ""
"By default, Emacs only breaks lines after whitespace characters like <kbd "
"class=\"key\">SPC</kbd> and <kbd class=\"key\">TAB</kbd>, but does not break "
"after whitespace characters like <kbd class=\"key\">EN QUAD</kbd>.  Emacs "
"provides a minor mode called <code class=\"code\">word-wrap-whitespace-mode</"
"code> that switches on word wrapping in the current mode, and sets up which "
"characters to wrap lines on based on the <code class=\"code\">word-wrap-"
"whitespace-characters</code> user option.  There&rsquo;s also a globalized "
"version of that mode called <code class=\"code\">global-word-wrap-whitespace-"
"mode</code>."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、Emacsは<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd>や<kbd class=\"key\">TAB</"
"kbd>のような空白文字の後でのみ行を折りますが、<kbd class=\"key\">EN QUAD</"
"kbd>のような空白文字の後には折りません。Emacsには、現在のモードでワードラッピ"
"ングを有効にし、<code class=\"code\">word-wrap-whitespace-characters</code>"
"ユーザーオプションに基づいてどの文字で行を折るかを設定する<code "
"class=\"code\">word-wrap-whitespace-mode</code>というマイナーモードが用意され"
"ています。また、このモードのグローバル版として<code class=\"code\">global-"
"word-wrap-whitespace-mode</code>もあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Visual-Line-Mode.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-word_002dwrap_002dby_002dcategory\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-modify_002dcategory_002dentry\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-char_002dcategory_002dset\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-category_002dset_002dmnemonics\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-word_002dwrap_002dby_002dcategory\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-modify_002dcategory_002dentry\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-char_002dcategory_002dset\"></a> "
