# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Watch-Expressions.html
msgid ""
"If the variable <code class=\"code\">gdb-use-colon-colon-notation</code> is "
"non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs uses the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">function</var>::<var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var></samp>&rsquo; format.  This allows the user to "
"display watch expressions which share the same variable name.  The default "
"value is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">gdb-use-colon-colon-notation</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacs は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\"><var class=\"var\">function</var>::<var "
"class=\"var\">variable</var></samp>&rsquo; 形式を使用します。これにより、ユー"
"ザーは同じ変数名を持つウォッチ式を表示できます。デフォルト値は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

