msgstr ""
"<span>30.1.1.1 解決対象となる課題の理解<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Understanding-the-Problems-it-Addresses\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Why-Version-Control_003f.html
msgid "Version control systems provide you with three important capabilities:"
msgstr "バージョン管理システムは、3つの重要な機能を提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Why-Version-Control_003f.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Reversibility</em>: the ability to back up to a previous "
"state if you discover that some modification you did was a mistake or a bad "
"idea."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">可逆性</em>：行った変更が間違いや不適切な判断だったと気づい"
"た際に、以前の状態に戻せること。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Why-Version-Control_003f.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Concurrency</em>: the ability to have many people "
"modifying the same collection of files knowing that conflicting "
"modifications can be detected and resolved."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">並行性</em>：競合する変更を検出・解決できることが前提で、多"
"くの人が同一のファイル群を変更できる能力。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Why-Version-Control_003f.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">History</em>: the ability to attach historical data to "
"your data, such as explanatory comments about the intention behind each "
"change.  Even for a programmer working solo, change histories are an "
"important aid to memory; for a multi-person project, they are a vitally "
"important form of communication among developers."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">履歴</em>: 各変更の意図に関する説明コメントなど、履歴データ"
"をデータに付加できる機能。単独で作業するプログラマーにとっても、変更履歴は記"
"憶を助ける重要な手段であり、複数人で取り組むプロジェクトにおいては、開発者間"
"の極めて重要なコミュニケーション手段となる。"

