#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h4>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Choice.html
msgid ""
"<span>22.6.1 How <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> works<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#How-display_002dbuffer-works\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>22.6.1 <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> の仕組み<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#How-display_002dbuffer-works\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Choice.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display_002dbuffer_002c-detailed-"
"description\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-display_002dbuffer_002c-detailed-"
"description\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Choice.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> command (as well as commands "
"that call it internally) chooses a window to display by following the steps "
"given below.  See <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Choosing-Window.html#Choosing-"
"Window\">Choosing a Window for Displaying a Buffer</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>, for details about how "
"to alter this sequence of steps."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer</code> コマンド（および内部的にこれを呼び"
"出すコマンド）は、以下に示す手順に従って表示するウィンドウを選択します。この"
"手順の変更方法の詳細については、<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp "
"Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Choosing-"
"Window.html#Choosing-Window\">Choosing a Window for Displaying a Buffer</a> "
"を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Choice.html
msgid ""
"If the buffer should be displayed in the selected window regardless of other "
"considerations, reuse the selected window.  By default, this step is "
"skipped, but you can tell Emacs not to skip it by adding a regular "
"expression matching the buffer&rsquo;s name together with a reference to the "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-same-window</code> action function (see "
"<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Functions.html#Buffer-Display-Action-"
"Functions\">Action Functions for Buffer Display</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>) to the option <code "
"class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> (see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Choosing-"
"Window.html#Choosing-Window\">Choosing a Window for Displaying a Buffer</a> "
"in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>).  For "
"example, to display the buffer <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> "
"preferably in the selected window write:"
msgstr ""
"他の条件に関わらず、選択したウィンドウにバッファを表示したい場合は、選択した"
"ウィンドウを再利用してください。デフォルトではこのステップはスキップされます"
"が、オプション <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> に、バッファ"
"名に一致する正規表現と <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-same-window</"
"code> アクション関数への参照（<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference "
"Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-"
"Functions.html#Buffer-Display-Action-Functions\">Action Functions for Buffer "
"Display</a> を参照）を追加することで、Emacs にこのステップをスキップさせない"
"ようにできます（<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> "
"の <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Choosing-Window.html#Choosing-Window\">Choosing a Window for "
"Displaying a Buffer</a> を参照）。例えば、バッファ <samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> を優先的に選択したウィンドウに表示するには、"
"次のように記述します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Choice.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setopt\n"
" display-buffer-alist\n"
" '((&quot;\\\\*scratch\\\\*&quot; (display-buffer-same-window))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Choice.html
msgid ""
"By default, <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-alist</code>は<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Choice.html
msgid ""
"Otherwise, if the buffer is already displayed in an existing window, reuse "
"that window.  Normally, only windows on the selected frame are considered, "
"but windows on other frames are also reusable if you use the corresponding "
"<code class=\"code\">reusable-frames</code> action alist entry (see <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Alists.html#Buffer-Display-Action-"
"Alists\">Action Alists for Buffer Display</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The "
"Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>).  See the next step for an example of "
"how to do that."
msgstr ""
"それ以外の場合、バッファがすでに既存のウィンドウに表示されているなら、その"
"ウィンドウを再利用してください。通常、選択中のフレームにあるウィンドウのみが"
"対象となりますが、対応する <code class=\"code\">reusable-frames</code> アク"
"ションアリスタのエントリを使用すれば、他のフレームにあるウィンドウも再利用可"
"能です（<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a "
"data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Buffer-Display-Action-Alists.html#Buffer-Display-Action-"
"Alists\">Action Alists for Buffer Display</a> を参照してください）。具体的な"
"方法については、次のステップの例をご覧ください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Choice.html
msgid ""
"Otherwise, optionally create a new frame and display the buffer there.  By "
"default, this step is skipped.  To enable it, change the value of the option "
"<code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code> (see <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Choosing-Window.html#Choosing-Window\">Choosing a Window for "
"Displaying a Buffer</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference "
"Manual</cite>) as follows:"
msgstr ""
"そうでない場合は、必要に応じて新しいフレームを作成し、そこにバッファを表示し"
"ます。デフォルトでは、このステップはスキップされます。有効にするには、オプ"
"ション <code class=\"code\">display-buffer-base-action</code> の値（<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Choosing-Window.html#Choosing-Window\">Choosing a Window for "
"Displaying a Buffer</a> を参照）を次のように変更します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Choice.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setopt\n"
" display-buffer-base-action\n"
" '((display-buffer-reuse-window display-buffer-pop-up-frame)\n"
"   (reusable-frames . 0)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Choice.html
msgid ""
"This customization will also try to make the preceding step search for a "
"reusable window on all visible or iconified frames."
msgstr ""
"このカスタマイズでは、直前のステップにおいて、表示されているすべてのフレーム"
"またはアイコン化されたフレームから再利用可能なウィンドウを検索するようにも試"
"みます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Choice.html
msgid ""
"Otherwise, try to create a new window by splitting a window on the selected "
"frame, and display the buffer in that new window.  <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-split_002dheight_002dthreshold\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-split_002dwidth_002dthreshold\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-split_002dwindow_002dpreferred_002ddirection\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-portrait-frame\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-landscape-frame\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"そうでない場合は、選択したフレーム上のウィンドウを分割して新しいウィンドウを"
"作成し、その新しいウィンドウにバッファを表示してみてください。  <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-split_002dheight_002dthreshold\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-split_002dwidth_002dthreshold\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"split_002dwindow_002dpreferred_002ddirection\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-portrait-frame\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"landscape-frame\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Choice.html
msgid ""
"The split can be either vertical or horizontal, depending on the variables "
"<code class=\"code\">split-height-threshold</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">split-width-threshold</code>.  These variables should have "
"integer values.  If <code class=\"code\">split-height-threshold</code> is "
"smaller than the chosen window&rsquo;s height, the split puts the new window "
"below.  Otherwise, if <code class=\"code\">split-width-threshold</code> is "
"smaller than the window&rsquo;s width, the split puts the new window on the "
"right.  If neither condition holds, Emacs tries to split so that the new "
"window is below&mdash;but only if the window was not split before (to avoid "
"excessive splitting).  Whether Emacs tries first to split vertically or "
"horizontally when both conditions hold is determined by the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">split-window-preferred-direction</code>.  Its default is "
"<code class=\"code\">longest</code>, which means to split vertically if the "
"window&rsquo;s frame is taller than it is wide (a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">portrait</em> frame), and split horizontally if its wider than "
"it&rsquo;s tall (a <em class=\"dfn\">landscape</em> frame).  The values "
"<code class=\"code\">vertical</code> and <code class=\"code\">horizontal</"
"code> always prefer, respectively, the vertical or the horizontal split."
msgstr ""
"分割は、変数 <code class=\"code\">split-height-threshold</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">split-width-threshold</code> に応じて、垂直または水平のいずれ"
"かになります。これらの変数には整数値を指定する必要があります。<code "
"class=\"code\">split-height-threshold</code> が選択したウィンドウの高さより小"
"さい場合、分割によって新しいウィンドウが下に配置されます。そうでない場合、つ"
"まり <code class=\"code\">split-width-threshold</code> がウィンドウの幅より小"
"さい場合は、新しいウィンドウが右側に配置されます。どちらの条件も満たさない場"
"合、Emacs は新しいウィンドウが下に来るように分割を試みます――ただし、これは"
"ウィンドウが以前に分割されていない場合に限ります（過剰な分割を避けるためで"
"す）。両方の条件が満たされた際に、Emacs がまず垂直分割を試みるか水平分割を試"
"みるかは、<code class=\"code\">split-window-preferred-direction</code> の値に"
"よって決まります。デフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">longest</code> であり、"
"これはウィンドウのフレームが幅よりも高さがある場合（<em class=\"dfn\">縦向き"
"</em>フレーム）は垂直分割を、高さよりも幅がある場合（<em class=\"dfn\">横向き"
"</em>フレーム）は水平分割を行うことを意味します。値 <code "
"class=\"code\">vertical</code> と <code class=\"code\">horizontal</code> は、"
"それぞれ常に垂直分割または水平分割を優先します。"

