# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Dividers.html
msgid ""
"On graphical displays, you can use <em class=\"dfn\">window dividers</em> in "
"order to separate windows visually.  Window dividers are bars that can be "
"dragged with the mouse, thus allowing you to easily resize adjacent windows."
msgstr ""
"グラフィカルディスプレイでは、<em class=\"dfn\">ウィンドウ区切り線</em>を使用"
"して、ウィンドウを視覚的に区分けできます。ウィンドウ区切り線はマウスでドラッ"
"グできるバーであり、これにより隣接するウィンドウのサイズを簡単に変更できま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Dividers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window_002ddivider_002dmode\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-window_002ddivider_002dmode\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Dividers.html
msgid ""
"To toggle the display of window dividers, use the command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x window-divider-mode</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウ区切り線の表示/非表示を切り替えるには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"window-divider-mode</kbd> コマンドを使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Dividers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"window_002ddivider_002ddefault_002dplaces\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"window_002ddivider_002ddefault_002dplaces\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Dividers.html
msgid ""
"To customize where dividers should appear, use the option <code "
"class=\"code\">window-divider-default-places</code>.  Its value should be "
"either <code class=\"code\">bottom-only</code> (to show dividers only on the "
"bottom of windows), <code class=\"code\">right-only</code> (to show dividers "
"only on the right of windows), or <code class=\"code\">t</code> (to show "
"them on the bottom and on the right)."
msgstr ""
"区切り線の表示位置をカスタマイズするには、オプション <code "
"class=\"code\">window-divider-default-places</code> を使用してください。その"
"値は、<code class=\"code\">bottom-only</code>（ウィンドウの下部にのみ区切り線"
"を表示）、<code class=\"code\">right-only</code>（ウィンドウの右側にのみ区切"
"り線を表示）、または <code class=\"code\">t</code>（下部と右側の両方に表示）"
"のいずれかに設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Dividers.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"window_002ddivider_002ddefault_002dbottom_002dwidth\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-window_002ddivider_002ddefault_002dright_002dwidth\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"window_002ddivider_002ddefault_002dbottom_002dwidth\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-window_002ddivider_002ddefault_002dright_002dwidth\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Dividers.html
msgid ""
"To adjust the width of window dividers displayed by this mode customize the "
"options <code class=\"code\">window-divider-default-bottom-width</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">window-divider-default-right-width</code>."
msgstr ""
"このモードで表示されるウィンドウ区切り線の幅を調整するには、オプション <code "
"class=\"code\">window-divider-default-bottom-width</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">window-divider-default-right-width</code> を設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Dividers.html
msgid ""
"When vertical scroll bars are disabled, dividers can be also useful to make "
"the first pixel column of a window visible, which would be otherwise covered "
"by the vertical border used to separate side-by-side windows (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Scroll-Bars.html\">Scroll Bars</a>)."
msgstr ""
"垂直スクロールバーが無効な場合、ウィンドウの最初のピクセル列を表示させるため"
"にディバイダーも有用です。そうしないと、横並びのウィンドウを区切る垂直ボー"
"ダーによってその列が隠れてしまいます（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Scroll-"
"Bars.html\">スクロールバー</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Window-Dividers.html
msgid ""
"For more details about window dividers see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Window-"
"Dividers.html#Window-Dividers\">Window Dividers</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"ウィンドウディバイダーの詳細については、<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp "
"Reference Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Window-Dividers.html#Window-"
"Dividers\">Window Dividers</a>を参照してください。"

