"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-font-properties-_0028MS-"
"Windows_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid "Optional font properties supported on MS-Windows are:"
msgstr ""
"MS-Windowsでサポートされているオプションのフォントプロパティは以下の通りで"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-font_002dweight_002dtable-_0028MS_002dWindows_0029\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">weight</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dweight_002dtable-_0028MS_002dWindows_0029\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-font_002dweight_002dtable-_0028MS_002dWindows_0029\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">weight</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dweight_002dtable-_0028MS_002dWindows_0029\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid ""
"Specifies the weight of the font.  Special values <code "
"class=\"code\">light</code>, <code class=\"code\">medium</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">demibold</code>, <code class=\"code\">bold</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">black</code> can be specified without <code "
"class=\"code\">weight=</code> (e.g., <kbd class=\"kbd\">Courier New-12:bold</"
"kbd>).  Otherwise, the weight should be a numeric value between 100 and 900, "
"or one of the named weights in <code class=\"code\">font-weight-table</"
"code>.  If unspecified, a regular font is assumed."
msgstr ""
"フォントの太さを指定します。<code class=\"code\">weight=</code> を使用せず"
"に、特殊な値 <code class=\"code\">light</code>、<code class=\"code\">medium</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">demibold</code>、<code class=\"code\">bold</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">black</code> を指定できます（例：<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">Courier New-12:bold</kbd>）。それ以外の場合、太さは 100 から "
"900 までの数値、または <code class=\"code\">font-weight-table</code> で定義さ"
"れている名前付きの太さのいずれかである必要があります。指定しない場合は、レ"
"ギュラーフォントとみなされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-font_002dslant_002dtable-_0028MS_002dWindows_0029\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">slant</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dslant_002dtable-_0028MS_002dWindows_0029\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-font_002dslant_002dtable-_0028MS_002dWindows_0029\"></"
"a><span><code class=\"code\">slant</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#index-font_002dslant_002dtable-_0028MS_002dWindows_0029\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid ""
"Specifies whether the font is italic.  Special values <code "
"class=\"code\">roman</code>, <code class=\"code\">italic</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">oblique</code> can be specified without <code "
"class=\"code\">slant=</code> (e.g., <kbd class=\"kbd\">Courier "
"New-12:italic</kbd>).  Otherwise, the slant should be a numeric value, or "
"one of the named slants in <code class=\"code\">font-slant-table</code>.  On "
"Windows, any slant above 150 is treated as italics, and anything below as "
"roman."
msgstr ""
"フォントが斜体であるかどうかを指定します。<code class=\"code\">slant=</code> "
"を省略して、特殊値 <code class=\"code\">roman</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">italic</code>、<code class=\"code\">oblique</code> を指定でき"
"ます（例：<kbd class=\"kbd\">Courier New-12:italic</kbd>）。それ以外の場合、"
"傾斜は数値、または <code class=\"code\">font-slant-table</code> で定義されて"
"いる名称付きの傾斜のいずれかを指定します。Windows では、150 を超える傾斜は斜"
"体として、それ未満はローマン体として扱われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">family</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">family</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid ""
"Specifies the font family, but normally this will be specified at the start "
"of the font name."
msgstr "フォントファミリーを指定しますが、通常はフォント名の先頭で指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">pixelsize</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">pixelsize</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid ""
"Specifies the font size in pixels.  This can be used instead of the point "
"size specified after the family name."
msgstr ""
"フォントサイズをピクセル単位で指定します。ファミリー名の後に指定するポイント"
"サイズの代わりに使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">adstyle</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">adstyle</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid ""
"Specifies additional style information for the font.  On MS-Windows, the "
"values <code class=\"code\">mono</code>, <code class=\"code\">sans</code>, "
"<code class=\"code\">serif</code>, <code class=\"code\">script</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">decorative</code> are recognized.  These are most "
"useful as a fallback with the font family left unspecified."
msgstr ""
"フォントの追加スタイル情報を指定します。MS-Windowsでは、<code "
"class=\"code\">mono</code>、<code class=\"code\">sans</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">serif</code>、<code class=\"code\">script</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">decorative</code> の値が認識されます。これらは、フォントファミ"
"リーが未指定の場合のフォールバックとして特に有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-w32_002dcharset_002dinfo_002dalist\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">registry</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"w32_002dcharset_002dinfo_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-w32_002dcharset_002dinfo_002dalist\"></a><span><code "
"class=\"code\">registry</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-"
"w32_002dcharset_002dinfo_002dalist\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid ""
"Specifies the character set registry that the font is expected to cover.  "
"Most TrueType and OpenType fonts will be Unicode fonts that cover several "
"national character sets, but you can narrow down the selection of fonts to "
"those that support a particular character set by using a specific registry "
"from <code class=\"code\">w32-charset-info-alist</code> here."
msgstr ""
"フォントがカバーすることが想定される文字セットレジストリを指定します。ほとん"
"どの TrueType および OpenType フォントは、複数の国別文字セットをカバーする "
"Unicode フォントですが、ここで <code class=\"code\">w32-charset-info-alist</"
"code> から特定のレジストリを指定することで、特定の文字セットをサポートする"
"フォントに絞り込むことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">spacing</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">spacing</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid ""
"Specifies how the font is spaced.  The <code class=\"code\">p</code> spacing "
"specifies a proportional font, and <code class=\"code\">m</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">c</code> specify a monospaced font."
msgstr ""
"フォントの間隔を指定します。<code class=\"code\">p</code> の間隔はプロポー"
"ショナルフォントを、<code class=\"code\">m</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">c</code> は等幅フォントを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Fonts.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">foundry</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">foundry</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
