"with code that expects it to be set, is set internally to <code "
"class=\"code\">raster</code> for bitmapped fonts, <code "
"class=\"code\">outline</code> for scalable fonts, or <code "
"class=\"code\">unknown</code> if the type cannot be determined as one of "
