#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-HOME.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-HOME-directory-on-MS_002dWindows\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-HOME-directory-on-MS_002dWindows\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-HOME.html
msgid ""
"The Windows equivalent of <code class=\"code\">HOME</code> is the <em "
"class=\"dfn\">user-specific application data directory</em>.  The actual "
"location depends on the Windows version; typical values are <samp "
"class=\"file\">C:\\Documents and Settings\\<var class=\"var\">username</"
"var>\\Application Data</samp> on Windows 2000 up to XP, <samp "
"class=\"file\">C:\\Users\\<var class=\"var\">username</"
"var>\\AppData\\Roaming</samp> on Windows Vista and later, and either <samp "
"class=\"file\">C:\\WINDOWS\\Application Data</samp> or <samp "
"class=\"file\">C:\\WINDOWS\\Profiles\\<var class=\"var\">username</"
"var>\\Application Data</samp> on Windows 9X/ME.  If this directory does not "
"exist or cannot be accessed, Emacs falls back to <samp class=\"file\">C:\\</"
"samp> as the default value of <code class=\"code\">HOME</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">HOME</code> に相当する Windows の項目は <em "
"class=\"dfn\">ユーザー固有のアプリケーションデータディレクトリ</em> です。実"
"際の場所は Windows のバージョンによって異なり、一般的な値は Windows 2000 か"
"ら XP までは <samp class=\"file\">C:\\Documents and Settings\\<var "
"class=\"var\">username</var>\\Application Data</samp>、Windows Vista 以降は "
"<samp class=\"file\">C:\\Users\\<var class=\"var\">username</"
"var>\\AppData\\Roaming</samp>、Windows 9X/ME では <samp class=\"file\">C:"
"\\WINDOWS\\Application Data</samp> または <samp class=\"file\">C:"
"\\WINDOWS\\Profiles\\<var class=\"var\">username</var>\\Application Data</"
"samp> となります。このディレクトリが存在しないかアクセスできない場合、Emacs "
"は <code class=\"code\">HOME</code> のデフォルト値として <samp "
"class=\"file\">C:\\</samp> を使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-HOME.html
msgid ""
"You can override this default value of <code class=\"code\">HOME</code> by "
"explicitly setting the environment variable <code class=\"env\">HOME</code> "
"to point to any directory on your system.  <code class=\"env\">HOME</code> "
"can be set either from the command shell prompt or from &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Properties</samp>&rsquo; dialog of &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">My Computer</samp>&rsquo;.  <code class=\"code\">HOME</code> "
"can also be set in the system registry, see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"MS_002dWindows-Registry.html\">The MS-Windows System Registry</a>."
msgstr ""
"環境変数 <code class=\"env\">HOME</code> を明示的に設定してシステム上の任意の"
"ディレクトリを指定することで、このデフォルト値 <code class=\"code\">HOME</"
"code> を上書きできます。<code class=\"env\">HOME</code> は、コマンドシェルの"
"プロンプトまたは <samp class=\"samp\">My Computer</samp> の &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Properties</samp>&rsquo; ダイアログから設定可能です。<code "
"class=\"code\">HOME</code> はシステムレジストリでも設定できます。詳細は <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"MS_002dWindows-Registry.html\">MS-Windows システムレジ"
"ストリ</a> を参照してください。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-HOME.html
msgid ""
"For compatibility with older versions of Emacs<a class=\"footnote\" "
"id=\"DOCF42\" href=\"#FOOT42\"><sup>42</sup></a>, if there is a file named "
"<samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> in <samp class=\"file\">C:\\</samp>, the "
"root directory of drive <samp class=\"file\">C:</samp>, and <code "
"class=\"env\">HOME</code> is set neither in the environment nor in the "
"Registry, Emacs will treat <samp class=\"file\">C:\\</samp> as the default "
"<code class=\"code\">HOME</code> location, and will not look in the "
"application data directory, even if it exists.  Note that only <samp "
"class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> is looked for in <samp class=\"file\">C:\\</"
"samp>; the older name <samp class=\"file\">_emacs</samp> (see below) is "
"not.  This use of <samp class=\"file\">C:\\.emacs</samp> to define <code "
"class=\"code\">HOME</code> is deprecated; Emacs will display a warning about "
"its use during startup."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-HOME.html
msgid ""
"Whatever the final place is, Emacs sets the internal value of the <code "
"class=\"env\">HOME</code> environment variable to point to it, and it will "
"use that location for other files and directories it normally looks for or "
"creates in your home directory."
msgstr ""
"最終的な場所がどこであれ、Emacsは環境変数 <code class=\"env\">HOME</code> の"
"内部値をその場所を指すように設定し、ホームディレクトリ内で通常参照したり作成"
"したりする他のファイルやディレクトリに対しても、その場所を使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-HOME.html
msgid ""
"You can always find out what Emacs thinks is your home directory&rsquo;s "
"location by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x d ~/ <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></"
"kbd>.  This should present the list of files in the home directory, and show "
"its full name on the first line.  Likewise, to visit your init file, type "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f ~/.emacs <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> "
"(assuming the file&rsquo;s name is <samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp>)."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x d ~/ <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> と入力すれば、"
"Emacsがホームディレクトリの場所として認識している箇所をいつでも確認できます。"
"これによりホームディレクトリ内のファイル一覧が表示され、1行目にそのフルパスが"
"示されます。同様に、initファイルを開くには <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f "
"~/.emacs <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> と入力してください（ファイル名が "
"<samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> であると想定した場合）。"

