"Usage-on-MS_002dWindows\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>I.7 MS-Windowsでのマウス操作<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Mouse-"
"Usage-on-MS_002dWindows\"> &para;</a></span>"

