#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002c-and-MS_002dWindows\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mouse_002c-and-MS_002dWindows\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"This section describes the Windows-specific variables related to the mouse."
msgstr ""
"このセクションでは、マウスに関連する Windows 固有の変数について説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"w32_002dmouse_002dbutton_002dtolerance\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-simulation-of-middle-mouse-button\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"w32_002dmouse_002dbutton_002dtolerance\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-simulation-of-middle-mouse-button\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">w32-mouse-button-tolerance</code> "
"specifies the time interval, in milliseconds, for faking middle mouse button "
"press on 2-button mice.  If both mouse buttons are depressed within this "
"time interval, Emacs generates a middle mouse button click event instead of "
"a double click on one of the buttons."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">w32-mouse-button-tolerance</code> は、2ボタンマウス"
"で中ボタンの押下を擬似的に再現するための時間間隔（ミリ秒）を指定します。この"
"時間間隔内に両方のマウスボタンが押された場合、Emacs はいずれかのボタンのダブ"
"ルクリックではなく、中ボタンのクリックイベントを生成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"w32_002dpass_002dextra_002dmouse_002dbuttons_002dto_002dsystem\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"w32_002dpass_002dextra_002dmouse_002dbuttons_002dto_002dsystem\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"If the variable <code class=\"code\">w32-pass-extra-mouse-buttons-to-system</"
"code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs passes the fourth and "
"fifth mouse buttons to Windows."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">w32-pass-extra-mouse-buttons-to-system</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacs はマウスの第4・第5ボタンを "
"Windows に渡します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"w32_002dswap_002dmouse_002dbuttons\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"w32_002dswap_002dmouse_002dbuttons\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Mouse.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">w32-swap-mouse-buttons</code> controls "
"which of the 3 mouse buttons generates the <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> "
"events.  When it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (the default), the "
"middle button generates <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> and the right "
"button generates <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> events.  If this variable "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the roles of these two buttons are "
"reversed."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">w32-swap-mouse-buttons</code> は、3つのマウスボタン"
"のうちどれが <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> イベントを発生させるかを制御し"
"ます。これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code>（デフォルト）の場合、中央ボタン"
"が <kbd class=\"kbd\">mouse-2</kbd> を、右ボタンが <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">mouse-3</kbd> イベントを発生させます。この変数が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、これら2つのボタンの役割が入れ替わりま"
"す。"

