#: build/html/emacs/Windows-Printing.html
msgid ""
"Note that the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">net use</samp>&rsquo; command "
"requires the UNC share name to be typed with the Windows-style backslashes, "
"while the value of <code class=\"code\">printer-name</code> can be set with "
