# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Words.html
msgid ""
"The commands <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-f</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">forward-"
"word</code>) and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-b</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">backward-"
"word</code>) move forward and backward over words.  These <kbd "
"class=\"key\">Meta</kbd>-based key sequences are analogous to the key "
"sequences <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd>, "
"which move over single characters.  The analogy extends to numeric "
"arguments, which serve as repeat counts.  <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-f</kbd> with "
"a negative argument moves backward, and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-b</kbd> with a "
"negative argument moves forward.  Forward motion stops right after the last "
"letter of the word, while backward motion stops right before the first "
"letter."
msgstr ""
"コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-f</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">forward-word</"
"code>) および <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-b</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">backward-"
"word</code>) は、単語単位で前後に移動します。これらの <kbd "
"class=\"key\">Meta</kbd> ベースのキーシーケンスは、単一文字単位で移動するキー"
"シーケンス <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-f</kbd> および <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-b</kbd> "
"に相当します。この対応関係は、繰り返し回数として機能する数値引数にも及びま"
"す。負の引数を指定した <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-f</kbd> は後方に移動し、負の引数"
"を指定した <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-b</kbd> は前方に移動します。前方への移動は単"
"語の最後の文字の直後で停止し、後方への移動は最初の文字の直前で停止します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Words.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dd\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-kill_002dword\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dd\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-kill_002dword\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Words.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-d</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kill-word</code>) kills "
"the word after point.  To be precise, it kills everything from point to the "
"place <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-f</kbd> would move to.  Thus, if point is in the "
"middle of a word, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-d</kbd> kills just the part after "
"point.  If some punctuation comes between point and the next word, it is "
"killed along with the word.  (If you wish to kill only the next word but not "
"the punctuation before it, simply do <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-f</kbd> to get the "
"end, and kill the word backwards with <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd></kbd>.)  <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-d</kbd> takes "
"arguments just like <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-f</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-d</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kill-word</code>) は、"
"point 以降の単語を削除します。正確には、point から <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-f</"
"kbd> が移動する位置までのすべてを削除します。したがって、point が単語の途中に"
"ある場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-d</kbd> は point 以降の部分のみを削除します。"
"point と次の単語の間に句読点がある場合、その句読点も単語と共に削除されます。"
"（次の単語のみを削除し、その前にある句読点は削除したくない場合は、単純に "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-f</kbd> で末尾を取得し、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd></kbd> で単語を逆順に削除してください。）<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-d</kbd> は <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-f</kbd> と同様に引数を取りま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Words.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-backward_002dkill_002dword\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dDEL\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-backward_002dkill_002dword\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-M_002dDEL\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Words.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">backward-kill-word</code>) kills the word before point.  It "
"kills everything from point back to where <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-b</kbd> would "
"move to.  For instance, if point is after the space in &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOO,&nbsp;BAR</samp>&rsquo;, it kills &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOO,&nbsp;</samp>&rsquo;.  If you wish to kill just &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>&rsquo;, and not the comma and the space, use "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-b M-d</kbd> instead of <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd></kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">backward-kill-word</code>) は、point より前の単語を削除しま"
"す。また、point から <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-b</kbd> が移動する位置までのすべて"
"を削除します。例えば、point が &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FOO,&nbsp;BAR</"
"samp>&rsquo; のスペースの後にある場合、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FOO,&nbsp;"
"</samp>&rsquo; が削除されます。カンマやスペースではなく、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">FOO</samp>&rsquo; だけを削除したい場合は、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd></kbd> の代わりに <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-b M-d</kbd> を使用してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Words.html
msgid ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-t</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">transpose-words</code>) "
"exchanges the word before or containing point with the following word.  The "
"delimiter characters between the words do not move.  For example, &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">FOO,&nbsp;BAR</samp>&rsquo; transposes into &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">BAR,&nbsp;FOO</samp>&rsquo; rather than &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">BAR&nbsp;FOO,</samp>&rsquo;.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Transpose.html\">Transposing Text</a>, for more on transposition."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-t</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">transpose-words</code>) "
"は、ハイフンの前またはハイフンを含む単語を、次の単語と入れ替えます。単語間の"
"区切り文字は移動しません。例えば、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">FOO,&nbsp;BAR</"
"samp>&rsquo; は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">BAR&nbsp;FOO,</samp>&rsquo; では"
"なく、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">BAR,&nbsp;FOO</samp>&rsquo; へと転置されま"
"す。転置の詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Transpose.html\">テキスト"
"の転置</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
