"(<code class=\"code\">cal-html-cursor-year</code>).  By default, this "
"command writes files to a <var class=\"var\">year</var> subdirectory, where "
"<var class=\"var\">year</var> is the year at cursor&mdash;if this is "
"altered, some hyperlinks between years will not work."
