#: build/html/emacs/Writing-Calendar-Files.html
msgid ""
"If the variable <code class=\"code\">cal-html-print-day-number-flag</code> "
"is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then the monthly calendars show the "
"day-of-the-year number.  The variable <code class=\"code\">cal-html-year-"
