# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">Yanking</em> means reinserting text previously killed.  "
"The usual way to move or copy text is to kill it and then yank it elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">ヤンキング</em>とは、一度切り取ったテキストを再挿入すること"
"を指します。テキストを移動またはコピーする際の一般的な方法は、一度切り取り、"
"それを別の場所にヤンキングすることです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Yanking.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"Yank the last kill into the buffer, at point (<code class=\"code\">yank</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"最後のキルをバッファの座標 (<code class=\"code\">yank</code>) にヤンクする。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Yanking.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-y</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-y</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"Either replace the text just yanked with an earlier batch of killed text "
"(<code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code>), or allow selecting from the list of "
"previously-killed batches of text.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Earlier-"
"Kills.html\">Yanking Earlier Kills</a>."
msgstr ""
"直前にヤンクしたテキストを、以前に削除されたテキストバッチ（<code "
"class=\"code\">yank-pop</code>）で置き換えるか、あるいは以前に削除されたテキ"
"ストバッチの一覧から選択できるようにします。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Earlier-"
"Kills.html\">以前の削除内容のヤンク</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/Yanking.html
msgid "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-w</kbd>"
msgstr "<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-w</kbd>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Yanking.html
msgid ""
"Cause the following command, if it is a kill command, to append to the "
"previous kill (<code class=\"code\">append-next-kill</code>).  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Appending-Kills.html\">Appending Kills</a>."
msgstr ""
"以下のコマンドがキルコマンドである場合、直前のキル（<code "
"class=\"code\">append-next-kill</code>）に追記します。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Appending-Kills.html\">キルの追記</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Yanking.html
msgid ""
