# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Yes-or-No-Prompts.html
msgid ""
"An Emacs command may require you to answer a yes-or-no question during the "
"course of its execution.  Such queries come in two main varieties."
msgstr ""
"Emacsのコマンドによっては、実行中に「はい」か「いいえ」で答える質問を求められ"
"ることがあります。こうした問い合わせには、主に2つの種類があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Yes-or-No-Prompts.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-y-or-n-prompt\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-y-or-n-prompt\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Yes-or-No-Prompts.html
msgid ""
"For the first type of yes-or-no query, the prompt ends with &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(y&nbsp;or&nbsp;n)</samp>&rsquo;.  You answer the query by "
"typing a single key, either &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">y</samp>&rsquo; or "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">n</samp>&rsquo;, which immediately exits the "
"minibuffer and delivers the response.  For example, if you type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-w</kbd> (<kbd class=\"kbd\">write-file</kbd>) to save a "
"buffer, and enter the name of an existing file, Emacs issues a prompt like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"1種類目の「はい/いいえ」形式のクエリでは、プロンプトは &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(y&nbsp;or&nbsp;n)</samp>&rsquo; で終わります。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">y</samp>&rsquo; または &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">n</"
"samp>&rsquo; のいずれか1つのキーを入力することでクエリに回答でき、これにより"
"直ちにミニバッファが終了し、応答が返されます。例えば、バッファを保存するため"
"に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-w</kbd> (<kbd class=\"kbd\">write-file</kbd>) と"
"入力し、既存のファイル名を入力すると、Emacs は次のようなプロンプトを表示しま"
"す："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Yes-or-No-Prompts.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "File `foo.el' exists; overwrite? (y or n)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/Yes-or-No-Prompts.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-yes-or-no-prompt\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-yes_002dor_002dno_002dprompt\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-yes-or-no-prompt\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-yes_002dor_002dno_002dprompt\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Yes-or-No-Prompts.html
msgid ""
"The second type of yes-or-no query is typically employed if giving the wrong "
"answer would have serious consequences; it thus features a longer prompt "
"ending with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">(yes or no)</samp>&rsquo; (or the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">yes-or-no-prompt</code> if you&rsquo;ve "
"customized that).  For example, if you invoke <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x k</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code>) on a file-visiting buffer with "
"unsaved changes, Emacs activates the minibuffer with a prompt like this:"
msgstr ""
"2種類目の「はい/いいえ」形式のクエリは、通常、誤った回答をした場合に深刻な結"
"果を招く場合に用いられます。そのため、末尾に &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(yes or no)</samp>&rsquo; （またはカスタマイズした場合は "
"<code class=\"code\">yes-or-no-prompt</code> の値）が付く、より長いプロンプト"
"が特徴となります。例えば、未保存の変更があるファイル参照バッファに対して "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x k</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kill-buffer</code>) を呼"
"び出すと、Emacs は次のようなプロンプトとともにミニバッファを起動します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/Yes-or-No-Prompts.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Buffer foo.el modified; kill anyway? (yes or no)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Yes-or-No-Prompts.html
msgid ""
"To answer, you must type &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">yes</samp>&rsquo; or "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">no</samp>&rsquo; into the minibuffer, followed "
"by <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"回答するには、ミニバッファに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">yes</samp>&rsquo; ま"
"たは &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">no</samp>&rsquo; と入力し、続けて <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入力してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/Yes-or-No-Prompts.html
msgid ""
"With both types of yes-or-no query the minibuffer behaves as described in "
"the previous sections; you can recenter the selected window with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-l</kbd>, scroll that window (<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-v</kbd> or "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">PageDown</kbd> scrolls forward, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-v</"
"kbd> or <kbd class=\"kbd\">PageUp</kbd> scrolls backward), switch to another "
"window with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x o</kbd>, use the history commands <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-p</kbd> and <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd>, etc.  Type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> to dismiss the query, and quit the minibuffer and "
"the querying command (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Quitting.html\">Quitting "
"and Aborting</a>)."
msgstr ""
"どちらのタイプのYes/Noクエリにおいても、ミニバッファは前節で説明した通りに動"
"作します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-l</kbd>で選択中のウィンドウを再センタリングし"
"たり、そのウィンドウをスクロールしたり（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-v</kbd>または"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">PageDown</kbd>で前方へ、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-v</kbd>または"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">PageUp</kbd>で後方へ）、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x o</kbd>で別"
"のウィンドウに切り替えたり、履歴コマンドの<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-p</kbd>や<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-n</kbd>を使用したりできます。クエリをキャンセルするには<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd>と入力し、ミニバッファとクエリコマンドを終了します"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Quitting.html\">終了と中断</a>を参照）。"

