# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/emacsclient-Options.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-a <var class=\"var\">command</var></samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-a <var class=\"var\">command</var></samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/emacsclient-Options.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--alternate-editor=<var class=\"var\">command</"
"var></samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--alternate-editor=<var class=\"var\">command</"
"var></samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/emacsclient-Options.html
msgid ""
"Specify a shell command to run if <code class=\"command\">emacsclient</code> "
"fails to contact Emacs.  This is useful when running <code "
"class=\"code\">emacsclient</code> in a script.  The command may include "
"arguments, which may be quoted &quot;like this&quot;.  Currently, escaping "
"of quotes is not supported."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"command\">emacsclient</code> が Emacs への接続に失敗した場合に"
"実行するシェルコマンドを指定します。これは、スクリプト内で <code "
"class=\"code\">emacsclient</code> を実行する際に便利です。コマンドには引数を"
"含めることができ、それらは&quot;このように&quot;クォートで囲むことができま"
"す。現在、クォートのエスケープはサポートされていません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/emacsclient-Options.html
msgid ""
"As a special exception, if <var class=\"var\">command</var> is the empty "
"string, then <code class=\"command\">emacsclient</code> starts Emacs in "
"daemon mode (as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">emacs --daemon</samp>&rsquo;) "
"and then tries connecting again."
msgstr ""
"特例として、<var class=\"var\">command</var> が空文字列の場合、<code "
"class=\"command\">emacsclient</code> は Emacs をデーモンモード（&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">emacs --daemon</samp>&rsquo;）で起動し、その後改めて接続を試み"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/emacsclient-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ALTERNATE_005fEDITOR-environment-"
"variable\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ALTERNATE_005fEDITOR-environment-"
"variable\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/emacsclient-Options.html
msgid ""
"The environment variable <code class=\"env\">ALTERNATE_EDITOR</code> has the "
"same effect as the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-a</samp>&rsquo; option.  If "
"both are present, the latter takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"環境変数 <code class=\"env\">ALTERNATE_EDITOR</code> は、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-a</samp>&rsquo; オプションと同じ効果を持ちます。両方が指定さ"
"れている場合は、後者が優先されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/emacsclient-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a id=\"index-client-frame\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-c</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-client-frame\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<a id=\"index-client-frame\"></a><span>&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-c</"
"samp>&rsquo;<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#index-client-frame\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/emacsclient-Options.html
msgid "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--create-frame</samp>&rsquo;"
msgstr "&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">--create-frame</samp>&rsquo;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/emacsclient-Options.html
msgid ""
"Create a new graphical <em class=\"dfn\">client frame</em>, instead of using "
"an existing Emacs frame.  See below for the special behavior of <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-c</kbd> in a client frame.  If Emacs cannot create a new "
"graphical frame (e.g., if it cannot connect to the X server), it tries to "
"create a text terminal client frame, as though you had supplied the &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">-t</samp>&rsquo; option instead."
msgstr ""
"既存のEmacsフレームを使用するのではなく、新しいグラフィカルな<em "
"class=\"dfn\">クライアントフレーム</em>を作成してください。クライアントフレー"
"ムにおける<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-c</kbd>の特殊な動作については、以下を参照"
"してください。Emacsが新しいグラフィカルフレームを作成できない場合（例：Xサー"
"バーに接続できない場合）、代わりに&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-t</"
"samp>&rsquo;オプションを指定したときと同様に、テキストターミナルのクライアン"
"トフレームの作成を試みます。"

