#: build/html/emacs/emacsclient-Options.html
msgid ""
"Tell Emacs to evaluate some Emacs Lisp code, instead of visiting some "
"files.  When this option is given, the arguments to <code "
"class=\"command\">emacsclient</code> are interpreted as a list of "
"expressions to evaluate, <em class=\"emph\">not</em> as a list of files to "
