# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd>
#: build/html/emacs/emacsclient-Options.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-server_002deval_002dargs_002dleft\"></"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-server_002deval_002dargs_002dleft\"></"
"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/emacsclient-Options.html
msgid ""
"Passing complex Lisp expression via the <samp class=\"option\">--eval</samp> "
"command-line option sometimes requires elaborate escaping of characters "
"special to the shell.  To avoid this, you can pass arguments to Lisp "
"functions in your expression as additional separate arguments to <code "
"class=\"command\">emacsclient</code>, and use <var class=\"var\">server-eval-"
"args-left</var> in the expression to access those arguments.  If empty "
"string arguments are passed to <code class=\"command\">emacsclient</code>, "
"those are included as well.  Be careful to have your expression remove the "
"processed arguments from <var class=\"var\">server-eval-args-left</var> "
"regardless of whether your code succeeds, for example by using <code "
"class=\"code\">pop</code>, otherwise Emacs will attempt to evaluate those "
"arguments as separate Lisp expressions."
msgstr ""
"複雑なLisp式を<samp class=\"option\">--eval</samp>コマンドラインオプション経"
"由で渡す際、シェルにとって特殊な文字に対して煩雑なエスケープ処理が必要になる"
"ことがあります。これを避けるには、式内のLisp関数への引数を<code "
"class=\"command\">emacsclient</code>への追加の個別引数として渡し、式内で<var "
"class=\"var\">server-eval-args-left</var>を使用してそれらの引数にアクセスする"
"方法があります。<code class=\"command\">emacsclient</code>に空文字列の引数が"
"渡された場合、それらも含まれます。コードの成否にかかわらず、例えば<code "
"class=\"code\">pop</code>を使用するなどして、式内で<var class=\"var\">server-"
"eval-args-left</var>から処理済みの引数を取り除くよう注意してください。そうし"
"ないと、Emacsはそれらの引数を個別のLisp式として評価しようとします。"

