# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/emacsclient-Options.html
msgid ""
"Wait for a response from Emacs for <var class=\"var\">N</var> seconds before "
"giving up.  If there is no response within that time, <code "
"class=\"command\">emacsclient</code> will display a warning and exit.  The "
"default is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo;, which means to wait "
"forever."
msgstr ""
"<var class=\"var\">N</var>秒間Emacsからの応答を待ち、その後断念します。その時"
"間内に応答がない場合、<code class=\"command\">emacsclient</code>は警告を表示"
"して終了します。デフォルトは&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">0</samp>&rsquo;で、こ"
"れは無期限に待機することを意味します。"

