"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Dired_002c-and-"
"MS_002dWindows_002fMS_002dDOS\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ls-emulation\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Dired_002c-and-"
"MS_002dWindows_002fMS_002dDOS\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ls-emulation\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"Dired normally uses the external program <code class=\"code\">ls</code> to "
"produce the directory listing displayed in Dired buffers (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Dired.html\">Dired, the Directory Editor</a>).  "
"However, MS-Windows and MS-DOS systems don&rsquo;t come with such a program, "
"although several ports of <small class=\"sc\">GNU</small> <code "
"class=\"code\">ls</code> are available.  Therefore, Emacs on those systems "
"<em class=\"emph\">emulates</em> <code class=\"code\">ls</code> in Lisp, by "
"using the <samp class=\"file\">ls-lisp.el</samp> package.  While <samp "
"class=\"file\">ls-lisp.el</samp> provides a reasonably full emulation of "
"<code class=\"code\">ls</code>, there are some options and features peculiar "
"to that emulation; they are described in this section."
msgstr ""
"Diredは通常、外部プログラム <code class=\"code\">ls</code> を使用して、Dired"
"バッファに表示されるディレクトリ一覧を生成します（<a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Dired.html\">Dired, the Directory Editor</a> を参照）。しかし、MS-"
"WindowsおよびMS-DOSシステムにはそのようなプログラムは付属していません。もっと"
"も、<small class=\"sc\">GNU</small> <code class=\"code\">ls</code> の移植版は"
"いくつか利用可能です。そのため、これらのシステム上のEmacsでは、<samp "
"class=\"file\">ls-lisp.el</samp> パッケージを用いてLispで <code "
"class=\"code\">ls</code> を<em class=\"emph\">エミュレート</em>します。<samp "
"class=\"file\">ls-lisp.el</samp> は <code class=\"code\">ls</code> を概ね完全"
"にエミュレートしますが、そのエミュレーション特有のオプションや機能がいくつか"
"あり、それらについて本節で説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">ls</code> emulation supports many of the <code "
"class=\"code\">ls</code> switches, but it doesn&rsquo;t support all of "
"them.  Here&rsquo;s the list of the switches it does support: <samp "
"class=\"option\">-A</samp>, <samp class=\"option\">-a</samp>, <samp "
"class=\"option\">-B</samp>, <samp class=\"option\">-C</samp>, <samp "
"class=\"option\">-c</samp>, <samp class=\"option\">-G</samp>, <samp "
"class=\"option\">-g</samp>, <samp class=\"option\">-h</samp>, <samp "
"class=\"option\">-i</samp>, <samp class=\"option\">-n</samp>, <samp "
"class=\"option\">-R</samp>, <samp class=\"option\">-r</samp>, <samp "
"class=\"option\">-S</samp>, <samp class=\"option\">-s</samp>, <samp "
"class=\"option\">-t</samp>, <samp class=\"option\">-U</samp>, <samp "
"class=\"option\">-u</samp>, <samp class=\"option\">-v</samp>, and <samp "
"class=\"option\">-X</samp>.  The <samp class=\"option\">-F</samp> switch is "
"partially supported (it appends the character that classifies the file, but "
"does not prevent symlink following)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">ls</code> エミュレーションは多くの <code "
"class=\"code\">ls</code> スイッチをサポートしていますが、すべてをサポートして"
"いるわけではありません。サポートされているスイッチの一覧は以下の通りです："
"<samp class=\"option\">-A</samp>、<samp class=\"option\">-a</samp>、<samp "
"class=\"option\">-B</samp>、<samp class=\"option\">-C</samp>、<samp "
"class=\"option\">-c</samp>、<samp class=\"option\">-G</samp>、<samp "
"class=\"option\">-g</samp>、<samp class=\"option\">-h</samp>、<samp "
"class=\"option\">-i</samp>、<samp class=\"option\">-n</samp>、<samp "
"class=\"option\">-R</samp>、<samp class=\"option\">-r</samp>、<samp "
"class=\"option\">-S</samp>、<samp class=\"option\">-s</samp>、<samp "
"class=\"option\">-t</samp>、<samp class=\"option\">-U</samp>、<samp "
"class=\"option\">-u</samp>、<samp class=\"option\">-v</samp>、および <samp "
"class=\"option\">-X</samp>。<samp class=\"option\">-F</samp> スイッチは部分的"
"にサポートされています（ファイルを分類する文字を付加しますが、シンボリックリ"
"ンクの追従は妨げません）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ls_002dlisp_002duse_002dinsert_002ddirectory_002dprogram\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ls_002dlisp_002duse_002dinsert_002ddirectory_002dprogram\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"On MS-Windows and MS-DOS, <samp class=\"file\">ls-lisp.el</samp> is "
"preloaded when Emacs is built, so the Lisp emulation of <code "
"class=\"code\">ls</code> is always used on those platforms.  If you have a "
"ported <code class=\"code\">ls</code>, setting <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-"
"use-insert-directory-program</code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"value will revert to using an external program named by the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-directory-program</code>."
msgstr ""
"MS-WindowsおよびMS-DOSでは、Emacsのビルド時に<samp class=\"file\">ls-"
"lisp.el</samp>がプリロードされるため、これらのプラットフォームでは常に<code "
"class=\"code\">ls</code>のLispエミュレーションが使用されます。移植版の<code "
"class=\"code\">ls</code>を使用している場合、<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-use-"
"insert-directory-program</code>に<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値を設"
"定すると、変数<code class=\"code\">insert-directory-program</code>で指定され"
"た外部プログラムの使用に戻ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Dired-sorting-order_002c-on-"
"MS_002dWindows_002fMS_002dDOS\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Dired-sorting-order_002c-on-"
"MS_002dWindows_002fMS_002dDOS\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"The order in which <samp class=\"file\">ls-lisp.el</samp> sorts files "
"depends on several customizable options described below."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">ls-lisp.el</samp> がファイルをソートする順序は、以下に説"
"明するいくつかのカスタマイズ可能なオプションによって決まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ls_002dlisp_002duse_002dstring_002dcollate\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ls_002dlisp_002duse_002dstring_002dcollate\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"The default sorting order follows locale-specific rules derived from your "
"system locale.  You can make the order locale-independent by customizing "
"<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-use-string-collate</code> to a <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトのソート順は、システムロケールから導出されるロケール固有のルールに"
"従います。<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-use-string-collate</code> を <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の値にカスタマイズすることで、ソート順をロケールに"
"依存しないようにできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Unicode-Collation-Algorithm-"
"_0028UCA_0029_002c-and-ls_002dlisp_002eel\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-ls_002dlisp_002dUCA_002dlike_002dcollation\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Unicode-Collation-Algorithm-"
"_0028UCA_0029_002c-and-ls_002dlisp_002eel\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-ls_002dlisp_002dUCA_002dlike_002dcollation\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"On GNU and Unix systems, when the locale&rsquo;s encoding is UTF-8, the "
"collation order follows the Unicode Collation Algorithm (<abbr "
"class=\"acronym\">UCA</abbr>).  To have a similar effect on MS-Windows, the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-UCA-like-collation</code> should have "
"a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value (this is the default).  The "
"resulting sorting order ignores punctuation, symbol characters, and "
"whitespace characters, so <samp class=\"file\">.foobar</samp>, <samp "
"class=\"file\">foobar</samp> and <samp class=\"file\">foo&nbsp;bar</samp> "
"will appear together rather than far apart."
msgstr ""
"GNUおよびUnixシステムにおいて、ロケールのエンコーディングがUTF-8の場合、照合"
"順序はUnicode Collation Algorithm (<abbr class=\"acronym\">UCA</abbr>) に従い"
"ます。MS-Windowsで同様の効果を得るには、変数 <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-"
"UCA-like-collation</code> に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を指定す"
"る必要があります（これがデフォルトです）。その結果得られるソート順序では、句"
"読点、記号文字、および空白文字が無視されるため、<samp "
"class=\"file\">.foobar</samp>、<samp class=\"file\">foobar</samp>、<samp "
"class=\"file\">foo&nbsp;bar</samp> は大きく離れるのではなく、まとめて表示され"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ls_002dlisp_002dignore_002dcase\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ls_002dlisp_002dignore_002dcase\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"By default, <samp class=\"file\">ls-lisp.el</samp> uses a case-sensitive "
"sort order for the directory listing it produces; this is so the listing "
"looks the same as on other platforms.  If you wish that the files be sorted "
"in case-insensitive order, set the variable <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-"
"ignore-case</code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、<samp class=\"file\">ls-lisp.el</samp> は生成するディレクトリ"
"一覧に大文字小文字を区別するソート順を採用しています。これは、他のプラット"
"フォームと同様の表示にするためです。ファイルを大文字小文字を区別せずにソート"
"したい場合は、変数 <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-ignore-case</code> に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ls_002dlisp_002ddirs_002dfirst\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ls_002dlisp_002ddirs_002dfirst\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"By default, files and subdirectories are sorted together, to emulate the "
"behavior of <code class=\"code\">ls</code>.  However, native MS-Windows/MS-"
"DOS file managers list the directories before the files; if you want that "
"behavior, customize the option <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-dirs-first</"
"code> to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、<code class=\"code\">ls</code> の動作を再現するため、ファイル"
"とサブディレクトリがまとめてソートされます。ただし、標準の MS-Windows/MS-DOS "
"ファイルマネージャーではディレクトリがファイルよりも先に表示されます。この動"
"作を希望する場合は、オプション <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-dirs-first</"
"code> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に設定してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ls_002dlisp_002dverbosity\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ls_002dlisp_002dverbosity\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-verbosity</code> controls the file "
"attributes that <samp class=\"file\">ls-lisp.el</samp> displays.  The value "
"should be either <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or a list that contains one "
"or more of the symbols <code class=\"code\">links</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">uid</code>, and <code class=\"code\">gid</code>.  <code "
"class=\"code\">links</code> means display the count of different file names "
"that are associated with (a.k.a.  <em class=\"dfn\">links to</em>) the "
"file&rsquo;s data; this is only useful on NTFS volumes.  <code "
"class=\"code\">uid</code> means display the numerical identifier of the user "
"who owns the file.  <code class=\"code\">gid</code> means display the "
"numerical identifier of the file owner&rsquo;s group.  The default value is "
"<code class=\"code\">(links uid gid)</code> i.e., all the 3 optional "
"attributes are displayed.  The value <code class=\"code\">nil</code> means "
"not to display any of these attributes."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-verbosity</code> は、<samp "
"class=\"file\">ls-lisp.el</samp> が表示するファイル属性を制御します。値には "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> か、<code class=\"code\">links</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">uid</code>、<code class=\"code\">gid</code> のいずれか1つ以上"
"の記号を含むリストを指定します。<code class=\"code\">links</code> は、ファイ"
"ルのデータに関連付けられている（別名 <em class=\"dfn\">リンク</em>）異なる"
"ファイル名の数を表示することを意味します。これは NTFS ボリュームでのみ有効で"
"す。<code class=\"code\">uid</code> は、ファイルの所有者であるユーザーの数値"
"識別子を表示することを意味します。<code class=\"code\">gid</code> は、ファイ"
"ル所有者のグループの数値識別子を表示することを意味します。デフォルト値は "
"<code class=\"code\">(links uid gid)</code> であり、つまり 3 つのオプション属"
"性がすべて表示されます。値 <code class=\"code\">nil</code> は、これらの属性を"
"いずれも表示しないことを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ls_002dlisp_002demulation\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-ls_002dlisp_002demulation\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-emulation</code> controls the "
"flavor of the <code class=\"code\">ls</code> emulation by setting the "
"defaults for the 3 options described above: <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-"
"ignore-case</code>, <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-dirs-first</code>, and "
"<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-verbosity</code>.  The value of this option can "
"be one of the following symbols:"
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-emulation</code> は、前述の 3 つのオプショ"
"ン <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-ignore-case</code>、<code class=\"code\">ls-"
"lisp-dirs-first</code>、<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-verbosity</code> のデ"
"フォルト値を設定することで、<code class=\"code\">ls</code> エミュレーションの"
"動作を制御します。このオプションの値には、以下の記号のいずれかを指定できま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">GNU</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">GNU</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"Emulate <small class=\"sc\">GNU</small> systems; this is the default.  This "
"sets <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-ignore-case</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">ls-lisp-dirs-first</code> to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, "
"and <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-verbosity</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">(links uid gid modes)</code>."
msgstr ""
"<small class=\"sc\">GNU</small> システムをエミュレートします。これがデフォル"
"トです。これにより、<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-ignore-case</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">ls-lisp-dirs-first</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"に、<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-verbosity</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">(links uid gid modes)</code> に設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">UNIX</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">UNIX</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"Emulate Unix systems.  Like <code class=\"code\">GNU</code>, but sets <code "
"class=\"code\">ls-lisp-verbosity</code> to <code class=\"code\">(links uid "
"modes)</code>."
msgstr ""
"Unixシステムをエミュレートする。<code class=\"code\">GNU</code>と同様だが、"
"<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-verbosity</code>を<code class=\"code\">(links "
"uid modes)</code>に設定する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">MacOS</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">MacOS</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"Emulate macOS.  Sets <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-ignore-case</code> to "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code>, and <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-dirs-first</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-verbosity</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"macOSをエミュレートします。<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-ignore-case</code>を"
"<code class=\"code\">t</code>に、<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-dirs-first</"
"code>と<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-verbosity</code>を<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>に設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dt>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">MS-Windows</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">MS-Windows</code>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"Emulate MS-Windows.  Sets <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-ignore-case</code> "
"and <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-dirs-first</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>, and <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-verbosity</code> "
"to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> on Windows 9X and to <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> on modern versions of Windows.  Note that the "
"default emulation is <em class=\"emph\">not</em> <code class=\"code\">MS-"
"Windows</code>, even on Windows, since many users of Emacs on those "
"platforms prefer the <small class=\"sc\">GNU</small> defaults."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"Any other value of <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-emulation</code> means the "
"same as <code class=\"code\">GNU</code>.  Customizing this option calls the "
"function <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-set-options</code> to update the 3 "
"dependent options as needed.  If you change the value of this variable "
"without using customize after <samp class=\"file\">ls-lisp.el</samp> is "
"loaded (note that it is preloaded on MS-Windows and MS-DOS), you can call "
"that function manually for the same result."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-emulation</code> のその他の値は、<code "
"class=\"code\">GNU</code> と同じ意味になります。このオプションをカスタマイズ"
"すると、関数 <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-set-options</code> が呼び出され、必"
"要に応じて関連する 3 つのオプションが更新されます。<samp class=\"file\">ls-"
"lisp.el</samp> の読み込み後（MS-Windows および MS-DOS ではプリロードされてい"
"る点にご注意ください）、customize を使用せずにこの変数の値を変更した場合で"
"も、同じ結果を得るために当該関数を手動で呼び出すことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ls_002dlisp_002dsupport_002dshell_002dwildcards\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ls_002dlisp_002dsupport_002dshell_002dwildcards\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-support-shell-wildcards</code> "
"controls how file-name patterns are supported: if it is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> (the default), they are treated as shell-style "
"wildcards; otherwise they are treated as Emacs regular expressions."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-support-shell-wildcards</code> は、ファイル"
"名パターンの扱いを制御します。これが <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外（デ"
"フォルト）の場合はシェル形式のワイルドカードとして扱われ、それ以外の場合は "
"Emacs の正規表現として扱われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ls_002dlisp_002dformat_002dtime_002dlist\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ls_002dlisp_002dformat_002dtime_002dlist\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-format-time-list</code> defines "
"how to format the date and time of files.  <em class=\"emph\">The value of "
"this variable is ignored</em>, unless Emacs cannot determine the current "
"locale.  (However, if the value of <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-use-"
"localized-time-format</code> is non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs "
"obeys <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-format-time-list</code> even if the "
"current locale is available; see below.)"
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-format-time-list</code> は、ファイルの日時"
"の書式を定義します。Emacs が現在のロケールを判定できない場合を除き、<em "
"class=\"emph\">この変数の値は無視されます</em>。（ただし、<code "
"class=\"code\">ls-lisp-use-localized-time-format</code> の値が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、現在のロケールが利用可能であっても "
"Emacs は <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-format-time-list</code> に従います。詳"
"細は後述します。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"The value of <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-format-time-list</code> is a list "
"of 2 strings.  The first string is used if the file was modified within the "
"current year, while the second string is used for older files.  In each of "
"these two strings you can use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;-"
"sequences to substitute parts of the time.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-format-time-list</code> の値は 2 つの文字列から"
"なるリストです。1 つ目の文字列はファイルが年内に変更された場合に使用され、2 "
"つ目の文字列はそれより古いファイルに使用されます。これら 2 つの文字列のいずれ"
"においても、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; シーケンスを用いて時"
"刻の一部を置換できます。例えば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><div><pre>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(&quot;%b %e %H:%M&quot; &quot;%b %e  %Y&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"Note that the strings substituted for these &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</"
"samp>&rsquo;-sequences depend on the current locale.  See <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Time-Parsing.html#Time-Parsing\">Time Parsing</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>, for more about format "
"time specs."
msgstr ""
"なお、これらの &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; シーケンスに置換さ"
"れる文字列は、現在のロケールによって異なります。時刻指定形式の詳細について"
"は、<cite class=\"cite\">The Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Time-Parsing.html#Time-Parsing\">Time Parsing</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ls_002dlisp_002duse_002dlocalized_002dtime_002dformat\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"ls_002dlisp_002duse_002dlocalized_002dtime_002dformat\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/emacs/ls-in-Lisp.html
msgid ""
"Normally, Emacs formats the file time stamps in either traditional or ISO-"
"style time format.  However, if the value of the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">ls-lisp-use-localized-time-format</code> is non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, Emacs formats file time stamps according to what "
"<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-format-time-list</code> specifies.  The &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo;-sequences in <code class=\"code\">ls-"
"lisp-format-time-list</code> produce locale-dependent month and day names, "
"which might cause misalignment of columns in Dired display.  The default "
"value of <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-use-localized-time-format</code> is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"通常、Emacsはファイルのタイムスタンプを、従来の形式またはISO形式のいずれかで"
"表示します。ただし、変数 <code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-use-localized-time-"
"format</code> の値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の場合、Emacsは "
"<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-format-time-list</code> の指定に従ってファイルの"
"タイムスタンプを表示します。<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-format-time-list</"
"code> 内の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%</samp>&rsquo; シーケンスはロケールに"
"依存した月名および日名を生成するため、Diredの表示において列のずれが生じること"
"があります。<code class=\"code\">ls-lisp-use-localized-time-format</code> の"
"デフォルト値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。"

